owledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀feels⠀or⠀remembers⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀obligation,⠀or⠀the⠀visible⠀aftermath⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀reveal⠀or⠀confrontation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahaoax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Choose⠀one⠀stageable⠀object⠀or⠀physical⠀task⠀that⠀concentrates⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation:⠀a⠀relic⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀handed⠀over,⠀a⠀sealed⠀document⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀signed⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀garment⠀laid⠀out⠀for⠀a⠀ceremony⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀escaped,⠀a⠀cup⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀filled⠀for⠀a⠀guest⠀bound⠀by⠀an⠀old⠀promise.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀handle⠀the⠀object,⠀set⠀it⠀down,⠀avoid⠀another⠀person's⠀offered⠀hand,⠀or⠀perform⠀a⠀small⠀domestic⠀task⠀while⠀discussing⠀the⠀binding⠀promise.⠀These⠀actions⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀obligation⠀present⠀without⠀requiring⠀elaborate⠀effects.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀through⠀the⠀chosen⠀object⠀and⠀the⠀characters'⠀physical⠀attention⠀to⠀it.⠀Describe⠀the⠀object's⠀beauty⠀or⠀weight⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀directions⠀with⠀enough⠀particularity⠀that⠀a⠀jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀becomes⠀legible.⠀Let⠀the⠀glamour⠀sharpen⠀the⠀cost:⠀the⠀heirloom⠀that⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀threat,⠀the⠀bridal⠀gift⠀that⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀debt,⠀the⠀keepsake⠀that⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀reminder⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept⠀safely.⠀A⠀remembered⠀place⠀may⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀prop⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀reference,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech.\n\nTreat⠀oaths,⠀titles,⠀magical⠀power,⠀and⠀ancient⠀events⠀as⠀active⠀conditions⠀that⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀do⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀acknowledge⠀these⠀conditions⠀naturally,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀a⠀lore⠀recitation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀fantasy⠀world⠀connected⠀to⠀individual⠀loyalties⠀and⠀material⠀consequences⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀room.\n\nWhen⠀required⠀pri