ht⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀must⠀appear,⠀keep⠀it⠀in⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀correct⠀person⠀and⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀senders.\n\nLet⠀jealousy,⠀divided⠀attachment,⠀or⠀the⠀intimacy⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀influence⠀what⠀someone⠀writes,⠀delays,⠀deletes,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀say.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀sent⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀felt⠀is⠀the⠀scene's⠀dramatic⠀center.⠀The⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀pending⠀reply,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀draft⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀confession⠀or⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahaoba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀concise⠀scene-oriented⠀passages⠀with⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Build⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀one⠀visual⠀anchor⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation:⠀a⠀relic⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀sealed⠀letter,⠀a⠀guarded⠀room,⠀a⠀garment⠀laid⠀out⠀for⠀a⠀ceremony⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀refused.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀anchor⠀as⠀the⠀exchange⠀develops,⠀so⠀the⠀object's⠀significance⠀accumulates⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀explained⠀at⠀once.\n\nUse⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references⠀that⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀mandatory⠀labels⠀on⠀every⠀line⠀or⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀may⠀attract⠀suspicion,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀facts⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nLet⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀world⠀enter⠀through⠀visible⠀and⠀practical⠀scene⠀facts.⠀A⠀relic,⠀title,⠀oath,⠀institution,⠀or⠀ancient⠀event⠀may⠀determine⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀permitted⠀to⠀touch⠀or⠀enter,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀will⠀cost.⠀Show⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀that⠀obligation⠀through⠀individual⠀loyalties⠀and⠀material⠀consequences:⠀a⠀guarded⠀room,⠀a⠀sealed⠀letter,⠀a⠀debt⠀called⠀due,⠀a⠀ceremony⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀refused.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀system⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀object,⠀garment,⠀room,⠀or⠀remembered⠀place⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment.⠀Let⠀the⠀glamour⠀sharpen⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀hide⠀it.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀familiar⠀detail⠀and⠀connect⠀it⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise,⠀but⠀their⠀private⠀feeling⠀remains⠀theirs;⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀it⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀does.\n\nKeep⠀inner⠀response⠀actual⠀and⠀specific.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀reason,⠀hesitate,⠀desire,⠀resent,⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀without⠀every⠀feeling⠀immediately⠀changing⠀a⠀visible⠀action.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀pending⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀recognition⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀relationship⠀unsettled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahaobb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies:⠀what⠀obligation⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀Let⠀progress⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀forced⠀discovery⠀or⠀reversal⠀in⠀every⠀installment.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀create⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules.\n\nLet⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀world⠀provide⠀the⠀cumulative⠀pressure.⠀A⠀title,⠀relic,⠀oath,⠀institution,⠀or⠀ancient⠀event⠀may⠀return⠀across⠀installments⠀as⠀a⠀condition⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀or⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs.⠀Connect⠀that⠀scale⠀to⠀individual⠀loyalties⠀and⠀material⠀consequences:⠀a⠀debt⠀partially⠀paid,⠀a⠀promise⠀reaffirmed,⠀a⠀relic⠀moved⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀household⠀affected⠀by⠀an⠀old⠀agreement.⠀Briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀re-entry,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀history.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀in⠀the⠀installment's⠀present.⠀Let⠀one⠀recurring⠀object,⠀room,⠀garment,⠀or⠀remembered⠀place⠀carry⠀a⠀jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀that⠀develops⠀over⠀time.⠀Each⠀return⠀should⠀reveal⠀a⠀new⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀obligation,⠀not⠀merely⠀repeat⠀the⠀same⠀description.⠀The⠀glamour⠀should⠀sharpen⠀the⠀cost⠀rather⠀than⠀soften⠀it.⠀A⠀familiar⠀detail⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀new⠀significance⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀later⠀event,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀contradiction⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀character⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion⠀to⠀create⠀suspense.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀inward⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀An⠀installment⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀changed⠀obligation,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀Use⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀development⠀earns⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀inherited⠀obligation⠀—⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀title,⠀or⠀hereditary⠀duty⠀—⠀as⠀the⠀pressure⠀inside⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀background.⠀Let⠀the⠀painful⠀exchange⠀pass⠀through⠀the⠀fantasy⠀fact:⠀an⠀oath⠀that⠀made⠀an⠀absence⠀ordinary,⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀taught⠀someone⠀to⠀call⠀a⠀loss⠀proper,⠀a⠀rank⠀that⠀requires⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀asking⠀forgiveness⠀cannot⠀stop⠀doing.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scale⠀real⠀but⠀let⠀it⠀arrive⠀in⠀small⠀acts⠀—⠀a⠀required⠀courtesy⠀performed⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀answer,⠀an⠀heirloom⠀set⠀down⠀without⠀ceremony,⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀speaking⠀that⠀lasts⠀one⠀breath⠀too⠀long.\n\nLet⠀the⠀strain⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself.⠀An⠀admission⠀slows⠀the⠀conversation,⠀sends⠀a⠀speaker⠀into⠀practical⠀detail,⠀or⠀stops⠀them⠀just⠀before⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀did.⠀Render⠀the⠀withheld⠀part⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀under⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀—⠀the⠀sentence⠀rehearsed⠀and⠀not⠀said,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀last⠀attempt,⠀attention⠀snagging⠀on⠀something⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀once⠀mended⠀—⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀withholding⠀a⠀specific⠀motive⠀such⠀as⠀shame,⠀protection,⠀or⠀fear⠀of⠀making⠀the⠀debt⠀heavier,⠀so⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀thought⠀and⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀character.⠀The⠀other⠀person⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀practical⠀help,⠀partial⠀warmth,⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀that⠀still⠀leaves⠀the⠀door⠀open;⠀whichever⠀occurs,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀sentence⠀can⠀attempt.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀treatment⠀plain.⠀Use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀diction⠀—⠀a⠀clerk's⠀precision,⠀a⠀soldier's⠀terseness⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀anguish,⠀and⠀let⠀restraint,⠀impatience,⠀or⠀careful⠀courtesy⠀carry⠀the⠀hurt.⠀A⠀kindness⠀can⠀arrive⠀too⠀late,⠀be⠀accepted⠀awkwardly,⠀or⠀remind⠀someone⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀failure;⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀exchange⠀into⠀confession⠀or⠀repair,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀tragic⠀close⠀either:⠀the⠀obligation⠀remains⠀owed⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀ends,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀continues⠀in⠀whatever⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀fold⠀the⠀submitted⠀action⠀or⠀address⠀into⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀the⠀world⠀answers⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀fantasy⠀facts⠀working⠀inside⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀title⠀changes⠀how⠀someone⠀is⠀addressed,⠀a⠀relic⠀must⠀be⠀handled⠀a⠀particular⠀way,⠀an⠀oath⠀limits⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀promised,⠀an⠀institution's⠀routine⠀decides⠀what⠀counts⠀as⠀a⠀polite⠀reply.⠀Let⠀characters⠀reveal⠀these⠀rules⠀by⠀following⠀them,⠀or⠀by⠀treating⠀a⠀cost⠀as⠀ordinary,⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀world.\n\nPut⠀the⠀social⠀observation⠀in⠀what⠀speakers⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀steward⠀offers⠀a⠀courtesy⠀that⠀confirms⠀who⠀stands⠀above⠀whom;⠀a⠀guard⠀does⠀not⠀question⠀why⠀the⠀levy⠀falls⠀on⠀one⠀street;⠀a⠀courier⠀calls⠀a⠀dangerous⠀errand⠀steady⠀work.⠀Let⠀the⠀meaning⠀surface⠀in⠀dialogue⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀actions⠀around⠀it⠀—⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀is⠀served⠀first,⠀whose⠀loss⠀gets⠀mentioned⠀—⠀never⠀in⠀a⠀paragraph⠀addressed⠀to⠀the⠀reader.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀perspective⠀permits⠀a⠀private⠀beat,⠀a⠀brief⠀inward⠀reaction⠀can⠀carry⠀what⠀a⠀speaker⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀aloud.\n\nAdvance⠀through⠀speech,⠀action,⠀and⠀the⠀selected⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀action⠀markers,⠀honoring⠀the⠀active⠀player-control⠀rules.⠀Give⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀business⠀and⠀real⠀choices,⠀including⠀cooperation⠀and⠀honest⠀help;⠀keep⠀their⠀private⠀knowledge⠀private⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀grants⠀access.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀momentum⠀leaves⠀it⠀—⠀mid-errand,⠀a⠀request⠀half-answered,⠀a⠀strain⠀still⠀present,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀just⠀finished⠀with⠀its⠀consequence⠀still⠀opening⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀turn⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀pressure⠀without⠀a⠀manufactured⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Tell⠀the⠀episode⠀in⠀plain,⠀unhurried⠀vernacular⠀prose⠀centered⠀on⠀an⠀ordinary⠀person⠀—⠀a⠀servant,⠀a⠀registry⠀clerk,⠀a⠀minor⠀heir⠀—⠀through⠀whom⠀the⠀magical⠀institution⠀is⠀felt,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀satire⠀arrive⠀as⠀observed⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀announcement.⠀The⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀or⠀hereditary⠀duty⠀is⠀a⠀social⠀arrangement⠀like⠀any⠀other,⠀with⠀its⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀its⠀expected⠀courtesies,⠀its⠀small⠀humiliations⠀and⠀unquestioned⠀beliefs;⠀a⠀character⠀exposes⠀their⠀position⠀by⠀how⠀completely⠀they⠀treat⠀these⠀as⠀the⠀way⠀things⠀are.\n\nLet⠀the⠀irony⠀come⠀from⠀flat⠀juxtaposition⠀rather⠀than⠀commentary.⠀A⠀ceremony⠀honors⠀the⠀relic⠀while⠀the⠀family⠀it⠀injured⠀stands⠀at⠀the⠀back;⠀a⠀title⠀commands⠀bowing⠀while⠀its⠀holder⠀performs⠀a⠀degrading⠀task;⠀a⠀public⠀vow⠀is⠀celebrated⠀in⠀the⠀square⠀while⠀one⠀household⠀quietly⠀counts⠀what⠀the⠀service⠀will⠀cost⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀requires,⠀but⠀the⠀noticing⠀stays⠀particular⠀—⠀one⠀act,⠀one⠀humiliation,⠀one⠀accepted⠀belief⠀—⠀and⠀never⠀hardens⠀into⠀a⠀lecture⠀or⠀a⠀verdict⠀on⠀mankind.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀material⠀weight⠀real.⠀The⠀magical⠀obligation⠀genuinely⠀changes⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀do:⠀a⠀son⠀sent⠀to⠀the⠀order's⠀service,⠀a⠀debt⠀payable⠀only⠀in⠀years,⠀a⠀ritual⠀that⠀consumes⠀the⠀village's⠀stores,⠀a⠀loyalty⠀that⠀closes⠀the⠀road⠀out.⠀Draw⠀idiom,⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀and⠀community⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀world⠀actually⠀supplied⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀period⠀speech⠀or⠀relocating⠀the⠀cast.⠀The⠀episode⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀damage⠀simply⠀continuing⠀—⠀no⠀protest⠀concluded,⠀no⠀reform⠀begun⠀—⠀leaving⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀see⠀it⠀clearly.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀diction⠀with⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀by⠀material⠀fact:⠀the⠀cracked⠀oath-stone,⠀the⠀rusted⠀fitting⠀on⠀the⠀relic⠀case,⠀the⠀ledger⠀where⠀a⠀family's⠀magical⠀debt⠀is⠀entered⠀in⠀a⠀tired⠀hand,⠀the⠀road⠀still⠀dangerous⠀from⠀a⠀failure⠀older⠀than⠀anyone⠀using⠀it.⠀Cut⠀connective⠀tissue⠀between⠀facts;⠀let⠀the⠀fantasy⠀scale⠀arrive⠀as⠀physical⠀evidence⠀and⠀practical⠀price⠀—⠀a⠀title⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀decides⠀what⠀someone⠀can⠀carry,⠀enter,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀afford,⠀and⠀an⠀ancient⠀war⠀matters⠀because⠀the⠀bridge⠀it⠀broke⠀is⠀still⠀missing.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀observation⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀call⠀normal,⠀stated⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀flat⠀register.⠀A⠀servant⠀handles⠀the⠀dangerous⠀relic⠀without⠀gloves⠀or⠀complaint;⠀a⠀soldier⠀calls⠀the⠀mutilating⠀oath⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀bread;⠀a⠀clerk⠀enters⠀the⠀levy⠀and⠀asks⠀only⠀whether⠀the⠀family⠀has⠀a⠀son⠀or⠀a⠀daughter⠀this⠀year.⠀Never⠀explain⠀the⠀institution's⠀cruelty;⠀the⠀irony⠀sits⠀in⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀obligation's⠀grand⠀name⠀and⠀its⠀worn⠀cost⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀body⠀and⠀budget.\n\nWork⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Short,⠀hard⠀sentences⠀register⠀immediate⠀stakes⠀and⠀abrupt⠀action;⠀let⠀a⠀sentence⠀run⠀longer⠀when⠀reasoning⠀genuinely⠀needs⠀room⠀—⠀calculating⠀what⠀survives⠀the⠀payment,⠀remembering⠀who⠀did⠀not⠀come⠀back,⠀deciding⠀whether⠀an⠀order⠀can⠀be⠀disobeyed.⠀Keep⠀rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀grounded⠀in⠀its⠀speaker⠀rather⠀than⠀spread⠀across⠀the⠀cast.⠀This⠀is⠀high⠀fantasy⠀with⠀its⠀damage⠀unsentimentally⠀priced,⠀not⠀survival⠀horror:⠀ceremonies,⠀loyalties,⠀and⠀mercies⠀still⠀exist,⠀and⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀cost⠀unpaid,⠀the⠀task⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀help⠀arriving⠀without⠀ceremony.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀definite⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀composition,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀situation⠀govern⠀what⠀it⠀records.⠀Use⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀needs⠀—⠀a⠀soldier's⠀letter⠀home⠀from⠀an⠀oath-bound⠀garrison,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀inventory⠀of⠀a⠀relic⠀and⠀its⠀repairs,⠀a⠀petition⠀written⠀in⠀an⠀institution's⠀routine⠀phrasing,⠀a⠀household⠀ledger,⠀a⠀posted⠀notice⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀fantasy⠀obligations⠀surface⠀as⠀matters⠀of⠀fact⠀inside⠀the⠀writing.⠀The⠀world's⠀scale⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀reported,⠀requested,⠀apologized⠀for,⠀or⠀paid.\n\nLet⠀the⠀social⠀observation⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀each⠀writer⠀treats⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀mother⠀describes⠀the⠀magical⠀levy⠀as⠀a⠀standard⠀charge⠀and⠀worries⠀instead⠀about⠀a⠀smaller⠀failure;⠀a⠀garrison⠀report⠀lists⠀a⠀death⠀as⠀one⠀line⠀among⠀provisions;⠀a⠀superior's⠀note⠀uses⠀grand⠀language⠀about⠀the⠀sacred⠀vow⠀while⠀the⠀enclosed⠀receipt⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀vow⠀cost⠀a⠀particular⠀family.⠀Treat⠀every⠀document⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact⠀performing⠀for⠀its⠀audience⠀—⠀deferential,⠀official,⠀pleading,⠀careless⠀—⠀not⠀as⠀its⠀author's⠀whole⠀live⠀mind;⠀what⠀goes⠀unsaid⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀loudest⠀fact⠀on⠀the⠀page.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀sequence⠀across⠀entries.⠀A⠀later⠀letter⠀corrects⠀an⠀earlier⠀report⠀without⠀understanding⠀the⠀full⠀situation;⠀a⠀journal⠀omits⠀the⠀very⠀fact⠀that⠀most⠀troubles⠀its⠀writer;⠀a⠀draft⠀left⠀unsent⠀says⠀what⠀the⠀posted⠀notice⠀could⠀not;⠀a⠀broken⠀and⠀reset⠀seal⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀date⠀carries⠀event⠀between⠀records.⠀Link⠀the⠀documents⠀through⠀a⠀shared⠀person,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀object⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀assemble⠀the⠀continuity,⠀and⠀add⠀no⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀any⠀record.⠀The⠀sequence⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀reply⠀delayed,⠀a⠀register⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀a⠀document⠀unable⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀it⠀most⠀needs⠀to⠀say.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀the⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀inside⠀obligations⠀that⠀stay⠀real.⠀Make⠀the⠀care⠀concrete⠀and⠀useful:⠀the⠀familiar⠀meal⠀cooked⠀before⠀a⠀difficult⠀ritual,⠀the⠀cloak⠀mended⠀after⠀the⠀magical⠀road⠀ruined⠀it,⠀the⠀watch⠀taken⠀so⠀someone⠀can⠀sleep⠀before⠀the⠀oath-renewal,⠀honey⠀remembered⠀for⠀the⠀apprentice⠀who⠀cannot⠀take⠀milk.⠀The⠀inherited⠀duty,⠀relic,⠀or⠀institution⠀keeps⠀its⠀actual⠀demands⠀—⠀the⠀comfort⠀is⠀particular⠀people⠀managing⠀those⠀demands⠀together,⠀not⠀the⠀demands⠀quietly⠀dissolving.\n\nKeep⠀affection⠀sincere⠀and⠀unfinished.⠀A⠀kindness⠀may⠀be⠀accepted⠀with⠀quiet⠀gratitude,⠀returned⠀with⠀practical⠀help,⠀or⠀received⠀awkwardly⠀by⠀someone⠀still⠀sore;⠀no⠀confession⠀or⠀completed⠀repair⠀is⠀required⠀for⠀the⠀warmth⠀to⠀count.⠀Leave⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀intact⠀—⠀a⠀small⠀argument⠀about⠀the⠀right⠀way⠀to⠀pack⠀the⠀relic⠀case,⠀teasing⠀about⠀an⠀old⠀fear,⠀a⠀preference⠀defended⠀past⠀all⠀reason⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀enjoy⠀something⠀without⠀saying⠀so,⠀the⠀pleasure⠀showing⠀in⠀attention⠀and⠀lingering⠀rather⠀than⠀announcement.⠀Weariness,⠀cost,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀can⠀share⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀ease.\n\nLet⠀plain⠀observation⠀keep⠀the⠀comfort⠀socially⠀situated.⠀The⠀servant⠀who⠀knows⠀exactly⠀how⠀the⠀old⠀lord⠀takes⠀his⠀tea,⠀the⠀soldier⠀who⠀shares⠀the⠀better⠀ration⠀and⠀mentions⠀nothing,⠀the⠀clerk⠀who⠀saves⠀a⠀particular⠀sweet⠀for⠀the⠀child⠀waiting⠀outside⠀the⠀registry⠀—⠀each⠀act⠀shows⠀a⠀position⠀and⠀a⠀history⠀of⠀paying⠀attention,⠀with⠀no⠀explanation⠀attached.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀world's⠀problems⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀cast⠀uniformly⠀agreeable.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀still⠀ahead⠀and⠀the⠀obligation⠀still⠀owed,⠀the⠀characters⠀a⠀little⠀steadier⠀for⠀the⠀care⠀given⠀and⠀received:⠀comfort⠀partial,⠀specific,⠀and⠀honest⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀still⠀costs.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀in⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Open⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀social⠀situation⠀under⠀pressure⠀—⠀a⠀household⠀preparing⠀for⠀an⠀oath-renewal,⠀a⠀town⠀absorbing⠀a⠀magical⠀levy,⠀a⠀family⠀whose⠀title⠀obliges⠀a⠀generation⠀to⠀dangerous⠀service⠀—⠀and⠀move⠀the⠀paragraphs⠀from⠀the⠀public⠀arrangement⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀it⠀constrains,⠀then⠀back⠀out⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀order⠀or⠀the⠀neighbors⠀will⠀see.⠀Fold⠀history⠀into⠀that⠀movement:⠀a⠀relic's⠀past⠀enters⠀through⠀ceremony,⠀memory,⠀or⠀an⠀argument⠀about⠀what⠀an⠀institution⠀once⠀promised,⠀never⠀through⠀a⠀separate⠀exposition⠀block.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀composed,⠀plain,⠀and⠀unsentimental.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀finished⠀language⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀without⠀making⠀anyone⠀talk⠀archaically,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀register⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀an⠀institution's⠀grand⠀claim⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀cost⠀without⠀pronouncing⠀a⠀moral:⠀the⠀title⠀commands⠀respect⠀while⠀its⠀holder⠀runs⠀a⠀degrading⠀errand;⠀the⠀vow⠀is⠀celebrated⠀in⠀public⠀while⠀a⠀household⠀quietly⠀loses⠀its⠀means.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀distance⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective⠀permits⠀—⠀recalling⠀an⠀earlier⠀event,⠀noting⠀a⠀pattern⠀across⠀years,⠀setting⠀a⠀ceremony⠀beside⠀a⠀kitchen⠀—⠀and⠀take⠀nothing⠀from⠀minds⠀the⠀contract⠀closes.\n\nLet⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀organize⠀the⠀telling:⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀face⠀and⠀private⠀room⠀can⠀shape⠀whole⠀passages⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀supports⠀it,⠀with⠀judgment⠀carried⠀in⠀arrangement⠀and⠀emphasis⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.⠀Keep⠀the⠀fantasy⠀stakes⠀material⠀—⠀grain,⠀heirs,⠀roads,⠀service⠀owed⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀structure⠀bears⠀real⠀weight⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀it.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀obligation⠀still⠀active⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀damage⠀still⠀visible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀the⠀frame⠀inside⠀a⠀present⠀pressure.⠀Before⠀the⠀tale⠀begins,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀need⠀from⠀this⠀telling:⠀a⠀council⠀weighing⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀family⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀renew⠀a⠀pact,⠀a⠀keeper⠀asked⠀to⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀village⠀told⠀to⠀supply⠀a⠀tithe.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller⠀a⠀concrete⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀listeners—a⠀survivor,⠀an⠀envoy,⠀an⠀old⠀servant,⠀a⠀disgraced⠀heir,⠀a⠀keeper⠀who⠀has⠀outlived⠀the⠀event.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀stakes⠀remain⠀active⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀told;⠀the⠀telling⠀does⠀not⠀suspend⠀the⠀world's⠀business⠀but⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀it.\n\nChoose⠀the⠀embedded⠀story's⠀material⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀social⠀position.⠀A⠀servant's⠀tale⠀notices⠀rations,⠀errands,⠀and⠀who⠀was⠀allowed⠀to⠀sit;⠀a⠀soldier's⠀tale⠀notices⠀orders,⠀distances,⠀and⠀who⠀was⠀left⠀behind;⠀a⠀keeper's⠀tale⠀notices⠀locks,⠀relics,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀silence.⠀The⠀teller⠀speaks⠀of⠀the⠀institution's⠀rule⠀as⠀ordinary—a⠀command,⠀a⠀vow,⠀a⠀tithe,⠀a⠀succession—while⠀the⠀narration⠀supplies⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀unpaid⠀cost⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀name.⠀Use⠀plain,⠀concrete⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀lecture:⠀the⠀tale's⠀grandeur⠀appears⠀through⠀the⠀particular⠀body,⠀debt,⠀or⠀labor⠀it⠀required.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀through⠀consequence,⠀not⠀announcement.⠀When⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀pauses⠀or⠀ends,⠀show⠀a⠀listener⠀acting⠀on⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀heard:⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀name⠀the⠀tale⠀omitted,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀renew⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀movement⠀toward⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀silence⠀where⠀agreement⠀was⠀expected.⠀The⠀return⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀decision;⠀it⠀needs⠀to⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀has⠀changed⠀how⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀is⠀read.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀tale's⠀actual⠀content—the⠀cost⠀it⠀revealed,⠀the⠀omission⠀it⠀made⠀visible—rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀stated⠀moral.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀levels.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀title,⠀or⠀gesture⠀from⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀may⠀reappear⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀where⠀it⠀now⠀carries⠀the⠀cost⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀learned⠀to⠀recognize:⠀the⠀oath⠀spoken⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀a⠀listener⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀renew,⠀the⠀relic⠀praised⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀now⠀ruining⠀a⠀household,⠀the⠀gesture⠀of⠀deference⠀shown⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀a⠀listener⠀performs⠀without⠀thinking.⠀The⠀repeated⠀element⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀the⠀tale⠀true;⠀it⠀makes⠀the⠀outer⠀obligation⠀legible.\n\nDelay⠀revelation⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀limited⠀knowledge⠀and⠀position.⠀The⠀teller⠀omits⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀understand,⠀what⠀they⠀fear⠀to⠀say,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀consider⠀too⠀ordinary⠀to⠀mention.⠀The⠀outer⠀scene⠀reveals⠀the⠀omission⠀through⠀a⠀listener's⠀direct⠀experience⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀account,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀arbitrary⠀interruption.⠀A⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀loyal,⠀generous,⠀or⠀accurate⠀while⠀still⠀normalizing⠀a⠀harm⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀now⠀see;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀cowardly⠀or⠀every⠀tale⠀a⠀confession.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀scale⠀as⠀a⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀or⠀ancient⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀must⠀affect⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀choice⠀will⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.⠀Use⠀the⠀current⠀world's⠀institutions,⠀landscapes,⠀and⠀history⠀as⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀frame-tale⠀method⠀supplies⠀the⠀situated⠀teller,⠀nested⠀account,⠀and⠀delayed⠀recognition;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀desert,⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀or⠀religious⠀setting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nArrange⠀the⠀scene⠀around⠀a⠀document's⠀administrative⠀reach.⠀A⠀register,⠀charter,⠀oath⠀formula,⠀inventory,⠀edict,⠀map,⠀or⠀testimony⠀appears⠀because⠀it⠀governs⠀something⠀present:⠀who⠀may⠀inherit,⠀who⠀must⠀serve,⠀what⠀a⠀household⠀owes,⠀which⠀boundary⠀is⠀recognized.⠀Show⠀the⠀document⠀being⠀used⠀or⠀consulted⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀moment—a⠀steward⠀copying⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀petitioner⠀waiting⠀while⠀a⠀seal⠀is⠀checked,⠀a⠀keeper⠀reading⠀a⠀formula⠀before⠀opening⠀a⠀door.⠀The⠀document⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀story's⠀authority;⠀it⠀is⠀one⠀account⠀among⠀others,⠀and⠀its⠀power⠀lies⠀in⠀what⠀it⠀permits⠀someone⠀to⠀demand.\n\nPlace⠀the⠀record⠀beside⠀a⠀remembered⠀condition.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀recalls⠀the⠀event⠀the⠀document⠀describes—a⠀founding,⠀a⠀battle,⠀a⠀punishment,⠀a⠀vow—let⠀the⠀memory⠀belong⠀to⠀that⠀rememberer⠀and⠀carry⠀their⠀position:⠀a⠀lord⠀remembers⠀the⠀vow,⠀a⠀servant⠀remembers⠀the⠀hunger,⠀a⠀keeper⠀remembers⠀the⠀locked⠀door.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀the⠀record's⠀wording⠀and⠀the⠀memory's⠀detail,⠀but⠀it⠀keeps⠀them⠀distinct.⠀A⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀accurate⠀about⠀dates⠀and⠀wrong⠀about⠀conditions;⠀a⠀witness⠀may⠀remember⠀a⠀ceremony⠀while⠀forgetting⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀it.\n\nShow⠀the⠀present⠀material⠀consequence⠀without⠀merging⠀it⠀into⠀the⠀official⠀account.⠀After⠀the⠀record⠀is⠀read⠀or⠀cited,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀administers⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀body,⠀household,⠀or⠀landscape:⠀a⠀ration⠀reduced,⠀a⠀child⠀sent⠀to⠀service,⠀a⠀wall⠀repaired⠀with⠀labor⠀someone⠀could⠀not⠀spare,⠀a⠀debt⠀carried⠀into⠀another⠀generation.⠀Use⠀plain,⠀specific⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀physical⠀trace—a⠀worn⠀seal,⠀a⠀copied⠀name,⠀a⠀boundary⠀stone,⠀a⠀repaired⠀wall.⠀Let⠀a⠀speaker⠀treat⠀the⠀institutional⠀rule⠀as⠀normal⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀its⠀cost;⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀official⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀it⠀governs.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀to⠀keep⠀kinds⠀of⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀A⠀documentary⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀what⠀a⠀record⠀says,⠀what⠀a⠀witness⠀remembers,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀shows,⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀merge⠀them⠀into⠀one⠀seamless⠀truth.⠀When⠀a⠀record⠀and⠀a⠀memory⠀conflict,⠀leave⠀the⠀conflict⠀legible⠀rather⠀than⠀resolving⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀corrected⠀version.⠀The⠀high-fantasy⠀scale⠀becomes⠀concrete⠀when⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀cost⠀someone⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀did⠀not⠀preserve.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀carry⠀historical⠀weight⠀without⠀becoming⠀nostalgia.⠀A⠀character's⠀recollection⠀of⠀an⠀oath,⠀battle,⠀founding,⠀or⠀punishment⠀reveals⠀their⠀position⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀emphasize⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀these⠀memories⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀but⠀each⠀memory⠀remains⠀limited⠀by⠀its⠀rememberer's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀interest.⠀Do⠀not⠀equate⠀the⠀German-language⠀route⠀with⠀one⠀country,⠀bureaucracy,⠀severity,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order;⠀the⠀documentary⠀method⠀arranges⠀evidence⠀and⠀memory,⠀while⠀the⠀current⠀high-fantasy⠀setting⠀supplies⠀its⠀own⠀institutions⠀and⠀language.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀collision⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀material⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀into⠀present⠀life.⠀Choose⠀one⠀concrete⠀point⠀where⠀an⠀inherited⠀power⠀touches⠀the⠀current⠀moment:⠀a⠀decaying⠀hall⠀where⠀a⠀petition⠀is⠀heard,⠀a⠀repaired⠀uniform⠀worn⠀by⠀a⠀servant⠀of⠀an⠀oath-bound⠀order,⠀a⠀toll⠀collected⠀at⠀a⠀gate⠀that⠀predates⠀the⠀current⠀ruler,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive⠀whose⠀key⠀is⠀a⠀relic,⠀a⠀debt⠀passed⠀down⠀a⠀family⠀line.⠀Show⠀that⠀detail⠀in⠀use—someone⠀waiting⠀in⠀the⠀cold⠀corridor,⠀someone⠀polishing⠀the⠀relic,⠀someone⠀paying⠀the⠀toll—so⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀is⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀backdrop.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀or⠀small⠀humiliation.⠀A⠀servant⠀adjusts⠀a⠀master's⠀collar,⠀a⠀novice⠀recites⠀a⠀vow,⠀a⠀keeper⠀polishes⠀a⠀relic,⠀a⠀petitioner⠀waits⠀while⠀someone⠀else⠀is⠀admitted⠀first.⠀The⠀narration⠀notices⠀the⠀gesture⠀and⠀its⠀social⠀meaning⠀without⠀explaining⠀it:⠀who⠀may⠀sit,⠀who⠀must⠀stand,⠀who⠀may⠀touch⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀object,⠀who⠀is⠀owed⠀an⠀answer.⠀Let⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal,⠀so⠀the⠀institution's⠀damage⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀itself⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nGenerate⠀atmosphere⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀sensory⠀experience⠀of⠀that⠀material⠀detail.⠀Describe⠀the⠀light,⠀cold,⠀smell,⠀wear,⠀or⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀place⠀as⠀it⠀affects⠀the⠀person⠀experiencing⠀it—the⠀chill⠀of⠀the⠀corridor⠀on⠀a⠀petitioner's⠀hands,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀wood⠀in⠀a⠀hall⠀where⠀a⠀family's⠀fate⠀is⠀decided,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀seal⠀pressed⠀into⠀wax.⠀The⠀atmosphere⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀mood⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀old⠀building;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀this⠀encounter,⠀and⠀it⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀experiences⠀the⠀power⠀being⠀exercised.⠀A⠀trusted⠀companion⠀may⠀allow⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀to⠀fall⠀away,⠀but⠀the⠀unmasked⠀moment⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀that⠀relationship⠀and⠀its⠀risks.⠀Private⠀desire,⠀loyalty,⠀fear,⠀or⠀resentment⠀can⠀be⠀present⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀intimacy⠀into⠀betrayal⠀or⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀into⠀a⠀trap.\n\nMake⠀the⠀old⠀authority's⠀power⠀legible⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀permits⠀someone⠀to⠀demand.⠀A⠀relic⠀may⠀be⠀powerful⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀permits⠀its⠀keeper⠀to⠀demand;⠀an⠀oath⠀may⠀bind⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀will⠀enforce⠀it;⠀a⠀title⠀may⠀matter⠀because⠀of⠀the⠀labor⠀and⠀deference⠀it⠀commands.⠀Show⠀that⠀demand⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀action—a⠀door⠀opened⠀or⠀refused,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀or⠀withheld,⠀a⠀payment⠀taken⠀or⠀waived—so⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation⠀changes⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀choice⠀costs.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules;⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀treatment⠀supplies⠀the⠀collision,⠀intimacy,⠀and⠀decay,⠀while⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀world⠀supplies⠀the⠀actual⠀source⠀and⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀inherited⠀power.\n\nDo⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀cynical⠀or⠀every⠀institution⠀corrupt.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀may⠀preserve⠀something⠀real,⠀and⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀serve⠀it⠀sincerely⠀while⠀still⠀participating⠀in⠀a⠀harm⠀the⠀scene⠀makes⠀visible.⠀The⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀element⠀works⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀an⠀ordinary⠀person⠀experiences,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀compulsory⠀revelation⠀of⠀villainy.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀inside⠀a⠀domestic⠀arrangement⠀that⠀an⠀obligation⠀governs.⠀A⠀vow⠀may⠀determine⠀who⠀inherits⠀a⠀house,⠀who⠀may⠀marry,⠀who⠀must⠀serve⠀a⠀temple,⠀who⠀feeds⠀a⠀dependent,⠀or⠀who⠀carries⠀a⠀family's⠀debt.⠀Show⠀that⠀arrangement⠀in⠀its⠀ordinary⠀activity:⠀a⠀meal⠀being⠀prepared,⠀a⠀chore⠀being⠀assigned,⠀a⠀visit⠀being⠀received,⠀a⠀ceremony⠀being⠀arranged,⠀a⠀quarrel⠀over⠀who⠀will⠀do⠀what.⠀The⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation⠀is⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀household's⠀daily⠀life,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀announcement.\n\nShow⠀the⠀obligation's⠀cost⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀material⠀consequence.⠀A⠀distant⠀war,⠀an⠀ancient⠀pact,⠀a⠀relic's⠀upkeep,⠀or⠀a⠀temple's⠀rule⠀enters⠀the⠀household⠀as⠀a⠀demand,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀ration,⠀or⠀a⠀prohibition.⠀The⠀narration⠀connects⠀the⠀large⠀event⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀material⠀result:⠀a⠀daughter⠀sent⠀to⠀serve,⠀a⠀son⠀taught⠀to⠀obey,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀refused⠀help,⠀a⠀guest⠀seated⠀according⠀to⠀rank,⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀food⠀set⠀aside⠀for⠀an⠀offering⠀while⠀someone⠀goes⠀hungry.⠀Use⠀plain,⠀attentive⠀description⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀household⠀owns,⠀owes,⠀repairs,⠀shares,⠀or⠀hides.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀household⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀speak⠀of⠀duty,⠀honor,⠀or⠀custom⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀practical⠀damage⠀that⠀the⠀speaker⠀does⠀not⠀name:⠀the⠀daughter's⠀silence⠀as⠀she⠀is⠀sent⠀away,⠀the⠀son's⠀obedience⠀as⠀he⠀is⠀taught⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀will⠀cost⠀him,⠀the⠀neighbor's⠀empty⠀hands⠀after⠀a⠀refusal.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀itself,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀elder⠀hypocritical⠀or⠀every⠀young⠀person⠀rebellious;⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀sincere,⠀generous,⠀or⠀loyal⠀while⠀still⠀enforcing⠀a⠀rule⠀whose⠀cost⠀the⠀narration⠀makes⠀visible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀scale⠀touch⠀personal⠀choices⠀through⠀these⠀domestic⠀consequences.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀weigh⠀a⠀vow⠀against⠀a⠀family⠀need,⠀a⠀duty⠀against⠀a⠀friendship,⠀or⠀a⠀command⠀against⠀a⠀memory,⠀but⠀the⠀reasoning⠀should⠀be⠀particular⠀to⠀that⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀position.⠀The⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀obligation⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀particular⠀choice⠀now⠀facing⠀the⠀household:⠀whether⠀to⠀renew⠀a⠀pact,⠀send⠀a⠀child,⠀pay⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀break⠀a⠀custom.⠀Grandeur⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀situation,⠀not⠀to⠀compulsory⠀formal⠀speech⠀for⠀every⠀character.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀social/domestic⠀route⠀controls⠀how⠀the⠀narration⠀arranges⠀attention⠀around⠀household⠀and⠀community⠀life;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀add⠀a⠀particular⠀national⠀family⠀pattern⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀high-fantasy⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀position's⠀routine.⠀A⠀guard⠀at⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀student⠀in⠀a⠀hall,⠀a⠀servant⠀in⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀keeper⠀of⠀a⠀shrine,⠀a⠀child⠀in⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀succession,⠀a⠀clerk⠀who⠀copies⠀names—choose⠀the⠀position⠀and⠀show⠀its⠀ordinary⠀activity:⠀the⠀waiting,⠀the⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀the⠀permitted⠀rooms,⠀the⠀tasks⠀repeated,⠀the⠀small⠀privileges⠀and⠀smaller⠀humiliations.⠀The⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation⠀is⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀position,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀announcement.\n\nShow⠀the⠀obligation⠀through⠀the⠀position's⠀material⠀consequences.⠀A⠀distant⠀war⠀may⠀mean⠀a⠀longer⠀watch,⠀a⠀new⠀tax,⠀a⠀missing⠀teacher,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀ceremony.⠀An⠀ancient⠀pact⠀may⠀determine⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀room,⠀touch⠀a⠀relic,⠀or⠀speak⠀a⠀name.⠀The⠀narration⠀shows⠀these⠀consequences⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀ordinary⠀activity:⠀the⠀guard's⠀fatigue⠀as⠀the⠀watch⠀lengthens,⠀the⠀student's⠀hunger⠀as⠀the⠀ration⠀shrinks,⠀the⠀servant's⠀silence⠀as⠀a⠀rule⠀is⠀repeated,⠀the⠀keeper's⠀hesitation⠀before⠀a⠀door.⠀Use⠀plain,⠀specific⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀details⠀of⠀the⠀position.\n\nUse⠀private⠀reasoning⠀to⠀connect⠀the⠀large⠀obligation⠀to⠀a⠀personal⠀choice.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀weigh⠀a⠀vow⠀against⠀a⠀family⠀need,⠀a⠀duty⠀against⠀a⠀friendship,⠀or⠀a⠀command⠀against⠀a⠀memory.⠀The⠀reasoning⠀should⠀be⠀particular⠀to⠀that⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀position:⠀a⠀brief⠀calculation,⠀a⠀remembered⠀face,⠀or⠀a⠀hesitation⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀lengthy⠀or⠀dramatic,⠀and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀perfectly⠀perceptive.⠀The⠀private⠀reasoning⠀makes⠀the⠀obligation's⠀cost⠀legible⠀from⠀inside⠀the⠀position,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀position⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀rule⠀as⠀normal⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀shows⠀its⠀cost⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀person's⠀fatigue,⠀fear,⠀hope,⠀or⠀silence:⠀the⠀guard⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀question⠀the⠀order,⠀the⠀student⠀who⠀repeats⠀the⠀vow,⠀the⠀servant⠀who⠀lowers⠀their⠀eyes,⠀the⠀clerk⠀who⠀copies⠀a⠀name⠀without⠀reading⠀it.⠀The⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀element⠀works⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀expects⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀person⠀experiences,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀a⠀victim⠀or⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀a⠀political⠀demonstration.\n\nDo⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀seasonal⠀or⠀Japanese⠀scenery.⠀Seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀appropriate,⠀but⠀the⠀route⠀controls⠀how⠀the⠀narration⠀arranges⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀attention.⠀The⠀current⠀high-fantasy⠀setting⠀supplies⠀its⠀own⠀institutions,⠀language,⠀and⠀landscape;⠀the⠀Japanese⠀literary⠀tradition⠀supplies⠀the⠀realist⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀relocated⠀cast⠀or⠀national⠀temperament.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nOpen⠀the⠀scene⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀account's⠀occasion⠀and⠀audience.⠀A⠀survivor⠀reports⠀to⠀a⠀council,⠀a⠀neighbor⠀recalls⠀an⠀event⠀to⠀a⠀newcomer,⠀a⠀servant⠀testifies⠀before⠀a⠀keeper,⠀a⠀soldier⠀describes⠀a⠀campaign⠀to⠀a⠀family,⠀a⠀chronicler⠀records⠀what⠀witnesses⠀have⠀said.⠀Show⠀why⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀being⠀given⠀now⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀need⠀from⠀it:⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀record,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀boundary,⠀a⠀name.⠀The⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation⠀is⠀present⠀as⠀the⠀subject⠀of⠀the⠀account,⠀but⠀the⠀account⠀itself⠀is⠀an⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀participation⠀level⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀can⠀claim.⠀A⠀character⠀who⠀was⠀present⠀may⠀describe⠀what⠀they⠀saw,⠀heard,⠀or⠀did;⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀heard⠀the⠀story⠀later⠀may⠀repeat⠀it⠀with⠀omissions,⠀additions,⠀or⠀a⠀different⠀emphasis.⠀Mark⠀secondhand⠀material⠀with⠀its⠀source:⠀'the⠀neighbor⠀said,'⠀'the⠀messenger⠀reported,'⠀'the⠀record⠀lists.'⠀The⠀narration⠀keeps⠀these⠀levels⠀clear⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀formal⠀deposition.⠀When⠀a⠀chronicle⠀or⠀official⠀record⠀appears,⠀place⠀it⠀beside⠀the⠀remembered⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀it⠀describes.\n\nShow⠀the⠀obligation's⠀cost⠀through⠀the⠀account's⠀concrete⠀details.⠀A⠀distant⠀war⠀may⠀be⠀reported⠀as⠀a⠀missing⠀relative,⠀a⠀burned⠀field,⠀a⠀new⠀tax,⠀or⠀a⠀changed⠀boundary.⠀An⠀ancient⠀pact⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀as⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀by⠀a⠀grandparent,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀must⠀stay⠀closed,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀no⠀one⠀may⠀speak.⠀The⠀narration⠀connects⠀the⠀large⠀event⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀material⠀result:⠀the⠀food,⠀shelter,⠀labor,⠀debt,⠀injury,⠀or⠀loss⠀that⠀the⠀oath⠀or⠀institution⠀produces.⠀Use⠀plain,⠀attentive⠀description⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀treats⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀rule,⠀tithe,⠀or⠀punishment⠀as⠀ordinary⠀while⠀the⠀account's⠀details⠀show⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀practical⠀damage⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀name:⠀the⠀survivor⠀who⠀reports⠀a⠀battle⠀without⠀mentioning⠀who⠀was⠀left⠀behind,⠀the⠀neighbor⠀who⠀recalls⠀a⠀ceremony⠀while⠀forgetting⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀it,⠀the⠀chronicler⠀who⠀lists⠀names⠀without⠀recording⠀the⠀hunger.⠀The⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀element⠀works⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀its⠀own⠀details⠀reveal,⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀witness⠀heroic⠀or⠀every⠀official⠀false.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀when⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀national⠀speech⠀pattern,⠀religion,⠀or⠀landscape⠀inventory.⠀Selecting⠀this⠀tradition⠀does⠀not⠀relocate⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.⠀The⠀social⠀realism/chronicle/testimony⠀route⠀controls⠀how⠀the⠀narration⠀arranges⠀attributed⠀accounts⠀and⠀material⠀evidence;⠀the⠀current⠀high-fantasy⠀world⠀supplies⠀its⠀own⠀institutions⠀and⠀history.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀present⠀demand⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀obligation⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀requires.⠀A⠀gate⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀open⠀without⠀a⠀toll,⠀a⠀ceremony⠀that⠀cannot⠀begin⠀until⠀a⠀vow⠀is⠀repeated,⠀a⠀lesson⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀summons,⠀a⠀meal⠀stopped⠀by⠀a⠀tithe⠀collector,⠀a⠀task⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀finished⠀before⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀unlocked.⠀Give⠀unfamiliar⠀names,⠀titles,⠀relics,⠀or⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀they⠀first⠀appear—a⠀phrase⠀of⠀explanation⠀woven⠀into⠀the⠀action,⠀not⠀a⠀glossary⠀pause.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀who⠀must⠀do⠀what⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀will⠀cost⠀within⠀the⠀opening⠀movement.\n\nTrack⠀spatial⠀changes⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀shift.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀hall⠀to⠀a⠀stair,⠀from⠀a⠀room⠀to⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀crowd⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀corner,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀with⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀new⠀space:⠀a⠀different⠀light,⠀a⠀new⠀sound,⠀a⠀closed⠀door,⠀a⠀changed⠀distance⠀between⠀speakers.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀who⠀is⠀speaking⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀showing.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀exposure⠀device.⠀After⠀a⠀command,⠀refusal,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀ritual⠀phrase,⠀show⠀a⠀particular⠀character's⠀response⠀in⠀plain⠀terms:⠀a⠀servant⠀lowers⠀their⠀eyes,⠀a⠀student⠀repeats⠀a⠀vow,⠀a⠀keeper⠀tightens⠀their⠀grip,⠀a⠀petitioner⠀steps⠀back,⠀a⠀child⠀stops⠀asking.⠀The⠀reaction⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner,⠀but⠀it⠀reveals⠀the⠀social⠀position⠀the⠀character⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀The⠀institution's⠀damage⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀beat⠀itself—the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀material⠀cost—not⠀in⠀a⠀lecture.\n\nLet⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs.⠀A⠀title⠀may⠀open⠀a⠀door,⠀an⠀oath⠀may⠀forbid⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀relic⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀payment,⠀an⠀ancient⠀pact⠀may⠀determine⠀who⠀may⠀speak⠀or⠀leave.⠀Show⠀these⠀effects⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀action⠀and⠀reaction⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀history.⠀The⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀obligation⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀particular⠀choice⠀now⠀facing⠀the⠀character:⠀pay⠀the⠀toll⠀or⠀turn⠀back,⠀repeat⠀the⠀vow⠀or⠀refuse,⠀open⠀the⠀door⠀or⠀keep⠀it⠀closed.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀first⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀Light⠀Novel⠀container⠀supplies⠀fast-readable⠀staging,⠀clear⠀spatial⠀movement,⠀and⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats;⠀the⠀current⠀story⠀supplies⠀its⠀own⠀narrator,⠀tone,⠀cast,⠀and⠀stopping⠀point.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀during⠀continuing⠀speech,⠀action,⠀thought,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀setup⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀reversal⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀decision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀sentence⠀follow⠀the⠀path⠀of⠀an⠀inherited⠀order⠀from⠀its⠀public⠀form⠀to⠀its⠀material⠀touch.⠀When⠀a⠀command,⠀oath,⠀or⠀ancient⠀name⠀enters⠀the⠀scene,⠀move⠀by⠀syntax⠀from⠀the⠀large⠀term⠀to⠀the⠀small⠀object⠀it⠀reaches:⠀the⠀worn⠀clasp,⠀the⠀unswept⠀step,⠀the⠀hand⠀that⠀hesitates⠀before⠀taking⠀up⠀the⠀duty.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀sound⠀or⠀image⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀obligation,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀general⠀atmosphere.⠀The⠀same⠀word⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀obligation⠀returns,⠀but⠀each⠀recurrence⠀should⠀carry⠀a⠀changed⠀application:⠀first⠀as⠀a⠀title⠀spoken⠀in⠀ceremony,⠀later⠀as⠀a⠀burden⠀recognized⠀in⠀a⠀private⠀gesture.\n\nUse⠀plain⠀observation⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀lyricism⠀honest.⠀After⠀a⠀shaped⠀image⠀of⠀the⠀citadel⠀or⠀the⠀old⠀law,⠀place⠀a⠀direct⠀fact:⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀bread,⠀a⠀child's⠀question,⠀the⠀exact⠀spot⠀where⠀a⠀ceremony⠀has⠀worn⠀the⠀stone.⠀Let⠀a⠀speaker⠀accept⠀an⠀institution⠀as⠀normal⠀in⠀ordinary⠀words,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀grandeur⠀of⠀the⠀title⠀or⠀oath⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀unexamined⠀act⠀of⠀obedience.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀attend⠀to⠀the⠀beauty⠀of⠀a⠀custom⠀without⠀endorsing⠀its⠀justice;⠀the⠀lyricism⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀attention,⠀not⠀to⠀approval.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀paragraph⠀as⠀a⠀movement⠀of⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀impressions.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail,⠀let⠀it⠀open⠀into⠀association⠀or⠀memory,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀with⠀the⠀association⠀still⠀active.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀other⠀characters'⠀speech⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀register;⠀the⠀lyrical⠀voice⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀mouth.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀obligation⠀still⠀pressing⠀or⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀resumed,⠀the⠀cadence⠀settling⠀without⠀announcing⠀a⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀high⠀fantasy⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀changed⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀place.⠀A⠀treaty,⠀a⠀war,⠀a⠀magical⠀catastrophe,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀oath⠀can⠀be⠀present⠀as⠀a⠀difference⠀in⠀the⠀height⠀of⠀a⠀wall,⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀voice⠀at⠀a⠀meal,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀now⠀performed⠀without⠀question.⠀Choose⠀the⠀small⠀irreversible⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀the⠀loss.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀an⠀earlier⠀occasion,⠀let⠀the⠀memory⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀object⠀or⠀practice:⠀a⠀relic⠀now⠀handled⠀differently,⠀a⠀ceremony⠀shortened,⠀a⠀name⠀no⠀longer⠀spoken⠀in⠀full.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀altered⠀understanding.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reflection⠀unsentimental.⠀Allow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀to⠀remain⠀pleasure:⠀food⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀good,⠀a⠀child⠀can⠀still⠀laugh,⠀a⠀repaired⠀object⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀useful.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀present⠀experience⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀every⠀scene⠀must⠀end⠀by⠀declaring⠀impermanence.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀accept⠀a⠀diminished⠀custom⠀as⠀normal⠀in⠀plain⠀words,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀acceptance⠀expose⠀the⠀cost⠀more⠀sharply⠀than⠀a⠀narrator's⠀lament.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀mention⠀the⠀old⠀practice⠀without⠀mourning⠀it,⠀and⠀the⠀absence⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀unremarked⠀adjustment.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀statement⠀as⠀a⠀counterweight⠀to⠀reflection.⠀After⠀a⠀passage⠀of⠀memory⠀or⠀longing,⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀plain⠀fact:⠀the⠀hour,⠀the⠀weather,⠀the⠀exact⠀number⠀of⠀steps⠀remaining.⠀This⠀prevents⠀the⠀reflective⠀mode⠀from⠀becoming⠀atmospheric⠀vagueness.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀continue⠀through⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀or⠀resumed⠀routine;⠀the⠀reflection⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀feeling⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀farewell.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀facts.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀route.⠀Establish⠀a⠀situated⠀teller,⠀an⠀audience,⠀and⠀an⠀occasion⠀for⠀the⠀account.⠀The⠀framed⠀tale⠀may⠀concern⠀a⠀high-fantasy⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀institution,⠀or⠀ancient⠀event,⠀but⠀its⠀authority⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀position⠀and⠀the⠀audience's⠀expectations,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀impersonal⠀chronicle.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀interrupt⠀the⠀tale⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀teller's⠀interest⠀or⠀the⠀listeners'⠀reaction⠀changes⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀told.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀formula⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀tale's⠀movement,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀teller's⠀practice⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀epic⠀convention.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀frame's⠀social⠀detail⠀plain⠀and⠀particular.⠀Show⠀the⠀teller's⠀ordinary⠀circumstances,⠀the⠀listeners'⠀practical⠀concerns,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀setting⠀through⠀exact⠀details:⠀who⠀is⠀seated⠀where,⠀what⠀work⠀is⠀set⠀aside,⠀what⠀payment⠀or⠀obligation⠀brought⠀the⠀audience⠀together.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀the⠀tale⠀celebrates.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀custom⠀as⠀normal⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀while⠀the⠀tale⠀quietly⠀shows⠀its⠀cost,⠀or⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀altered⠀for⠀convenience.⠀The⠀frame⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀tale's⠀meaning,⠀only⠀to⠀show⠀who⠀tells⠀it,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀for⠀what⠀purpose.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀tale's⠀narrated⠀world⠀from⠀the⠀frame's⠀present⠀world.⠀Magic,⠀oaths,⠀and⠀ancient⠀obligations⠀may⠀operate⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀with⠀full⠀high-fantasy⠀consequence,⠀while⠀the⠀frame⠀remains⠀a⠀particular⠀social⠀occasion.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀interest⠀shape⠀the⠀tale's⠀emphasis:⠀a⠀merchant⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀the⠀debt,⠀a⠀servant⠀on⠀the⠀command,⠀a⠀survivor⠀on⠀the⠀unkept⠀oath.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀universal⠀honor⠀code,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀religious⠀atmosphere.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀practical⠀business,⠀and⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀tale⠀unfinished⠀or⠀the⠀audience⠀dispersing,⠀leaving⠀the⠀account's⠀authority⠀unsettled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀institution⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀One⠀relic,⠀one⠀title,⠀one⠀clause⠀of⠀an⠀oath,⠀or⠀one⠀mark⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀event⠀can⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀larger⠀order.⠀Let⠀a⠀direct⠀clause⠀state⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀it:⠀pays⠀the⠀fee,⠀repeats⠀the⠀words,⠀covers⠀the⠀mark,⠀turns⠀away.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀institution's⠀whole⠀history.⠀The⠀detail⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀obligation⠀legible⠀through⠀its⠀material⠀consequence:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀relic⠀in⠀the⠀hand,⠀the⠀fee⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀purse⠀lighter,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀must⠀remain⠀closed.\n\nExpose⠀social⠀damage⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀accept⠀an⠀unjust⠀custom⠀as⠀normal⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀unremarkable⠀sentence.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀record⠀the⠀act⠀without⠀comment.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀cost⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀delete⠀it:⠀show⠀the⠀hand⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀reach⠀for⠀the⠀bread,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀opened,⠀the⠀name⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀spoken.⠀Keep⠀causality⠀intact.⠀If⠀a⠀choice⠀follows⠀from⠀an⠀obligation,⠀the⠀connection⠀must⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀authorized⠀thought.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀one⠀clause⠀of⠀the⠀oath⠀before⠀complying,⠀or⠀notice⠀the⠀exact⠀price⠀of⠀refusal.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀economical⠀movement.⠀A⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Cast⠀voices⠀remain⠀individual;⠀minimalism⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀essential⠀detail⠀has⠀done⠀its⠀work,⠀with⠀the⠀task⠀completed⠀or⠀still⠀before⠀the⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Begin⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀action,⠀perception,⠀or⠀speech⠀of⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀situation,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀larger⠀order⠀emerge⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀ceremony⠀performed,⠀a⠀messenger⠀received,⠀a⠀debt⠀called⠀in,⠀a⠀relic⠀handled.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀oath⠀while⠀fastening⠀a⠀clasp,⠀or⠀notice⠀the⠀institution's⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀another⠀speaker⠀accepts⠀a⠀command.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀history⠀lecture;⠀let⠀titles,⠀relics,⠀and⠀ancient⠀events⠀become⠀present⠀through⠀their⠀current⠀consequences.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀stay⠀clean⠀and⠀observant.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀flexible⠀in⠀rhythm⠀and⠀paragraphing,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀ornamental⠀or⠀self-consciously⠀literary.⠀Use⠀plain⠀statements⠀to⠀ground⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀exact⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀practical⠀difficulty⠀of⠀a⠀journey,⠀the⠀unexamined⠀phrase⠀a⠀character⠀repeats.⠀Social⠀meaning⠀can⠀emerge⠀from⠀what⠀speakers⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀of⠀compliance⠀may⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀more⠀sharply⠀than⠀a⠀speech⠀about⠀its⠀injustice.⠀Show⠀the⠀exact⠀moment⠀of⠀acceptance:⠀a⠀servant⠀who⠀steps⠀aside⠀without⠀being⠀told,⠀a⠀clerk⠀who⠀repeats⠀a⠀formula⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀weather,⠀a⠀child⠀who⠀already⠀knows⠀which⠀name⠀not⠀to⠀ask⠀about.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀A⠀shift⠀from⠀dialogue⠀to⠀recollection⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀formulaic⠀flashback.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀perspective.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀with⠀the⠀action⠀continuing,⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀resumed.⠀Contemporary⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting⠀or⠀a⠀concluding⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀high-fantasy⠀relationship⠀the⠀organizing⠀premise⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀bond⠀legible:⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀before⠀a⠀public⠀oath,⠀a⠀small⠀service⠀performed⠀during⠀a⠀larger⠀obligation,⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀interrupted⠀by⠀ceremony⠀or⠀danger.⠀Let⠀the⠀magical⠀or⠀institutional⠀scale⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀material⠀consequences:⠀a⠀summons,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀title,⠀a⠀journey.⠀The⠀bond⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀the⠀only⠀subject,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀notices⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀protect⠀or⠀risk.\n\nUse⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀with⠀restraint.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀pair⠀and⠀gain⠀new⠀weight⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀changes.⠀A⠀callback⠀may⠀occur⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀an⠀earlier⠀moment⠀a⠀different⠀meaning:⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀before⠀a⠀first⠀journey⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀journey's⠀cost⠀is⠀known,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀gesture⠀may⠀become⠀impossible⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀obligation.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀may⠀appear⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise⠀supports⠀them.⠀Let⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀observation⠀keep⠀the⠀emotional⠀material⠀from⠀becoming⠀inflated:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀show⠀care⠀by⠀remembering⠀a⠀practical⠀detail,⠀or⠀reveal⠀a⠀cost⠀by⠀accepting⠀a⠀separation⠀as⠀normal⠀without⠀protest.\n\nGive⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀arc⠀in⠀every⠀reply.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀question⠀still⠀open,⠀a⠀private⠀understanding⠀reached,⠀or⠀an⠀obligation⠀resumed.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀character's⠀unknown⠀mind.⠀The⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀may⠀remain⠀unsettled⠀even⠀after⠀a⠀factual⠀or⠀external⠀matter⠀is⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀a⠀retold⠀chronicle.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀declaration⠀that⠀establishes⠀the⠀person,⠀the⠀place,⠀or⠀the⠀obligation⠀at⠀stake,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀of⠀the⠀deed.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀mark⠀oaths,⠀kinships,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀feuds,⠀or⠀public⠀acts⠀when⠀the⠀established⠀world⠀supports⠀them.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀deed⠀or⠀obligation⠀and⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀same⠀words⠀sworn⠀at⠀a⠀departure⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀called⠀in,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀may⠀change⠀its⠀meaning⠀after⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀memorable.⠀Relate⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered:⠀the⠀debt⠀it⠀created,⠀the⠀feud⠀it⠀opened,⠀the⠀name⠀it⠀changed.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀open⠀to⠀ordinary⠀correction.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀elevated⠀account⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern,⠀dispute⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀accept⠀an⠀institution⠀as⠀normal⠀in⠀plain⠀words.⠀This⠀is⠀where⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀observation⠀enters:⠀the⠀saga's⠀grandeur⠀can⠀be⠀exposed⠀through⠀the⠀unexamined⠀compliance⠀or⠀small⠀humiliation⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀it⠀names.⠀Show⠀the⠀exact⠀correction:⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀remembers⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀the⠀journey⠀rather⠀than⠀its⠀glory,⠀a⠀servant⠀who⠀repeats⠀the⠀oath⠀as⠀a⠀condition⠀of⠀work,⠀a⠀survivor⠀who⠀notes⠀that⠀the⠀famous⠀gift⠀was⠀never⠀returned.⠀The⠀teller's⠀access⠀must⠀remain⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀speaker⠀ceremonial⠀or⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene's⠀scale⠀remain⠀concrete.⠀A⠀public⠀deed⠀may⠀be⠀large⠀in⠀consequence⠀but⠀particular⠀in⠀execution:⠀the⠀exact⠀route⠀taken,⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀sworn,⠀the⠀exact⠀object⠀given.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered.⠀Do⠀not⠀declare⠀a⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf⠀unless⠀the⠀actual⠀story⠀supports⠀that⠀communal⠀judgment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀composed⠀third-person⠀social-realist⠀prose⠀route.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀plain⠀and⠀observant:⠀report⠀what⠀a⠀hall,⠀road,⠀relic,⠀or⠀official⠀actually⠀looks⠀like⠀and⠀what⠀people⠀do⠀there,⠀without⠀decorative⠀archaism⠀or⠀explanatory⠀lectures⠀about⠀the⠀realm.⠀Let⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀oaths,⠀titles,⠀and⠀inherited⠀offices⠀appear⠀through⠀their⠀practical⠀effects—who⠀may⠀sit,⠀who⠀must⠀wait,⠀what⠀a⠀broken⠀seal⠀costs,⠀whose⠀name⠀opens⠀a⠀door—rather⠀than⠀through⠀formal⠀speeches.\n\nBuild⠀institutional⠀exposure⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀and⠀small⠀humiliations.⠀A⠀clerk's⠀hesitation⠀before⠀a⠀relic,⠀a⠀family's⠀careful⠀wording⠀in⠀a⠀petition,⠀a⠀servant's⠀knowledge⠀of⠀which⠀debts⠀are⠀never⠀mentioned,⠀or⠀the⠀routine⠀cruelty⠀of⠀a⠀garrison's⠀accounting⠀can⠀reveal⠀how⠀power⠀works.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀accepting⠀some⠀part⠀of⠀this⠀as⠀normal,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀specific⠀material⠀consequence⠀make⠀that⠀acceptance⠀visible.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀summary⠀of⠀injustice.\n\nGive⠀focal⠀characters⠀private⠀thought⠀and⠀sensation⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀plain⠀register⠀as⠀the⠀narration.⠀Their⠀reasoning⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀self-j