ed,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material,⠀not⠀as⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀End⠀the⠀exchange⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point—a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀a⠀silence—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀moral⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references—a⠀hall's⠀worn⠀floor,⠀a⠀relic's⠀glow,⠀a⠀character's⠀averted⠀face—not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nExpose⠀institutions⠀through⠀ordinary⠀visible⠀acts⠀and⠀small⠀humiliations.⠀A⠀servant's⠀practiced⠀bow,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀refusal⠀without⠀looking⠀up,⠀a⠀family's⠀careful⠀silence⠀when⠀a⠀titled⠀person⠀speaks,⠀or⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀room's⠀occupants⠀rearrange⠀themselves⠀when⠀an⠀official⠀enters⠀can⠀reveal⠀how⠀power⠀operates.⠀Let⠀characters⠀accept⠀these⠀patterns⠀as⠀normal.⠀Their⠀dialogue⠀should⠀fit⠀the⠀immediate⠀practical⠀situation,⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀realm.\n\nMake⠀high-fantasy⠀obligations⠀visually⠀and⠀practically⠀present.⠀A⠀relic⠀sits⠀on⠀a⠀table⠀and⠀changes⠀how⠀people⠀approach⠀it.⠀An⠀oath⠀is⠀a⠀document⠀someone⠀must⠀sign⠀or⠀a⠀mark⠀someone⠀must⠀show.⠀An⠀inherited⠀title⠀determines⠀who⠀enters⠀first,⠀who⠀sits,⠀and⠀who⠀must⠀wait.⠀Show⠀these⠀effects⠀through⠀scene-setting,⠀focal⠀narration,⠀and⠀what⠀characters⠀do.⠀When⠀a⠀decision⠀costs⠀something,⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀object⠀handed⠀over,⠀the⠀person⠀left⠀outside,⠀the⠀door⠀that⠀closes.\n\nKeep⠀focal⠀narration⠀and⠀inner⠀response⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀plain⠀register⠀as⠀the⠀dialogue.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀not⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected;⠀those⠀require⠀their⠀own⠀authorization⠀or⠀feature.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point—a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀a⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀refusal—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀moral⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nUse⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Each⠀installment⠀should⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀full⠀retelling⠀of⠀earlier⠀installments.\n\nExpose⠀institutions⠀through⠀ordinary⠀acts⠀and⠀small⠀humiliations⠀that⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀over⠀time.⠀A⠀clerk's⠀refusal⠀in⠀one⠀installment⠀may⠀be⠀echoed⠀by⠀a⠀family⠀member's⠀careful⠀wording⠀in⠀the⠀next.⠀A⠀guard's⠀routine⠀inspection⠀may⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀consequence.⠀A⠀character's⠀unquestioned⠀belief⠀may⠀become⠀visible⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀makes⠀its⠀cost⠀concrete.⠀Let⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerge⠀from⠀these⠀accumulated⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.\n\nLet⠀high-fantasy⠀obligations⠀provide⠀long-term⠀material⠀consequences.⠀An⠀oath⠀may⠀bind⠀a⠀character⠀across⠀multiple⠀installments,⠀its⠀cost⠀becoming⠀clearer⠀as⠀circumstances⠀change.⠀A⠀relic⠀may⠀be⠀introduced⠀in⠀one⠀installment⠀and⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀in⠀another.⠀An⠀inherited⠀title⠀may⠀shape⠀access,⠀deference,⠀and⠀obligation⠀throughout.⠀Connect⠀these⠀large-scale⠀forces⠀to⠀particular⠀loyalties⠀and⠀losses:⠀the⠀person⠀the⠀oath⠀binds,⠀the⠀land⠀it⠀protects,⠀the⠀debt⠀it⠀transfers,⠀the⠀silence⠀it⠀requires.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀plain⠀and⠀observant.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀The⠀style⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀create⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules.⠀End⠀an⠀installment⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point—a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀knowledge—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀moral⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahaqaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nTreat⠀inherited⠀obligations,⠀magical⠀costs,⠀and⠀ancient⠀consequences⠀as⠀the⠀specific⠀material⠀of⠀unresolved⠀personal⠀hurt.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀honor⠀an⠀oath,⠀use⠀a⠀relic,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀institution,⠀make⠀the⠀choice⠀expose⠀what⠀they⠀need⠀from⠀someone⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀withholding,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀bring⠀themselves⠀to⠀apologize⠀for.⠀The⠀mythic⠀scale⠀should⠀not⠀dwarf⠀the⠀relationship;⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀relationship's⠀strain⠀more⠀consequential.\n\nStage⠀the⠀emotional⠀conflict⠀through⠀clear,⠀readable⠀action⠀and⠀direct⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀a⠀fight,⠀a⠀ritual,⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀become⠀the⠀occasion⠀for⠀an⠀admission⠀or⠀a⠀refusal.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀surfaces⠀during⠀the⠀encounter,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀or⠀does⠀next⠀rather⠀than⠀serving⠀as⠀a⠀decorative⠀flashback.⠀An⠀advance⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀conflict⠀may⠀come⠀at⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀wound⠀being⠀opened,⠀and⠀a⠀victory⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀more⠀exposed⠀than⠀before.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀turbulence⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀conversation⠀and⠀subsequent⠀behavior.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀while⠀avoiding⠀the⠀real⠀one,⠀offer⠀help⠀that⠀carries⠀an⠀unspoken⠀accusation,⠀or⠀accept⠀comfort⠀without⠀being⠀able⠀to⠀return⠀it.⠀Warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀can⠀occupy⠀the⠀same⠀exchange:⠀a⠀gesture⠀may⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀still⠀insufficient,⠀an⠀apology⠀may⠀be⠀genuine⠀and⠀still⠀leave⠀the⠀original⠀injury⠀unaddressed.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀hurt⠀or⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀rupture.⠀Let⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost⠀remain⠀present⠀after⠀the⠀practical⠀matter⠀is⠀settled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahaqab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers⠀and⠀enough⠀setting⠀detail⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀high⠀fantasy⠀world⠀active.⠀Attribute⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀narrative⠀paragraph⠀move⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀action,⠀reaction,⠀or⠀environmental⠀change.⠀When⠀a⠀title,⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀or⠀institution⠀appears,⠀show⠀what⠀it⠀lets⠀a⠀character⠀do⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀them⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀exchange⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀for⠀exposition.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto-style⠀relationship-driven⠀staging⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀participants⠀practical⠀and⠀emotional⠀reasons⠀to⠀act.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀to⠀protect⠀someone,⠀to⠀prove⠀something⠀to⠀a⠀rival,⠀or⠀to⠀honor⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise.⠀Let⠀those⠀motives⠀surface⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀do,⠀not⠀in⠀summary.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀affects⠀the⠀current⠀encounter,⠀make⠀it⠀change⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀a⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀collaborative⠀scene⠀keeps⠀moving⠀forward.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world⠀and⠀any⠀NPCs⠀active⠀beyond⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀continue⠀a⠀task,⠀issue⠀a⠀warning,⠀or⠀react⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀just⠀did⠀without⠀demanding⠀an⠀answer.⠀End⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀group⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀in⠀motion,⠀a⠀conversation⠀may⠀be⠀unfinished,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀development⠀may⠀have⠀just⠀become⠀visible.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀menu⠀of⠀choices⠀at⠀the⠀end.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahaqac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀martial⠀adventure⠀route⠀of⠀the⠀Chinese⠀literary⠀tradition⠀to⠀stage⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀oaths,⠀magical⠀powers,⠀and⠀inherited⠀obligations⠀as⠀a⠀wuxia-inflected⠀narrative⠀of⠀rivalry,⠀loyalty,⠀and⠀reputation.⠀Let⠀named⠀techniques,⠀schools,⠀relics,⠀or⠀oaths⠀carry⠀public⠀meaning:⠀a⠀character's⠀use⠀of⠀a⠀power⠀or⠀fulfillment⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀should⠀affect⠀how⠀others⠀judge⠀them,⠀not⠀merely⠀produce⠀an⠀effect.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀episodic⠀and⠀action-forward,⠀with⠀clear⠀staging⠀of⠀movement,⠀exchange,⠀and⠀consequence.\n\nShape⠀conflict⠀through⠀Kishimoto-style⠀relationship-driven⠀action.⠀A⠀duel,⠀a⠀rescue,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀promise⠀should⠀reveal⠀the⠀bond⠀between⠀opponents⠀or⠀companions.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀surfaces⠀in⠀combat⠀or⠀conversation,⠀let⠀it⠀change⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀choice:⠀they⠀may⠀hesitate,⠀change⠀tactics,⠀or⠀finally⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀withheld.⠀An⠀earned⠀breakthrough⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀technique⠀completed⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀victory⠀made⠀possible⠀by⠀a⠀companion's⠀trust.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀world's⠀history⠀active⠀without⠀pausing⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀exposition.⠀A⠀title,⠀relic,⠀or⠀institution⠀may⠀be⠀introduced⠀through⠀its⠀effect⠀on⠀the⠀current⠀encounter:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀strike⠀a⠀former⠀ally,⠀a⠀weapon⠀may⠀demand⠀a⠀price,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀oath⠀may⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀between⠀two⠀loyalties.⠀Let⠀the⠀martial⠀adventure⠀conventions⠀serve⠀the⠀relationship⠀conflict⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀spectacle.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahaqad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀high⠀fantasy⠀world⠀through⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀detail.⠀Show⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀oath⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀character's⠀hand⠀tightens⠀on⠀a⠀relic,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀magic⠀in⠀cracked⠀skin⠀or⠀a⠀spent⠀breath,⠀and⠀the⠀burden⠀of⠀an⠀institution⠀in⠀the⠀worn⠀edges⠀of⠀its⠀uniform⠀or⠀the⠀dust⠀on⠀its⠀threshold.⠀Keep⠀transitions⠀compressed:⠀move⠀from⠀one⠀action⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀explanatory⠀padding,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀physical⠀consequence⠀of⠀a⠀choice⠀stand⠀in⠀for⠀a⠀longer⠀meditation.\n\nStage⠀Kishimoto-style⠀relationship⠀conflict⠀through⠀clear,⠀forceful⠀action.⠀A⠀blow,⠀a⠀block,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀between⠀characters.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀surfaces,⠀make⠀it⠀concrete:⠀a⠀scar,⠀a⠀voice,⠀a⠀particular⠀failure⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀moves⠀or⠀speaks⠀now.⠀Let⠀an⠀advance⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀practical⠀and⠀personal⠀basis,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀technique⠀adapted⠀under⠀pressure⠀or⠀a⠀companion's⠀timely⠀action,⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀sudden⠀unearned⠀victory.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀compression⠀from⠀flattening⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀short,⠀hard⠀sentences⠀for⠀impact⠀and⠀physical⠀exchange,⠀the