r⠀than⠀letting⠀all⠀boundaries⠀dissolve⠀into⠀cotton.\n\nLet⠀the⠀Tarantinoid⠀dialogue⠀be⠀processed⠀as⠀pressure⠀slowly⠀loaded⠀in⠀the⠀mind.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀notice⠀after⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀an⠀apparently⠀polite⠀question⠀was⠀a⠀test,⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀serving⠀object⠀was⠀handed⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀direction,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀pause⠀was⠀held⠀just⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀include⠀an⠀unheard⠀third⠀party.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀replay⠀the⠀beat,⠀loop⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀prior⠀image,⠀or⠀reject⠀its⠀own⠀conclusion.⠀Changes⠀of⠀control⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀changes⠀in⠀inner⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀forced⠀return⠀to⠀normal⠀conversation,⠀a⠀sudden⠀draining⠀of⠀thought⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀prop⠀is⠀introduced,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀that⠀keeps⠀the⠀mind⠀from⠀moving⠀forward.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀this⠀person⠀to⠀be⠀witty,⠀neurotic,⠀or⠀symbol-hungry;⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀note⠀the⠀plain⠀failure⠀of⠀ordinary⠀language⠀to⠀name⠀a⠀past⠀debt.\n\nIf⠀a⠀magical⠀consequence⠀enters,⠀make⠀it⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀experience,⠀not⠀in⠀exposition:⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀observe⠀a⠀rise⠀in⠀pulse⠀when⠀a⠀particular⠀mark⠀is⠀touched,⠀a⠀remembered⠀smell⠀that⠀immediately⠀matches⠀the⠀present⠀air,⠀or⠀the⠀suddenly⠀insupportable⠀texture⠀of⠀a⠀newly⠀laid⠀covering.⠀Do⠀not⠀transform⠀every⠀consequence⠀into⠀a⠀secret⠀rare⠀sensation;⠀sometimes⠀the⠀character's⠀body⠀simply⠀refuses⠀a⠀cup⠀of⠀water⠀or⠀a⠀voice⠀carries⠀too⠀much⠀of⠀an⠀older⠀room.⠀The⠀imaginary⠀may⠀mix⠀with⠀memory,⠀but⠀the⠀recipe⠀must⠀keep⠀fantasy⠀distinct⠀through⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀anchors⠀or⠀clarified⠀private⠀speech.⠀Do⠀not⠀slide⠀the⠀whole⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀dream.\n\nThe⠀stream⠀can⠀stop⠀at⠀an⠀apparently⠀small⠀point:⠀a⠀remembered⠀face⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀leave,⠀a⠀half-finished⠀idea⠀caught⠀against⠀a⠀domestic⠀sound,⠀a⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀ten⠀seconds⠀ago⠀finally⠀reaching⠀its⠀full⠀meaning.⠀No⠀external⠀task,⠀useful⠀decision,⠀or⠀therapeutic⠀insight⠀is⠀required⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.⠀The⠀private⠀interval⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀be⠀dense⠀without⠀preparing⠀a⠀next⠀move.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahavaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀exchange⠀as⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀readable⠀attributed⠀messages.⠀Place⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀pressure⠀inside⠀the⠀particular⠀space⠀between⠀transmission⠀and⠀reply:⠀a⠀sender⠀may⠀be⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀relic⠀cannot⠀be⠀photographed,⠀a⠀significant⠀update⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀certain⠀person⠀to⠀type⠀the⠀first⠀letter⠀of⠀a⠀formal⠀name,⠀or⠀an⠀heir⠀may⠀be⠀'present'⠀in⠀the⠀channel⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀while⠀they⠀cannot⠀legally⠀respond.⠀Let⠀the⠀biggest⠀official⠀or⠀magical⠀stakes⠀be⠀felt⠀through⠀these⠀small⠀asynchronous⠀operations,⠀not⠀through⠀someone⠀copying⠀a⠀history-book⠀paragraph⠀into⠀chat.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀separate⠀material⠀trace⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀format⠀supports⠀it:⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀labeled⠀as⠀a⠀draft⠀and⠀must⠀not⠀act⠀as⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀party.\n\nThe⠀Tarantinoid⠀dialogue⠀pressure⠀should⠀operate⠀through⠀interface-pace.⠀Make⠀actual⠀differences⠀in⠀typing⠀style⠀matter⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀correspond⠀to⠀a⠀sender's⠀context:⠀one⠀person⠀uses⠀complete,⠀slow⠀clauses⠀while⠀guarding⠀an⠀old⠀threshold;⠀another⠀abandons⠀mid-message⠀because⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀interrupts.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀from⠀becoming⠀uniform⠀glib⠀banter.⠀Read⠀receipts,⠀edited⠀messages,⠀delayed⠀'seen⠀at'⠀moments,⠀and⠀attachments⠀may⠀signal⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀control,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀timestamp⠀simply⠀to⠀inject⠀drama.⠀The⠀critical⠀change⠀should⠀usually⠀live⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀not⠀said⠀around⠀an⠀ordinary⠀burden:⠀a⠀message⠀asking⠀the⠀wrong⠀person⠀to⠀bring⠀the⠀wrong⠀vessel,⠀a⠀picture⠀of⠀a⠀wounded⠀animal⠀sent⠀to⠀establish⠀proof⠀of⠀consequence,⠀a⠀formal⠀salutation⠀replaced⠀with⠀a⠀private⠀name⠀only⠀after⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀acknowledged.\n\nUse⠀separated⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀message⠀stream⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀required⠀for⠀a⠀narrated⠀physical⠀or⠀internal⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀senders⠀cannot⠀see.⠀The⠀context⠀may⠀report⠀a⠀lamp⠀failing,⠀a⠀door⠀sealing,⠀a⠀person⠀refusing⠀to⠀touch⠀a⠀phone,⠀or⠀an⠀unsent⠀thought⠀that⠀one⠀sender⠀does⠀not⠀transmit.⠀Clearly⠀partition⠀such⠀context⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀with⠀labels⠀or⠀formatting⠀that⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀supports.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀under⠀the⠀appropriate⠀ownership:⠀a⠀sender's⠀own⠀unsent⠀thought⠀may⠀appear⠀separately,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀grant⠀another⠀sender⠀knowledge⠀of⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀this⠀become⠀a⠀monologue⠀in⠀chat⠀form;⠀messages⠀should⠀still⠀be⠀genuine⠀attempts⠀to⠀communicate,⠀misread,⠀or⠀manage⠀a⠀person.\n\nIf⠀a⠀magical⠀consequence⠀occurs⠀in⠀the⠀physical⠀world,⠀let⠀it⠀arrive⠀through⠀an⠀asynchronous⠀mismatch⠀or⠀through⠀separated⠀context.⠀A⠀sender's⠀next⠀message⠀may⠀become⠀shorter⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀watching⠀a⠀burning⠀field;⠀a⠀delivered⠀receipt⠀may⠀appear⠀without⠀a⠀reply⠀because⠀the⠀phone⠀has⠀survived⠀a⠀magical⠀event⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀end.⠀Do⠀not⠀produce⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀emoji⠀as⠀a⠀shortcut⠀for⠀interiority.⠀If⠀an⠀attachment⠀is⠀sent,⠀show⠀its⠀actual⠀use:⠀a⠀photo⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀forbidden⠀building,⠀a⠀voice⠀note⠀whose⠀background⠀contains⠀the⠀old⠀warning⠀bells,⠀a⠀partial⠀copy⠀of⠀a⠀contract⠀that⠀cuts⠀off⠀before⠀the⠀binding⠀clause.⠀Each⠀attachment⠀must⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀can⠀do.\n\nThe⠀exchange⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀resolution:⠀one⠀sent⠀message⠀waiting⠀on⠀read,⠀one⠀unsent⠀draft⠀remaining⠀private,⠀one⠀incoming⠀typing⠀indicator⠀stopping⠀without⠀a⠀reply.⠀No⠀forced⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀needed,⠀but⠀the⠀asynchronous⠀boundary⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀be⠀its⠀own⠀turn.⠀Avoid⠀saying⠀'the⠀conversation⠀paused⠀for⠀an⠀important⠀decision';⠀instead⠀let⠀the⠀pause⠀be⠀a⠀status-visible⠀event⠀or⠀an⠀uncertain⠀interface⠀shift.⠀The⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀neat⠀arrangement⠀or⠀a⠀magical⠀reveal,⠀and⠀no⠀automatic⠀level-up/progression⠀beat⠀is⠀introduced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahavba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Quentin⠀Tarantino⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀visual-novel⠀form:⠀clear,⠀concise⠀scene-setting;⠀speaker-attributed⠀dialogue⠀blocks;⠀separate⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀where⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀shown.⠀Use⠀image/bg/expression⠀cues⠀as⠀references⠀that⠀anchor⠀the⠀illustrated⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀rules⠀that⠀a⠀sprite⠀must⠀be⠀named⠀in⠀every⠀line.⠀Keep⠀positioning⠀changes⠀and⠀cuts⠀legible:⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀location,⠀a⠀person⠀stepping⠀into⠀or⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀frame,⠀a⠀time-o