registration⠀plaque,⠀not⠀its⠀legend;⠀the⠀oath-taker⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀a⠀second⠀copy;⠀the⠀magical⠀archive⠀may⠀be⠀unavailable⠀because⠀the⠀archivist⠀is⠀on⠀a⠀scheduled⠀break.⠀Use⠀plain⠀verbs⠀and⠀direct⠀sentence⠀order.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀offers⠀an⠀inward⠀connection,⠀make⠀it⠀materially⠀contribute⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀decision⠀or⠀perception;⠀a⠀character's⠀uncertainty⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀by⠀keeping⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀in⠀view⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀deleting⠀all⠀inner⠀experience.\n\nUse⠀minimalism⠀as⠀comic⠀timing.⠀One⠀official⠀phrase,⠀repeated⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀situation,⠀can⠀expose⠀an⠀institutional⠀pretension⠀better⠀than⠀a⠀long⠀satirical⠀passage:⠀the⠀prophecy⠀that⠀promised⠀a⠀sign⠀becomes⠀a⠀posted⠀form⠀with⠀a⠀spacing⠀requirement;⠀the⠀ancient⠀enemy⠀becomes⠀a⠀line⠀item⠀in⠀a⠀truce⠀budget.⠀Let⠀the⠀repetition⠀accumulate⠀by⠀variation,⠀not⠀mere⠀duplication.⠀A⠀character's⠀speech⠀should⠀remain⠀distinct;⠀minimalism⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀everyone⠀to⠀talk⠀in⠀terse⠀declaratives.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀formal⠀and⠀bureaucratic,⠀another⠀curt,⠀another⠀rambling⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀the⠀narrator⠀renders⠀in⠀one⠀long,⠀edgy⠀sentence.\n\nOmission⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀consequence⠀inferable.⠀If⠀a⠀relic's⠀activation⠀requires⠀a⠀fee,⠀show⠀the⠀fee⠀being⠀refused⠀or⠀paid;⠀do⠀not⠀leave⠀the⠀causal⠀link⠀so⠀implicit⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀loses⠀track⠀of⠀cause⠀and⠀effect.⠀Keep⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀history⠀and⠀magic⠀as⠀actual⠀constraints⠀on⠀possible⠀action,⠀so⠀the⠀narrator's⠀economy⠀of⠀detail⠀does⠀not⠀reduce⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀active⠀obligations⠀or⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀what⠀depends⠀on⠀them.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀on⠀an⠀unfinished⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀waiting⠀figure,⠀or⠀a⠀scheduled⠀appointment,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahayas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scenes⠀in⠀which⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀magic,⠀oaths,⠀and⠀institutions⠀operate⠀through⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀arrangements.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀open⠀in⠀a⠀waiting⠀room⠀of⠀the⠀tower⠀of⠀prophecy,⠀but⠀notice⠀the⠀tea⠀urn,⠀the⠀numbered⠀tickets,⠀the⠀junior⠀c