            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-high_fantasy-07",
            "name": "🔧 Init · High Fantasy · 07/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == high_fantasy}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip High Fantasy. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 7 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-high_fantasy; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPahayat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀established⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀visible⠀through⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀practical⠀obligations.⠀The⠀two⠀may⠀have⠀met⠀during⠀a⠀border⠀negotiation,⠀served⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀relic-recovery⠀commission,⠀or⠀share⠀a⠀household⠀near⠀a⠀magical⠀archive;⠀whatever⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise,⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀concentrate⠀on⠀one⠀recurring⠀pattern⠀between⠀them:⠀a⠀phrase⠀one⠀uses⠀to⠀signal⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀is⠀overexplaining,⠀a⠀division⠀of⠀labor⠀around⠀a⠀dangerous⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀joke⠀about⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀of⠀a⠀historical⠀event.⠀Repetition⠀should⠀pay⠀off⠀by⠀becoming⠀newly⠀weighted⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene,⠀not⠀by⠀mere⠀callback.\n\nLet⠀Pratchett's⠀social⠀comedy⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀relationship's⠀practical⠀frictions.⠀Affection⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀one⠀partner⠀knowing⠀which⠀institutional⠀delay⠀will⠀make⠀the⠀other⠀sarcastic⠀before⠀the⠀clerk⠀does;⠀jealousy⠀can⠀be⠀shown⠀through⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀touch⠀the⠀shared⠀talisman;⠀comfort⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀matter⠀of⠀putting⠀the⠀kettle⠀on⠀while⠀a⠀prophecy's⠀administrative⠀appeal⠀is⠀pending.⠀Show⠀differences⠀in⠀each⠀character's⠀relationship⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority.⠀One⠀may⠀quote⠀the⠀by-laws,⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀treat⠀every⠀official⠀attestation⠀as⠀folklore⠀until⠀it⠀costs⠀money,⠀and⠀their⠀attempts⠀to⠀translate⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀should⠀not⠀erase⠀their⠀distinct⠀voices.\n\nHigh⠀fantasy's⠀scale⠀must⠀remain⠀consequential.⠀A⠀magical⠀oath,⠀inherited⠀duty,⠀or⠀political⠀emergency⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀pair⠀can⠀promise⠀or⠀how⠀long⠀they⠀can⠀stay⠀in⠀one⠀place;⠀the⠀relationship⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀refuge⠀that⠀cancels⠀the⠀world's⠀obligations.⠀Authorized⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀reveal⠀one⠀character's⠀unspoken⠀reason⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀remains⠀unaware.⠀Build⠀the⠀scene's⠀repeated⠀moments⠀and⠀private⠀language⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise,⠀so⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀fulfills⠀that⠀particular⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀familiar⠀trope.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀domestic⠀exchange⠀while⠀an⠀external⠀demand⠀waits,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀full⠀reconciliation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahayau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀the⠀telling⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀of⠀deeds⠀that⠀people⠀still⠀dispute,⠀using⠀deliberate⠀rhythm,⠀compact⠀introductory⠀declarations,⠀and⠀recurring⠀phrases⠀tied⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀act⠀or⠀name.⠀A⠀recurring⠀designation⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀an⠀established⠀way⠀of⠀speaking⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀deed,⠀not⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀at⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀changes⠀its⠀application:⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀was⠀praised⠀as⠀heroic⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀maintenance⠀liability;⠀a⠀title⠀inherited⠀for⠀valor⠀may⠀turn⠀out⠀to⠀include⠀a⠀disputed⠀boundary⠀and⠀a⠀very⠀old⠀fine.\n\nLet⠀oral⠀retelling⠀preserve⠀both⠀the⠀official⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀one.⠀The⠀saga⠀may⠀introduce⠀a⠀knight⠀or⠀oath-taker⠀in⠀elevated⠀terms,⠀then⠀let⠀dialogue⠀supply⠀the⠀correction:⠀the⠀subject⠀objects⠀to⠀one⠀detail,⠀a⠀listener⠀asks⠀about⠀the⠀actual⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀dragon-proof⠀shield,⠀or⠀the⠀chronicler's⠀opening⠀is⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀subject⠀asking⠀whether⠀this⠀is⠀the⠀version⠀that⠀omits⠀the⠀horse.⠀Let⠀the⠀practical⠀explanation⠀leave⠀the⠀hero's⠀deed⠀real⠀and⠀consequential⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀ceremony⠀around⠀it⠀is⠀reduced.⠀Different⠀characters⠀should⠀hold⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀access⠀must⠀stay⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.\n\nHigh⠀fantasy's⠀scale⠀enters⠀through⠀deeds⠀that⠀continue⠀to⠀matter.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀relate⠀a⠀pact,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀war,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀consecration,⠀but⠀ground⠀it⠀in⠀specific⠀consequences:⠀whose⠀field⠀is⠀still⠀marked⠀by⠀the⠀boundary⠀stone,⠀which⠀family⠀no⠀longer⠀owes⠀the⠀old⠀service,⠀or⠀what⠀magical⠀condition⠀remains⠀active⠀because⠀the⠀original⠀wording⠀was⠀never⠀amended.⠀Let⠀the⠀saga's⠀recurring⠀structure⠀create⠀anticipation⠀by⠀varying⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀application⠀of⠀each⠀return,⠀so⠀a⠀phrase⠀gathers⠀weight⠀from⠀the⠀new⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀repeating⠀identically.⠀An⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀before⠀the⠀chronicler⠀finishes,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀subject⠀walking⠀away⠀while⠀the⠀listeners⠀disagree⠀about⠀the⠀next⠀clause;⠀the⠀business⠀of⠀remembrance⠀can⠀remain⠀incomplete.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahayav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀spell⠀as⠀a⠀saga-inflected⠀social⠀chronicle⠀in⠀continuous⠀prose.⠀Treat⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀elements⠀as⠀active⠀inherited⠀material:⠀a⠀title,⠀relic,⠀oath,⠀institution,⠀landscape,⠀or⠀ancient⠀event⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀someone⠀can⠀do,⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀household⠀must⠀arrange⠀its⠀day.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀that⠀weight⠀into⠀uniformly⠀formal⠀speech;⠀let⠀it⠀surface⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀obligation,⠀a⠀practical⠀shortage,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀dispute⠀over⠀wording,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀consequence.\n\nGive⠀the⠀chronicle⠀a⠀definite⠀narrative⠀stance:⠀it⠀records⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀its⠀participants,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀report⠀public⠀speech,⠀visible⠀action,⠀and⠀material⠀results.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀focal⠀private⠀experience,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀plain⠀nonspoken⠀chronicle⠀prose,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀separate⠀from⠀what⠀another⠀person⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀knows⠀or⠀hears.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀a⠀performed⠀recitation⠀or⠀an⠀omniscient⠀announcement⠀unless⠀the⠀contract⠀separately⠀authorizes⠀that⠀access.\n\nUse⠀the⠀saga⠀route⠀to⠀hold⠀two⠀ledgers⠀in⠀view:⠀the⠀official⠀or⠀remembered⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀social⠀account.⠀Let⠀them⠀disagree⠀through⠀concrete⠀domestic⠀or⠀institutional⠀detail.⠀A⠀great⠀oath⠀may⠀have⠀a⠀household⠀budget;⠀a⠀legendary⠀relic⠀may⠀need⠀oiling;⠀a⠀prophecy's⠀wording⠀may⠀be⠀argued⠀over⠀by⠀two⠀clerks;⠀a⠀remembered⠀raid⠀may⠀still⠀determine⠀which⠀road⠀a⠀family⠀uses.⠀The⠀chronicler⠀may⠀notice⠀these⠀gaps,⠀but⠀the⠀humor⠀should⠀expose⠀something⠀particular⠀about⠀power,⠀memory,⠀or⠀obligation⠀rather⠀than⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty.\n\nKeep⠀different⠀relationships⠀to⠀language⠀and⠀authority⠀distinct.⠀Some⠀people⠀quote⠀old⠀verse⠀or⠀legal⠀formula;⠀others⠀summarize⠀for⠀the⠀kitchen,⠀complain⠀about⠀the⠀weather,⠀or⠀argue⠀with⠀a⠀ledger.⠀Let⠀the⠀chronicler⠀preserve⠀that⠀difference⠀rather⠀than⠀smoothing⠀everyone⠀into⠀one⠀grand⠀register.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀continuous⠀and⠀readable,⠀without⠀headings,⠀scene⠀numbers,⠀or⠀modern⠀editorial⠀notes⠀unless⠀a⠀later⠀feature⠀authorizes⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahayaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀a⠀continuous⠀screenplay⠀for⠀the⠀current⠀spell.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀concise⠀scene⠀heading⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Use⠀readable⠀action⠀lines⠀that⠀show⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀elements⠀as⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀material⠀facts:⠀a⠀sealed⠀letter⠀with⠀a⠀royal⠀crest,⠀a⠀relic⠀that⠀hums⠀when⠀touched,⠀a⠀gate⠀that⠀requires⠀three⠀names⠀spoken⠀aloud.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀economical;⠀do⠀not⠀describe⠀camera⠀angles,⠀lens⠀choices,⠀or⠀impossible⠀stage⠀affect.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀character-specific⠀relationships⠀to⠀authority⠀and⠀official⠀speech.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀quote⠀an⠀oath⠀precisely,⠀another⠀may⠀summarize⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀kitchen⠀staff,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀complain⠀that⠀the⠀prophecy⠀was⠀already⠀disputed⠀last⠀year.⠀Comic⠀correction⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀a⠀practical⠀contradiction—an⠀official⠀proclamation⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀obeyed⠀because⠀the⠀bridge⠀is⠀out,⠀a⠀sacred⠀vow⠀that⠀clashes⠀with⠀a⠀harvest⠀schedule—not⠀from⠀everyone⠀being⠀equally⠀witty.\n\nUse⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀a⠀brief⠀cut⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀asks⠀for⠀it.⠀For⠀example,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀horn⠀may⠀interrupt⠀a⠀negotiation.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀these⠀devices⠀merely⠀to⠀create⠀subtext⠀or⠀tension.⠀Keep⠀private⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀cast:⠀if⠀a⠀focal⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀clear⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀screenplay⠀presentation,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀voice-over⠀unless⠀that⠀presentation⠀separately⠀authorizes⠀a⠀performed⠀thought.\n\nA⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀new⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀visible⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀revelation⠀at⠀each⠀cut.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahayax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀high-fantasy⠀scene⠀for⠀the⠀current⠀spell.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrance⠀and⠀exit⠀directions,⠀and⠀economical⠀blocking.⠀Let⠀the⠀supernatural⠀or⠀historical⠀elements⠀appear⠀as⠀physical⠀stage⠀business:⠀a⠀sealed⠀chest⠀that⠀requires⠀two⠀people⠀to⠀carry,⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀key⠀that⠀catches⠀on⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀folded⠀map⠀whose⠀corners⠀have⠀been⠀mended.⠀These⠀details⠀make⠀the⠀mythic⠀world⠀playable⠀without⠀requiring⠀impossible⠀effects.\n\nGive⠀each⠀character⠀a⠀different⠀relation⠀to⠀ritual⠀and⠀authority.⠀A⠀steward⠀may⠀quote⠀an⠀oath⠀to⠀enforce⠀a⠀small⠀rule;⠀a⠀runner⠀may⠀misremember⠀it;⠀a⠀lord⠀may⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀avoid⠀answering⠀a⠀practical⠀question.⠀Let⠀the⠀comedy⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀official⠀speech⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀being⠀done⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀not⠀from⠀every⠀character⠀making⠀polished⠀jokes.\n\nUse⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀what⠀to⠀carry⠀information.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀hides⠀a⠀letter,⠀the⠀audience⠀should⠀know⠀where⠀it⠀is;⠀another⠀character⠀should⠀not⠀accidentally⠀produce⠀it⠀without⠀a⠀staged⠀action.⠀Keep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀note⠀attributed⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀stage-play⠀presentation,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀that⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀hear⠀unless⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀justifies⠀it.⠀A⠀monologue⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀public⠀decision⠀or⠀a⠀performed⠀complaint,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀hidden⠀thought.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀obligatory⠀final⠀speech⠀or⠀crowd⠀gathering.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahayay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nUse⠀a⠀particular⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind⠀for⠀the⠀current⠀spell.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrative⠀move⠀by⠀association⠀among⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern.⠀The⠀high-fantasy⠀elements⠀must⠀remain⠀legible⠀events⠀or⠀objects,⠀but⠀they⠀may⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀association:⠀a⠀proclamation⠀read⠀at⠀dawn⠀recalls⠀a⠀kitchen⠀argument;⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀relic⠀is⠀felt⠀in⠀a⠀sore⠀shoulder;⠀an⠀ancient⠀battle⠀name⠀brings⠀back⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀smoke⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀fire.\n\nKeep⠀what⠀is⠀actual,⠀remembered,⠀and⠀imagined⠀distinguishable.⠀If⠀the⠀mind⠀leaps⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀object⠀to⠀a⠀past⠀event,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀tell⠀which⠀is⠀which,⠀but⠀the⠀association⠀need⠀not⠀announce⠀its⠀trigger⠀every⠀time.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀style⠀make⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate;⠀a⠀broken⠀seal⠀remains⠀broken,⠀a⠀spoken⠀oath⠀remains⠀spoken.\n\nThe⠀comic⠀energy⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀mind⠀and⠀its⠀social⠀position.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀may⠀half-remember⠀an⠀official⠀phrase,⠀supply⠀a⠀satirical⠀correction,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀formal⠀vow⠀is⠀impractical⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀household⠀problem.⠀Other⠀characters⠀should⠀not⠀all⠀think⠀or⠀speak⠀in⠀rolling⠀associative⠀prose;⠀their⠀dialogue⠀may⠀be⠀terse,⠀bureaucratic,⠀or⠀plain,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀may⠀register⠀the⠀difference.\n\nLet⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀attention,⠀but⠀preserve⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀know⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀actually⠀happened.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀difficulty⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀hidden⠀revelation.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀still⠀circling⠀or⠀when⠀an⠀external⠀interruption⠀redirects⠀attention;⠀an⠀unfinished⠀thought⠀is⠀allowed⠀if⠀the⠀current⠀boundary⠀naturally⠀falls⠀there.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahayaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀high-fantasy⠀exchange⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀chat⠀transcript.⠀Give⠀each⠀sender⠀a⠀distinct⠀display⠀name⠀or⠀handle⠀and⠀a⠀consistent⠀digital⠀habit⠀that⠀reflects⠀their⠀relationship⠀to⠀authority⠀and⠀official⠀language:⠀one⠀writes⠀in⠀complete⠀formal⠀sentences,⠀one⠀sends⠀a⠀rapid⠀series⠀of⠀short⠀messages,⠀one⠀corrects⠀a⠀typo⠀with⠀a⠀follow-up.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀message⠀witty.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀fantasy⠀world⠀present⠀through⠀the⠀transmitted⠀content.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀attach⠀a⠀scan⠀of⠀a⠀wax-sealed⠀letter,⠀reference⠀a⠀relic's⠀recent⠀repair,⠀forward⠀a⠀fragment⠀of⠀an⠀oath,⠀or⠀ask⠀whether⠀the⠀royal⠀courier⠀bypassed⠀the⠀usual⠀gate.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀read⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀affect⠀the⠀exchange;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext⠀or⠀tension.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft.⠀If⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀shows⠀a⠀draft⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀sent,⠀mark⠀it⠀clearly⠀as⠀a⠀draft⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀outside⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀participants⠀can⠀read.⠀A⠀sent⠀message⠀is⠀in-world⠀transmitted⠀text;⠀a⠀draft⠀is⠀private⠀composition.⠀If⠀required⠀private⠀thought⠀accompanies⠀the⠀exchange,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀separated⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀or⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀interiority⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀never⠀as⠀a⠀line⠀in⠀the⠀transcript⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀see.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comedy⠀come⠀from⠀actual⠀digital⠀behavior:⠀two⠀people⠀argue⠀about⠀whether⠀the⠀sacred⠀seal⠀should⠀be⠀photographed,⠀a⠀group⠀chat⠀repeats⠀a⠀prophecy⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀year,⠀an⠀administrator⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀standard⠀form⠀after⠀a⠀dragon⠀sighting.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀need⠀not⠀appear⠀in⠀every⠀message.⠀The⠀transcript⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀practical⠀answer,⠀an⠀unresolved⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀reply;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀group-chat⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahayba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀high-fantasy⠀spell⠀as⠀a⠀scene-oriented⠀visual⠀novel⠀excerpt.⠀Begin⠀with⠀concise⠀setting⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀fantasy⠀world⠀visible:⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀hall,⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀relic's⠀covering,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀road⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀winter.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀turn⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀into⠀executable⠀commands⠀or⠀impose⠀a⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nUse⠀clear⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀character's⠀speech⠀fit⠀their⠀relation⠀to⠀official⠀language⠀and⠀authority.⠀A⠀courier⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀rule⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms;⠀a⠀clerk⠀may⠀quote⠀the⠀exact⠀wording;⠀a⠀local⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀proverb⠀incorrectly.⠀Comic⠀correction⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀practical⠀contradiction,⠀not⠀from⠀every⠀character⠀making⠀polished⠀jokes.\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀room⠀for⠀internal⠀response:⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀believe⠀another⠀person⠀wants,⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀say.⠀A⠀change⠀in⠀expression⠀or⠀posture⠀may⠀draw⠀attention,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀The⠀same⠀smile⠀may⠀mean⠀relief,⠀politeness,⠀or⠀distraction,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀misread⠀it.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀advance⠀through⠀information⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀choices⠀are⠀available⠀or⠀what⠀obligations⠀become⠀concrete.⠀Do⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀engine⠀mechanics⠀unless⠀a⠀separate⠀feature⠀authorizes⠀them.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀new⠀instruction,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀material⠀consequence;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀prompt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahaybb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Terry⠀Pratchett⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀the⠀current⠀installment⠀in⠀continuous⠀prose.⠀Keep⠀the⠀through-line⠀explicit⠀without⠀repeating⠀too⠀much:⠀what⠀task,⠀message,⠀journey,⠀or⠀obligation⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀during⠀this⠀reply,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀for⠀the⠀next.⠀Recover⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀a⠀returning⠀reader⠀needs—such⠀as⠀whose⠀seal⠀was⠀broken⠀or⠀which⠀road⠀is⠀now⠀blocked—rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history.\n\nLet⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀weight⠀appear⠀as⠀local⠀material⠀consequence:⠀a⠀changed⠀tax⠀means⠀fewer⠀sacks⠀of⠀grain,⠀a⠀restored⠀oath⠀changes⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀the⠀storehouse,⠀an⠀old⠀relic's⠀warning⠀alters⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀the⠀guard⠀patrol.⠀When⠀a⠀historical⠀event⠀affects⠀the⠀present,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀person,⠀object,⠀or⠀room;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀explanatory⠀essay⠀or⠀make⠀everyone⠀speak⠀in⠀formal⠀verse.\n\nUse⠀humor⠀about⠀actual⠀institutional⠀behavior.⠀A⠀clerk⠀may⠀require⠀three⠀copies⠀of⠀the⠀prophecy⠀before⠀acting;⠀a⠀veteran⠀may⠀point⠀out⠀that⠀the⠀famous⠀battle⠀oath⠀was⠀really⠀about⠀borrowing⠀mules;⠀a⠀courier⠀may⠀ask⠀whether⠀the⠀magic⠀map⠀includes⠀a⠀shortcut⠀that⠀avoids⠀the⠀toll.⠀The⠀comic⠀correction⠀should⠀reveal⠀something⠀particular⠀about⠀power,⠀memory,⠀or⠀practical⠀life,⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀a⠀professional⠀wit.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀ordinary⠀narrative⠀interiority,⠀not⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀speech.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀knows⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀know.⠀The⠀installment⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀completed⠀errand,⠀a⠀new⠀fact,⠀a⠀continued⠀journey,⠀or⠀an⠀earned⠀development⠀that⠀leaves⠀a⠀specific⠀question⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀crisis⠀merely⠀to⠀stop⠀the⠀reply.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀rules.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀that⠀a⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀a⠀public⠀force⠀but⠀also⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀wound.⠀Begin⠀with⠀the⠀narrator's⠀direct,⠀irreverent⠀inquiry⠀into⠀a⠀title,⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀or⠀institution:⠀trace⠀what⠀the⠀rule⠀actually⠀costs⠀in⠀goods,⠀time,⠀access,⠀or⠀loyalty,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀state⠀that⠀cost⠀without⠀ceremonial⠀deference.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀inquiry⠀move⠀from⠀the⠀institution⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀relationship.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀enforces⠀the⠀rule⠀is⠀also⠀someone⠀who⠀once⠀failed⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀owes⠀the⠀debt⠀is⠀also⠀someone⠀who⠀cannot⠀apologize.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀shift;⠀let⠀it⠀occur⠀when⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀rule⠀requires⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀relationship.\n\nLet⠀the⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀precise,⠀even⠀mocking⠀point⠀about⠀a⠀sacred⠀obligation⠀and⠀then⠀hesitate⠀when⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀answers⠀with⠀a⠀personal⠀fact.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀continue⠀arguing⠀while⠀privately⠀registering⠀that⠀the⠀argument⠀has⠀become⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀not⠀saying⠀something⠀else.⠀Write⠀that⠀private⠀registration⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀lucid⠀thought,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀stock⠀phrase⠀of⠀anguish.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator's⠀irreverence⠀fails,⠀show⠀the⠀failure⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀way:⠀a⠀sentence⠀that⠀stops⠀short,⠀a⠀question⠀repeated⠀with⠀less⠀confidence,⠀a⠀practical⠀observation⠀that⠀suddenly⠀exposes⠀the⠀speaker's⠀own⠀position.⠀Warmth⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀an⠀awkward⠀offer,⠀a⠀partial⠀admission,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀hurt.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀fantasy⠀scale⠀materially⠀present.⠀A⠀broken⠀oath⠀should⠀leave⠀a⠀visible⠀debt,⠀a⠀relic⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀someone⠀may⠀do,⠀and⠀an⠀inherited⠀institution⠀should⠀cost⠀a⠀particular⠀character⠀something⠀they⠀cannot⠀easily⠀recover.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀expose⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀rule,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀that⠀exposure⠀become⠀an⠀escape⠀from⠀the⠀emotional⠀cost.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀obligation⠀still⠀in⠀force⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀unsettled.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀candor⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀pain⠀more⠀precise,⠀not⠀more⠀distant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀interval⠀in⠀scannable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀speakers.⠀Let⠀a⠀high-fantasy⠀condition⠀operate⠀inside⠀the⠀present⠀exchange:⠀an⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀institution,⠀or⠀inherited⠀debt⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀say,⠀refuse,⠀offer,⠀or⠀ask⠀right⠀now.⠀Do⠀not⠀postpone⠀the⠀fantasy⠀element⠀to⠀background⠀exposition.⠀If⠀a⠀ritual⠀is⠀due,⠀let⠀the⠀conversation⠀turn⠀on⠀who⠀must⠀attend,⠀who⠀may⠀not,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀ritual⠀will⠀cost.⠀If⠀a⠀relic⠀is⠀present,⠀let⠀it⠀alter⠀one⠀character's⠀options⠀or⠀another⠀character's⠀claim.\n\nGive⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀irreverence⠀to⠀particular⠀voices.⠀One⠀focal⠀character⠀or⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀ask⠀the⠀direct⠀practical⠀question⠀that⠀punctures⠀ceremony:⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀procession,⠀why⠀the⠀sacred⠀exemption⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀ledger,⠀what⠀the⠀oath⠀actually⠀obliges⠀someone⠀to⠀do.⠀Other⠀speakers⠀may⠀answer⠀sincerely,⠀evade,⠀or⠀resent⠀the⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀witty⠀or⠀every⠀institution⠀absurd.⠀A⠀speaker⠀can⠀be⠀personally⠀bound⠀by⠀the⠀same⠀rule⠀they⠀critique,⠀and⠀their⠀irreverence⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀testing⠀a⠀cost⠀they⠀already⠀feel.\n\nUse⠀short⠀narrative⠀passages⠀to⠀supply⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀perception⠀or⠀reasoning⠀between⠀lines⠀of⠀dialogue.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀within⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀A⠀character's⠀spoken⠀challenge⠀and⠀their⠀private⠀hesitation⠀may⠀differ,⠀but⠀the⠀difference⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀their⠀position⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀general⠀rule⠀that⠀everyone⠀conceals⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀the⠀continuation⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀unresolved⠀practical⠀consequence:⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged,⠀a⠀permission⠀refused,⠀a⠀relic's⠀effect⠀still⠀unfolding.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀legible⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀exchange,⠀even⠀if⠀a⠀question⠀remains⠀unanswered⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀remains⠀unfinished.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀choice⠀screen,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀satirical⠀and⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀route.⠀Treat⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀as⠀one⠀episode⠀in⠀a⠀larger⠀social⠀inquiry⠀into⠀the⠀active⠀high-fantasy⠀world.⠀Begin⠀with⠀the⠀public⠀form⠀of⠀an⠀institution:⠀a⠀ceremony,⠀an⠀oath-taking,⠀a⠀relic's⠀display,⠀or⠀an⠀official⠀record.⠀Let⠀the⠀vernacular⠀narrator⠀observe⠀the⠀form⠀precisely,⠀including⠀the⠀functionaries,⠀the⠀waiting,⠀the⠀objects,⠀and⠀the⠀language⠀of⠀obligation.⠀Then⠀follow⠀one⠀direct⠀question⠀beyond⠀the⠀socially⠀approved⠀answer.⠀The⠀question⠀should⠀be⠀practical:⠀who⠀supplies⠀the⠀candles,⠀why⠀the⠀exemption⠀appears⠀in⠀one⠀register⠀and⠀not⠀another,⠀what⠀the⠀oath⠀does⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀cannot⠀refuse⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀episode⠀expose⠀a⠀contradiction⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀moral⠀fable.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀solemn⠀rule⠀is⠀honored⠀in⠀public⠀while⠀its⠀cost⠀falls⠀on⠀someone⠀privately,⠀or⠀that⠀ritual⠀language⠀conceals⠀an⠀exchange⠀of⠀influence.⠀Write⠀the⠀contradiction⠀through⠀concrete⠀institutional⠀detail:⠀a⠀fee,⠀a⠀missing⠀name,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀relic,⠀a⠀debt⠀recorded⠀under⠀the⠀wrong⠀heading.⠀Keep⠀the⠀satire⠀aimed⠀at⠀the⠀institution's⠀operation,⠀not⠀at⠀the⠀burden⠀itself.⠀The⠀character⠀who⠀suffers⠀the⠀cost⠀should⠀remain⠀particular⠀and⠀entangled,⠀not⠀a⠀symbol⠀of⠀universal⠀injustice.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀beat⠀at⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀episode.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀expose⠀the⠀contradiction⠀and⠀still⠀be⠀trapped⠀by⠀the⠀obligation.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀irreverence⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀absurdity⠀clearer⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀character⠀free.⠀If⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀recurs,⠀let⠀it⠀deepen⠀the⠀condition⠀or⠀revise⠀a⠀first⠀impression:⠀a⠀new⠀record⠀may⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀exemption⠀had⠀a⠀hidden⠀condition,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀functionary⠀may⠀act⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀interest.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀and⠀community⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀setting.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀dynasty,⠀accent,⠀or⠀cast⠀identity.⠀Ancient⠀history⠀should⠀become⠀real⠀through⠀a⠀record,⠀debt,⠀or⠀disputed⠀inheritance⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀someone⠀may⠀do⠀next.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard-edged⠀concrete⠀units.⠀Open⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀material⠀form⠀of⠀a⠀high-fantasy⠀obligation:⠀a⠀seal⠀cracked⠀across⠀its⠀wax,⠀a⠀relic's⠀binding⠀worn⠀at⠀the⠀hinge,⠀a⠀debt⠀recorded⠀in⠀a⠀ledger⠀whose⠀ink⠀has⠀bled,⠀an⠀oath⠀spoken⠀over⠀a⠀blade⠀that⠀needs⠀sharpening.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀obligation.⠀Let⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀record⠀show⠀its⠀age⠀and⠀its⠀current⠀pressure.\n\nLet⠀a⠀speaker⠀test⠀the⠀rule⠀against⠀its⠀physical⠀result.⠀Use⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀challenge:⠀name⠀what⠀the⠀ceremony⠀costs⠀in⠀goods,⠀time,⠀or⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀ask⠀why⠀the⠀sacred⠀exemption⠀does⠀not⠀match⠀the⠀supplies⠀actually⠀issued.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inquiry⠀causal.⠀The⠀speaker⠀should⠀trace⠀a⠀consequence,⠀not⠀merely⠀mock⠀the⠀rule.⠀When⠀the⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀to⠀follow⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀effects,⠀sustain⠀the⠀thought⠀in⠀longer⠀syntax.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀turns⠀on⠀a⠀decision,⠀compress⠀the⠀transition:⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀damaged⠀relic,⠀an⠀institution's⠀armed⠀response,⠀a⠀debt⠀called⠀in.\n\nGround⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀speaker's⠀position.⠀A⠀functionary⠀may⠀defend⠀the⠀rule⠀because⠀they⠀have⠀already⠀paid⠀for⠀it;⠀a⠀debtor⠀may⠀curse⠀the⠀oath⠀while⠀still⠀bound⠀by⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀prose⠀uniformly⠀sarcastic.⠀The⠀edge⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀situation's⠀practical⠀pressure,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀default⠀tone.⠀Change⠀rhythm⠀when⠀the⠀stakes⠀become⠀material:⠀describe⠀a⠀ritual⠀sparely,⠀then⠀interrupt⠀it⠀with⠀one⠀concrete⠀fact.⠀Keep⠀grandeur⠀and⠀magic⠀present⠀in⠀durable⠀physical⠀form.⠀The⠀fantasy⠀scale⠀remains⠀real⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀not⠀through⠀ornate⠀language.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀current⠀material⠀through⠀authored⠀documents.⠀Each⠀entry⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀writer,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Let⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀world⠀appear⠀as⠀records⠀with⠀practical⠀stakes:⠀a⠀clerk's⠀ledger⠀entry,⠀a⠀messenger's⠀report,⠀a⠀claimant's⠀petition,⠀a⠀field⠀note,⠀or⠀a⠀letter⠀about⠀an⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀institution,⠀or⠀inherited⠀estate.⠀The⠀document's⠀writer⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀write⠀and⠀a⠀position⠀that⠀limits⠀what⠀they⠀know.\n\nLet⠀the⠀document's⠀author⠀follow⠀a⠀direct⠀question.⠀A⠀clerk⠀can⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀sacred⠀exemption⠀contradicts⠀a⠀tax⠀roll.⠀A⠀messenger⠀can⠀report⠀what⠀a⠀ceremony⠀actually⠀cost⠀in⠀supplies.⠀A⠀claimant⠀can⠀ask⠀why⠀a⠀relic's⠀transfer⠀was⠀recorded⠀under⠀the⠀wrong⠀heading.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀document⠀into⠀confession.⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀writers;⠀some⠀are⠀precise⠀and⠀skeptical,⠀others⠀evade⠀or⠀flatter.⠀Let⠀the⠀document's⠀omissions⠀and⠀revisions⠀carry⠀information.⠀A⠀later⠀marginal⠀note⠀can⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀claim.⠀A⠀missing⠀page⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀decision⠀someone⠀is⠀not⠀willing⠀to⠀record.⠀A⠀reused⠀parchment⠀or⠀an⠀unsigned⠀draft⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀rule⠀or⠀institution⠀becoming⠀physical.\n\nPreserve⠀continuity⠀through⠀the⠀next⠀document's⠀purpose.⠀If⠀a⠀report⠀omits⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀later⠀reply⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀journal⠀breaks⠀off⠀before⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀following⠀letter⠀can⠀reveal⠀the⠀oath's⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.⠀Keep⠀the⠀document⠀form⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀writer⠀must⠀not⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀could⠀not⠀know,⠀and⠀a⠀record's⠀private⠀thoughts⠀are⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀live⠀continuation⠀of⠀an⠀external⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀track.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀care⠀inside⠀the⠀high-fantasy⠀world.⠀Do⠀not⠀remove⠀oaths,⠀relics,⠀debts,⠀or⠀institutions⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀turns⠀warm.⠀Begin⠀with⠀the⠀pressure⠀the⠀obligation⠀creates:⠀a⠀ritual⠀due⠀at⠀dawn,⠀a⠀vow⠀that⠀makes⠀rest⠀unsafe,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀follows⠀the⠀character⠀into⠀the⠀room.⠀Then⠀show⠀a⠀chosen⠀practical⠀kindness⠀that⠀works⠀around⠀the⠀constraint.⠀Someone⠀brings⠀a⠀familiar⠀remedy⠀before⠀the⠀ritual,⠀remembers⠀a⠀preference⠀despite⠀a⠀long⠀journey,⠀mends⠀gear⠀that⠀the⠀vow⠀has⠀worn,⠀or⠀sits⠀with⠀another⠀person⠀after⠀a⠀difficult⠀oath⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀confession.\n\nLet⠀the⠀care⠀be⠀specific⠀and⠀material.⠀The⠀comfort⠀should⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does:⠀the⠀food⠀prepared,⠀the⠀blanket⠀placed,⠀the⠀seal⠀checked,⠀the⠀silence⠀kept.⠀Use⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀candor⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀warmth⠀from⠀becoming⠀sentimental.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀gently⠀puncture⠀their⠀own⠀grand⠀language⠀or⠀tease⠀a⠀friend⠀about⠀a⠀noble⠀posture,⠀but⠀the⠀kindness⠀remains⠀sincere.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀prohibition⠀precisely⠀because⠀it⠀blocks⠀ordinary⠀care.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀refuse⠀comfort,⠀keep⠀a⠀private⠀wound,⠀or⠀disagree⠀with⠀the⠀way⠀help⠀is⠀offered.⠀Affection⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀emotional⠀breakthrough.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀fantasy⠀scale⠀in⠀view.⠀A⠀small⠀pleasure⠀can⠀be⠀framed⠀by⠀a⠀larger⠀institution⠀that⠀still⠀demands⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀morning.⠀Let⠀that⠀contrast⠀add⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀cancel⠀the⠀comfort.⠀Preserve⠀established⠀problems⠀and⠀threats⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀facts.⠀The⠀scene's⠀calm⠀is⠀something⠀the⠀characters⠀make⠀and⠀can⠀lose,⠀not⠀a⠀guarantee⠀that⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀become⠀safe.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions.⠀Use⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀formal⠀architecture⠀as⠀a⠀license⠀for⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀or⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀imitation.⠀Establish⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀high-fantasy⠀institution,⠀oath,⠀or⠀relic⠀in⠀one⠀composed⠀movement:⠀its⠀ceremony,⠀its⠀history,⠀or⠀its⠀current⠀operation.⠀Then⠀let⠀a⠀precise⠀sentence⠀expose⠀the⠀practical⠀cost⠀beneath⠀that⠀public⠀meaning:⠀who⠀pays,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀is⠀expected⠀to⠀kneel⠀while⠀the⠀ledger⠀stays⠀unbalanced.\n\nPlace⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀direct⠀inquiry⠀inside⠀this⠀composed⠀register.⠀The⠀irreverence⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀a⠀precise⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀tone.⠀A⠀paragraph⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀procession's⠀order⠀and⠀the⠀dignity⠀of⠀its⠀participants,⠀then⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀youngest⠀attendant⠀is⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀must⠀carry⠀the⠀debt.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀question⠀socially⠀approved⠀answers⠀without⠀abandoning⠀the⠀sentence's⠀formal⠀balance.⠀Distinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀speech;⠀characters⠀may⠀still⠀talk⠀plainly,⠀but⠀the⠀narrative⠀voice⠀composes⠀and⠀judges.\n\nUse⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast⠀when⠀it⠀organizes⠀the⠀material.⠀A⠀formal⠀audience⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀same⠀obligation⠀becomes⠀personal.⠀Let⠀the⠀transition⠀be⠀motivated⠀by⠀a⠀material⠀consequence:⠀the⠀audience⠀ends,⠀a⠀character⠀receives⠀the⠀relic,⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀acknowledged,⠀or⠀a⠀permission⠀is⠀refused.⠀Connect⠀scale⠀to⠀individual⠀loyalty.⠀A⠀relic's⠀history⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀ornament⠀but⠀a⠀reason⠀someone⠀can⠀be⠀compelled,⠀forgiven,⠀or⠀refused.⠀Keep⠀the⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀flexible;⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀allowed⠀when⠀it⠀traces⠀a⠀causal⠀chain⠀or⠀an⠀institution's⠀effect.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀composed⠀scene⠀has⠀made⠀its⠀next⠀implication⠀legible,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀summary⠀or⠀moral.⠀The⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀still⠀governs⠀perspective,⠀access,⠀and⠀interiority.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀each⠀segment⠀as⠀a⠀situated⠀oral⠀telling.⠀Identify⠀the⠀teller,⠀the⠀audience⠀that⠀needs⠀or⠀resists⠀the⠀tale,⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀purpose⠀of⠀telling:⠀to⠀persuade⠀a⠀council,⠀delay⠀a⠀judgment,⠀warn⠀an⠀heir,⠀defend⠀an⠀absent⠀ally,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀listener⠀correct⠀a⠀mistaken⠀oath.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀direct⠀reasoning⠀operate⠀inside⠀the⠀actual⠀tale.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀wonder⠀and⠀ask⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀it,⠀which⠀ancient⠀phrase⠀now⠀justifies⠀the⠀rule,⠀what⠀the⠀ritual's⠀promised⠀protection⠀actually⠀consumed,⠀or⠀why⠀an⠀institution⠀honors⠀a⠀precedent⠀no⠀participant⠀could⠀have⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time.\n\nUse⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀to⠀expose⠀the⠀consequence⠀behind⠀an⠀inherited⠀fact.⠀An⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀title,⠀or⠀ancestral⠀agreement⠀does⠀not⠀remain⠀decorative.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀shows⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀obligation⠀changed⠀a⠀household⠀budget,⠀a⠀marriage⠀contract,⠀an⠀exile⠀sentence,⠀a⠀harvest⠀decision,⠀or⠀a⠀child's⠀education.⠀Connect⠀that⠀material⠀cost⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀listener's⠀present⠀choice.⠀Tie⠀it⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀good,⠀service,⠀prohibition,⠀or⠀debt⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀can⠀affect.\n\nThe⠀outer⠀story⠀interrupts⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀being⠀received.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀reject,⠀bargain,⠀correct,⠀compare,⠀or⠀capitulate.⠀When⠀a⠀listener⠀repeats⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀tale⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀teller⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀legal⠀meaning,⠀the⠀frame's⠀recurrence⠀revises⠀the⠀audience,⠀not⠀a⠀hidden⠀timeline.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀levels⠀clearly⠀marked⠀by⠀voice⠀or⠀typographic⠀convention,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀formal⠀opening⠀and⠀closing⠀formulas⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀world's⠀ritual⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀habit⠀supplies⠀one.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀embedded⠀tale⠀contradicts⠀an⠀official⠀monument,⠀chronicle,⠀or⠀legal⠀proverb,⠀make⠀the⠀contradiction⠀matter⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.⠀A⠀teller⠀can⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀king's⠀mercy⠀depended⠀on⠀a⠀loan⠀he⠀never⠀repaid,⠀that⠀the⠀founding⠀treaty⠀protected⠀a⠀particular⠀forge⠀because⠀a⠀living⠀practitioner⠀had⠀leverage,⠀not⠀grace,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀sacred⠀name⠀survives⠀only⠀because⠀clerks⠀kept⠀collecting⠀the⠀tax.⠀The⠀listener⠀can⠀then⠀ask⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀the⠀teller⠀wanted:⠀who⠀will⠀continue⠀to⠀bear⠀the⠀cost⠀when⠀the⠀ceremony⠀resumes?⠀The⠀fiction⠀may⠀permit⠀a⠀wonder⠀whose⠀mechanism⠀cannot⠀be⠀explained,⠀but⠀no⠀wonder⠀may⠀automatically⠀erase⠀its⠀material⠀cost⠀or⠀exempt⠀it⠀from⠀rational⠀question.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀consequence⠀requires:⠀at⠀a⠀near-ending⠀question,⠀an⠀interrupted⠀testimony,⠀a⠀servant's⠀opened⠀door,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀danger.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀complete⠀resolution⠀into⠀the⠀response⠀or⠀require⠀an⠀external⠀threat⠀to⠀stop⠀business.⠀The⠀tale's⠀effect⠀on⠀obligation⠀is⠀the⠀point,⠀not⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀nested⠀clauses.⠀A⠀wonder⠀may⠀remain⠀unexplained⠀without⠀weakening⠀the⠀argument;⠀an⠀absurd⠀rule⠀may⠀persist⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀person⠀cynical.⠀Keep⠀humor,⠀contempt,⠀and⠀tenderness⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀voice⠀that⠀actually⠀owns⠀them,⠀and⠀let⠀sincere⠀cooperation⠀or⠀honor⠀stand⠀where⠀the⠀world's⠀facts⠀support⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose⠀as⠀the⠀storytelling⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀operate⠀through⠀an⠀actual⠀record,⠀investigation,⠀or⠀inheritance⠀proceeding:⠀a⠀land⠀register,⠀a⠀guild⠀ledger,⠀an⠀oath⠀roll,⠀a⠀steward's⠀deposition,⠀a⠀toll⠀account,⠀or⠀a⠀legatee's⠀inventory.⠀The⠀teller⠀should⠀treat⠀the⠀record⠀not⠀as⠀decoration⠀but⠀as⠀an⠀instrument⠀that⠀can⠀change⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀city,⠀hold⠀a⠀title,⠀sell⠀a⠀relic,⠀receive⠀protection,⠀or⠀bear⠀a⠀debt.\n\nCompare⠀the⠀record⠀with⠀the⠀remembered⠀conditions⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀founding⠀charter's⠀generous⠀flourishes⠀appear⠀just⠀after⠀a⠀fire⠀the⠀tax⠀roll⠀never⠀mentions,⠀that⠀the⠀ancestor⠀honored⠀in⠀the⠀entry⠀book⠀was⠀also⠀listed⠀as⠀a⠀debtor⠀in⠀the⠀year⠀the⠀hereditary⠀privilege⠀was⠀granted,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀relic's⠀promised⠀aid⠀coincided⠀exactly⠀with⠀a⠀transport⠀contract⠀paid⠀in⠀advance.⠀Let⠀the⠀comparison⠀create⠀the⠀present⠀consequence:⠀a⠀living⠀claimant⠀loses⠀an⠀inheritance,⠀a⠀village⠀rediscovers⠀its⠀lost⠀water⠀right,⠀a⠀council⠀must⠀decide⠀which⠀version⠀of⠀the⠀vow⠀controls⠀a⠀marriage⠀or⠀an⠀armed⠀response.\n\nLet⠀the⠀contemporary⠀teller⠀remain⠀present⠀as⠀an⠀inquirer.⠀The⠀prose⠀can⠀show⠀a⠀clerk⠀or⠀legatee⠀setting⠀two⠀documents⠀side⠀by⠀side,⠀asking⠀a⠀surviving⠀elder⠀what⠀the⠀old⠀note⠀meant,⠀noticing⠀a⠀seal⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀struck⠀by⠀the⠀office⠀that⠀claims⠀it,⠀or⠀explaining⠀to⠀a⠀noble⠀why⠀the⠀ancient⠀name⠀no⠀longer⠀conveys⠀the⠀toll⠀exemption.⠀The⠀inquiry⠀can⠀be⠀personal⠀and⠀candid⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀confession.⠀The⠀historical-memory⠀structure⠀should⠀allow⠀later⠀knowledge⠀to⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀impression⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀participant⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀now⠀reveals.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀scale⠀in⠀the⠀material⠀texture⠀of⠀the⠀record.⠀A⠀magical⠀oath⠀is⠀not⠀merely⠀a⠀strange⠀concept;⠀it⠀has⠀an⠀administrator,⠀a⠀renewal⠀fee,⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀exceptions,⠀and⠀a⠀penalty⠀clause⠀whose⠀wording⠀shifts⠀when⠀copied.⠀Ancient⠀events⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs⠀because⠀the⠀ledger,⠀charter,⠀or⠀register⠀is⠀still⠀used.⠀When⠀wonder⠀is⠀invoked,⠀let⠀the⠀documentary⠀voice⠀question⠀what⠀it⠀actually⠀delivered.⠀A⠀spell⠀that⠀protects⠀a⠀household⠀may⠀have⠀also⠀required⠀the⠀household⠀to⠀feed⠀a⠀particular⠀official⠀for⠀a⠀season;⠀a⠀title⠀may⠀be⠀void⠀if⠀no⠀living⠀witness⠀can⠀name⠀the⠀original⠀service.⠀Expose⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀rule⠀without⠀explaining⠀the⠀magic⠀away⠀or⠀discarding⠀its⠀power.\n\nWrite⠀with⠀the⠀clear,⠀sequential⠀syntax⠀of⠀the⠀documentary⠀route:⠀short⠀connected⠀clauses,⠀precise⠀dates⠀or⠀conditions⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀known,⠀and⠀no⠀overwrought⠀national-character⠀language.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀grimness,⠀bureaucracy,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀country⠀as⠀the⠀default.⠀When⠀the⠀record⠀is⠀incomplete,⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀honestly.⠀A⠀missing⠀page,⠀an⠀unreadable⠀name,⠀or⠀a⠀contradictory⠀memory⠀can⠀keep⠀the⠀matter⠀open⠀without⠀stalling⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀records⠀comparison,⠀a⠀discovered⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀just⠀made;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀completed⠀case⠀or⠀a⠀moral.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀world's⠀humor,⠀tenderness,⠀and⠀anger⠀remain⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀characters⠀who⠀own⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nSet⠀the⠀telling⠀at⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀an⠀inherited⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀authority⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀life⠀that⠀actually⠀sustains⠀or⠀erodes⠀it.⠀Use⠀a⠀relic,⠀title,⠀oath,⠀ancestral⠀pact,⠀or⠀magical⠀privilege⠀whose⠀power⠀cannot⠀hold⠀itself.⠀Show⠀its⠀decay⠀through⠀present⠀urban⠀material⠀detail:⠀a⠀sacred⠀forge⠀now⠀behind⠀a⠀worker's⠀lease,⠀an⠀oath⠀stone's⠀precinct⠀bisected⠀by⠀a⠀shared⠀wall,⠀a⠀title⠀relied⠀on⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀cannot⠀pay⠀the⠀registration⠀fee,⠀a⠀protective⠀glyph⠀damaged⠀during⠀a⠀repair⠀the⠀protector⠀ignored.⠀Let⠀the⠀collision⠀make⠀an⠀obligation⠀concrete;⠀someone⠀must⠀decide⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀upkeep,⠀who⠀may⠀enter,⠀who⠀inherits,⠀or⠀whose⠀word⠀still⠀binds.\n\nBegin⠀with⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly,⠀so⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀is⠀carried⠀by⠀the⠀space⠀and⠀interaction⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀introductory⠀mood⠀paragraphs.⠀Use⠀precise⠀details—plaster,⠀pipes,⠀market⠀stall⠀covers,⠀worn⠀seals,⠀dusty⠀court⠀rolls,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive—and⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀inquire⠀into⠀how⠀the⠀old⠀thing⠀currently⠀works.⠀A⠀direct⠀question⠀can⠀puncture⠀a⠀solemn⠀assumption:⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀old⠀keeper⠀still⠀hold⠀the⠀key⠀if⠀he⠀cannot⠀read⠀the⠀deed,⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀temple⠀take⠀the⠀payment⠀but⠀not⠀repair⠀the⠀door⠀the⠀god's⠀mark⠀protects,⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀noble⠀refuse⠀the⠀legal⠀name⠀that⠀would⠀make⠀the⠀exemption⠀valid?⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀reveal⠀a⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀or⠀a⠀compromised⠀intimacy,⠀not⠀merely⠀a⠀corruption⠀of⠀authority.\n\nFrame⠀the⠀encounter⠀as⠀a⠀meeting⠀between⠀two⠀or⠀more⠀particular⠀people⠀with⠀different⠀interests⠀in⠀the⠀decaying⠀inheritance,⠀and⠀let⠀one⠀private⠀mask⠀fall⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀confess⠀that⠀they⠀protected⠀the⠀relic⠀because⠀their⠀lover⠀lived⠀inside⠀the⠀precinct,⠀another⠀may⠀admit⠀they⠀maintained⠀the⠀oath⠀only⠀to⠀collect⠀the⠀rent,⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀the⠀guardian⠀and⠀the⠀claimant⠀already⠀know⠀each⠀other⠀from⠀a⠀failed⠀marriage⠀or⠀a⠀childhood⠀debt.⠀Let⠀the⠀intimacy⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀decision.⠀The⠀cost⠀is⠀emotional⠀and⠀relational⠀as⠀well⠀as⠀legal,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀reduce⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀betrayal⠀plot.⠀Cooperation⠀and⠀genuine⠀protection⠀remain⠀available⠀when⠀the⠀world⠀supports⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀modern⠀material⠀lens⠀without⠀inventing⠀phones,⠀corporations,⠀or⠀anachronistic⠀machinery⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀world⠀already⠀contains⠀them.⠀Use⠀local⠀institutions⠀and⠀crafts:⠀a⠀guild⠀or⠀stationers'⠀office⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀corporation,⠀a⠀foot⠀courier⠀or⠀signal⠀chain⠀rather⠀than⠀an⠀electronic⠀dispatch,⠀a⠀lease⠀and⠀a⠀key⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀database.⠀When⠀magic⠀is⠀present,⠀let⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀treatment⠀show⠀its⠀price⠀through⠀present⠀contact.⠀A⠀ward⠀may⠀dim⠀as⠀the⠀building⠀settles,⠀an⠀oath⠀may⠀bind⠀only⠀while⠀a⠀particular⠀door⠀remains⠀oak,⠀a⠀title⠀may⠀fail⠀if⠀the⠀holder⠀has⠀not⠀slept⠀within⠀the⠀old⠀walls⠀for⠀a⠀season.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀ask⠀exactly⠀that⠀practical⠀question.\n\nUse⠀the⠀portable⠀stylistic⠀treatment⠀only:⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀its⠀own⠀city,⠀and⠀the⠀encounter⠀exposes⠀that⠀gap.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀business⠀is⠀unfinished—at⠀a⠀door⠀opening,⠀a⠀quiet⠀refusal,⠀a⠀shared⠀memory⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀one⠀person⠀will⠀sign—and⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀climactic⠀confrontation⠀unless⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀stakes⠀produce⠀one.⠀Keep⠀humor⠀and⠀candor⠀owned⠀by⠀particular⠀voices⠀rather⠀than⠀uniformly⠀grim⠀narration,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀fantasy's⠀mythic⠀scale⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀changed⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀oath⠀or⠀relic⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀stock⠀grand⠀speeches.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀narration.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀be⠀told⠀by⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀was⠀present⠀inside⠀or⠀near⠀the⠀inherited⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀institution,⠀oath,⠀relic,⠀or⠀war:⠀a⠀former⠀servant⠀of⠀the⠀shrine,⠀a⠀child⠀of⠀a⠀minor⠀oath-holder,⠀a⠀ferryman⠀who⠀carried⠀the⠀army's⠀supplies,⠀a⠀healer⠀called⠀after⠀the⠀tithe,⠀a⠀clerk⠀who⠀saw⠀what⠀the⠀feast⠀actually⠀cost.⠀The⠀narrator⠀speaks⠀from⠀remembered⠀participation⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀an⠀official⠀register.\n\nMake⠀the⠀testimony⠀expose⠀the⠀practical⠀underside⠀of⠀a⠀solemn⠀rule⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀institution⠀wholly⠀false.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀candidly⠀explain⠀why⠀the⠀protection⠀worked⠀only⠀until⠀the⠀levy⠀arrived,⠀how⠀the⠀title⠀came⠀with⠀a⠀marriage⠀debt,⠀what⠀the⠀ritual⠀did⠀to⠀the⠀water⠀supply,⠀or⠀why⠀the⠀vow⠀was⠀credited⠀to⠀the⠀wrong⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀uniform⠀anger⠀or⠀a⠀heroic⠀outsider.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀have⠀benefited,⠀may⠀still⠀respect⠀the⠀god⠀or⠀law,⠀or⠀may⠀be⠀withholding⠀a⠀particular⠀shame.⠀The⠀key⠀operation⠀is⠀direct⠀personal⠀candor:⠀one⠀voice⠀follows⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀approved⠀answer.\n\nGive⠀the⠀inner⠀account⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀remembered⠀history⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀purely⠀present⠀argument.⠀Distinguish⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knew⠀then⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀now.⠀Use⠀phrases⠀like⠀\"we⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀that⠀the⠀seal⠀had⠀been⠀promised,\"⠀\"only⠀later⠀I⠀understood⠀why⠀the⠀steward⠀burned⠀the⠀lists,\"⠀or⠀\"I⠀was⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀counted⠀them,⠀and⠀I⠀said⠀nothing.\"⠀Let⠀that⠀later⠀recognition⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀outer⠀decision,⠀not⠀a⠀melodramatic⠀reversal.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀ask⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀confirm,⠀explain,⠀or⠀testify⠀publicly,⠀and⠀the⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀before⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀fully⠀accepted.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀whenever⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀supplies⠀them,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀on⠀scenes⠀where⠀none⠀is⠀given.⠀The⠀testimony's⠀cadence⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀community⠀and⠀education.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀cast⠀universally⠀witty,⠀saintly,⠀or⠀oppressed;⠀characters⠀may⠀protect⠀their⠀own⠀interests,⠀lie,⠀cooperate,⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀speak⠀without⠀simplifying⠀the⠀fantasy⠀world⠀into⠀cynicism.\n\nThe⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀scale⠀should⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀changed⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀oath⠀or⠀title,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀background⠀mountains⠀or⠀old⠀names.⠀A⠀regional⠀tax,⠀a⠀marriage⠀contest,⠀a⠀pilgrimage⠀road,⠀a⠀magical⠀channel,⠀or⠀a⠀temple⠀granary⠀can⠀carry⠀ancient⠀power⠀while⠀the⠀testimonial⠀shows⠀how⠀it⠀touched⠀ordinary⠀food,⠀sleep,⠀and⠀choice.⠀When⠀wonder⠀is⠀present,⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀question⠀what⠀it⠀actually⠀delivered⠀without⠀denying⠀it:⠀a⠀god's⠀favor⠀may⠀have⠀arrived⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀community⠀fed⠀the⠀army⠀for⠀a⠀winter;⠀a⠀healing⠀relic⠀may⠀work⠀while⠀its⠀keeper's⠀family⠀carries⠀the⠀pain.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀whether⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀dangerous⠀line⠀of⠀testimony,⠀or⠀at⠀the⠀listeners'⠀first⠀uncertain⠀reaction;⠀no⠀moral⠀resolution⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀early-modern⠀comic⠀and⠀theatrical⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀move⠀through⠀present⠀social⠀collisions:⠀a⠀retainer⠀caught⠀between⠀two⠀contradictory⠀oaths,⠀a⠀guild⠀trying⠀to⠀interpret⠀a⠀protective⠀verse⠀for⠀a⠀toll⠀dispute,⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation⠀obstructed⠀by⠀an⠀ancestral⠀blessing,⠀a⠀magistrate's⠀deputy⠀who⠀must⠀feed⠀the⠀god's⠀horse⠀before⠀the⠀god's⠀law⠀can⠀be⠀read.⠀The⠀prose⠀may⠀be⠀direct,⠀fast,⠀and⠀ironic⠀without⠀being⠀uniformly⠀quippy;⠀every⠀joke⠀should⠀be⠀particular⠀to⠀its⠀owner⠀and⠀its⠀social⠀position.\n\nMake⠀the⠀comic⠀material⠀rise⠀from⠀the⠀exact⠀mechanics⠀of⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀setting.⠀Rulebooks,⠀rituals,⠀relics,⠀oaths,⠀taxes,⠀precedence,⠀land⠀rights,⠀and⠀sacred⠀phrases⠀can⠀be⠀absurd⠀when⠀placed⠀against⠀ordinary⠀need.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀expose⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀with⠀a⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo-style⠀direct⠀question:⠀if⠀the⠀founder⠀forbade⠀borrowing,⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀temple⠀lease⠀mention⠀interest;⠀if⠀the⠀title⠀passes⠀by⠀blood,⠀what⠀does⠀the⠀foundling's⠀seal⠀actually⠀conjure;⠀if⠀the⠀vow⠀is⠀irrevocable,⠀who⠀pays⠀for⠀the⠀food⠀the⠀vow⠀obliges⠀the⠀household⠀to⠀serve?⠀The⠀humor⠀should⠀be⠀nimble⠀and⠀uncompromising⠀rather⠀than⠀slapstick⠀filler.⠀It⠀can⠀become⠀biting,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀character⠀to⠀be⠀corrupt;⠀honesty,⠀loyalty,⠀and⠀cooperation⠀can⠀produce⠀comedy⠀as⠀readily⠀as⠀deceit.\n\nLet⠀the⠀dialogue⠀and⠀stage-like⠀presentation⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀clear⠀entrances,⠀physical⠀business,⠀and⠀spoken⠀exchanges⠀so⠀the⠀situation⠀remains⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀mistake⠀an⠀identity,⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀legally⠀precise⠀non-answer,⠀or⠀turn⠀a⠀title⠀into⠀a⠀pun⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀agreement.⠀If⠀a⠀supernatural⠀element⠀exists,⠀treat⠀it⠀through⠀its⠀practical,⠀social⠀effects:⠀a⠀protective⠀charm⠀may⠀be⠀argued⠀over⠀like⠀a⠀land⠀deed;⠀a⠀prophecy⠀may⠀be⠀parsed⠀for⠀its⠀tax⠀consequences;⠀a⠀sacred⠀beast⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀proceed⠀until⠀it⠀is⠀properly⠀fed.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀the⠀world⠀excludes⠀or⠀reduce⠀ancient⠀power⠀to⠀a⠀joke.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀seasonal⠀imagery,⠀tea⠀ceremony,⠀restrained⠀introspection,⠀or⠀a⠀national⠀inventory⠀of⠀scenery⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀and⠀character⠀genuinely⠀supply⠀them.⠀The⠀method⠀permits⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀exuberance,⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀where⠀appropriate.⠀Distinctive⠀regional⠀language⠀or⠀social⠀categories⠀may⠀appear⠀if⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀them,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀foreign⠀honor⠀system⠀or⠀stereotype.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀narrator;⠀if⠀multiple⠀voices⠀appear,⠀keep⠀their⠀forms⠀distinct⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀follow.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀satisfying⠀reversal,⠀a⠀fresh⠀entanglement,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀standoff;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀sentimental⠀turn.⠀When⠀the⠀comic⠀rhythm⠀rises,⠀it⠀can⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀social⠀position⠀without⠀ending⠀the⠀dispute:⠀a⠀merchant⠀realizes⠀the⠀lease⠀was⠀invalid,⠀a⠀lord⠀cannot⠀remember⠀which⠀name⠀he⠀swore,⠀a⠀deputy⠀joyfully⠀discovers⠀the⠀fine⠀applies⠀to⠀both⠀parties.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀boundary⠀allows,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀polyphonic⠀and⠀nonlinear⠀narration.⠀Break⠀the⠀telling⠀into⠀two⠀or⠀more⠀attributed⠀voices⠀that⠀remember⠀or⠀report⠀the⠀same⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀event⠀from⠀different⠀positions:⠀a⠀former⠀soldier,⠀a⠀temple⠀debtor,⠀a⠀marriage⠀broker,⠀a⠀landholder,⠀a⠀child⠀who⠀watched⠀the⠀collapse,⠀a⠀traveling⠀judge,⠀or⠀a⠀defeated⠀rival.⠀Do⠀not⠀flatten⠀the⠀speakers⠀into⠀one⠀chronicle.⠀Let⠀each⠀voice⠀carry⠀its⠀own⠀selection,⠀self-interest,⠀and⠀idiom,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀voices⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀understood⠀earlier.\n\nMove⠀nonlinearly⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀levels⠀intelligible.⠀A⠀later⠀memoir⠀may⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀decree,⠀a⠀child's⠀memory⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀an⠀official⠀report,⠀or⠀an⠀observer⠀may⠀start⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀siege⠀and⠀only⠀later⠀reveal⠀why⠀the⠀gate⠀was⠀open.⠀Label⠀the⠀voices⠀with⠀names⠀or⠀positions⠀where⠀attribution⠀is⠀ambiguous,⠀and⠀use⠀small⠀physical⠀or⠀textual⠀anchors—a⠀watermark,⠀a⠀map⠀fragment,⠀a⠀repeated⠀first⠀line,⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀the⠀dead—to⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀track⠀time⠀and⠀ownership.⠀The⠀nonlinearity⠀should⠀create⠀concrete⠀revision,⠀not⠀merely⠀reorder⠀the⠀same⠀facts.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀candid⠀debunking⠀inside⠀the⠀polyphony.⠀One⠀speaker⠀can⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀miracle⠀actually⠀cost,⠀another⠀can⠀admit⠀that⠀the⠀army⠀began⠀the⠀retreat⠀before⠀the⠀consul⠀gave⠀the⠀heroic⠀order,⠀a⠀third⠀can⠀explain⠀that⠀the⠀famous⠀oath⠀was⠀never⠀spoken⠀by⠀the⠀ancestor⠀it⠀names.⠀Let⠀those⠀revelations⠀change⠀a⠀present⠀decision:⠀which⠀heir⠀may⠀enter,⠀who⠀owes⠀the⠀indemnity,⠀whose⠀name⠀goes⠀on⠀the⠀memorial,⠀whether⠀the⠀village⠀will⠀follow⠀a⠀restored⠀claimant.⠀The⠀different⠀accounts⠀need⠀not⠀converge⠀into⠀one⠀absolute⠀truth.⠀The⠀truth⠀may⠀lie⠀in⠀the⠀overlapping⠀and⠀contradictory⠀recollections,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀how⠀each⠀teller's⠀stake⠀shapes⠀the⠀account.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀marvelous⠀as⠀ordinary⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀canon⠀permits⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.⠀When⠀a⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀wonder⠀is⠀present,⠀the⠀polyphony⠀can⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀entered⠀ordinary⠀commerce,⠀law,⠀food,⠀or⠀marriage:⠀a⠀magical⠀road⠀may⠀be⠀remembered⠀mainly⠀for⠀the⠀toll⠀booth,⠀a⠀god's⠀favor⠀may⠀be⠀cited⠀in⠀a⠀land⠀dispute,⠀an⠀immortal's⠀curse⠀may⠀have⠀made⠀a⠀particular⠀family's⠀surname⠀valuable.⠀Let⠀the⠀voices⠀question⠀the⠀wonder's⠀social⠀effect⠀without⠀explaining⠀it⠀away.⠀The⠀magic⠀remains⠀real;⠀its⠀weight⠀is⠀distributed⠀unevenly⠀and⠀remembered⠀unevenly.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀active⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀generic⠀Latin⠀American⠀scenery,⠀magical⠀realism⠀as⠀a⠀default,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀political⠀template⠀onto⠀an⠀unrelated⠀setting.⠀The⠀nonlinear⠀structure⠀itself⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀subdued⠀political⠀pressure:⠀a⠀member⠀of⠀a⠀low⠀house⠀can⠀recall⠀the⠀same⠀sacred⠀day⠀as⠀a⠀lord⠀and⠀reveal⠀that⠀they⠀were⠀not⠀only⠀witnesses⠀but⠀also⠀parties⠀to⠀the⠀settlement.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀while⠀a⠀voice⠀is⠀still⠀speaking,⠀while⠀a⠀document⠀breaks⠀off,⠀or⠀while⠀the⠀listener⠀must⠀decide⠀which⠀account⠀to⠀accept.⠀No⠀resolution⠀or⠀final⠀moral⠀is⠀required;⠀the⠀point⠀is⠀that⠀attributed⠀memory⠀has⠀revised⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀inherited⠀fact.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀reader's⠀orientation⠀precise.⠀Establish⠀the⠀place,⠀the⠀person⠀or⠀persons⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀mechanism⠀at⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀short⠀units.⠀Use⠀clear⠀spatial⠀changes:⠀steps⠀up⠀to⠀a⠀shrine,⠀a⠀passage⠀behind⠀a⠀loom,⠀a⠀courtyard⠀where⠀the⠀oath⠀is⠀sealed,⠀a⠀switchback⠀road⠀from⠀the⠀working⠀port⠀to⠀the⠀old⠀keep.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀long⠀history⠀lecture.⠀Explain⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀title,⠀relic,⠀tax,⠀or⠀spell⠀briefly⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀it⠀becomes⠀relevant,⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀background⠀block.\n\nLet⠀a⠀single⠀principal⠀drive⠀the⠀inquiry.⠀That⠀principal⠀asks⠀a⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo-style⠀direct⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀inherited⠀obligation:⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀protective⠀rite⠀require⠀burning⠀the⠀new⠀bridge⠀timber,⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀heir's⠀seal⠀work⠀only⠀if⠀a⠀dead⠀man's⠀debt⠀is⠀acknowledged,⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀temple⠀feed⠀the⠀eternal⠀flame⠀with⠀last⠀year's⠀grain⠀while⠀the⠀poor⠀gate⠀remains⠀cold?⠀The⠀question⠀should⠀expose⠀a⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀without⠀needing⠀a⠀philosophical⠀speech.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inquiry⠀nimble⠀and⠀concrete,⠀tied⠀to⠀an⠀actual⠀meal,⠀tax,⠀marriage⠀contract,⠀military⠀order,⠀or⠀magic⠀fee⠀that⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀change.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀instead⠀of⠀long⠀reflective⠀paragraphs.⠀After⠀a⠀claim⠀or⠀discovery,⠀give⠀the⠀principal⠀or⠀another⠀present⠀character⠀a⠀specific⠀private⠀response—recalculating⠀a⠀debt,⠀remembering⠀a⠀key⠀phrase,⠀noticing⠀a⠀sore⠀shoulder⠀from⠀carrying⠀the⠀relic,⠀suppressing⠀a⠀laugh⠀at⠀a⠀legal⠀formula—then⠀continue⠀the⠀action.⠀The⠀reaction⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀actual⠀character,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀belong⠀to⠀that⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀response⠀a⠀snappy⠀wisecrack.⠀Sincere⠀loyalty,⠀wounded⠀dignity,⠀and⠀cooperative⠀help⠀are⠀available⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀world's⠀facts⠀allow.\n\nMake⠀the⠀mythic⠀scale⠀tangible⠀through⠀the⠀immediate⠀cost.⠀A⠀war⠀oath⠀may⠀now⠀force⠀a⠀weaver's⠀child⠀into⠀service;⠀a⠀founding⠀spell⠀may⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀spring⠀that⠀a⠀merchant⠀has⠀just⠀enclosed;⠀a⠀sacred⠀title⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀debt⠀the⠀current⠀holder⠀cannot⠀name.⠀These⠀are⠀not⠀decorative⠀antiquity.⠀Show⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀lock,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀or⠀a⠀bodily⠀reminder⠀of⠀the⠀price.⠀When⠀a⠀magical⠀mechanism⠀exists,⠀present⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀constraint⠀with⠀visible⠀conditions:⠀the⠀charm⠀fails⠀at⠀noon⠀unless⠀fed,⠀the⠀passage⠀opens⠀only⠀after⠀the⠀toll⠀is⠀paid⠀in⠀salt,⠀the⠀curse⠀is⠀paused⠀by⠀a⠀marriage⠀the⠀old⠀law⠀already⠀recognizes.⠀Let⠀the⠀principal⠀test⠀or⠀challenge⠀that⠀condition⠀directly.\n\nKeep⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀Separate⠀movement⠀from⠀speech⠀from⠀thought⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀rereading.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀use⠀close⠀third⠀person,⠀an⠀explicit⠀first-person⠀voice,⠀or⠀a⠀structured⠀participant⠀account⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀internally⠀consistent.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀while⠀the⠀situation⠀is⠀still⠀advancing—at⠀a⠀door⠀opened,⠀a⠀bargain⠀refused,⠀a⠀rune⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀begun⠀to⠀fade—and⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger,⠀joke,⠀or⠀completed⠀challenge.⠀The⠀aim⠀is⠀a⠀fast,⠀habitable⠀episode⠀in⠀which⠀High⠀Fantasy's⠀obligations⠀become⠀immediate,⠀questionable,⠀and⠀costly,⠀not⠀a⠀generalized⠀lesson⠀about⠀corruption⠀or⠀loss.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀shaped⠀attention⠀test⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀claims⠀to⠀be⠀true.⠀Build⠀an⠀image⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀sentence⠀that⠀questions⠀it:⠀the⠀enchanted⠀wall⠀may⠀rise⠀like⠀dawn⠀and⠀still⠀show⠀weathering⠀that⠀no⠀spell⠀restored;⠀a⠀title⠀may⠀ring⠀through⠀the⠀hall⠀while⠀the⠀person⠀carrying⠀it⠀is⠀already⠀being⠀managed⠀by⠀practical⠀officials.⠀Make⠀grandeur⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀decorate.⠀A⠀recurring⠀image⠀or⠀sound⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀reader⠀deeper⠀into⠀one⠀particular⠀consequence,⠀not⠀thicken⠀a⠀mythic⠀tone.\n\nGive⠀the⠀prose⠀line⠀its⠀own⠀movement⠀of⠀inquiry.⠀Let⠀a⠀long⠀periodic⠀sentence⠀travel⠀through⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀relic,⠀an⠀institution,⠀and⠀then⠀land⠀on⠀a⠀plain⠀physical⠀fact⠀that⠀revises⠀it:⠀the⠀ceremony's⠀formula⠀ends⠀with⠀the⠀champion's⠀shivering⠀hand;⠀the⠀invulnerable⠀banner⠀is⠀stacked⠀with⠀the⠀ordinary⠀linens.⠀Use⠀plain⠀statements⠀as⠀hinges⠀at⠀the⠀ends⠀of⠀comparisons,⠀so⠀the⠀lyric⠀accumulation⠀does⠀something⠀besides⠀elevate.⠀Keep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀reasoning⠀audible⠀in⠀the⠀syntax—the⠀image⠀is⠀the⠀argument—and⠀let⠀the⠀rhythm⠀open⠀the⠀pause⠀in⠀which⠀an⠀official⠀explanation⠀starts⠀to⠀look⠀absurd.\n\nDo⠀not⠀press⠀every⠀phenomenon⠀into⠀metaphor.⠀A⠀battle,⠀a⠀forbidden⠀archive,⠀a⠀negotiation⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀real⠀event⠀with⠀material⠀causes⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀attends⠀to⠀how⠀it⠀will⠀sound⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀repeated.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀image⠀returns,⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀carrying⠀a⠀changed⠀fact⠀rather⠀than⠀comfort.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀stay⠀in⠀ordinary⠀speech;⠀no⠀character⠀has⠀to⠀speak⠀in⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register⠀for⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀stay⠀lyrical.⠀Tenderness⠀is⠀available⠀without⠀sentimentality,⠀humor⠀without⠀dissolving⠀the⠀world's⠀weight.⠀Grandeur⠀remains⠀in⠀the⠀invoked⠀scale,⠀while⠀the⠀teller⠀keeps⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀notice⠀the⠀carpenter's⠀bill,⠀the⠀mispronounced⠀title,⠀the⠀river's⠀ordinary⠀cold,⠀and⠀to⠀count⠀them⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀historical⠀truth.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBegin⠀with⠀an⠀inherited⠀obligation⠀already⠀pressing⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀or⠀place:⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀relic's⠀demand,⠀a⠀title's⠀duty,⠀a⠀law⠀of⠀magic,⠀a⠀border⠀shrine,⠀or⠀a⠀treaty⠀between⠀houses.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀pursue⠀a⠀plain,⠀lucid⠀question⠀about⠀it—who⠀benefits,⠀what⠀the⠀wording⠀actually⠀requires⠀today,⠀why⠀this⠀gate⠀is⠀sealed,⠀who⠀decided—and⠀follow⠀that⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀official⠀answer⠀into⠀practical⠀records,⠀witnesses,⠀ritual⠀language,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀consequences⠀for⠀people⠀who⠀must⠀live⠀under⠀the⠀rule.⠀The⠀rule⠀may⠀be⠀absurd,⠀unjust,⠀or⠀self-serving,⠀but⠀the⠀world's⠀grandeur⠀remains⠀real:⠀titles,⠀relics,⠀ancient⠀events,⠀and⠀magical⠀force⠀still⠀change⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀done⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀costs.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀inquiry⠀shrink⠀the⠀fantasy⠀into⠀satire;⠀let⠀the⠀satire,⠀where⠀it⠀comes,⠀sharpen⠀the⠀cost.\n\nThink⠀in⠀nimble⠀steps⠀rather⠀than⠀solemn⠀fantasy⠀cadence:⠀question,⠀distinction,⠀consequence,⠀next⠀question.⠀Candor⠀and⠀black⠀humor⠀belong⠀to⠀particular⠀voices.⠀A⠀clerk⠀may⠀joke⠀about⠀the⠀oath's⠀contradictions;⠀a⠀sworn⠀knight⠀may⠀speak⠀of⠀it⠀plainly;⠀a⠀shrine⠀keeper⠀may⠀be⠀devout⠀and⠀still⠀notice⠀the⠀paperwork.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀whole⠀cast⠀uniformly⠀cynical,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀one⠀character's⠀irreverence⠀as⠀a⠀license⠀to⠀explain⠀away⠀the⠀magic⠀or⠀history.\n\nUse⠀memory⠀as⠀a⠀working⠀instrument.⠀When⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀enters,⠀anchor⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change:⠀a⠀field⠀now⠀forest,⠀a⠀bell⠀rung⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀rope,⠀a⠀name⠀no⠀longer⠀spoken⠀aloud,⠀a⠀tool⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀fits⠀the⠀hand⠀that⠀used⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀coexist⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available;⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀reflect⠀directly⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀object⠀carry⠀the⠀association.⠀The⠀recollection⠀should⠀alter⠀the⠀practical⠀stakes⠀of⠀the⠀current⠀decision—why⠀someone⠀still⠀honors⠀a⠀rule,⠀why⠀they⠀no⠀longer⠀can,⠀what⠀loyalty⠀now⠀costs—without⠀being⠀required⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀obligation.⠀Leave⠀attachment⠀unfinished.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀pleasurable;⠀not⠀every⠀scene⠀has⠀to⠀announce⠀impermanence.\n\nInterleave⠀past⠀and⠀present⠀so⠀that⠀each⠀recollection⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀current⠀question⠀can⠀mean.⠀When⠀a⠀large-scale⠀event⠀or⠀ancient⠀power⠀presses⠀on⠀a⠀personal⠀choice,⠀show⠀the⠀exact⠀cost:⠀time,⠀distance,⠀loyalty,⠀a⠀body,⠀a⠀harvest,⠀a⠀promise⠀kept⠀or⠀broken.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀weigh⠀it⠀from⠀within⠀their⠀own⠀knowledge.⠀Keep⠀nonspoken⠀reflection⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience—the⠀question⠀turning⠀over,⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀the⠀calculation⠀of⠀cost,⠀the⠀reluctance⠀or⠀desire⠀that⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀become⠀speech.⠀Dialogue,⠀letters,⠀or⠀a⠀performed⠀aside⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀say,⠀but⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀substitute⠀for⠀that⠀private⠀experience.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.\n\nYou⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀any⠀natural⠀point⠀the⠀active⠀story⠀reaches:⠀a⠀continuing⠀question,⠀a⠀half-finished⠀task,⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀or⠀a⠀spoken⠀exchange.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀inquiry⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀verdict,⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀loyalty⠀crisis,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀test.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀telling⠀inside⠀the⠀fantasy⠀world:⠀a⠀storyteller⠀performing⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀relic's⠀origin,⠀a⠀founding,⠀a⠀battle,⠀or⠀a⠀magical⠀prohibition⠀for⠀an⠀audience⠀whose⠀questions,⠀payments,⠀rivalries,⠀and⠀interruptions⠀shape⠀what⠀gets⠀told.⠀The⠀tale's⠀inherited⠀claims⠀carry⠀real⠀magical⠀and⠀political⠀force⠀here;⠀the⠀frame⠀lets⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀how⠀each⠀telling⠀serves⠀an⠀immediate⠀interest.⠀Let⠀a⠀listener⠀ask⠀the⠀very⠀question⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀avoids,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀storyteller's⠀evasion⠀as⠀meaningful⠀as⠀any⠀spell.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀two⠀registers⠀distinct⠀in⠀plain⠀prose.⠀Inside⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale,⠀hold⠀the⠀rhythm⠀and⠀authority⠀of⠀a⠀traditional⠀account.⠀Around⠀it,⠀use⠀the⠀narrator's⠀and⠀characters'⠀ordinary⠀language⠀for⠀appetite,⠀delay,⠀calculation,⠀embarrassment,⠀relief.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀child⠀being⠀placated,⠀a⠀court⠀officer⠀checking⠀loyalty,⠀a⠀merchant⠀testing⠀a⠀provenance⠀claim,⠀or⠀a⠀mourner⠀asking⠀the⠀story⠀to⠀do⠀work⠀it⠀cannot⠀do;⠀whatever⠀listener⠀the⠀premise⠀supplies,⠀let⠀that⠀interest⠀bend⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀frame⠀need⠀not⠀diminish⠀wonder—it⠀can⠀preserve⠀the⠀tale's⠀splendor⠀and⠀still⠀show⠀the⠀handlers⠀who⠀profit⠀from⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀same⠀tale⠀returns⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀claim,⠀ground⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀concrete⠀human⠀agency:⠀a⠀date⠀corrected⠀by⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀name⠀altered⠀to⠀flatter⠀a⠀patron,⠀an⠀ending⠀retained⠀because⠀it⠀keeps⠀someone⠀afraid.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀marvels⠀to⠀be⠀exposed⠀as⠀fraud,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀them⠀to⠀be⠀confirmed⠀on⠀the⠀spot;⠀leave⠀that⠀question⠀exactly⠀where⠀the⠀audience⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀holds⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀satire⠀work⠀by⠀placing⠀official⠀language⠀beside⠀practical⠀fact,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀ceremonies,⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀and⠀occasions⠀of⠀storytelling⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀culture⠀the⠀story⠀supplies—if⠀a⠀particular⠀tradition⠀is⠀in⠀play,⠀keep⠀it⠀coherent⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀decorative⠀pieces⠀from⠀several.⠀Match⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀perspective:⠀a⠀listener-narrator⠀infers⠀the⠀teller's⠀motives⠀from⠀pacing⠀and⠀omission,⠀while⠀a⠀teller-narrator⠀can⠀confess⠀or⠀conceal⠀them⠀directly.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀fantasy⠀situation⠀concrete,⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀scale⠀and⠀the⠀cost.⠀A⠀land⠀won⠀by⠀an⠀eternal⠀oath⠀may⠀be⠀represented⠀by⠀the⠀single⠀cracked⠀tile⠀in⠀the⠀hall⠀where⠀the⠀tribute⠀is⠀counted;⠀an⠀unbreakable⠀sword⠀may⠀be⠀lying⠀across⠀a⠀stack⠀of⠀warrant⠀forms.⠀Do⠀not⠀inventory⠀the⠀palace,⠀the⠀archive,⠀or⠀the⠀ritual⠀calendar.⠀Let⠀the⠀world's⠀magic⠀and⠀history⠀act⠀through⠀what⠀those⠀details⠀cause:⠀a⠀title⠀shapes⠀a⠀marriage,⠀an⠀old⠀curse⠀moves⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀salt,⠀a⠀prohibition⠀explains⠀why⠀the⠀meeting⠀is⠀held⠀at⠀dusk.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reasoning⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀When⠀a⠀rule⠀looks⠀absurd,⠀state⠀the⠀absurdity⠀through⠀the⠀observation,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀slogan.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀infallible⠀oracle's⠀message⠀was⠀written⠀by⠀three⠀couriers,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀blood⠀oath's⠀sole⠀surviving⠀witness⠀is⠀now⠀paid⠀by⠀the⠀treasury⠀to⠀deny⠀it.⠀Spend⠀no⠀paragraph⠀explaining⠀that⠀institutions⠀lie;⠀the⠀detail⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀consequence⠀do⠀that⠀work.⠀Give⠀private⠀thought⠀only⠀the⠀room⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀needs⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀connection—one⠀sentence⠀in⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀action,⠀longer⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀genuinely⠀requires⠀calculation.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀economical⠀and⠀individually⠀pitched;⠀not⠀every⠀speaker⠀is⠀an⠀aphorist.⠀A⠀servant⠀and⠀a⠀magistrate⠀may⠀say⠀the⠀same⠀plain⠀sentence—that⠀the⠀road⠀is⠀closed⠀because⠀the⠀road⠀spirit⠀is⠀dying—for⠀different⠀ends:⠀one⠀to⠀stop⠀the⠀cart,⠀the⠀other⠀to⠀justify⠀a⠀new⠀tax.⠀The⠀humor⠀lives⠀in⠀that⠀gap,⠀without⠀a⠀spoken⠀joke.⠀Let⠀omission⠀leave⠀the⠀next⠀transaction⠀inferable⠀without⠀cutting⠀the⠀causal⠀chain⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀discovery⠀or⠀a⠀refusal⠀mean⠀anything.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀stop⠀as⠀soon⠀as⠀the⠀consequence⠀is⠀visible;⠀it⠀needs⠀no⠀epilogue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nMove⠀through⠀the⠀fantasy⠀institution⠀or⠀obligation⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀contemporary⠀novel⠀moves⠀through⠀any⠀complex⠀social⠀scene:⠀witness⠀the⠀practical⠀transaction⠀first,⠀then⠀let⠀perception,⠀dialogue,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀clarify⠀what⠀the⠀transaction⠀costs.⠀An⠀oath⠀stops⠀being⠀an⠀abstraction⠀when⠀two⠀officials⠀argue⠀over⠀whether⠀its⠀wording⠀covers⠀a⠀drained⠀irrigation⠀channel;⠀a⠀relic⠀stops⠀being⠀sacred⠀by⠀announcement⠀when⠀a⠀courier⠀packs⠀it⠀beside⠀a⠀lunch.⠀Treat⠀the⠀unmagical⠀daily⠀life⠀around⠀magic⠀as⠀the⠀instrument⠀of⠀understanding,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀fall⠀from⠀a⠀grander⠀tone.\n\nFollow⠀the⠀narrator's⠀question⠀with⠀modern⠀prose's⠀flexible⠀attention.⠀A⠀conversation⠀about⠀a⠀border⠀dispute⠀may⠀recall⠀the⠀last⠀time⠀the⠀boundary⠀was⠀redrawn;⠀an⠀archive⠀search⠀may⠀prompt⠀a⠀private⠀realization⠀about⠀a⠀document's⠀silence.⠀Do⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀general⠀history.⠀Let⠀recollection⠀enter⠀when⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀actually⠀prompts⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀conversation⠀or⠀action⠀carrying⠀new⠀information.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀mark⠀the⠀shifts:⠀longer⠀paragraphs⠀for⠀institutional⠀entanglement,⠀shorter⠀ones⠀for⠀direct⠀exchange,⠀private⠀thought⠀held⠀inside⠀whatever⠀access⠀the⠀story⠀permits.\n\nShow⠀the⠀practical⠀absurdity⠀of⠀the⠀inherited⠀world⠀without⠀turning⠀all⠀magic⠀into⠀fraud⠀or⠀every⠀institution⠀into⠀a⠀joke.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀discover⠀that⠀a⠀curse⠀is⠀now⠀enforced⠀mainly⠀by⠀inheritance⠀lawyers,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀prophecy⠀is⠀kept⠀alive⠀by⠀a⠀guild⠀that⠀charges⠀for⠀interpretations—observations⠀with⠀real⠀consequences,⠀which⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀then⠀argue,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀silently⠀count⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀complying.⠀Humor⠀and⠀pathos⠀both⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀exactness⠀of⠀the⠀material⠀situation.⠀Stay⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀end:⠀once⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀discovery⠀is⠀registered,⠀the⠀day's⠀business⠀can⠀continue⠀or⠀hang⠀suspended,⠀with⠀no⠀thesis⠀sentence⠀about⠀the⠀age.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀actual⠀relationship⠀premise⠀carry⠀the⠀fantasy⠀content.⠀If⠀the⠀pairing⠀is⠀rivals,⠀let⠀the⠀rivalry⠀be⠀measured⠀in⠀magical⠀qualifications,⠀inheritance⠀claims,⠀or⠀diplomatic⠀performance,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀shift⠀toward⠀intimacy⠀occur⠀through⠀specific⠀words,⠀gestures,⠀and⠀choices⠀both⠀of⠀them⠀would⠀recognize.⠀If⠀it⠀is⠀childhood⠀friends,⠀let⠀the⠀shared⠀repetitions⠀be⠀the⠀objects,⠀songs,⠀oath⠀phrasings,⠀or⠀places⠀through⠀which⠀they⠀have⠀already⠀tested⠀the⠀world's⠀rules⠀together.⠀The⠀world's⠀scale⠀enters⠀not⠀as⠀backdrop⠀but⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀relationship⠀must⠀negotiate:⠀a⠀magical⠀obligation⠀divides⠀their⠀time,⠀a⠀treaty⠀supplies⠀the⠀pretext⠀for⠀secrecy,⠀a⠀title⠀changes⠀what⠀intimacy⠀can⠀be⠀acknowledged.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀economically.⠀A⠀private⠀phrase⠀returns⠀when⠀the⠀later⠀situation⠀has⠀altered⠀its⠀meaning;⠀an⠀object⠀becomes⠀a⠀signal⠀between⠀them⠀without⠀needing⠀explanation⠀again.⠀Pay⠀the⠀pairing⠀off⠀at⠀scene⠀level:⠀the⠀particular⠀comfort,⠀irritation,⠀loyalty,⠀desire,⠀competition,⠀or⠀shared⠀laughter⠀that⠀only⠀these⠀two⠀create.⠀Their⠀shared⠀irreverence⠀can⠀puncture⠀institutional⠀pomposity—one⠀remarks⠀that⠀the⠀prophecy⠀has⠀been⠀recited⠀at⠀every⠀guild⠀fee⠀increase⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀knows⠀the⠀private⠀cost⠀behind⠀the⠀joke—without⠀forcing⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀banter⠀or⠀every⠀feeling⠀into⠀verbal⠀contest.⠀Affection⠀and⠀seriousness⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀intimate⠀as⠀the⠀joke,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀spoken⠀to⠀matter.\n\nPreserve⠀causal⠀interiority.⠀Let⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀think,⠀notice,⠀want,⠀and⠀hesitate⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀pairing's⠀history⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene;⠀a⠀partner⠀may⠀understand⠀fully,⠀partly,⠀or⠀not⠀at⠀all.⠀Keep⠀magical⠀and⠀historical⠀consequences⠀real:⠀the⠀relationship⠀does⠀not⠀immunize⠀either⠀of⠀them⠀from⠀harm,⠀and⠀duty,⠀exhaustion,⠀ambition,⠀or⠀shame⠀can⠀produce⠀genuine⠀rupture⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀development⠀into⠀a⠀compulsory⠀betrayal⠀arc.⠀Give⠀the⠀emotional⠀beats⠀room⠀to⠀last⠀without⠀padding⠀them⠀with⠀generalized⠀relationship⠀introspection,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀close⠀when⠀the⠀interaction⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀its⠀consequences⠀still⠀unfolding.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀architecture⠀of⠀an⠀oral⠀chronicle,⠀then⠀submit⠀its⠀own⠀epithets⠀to⠀practical⠀correction.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀formula—'Let⠀it⠀be⠀remembered,'⠀or⠀the⠀world's⠀own⠀equivalent—and⠀let⠀compact⠀declarations⠀establish⠀a⠀deed,⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀kin⠀group,⠀a⠀gift,⠀a⠀feud,⠀a⠀journey.⠀Keep⠀the⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀recurrence:⠀do⠀not⠀mint⠀a⠀new⠀ornamental⠀title⠀each⠀time⠀a⠀person⠀appears;⠀revisit⠀a⠀phrase⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀The⠀fantasy⠀scale⠀enters⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀saga⠀treats⠀as⠀publicly⠀significant—a⠀treaty's⠀founding⠀moment,⠀an⠀ancestral⠀weapon's⠀return,⠀the⠀prohibition⠀ceremony⠀after⠀a⠀magical⠀flood.\n\nLet⠀the⠀skepticism⠀operate⠀inside⠀the⠀voice⠀itself.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀formula⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀observation⠀that⠀modifies⠀the⠀record:⠀the⠀meal⠀at⠀which⠀the⠀oath⠀was⠀sworn⠀was⠀paid⠀for⠀by⠀a⠀merchant⠀alliance⠀whose⠀interest⠀the⠀oath⠀later⠀served;⠀the⠀ancestor's⠀sword⠀stayed⠀sheathed⠀at⠀every⠀documented⠀battle.⠀Not⠀every⠀retelling⠀is⠀a⠀scandal,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀abandon⠀the⠀world's⠀real⠀magic⠀or⠀historical⠀weight—the⠀chronicle's⠀magic⠀can⠀be⠀actual,⠀and⠀the⠀oath⠀may⠀still⠀bind.⠀Keep⠀the⠀correction⠀exact,⠀so⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀recognize⠀that⠀the⠀official⠀phrase⠀has⠀been⠀kept⠀while⠀its⠀practical⠀history⠀has⠀been⠀quietly⠀altered.\n\nLet⠀recurrence⠀and⠀argument⠀set⠀the⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀short⠀declarative⠀formula⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀longer⠀passage⠀of⠀inquiry,⠀or⠀a⠀long⠀traditional⠀sequence⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀one-sentence⠀material⠀fact.⠀Use⠀that⠀movement⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀recorded⠀glory⠀and⠀legal⠀inheritance⠀interact.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀collective⠀where⠀it⠀is—the⠀narrator⠀may⠀say⠀'they⠀say'⠀or⠀'the⠀hall⠀remembers,'⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀certain⠀tellers⠀have⠀reason⠀to⠀leave⠀out.⠀Leave⠀the⠀record⠀open⠀rather⠀than⠀condemning⠀all⠀memory:⠀the⠀act⠀may⠀survive⠀differently⠀in⠀the⠀ledger,⠀the⠀hearth⠀account,⠀and⠀the⠀children's⠀rhyme,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀have⠀to⠀decide⠀which⠀one⠀owns⠀the⠀truth.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀composed⠀inward-prose⠀mode⠀with⠀a⠀social-psychological⠀essayistic⠀vantage.⠀The⠀narrator⠀observes⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀experience⠀from⠀close⠀inside⠀while⠀retaining⠀a⠀reflective⠀distance⠀that⠀can⠀step⠀back⠀and⠀examine⠀the⠀institution,⠀household,⠀or⠀oath⠀as⠀a⠀participant-observer⠀would.⠀Let⠀magical⠀power,⠀inherited⠀obligation,⠀and⠀administrative⠀authority⠀be⠀tested⠀against⠀what⠀one⠀particular⠀person⠀can⠀actually⠀know,⠀remember,⠀and⠀bear.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀lucid⠀irreverence⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀exposition.⠀When⠀ancient⠀obligation,⠀ritual⠀process,⠀or⠀bureaucratic⠀authority⠀appears,⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀ask⠀the⠀question⠀the⠀rule⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀silence:⠀what⠀does⠀this⠀actually⠀cost,⠀and⠀who⠀profits⠀from⠀the⠀solemnity?⠀Allow⠀a⠀specific⠀voice—the⠀narrator's,⠀a⠀character's,⠀or⠀a⠀scene⠀participant's—to⠀reason⠀through⠀a⠀contradiction⠀until⠀the⠀absurdity⠀becomes⠀concrete.⠀Irony⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀precise⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀uniform⠀cynicism.⠀Treat⠀inherited⠀magic⠀as⠀materially⠀real,⠀with⠀limits⠀and⠀debts⠀that⠀do⠀not⠀politely⠀align⠀with⠀legend.\n\nGive⠀the⠀high⠀fantasy⠀world⠀its⠀active⠀scale.⠀Old⠀names,⠀relics,⠀treaties,⠀and⠀landscapes⠀should⠀alter⠀what⠀a⠀decision⠀can⠀do.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀record⠀and⠀memory:⠀a⠀chronicle⠀version⠀of⠀a⠀pact⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀a⠀participant's⠀recollected⠀fear,⠀and⠀an⠀official⠀account⠀of⠀an⠀oath⠀may⠀omit⠀who⠀was⠀punished⠀for⠀keeping⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀story⠀touches⠀large⠀events,⠀let⠀their⠀weight⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀character's⠀private⠀train⠀of⠀thought—sensation,⠀recollection,⠀inference—not⠀only⠀in⠀public⠀declarations.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social-psychological⠀Scandinavian⠀register⠀definite:⠀domestic⠀and⠀institutional⠀life⠀carries⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀ancient⠀power,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀examines⠀that⠀pressure⠀through⠀precise⠀observation⠀of⠀rooms,⠀work,⠀money,⠀family⠀obligation,⠀and⠀official⠀routine.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Nordic⠀landscape⠀or⠀custom⠀as⠀scenery.⠀Use⠀social⠀realism⠀as⠀a⠀check⠀on⠀myth,⠀not⠀an⠀argument⠀that⠀magic⠀cannot⠀exist.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀deepened⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀manufactured⠀confirmation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀screen-oriented⠀sequence.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀whenever⠀place⠀or⠀time⠀matters,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀that⠀state⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀and⠀audible,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀attributed⠀by⠀character⠀name.⠀Let⠀each⠀invention⠀of⠀the⠀setting⠀be⠀readable⠀as⠀a⠀scene⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀without⠀camera⠀instructions:⠀where⠀the⠀speaker⠀stands,⠀what⠀object⠀is⠀handled,⠀what⠀sound⠀carries⠀from⠀elsewhere.\n\nPlace⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀irreverence⠀in⠀spoken⠀exchange⠀and⠀physical⠀demonstration.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀the⠀procedural⠀question⠀no⠀one⠀wants⠀answered:⠀who⠀authorized⠀this⠀rite,⠀what⠀happens⠀if⠀we⠀do⠀not⠀renew⠀it,⠀why⠀does⠀the⠀archive⠀call⠀it⠀a⠀debt?⠀Let⠀the⠀counterargument⠀appear⠀through⠀observation,⠀not⠀editorial⠀comment.⠀A⠀silent⠀visual⠀can⠀puncture⠀a⠀solemn⠀claim,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀an⠀actual⠀event⠀the⠀viewer⠀would⠀see.⠀Use⠀an⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀a⠀quick⠀cut⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀timing⠀carries⠀information⠀the⠀scene⠀cannot⠀otherwise⠀deliver.\n\nKeep⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀scale⠀in⠀concrete⠀objects⠀and⠀decisions.⠀A⠀relic's⠀appearance,⠀an⠀oath⠀repeated⠀at⠀dawn,⠀a⠀seal⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀table⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀someone⠀can⠀do.⠀Show⠀institutions⠀as⠀arrangements⠀that⠀bind⠀particular⠀lives:⠀the⠀script⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀clerk⠀who⠀must⠀refuse⠀a⠀petition,⠀a⠀soldier⠀recalled⠀under⠀an⠀ancient⠀vow,⠀an⠀accountant⠀whose⠀ledger⠀argument⠀is⠀stronger⠀than⠀prophecy.⠀Make⠀the⠀cost⠀legible⠀in⠀action,⠀not⠀in⠀speeches⠀about⠀large⠀themes.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀inner⠀response⠀matters⠀but⠀cannot⠀safely⠀be⠀spoken,⠀include⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀such⠀as:\n<nemo-interiority character=\"Character name\">\nActual fictional private experience for this character.\n</nemo-interiority>\nPlacement⠀of⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀should⠀preserve⠀the⠀active⠀presentation:⠀keep⠀it⠀near⠀the⠀action⠀it⠀accompanies,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀give⠀other⠀characters⠀knowledge⠀of⠀it.⠀Use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀narrative⠀is⠀one⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀later⠀say;⠀a⠀voice-over⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀substitute⠀for⠀private⠀thought.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀result⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀minimal⠀setting⠀note:⠀what⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀is⠀audible,⠀where⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀can⠀occur.⠀Use⠀character⠀names⠀as⠀speaker⠀labels,⠀and⠀keep⠀stage⠀directions⠀short⠀and⠀concrete—what⠀is⠀carried,⠀handed⠀over,⠀read⠀aloud,⠀sealed,⠀or⠀thrown⠀back.⠀Indicate⠀pauses⠀and⠀movement⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀change⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀or⠀the⠀blockable⠀meaning⠀of⠀an⠀object.\n\nMake⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀irreverence⠀take⠀the⠀form⠀of⠀staged⠀argument.⠀A⠀character⠀should⠀challenge⠀a⠀solemn⠀rule⠀by⠀pointing⠀to⠀what⠀everyone⠀on⠀stage⠀can⠀see:⠀the⠀relic⠀is⠀cracked,⠀the⠀oath⠀was⠀rewritten,⠀the⠀official⠀forgot⠀his⠀own⠀procedure.⠀Let⠀the⠀challenge⠀come⠀from⠀ordinary⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀world⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀generalized⠀distrust.⠀The⠀lines⠀may⠀be⠀deft,⠀but⠀their⠀force⠀should⠀depend⠀on⠀facts⠀established⠀by⠀prior⠀action⠀or⠀props.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀skeptical⠀remark⠀equally⠀funny;⠀the⠀humor⠀should⠀accumulate⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀absurdity⠀being⠀tested.\n\nLet⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀scale⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀action's⠀material⠀consequences.⠀An⠀ancient⠀edict⠀is⠀a⠀paper⠀someone⠀must⠀carry;⠀an⠀inherited⠀debt⠀becomes⠀a⠀summons⠀with⠀a⠀broken⠀seal;⠀a⠀magical⠀obligation⠀affects⠀who⠀may⠀speak⠀first⠀or⠀sit⠀at⠀a⠀table.⠀The⠀stage⠀directions⠀should⠀make⠀such⠀details⠀true⠀and⠀observable:⠀the⠀document⠀is⠀passed,⠀examined,⠀refused,⠀or⠀pocketed.⠀Institutions⠀are⠀present⠀as⠀particular⠀arrangements⠀among⠀people,⠀not⠀as⠀background⠀narration.⠀The⠀conflict⠀can⠀be⠀large⠀without⠀everyone⠀speaking⠀in⠀an⠀elevated⠀register.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀necessary⠀and⠀cannot⠀be⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside,⠀include⠀it⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀staged⠀speech,⠀such⠀as:\n<nemo-interiority character=\"Character name\">\nActual fictional private experience for this character.\n</nemo-interiority>\nUse⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀its⠀own⠀dramatic⠀purpose—confession,⠀deception,⠀address,⠀decision—is⠀served.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀content.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀pause⠀after⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement;⠀no⠀revelation⠀is⠀mandatory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀the⠀reply⠀as⠀the⠀lived,⠀fragmentary⠀movement⠀of⠀an⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀perception⠀or⠀bodily⠀fact⠀in⠀the⠀moment,⠀then⠀allow⠀the⠀narration⠀to⠀slide⠀into⠀memory,⠀dread,⠀private⠀words,⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀room.⠀The⠀fantasy⠀world⠀remains⠀present⠀through⠀concrete⠀sensations:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀seal,⠀the⠀heat⠀of⠀a⠀ritual⠀lamp,⠀the⠀remembered⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀storage⠀room.⠀Distinguish⠀clearly⠀between⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now,⠀what⠀is⠀recollected,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀imagined⠀or⠀desired.\n\nShape⠀the⠀stream⠀by⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀irreverence.⠀The⠀mind⠀should⠀follow⠀a⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀official⠀answer⠀until⠀the⠀absurdity⠀of⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀tax,⠀or⠀a⠀ceremony⠀becomes⠀explicit.⠀Let⠀that⠀questioning⠀be⠀an⠀active⠀habit,⠀not⠀an⠀abstraction:⠀why⠀does⠀this⠀debt⠀follow⠀the⠀name⠀instead⠀of⠀the⠀person,⠀who⠀decided⠀the⠀staircase⠀counts⠀as⠀hallowed?⠀The⠀queries⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted,⠀contradicted,⠀or⠀abandoned,⠀but⠀their⠀recurrence⠀will⠀bind⠀a⠀fantasy⠀obligation⠀to⠀personal⠀experience.⠀The⠀mind⠀can⠀notice⠀that⠀an⠀official⠀form⠀does⠀not⠀ask⠀what⠀happened⠀to⠀the⠀petitioner.\n\nLet⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀scale⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀fragments⠀and⠀repetition.⠀An⠀ancient⠀covenant⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀phrase⠀half-remembered,⠀an⠀inscription⠀read⠀three⠀times⠀before⠀its⠀meaning⠀shifts,⠀a⠀hand⠀that⠀would⠀not⠀stop⠀shaking⠀after⠀signing.⠀As⠀the⠀mind⠀circles⠀a⠀decision,⠀show⠀the⠀real⠀material⠀costs:⠀a⠀relative⠀who⠀cannot⠀inherit,⠀a⠀journey⠀that⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀permitted,⠀a⠀silence⠀in⠀the⠀archive⠀where⠀a⠀name⠀should⠀be.⠀Grandeur⠀should⠀emerge⠀from⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀these⠀particular⠀debts,⠀not⠀from⠀sweeping⠀language⠀about⠀fate.\n\nKeep⠀to⠀the⠀chosen⠀character's⠀actual⠀associative⠀movement.⠀Other⠀minds⠀are⠀not⠀transparent.⠀Keep⠀each⠀sentence⠀anchored⠀well⠀enough⠀that⠀a⠀reader⠀can⠀orient:⠀this⠀is⠀now,⠀this⠀was⠀winter,⠀this⠀is⠀what⠀I⠀told⠀myself.⠀At⠀the⠀end,⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀find⠀a⠀small⠀resolution,⠀lose⠀the⠀thread,⠀or⠀turn⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀table⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀cleared.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀transcript⠀of⠀readable⠀messages.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀message⠀to⠀a⠀named⠀sender.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀interface⠀events⠀that⠀carry⠀information:⠀a⠀timestamp⠀when⠀time⠀matters,⠀an⠀edited⠀message⠀when⠀the⠀correction⠀changes⠀meaning,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀when⠀its⠀absence⠀is⠀significant,⠀a⠀failed⠀attachment⠀when⠀the⠀system⠀refuses⠀a⠀file.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀typing⠀indicators⠀or⠀encryption⠀notices⠀as⠀decoration.\n\nLet⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀institutions⠀appear⠀through⠀message⠀behavior.⠀A⠀character⠀messages⠀a⠀clerk⠀about⠀an⠀inheritance⠀vow;⠀the⠀clerk⠀replies⠀with⠀a⠀form⠀number⠀and⠀a⠀link⠀to⠀an⠀archive⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀open.⠀An⠀official⠀channel⠀requires⠀the⠀petitioner⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀ancient⠀name⠀in⠀the⠀modern⠀registration⠀field.⠀A⠀group⠀chat⠀for⠀the⠀ritual⠀committee⠀disintegrates⠀into⠀memes⠀about⠀the⠀blood-price.⠀Specific⠀world⠀facts⠀should⠀remain⠀concrete:⠀the⠀wording⠀of⠀an⠀oath,⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀a⠀ferry,⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀a⠀banned⠀historian,⠀the⠀seal⠀requirement.⠀Use⠀attachments⠀and⠀forwarded⠀messages⠀when⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀only⠀way⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀present⠀evidence.\n\nEmbed⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀in⠀the⠀mechanics⠀of⠀messaging.⠀Let⠀one⠀speaker⠀ask⠀the⠀small⠀logical⠀question:⠀if⠀the⠀vow⠀binds⠀blood,⠀why⠀does⠀it⠀also⠀bind⠀the⠀adopted⠀child;⠀if⠀the⠀document⠀is⠀sealed,⠀why⠀is⠀the⠀seal⠀shown⠀as⠀a⠀profile⠀picture?⠀The⠀answer⠀may⠀be⠀evasion,⠀a⠀policy⠀sentence,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀later⠀replaced,⠀or⠀a⠀delay.⠀Let⠀speakers'⠀private⠀concerns⠀stay⠀private,⠀because⠀sent⠀text⠀is⠀not⠀thought.⠀If⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀composes⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀show⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀draft⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀unsent⠀marker,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀bracketed⠀label⠀or⠀a⠀separate⠀draft⠀block,⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀distinct⠀from⠀any⠀message⠀the⠀other⠀parties⠀can⠀see.⠀The⠀other⠀parties⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀is⠀sent.\n\nWhen⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀in⠀clearly⠀separated⠀minimal⠀narrative⠀blocks⠀before⠀or⠀between⠀messages.⠀Such⠀context⠀may⠀explain⠀who⠀is⠀carrying⠀a⠀phone⠀into⠀a⠀ward,⠀why⠀a⠀receiver⠀is⠀not⠀answering,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀ritual⠀building⠀sounds⠀like⠀in⠀the⠀background.⠀Keep⠀the⠀transcript's⠀progress⠀legible:⠀what⠀is⠀being⠀asked,⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀proven⠀or⠀refused,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open.⠀The⠀reply⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀question,⠀a⠀notification,⠀or⠀silence⠀after⠀an⠀unanswered⠀message—no⠀cliffhanger⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀visual-novel⠀scene⠀rhythm:⠀a⠀concise⠀setting⠀description,⠀spoken⠀lines⠀with⠀clear⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀between⠀or⠀within⠀lines.⠀Each⠀scene⠀change⠀should⠀be⠀marked⠀legibly,⠀but⠀the⠀narrative⠀does⠀not⠀branch,⠀select⠀players,⠀or⠀show⠀menu⠀choices.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀an⠀illustrated⠀moment⠀without⠀any⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀character⠀emblem⠀instruction.\n\nUse⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀irreverence⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀scene's⠀visible⠀trappings⠀and⠀its⠀practical⠀reality.⠀Describe⠀the⠀ceremonial⠀chamber,⠀the⠀ancient⠀oath⠀board,⠀the⠀gold-threaded⠀robe;⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀note⠀the⠀stain⠀on⠀the⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀missing⠀word⠀in⠀the⠀oath,⠀the⠀servant⠀waiting⠀by⠀the⠀door.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀question⠀a⠀rule⠀by⠀pointing⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀viewer⠀just⠀saw.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀why⠀the⠀relic⠀must⠀be⠀returned⠀by⠀midnight⠀if⠀the⠀archive⠀itself⠀closes⠀at⠀four.⠀The⠀reprimand⠀that⠀follows⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀social⠀fact,⠀not⠀a⠀proof⠀that⠀the⠀questioner⠀was⠀wrong.\n\nLet⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀scale⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀objects⠀and⠀obligations.⠀A⠀seal⠀may⠀be⠀inherited⠀but⠀cracked;⠀a⠀title⠀permits⠀a⠀door⠀but⠀not⠀a⠀library;⠀an⠀ancient⠀promise⠀requires⠀someone⠀to⠀carry⠀a⠀message⠀across⠀the⠀border⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀moon.⠀Show⠀these⠀particulars⠀through⠀stage⠀image⠀and⠀immediate⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀general⠀catastrophe.⠀Institutions⠀appear⠀as⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀the⠀registrar⠀who⠀first⠀asks⠀for⠀proof⠀of⠀lineage,⠀the⠀guard⠀who⠀repeats⠀the⠀same⠀clause⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀tone,⠀the⠀aunt⠀who⠀says⠀'we⠀do⠀not⠀speak⠀of⠀that⠀debt'⠀while⠀setting⠀out⠀three⠀cups.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀line.⠀A⠀focal⠀narration⠀line⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀character's⠀thought,⠀perception,⠀or⠀suspicion.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀Separate⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says⠀aloud⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀narration⠀reports.⠀A⠀visible⠀expression⠀may⠀be⠀paused⠀on,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀later⠀contradiction⠀in⠀a⠀document⠀or⠀an⠀arrangement⠀do⠀the⠀real⠀inferential⠀work.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀line⠀delivered,⠀a⠀background⠀description⠀that⠀has⠀changed,⠀or⠀a⠀request⠀left⠀hanging.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahazbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀continuation⠀of⠀a⠀clear⠀through-line.⠀Open⠀with⠀enough⠀recovered⠀context⠀to⠀let⠀a⠀reader⠀enter⠀without⠀a⠀full⠀retelling:⠀'The⠀archive⠀had⠀not⠀opened⠀since⠀the⠀seal⠀failed;⠀that⠀was⠀why⠀N⠀now⠀stood⠀beside⠀the⠀gate⠀with⠀a⠀borrowed⠀cart.'⠀In⠀each⠀segment,⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀open⠀for⠀later⠀installments.⠀Do⠀not⠀pad⠀with⠀a⠀complete⠀recap⠀of⠀every⠀prior⠀fact;⠀bring⠀back⠀only⠀the⠀detail⠀that⠀will⠀matter⠀now.\n\nLet⠀Wang⠀Xiaobo's⠀rational⠀inquiry⠀become⠀the⠀serial⠀burden.⠀Each⠀installment⠀can⠀examine⠀one⠀concrete⠀rule,⠀form,⠀or⠀ritual:⠀why⠀the⠀ferryman⠀refuses⠀a⠀toll⠀paid⠀in⠀temple⠀script,⠀what⠀the⠀oath⠀actually⠀says⠀in⠀the⠀old⠀clause,⠀whether⠀the⠀registrar's⠀regulation⠀matches⠀the⠀wall⠀inscription.⠀Let⠀the⠀speaker⠀or⠀focal⠀narration⠀push⠀the⠀question⠀past⠀the⠀official⠀answer:⠀'The⠀office⠀was⠀closed,⠀but⠀the⠀lamp⠀was⠀still⠀burning.⠀If⠀no⠀one⠀worked⠀there⠀after⠀the⠀twelfth⠀bell,⠀who⠀filed⠀the⠀rejection?'⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀regulation⠀and⠀the⠀observable⠀world⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀small,⠀legible⠀absurdity,⠀not⠀a⠀sweeping⠀satire.⠀Humor⠀can⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀particular⠀mismatch,⠀and⠀the⠀installment⠀can⠀let⠀the⠀absurdity⠀stand⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀high⠀fantasy⠀cumulative.⠀Oaths,⠀debts,⠀names,⠀roads,⠀seal⠀requirements,⠀and⠀magical⠀consequences⠀should⠀be⠀introduced⠀as⠀particular⠀facts,⠀then⠀revisited⠀later⠀under⠀new⠀conditions.⠀A⠀prior⠀installment's⠀detail—the⠀cracked⠀coin,⠀the⠀third⠀clause,⠀the⠀bridge⠀in⠀winter—can⠀return⠀as⠀evidence⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀contradict⠀established⠀facts⠀to⠀create⠀surprise;⠀let⠀a⠀new⠀installment⠀reveal⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀or⠀rule⠀applied⠀differently⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀context.⠀Progress⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀relationship⠀changed⠀by⠀assistance,⠀a⠀small⠀material⠀gain,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀partially⠀discharged.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀installment⠀wherever⠀the⠀existing⠀scene⠀boundary⠀falls.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀finish⠀an⠀errand⠀and⠀go⠀home,⠀can⠀sit⠀with⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀or⠀can⠀notice⠀a⠀known⠀fact⠀with⠀fresh⠀attention.⠀Keep⠀the⠀next⠀continuation⠀genuinely⠀open⠀without⠀promising⠀a⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nBegin⠀each⠀interval⠀from⠀a⠀concrete⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀that⠀already⠀carries⠀a⠀large⠀obligation:⠀a⠀vow⠀tablet⠀whose⠀leather⠀has⠀been⠀handled⠀too⠀often,⠀a⠀sword⠀returned⠀to⠀its⠀rack⠀with⠀unnecessary⠀care,⠀a⠀hall⠀whose⠀old⠀inscriptions⠀promise⠀a⠀cost⠀no⠀one⠀has⠀paid.⠀Let⠀that⠀detail⠀orient⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀once,⠀later,⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀connection;⠀let⠀the⠀repeated⠀surface⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀interval⠀has⠀changed.\n\nMake⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀risky⠀through⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀rules.⠀An⠀admission⠀can⠀forfeit⠀an⠀alliance,⠀a⠀refusal⠀can⠀dishonor⠀a⠀household,⠀an⠀apology⠀can⠀arrive⠀after⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀needed⠀it⠀can⠀no⠀longer⠀hear⠀it.⠀Show⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀speech⠀breaks⠀or⠀labor⠀continues:⠀a⠀ruler⠀finishes⠀sealing⠀a⠀letter⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀courier⠀recites⠀a⠀formal⠀charge⠀while⠀her⠀hands⠀shake.⠀The⠀strain⠀should⠀affect⠀subsequent⠀behavior,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀a⠀single⠀line.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀as⠀a⠀chosen⠀act.⠀After⠀a⠀heated⠀exchange,⠀hold⠀on⠀an⠀unclaimed⠀cup,⠀a⠀bench⠀pushed⠀out⠀of⠀line,⠀or⠀a⠀trail⠀of⠀wax⠀on⠀stone.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀avoid⠀a⠀name⠀because⠀speaking⠀it⠀would⠀bind⠀their⠀next⠀action.⠀Keep⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀decode⠀another⠀character's⠀silence.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling:⠀formal⠀oaths⠀spoken⠀with⠀tenderness,⠀a⠀petty⠀complaint⠀carrying⠀the⠀whole⠀resentment⠀of⠀a⠀broken⠀succession.\n\nAllow⠀comfort⠀to⠀be⠀partial⠀and⠀awkward.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀help⠀without⠀naming⠀the⠀wound,⠀or⠀refuse⠀further⠀reassurance⠀while⠀still⠀remaining⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀injury.⠀Advance⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀supported⠀choices,⠀and⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀interval's⠀emotional⠀cost⠀has⠀become⠀legible,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nAnchor⠀each⠀exchange⠀in⠀one⠀selected⠀physical⠀impression⠀that⠀already⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀world's⠀obligations:⠀a⠀cold⠀brazier⠀in⠀a⠀hall⠀where⠀a⠀summons⠀is⠀expected,⠀a⠀mended⠀cloak⠀fold,⠀a⠀fresh⠀scratch⠀on⠀a⠀reliquary.⠀Use⠀that⠀detail⠀to⠀hold⠀the⠀tone⠀instead⠀of⠀describing⠀the⠀mood.⠀Let⠀the⠀large⠀obligations⠀remain⠀present⠀in⠀what⠀speakers⠀may⠀or⠀may⠀not⠀ask,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀ancient⠀history.\n\nCarry⠀feeling⠀through⠀brief⠀surfaces⠀and⠀omission.⠀A⠀soldier⠀can⠀answer⠀a⠀summons⠀without⠀mentioning⠀the⠀lamp⠀she⠀left⠀burning⠀in⠀an⠀empty⠀dormitory;⠀a⠀regent's⠀dry⠀formal⠀phrasing⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀than⠀direct⠀complaint.⠀Treat⠀omission⠀as⠀a⠀choice:⠀someone⠀may⠀avoid⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀a⠀vanished⠀heir⠀because⠀speaking⠀it⠀would⠀bind⠀their⠀next⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀character⠀to⠀pause,⠀gaze,⠀or⠀stammer.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀exchange⠀scannable⠀and⠀collaborative.⠀Give⠀every⠀speech⠀unmistakable⠀attribution⠀and⠀keep⠀paragraphs⠀readable.⠀Advance⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀and⠀world⠀consequences⠀within⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀messenger⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀take⠀back⠀an⠀insult,⠀a⠀sentry⠀may⠀pocket⠀a⠀broken⠀seal⠀instead⠀of⠀reporting⠀it,⠀a⠀guild⠀clerk⠀may⠀keep⠀writing⠀while⠀the⠀protagonists⠀argue.⠀Each⠀character's⠀practical⠀life⠀continues⠀without⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀forced⠀question.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀latest⠀speech⠀or⠀action.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀stop⠀mid-sentence⠀because⠀another⠀entered,⠀or⠀because⠀they⠀have⠀decided⠀to⠀keep⠀a⠀map⠀instead⠀of⠀handing⠀it⠀over.⠀The⠀pause⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀produce⠀a⠀result,⠀but⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀begin⠀from⠀the⠀unfinished⠀setup.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀player-control⠀rules⠀from⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀first⠀person⠀or⠀turn⠀the⠀reply⠀into⠀an⠀instruction⠀to⠀the⠀player.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀martial-adventure⠀route⠀as⠀a⠀compact⠀direct⠀account⠀of⠀moving⠀through⠀a⠀dangerous⠀place⠀or⠀carrying⠀out⠀a⠀decisive⠀assignment.⠀Begin⠀from⠀the⠀interval's⠀entry:⠀the⠀person⠀departing⠀or⠀arriving,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀records⠀the⠀movement,⠀such⠀as⠀worn⠀rope⠀beside⠀a⠀well⠀or⠀a⠀sword⠀left⠀in⠀a⠀shrine.⠀Let⠀that⠀entry⠀point⠀establish⠀the⠀route⠀and⠀its⠀stakes.\n\nTell⠀each⠀feat⠀through⠀Kawabata's⠀selected⠀impressions⠀rather⠀than⠀inflated⠀battle⠀narrative.⠀Show⠀a⠀torn⠀banner's⠀edge,⠀a⠀dropped⠀hairpin⠀at⠀a⠀ford,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀latch⠀before⠀no⠀answer⠀comes.⠀Feelings⠀appear⠀through⠀objects⠀and⠀actions:⠀a⠀hero⠀wipes⠀a⠀bowl⠀clean⠀before⠀handing⠀it⠀back,⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀debt⠀unpaid⠀without⠀explaining⠀why.⠀Do⠀not⠀spell⠀out⠀every⠀motive;⠀a⠀paused⠀step⠀at⠀a⠀familiar⠀gate⠀can⠀be⠀enough.\n\nConnect⠀the⠀fantasy⠀obligations⠀to⠀the⠀martial⠀journey⠀through⠀concrete⠀cost.⠀An⠀order⠀may⠀require⠀crossing⠀the⠀estate⠀that⠀once⠀belonged⠀to⠀an⠀exiled⠀master;⠀an⠀oath⠀may⠀demand⠀rescue⠀without⠀return.⠀Show⠀the⠀consequences⠀materially:⠀lost⠀provisions,⠀a⠀horse's⠀limp,⠀a⠀bribe⠀that⠀wins⠀passage⠀but⠀costs⠀a⠀future⠀ally.⠀Use⠀clear⠀cause⠀and⠀effect⠀without⠀reducing⠀the⠀world⠀to⠀a⠀combat⠀sequence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀regulate⠀the⠀telling.⠀Occasional⠀direct⠀speech⠀is⠀welcome,⠀but⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀carry⠀much⠀of⠀the⠀action.⠀End⠀from⠀the⠀latest⠀material⠀consequence⠀or⠀unfinished⠀route:⠀a⠀new⠀debt,⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀stage,⠀or⠀a⠀road⠀left⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀assignment⠀to⠀be⠀completed⠀or⠀the⠀danger⠀resolved⠀before⠀the⠀interval⠀closes.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nBegin⠀from⠀the⠀practical⠀burden⠀of⠀an⠀obligation:⠀carrying⠀an⠀extra⠀pack⠀because⠀a⠀conscript⠀died,⠀reading⠀a⠀demand⠀letter⠀before⠀the⠀family⠀sees⠀it,⠀being⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀must⠀spend⠀a⠀healing⠀charm⠀now⠀or⠀save⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀watch.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀concrete⠀nouns⠀and⠀short⠀decisive⠀transitions.⠀Show⠀wear⠀before⠀glory:⠀a⠀blade's⠀nick,⠀a⠀rent⠀in⠀a⠀banner,⠀the⠀second⠀knot⠀tied⠀in⠀a⠀bootlace.\n\nSelect⠀one⠀sharp⠀physical⠀detail⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀recurring⠀meaning⠀rather⠀than⠀painting⠀every⠀room.⠀A⠀fire's⠀crack,⠀a⠀cart's⠀wet⠀axle,⠀or⠀a⠀torn⠀seam⠀on⠀the⠀inside⠀of⠀a⠀sleeve⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀passage⠀of⠀time.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀detail⠀once,⠀later,⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning.⠀Keep⠀transitions⠀quick⠀but⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀actually⠀working⠀through⠀stakes:⠀whether⠀a⠀charge's⠀oath⠀is⠀already⠀void,⠀whether⠀an⠀unsealed⠀letter⠀means⠀the⠀messenger⠀heard⠀the⠀ambush⠀plan.\n\nGround⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀veteran⠀may⠀reduce⠀a⠀betrayal⠀to⠀\"he⠀sold⠀the⠀grain,\"⠀while⠀a⠀younger⠀guard⠀curses⠀the⠀whole⠀watch.⠀The⠀formal⠀voice⠀of⠀a⠀seal⠀clerk⠀and⠀the⠀coarse⠀language⠀of⠀a⠀caravan⠀master⠀can⠀share⠀the⠀page⠀without⠀one⠀correct⠀register⠀dominating.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀sarcastic⠀or⠀every⠀line⠀an⠀action⠀beat.\n\nPreserve⠀Kawabata's⠀omission.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀dead⠀friend⠀by⠀turning⠀away⠀to⠀inspect⠀a⠀stirrup;⠀the⠀odd⠀pause⠀can⠀mean⠀more⠀than⠀an⠀outburst,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀decoded.⠀The⠀world⠀remains⠀dangerous⠀and⠀costly,⠀yet⠀not⠀every⠀entry⠀must⠀become⠀a⠀survival⠀horror⠀scene.⠀End⠀from⠀the⠀latest⠀concrete⠀unfinished⠀state:⠀a⠀lamp⠀burning⠀beside⠀an⠀unattended⠀post,⠀a⠀pack⠀still⠀unbuckled,⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀unread.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀conclusion⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀larger⠀conflict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCompose⠀the⠀passage⠀as⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀documents⠀from⠀the⠀current⠀situation.⠀Choose⠀the⠀form⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀and⠀authorship⠀contract:⠀a⠀summons,⠀a⠀baggage⠀inventory,⠀a⠀captain's⠀field⠀note,⠀a⠀temple⠀register,⠀a⠀letter⠀sealed⠀with⠀reused⠀wax,⠀or⠀a⠀laborer's⠀marked⠀tally.⠀Give⠀each⠀item⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀reader⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀writing.\n\nThrough⠀the⠀documents,⠀make⠀the⠀world's⠀obligations⠀specific.⠀A⠀supply⠀record⠀may⠀list⠀\"cart⠀axle⠀split⠀near⠀the⠀eastern⠀gate\"⠀without⠀saying⠀the⠀gatekeeper⠀was⠀beaten;⠀a⠀pardon⠀may⠀name⠀the⠀wrong⠀prisoner⠀because⠀the⠀clerk⠀could⠀not⠀admit⠀a⠀clerical⠀error.⠀Let⠀small⠀physical⠀details⠀in⠀the⠀document⠀carry⠀feeling:⠀a⠀smudged⠀character,⠀ink⠀thinned⠀with⠀water,⠀a⠀row⠀of⠀nails⠀still⠀folded⠀in⠀a⠀page.⠀Treat⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀does⠀not⠀record⠀as⠀a⠀choice:⠀fear,⠀loyalty,⠀urgency,⠀exhaustion,⠀or⠀the⠀belief⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀will⠀read⠀it.\n\nConnect⠀entries⠀through⠀material⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀seal⠀appears⠀on⠀a⠀warrant⠀and⠀later⠀on⠀an⠀empty⠀money⠀pouch;⠀a⠀stained⠀ribbon⠀attached⠀to⠀one⠀letter⠀turns⠀up⠀in⠀a⠀burial⠀list.⠀Such⠀connections⠀should⠀revise⠀understanding,⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀silence.⠀Keep⠀the⠀selected⠀author's⠀compression:⠀brief⠀entries,⠀exact⠀images,⠀no⠀summary⠀of⠀emotion.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator⠀after⠀each⠀document.⠀Let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀records⠀carry⠀the⠀sequence.⠀If⠀two⠀writers⠀disagree⠀about⠀a⠀day's⠀events,⠀preserve⠀the⠀disagreement;⠀if⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀corrects⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀show⠀what⠀changed⠀in⠀knowledge⠀or⠀circumstance.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀contain⠀hidden⠀or⠀mistaken⠀information,⠀but⠀it⠀cannot⠀reveal⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀did⠀not⠀know.⠀End⠀from⠀the⠀latest⠀document's⠀unfinished⠀state:⠀a⠀line⠀left⠀incomplete,⠀a⠀delivery⠀still⠀uncertain,⠀a⠀record⠀set⠀aside⠀before⠀it⠀could⠀be⠀signed.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nBegin⠀from⠀the⠀obligation⠀or⠀danger⠀that⠀frames⠀the⠀tender⠀interval:⠀a⠀knight⠀still⠀bound⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀horn,⠀a⠀herbalist⠀waiting⠀for⠀an⠀execution⠀reprieve,⠀a⠀household⠀preparing⠀for⠀an⠀inspection.⠀Keep⠀that⠀frame⠀present⠀without⠀letting⠀it⠀dominate⠀the⠀scene.⠀Care⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀small⠀things⠀done⠀inside⠀it:⠀warming⠀a⠀spare⠀bowl,⠀saving⠀the⠀softest⠀seeds⠀for⠀a⠀child,⠀remembering⠀which⠀of⠀two⠀identical⠀cloaks⠀belongs⠀to⠀which⠀conscript.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀physical⠀register⠀for⠀affection.⠀Capture⠀a⠀hand⠀resting⠀on⠀a⠀cooled⠀lantern,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀newly⠀cut⠀reeds⠀spread⠀over⠀a⠀wet⠀floor,⠀a⠀comb⠀left⠀where⠀someone⠀will⠀find⠀it.⠀Avoid⠀explaining⠀the⠀characters'⠀feelings⠀in⠀general⠀terms.⠀Choose⠀one⠀recurring⠀small⠀act⠀as⠀the⠀vehicle⠀for⠀warmth:⠀leaving⠀a⠀fresh⠀wick⠀in⠀a⠀partner's⠀lamp,⠀always⠀separating⠀the⠀good⠀grain⠀for⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀horse.⠀Let⠀that⠀act⠀repeat⠀with⠀slight⠀variation⠀rather⠀than⠀turning⠀into⠀a⠀confession.\n\nPreserve⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy.⠀A⠀caring⠀person⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀short-tempered⠀about⠀a⠀damaged⠀book,⠀and⠀a⠀loved⠀one⠀may⠀refuse⠀to⠀talk⠀about⠀a⠀wound⠀but⠀accept⠀a⠀blanket.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀everyone⠀agrees.⠀Let⠀a⠀dispute⠀about⠀whether⠀to⠀send⠀the⠀children⠀to⠀the⠀wall⠀continue⠀while⠀one⠀character⠀slices⠀fruit⠀and⠀hands⠀over⠀the⠀better⠀half.\n\nFit⠀the⠀tenderness⠀into⠀the⠀narrative⠀movement.⠀The⠀interval⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀someone⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀room⠀and⠀end⠀with⠀them⠀still⠀present,⠀the⠀light⠀still⠀on,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀half⠀finished.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀emotional⠀breakthrough⠀or⠀require⠀every⠀problem⠀to⠀be⠀solved.⠀Close⠀from⠀the⠀interval's⠀quiet⠀continuation:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀finished,⠀a⠀repaired⠀coat⠀set⠀aside,⠀the⠀larger⠀oaths⠀waiting⠀outside.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose,⠀with⠀deliberate⠀movement⠀between⠀paragraphs⠀and⠀a⠀narrator⠀whose⠀view⠀may⠀include⠀the⠀room's⠀function,⠀the⠀customs⠀behind⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀the⠀history⠀of⠀an⠀institution.⠀Select⠀the⠀social⠀frame⠀from⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀public⠀ceremony,⠀a⠀visiting⠀supplicant,⠀or⠀a⠀corridor⠀where⠀two⠀debts⠀intersect.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀socially⠀situated,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀assume⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀cast⠀or⠀force⠀everyone⠀into⠀elaborate⠀speech.\n\nFrame⠀the⠀fantasy⠀obligations⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀world.⠀An⠀oath⠀to⠀a⠀border⠀shrine⠀may⠀be⠀recited⠀from⠀memory⠀by⠀a⠀child⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀yet⠀understand⠀its⠀penalties;⠀a⠀merchant's⠀silent⠀bow⠀to⠀a⠀ruined⠀hall⠀may⠀be⠀older⠀than⠀any⠀current⠀law.⠀Let⠀such⠀context⠀enter⠀through⠀a⠀door⠀frame,⠀a⠀worn⠀step,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀register,⠀or⠀a⠀title⠀spoken⠀with⠀hesitation.⠀The⠀larger⠀forces⠀remain⠀consequential⠀but⠀never⠀replace⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀with⠀historical⠀lecture.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀compression⠀within⠀the⠀formal⠀register.⠀Prefer⠀one⠀sharp⠀physical⠀detail⠀to⠀three⠀approximate⠀ones:⠀light⠀falling⠀on⠀a⠀chipped⠀dynastic⠀seal,⠀a⠀page⠀folded⠀over⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀guard's⠀left⠀glove⠀missing⠀the⠀third⠀finger.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀state⠀judgment⠀or⠀social⠀meaning⠀where⠀the⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀permits,⠀but⠀emotion⠀should⠀often⠀pass⠀through⠀those⠀objects⠀and⠀omissions.⠀Do⠀not⠀decorate⠀every⠀sentence⠀or⠀replace⠀direct⠀private⠀thought⠀with⠀remote⠀commentary⠀if⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀grants⠀interiority.\n\nGive⠀the⠀prose⠀sufficient⠀distance⠀to⠀connect⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀meanings.⠀A⠀small⠀delay⠀while⠀a⠀servant⠀adjusts⠀a⠀curtain⠀may⠀signal⠀a⠀household's⠀fear⠀of⠀an⠀inspection;⠀a⠀familiar⠀salute⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀survival⠀instinct⠀and⠀not⠀loyalty.⠀Arrange⠀transitions⠀so⠀the⠀scene⠀moves⠀from⠀entrance⠀to⠀an⠀incomplete⠀or⠀held⠀stillness⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀tidy⠀moral.⠀End⠀from⠀that⠀stillness:⠀a⠀gesture⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀door⠀not⠀yet⠀closed,⠀a⠀significance⠀the⠀narration⠀has⠀brought⠀into⠀view⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀live⠀occasion⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀tale⠀must⠀be⠀told⠀to⠀listeners⠀who⠀can⠀act⠀on⠀it.⠀Establish⠀the⠀reason⠀through⠀the⠀present⠀situation:⠀the⠀listeners⠀need⠀to⠀decide⠀whether⠀to⠀honor⠀an⠀old⠀promise,⠀accept⠀a⠀claim,⠀withhold⠀violence,⠀or⠀open⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀has⠀been⠀closed⠀by⠀an⠀inherited⠀oath.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀purpose⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀fallible.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀persuade,⠀delay,⠀warn,⠀or⠀console,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀succeed.\n\nUse⠀the⠀teller's⠀attention⠀as⠀the⠀method⠀of⠀selection.⠀At⠀each⠀turn,⠀show⠀only⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀attach⠀to⠀the⠀old⠀event⠀being⠀recovered:⠀a⠀ring⠀catching⠀torchlight,⠀a⠀cracked⠀seal⠀that⠀still⠀holds,⠀dust⠀on⠀a⠀banner⠀no⠀one⠀will⠀lower.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience's⠀questions,⠀silences,⠀and⠀misremembered⠀corrections⠀expose⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀leaves⠀out.⠀When⠀a⠀listener⠀interrupts⠀with⠀a⠀wrong⠀name⠀or⠀a⠀missing⠀detail,⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀avoidance⠀or⠀correction⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀omission.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀around⠀a⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀legacy⠀whose⠀terms⠀still⠀bind⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.⠀The⠀inner⠀story⠀may⠀concern⠀an⠀oath⠀sworn⠀before⠀a⠀mountain⠀fell,⠀a⠀relic⠀that⠀remembers⠀its⠀first⠀bearer,⠀a⠀city⠀whose⠀walls⠀were⠀sung⠀into⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀bound⠀to⠀a⠀dragon's⠀unkept⠀word.⠀Make⠀the⠀old⠀power⠀present⠀through⠀selected⠀sensory⠀images⠀inside⠀the⠀tale:⠀cold⠀air⠀moving⠀across⠀a⠀throne⠀room⠀floor,⠀the⠀sudden⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀crown⠀unworn⠀for⠀centuries,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀on⠀stone⠀where⠀a⠀spell⠀once⠀failed.⠀These⠀images⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀inner⠀characters'⠀choices;⠀they⠀make⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀those⠀choices⠀perceptible.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀frame⠀active⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀audience⠀when⠀the⠀inner⠀story⠀changes⠀what⠀they⠀understand.⠀The⠀shift⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀determines⠀who⠀may⠀enter,⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀reveals⠀a⠀hidden⠀allegiance,⠀or⠀a⠀listener's⠀recognition⠀that⠀the⠀tale⠀is⠀about⠀them.⠀Ground⠀the⠀transition⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀physical⠀motion:⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀log⠀shifting⠀in⠀the⠀fire,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawing⠀from⠀a⠀table.⠀This⠀keeps⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct⠀without⠀a⠀formal⠀announcement.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀mechanism.⠀Choose⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀from⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀reappear⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀should⠀mean⠀something⠀slightly⠀different⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀speaks⠀it,⠀touches⠀it,⠀or⠀refuses⠀to⠀repeat⠀it.⠀A⠀word⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀language⠀may⠀first⠀sound⠀like⠀a⠀storyteller's⠀flourish⠀and⠀later⠀identify⠀a⠀listener's⠀inherited⠀obligation.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀recurrence⠀on⠀its⠀first⠀appearance;⠀let⠀the⠀changed⠀relation⠀to⠀it⠀reveal⠀the⠀hidden⠀fact.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀agency.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀not⠀know⠀everything⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀contains;⠀the⠀audience⠀may⠀know⠀more⠀than⠀they⠀reveal.⠀A⠀listener's⠀interruption⠀can⠀redirect⠀the⠀story⠀toward⠀a⠀truth⠀the⠀teller⠀would⠀prefer⠀to⠀avoid.⠀Some⠀believe,⠀some⠀bargain,⠀some⠀mourn.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀listener⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀skeptical⠀or⠀credulous⠀posture.\n\nRender⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀intervals⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀Between⠀narrative⠀beats,⠀show⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀sensory⠀attention:⠀a⠀dry⠀throat,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀chest,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀the⠀room⠀grows⠀colder⠀when⠀a⠀certain⠀name⠀is⠀spoken.⠀These⠀are⠀not⠀pauses⠀in⠀the⠀action;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀action⠀of⠀someone⠀carrying⠀an⠀old⠀weight⠀into⠀the⠀present.⠀Let⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀inherit⠀the⠀same⠀selectivity,⠀so⠀that⠀even⠀a⠀battle⠀or⠀a⠀birth⠀is⠀told⠀through⠀a⠀few⠀chosen⠀images⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀full⠀chronicle.\n\nLet⠀the⠀tale's⠀effect⠀on⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀actually⠀been⠀revealed.⠀The⠀inner⠀story⠀may⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀believes,⠀who⠀they⠀will⠀follow,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀willing⠀to⠀risk.⠀End⠀when⠀that⠀change⠀has⠀become⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀whether⠀through⠀speech,⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀renewed⠀obligation.⠀The⠀telling⠀itself⠀should⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀world⠀and⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀listening,⠀but⠀the⠀story⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀oath⠀or⠀close⠀every⠀wound.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀modernist-uncanny⠀construction.⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀material⠀enters⠀through⠀a⠀limited,⠀socially⠀alert⠀narrative⠀consciousness⠀as⠀something⠀that⠀disturbs⠀ordinary⠀perception⠀and⠀civic⠀order⠀without⠀being⠀explained⠀away.⠀Keep⠀the⠀syntax⠀cooler⠀and⠀corrective:⠀precise⠀compound⠀observations,⠀occasional⠀ironic⠀contrast,⠀sentences⠀that⠀notice⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀being⠀said.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀stay⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀person's⠀observations⠀or⠀shift⠀at⠀section⠀breaks,⠀but⠀the⠀distance⠀should⠀remain⠀consistent⠀within⠀each⠀section.\n\nStart⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀place⠀that⠀already⠀carries⠀the⠀past:⠀a⠀restored⠀hall⠀with⠀a⠀crack⠀in⠀the⠀foundation,⠀a⠀border⠀town⠀where⠀an⠀old⠀treaty⠀still⠀determines⠀who⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀knife,⠀a⠀guild⠀office⠀with⠀a⠀cipher⠀that⠀only⠀one⠀family⠀can⠀read.⠀Let⠀High⠀Fantasy's⠀inherited⠀institutions⠀appear⠀as⠀ordinary⠀civic⠀texture—ledgers,⠀oaths,⠀feasts—while⠀the⠀particular⠀magic⠀remains⠀strange⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀closer⠀than⠀the⠀characters⠀think.⠀Show⠀an⠀oath⠀as⠀a⠀legal⠀document⠀with⠀a⠀clause⠀no⠀one⠀discusses,⠀a⠀relic⠀as⠀an⠀object⠀moved⠀during⠀renovations,⠀a⠀title⠀as⠀a⠀tax⠀exemption⠀that⠀now⠀carries⠀unexpected⠀authority.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀noticing⠀to⠀convey⠀the⠀uncanny⠀through⠀surfaces.⠀Instead⠀of⠀describing⠀a⠀spell,⠀show⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀lampshadow⠀bends⠀near⠀a⠀sealed⠀door;⠀instead⠀of⠀detailing⠀a⠀battle,⠀show⠀a⠀silver⠀button⠀lost⠀under⠀a⠀table⠀and⠀the⠀exact⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀page⠀turning⠀in⠀an⠀empty⠀archive.⠀Choose⠀a⠀few⠀details⠀per⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀their⠀recurrence⠀create⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀a⠀hidden⠀order.⠀Omit⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀magical⠀confirmation;⠀let⠀its⠀effect⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀dropped⠀cup,⠀a⠀held⠀breath,⠀a⠀changed⠀temperature⠀against⠀a⠀window.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀emotional⠀interior⠀present⠀but⠀restrained.⠀Show⠀feeling⠀through⠀small⠀acts⠀of⠀attention:⠀a⠀clerk⠀who⠀counts⠀coins⠀more⠀slowly⠀as⠀an⠀old⠀name⠀is⠀spoken,⠀a⠀soldier⠀who⠀remembers⠀a⠀childhood⠀song⠀while⠀fastening⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀belt.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀connection.⠀The⠀relationship⠀between⠀the⠀cracked⠀seal⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀reluctance⠀to⠀take⠀an⠀oath⠀remains⠀implicit,⠀carried⠀by⠀the⠀described⠀surfaces⠀and⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀omission.\n\nLet⠀the⠀chosen⠀distance⠀shape⠀the⠀magical⠀scale.⠀High⠀Fantasy's⠀ancient⠀events⠀may⠀be⠀reported⠀through⠀official⠀records,⠀but⠀the⠀report⠀is⠀only⠀one⠀layer.⠀After⠀quoting⠀a⠀brief⠀document,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀sensory⠀world:⠀the⠀ink⠀smell⠀on⠀a⠀clerk's⠀fingers,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀ring⠀on⠀a⠀chain.⠀The⠀grand⠀event⠀exists⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀present⠀bends⠀around⠀it.⠀A⠀single⠀guarded⠀sentence⠀about⠀a⠀mountain's⠀fall⠀can⠀feel⠀enormous⠀because⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀quiet.\n\nMove⠀through⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀short,⠀arranged⠀sections.⠀Each⠀section⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀discrete⠀observed⠀scene—a⠀meeting,⠀a⠀nighttime⠀passage,⠀a⠀conversation⠀before⠀a⠀door—separated⠀by⠀white⠀space.⠀Within⠀each,⠀let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀details⠀carry⠀the⠀fantastic⠀premise.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀waiting⠀outside⠀a⠀council⠀chamber⠀notices⠀a⠀painted⠀map⠀where⠀an⠀old⠀kingdom⠀is⠀labeled⠀only⠀by⠀a⠀small⠀gold⠀dot,⠀activate⠀that⠀dot⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀section⠀through⠀a⠀consequence:⠀a⠀border⠀dispute,⠀a⠀name⠀someone⠀refuses⠀to⠀translate,⠀a⠀tax⠀still⠀collected⠀for⠀a⠀war⠀no⠀one⠀living⠀remembers.\n\nUse⠀the⠀German-language⠀route's⠀interest⠀in⠀social⠀order⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀magical⠀inheritance⠀feel⠀real.⠀The⠀contract⠀between⠀the⠀material⠀past⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀is⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀unease:⠀people⠀know⠀the⠀rules⠀but⠀not⠀why⠀they⠀still⠀bind.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀voice⠀capable⠀of⠀ironic⠀observation⠀without⠀making⠀it⠀dismissive.⠀A⠀line⠀can⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀ancient⠀plaque⠀has⠀been⠀polished⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀no⠀longer⠀reads⠀it.⠀That⠀sentence⠀does⠀double⠀work:⠀it⠀names⠀the⠀eroded⠀continuity⠀while⠀leaving⠀its⠀force⠀tangible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀ending⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀recurrence⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀final⠀section⠀should⠀not⠀prove⠀the⠀magic⠀or⠀close⠀the⠀political⠀issue;⠀it⠀should⠀show⠀one⠀more⠀recurrence⠀from⠀a⠀slightly⠀changed⠀angle,⠀so⠀the⠀unseen⠀order⠀remains⠀active.⠀The⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀legacy⠀is⠀present⠀in⠀that⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀magic⠀displayed,⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀fact⠀of⠀distance⠀and⠀consequence⠀that⠀the⠀characters⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀both⠀feel.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀a⠀present-day⠀or⠀near-contemporary⠀world⠀where⠀an⠀older⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀authority⠀has⠀not⠀disappeared⠀but⠀has⠀become⠀private,⠀compromised,⠀and⠀woven⠀into⠀daily⠀compromises.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀renovated⠀fortress⠀apartment,⠀a⠀guild⠀office⠀above⠀a⠀market,⠀a⠀family⠀vault⠀that⠀doubles⠀as⠀a⠀meeting⠀room.⠀The⠀old⠀power⠀is⠀real⠀and⠀consequential;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀nostalgic⠀decoration.⠀Titles,⠀oaths,⠀relics,⠀and⠀lineages⠀still⠀decide⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀room,⠀who⠀owes⠀silence,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀promise⠀costs,⠀but⠀they⠀operate⠀through⠀the⠀exact⠀textures⠀of⠀contemporary⠀life—phone⠀calls,⠀leases,⠀coats⠀left⠀on⠀chairs,⠀a⠀ritual⠀scrawled⠀on⠀a⠀delivery⠀receipt.\n\nUse⠀Gothic-Punk's⠀collision⠀as⠀the⠀engine.⠀Show⠀an⠀inherited⠀power⠀meeting⠀a⠀present⠀need⠀or⠀desire:⠀an⠀old⠀oath⠀demands⠀a⠀signature⠀that⠀will⠀bind⠀a⠀modern⠀contract;⠀a⠀relic⠀must⠀be⠀worn⠀to⠀a⠀business⠀dinner;⠀a⠀family⠀portrait⠀watches⠀a⠀tenant⠀dispute.⠀Let⠀that⠀collision⠀be⠀morally⠀complicated⠀and⠀intimate,⠀not⠀a⠀simple⠀contest⠀between⠀noble⠀past⠀and⠀corrupt⠀present.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀honor⠀an⠀old⠀loyalty⠀and⠀still⠀betray⠀a⠀living⠀person;⠀an⠀ancient⠀title⠀can⠀protect⠀someone⠀and⠀also⠀silence⠀another.⠀Allow⠀private⠀desire⠀to⠀shift⠀the⠀encounter:⠀fear,⠀attraction,⠀resentment,⠀relief,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀believed⠀can⠀all⠀reshape⠀how⠀a⠀character⠀speaks⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀notice.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀perception⠀to⠀make⠀inherited⠀power⠀feel⠀intrusive.⠀Describe⠀only⠀a⠀few⠀details⠀per⠀beat,⠀chosen⠀because⠀they⠀make⠀absence⠀or⠀pressure⠀perceptible.⠀The⠀glint⠀of⠀a⠀signet⠀ring⠀while⠀someone⠀signs⠀a⠀false⠀name;⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀wax⠀in⠀a⠀corridor⠀that⠀has⠀electric⠀lights;⠀a⠀single⠀white⠀thread⠀on⠀a⠀black⠀sleeve.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀the⠀magic⠀itself⠀fully.⠀Let⠀its⠀effect⠀appear⠀in⠀small⠀physical⠀changes:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀too⠀smoothly,⠀a⠀shadow⠀that⠀arrives⠀before⠀the⠀person,⠀a⠀cold⠀spot⠀near⠀a⠀portrait.⠀This⠀makes⠀the⠀magical⠀inheritance⠀uncanny⠀and⠀personal⠀rather⠀than⠀epic.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀focal⠀characters.⠀Their⠀interior⠀experience⠀should⠀be⠀available:⠀the⠀private⠀thought⠀that⠀contradicts⠀their⠀polite⠀answer,⠀the⠀detail⠀they⠀cannot⠀stop⠀seeing,⠀the⠀bodily⠀reaction⠀they⠀try⠀to⠀hide.⠀Hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority⠀follows⠀the⠀supplied⠀context⠀and⠀narration⠀contract.⠀Show⠀both⠀social⠀masks⠀and⠀moments⠀where⠀the⠀mask⠀slips⠀in⠀trusted⠀company—a⠀sibling,⠀an⠀old⠀servant,⠀a⠀lover.⠀The⠀slip⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀shared⠀look,⠀a⠀gesture⠀repeated⠀from⠀childhood,⠀or⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀quietly.⠀Let⠀the⠀particular⠀relationship⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀slip⠀reveals.\n\nUse⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀to⠀root⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀legacy⠀in⠀real⠀costs.⠀Money,⠀rent,⠀inheritance,⠀maintenance,⠀access,⠀and⠀paperwork⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀old⠀oath.⠀A⠀ritual⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀fresh⠀candle⠀that⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀bought⠀after⠀work;⠀a⠀binding⠀promise⠀may⠀be⠀witnessed⠀by⠀a⠀notary⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀believe⠀it.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀changes⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀do:⠀one⠀character⠀can⠀refuse⠀a⠀request⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀debt⠀inherited⠀three⠀generations⠀back;⠀another⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀speak⠀only⠀after⠀touching⠀a⠀particular⠀stone.\n\nStructure⠀the⠀story⠀around⠀a⠀single⠀charged⠀encounter⠀that⠀gathers⠀multiple⠀obligations.⠀A⠀meeting,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀childhood⠀room,⠀a⠀conversation⠀outside⠀a⠀sealed⠀archive.⠀Within⠀that⠀container,⠀use⠀recurrence⠀to⠀build⠀meaning.⠀A⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀old⠀vow,⠀a⠀specific⠀gesture—two⠀fingers⠀pressed⠀to⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀hand⠀passed⠀over⠀a⠀candle,⠀a⠀ring⠀turned⠀once—can⠀reappear⠀with⠀different⠀weight.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀recurrence⠀on⠀its⠀first⠀appearance;⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀accrue⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀changing⠀relation⠀to⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀exchange⠀is⠀experienced.⠀In⠀a⠀trusted⠀space,⠀the⠀style⠀can⠀become⠀more⠀tender⠀or⠀more⠀cruel;⠀in⠀a⠀public⠀or⠀compromised⠀space,⠀it⠀can⠀grow⠀abrupt⠀and⠀watchful.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀is⠀never⠀absent,⠀but⠀the⠀room's⠀temperature⠀and⠀sound⠀register⠀its⠀pressure.⠀Describe⠀these⠀registers⠀through⠀brief,⠀selected⠀detail:⠀the⠀hum⠀of⠀a⠀heater⠀against⠀an⠀old⠀chant,⠀a⠀train⠀passing⠀while⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀spoken.⠀The⠀contrast⠀between⠀the⠀magical⠀and⠀the⠀mundane⠀should⠀create⠀a⠀sense⠀that⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀sitting⠀unnoticed⠀in⠀the⠀room.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀collision⠀has⠀altered⠀the⠀characters'⠀positions—not⠀resolved⠀all⠀oaths,⠀not⠀defeated⠀the⠀old⠀power,⠀but⠀made⠀the⠀personal⠀cost⠀clearer.⠀The⠀final⠀beat⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀character⠀closing⠀a⠀door,⠀turning⠀off⠀a⠀lamp,⠀or⠀leaving⠀one⠀object⠀on⠀a⠀table.⠀Let⠀the⠀ending⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀exchange⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀occurred,⠀whether⠀that⠀means⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀renewed⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀now⠀carries⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀The⠀Gothic-Punk⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀effect⠀is⠀an⠀intimate⠀horror⠀of⠀continuity:⠀the⠀old⠀world⠀remains⠀present⠀beneath⠀the⠀modern⠀surface.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral-epic⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route,⠀situated⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀community⠀and⠀language⠀tradition.⠀The⠀story⠀is⠀told⠀in⠀a⠀world⠀where⠀lineage,⠀oath,⠀and⠀ancient⠀event⠀are⠀kept⠀alive⠀by⠀public⠀or⠀semi-public⠀recitation.⠀A⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀reciting⠀before⠀a⠀festival,⠀a⠀council,⠀a⠀wedding,⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀after⠀a⠀loss.⠀Keep⠀the⠀region,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀specific:⠀names,⠀terms⠀of⠀address,⠀foods,⠀garments,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀layout⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀space⠀should⠀be⠀precise⠀rather⠀than⠀generic.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀supplied⠀with⠀a⠀setting,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀language⠀and⠀community;⠀if⠀not,⠀choose⠀one⠀definite⠀community⠀and⠀keep⠀its⠀details⠀consistent.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀build⠀through⠀the⠀needs⠀of⠀the⠀listeners.⠀The⠀telling⠀has⠀a⠀purpose:⠀to⠀remind⠀a⠀family⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀promise,⠀to⠀settle⠀a⠀dispute⠀about⠀inheritance,⠀to⠀prepare⠀someone⠀for⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀to⠀console⠀a⠀child⠀facing⠀a⠀rite.⠀The⠀listeners⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀correct,⠀ask⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀part,⠀or⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase;⠀these⠀responses⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀oral⠀form⠀and⠀can⠀shift⠀the⠀tale's⠀emphasis.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀intelligible:⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀is⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀belongs⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀time,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀may⠀land⠀on⠀a⠀different⠀object⠀or⠀face⠀than⠀the⠀one⠀described⠀before⠀the⠀tale⠀began.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀inner⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀tale,⠀use⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀imagery⠀to⠀activate⠀the⠀ancient⠀power.⠀Describe⠀the⠀past⠀through⠀a⠀few⠀carefully⠀chosen⠀details⠀encountered⠀by⠀its⠀own⠀focal⠀characters:⠀a⠀blade⠀lifted⠀from⠀water,⠀dust⠀on⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀bronze⠀lamp,⠀a⠀woman's⠀hand⠀pausing⠀above⠀a⠀bowl.⠀The⠀old⠀magic⠀should⠀be⠀felt⠀through⠀those⠀details⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀catalogue⠀of⠀powers.⠀Let⠀some⠀details⠀repeat⠀between⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀frame—a⠀cloth,⠀a⠀fruit,⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀respect—so⠀the⠀story⠀and⠀the⠀present⠀room⠀exchange⠀sensory⠀material.⠀The⠀repetition⠀carries⠀the⠀oath⠀or⠀curse⠀across⠀time⠀without⠀a⠀narrator's⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral-epic⠀form⠀to⠀manage⠀information.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀know⠀things⠀the⠀inner⠀characters⠀did⠀not,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀convert⠀that⠀into⠀a⠀solution⠀imposed⠀from⠀outside.⠀Instead,⠀allow⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀arrange⠀the⠀material:⠀she⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀name,⠀delay⠀a⠀crucial⠀event,⠀or⠀tell⠀a⠀short⠀embedded⠀episode⠀within⠀the⠀larger⠀tale.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀should⠀affect⠀the⠀outer⠀listeners⠀when⠀it⠀arrives—a⠀gasp,⠀silence,⠀a⠀repeated⠀word—and⠀then⠀be⠀returned⠀to⠀the⠀inner⠀action.⠀A⠀public⠀recitation⠀is⠀a⠀performance,⠀but⠀it⠀also⠀has⠀a⠀body:⠀the⠀teller's⠀dry⠀mouth,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀garland,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀the⠀floor⠀under⠀crossed⠀legs,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀voice⠀cracks⠀on⠀a⠀name.⠀Show⠀these⠀briefly⠀at⠀moments⠀when⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀turns.\n\nLet⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀scale⠀be⠀local⠀and⠀material.⠀An⠀old⠀oath⠀may⠀determine⠀which⠀fields⠀may⠀be⠀planted,⠀whose⠀children⠀may⠀marry,⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀shrine,⠀or⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀repaid⠀after⠀a⠀war.⠀The⠀inner⠀tale⠀may⠀include⠀gods,⠀heroes,⠀monsters,⠀and⠀magical⠀objects,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀act⠀inside⠀social⠀relationships⠀that⠀the⠀genre's⠀inherited⠀obligations⠀make⠀legible.⠀The⠀outer⠀frame⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀royal⠀court⠀or⠀a⠀formal⠀ritual;⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀veranda,⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀the⠀lamps⠀are⠀lit.⠀Let⠀the⠀old⠀tale's⠀grandeur⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀gathering:⠀a⠀listener⠀who⠀now⠀understands⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀family⠀that⠀must⠀renew⠀a⠀promise,⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀passes⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀emotional⠀omission⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀choices.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀about⠀a⠀character's⠀motives⠀or⠀a⠀death⠀can⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀listener's⠀reaction⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀gesture⠀repeated⠀from⠀the⠀tale.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀a⠀stoic;⠀grief,⠀anger,⠀joy,⠀and⠀longing⠀may⠀be⠀expressed⠀directly⠀by⠀listeners⠀who⠀interrupt⠀or⠀by⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀visible⠀state.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀as⠀needed,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀oral⠀delivery⠀with⠀interior⠀monologue.⠀The⠀relation⠀among⠀details⠀can⠀carry⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.\n\nLet⠀the⠀ending⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀tale⠀has⠀actually⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀room.⠀A⠀name⠀the⠀listeners⠀now⠀understand⠀differently,⠀a⠀promise⠀someone⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀story⠀must⠀renew,⠀an⠀object⠀passing⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀smoke⠀thinning,⠀a⠀child⠀falling⠀asleep,⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀bell,⠀but⠀the⠀chosen⠀image⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀transmission⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀occurred⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀required⠀closing⠀gesture.⠀The⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀legacy⠀remains⠀active;⠀the⠀Indian⠀oral-epic⠀route⠀makes⠀its⠀transmission⠀an⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀present,⠀felt⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀listeners'⠀attention.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀fantastic-tale⠀route:⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀material⠀unfolds⠀as⠀a⠀short,⠀episodic⠀narrative⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀seemingly⠀ordinary⠀situation⠀is⠀opened⠀by⠀an⠀old⠀promise,⠀a⠀strange⠀visitor,⠀or⠀a⠀forbidden⠀movement.⠀The⠀telling⠀is⠀spare⠀and⠀attentive;⠀it⠀moves⠀through⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀carefully⠀lit⠀moments⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀broad⠀exposition.⠀Each⠀scene⠀selects⠀a⠀few⠀sensory⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀invisible⠀pressure⠀of⠀the⠀magical⠀world:⠀the⠀rustle⠀of⠀a⠀paper⠀door,⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀smoke⠀bending,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀bell⠀struck⠀once,⠀the⠀coolness⠀of⠀a⠀lacquered⠀box.⠀These⠀details⠀register⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀something⠀old⠀and⠀powerful⠀that⠀touches⠀the⠀present.\n\nBegin⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀place⠀that⠀allows⠀both⠀daily⠀life⠀and⠀sudden⠀wonder:⠀a⠀mountain⠀post-station,⠀a⠀lakeside⠀house,⠀a⠀shrine⠀storehouse,⠀an⠀inn⠀where⠀a⠀traveler⠀waits⠀out⠀a⠀storm,⠀a⠀household⠀preparing⠀for⠀a⠀seasonal⠀rite.⠀High⠀Fantasy's⠀inherited⠀obligations⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀social⠀facts⠀in⠀this⠀world:⠀a⠀family⠀may⠀not⠀enter⠀a⠀certain⠀room,⠀a⠀title⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀spoken⠀aloud⠀inside⠀the⠀gate,⠀a⠀betrothal⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀charm⠀hidden⠀in⠀a⠀chest,⠀a⠀debt⠀from⠀an⠀ancestor's⠀broken⠀vow⠀still⠀changes⠀the⠀weather.⠀Show⠀these⠀rules⠀through⠀behavior⠀and⠀consequence,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrator's⠀lecture.⠀A⠀character⠀avoids⠀a⠀step,⠀another⠀touches⠀a⠀pillar⠀before⠀speaking,⠀a⠀servant⠀sets⠀an⠀extra⠀cup⠀in⠀a⠀place⠀no⠀one⠀uses.\n\nLet⠀the⠀fantastic⠀elements⠀be⠀presented⠀plainly⠀but⠀through⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀perception.⠀When⠀a⠀messenger⠀from⠀the⠀spirit⠀world⠀speaks,⠀describe⠀only⠀the⠀strange⠀quality⠀of⠀ordinary⠀things⠀around⠀the⠀speaker⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀elaborate⠀spectacle.⠀The⠀messenger's⠀voice⠀may⠀arrive⠀with⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀leaves;⠀a⠀ghost⠀may⠀be⠀known⠀by⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀candle⠀shadow⠀falls⠀onto⠀an⠀empty⠀sleeve;⠀a⠀magical⠀sword⠀may⠀be⠀revealed⠀by⠀a⠀drop⠀of⠀water⠀that⠀travels⠀upward⠀along⠀its⠀edge.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀mechanism;⠀let⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀attention⠀move⠀from⠀detail⠀to⠀detail,⠀establishing⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀power⠀is⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀room.\n\nUse⠀intervals⠀of⠀omission⠀to⠀carry⠀feeling.⠀After⠀an⠀event,⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀neutral⠀object:⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀closed⠀door,⠀a⠀thread⠀pulled⠀from⠀a⠀mat.⠀The⠀connection⠀between⠀the⠀event⠀and⠀the⠀object⠀may⠀remain⠀implicit,⠀but⠀the⠀chosen⠀object⠀allows⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀feel⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀said.⠀For⠀example,⠀after⠀a⠀ghost⠀delivers⠀a⠀warning,⠀describe⠀the⠀exact⠀way⠀the⠀character⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀knife⠀and⠀then⠀does⠀not⠀pick⠀it⠀up⠀again.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀leave⠀certain⠀motives⠀unspoken⠀while⠀still⠀providing⠀enough⠀concrete⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀experience.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀scale⠀present⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀sentence⠀epic.⠀Ancient⠀wars,⠀founding⠀oaths,⠀and⠀divine⠀gifts⠀may⠀be⠀mentioned⠀briefly⠀in⠀dialogue⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀told⠀episode,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀always⠀be⠀tied⠀to⠀an⠀immediate⠀effect:⠀a⠀scar⠀that⠀can⠀never⠀be⠀hidden,⠀a⠀field⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀grow,⠀a⠀mirror⠀that⠀shows⠀the⠀face⠀of⠀a⠀vanished⠀heir.⠀The⠀protagonist's⠀decision⠀should⠀be⠀shown⠀as⠀a⠀choice⠀under⠀inherited⠀constraint.⠀The⠀uncertain⠀cost⠀of⠀obedience,⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀fear⠀or⠀longing⠀the⠀character⠀feels,⠀can⠀all⠀be⠀conveyed⠀through⠀small⠀acts⠀of⠀attention.\n\nThe⠀narrative⠀may⠀be⠀told⠀in⠀first⠀or⠀third⠀person⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀contract.⠀If⠀first⠀person,⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀associations⠀structure⠀the⠀prose:⠀objects⠀remind⠀them⠀of⠀earlier⠀scenes,⠀a⠀certain⠀phrase⠀returns,⠀a⠀sensation⠀from⠀childhood⠀recurs⠀before⠀a⠀decision.⠀If⠀third⠀person,⠀keep⠀the⠀distance⠀limited⠀and⠀sensory,⠀staying⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀perspective⠀at⠀a⠀time.⠀In⠀either⠀case,⠀avoid⠀forced⠀seasonality⠀or⠀decorative⠀Japanese⠀scenery;⠀use⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀scene's⠀setting⠀requires.⠀The⠀fantastic⠀should⠀feel⠀native⠀to⠀this⠀specific⠀world⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀translated⠀into⠀a⠀uniform⠀ancient-Japan⠀package.\n\nUse⠀repetition⠀of⠀a⠀simple⠀gesture⠀or⠀object⠀to⠀build⠀meaning:⠀a⠀person⠀passes⠀a⠀comb⠀through⠀their⠀hair,⠀a⠀gate⠀is⠀opened⠀the⠀same⠀number⠀of⠀times,⠀a⠀cicada's⠀call⠀arrives⠀whenever⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀spoken.⠀Each⠀repetition⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀different⠀emotion,⠀showing⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀moving⠀closer⠀to⠀or⠀farther⠀from⠀the⠀impossible⠀demand⠀placed⠀on⠀them.⠀Delay⠀the⠀full⠀revelation⠀of⠀the⠀legacy⠀but⠀plant⠀its⠀signs⠀early⠀through⠀these⠀recurrences.⠀When⠀the⠀revelation⠀does⠀come,⠀it⠀should⠀arrive⠀within⠀a⠀scene,⠀as⠀a⠀new⠀sensory⠀fact,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀explanatory⠀summary.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀event⠀has⠀produced⠀a⠀legible⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀position⠀or⠀understanding.⠀The⠀outcome⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀small⠀acceptance,⠀a⠀return,⠀or⠀an⠀opening—whatever⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀event,⠀not⠀a⠀mandated⠀happy⠀ending.⠀The⠀final⠀beat⠀should⠀combine⠀action⠀and⠀sensation:⠀a⠀character⠀steps⠀over⠀a⠀threshold⠀with⠀an⠀unlit⠀lantern,⠀a⠀curtain⠀moves⠀although⠀there⠀is⠀no⠀wind,⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀spoken⠀into⠀a⠀bowl⠀of⠀water.⠀Let⠀the⠀chosen⠀beat⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀encounter⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀occurred,⠀so⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀dimensions⠀remain⠀large⠀but⠀are⠀felt⠀through⠀the⠀exact,⠀quiet⠀detail⠀where⠀the⠀two⠀worlds⠀touch.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀marvelous-realist⠀route:⠀present⠀High⠀Fantasy's⠀magic⠀as⠀an⠀accepted⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀physical⠀world⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀community.⠀The⠀supernatural⠀is⠀not⠀introduced⠀with⠀a⠀shock⠀or⠀a⠀proof;⠀it⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀register⠀as⠀weather,⠀church⠀bells,⠀market⠀prices,⠀and⠀family⠀memory.⠀The⠀story⠀is⠀written⠀in⠀continuous⠀narrative⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀limited,⠀closely⠀observed⠀perspective,⠀moving⠀through⠀interiors,⠀streets,⠀fields,⠀and⠀conversation.⠀Keep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀when⠀supplied;⠀otherwise⠀choose⠀a⠀definite⠀Latin⠀American⠀community⠀and⠀stay⠀consistent⠀with⠀its⠀sounds,⠀foods,⠀names,⠀and⠀local⠀arrangements.\n\nBegin⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀situation⠀in⠀which⠀an⠀inherited⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀obligation⠀touches⠀daily⠀life.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀debt⠀owed⠀to⠀a⠀buried⠀ancestor,⠀a⠀saint⠀or⠀spirit⠀who⠀still⠀receives⠀a⠀share⠀of⠀each⠀harvest,⠀a⠀house⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀kept⠀lit,⠀a⠀title⠀that⠀only⠀a⠀child⠀can⠀carry,⠀a⠀war⠀wound⠀that⠀announces⠀rain,⠀a⠀lineage⠀forced⠀to⠀leave⠀one⠀chair⠀empty⠀at⠀supper.⠀Show⠀the⠀community⠀already⠀living⠀with⠀these⠀facts.⠀Neighbors⠀know⠀which⠀days⠀are⠀unlucky⠀for⠀planting,⠀which⠀family⠀may⠀not⠀cross⠀a⠀certain⠀bridge,⠀which⠀door⠀to⠀leave⠀unlocked.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters⠀treat⠀these⠀facts⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀ordinary⠀order⠀of⠀the⠀place.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀attention⠀to⠀activate⠀the⠀marvelous.⠀Choose⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀sensory⠀details⠀per⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀bear⠀the⠀impossible⠀element.⠀If⠀a⠀dead⠀woman⠀returns⠀for⠀a⠀night,⠀don't⠀describe⠀her⠀arrival⠀as⠀special⠀effects;⠀describe⠀the⠀exact⠀smell⠀of⠀gardenias⠀near⠀the⠀kitchen,⠀the⠀way⠀her⠀son's⠀hands⠀hesitate⠀above⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀faint⠀coolness⠀along⠀the⠀hallway⠀where⠀she⠀walks.⠀If⠀an⠀old⠀curse⠀makes⠀a⠀millstone⠀turn⠀by⠀itself,⠀show⠀only⠀the⠀fine⠀dust⠀falling⠀from⠀its⠀stone⠀edge⠀and⠀a⠀child⠀who⠀stops⠀talking⠀when⠀it⠀starts.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀why;⠀the⠀community⠀already⠀knows.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀magical⠀element⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀genre's⠀larger⠀stakes.⠀An⠀old⠀oath⠀may⠀govern⠀who⠀can⠀enter⠀a⠀mine,⠀who⠀may⠀marry,⠀who⠀can⠀leave⠀the⠀village,⠀or⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀given⠀back⠀before⠀a⠀drought⠀ends.⠀Titles⠀and⠀relics⠀carry⠀real⠀power:⠀a⠀municipal⠀record,⠀a⠀saint's⠀medal,⠀a⠀broken⠀silver⠀stirrup,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀name⠀can⠀alter⠀a⠀legal⠀or⠀social⠀outcome.⠀The⠀protagonist's⠀personal⠀choice⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀obligation⠀becomes⠀costly.⠀The⠀narrative⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀would⠀lose⠀by⠀honoring⠀or⠀refusing⠀the⠀old⠀agreement,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀loss⠀concrete⠀through⠀ordinary⠀objects—a⠀key,⠀a⠀photograph,⠀a⠀cow,⠀a⠀plot⠀of⠀land.\n\nUse⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀techniques⠀where⠀appropriate,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀magic⠀real.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀doubt,⠀remember,⠀negotiate,⠀or⠀seek⠀help;⠀their⠀thoughts⠀and⠀motives⠀should⠀be⠀available⠀as⠀the⠀narration⠀requires.⠀If⠀a⠀ghost⠀speaks,⠀she⠀speaks;⠀if⠀a⠀spell⠀has⠀shaped⠀the⠀town,⠀that⠀shape⠀is⠀real⠀and⠀can⠀be⠀verified⠀by⠀another⠀character.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀treat⠀the⠀marvelous⠀serenely,⠀but⠀the⠀pressure⠀it⠀exerts⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀emotional.\n\nLet⠀memory⠀and⠀history⠀flow⠀through⠀the⠀present.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀fold⠀in⠀a⠀remembered⠀conversation,⠀a⠀story⠀told⠀by⠀a⠀grandmother,⠀a⠀photograph⠀examined⠀after⠀a⠀funeral.⠀Kawabata's⠀transience⠀appears⠀here⠀as⠀the⠀gentle,⠀persistent⠀weight⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀passed:⠀a⠀particular⠀gesture⠀repeated⠀across⠀three⠀generations,⠀a⠀song⠀heard⠀only⠀when⠀someone⠀is⠀dying,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀means⠀another⠀name⠀in⠀an⠀older⠀language.⠀Let⠀those⠀recurrences⠀give⠀the⠀scene⠀its⠀structure.⠀A⠀repeated⠀object—a⠀button,⠀a⠀ribbon,⠀a⠀crack⠀in⠀a⠀wall—can⠀carry⠀the⠀old⠀oath⠀into⠀each⠀new⠀encounter⠀without⠀a⠀lengthy⠀explanation.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀dialogue⠀in⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀register.⠀Let⠀regional⠀Spanish⠀or⠀Portuguese⠀or⠀the⠀supplied⠀language's⠀natural⠀rhythm⠀appear⠀through⠀word⠀choice,⠀names,⠀and⠀turns⠀of⠀phrase,⠀without⠀forcing⠀every⠀sentence⠀into⠀phonetic⠀spelling.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀invoke⠀a⠀saint,⠀offer⠀a⠀blessing,⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀say⠀a⠀dead⠀person's⠀name.⠀These⠀are⠀community⠀practices,⠀not⠀carnival⠀decorations.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀hold⠀that⠀register⠀comfortably,⠀moving⠀from⠀ordinary⠀speech⠀into⠀brief⠀lyric⠀description⠀when⠀the⠀marvelous⠀requires⠀attention.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀obligation⠀has⠀become⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀The⠀final⠀image⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀family⠀gathered⠀at⠀a⠀threshold,⠀a⠀child⠀inheriting⠀a⠀dangerous⠀name,⠀a⠀field⠀being⠀measured⠀for⠀a⠀boundary⠀that⠀shifts⠀only⠀at⠀night,⠀or⠀a⠀candle⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀watched⠀in⠀shifts.⠀Let⠀the⠀chosen⠀image⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀obligation⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀been⠀activated⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀required⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀opening.⠀The⠀marvelous-realist⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀story⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀reader⠀believing⠀both⠀in⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀in⠀the⠀reality⠀of⠀the⠀magic⠀that⠀shapes⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀that⠀already⠀carries⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀obligation.⠀Start⠀with⠀something⠀visible⠀and⠀immediate:⠀a⠀character's⠀hand⠀on⠀a⠀sealed⠀door,⠀a⠀spell⠀rising⠀from⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀town⠀bell⠀ringing⠀because⠀an⠀old⠀debt⠀has⠀come⠀due.⠀Do⠀not⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀long⠀history.⠀Instead,⠀place⠀the⠀protagonist⠀in⠀a⠀room,⠀road,⠀hall,⠀or⠀courtyard⠀where⠀the⠀inherited⠀power⠀is⠀already⠀changing⠀the⠀air.⠀Use⠀clean⠀spatial⠀cues:⠀left,⠀right,⠀near⠀the⠀window,⠀beyond⠀the⠀gate,⠀at⠀the⠀foot⠀of⠀the⠀stairs.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀know⠀where⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing.\n\nUse⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀A⠀short⠀action⠀paragraph⠀might⠀end⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀looks⠀up;⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀gets⠀its⠀own⠀paragraph;⠀then⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀follows.⠀The⠀reaction⠀is⠀where⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀appears.⠀Instead⠀of⠀describing⠀every⠀consequence⠀of⠀a⠀magical⠀event,⠀show⠀only⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀sensory⠀details⠀that⠀the⠀protagonist⠀notices:⠀the⠀taste⠀of⠀iron⠀in⠀their⠀mouth,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀shadow⠀moves⠀against⠀the⠀wall,⠀a⠀cold⠀spot⠀shaped⠀like⠀a⠀hand.⠀The⠀spell⠀or⠀old⠀power⠀is⠀real,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀felt⠀through⠀those⠀compressed⠀impressions⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀itemized⠀display.\n\nGive⠀unfamiliar⠀names⠀and⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀without⠀stopping⠀the⠀scene.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀bears⠀a⠀title⠀like⠀Oathkeeper,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀title⠀allows⠀or⠀forbids⠀in⠀one⠀tight⠀line,⠀either⠀through⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀reaction.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀guard⠀says,⠀\"You⠀can't⠀cross.⠀Your⠀grandmother's⠀name⠀is⠀still⠀on⠀the⠀stone,\"⠀and⠀the⠀protagonist⠀touches⠀a⠀charm⠀they⠀were⠀told⠀never⠀to⠀remove.⠀The⠀line⠀explains⠀the⠀rule⠀and⠀shows⠀the⠀cost.⠀Keep⠀any⠀necessary⠀mechanics⠀active⠀and⠀local:⠀a⠀relic's⠀function,⠀a⠀lineage's⠀restriction,⠀a⠀debt's⠀deadline⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀an⠀event⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀respond⠀to,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀footnote.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀stakes⠀immediate.⠀The⠀protagonist⠀may⠀not⠀think⠀about⠀an⠀ancient⠀war⠀in⠀general⠀terms;⠀they⠀think⠀about⠀a⠀specific⠀person,⠀claim,⠀or⠀loss⠀that⠀the⠀old⠀power⠀now⠀changes.⠀A⠀dead⠀king's⠀oath⠀may⠀mean⠀the⠀protagonist⠀cannot⠀save⠀a⠀sibling;⠀a⠀dragon's⠀promise⠀may⠀mean⠀the⠀town's⠀well⠀is⠀safe⠀only⠀for⠀one⠀more⠀night;⠀a⠀family⠀title⠀may⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀between⠀two⠀companions.⠀Make⠀the⠀personal⠀consequence⠀clear⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀character's⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀dry,⠀based⠀on⠀their⠀actual⠀personality,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀that⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀quip.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀intervals⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀structure.⠀After⠀a⠀significant⠀magical⠀moment,⠀do⠀not⠀immediately⠀rush⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀event.⠀Insert⠀a⠀short⠀beat⠀of⠀attention⠀to⠀something⠀passing⠀or⠀difficult⠀to⠀keep:⠀the⠀flutter⠀of⠀candle⠀smoke,⠀a⠀thread⠀pulled⠀from⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀coin⠀that⠀has⠀grown⠀warm.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀that⠀detail⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀influence⠀the⠀next⠀choice.⠀This⠀beat⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀plot;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀character⠀processing⠀the⠀old⠀power.⠀It⠀can⠀reveal⠀feeling⠀through⠀selection⠀instead⠀of⠀explanation.⠀For⠀example,⠀after⠀an⠀oath⠀activates,⠀a⠀knight⠀may⠀watch⠀the⠀blood⠀dry⠀on⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀cup⠀for⠀a⠀second⠀before⠀speaking.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀and⠀description⠀to⠀register⠀the⠀world's⠀history⠀without⠀turning⠀into⠀an⠀encyclopedia.⠀When⠀the⠀protagonist⠀and⠀a⠀companion⠀discuss⠀the⠀situation,⠀keep⠀the⠀history⠀piecemeal⠀and⠀attached⠀to⠀current⠀action.⠀\"The⠀founding⠀bell⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀vault.\"⠀\"I⠀know.⠀My⠀father⠀broke⠀it.\"⠀That⠀exchange⠀is⠀enough⠀to⠀suggest⠀a⠀larger⠀past.⠀If⠀a⠀past⠀event⠀matters,⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀in⠀small⠀flashes⠀during⠀the⠀response⠀beats:⠀a⠀sound⠀like⠀a⠀door⠀slamming⠀in⠀another⠀century,⠀a⠀gesture⠀the⠀protagonist⠀learned⠀from⠀someone⠀now⠀dead.⠀Repeating⠀one⠀physical⠀signal—a⠀crack⠀in⠀the⠀floor,⠀a⠀bead⠀of⠀water⠀on⠀a⠀window,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀old⠀paper—can⠀carry⠀the⠀old⠀obligation⠀across⠀scenes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀controlled.⠀The⠀Light⠀Novel⠀style⠀often⠀uses⠀close⠀first⠀person⠀or⠀limited⠀third⠀person⠀with⠀a⠀focused⠀interior.⠀Make⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀private⠀response⠀available⠀after⠀each⠀major⠀turn:⠀a⠀brief⠀thought,⠀a⠀sensation,⠀a⠀decision⠀not⠀to⠀say⠀something.⠀The⠀response⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀that⠀character⠀and⠀should⠀respect⠀the⠀active⠀narration⠀and⠀interiority⠀contract.⠀If⠀hidden⠀or⠀visible⠀interiority⠀is⠀required,⠀follow⠀the⠀supplied⠀wrapper⠀and⠀placement⠀rules.⠀Do⠀not⠀skip⠀the⠀interiority⠀just⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀prose⠀fast;⠀a⠀reaction⠀beat⠀can⠀carry⠀it⠀in⠀one⠀compressed⠀sentence.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀turn⠀where⠀the⠀protagonist's⠀position⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀story⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀whole⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀conflict,⠀but⠀the⠀final⠀beat⠀should⠀show⠀where⠀the⠀protagonist⠀stands:⠀a⠀hand⠀against⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀ring⠀turned⠀on⠀a⠀finger,⠀an⠀unlit⠀torch⠀lifting⠀as⠀a⠀distant⠀sound⠀begins.⠀The⠀closing⠀moment⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀realization,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀question.⠀Let⠀the⠀chosen⠀beat⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀specific⠀turn⠀that⠀has⠀just⠀occurred⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀required⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀opening.⠀The⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀obligation⠀remains⠀active,⠀but⠀the⠀Light⠀Novel's⠀clarity⠀ensures⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀exactly⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀this⠀scene⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀might⠀test.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene⠀from⠀a⠀small⠀cluster⠀of⠀exact⠀sensory⠀images⠀that⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀larger⠀obligation:⠀a⠀worn⠀rune⠀on⠀a⠀sword⠀hilt,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀winter⠀iron,⠀dust⠀settling⠀on⠀an⠀oath-tablet.⠀Choose⠀images⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀immediate⠀setting⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀perception,⠀then⠀let⠀them⠀recur⠀with⠀slight⠀variation⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀changes.⠀A⠀recurrence⠀should⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀image⠀makes⠀present:⠀the⠀same⠀coldness⠀of⠀a⠀brass⠀handle⠀may⠀first⠀mean⠀arrival,⠀later⠀refusal,⠀later⠀a⠀door⠀no⠀one⠀opens.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀image's⠀full⠀significance;⠀let⠀the⠀changed⠀context⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.\n\nShape⠀the⠀paragraph⠀rhythm⠀around⠀one⠀clear⠀action⠀or⠀exchange.⠀Use⠀a⠀short⠀declarative⠀sentence⠀for⠀the⠀decisive⠀movement,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀gather⠀associations—sound,⠀light,⠀a⠀remembered⠀gesture—before⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀The⠀longer⠀sentence⠀should⠀unfold⠀by⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀inventory:⠀one⠀perception⠀can⠀lead⠀to⠀a⠀comparison,⠀and⠀the⠀comparison⠀can⠀return⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀the⠀room⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding.⠀Keep⠀the⠀figurative⠀language⠀traceable⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀see,⠀hear,⠀or⠀remember.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀swears⠀an⠀oath⠀or⠀inherits⠀a⠀title,⠀render⠀the⠀ceremony⠀through⠀attention⠀to⠀her⠀hands,⠀the⠀breath⠀of⠀the⠀witnesses,⠀or⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀ring,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀syntax⠀slow⠀around⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀obligation⠀becomes⠀physical.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrator⠀limited⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀perception,⠀but⠀allow⠀the⠀prose⠀to⠀carry⠀unspoken⠀feeling⠀through⠀image⠀and⠀rhythm.⠀If⠀a⠀lord⠀must⠀burn⠀a⠀charter,⠀show⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀vellum⠀darkening,⠀the⠀small⠀pause,⠀and⠀the⠀smoke⠀rising⠀past⠀a⠀window⠀where⠀someone⠀once⠀stood.⠀Do⠀not⠀state⠀that⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀irrevocable;⠀instead⠀let⠀the⠀curling⠀page⠀hold⠀the⠀loss.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀directly⠀about⠀a⠀sacrifice,⠀but⠀the⠀thought⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀perception⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀history.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀character's⠀spoken⠀register;⠀dialogue⠀may⠀remain⠀plainer⠀than⠀the⠀prose⠀around⠀it.\n\nTreat⠀magic⠀as⠀physically⠀continuous⠀with⠀the⠀world.⠀When⠀a⠀spell⠀is⠀cast,⠀follow⠀one⠀traceable⠀sensation:⠀the⠀sudden⠀cold⠀on⠀the⠀tongue,⠀the⠀color⠀draining⠀from⠀a⠀stone,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀rain⠀in⠀a⠀sealed⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀describe⠀magical⠀energy⠀in⠀abstract⠀terms.⠀The⠀consequence⠀is⠀not⠀only⠀the⠀effect⠀but⠀what⠀the⠀caster⠀notices⠀afterward—a⠀door⠀left⠀ajar,⠀a⠀faded⠀mark⠀on⠀the⠀wrist,⠀a⠀silence⠀where⠀a⠀bird⠀had⠀been⠀singing.⠀Let⠀that⠀aftermath⠀occupy⠀the⠀prose⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀register,⠀without⠀turning⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀moral⠀or⠀a⠀system⠀explanation.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀sensory⠀transition:⠀a⠀lamp⠀being⠀trimmed,⠀a⠀muddied⠀hem⠀passing⠀through⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀hand⠀releasing⠀a⠀rail.⠀The⠀stop⠀may⠀occur⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀unfinished⠀practical⠀task⠀or⠀unspoken⠀recognition.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀conclusion⠀about⠀the⠀kingdom's⠀future;⠀allow⠀the⠀detail⠀to⠀hold⠀the⠀present⠀feeling,⠀with⠀the⠀larger⠀obligation⠀continuing⠀beyond⠀the⠀sentence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nCompose⠀scenes⠀as⠀intervals⠀in⠀which⠀present⠀perception⠀stirs⠀a⠀specific⠀memory⠀or⠀quiet⠀realization⠀about⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀reflection⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀from⠀the⠀high⠀fantasy⠀setting:⠀a⠀broken⠀seal,⠀a⠀faded⠀banner,⠀a⠀sword⠀laid⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀ring⠀no⠀longer⠀worn.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀object⠀first,⠀then⠀allow⠀the⠀memory⠀to⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀felt⠀discrepancy⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀complete⠀narrative⠀flashback:⠀the⠀hall⠀is⠀quieter⠀now,⠀the⠀hearth⠀smaller⠀than⠀it⠀seemed,⠀the⠀same⠀window⠀admitting⠀a⠀different⠀season.⠀The⠀past⠀should⠀enter⠀through⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details,⠀not⠀a⠀full⠀reconstruction.\n\nLet⠀the⠀movement⠀from⠀present⠀to⠀past⠀be⠀selective⠀and⠀reversible.⠀A⠀perception⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀particular⠀occasion,⠀and⠀the⠀recollection⠀may⠀return⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀attention:⠀the⠀remembered⠀voice⠀makes⠀the⠀current⠀silence⠀audible,⠀the⠀remembered⠀warmth⠀makes⠀the⠀cold⠀handle⠀noticeable.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀memory⠀painful.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀joke,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀unexpected⠀kindness,⠀and⠀the⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀intact⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀present⠀reveals⠀its⠀distance.⠀Use⠀the⠀melancholy⠀to⠀deepen⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀oath⠀or⠀historical⠀consequence,⠀not⠀to⠀replace⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀decision⠀costs⠀something,⠀show⠀what⠀small⠀thing⠀is⠀lost⠀in⠀the⠀transaction:⠀a⠀routine,⠀a⠀view⠀from⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀habit⠀of⠀speech.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scale⠀of⠀the⠀world⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀reflective⠀attention.⠀A⠀queen⠀may⠀stand⠀before⠀a⠀ruined⠀map⠀and⠀remember⠀the⠀cartographer's⠀hands.⠀A⠀soldier⠀may⠀polish⠀a⠀blade⠀and⠀recall⠀the⠀exact⠀tone⠀of⠀a⠀command.⠀These⠀recollections⠀should⠀be⠀selective,⠀not⠀exhaustive.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀interrupt⠀action,⠀follow⠀it,⠀or⠀occur⠀during⠀a⠀pause,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀stay⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀step⠀outside⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀access⠀to⠀moralize⠀about⠀time.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀think⠀directly⠀about⠀obligation,⠀regret,⠀or⠀hope,⠀but⠀phrase⠀the⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀sparse⠀terms.⠀Avoid⠀abstractions⠀like⠀\"the⠀weight⠀of⠀history.\"⠀Instead⠀have⠀the⠀character⠀consider⠀a⠀specific⠀appointment⠀at⠀dawn,⠀or⠀a⠀child⠀whose⠀name⠀has⠀been⠀added⠀to⠀a⠀muster⠀roll.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀reflects⠀in⠀third⠀person,⠀keep⠀the⠀vocabulary⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀perception.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀be⠀unfinished⠀or⠀interrupted;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀reach⠀a⠀conclusion⠀about⠀the⠀past.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀a⠀small,⠀irreversible⠀change:⠀a⠀candle⠀guttering,⠀a⠀watchman's⠀call⠀receding,⠀a⠀bowl⠀left⠀unfilled.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀before⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀completed⠀or⠀a⠀conversation⠀resolved,⠀leaving⠀the⠀larger⠀future⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀conclude⠀with⠀an⠀epigram⠀about⠀loss.⠀Let⠀the⠀final⠀image⠀hold⠀the⠀unfinished⠀feeling,⠀while⠀the⠀world's⠀obligations⠀continue⠀beyond⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀lyric,⠀reflective⠀oral⠀frame⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀storyteller⠀and⠀audience⠀when⠀perspective⠀requires⠀it:⠀a⠀servant⠀in⠀a⠀garden,⠀a⠀guest⠀at⠀a⠀night⠀meal,⠀a⠀keeper⠀of⠀archives⠀recounting⠀a⠀debt.⠀The⠀frame⠀should⠀remain⠀lightly⠀present—a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀poured⠀cup,⠀a⠀hesitation—not⠀an⠀elaborate⠀machinery.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀perceptions⠀shape⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀moth⠀crossing⠀the⠀lamp⠀may⠀lead⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀mention⠀a⠀moth⠀in⠀the⠀embedded⠀story,⠀or⠀a⠀pause⠀to⠀refill⠀a⠀cup⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀what⠀to⠀omit.⠀The⠀embedded⠀story⠀carries⠀the⠀high⠀fantasy⠀action⠀and⠀consequence:⠀a⠀broken⠀treaty,⠀a⠀stolen⠀name,⠀a⠀journey⠀across⠀a⠀salt⠀waste.\n\nIn⠀the⠀embedded⠀story,⠀use⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀perception⠀to⠀focus⠀on⠀ordinary,⠀perishable⠀things⠀inside⠀grand⠀events.⠀If⠀an⠀oath⠀is⠀sworn,⠀describe⠀the⠀ink⠀drying,⠀the⠀faint⠀sweetness⠀of⠀tea⠀left⠀untouched,⠀a⠀moth⠀crossing⠀the⠀lamp.⠀If⠀magic⠀is⠀worked,⠀render⠀one⠀physical⠀trace—a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀pattern⠀appearing⠀in⠀dust—rather⠀than⠀a⠀spectacle.⠀Consequences⠀should⠀emerge⠀through⠀these⠀details:⠀a⠀city⠀falls,⠀but⠀the⠀teller⠀pauses⠀on⠀a⠀particular⠀door⠀left⠀open.⠀The⠀teller⠀selects⠀these⠀details;⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator's⠀free⠀access⠀to⠀every⠀mind⠀or⠀object.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀storyteller⠀to⠀reflect⠀on⠀the⠀told⠀events⠀with⠀quiet,⠀unassertive⠀commentary.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀compare⠀a⠀past⠀occasion⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀setting,⠀mention⠀what⠀was⠀not⠀recorded,⠀or⠀note⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀object.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reflection⠀brief⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀knowledge.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀includes⠀other⠀minds,⠀indicate⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀learned⠀it⠀later⠀or⠀inferred⠀it:⠀\"afterward⠀she⠀said,\"⠀\"the⠀letter⠀was⠀found,\"⠀\"he⠀must⠀have⠀seen.\"⠀This⠀respects⠀the⠀frame's⠀access⠀limits⠀and⠀keeps⠀the⠀teller⠀a⠀participant⠀in⠀the⠀occasion⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀transparent⠀voice.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀return⠀briefly⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀telling⠀affects⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀small⠀change:⠀the⠀listener⠀notices⠀a⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀tale⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀room,⠀the⠀teller⠀sets⠀down⠀the⠀cup,⠀the⠀light⠀shifts.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀story's⠀meaning⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀moral.⠀It⠀may⠀instead⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀altered⠀the⠀silence,⠀the⠀listener's⠀posture,⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀willingness⠀to⠀continue.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀tradition-specific⠀route⠀coherent.⠀Because⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀lyric,⠀reflective⠀oral⠀frame,⠀avoid⠀picaresque⠀satire,⠀absurdist⠀construction,⠀or⠀a⠀chain⠀of⠀nested⠀tales.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀an⠀honor⠀code,⠀pilgrimage,⠀or⠀desert⠀imagery⠀unless⠀supplied.⠀The⠀setting's⠀current⠀world⠀facts⠀control⠀geography⠀and⠀social⠀structure.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀with⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀story⠀touching⠀at⠀one⠀point,⠀leaving⠀the⠀embedded⠀conflict⠀unresolved⠀and⠀the⠀story's⠀emotional⠀aftereffect⠀lingering⠀in⠀the⠀frame's⠀quiet⠀present.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀short,⠀direct⠀clauses.⠀For⠀each⠀scene,⠀choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀imply⠀the⠀larger⠀fantasy⠀world:⠀a⠀blackened⠀oath-stone,⠀a⠀child's⠀wooden⠀sword,⠀the⠀third⠀bell⠀ringing⠀across⠀a⠀quiet⠀courtyard.⠀Let⠀one⠀detail⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀orientation.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀a⠀ruined⠀keep,⠀do⠀not⠀list⠀its⠀history;⠀show⠀a⠀single⠀beam⠀holding⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀passing⠀through⠀it.⠀The⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀exact⠀enough⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀world's⠀scale⠀without⠀requiring⠀explanation.\n\nWhen⠀presenting⠀a⠀choice⠀or⠀magical⠀consequence,⠀keep⠀causality⠀clear.⠀A⠀spell⠀may⠀work⠀through⠀a⠀direct⠀effect—the⠀water⠀stills,⠀the⠀brand⠀fades,⠀the⠀lock⠀cools.⠀State⠀the⠀effect⠀in⠀one⠀sentence,⠀then⠀the⠀character's⠀response⠀in⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀system⠀of⠀magic⠀unless⠀a⠀specific⠀incorrect⠀reading⠀would⠀alter⠀what⠀happened.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀inference⠀possible:⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀refuses⠀an⠀oath,⠀the⠀conversation⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀other⠀speaker⠀turning⠀away;⠀no⠀further⠀explanation⠀is⠀needed.⠀The⠀refusal's⠀consequence⠀remains⠀inferable⠀from⠀the⠀movement⠀and⠀the⠀broken-off⠀exchange.\n\nUse⠀selected⠀physical⠀impressions⠀the⠀way⠀Kawabata⠀does,⠀but⠀reduce⠀their⠀number.⠀Instead⠀of⠀three⠀images,⠀choose⠀one:⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀dust⠀after⠀the⠀archive⠀closes,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀ring⠀in⠀a⠀palm,⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀light⠀on⠀a⠀broken⠀seal.⠀This⠀image⠀can⠀recur⠀later⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀exact:⠀the⠀same⠀smell⠀of⠀dust⠀may⠀now⠀mean⠀return⠀rather⠀than⠀departure,⠀and⠀the⠀change⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced.⠀Keep⠀the⠀feeling⠀inside⠀the⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀emotion.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀afraid,⠀show⠀her⠀hand⠀hesitating⠀above⠀a⠀latch,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀say⠀she⠀was⠀afraid⠀unless⠀the⠀direct⠀thought⠀is⠀necessary.⠀A⠀necessary⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀one⠀short⠀clause,⠀placed⠀where⠀it⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀perception.\n\nWhere⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀let⠀dialogue⠀be⠀spare.⠀Speakers⠀may⠀use⠀short⠀sentences,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀terse⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀way.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀a⠀fragment;⠀another⠀may⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀more⠀formal⠀word.⠀The⠀prose⠀around⠀the⠀dialogue⠀should⠀remain⠀economical.⠀A⠀pause⠀can⠀be⠀indicated⠀by⠀an⠀action—tapping⠀a⠀cup,⠀straightening⠀a⠀scroll—rather⠀than⠀by⠀an⠀adverb.⠀Let⠀the⠀action⠀carry⠀the⠀pause's⠀weight⠀without⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀implies⠀continuation.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀stop⠀after⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀movement⠀toward⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀image⠀of⠀something⠀unresolved.⠀Do⠀not⠀append⠀an⠀explanation⠀about⠀the⠀future⠀or⠀a⠀summarizing⠀sentence.⠀The⠀world's⠀size⠀remains⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀unfinished⠀action.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀continuous⠀scene⠀prose.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀perception⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀reader⠀in⠀the⠀high⠀fantasy⠀world:⠀a⠀groom⠀leading⠀a⠀horse⠀across⠀a⠀frost-covered⠀yard,⠀a⠀scribe⠀trimming⠀a⠀lamp⠀in⠀a⠀council⠀chamber,⠀a⠀girl⠀setting⠀a⠀bowl⠀on⠀a⠀window⠀ledge⠀above⠀a⠀burned⠀garden.⠀Let⠀the⠀action⠀proceed⠀through⠀a⠀mix⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀physical⠀movement,⠀and⠀focal⠀attention.⠀Use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀to⠀shift⠀between⠀exterior⠀events⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀interior⠀response⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀shift.⠀The⠀transition⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀natural⠀movement⠀of⠀attention:⠀an⠀action⠀ends,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀paragraph⠀begins⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀noticed⠀or⠀remembered⠀because⠀of⠀it.\n\nWhen⠀magic⠀or⠀inherited⠀obligation⠀matters,⠀keep⠀it⠀grounded⠀in⠀ordinary⠀perception.⠀If⠀a⠀voice⠀comes⠀from⠀a⠀sealed⠀chapel,⠀describe⠀the⠀sound⠀as⠀something⠀heard⠀through⠀stone:⠀a⠀low⠀note,⠀like⠀a⠀hinge⠀turning⠀under⠀water.⠀If⠀a⠀lord⠀must⠀answer⠀a⠀summons,⠀show⠀her⠀pausing⠀to⠀push⠀a⠀chair⠀back,⠀then⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀signet⠀on⠀her⠀hand.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀entire⠀legal⠀system;⠀instead⠀let⠀one⠀direct⠀consequence—a⠀closed⠀road,⠀a⠀guard's⠀changed⠀tone—show⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀costs.⠀The⠀consequence⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀terms,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀laws⠀or⠀history.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀imagery⠀to⠀shape⠀the⠀narrative⠀eye.⠀Select⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀sensory⠀impressions⠀per⠀scene⠀and⠀allow⠀them⠀to⠀recur:⠀the⠀same⠀smudge⠀on⠀a⠀plaster⠀wall,⠀the⠀same⠀coldness⠀of⠀a⠀brass⠀handle,⠀the⠀same⠀uneven⠀flagstone⠀at⠀the⠀threshold.⠀A⠀repeated⠀image⠀should⠀gather⠀feeling⠀without⠀a⠀full⠀explanation.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀remembers⠀an⠀earlier⠀event,⠀let⠀the⠀memory⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀sudden⠀sensory⠀match—the⠀smell⠀of⠀wet⠀wool,⠀a⠀particular⠀angle⠀of⠀shadow—rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀formal⠀flashback.⠀The⠀memory⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀then⠀dissolve⠀back⠀into⠀the⠀present⠀scene.\n\nAllow⠀direct⠀interiority⠀when⠀it⠀naturally⠀arises.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀about⠀what⠀an⠀oath⠀means⠀to⠀her,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀she⠀no⠀longer⠀visits⠀a⠀certain⠀room.⠀Keep⠀the⠀thought⠀in⠀her⠀own⠀idiom.⠀Do⠀not⠀shift⠀into⠀an⠀omniscient⠀moral⠀register.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀third-person⠀limited,⠀avoid⠀giving⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀mind⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀it.⠀The⠀interiority⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure:⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object,⠀or⠀the⠀moment⠀before⠀a⠀decision.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀after⠀a⠀question⠀has⠀been⠀asked⠀but⠀not⠀answered,⠀after⠀a⠀character⠀has⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀cup,⠀after⠀a⠀door⠀has⠀closed.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀thematic⠀summary⠀about⠀the⠀world⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀contemporary-novel⠀method⠀handles⠀high⠀fantasy's⠀scale⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀carry⠀its⠀weight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nCenter⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀in⠀each⠀scene.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀involves⠀a⠀bond⠀between⠀a⠀mage⠀and⠀a⠀knight,⠀choose⠀moments⠀that⠀reveal⠀its⠀private⠀terms:⠀a⠀shared⠀silence⠀before⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀hand⠀adjusting⠀a⠀harness,⠀one⠀character⠀saving⠀the⠀last⠀of⠀the⠀tea⠀for⠀the⠀other.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀relationship;⠀let⠀a⠀small⠀action⠀or⠀phrase⠀carry⠀the⠀history.⠀The⠀high⠀fantasy⠀stakes⠀should⠀press⠀on⠀this⠀intimacy—a⠀summons,⠀a⠀broken⠀oath,⠀a⠀battle⠀line—so⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀is⠀tested⠀by⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀isolated⠀from⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀selection⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀pairing's⠀particular⠀promise⠀legible:⠀what⠀these⠀two⠀people⠀offer⠀each⠀other⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀does.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀to⠀earlier⠀moments⠀through⠀concrete⠀objects⠀and⠀private⠀language.⠀A⠀ribbon,⠀a⠀chipped⠀cup,⠀a⠀particular⠀phrase⠀from⠀an⠀argument⠀may⠀reappear⠀with⠀changed⠀meaning.⠀The⠀callback⠀should⠀feel⠀earned:⠀it⠀recalls⠀something⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀seen,⠀not⠀a⠀random⠀symbol.⠀When⠀a⠀promise⠀is⠀made⠀or⠀broken,⠀show⠀how⠀it⠀alters⠀a⠀private⠀routine.⠀For⠀example,⠀after⠀a⠀quarrel⠀over⠀a⠀mission,⠀the⠀morning⠀ritual⠀of⠀dividing⠀bread⠀may⠀be⠀done⠀in⠀silence,⠀one⠀piece⠀left⠀behind.⠀The⠀changed⠀routine⠀carries⠀the⠀consequence⠀without⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀quarrel.\n\nLet⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀imagery⠀shape⠀emotional⠀beats.⠀Instead⠀of⠀long⠀interior⠀monologue⠀or⠀smoldering⠀descriptions,⠀choose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀sensory⠀details⠀that⠀reveal⠀the⠀feeling:⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀character⠀touches⠀a⠀torn⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀coolness⠀of⠀a⠀window⠀where⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀had⠀been⠀standing.⠀Omission⠀can⠀be⠀powerful;⠀leave⠀some⠀reactions⠀unspoken.⠀But⠀do⠀not⠀erase⠀required⠀interiority.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀directly⠀about⠀love,⠀fear,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀relief,⠀phrased⠀in⠀her⠀own⠀voice.⠀The⠀thought⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀relationship's⠀terms:⠀not⠀\"she⠀loved⠀her\"⠀in⠀general,⠀but⠀a⠀particular⠀worry,⠀hope,⠀or⠀recognition⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀scene.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀consequences.⠀A⠀gesture⠀of⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀magical⠀alarm;⠀a⠀confession⠀may⠀happen⠀beside⠀a⠀dying⠀fire⠀as⠀an⠀enemy⠀approaches.⠀The⠀stakes⠀of⠀the⠀fantasy⠀world⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀offer⠀each⠀other.⠀They⠀may⠀choose⠀duty⠀over⠀private⠀desire,⠀or⠀find⠀a⠀way⠀to⠀keep⠀both,⠀but⠀the⠀cost⠀should⠀be⠀visible.⠀Use⠀the⠀world's⠀institutions⠀and⠀magic⠀to⠀create⠀friction⠀that⠀is⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀pairing,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀obstacle.⠀The⠀consequence⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀or⠀complicate⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀feel.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀an⠀emotional⠀beat⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀relationship's⠀future⠀open:⠀one⠀character⠀watches⠀the⠀other⠀through⠀a⠀closing⠀door,⠀a⠀hand⠀almost⠀reaches⠀out⠀then⠀withdraws,⠀a⠀question⠀remains⠀unanswered.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀confession⠀in⠀every⠀response.⠀The⠀payoff⠀can⠀be⠀quiet—a⠀return⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀phrase,⠀or⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀waiting⠀in⠀the⠀usual⠀place.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nAdopt⠀the⠀register⠀of⠀an⠀oral⠀chronicle⠀without⠀forcing⠀archaic⠀syntax⠀everywhere.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀identifies⠀the⠀deed⠀or⠀person:⠀\"In⠀the⠀year⠀of⠀the⠀broken⠀gate,⠀Mara⠀of⠀the⠀Seventh⠀House⠀returned⠀to⠀the⠀lake.\"⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀scene.⠀Repeat⠀names⠀and⠀titles⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀account—not⠀as⠀ornamental⠀epithets⠀but⠀as⠀markers⠀of⠀oath,⠀kin,⠀or⠀remembered⠀consequence.⠀The⠀declaration⠀should⠀establish⠀what⠀the⠀account⠀will⠀remember,⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀whole⠀event.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀an⠀act⠀will⠀be⠀remembered.⠀A⠀phrase⠀like⠀\"the⠀candle⠀was⠀not⠀lit⠀that⠀night\"⠀may⠀return⠀later⠀when⠀a⠀different⠀character⠀makes⠀a⠀similar⠀choice.⠀Each⠀recurrence⠀should⠀add⠀information⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀implication.⠀Let⠀public⠀summary⠀alternate⠀with⠀Kawabata-like⠀sensory⠀close-up:⠀after⠀a⠀sentence⠀about⠀a⠀battle's⠀outcome,⠀focus⠀on⠀the⠀still-warm⠀hilt,⠀the⠀dust⠀on⠀a⠀fallen⠀standard,⠀the⠀exact⠀color⠀of⠀the⠀sky⠀through⠀smoke.⠀The⠀close-up⠀should⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀exact,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀selective⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀an⠀omniscient⠀narrator's⠀free⠀access⠀to⠀every⠀object.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀takes⠀a⠀vow⠀or⠀receives⠀a⠀gift,⠀present⠀the⠀public⠀words⠀briefly,⠀then⠀show⠀a⠀private⠀detail⠀that⠀complicates⠀the⠀declaration:⠀the⠀speaker's⠀hand⠀trembling⠀once,⠀a⠀listening⠀child⠀turning⠀away,⠀a⠀spoon⠀left⠀in⠀the⠀cup.⠀The⠀saga⠀voice⠀may⠀observe⠀such⠀details⠀without⠀explaining⠀their⠀full⠀meaning.⠀The⠀teller's⠀access⠀should⠀remain⠀consistent;⠀if⠀the⠀perspective⠀is⠀an⠀oral⠀account⠀passed⠀down,⠀it⠀may⠀include⠀reported⠀private⠀moments⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀source⠀could⠀have⠀known⠀them,⠀or⠀use⠀a⠀formula⠀like⠀\"afterward⠀she⠀said.\"⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀that⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀excludes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀high⠀fantasy⠀world⠀active.⠀Oaths⠀bind⠀through⠀consequences—a⠀broken⠀vow⠀closes⠀a⠀road,⠀a⠀given⠀name⠀changes⠀the⠀behavior⠀of⠀a⠀guardian⠀stone.⠀Show⠀these⠀consequences⠀in⠀the⠀narrative⠀rather⠀than⠀stating⠀them⠀as⠀lore.⠀When⠀magic⠀occurs,⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀remembered⠀event:⠀the⠀chronicle⠀may⠀say⠀\"the⠀frost⠀did⠀not⠀touch⠀her⠀footprints,\"⠀then⠀follow⠀with⠀one⠀precise⠀image⠀of⠀that⠀phenomenon.⠀The⠀consequence⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀account's⠀terms,⠀not⠀in⠀an⠀explanatory⠀aside.\n\nEnd⠀with⠀an⠀opening⠀toward⠀memory:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀note⠀what⠀was⠀not⠀yet⠀known,⠀what⠀later⠀became⠀a⠀saying,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀witnesses⠀disagreed⠀about.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀moral.⠀The⠀final⠀sentence⠀can⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀recurring⠀image⠀or⠀naming⠀phrase⠀with⠀one⠀new⠀variation,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀chapter⠀implicit.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀story⠀as⠀folktale-inflected⠀telling:⠀the⠀extraordinary⠀is⠀narrated⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀plain,⠀matter-of-fact⠀register⠀as⠀the⠀ordinary,⠀so⠀an⠀oath,⠀a⠀relic,⠀or⠀an⠀old⠀grief⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀household's⠀concrete⠀surface⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀separate⠀register⠀of⠀wonders.⠀State⠀the⠀magical⠀thing⠀plainly⠀when⠀it⠀appears⠀and⠀move⠀on;⠀let⠀repetition⠀with⠀small⠀variation—a⠀formula⠀spoken⠀at⠀two⠀different⠀doors,⠀an⠀errand⠀made⠀twice—accumulate⠀weight⠀instead⠀of⠀commentary.\n\nUse⠀Kawabata's⠀selective⠀attention⠀inside⠀that⠀register.⠀Hold⠀one⠀physical⠀impression⠀at⠀a⠀time—the⠀nap⠀of⠀a⠀cloak,⠀the⠀cracked⠀rim⠀of⠀a⠀bowl,⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀counts⠀out⠀coins—and⠀let⠀the⠀relation⠀between⠀successive⠀impressions⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀without⠀explaining⠀every⠀connection.⠀Brief⠀intervals⠀can⠀pass⠀in⠀a⠀sentence;⠀whatever⠀changes⠀inside⠀them⠀should⠀register⠀in⠀a⠀selected⠀material⠀or⠀social⠀detail⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀announced⠀emotion.⠀Snow,⠀silence,⠀isolation,⠀and⠀bleakness⠀are⠀available⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀actual⠀setting⠀and⠀occasion⠀produce⠀them;⠀they⠀are⠀not⠀this⠀mode's⠀required⠀weather.⠀If⠀the⠀community⠀is⠀specifically⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀or⠀Swedish,⠀keep⠀its⠀idiom,⠀customs,⠀and⠀social⠀texture⠀distinct⠀rather⠀than⠀blending⠀a⠀generic⠀North.\n\nKeep⠀high⠀fantasy⠀obligations⠀immediate⠀and⠀costly.⠀A⠀title⠀or⠀lineage⠀enters⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀or⠀must⠀do⠀today:⠀an⠀errand⠀only⠀the⠀oath-bound⠀can⠀run,⠀help⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀accepted,⠀a⠀threshold⠀the⠀relic⠀cannot⠀cross.⠀Magic⠀is⠀a⠀practical⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀world—a⠀working⠀has⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀limit,⠀a⠀residue,⠀a⠀price⠀in⠀ordinary⠀things—even⠀when⠀only⠀one⠀detail⠀of⠀it⠀is⠀shown.⠀Narrate⠀from⠀the⠀authorized⠀focal⠀character;⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀knows,⠀senses,⠀and⠀privately⠀doubts⠀is⠀written⠀as⠀their⠀actual⠀experience⠀and⠀stays⠀unavailable⠀to⠀others⠀unless⠀observed⠀or⠀inferred.\n\nLet⠀the⠀scene⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀present⠀action⠀stops—a⠀departure,⠀a⠀small⠀errand⠀finished⠀or⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀an⠀instruction⠀not⠀yet⠀answered.⠀The⠀larger⠀history⠀remains⠀causally⠀present⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀in⠀small⠀choices;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀a⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀redemptive⠀turn⠀to⠀close.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀scenes:⠀a⠀heading⠀whenever⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀action⠀in⠀concise⠀readable⠀blocks,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀attributed⠀to⠀named⠀speakers.⠀Give⠀each⠀environment⠀one⠀chosen⠀material⠀detail—a⠀relic⠀on⠀its⠀stand,⠀a⠀frayed⠀oath-band⠀at⠀a⠀wrist,⠀low⠀light⠀across⠀a⠀threshold—and⠀let⠀the⠀blocking⠀and⠀business⠀occur⠀around⠀it⠀rather⠀than⠀around⠀a⠀set⠀inventory.⠀When⠀the⠀sequence⠀cuts⠀away⠀and⠀returns,⠀that⠀same⠀detail⠀can⠀re-establish⠀the⠀place⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀line⠀without⠀restating⠀its⠀history.\n\nLet⠀the⠀fantasy's⠀scale⠀appear⠀as⠀staged⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀statement.⠀Where⠀an⠀ancient⠀title⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀scene,⠀it⠀shows⠀in⠀an⠀empty⠀seat,⠀a⠀refused⠀hand,⠀an⠀errand⠀only⠀the⠀oath-bound⠀may⠀run;⠀where⠀a⠀working⠀bears⠀on⠀it,⠀in⠀a⠀surface⠀it⠀has⠀changed,⠀a⠀motion⠀it⠀has⠀stopped,⠀a⠀mark⠀it⠀has⠀left.⠀Limits⠀are⠀visible⠀events—a⠀flame⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀light,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀opens⠀from⠀one⠀side⠀only.⠀Dialogue⠀concerns⠀the⠀practical⠀task⠀at⠀hand;⠀the⠀oath⠀or⠀institution⠀behind⠀it⠀is⠀inferred⠀from⠀what⠀people⠀handle,⠀avoid,⠀and⠀pay.\n\nKeep⠀private⠀experience⠀private.⠀When⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀thought⠀belongs⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀set⠀it⠀apart⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀note⠀marked⠀as⠀that⠀character's⠀unheard⠀interiority—never⠀as⠀speech⠀another⠀character⠀could⠀hear⠀or⠀answer.⠀Use⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀for⠀events⠀that⠀are⠀genuinely⠀offscreen⠀and⠀consequential,⠀and⠀voice-over⠀only⠀where⠀this⠀mind⠀has⠀an⠀established⠀reason⠀to⠀speak⠀over⠀the⠀picture.\n\nCut⠀on⠀consequence,⠀not⠀on⠀completion:⠀a⠀small⠀action⠀finished,⠀a⠀departure⠀begun,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀hanging⠀in⠀the⠀room.⠀Ellipsis⠀between⠀scenes⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀method.⠀The⠀larger⠀obligation⠀stays⠀present⠀through⠀what⠀each⠀scene⠀costs,⠀and⠀no⠀scene⠀needs⠀a⠀revelation,⠀a⠀twist,⠀or⠀a⠀resolved⠀beat⠀to⠀justify⠀ending.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script:⠀named⠀speakers,⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits,⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions,⠀objects⠀a⠀company⠀can⠀handle.⠀Build⠀each⠀scene⠀around⠀one⠀significant⠀prop⠀or⠀piece⠀of⠀business—a⠀cup⠀held⠀too⠀long,⠀an⠀oath-cloth⠀folded⠀wrong,⠀a⠀ring⠀turned⠀once,⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀slowly—and⠀let⠀pauses⠀and⠀emphasis⠀grow⠀out⠀of⠀that⠀handling⠀instead⠀of⠀stopping⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀description.⠀Ordinary⠀objects⠀are⠀the⠀stage⠀surface⠀of⠀the⠀fantasy's⠀history:⠀an⠀inherited⠀knife,⠀a⠀token⠀of⠀allegiance,⠀a⠀mended⠀hinge.⠀The⠀weight⠀of⠀house,⠀oath,⠀or⠀old⠀law⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀carried,⠀refused,⠀set⠀down,⠀or⠀passed.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀and⠀visible⠀action⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀stay⠀shut,⠀a⠀candle⠀that⠀burns⠀without⠀heat,⠀a⠀supply⠀arriving⠀short⠀can⠀stage⠀magic⠀and⠀obligation⠀as⠀practical⠀conditions⠀with⠀visible⠀limits;⠀no⠀lecture⠀is⠀needed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀cast⠀occupied⠀with⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀the⠀moment—counting,⠀mending,⠀waiting,⠀preparing—so⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀business⠀does⠀the⠀indicating.\n\nInner⠀experience⠀stays⠀inner.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀includes⠀private⠀thought,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀marked⠀place,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀the⠀others⠀could⠀hear.⠀A⠀monologue⠀is⠀permitted⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀actually⠀calls⠀for⠀a⠀spoken⠀private⠀address,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀then⠀that⠀character's⠀performed⠀speech,⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀audience⠀and⠀motive—not⠀the⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀realization.⠀Do⠀not⠀represent⠀a⠀state⠀of⠀mind⠀with⠀sound⠀or⠀light;⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀body⠀does.\n\nEnd⠀on⠀action:⠀an⠀exit,⠀an⠀object⠀laid⠀down,⠀an⠀instruction⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀silence⠀after⠀a⠀line.⠀A⠀broken⠀oath⠀or⠀hard⠀choice⠀appears⠀as⠀a⠀completed⠀physical⠀fact—the⠀token⠀returned,⠀the⠀errand⠀abandoned⠀halfway—not⠀as⠀a⠀narrated⠀verdict.⠀The⠀larger⠀history⠀remains⠀onstage⠀as⠀pressure,⠀not⠀prophecy,⠀and⠀no⠀gathering,⠀unmasking,⠀or⠀resolved⠀tableau⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nRender⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀as⠀continuous⠀movement:⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀and⠀interruption⠀braided,⠀with⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀following⠀the⠀associations.⠀Kawabata's⠀selectivity⠀governs⠀what⠀recurs:⠀a⠀small⠀set⠀of⠀concrete⠀images—a⠀threshold,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀ring,⠀a⠀banner's⠀color,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀one⠀room—returns⠀and⠀shifts,⠀each⠀return⠀revising⠀what⠀the⠀image⠀means⠀without⠀restating⠀its⠀history.⠀Keep⠀orientation⠀at⠀every⠀turn:⠀a⠀tense⠀shift,⠀a⠀named⠀place,⠀a⠀sensory⠀anchor⠀tells⠀the⠀reader⠀whether⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀room,⠀a⠀remembered⠀hall,⠀or⠀a⠀rehearsed⠀promise,⠀without⠀breaking⠀the⠀flow⠀to⠀explain.\n\nLet⠀high⠀fantasy⠀obligations⠀enter⠀as⠀intimate⠀mental⠀material⠀rather⠀than⠀background⠀exposition.⠀The⠀oath⠀is⠀a⠀phrase⠀half-remembered⠀and⠀completed⠀wrong;⠀the⠀old⠀penalty⠀is⠀pressure⠀in⠀the⠀chest⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀word;⠀the⠀relic⠀is⠀a⠀texture⠀in⠀the⠀hand⠀when⠀no⠀one⠀watches;⠀the⠀law⠀is⠀a⠀practical⠀fact⠀the⠀mind⠀circles⠀the⠀way⠀it⠀circles⠀weather⠀or⠀debt.⠀Magic⠀can⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀limit⠀the⠀body⠀has⠀learned—a⠀hand⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀pass⠀a⠀certain⠀line,⠀a⠀light⠀that⠀answers⠀one⠀name.⠀Interruptions⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀concern,⠀never⠀from⠀an⠀imposed⠀epiphany.\n\nStay⠀inside⠀the⠀one⠀mind.⠀Other⠀people⠀exist⠀as⠀this⠀person's⠀perceptions,⠀memories,⠀and⠀misreadings;⠀their⠀thoughts⠀are⠀not⠀entered,⠀and⠀the⠀stream⠀does⠀not⠀dissolve⠀into⠀a⠀general⠀mood.⠀Distinguish⠀fear⠀from⠀fact,⠀and⠀present⠀act⠀from⠀recollection,⠀even⠀within⠀the⠀associative⠀movement.\n\nThe⠀stream⠀may⠀stop⠀wherever⠀its⠀attention⠀stops—a⠀held⠀breath,⠀an⠀image⠀returned⠀to⠀once⠀more,⠀an⠀instruction⠀begun⠀and⠀unfinished—without⠀resolving⠀the⠀remembered⠀threat⠀or⠀closing⠀the⠀open⠀decision.⠀The⠀fantasy's⠀stakes⠀persist⠀as⠀the⠀pressure⠀these⠀circulating⠀materials⠀exert⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀small⠀choice;⠀no⠀reply⠀owes⠀a⠀completed⠀reckoning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀on⠀whatever⠀channel⠀this⠀world⠀actually⠀supplies—sending-stone,⠀warded⠀slate,⠀mirrored⠀page,⠀courier⠀thread—and⠀treat⠀that⠀medium's⠀real⠀behaviors⠀as⠀the⠀interface:⠀delivery⠀delay,⠀a⠀sign⠀that⠀the⠀far⠀sender⠀is⠀composing,⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀recalled⠀once⠀sent.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀events⠀that⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer;⠀if⠀the⠀medium⠀has⠀no⠀receipts,⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀their⠀equivalent⠀for⠀subtext.\n\nLet⠀each⠀correspondent's⠀habits⠀characterize⠀them:⠀one⠀sends⠀short⠀fragments⠀between⠀tasks,⠀another⠀composes⠀long⠀and⠀sends⠀rarely,⠀one⠀answers⠀a⠀question⠀two⠀messages⠀late.⠀Timing⠀is⠀feeling.⠀A⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀short⠀reply,⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀at⠀an⠀hour⠀the⠀sender⠀should⠀be⠀elsewhere,⠀a⠀name⠀used⠀where⠀a⠀title⠀was⠀expected⠀carry⠀Kawabata's⠀emotional⠀omission⠀without⠀a⠀narrator⠀decoding⠀them.\n\nLet⠀obligations⠀enter⠀as⠀contractual⠀fact⠀inside⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀fixes⠀where⠀someone⠀may⠀travel,⠀a⠀working⠀that⠀requires⠀a⠀named⠀object,⠀a⠀household⠀rule⠀with⠀an⠀old⠀law⠀behind⠀it.⠀Someone⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀thing,⠀declines⠀to⠀discuss⠀a⠀relic,⠀or⠀states⠀the⠀exact⠀limit⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀in⠀one⠀line;⠀the⠀history⠀appears⠀in⠀that⠀pressure⠀and⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀avoided,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀lore⠀message.⠀Where⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀is⠀needed,⠀give⠀it⠀in⠀brief,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀narration.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀is⠀transmitted⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀not.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀its⠀own⠀composed⠀text,⠀wording⠀the⠀character⠀chose⠀and⠀abandoned;⠀show⠀one⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀reader⠀needs⠀to⠀see⠀what⠀was⠀withheld.⠀The⠀sender's⠀live⠀private⠀experience—attention⠀drifting⠀mid-composition,⠀the⠀impulse⠀behind⠀a⠀revision—stays⠀in⠀the⠀separated⠀narration⠀or⠀wherever⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀places⠀nonspoken⠀experience,⠀never⠀inside⠀a⠀sent⠀message.⠀An⠀exchange⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀message⠀answered,⠀a⠀reply⠀left⠀standing,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀other⠀side⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀seen;⠀no⠀twist⠀or⠀completion⠀is⠀owed.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbaba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene:⠀a⠀concise⠀set-up⠀naming⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀facts,⠀dialogue⠀in⠀clear⠀speaker⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀between⠀exchanges.⠀Choose⠀one⠀cue⠀that⠀actually⠀orients⠀the⠀beat—a⠀particular⠀door,⠀a⠀stain⠀on⠀the⠀floor,⠀a⠀hand⠀resting⠀near⠀a⠀sealed⠀letter—and⠀mention⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀shifts⠀understanding;⠀do⠀not⠀tag⠀lines⠀with⠀expression⠀or⠀background⠀labels⠀as⠀a⠀rule.⠀The⠀cue⠀is⠀a⠀staging⠀reference,⠀not⠀engine⠀code,⠀and⠀no⠀menu,⠀player⠀choice,⠀romance⠀meter,⠀or⠀image⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀style⠀alone.\n\nLet⠀the⠀practical⠀matter⠀occupy⠀the⠀dialogue:⠀an⠀oath⠀to⠀renew,⠀a⠀relic⠀to⠀return,⠀a⠀summons⠀to⠀answer.⠀Obligations⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀narrative⠀passages⠀as⠀material⠀conditions⠀and⠀costs—the⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀promise⠀binds,⠀the⠀mark⠀an⠀old⠀working⠀left,⠀the⠀road⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀taken⠀slowly—and⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀about⠀them.⠀Private⠀response⠀stays⠀with⠀that⠀character:⠀the⠀inner⠀reaction⠀is⠀written⠀as⠀their⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀unknown⠀to⠀others⠀unless⠀observed⠀or⠀inferred,⠀never⠀spread⠀across⠀the⠀cast⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀mood.\n\nLet⠀magic⠀and⠀history⠀enter⠀through⠀arrangement.⠀An⠀object⠀missing⠀from⠀its⠀usual⠀place,⠀a⠀seat⠀rearranged,⠀a⠀hesitation⠀before⠀a⠀threshold⠀can⠀revise⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀means⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀speech;⠀when⠀a⠀chosen⠀cue⠀returns⠀later,⠀its⠀new⠀context⠀gives⠀it⠀weight⠀instead⠀of⠀repeating⠀the⠀first⠀suspicion.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible,⠀using⠀only⠀the⠀transitions⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs.\n\nA⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀small⠀action,⠀a⠀held⠀pause,⠀or⠀a⠀request⠀still⠀unanswered.⠀The⠀larger⠀plot⠀stays⠀active⠀through⠀what⠀each⠀beat⠀changes⠀or⠀costs;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀decision⠀point,⠀a⠀reveal,⠀or⠀a⠀resolved⠀route.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPahbabb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀High⠀Fantasy⠀/⠀Yasunari⠀Kawabata⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀in⠀installments⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line.⠀At⠀the⠀top⠀of⠀each⠀reply,⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀particular⠀that⠀will⠀matter⠀now—the⠀errand⠀already⠀begun,⠀the⠀last⠀change⠀in⠀an⠀oath⠀or⠀object,⠀the⠀person⠀still⠀awaited—and⠀re-anchor⠀it⠀in⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀details:⠀the⠀seal⠀that⠀was⠀intact,⠀the⠀bowl⠀set⠀aside,⠀the⠀road⠀newly⠀barred,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀room.⠀A⠀selected⠀detail⠀carries⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀earlier⠀installments⠀without⠀recap;⠀do⠀not⠀retell⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀already⠀followed.\n\nLet⠀obligations⠀develop⠀through⠀earned⠀local⠀change⠀rather⠀than⠀rising⠀exposition.⠀The⠀institution⠀is⠀felt⠀in⠀a⠀delayed⠀supply,⠀a⠀refused⠀entry,⠀a⠀person⠀now⠀bound;⠀the⠀history⠀matters⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀someone⠀may⠀do⠀today.⠀Magic⠀is⠀a⠀practical⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀installment—the⠀working⠀has⠀a⠀limit,⠀requires⠀an⠀object,⠀leaves⠀a⠀residue,⠀alters⠀one⠀ordinary⠀task—and⠀its⠀cost⠀shows⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀choice.⠀Progress⠀can⠀be⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources;⠀no⠀ranking,⠀leveling,⠀or⠀progression⠀system⠀appears⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀itself⠀runs⠀on⠀one.\n\nLet⠀a⠀reply⠀dwell⠀where⠀the⠀meaning⠀is—a⠀small⠀exchange,⠀a⠀walk,⠀a⠀wait—before⠀moving⠀on.⠀Hooks⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀material:⠀a⠀fact⠀that⠀reframes⠀the⠀next⠀task,⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment,⠀work⠀plainly⠀finished.⠀They⠀are⠀not⠀owed⠀at⠀every⠀turn,⠀and⠀neither⠀is⠀a⠀cliffhanger.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀provides,⠀appearing⠀when⠀it⠀illuminates⠀the⠀continuing⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀required⠀beat.⠀When⠀a⠀detail⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀installment⠀returns,⠀let⠀its⠀new⠀use⠀deepen⠀the⠀present⠀concern⠀instead⠀of⠀restating⠀the⠀old⠀one.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀installment's⠀attention⠀ends—an⠀action⠀done,⠀a⠀reply⠀awaited,⠀a⠀door⠀newly⠀open—so⠀the⠀thread⠀can⠀be⠀taken⠀up⠀again.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
