            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-historical_fiction-03",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Historical Fiction · 03/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == historical_fiction}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Historical Fiction. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 3 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-historical_fiction; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaiaiap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBegin⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀a⠀small,⠀exact⠀historical⠀detail:⠀a⠀sign⠀repainted⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀proprietor,⠀a⠀wall⠀mended⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀stone,⠀a⠀road⠀the⠀carts⠀no⠀longer⠀take,⠀a⠀family⠀name⠀the⠀clerks⠀now⠀spell⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀it⠀and⠀pass⠀into⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀business⠀—⠀the⠀purchase,⠀the⠀errand,⠀the⠀conversation⠀waiting⠀to⠀happen.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarative⠀movement⠀to⠀hold⠀present⠀and⠀past⠀apart.⠀One⠀short⠀sentence⠀states⠀what⠀is;⠀the⠀next⠀admits,⠀without⠀elaboration,⠀what⠀used⠀to⠀be.⠀Let⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀them⠀do⠀the⠀reflecting.⠀Direct⠀meditation⠀is⠀allowed,⠀but⠀keep⠀it⠀brief⠀and⠀attached⠀to⠀this⠀narrator's⠀particular⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀time⠀in⠀general,⠀and⠀let⠀memory⠀return⠀through⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀sound⠀already⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀—⠀the⠀wrong⠀bell,⠀the⠀mended⠀tool's⠀changed⠀weight⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀disembodied⠀reflection.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀stay⠀ordinary.⠀A⠀warm⠀room,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀well⠀can⠀be⠀fully⠀present⠀and⠀fully⠀enjoyed⠀without⠀being⠀undercut.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀specific⠀attachments⠀this⠀narrator⠀carries,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀are⠀free⠀not⠀to⠀share⠀it;⠀the⠀clerk⠀mispronouncing⠀the⠀name⠀notices⠀nothing.⠀The⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀only⠀what⠀their⠀own⠀years⠀and⠀position⠀allowed⠀them⠀to⠀witness,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀never⠀learned⠀stays⠀unknown.\n\nLet⠀the⠀detail's⠀full⠀meaning⠀take⠀its⠀time⠀surfacing.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀speak,⠀bargain,⠀work,⠀and⠀answer⠀before⠀it⠀arrives.⠀When⠀it⠀does,⠀state⠀the⠀recognition⠀in⠀one⠀plain⠀sentence⠀—⠀that⠀this⠀present⠀thing⠀is⠀the⠀trace⠀of⠀something⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀—⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀stand⠀there.⠀The⠀practical⠀scene⠀can⠀continue⠀afterward;⠀end⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀recognition⠀lands,⠀mid-errand⠀if⠀that⠀is⠀where⠀it⠀falls.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀this⠀one⠀as⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀telling.⠀Give⠀the⠀tale⠀a⠀teller,⠀an⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀occasion⠀that⠀permits⠀it:⠀an⠀evening's⠀pause⠀in⠀a⠀caravan,⠀work⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀hands⠀free,⠀a⠀request⠀the⠀teller's⠀position⠀entitles⠀them⠀to⠀answer⠀or⠀refuse.⠀Let⠀that⠀standing⠀and⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀decide⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀know,⠀claim,⠀or⠀safely⠀leave⠀unsaid.⠀Build⠀the⠀frame⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀setting,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀of⠀the⠀scenario⠀—⠀a⠀teller⠀in⠀a⠀Persian⠀milieu⠀does⠀not⠀acquire⠀frame⠀conventions⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀never⠀granted,⠀and⠀no⠀one⠀acquires⠀a⠀generic⠀antiquity,⠀a⠀mystic's⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀honor⠀code⠀the⠀scene⠀did⠀not⠀establish.\n\nLet⠀the⠀inner⠀tale⠀move⠀in⠀brief⠀declarative⠀beats.⠀The⠀teller⠀states⠀actions⠀and⠀images⠀compactly⠀—⠀who⠀came⠀to⠀the⠀door,⠀what⠀was⠀asked,⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀—⠀and⠀stops⠀where⠀a⠀listener⠀would⠀expect⠀the⠀explanation.⠀Those⠀gaps⠀are⠀the⠀teller's⠀choices,⠀bounded⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀witnessed,⠀heard,⠀or⠀dares⠀to⠀say.⠀A⠀single⠀distilled⠀image⠀may⠀return⠀twice⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀its⠀meaning⠀changed⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀finally⠀supplies⠀the⠀piece⠀that⠀was⠀withheld.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀break⠀in⠀at⠀a⠀meaningful⠀joint.⠀A⠀listener⠀questions⠀a⠀detail,⠀offers⠀the⠀version⠀heard⠀in⠀another⠀household,⠀or⠀presses⠀on⠀the⠀name⠀the⠀teller⠀avoided;⠀the⠀teller⠀answers,⠀deflects,⠀or⠀goes⠀quiet,⠀and⠀each⠀interruption⠀shows⠀something⠀about⠀the⠀audience's⠀world⠀or⠀the⠀teller's⠀standing⠀in⠀it.⠀The⠀teller's⠀own⠀stake⠀can⠀surface⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀—⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀hand⠀stopped⠀mid-gesture⠀—⠀without⠀ever⠀being⠀confessed.\n\nThe⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀may⠀land⠀inside⠀the⠀tale,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀as⠀the⠀sentence⠀the⠀teller⠀declines⠀to⠀finish.⠀Whichever⠀arrives,⠀it⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀stillness⠀that⠀preceded⠀it.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀there,⠀even⠀with⠀the⠀audience⠀still⠀waiting,⠀the⠀evening⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀most⠀of⠀the⠀tale⠀untold.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nWork⠀from⠀a⠀short⠀list⠀of⠀exact⠀period⠀details:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀key⠀on⠀its⠀ring,⠀the⠀color⠀of⠀the⠀seal⠀wax,⠀the⠀posted⠀price⠀of⠀passage,⠀the⠀bar⠀across⠀the⠀door⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀lift⠀it.⠀Choose⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀social⠀or⠀material⠀implication,⠀so⠀that⠀each⠀one⠀quietly⠀states⠀who⠀has⠀access,⠀who⠀owes,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀kept⠀out.⠀When⠀one⠀detail⠀already⠀makes⠀the⠀situation⠀inferable,⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀to⠀underline⠀it.\n\nMove⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses,⠀and⠀let⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action⠀carry⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀commentary.⠀When⠀an⠀inward⠀connection⠀genuinely⠀matters,⠀state⠀it⠀once⠀and⠀give⠀the⠀sentence⠀room⠀to⠀make⠀sense;⠀one⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀serves⠀the⠀style⠀better⠀than⠀three⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀Never⠀delete⠀causality:⠀if⠀a⠀character⠀acts,⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀infer⠀why⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀already⠀on⠀the⠀page.\n\nLet⠀the⠀meaningful⠀gap⠀be⠀the⠀structure.⠀Leave⠀out⠀the⠀sentence⠀that⠀would⠀connect⠀two⠀stated⠀facts,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀detail⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀close⠀the⠀gap⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀side.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀should⠀re-see⠀something⠀already⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀deliver⠀new⠀information⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator's⠀inward⠀life⠀touches⠀the⠀gap,⠀one⠀line⠀of⠀unspoken⠀reasoning⠀or⠀attention⠀is⠀enough⠀to⠀carry⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀cast's⠀voices⠀individual:⠀the⠀clerk,⠀the⠀carrier,⠀and⠀the⠀sister⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀one⠀clipped⠀register.⠀Where⠀the⠀source⠀does⠀not⠀specify⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀could⠀know,⠀do⠀not⠀silently⠀grant⠀the⠀knowledge;⠀uncertainty⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀period's⠀accuracy.⠀Stop⠀when⠀the⠀revelation⠀has⠀landed,⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀sentence⠀that⠀explains⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀meant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaias::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀whatever⠀inner⠀experience⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀authorizes⠀for⠀the⠀viewpoint.⠀Bring⠀the⠀period⠀in⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀background⠀lectures:⠀someone⠀waits⠀because⠀the⠀post⠀is⠀slow,⠀haggles⠀because⠀the⠀market⠀sets⠀the⠀price,⠀uses⠀the⠀side⠀door⠀because⠀rank⠀decides⠀who⠀enters⠀at⠀the⠀front.⠀The⠀register⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene;⠀a⠀historical⠀setting⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀archaic⠀diction.\n\nUse⠀the⠀compact⠀declarative⠀as⠀a⠀rhythmic⠀event⠀inside⠀the⠀continuous⠀narration.⠀After⠀a⠀passage⠀of⠀flexible⠀movement,⠀drop⠀to⠀one⠀short⠀sentence⠀that⠀states⠀a⠀fact⠀or⠀perception⠀without⠀commentary,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀on⠀or⠀the⠀dialogue⠀resume⠀while⠀the⠀unstated⠀implication⠀sits⠀with⠀the⠀reader.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀works⠀the⠀same⠀way:⠀a⠀brief⠀sentence⠀arriving⠀later⠀that⠀re-keys⠀something⠀already⠀shown,⠀never⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀explanation.\n\nLet⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀uncertainty.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀reason⠀about⠀what⠀an⠀expression⠀meant,⠀remember⠀the⠀last⠀time⠀this⠀room⠀was⠀full,⠀or⠀register⠀a⠀sensation⠀without⠀announcing⠀its⠀importance.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀aloud⠀can⠀carry⠀as⠀much⠀weight⠀as⠀what⠀they⠀say,⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀stays⠀inside⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀where⠀the⠀other⠀characters⠀cannot⠀reach⠀it.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀A⠀new⠀paragraph⠀can⠀mark⠀a⠀shift⠀of⠀attention⠀or⠀a⠀lapse⠀of⠀hours⠀without⠀summarizing⠀what⠀the⠀reader⠀already⠀knows.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀delayed⠀sentence⠀has⠀landed,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀scene's⠀business⠀—⠀the⠀transaction,⠀the⠀visit,⠀the⠀unfinished⠀argument⠀—⠀is⠀still⠀in⠀progress.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀you⠀choose.⠀Take⠀the⠀moment⠀that⠀lets⠀this⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀show⠀itself:⠀a⠀private⠀exchange⠀before⠀a⠀public⠀day,⠀a⠀task⠀the⠀two⠀have⠀done⠀together⠀a⠀hundred⠀times,⠀an⠀occasion⠀where⠀they⠀must⠀manage⠀what⠀other⠀people⠀are⠀permitted⠀to⠀see.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀social⠀position⠀decide⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀aloud,⠀risked,⠀or⠀offered,⠀and⠀treat⠀that⠀constraint⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀engine⠀rather⠀than⠀its⠀decoration.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀to⠀fill⠀the⠀space.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀emotional⠀weight⠀in⠀compact⠀exchanges⠀and⠀legible⠀silences.⠀One⠀short⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀a⠀paragraph⠀of⠀explanation,⠀and⠀a⠀silence⠀read⠀against⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀established⠀can⠀do⠀more.⠀Build⠀private⠀language⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀relationship's⠀own⠀history⠀—⠀the⠀phrase⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀always⠀says⠀wrong⠀on⠀purpose,⠀the⠀errand⠀that⠀has⠀come⠀to⠀mean⠀something⠀else⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀out⠀of⠀generic⠀endearments.⠀Where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀allows⠀inner⠀experience,⠀let⠀each⠀one's⠀unspoken⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀moment⠀exist⠀alongside⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀said.\n\nGive⠀the⠀beat⠀that⠀matters⠀its⠀space.⠀Whichever⠀of⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀this⠀premise⠀promises,⠀do⠀not⠀rush⠀past⠀it⠀toward⠀resolution.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀constraints⠀supply⠀the⠀pressure:⠀the⠀letter⠀two⠀weeks⠀in⠀transit,⠀the⠀meeting⠀interrupted⠀by⠀duty,⠀the⠀gesture⠀impossible⠀with⠀a⠀houseful⠀of⠀watchers.⠀The⠀consequence⠀should⠀fulfill⠀this⠀relationship's⠀specific⠀promise,⠀not⠀a⠀universal⠀expectation⠀about⠀how⠀such⠀scenes⠀end.\n\nHold⠀the⠀stillness⠀before⠀the⠀turn.⠀The⠀revelation⠀may⠀be⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀finally⠀naming⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀has⠀been⠀waiting⠀to⠀hear,⠀or⠀recognizing⠀a⠀repeated⠀detail⠀for⠀what⠀it⠀has⠀meant⠀all⠀along;⠀state⠀it⠀briefly⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀quiet⠀hold⠀around⠀it.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀lands,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀—⠀the⠀reply⠀unwritten,⠀the⠀arrangement⠀unspoken,⠀the⠀journey⠀not⠀yet⠀taken⠀—⠀stays⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀already⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀deliberately⠀—⠀name⠀the⠀occasion,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀this⠀telling⠀exists⠀to⠀remember⠀—⠀and⠀establish⠀the⠀record⠀in⠀compact⠀declarations:⠀the⠀deed,⠀the⠀kinship⠀tie,⠀the⠀journey's⠀route,⠀the⠀gift⠀given,⠀the⠀grudge⠀carried.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀decide⠀which⠀acts⠀are⠀worth⠀recording⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀entitled⠀to⠀tell⠀them.⠀Keep⠀the⠀source⠀tradition⠀coherent;⠀no⠀imported⠀pantheon,⠀and⠀no⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀issued⠀to⠀speakers⠀whose⠀world⠀never⠀used⠀it.\n\nRecur⠀with⠀restraint.⠀A⠀designation⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀an⠀established⠀deed⠀or⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀assigned⠀as⠀ornament⠀at⠀every⠀entrance.⠀Return⠀to⠀a⠀phrase⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application.⠀State⠀what⠀an⠀act⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀for⠀in⠀one⠀brief⠀line,⠀then⠀complicate⠀the⠀reputation⠀only⠀with⠀particulars⠀—⠀the⠀witness⠀who⠀saw⠀it⠀differently,⠀the⠀cost⠀the⠀account⠀leaves⠀out.\n\nLet⠀the⠀meaningful⠀gap⠀structure⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀Omit⠀the⠀motive,⠀the⠀witness,⠀or⠀the⠀immediate⠀consequence⠀of⠀a⠀recorded⠀deed,⠀and⠀leave⠀that⠀stillness⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀to⠀disturb.⠀The⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀is⠀the⠀moment⠀an⠀earlier⠀act⠀turns⠀out⠀to⠀have⠀carried⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀telling⠀had⠀not⠀yet⠀supplied;⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀person⠀rather⠀than⠀appending⠀another⠀event.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀privately⠀knows⠀of⠀the⠀deed⠀can⠀sit⠀beneath⠀the⠀public⠀account,⠀held⠀in⠀how⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀passed⠀over,⠀without⠀being⠀declared.⠀What⠀the⠀chronicle⠀has⠀no⠀way⠀to⠀know⠀stays⠀a⠀gap;⠀the⠀telling⠀does⠀not⠀become⠀omniscient.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀revelation⠀has⠀changed⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀the⠀deed,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀larger⠀story,⠀the⠀feud⠀unresolved⠀or⠀the⠀journey⠀unfinished,⠀continues⠀beyond⠀the⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route⠀of⠀Scandinavian⠀literary⠀traditions:⠀a⠀particular⠀household⠀or⠀workplace⠀observed⠀from⠀within⠀its⠀practical⠀obligations.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀enter⠀through⠀the⠀social⠀texture⠀they⠀create—authority,⠀dependence,⠀consent,⠀shame,⠀expectation,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀speaking—not⠀through⠀explained⠀record⠀types.⠀A⠀scene⠀is⠀built⠀from⠀what⠀someone⠀must⠀do⠀next:⠀ready⠀the⠀room,⠀receive⠀a⠀visitor,⠀handle⠀a⠀payment,⠀carry⠀a⠀message,⠀respond⠀to⠀a⠀silence⠀at⠀the⠀table.\n\nWrite⠀in⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀brief⠀declarative⠀movement.⠀Keep⠀narration⠀close⠀and⠀economical:⠀a⠀distilled⠀image⠀of⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀doorway,⠀a⠀coat⠀hung⠀in⠀the⠀wrong⠀place.⠀What⠀a⠀person⠀notices⠀or⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀carries⠀uncertainty.⠀A⠀short⠀sentence⠀may⠀register⠀that⠀a⠀chair⠀has⠀been⠀moved⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀greeting⠀came⠀late;⠀do⠀not⠀announce⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀Other⠀characters⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀and⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀practical⠀interpretation,⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀notice⠀it⠀at⠀all.\n\nLet⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀social⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀document⠀suddenly⠀found.⠀An⠀earlier⠀scene⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀tenant's⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀wife's⠀incomplete⠀answer,⠀a⠀servant's⠀careful⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀host⠀performing⠀welcome⠀too⠀punctually.⠀Later,⠀a⠀new⠀exchange⠀makes⠀that⠀earlier⠀behavior⠀readable:⠀an⠀obligation⠀is⠀revealed,⠀an⠀apology⠀becomes⠀recognizable,⠀an⠀absence⠀becomes⠀intelligible,⠀a⠀kindness⠀is⠀shown⠀to⠀have⠀had⠀a⠀hidden⠀cost.⠀The⠀scene⠀changes⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀enacted⠀between⠀people.⠀History⠀supplies⠀the⠀structural⠀cause—legal⠀position,⠀economic⠀dependence,⠀family⠀authority,⠀the⠀limits⠀of⠀communication—while⠀the⠀revelation⠀remains⠀an⠀intimate,⠀interpersonal⠀turn.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀eye⠀calibrated⠀to⠀position.⠀What⠀a⠀servant⠀sees⠀of⠀the⠀family⠀is⠀different⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀family⠀knows⠀of⠀the⠀servant;⠀a⠀clerk's⠀claim⠀to⠀hear⠀something⠀differs⠀from⠀a⠀spouse's.⠀Let⠀rank⠀affect⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀said,⠀asked,⠀admitted,⠀or⠀refused⠀within⠀a⠀conversation,⠀and⠀let⠀work⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀accumulating⠀unease.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀this⠀into⠀a⠀catalogue⠀of⠀customs⠀or⠀a⠀thesis⠀about⠀a⠀national⠀temperament;⠀keep⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀place⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀supplied.\n\nInward⠀experience⠀remains⠀ordinary⠀private⠀prose⠀inside⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀rehearse⠀addressing⠀the⠀householder,⠀feel⠀the⠀embarrassment⠀of⠀a⠀delayed⠀wage,⠀reason⠀about⠀whether⠀a⠀kindness⠀is⠀charity⠀or⠀obligation,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀has⠀become⠀unsafe.⠀Private⠀and⠀spoken⠀content⠀may⠀differ⠀because⠀of⠀dependence,⠀loyalty,⠀fear,⠀courtesy,⠀or⠀simple⠀social⠀consequence.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀the⠀thought.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀household⠀task⠀completed,⠀a⠀word⠀withheld,⠀a⠀guest⠀received,⠀or⠀the⠀quiet⠀cost⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀now⠀been⠀understood.⠀No⠀confession⠀or⠀completed⠀confrontation⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀screen⠀can⠀capture⠀it:⠀concise⠀blocks⠀of⠀visible⠀action,⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues,⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Keep⠀description⠀to⠀what⠀a⠀viewer⠀could⠀see⠀or⠀hear.⠀A⠀task⠀underway,⠀a⠀hand⠀stilled,⠀a⠀glance⠀directed⠀toward⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀door⠀left⠀standing⠀open—these⠀are⠀complete⠀units⠀of⠀information.⠀They⠀are⠀not⠀primers⠀for⠀period⠀authenticity;⠀their⠀historical⠀weight⠀appears⠀through⠀who⠀may⠀perform⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀them.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀declarative⠀compression⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line.⠀Short⠀sentences.⠀One⠀movement⠀per⠀beat.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀look,⠀a⠀step⠀back⠀from⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀drink⠀not⠀taken.⠀The⠀line⠀records⠀the⠀fact⠀without⠀translating⠀it.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀another's⠀hesitation⠀and⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀business⠀at⠀hand⠀instead;⠀the⠀response⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀interpretation.⠀What⠀a⠀character⠀declines⠀to⠀say⠀remains⠀audible⠀as⠀speech⠀that⠀turns⠀away,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀described⠀hidden⠀emotion.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀and⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀silence.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀statement⠀was⠀made⠀to⠀the⠀corridor⠀outside,⠀where⠀the⠀statement's⠀social⠀consequence⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀someone⠀else's⠀task;⠀the⠀missing⠀middle⠀is⠀the⠀gap.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀may⠀carry⠀work⠀continuing⠀in⠀another⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀house,⠀a⠀door,⠀a⠀voice,⠀a⠀cart⠀on⠀a⠀road,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀world⠀presses⠀against⠀the⠀immediate⠀conversation⠀without⠀being⠀explained.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀voice-over⠀to⠀supply⠀what⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀withholds.\n\nDelay⠀revelation⠀by⠀staging⠀a⠀later⠀image⠀that⠀revalues⠀an⠀earlier⠀one.⠀An⠀object⠀present⠀in⠀an⠀opening⠀scene⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀pair⠀of⠀hands.⠀A⠀door⠀that⠀was⠀left⠀open⠀is⠀now⠀closed⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀social⠀permission⠀someone⠀received.⠀A⠀letter⠀shown⠀but⠀not⠀handed⠀over⠀appears⠀later⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀table,⠀moved.⠀The⠀later⠀image⠀does⠀not⠀announce⠀its⠀meaning;⠀it⠀allows⠀the⠀attentive⠀viewer⠀to⠀see⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀silence⠀had⠀content.⠀Let⠀the⠀revelation⠀arise⠀from⠀visible⠀arrangement⠀and⠀movement⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀dialogue⠀that⠀retroactively⠀explains.\n\nThis⠀is⠀a⠀historical⠀world,⠀so⠀the⠀blockable,⠀enterable,⠀and⠀hearable⠀space⠀is⠀structured⠀by⠀social⠀position.⠀A⠀servant⠀may⠀be⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀but⠀not⠀at⠀the⠀table;⠀a⠀clerk⠀may⠀touch⠀the⠀ledger⠀but⠀not⠀remove⠀it;⠀a⠀wife⠀may⠀direct⠀a⠀servant⠀in⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀would⠀be⠀insolence⠀from⠀anyone⠀else.⠀Stage⠀the⠀scene⠀so⠀these⠀positions⠀are⠀physically⠀present⠀and⠀govern⠀who⠀crosses⠀a⠀threshold⠀or⠀handles⠀an⠀object.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀task⠀completed,⠀a⠀door⠀closed,⠀a⠀person⠀left⠀visible⠀through⠀a⠀doorway,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀stops⠀before⠀its⠀full⠀implication.⠀No⠀confession⠀or⠀completed⠀revelation⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nBuild⠀the⠀playable⠀scene⠀from⠀legitimate⠀movement⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀space.⠀Entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀are⠀social⠀facts,⠀not⠀merely⠀stage⠀business:⠀a⠀servant⠀comes⠀to⠀tend⠀the⠀fire⠀and⠀leaves⠀whether⠀or⠀not⠀the⠀conversation⠀has⠀found⠀its⠀natural⠀end;⠀a⠀wife⠀may⠀enter⠀while⠀the⠀clerk⠀is⠀reading;⠀a⠀tenant⠀waits⠀at⠀the⠀door⠀until⠀asked⠀inside.⠀The⠀period⠀authority⠀that⠀permits⠀or⠀forbids⠀these⠀movements⠀shapes⠀the⠀blocking⠀before⠀it⠀ever⠀has⠀to⠀be⠀spoken.\n\nKeep⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀dialogic⠀economy.⠀Lines⠀are⠀short,⠀declarative,⠀and⠀often⠀about⠀the⠀immediate⠀physical⠀business.⠀A⠀character⠀asks⠀for⠀a⠀lamp,⠀tells⠀someone⠀the⠀mud⠀is⠀wet,⠀mentions⠀that⠀the⠀child⠀has⠀gone⠀to⠀bed,⠀or⠀lets⠀a⠀silence⠀stand⠀instead⠀of⠀answering.⠀The⠀staged⠀pause⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀labeled⠀motive.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀break⠀it,⠀observe⠀it,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀task⠀through⠀it.⠀The⠀speaker's⠀refusal⠀to⠀complete⠀a⠀sentence⠀is⠀a⠀visible⠀event⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀an⠀explanatory⠀aside.\n\nUse⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀this⠀is⠀live⠀theater:⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀where⠀each⠀character⠀is,⠀but⠀each⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀know⠀what⠀every⠀other⠀character⠀sees.⠀Make⠀the⠀space⠀testable.⠀An⠀entrance⠀through⠀the⠀wrong⠀door,⠀a⠀drawer⠀that⠀opens⠀too⠀easily,⠀a⠀person⠀standing⠀within⠀hearing⠀of⠀the⠀table,⠀a⠀load⠀of⠀fuel⠀brought⠀at⠀an⠀unusual⠀hour—stage⠀these⠀plainly.⠀They⠀become⠀meaningful⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀movement⠀shows⠀that⠀someone⠀knew⠀or⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀where⠀another⠀person⠀stood.\n\nLet⠀ingress⠀and⠀egress⠀carry⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation.⠀The⠀play⠀may⠀first⠀show⠀a⠀woman⠀leaving⠀the⠀room⠀before⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money⠀is⠀mentioned.⠀Later⠀she⠀re-enters⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment⠀with⠀clean⠀linen,⠀and⠀the⠀audience⠀understands⠀that⠀she⠀was⠀never⠀absent,⠀only⠀outside⠀the⠀door.⠀Or:⠀a⠀clerk⠀steps⠀out⠀as⠀the⠀master⠀begins⠀to⠀speak,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀line⠀shows⠀the⠀clerk⠀had⠀come⠀back⠀for⠀a⠀forgotten⠀glove.⠀These⠀are⠀workable⠀stage⠀facts.⠀The⠀shrinking⠀interval⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀understands⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀admit⠀becomes⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀the⠀scene's⠀pressure.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀this⠀into⠀a⠀farcical⠀pattern⠀or⠀a⠀trick;⠀use⠀it⠀when⠀it⠀deepens⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀traffic.\n\nRequired⠀private⠀experience⠀remains⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀separated⠀from⠀audible⠀speech.⠀It⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀thinks⠀or⠀feels⠀while⠀the⠀staged⠀scene⠀continues,⠀and⠀no⠀other⠀character⠀hears⠀it.⠀Reserve⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀for⠀the⠀few⠀moments⠀when⠀their⠀performance⠀function⠀is⠀stronger⠀than⠀the⠀surrounding⠀social⠀scene;⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀them⠀to⠀dump⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀into⠀the⠀audience.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀task⠀half-finished⠀at⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀person⠀left⠀waiting⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀answered⠀with⠀silence.⠀No⠀confrontation⠀or⠀completed⠀revelation⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀one⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind⠀govern⠀the⠀page.⠀Its⠀perceptions⠀arrive⠀irregularly⠀and⠀without⠀a⠀case⠀report's⠀order:⠀the⠀gray⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀dishcloth,⠀the⠀residue⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀staircase,⠀words⠀half-formed⠀in⠀the⠀voice⠀of⠀a⠀parent⠀or⠀employer,⠀a⠀pain⠀in⠀the⠀hand.⠀Syntax⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀mind's⠀momentum,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀present⠀room,⠀a⠀remembered⠀room,⠀and⠀a⠀feared⠀room.⠀The⠀distinction⠀can⠀be⠀anchored⠀by⠀physical⠀markers:⠀a⠀current⠀task,⠀a⠀body⠀in⠀motion,⠀a⠀repeated⠀sound.\n\nSet⠀the⠀mind's⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀historical⠀world.⠀Its⠀associations⠀should⠀be⠀saturated⠀with⠀social⠀structure:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀one⠀is⠀not⠀allowed⠀to⠀open,⠀the⠀timbre⠀of⠀a⠀voice⠀from⠀outside⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀phrase⠀a⠀mistress⠀uses⠀only⠀when⠀she⠀speaks⠀to⠀a⠀servant,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀wax⠀and⠀not-quite-dry⠀plaster,⠀the⠀delayed⠀wage⠀imagined⠀in⠀coin.⠀These⠀are⠀not⠀background⠀color;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀nodes⠀among⠀which⠀the⠀mind⠀moves.⠀Let⠀world⠀facts⠀such⠀as⠀mail,⠀work,⠀rank,⠀and⠀distance⠀constrain⠀what⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀mind⠀at⠀all.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀short⠀declarative⠀bursts⠀inside⠀the⠀stream.⠀A⠀line⠀may⠀carry⠀only⠀one⠀perception⠀or⠀one⠀turn⠀of⠀association.⠀The⠀movement⠀may⠀include⠀prolonged⠀suspension⠀and⠀a⠀sudden⠀snapping⠀of⠀connection.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀paragraph-long⠀explanation⠀of⠀each⠀image.⠀The⠀style's⠀unity⠀comes⠀from⠀return:⠀a⠀particular⠀sensory⠀node—a⠀knot⠀of⠀old⠀rope,⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀man's⠀shoulders⠀under⠀a⠀wet⠀coat—may⠀run⠀through⠀different⠀levels⠀of⠀thought,⠀discarded,⠀then⠀encountered⠀again⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀state.\n\nLet⠀the⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀arise⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀mind's⠀connection⠀to⠀something⠀already⠀sedimented.⠀A⠀smell⠀remembered⠀from⠀early⠀morning⠀now⠀attaches⠀to⠀a⠀name.⠀A⠀phrase⠀the⠀character⠀repeated⠀without⠀attending⠀suddenly⠀shows⠀an⠀obligation.⠀The⠀mind⠀has⠀carried⠀the⠀detail⠀across⠀many⠀lines,⠀and⠀a⠀later⠀association⠀makes⠀the⠀earlier⠀one⠀submit⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀significance.⠀Do⠀not⠀mount⠀this⠀as⠀the⠀climax⠀of⠀an⠀investigation;⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀arrival,⠀possibly⠀brief,⠀possibly⠀immediately⠀threatened⠀by⠀practical⠀interruption.⠀The⠀thought⠀may⠀arrive⠀while⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀scrubbing,⠀walking,⠀dressing,⠀or⠀serving;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀pushed⠀away⠀and⠀return.⠀The⠀story⠀need⠀not⠀pause⠀into⠀an⠀epiphany,⠀and⠀the⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀connection⠀at⠀once.\n\nKeep⠀knowledge⠀and⠀access⠀consistent.⠀A⠀mind⠀under⠀a⠀low⠀roof⠀cannot⠀think⠀the⠀records⠀kept⠀in⠀another⠀house⠀except⠀through⠀hearsay,⠀cost,⠀and⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀authority⠀that⠀holds⠀them.⠀A⠀mind⠀planning⠀a⠀letter⠀can⠀imagine⠀the⠀recipient's⠀face⠀but⠀cannot⠀know⠀the⠀recipient's⠀reply.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀opaque⠀except⠀as⠀they⠀reach⠀this⠀mind⠀through⠀perception⠀and⠀recollection.⠀No⠀person's⠀interiority⠀is⠀reached⠀without⠀authorization.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀an⠀unfinished⠀association,⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀released⠀into⠀sleep⠀or⠀work,⠀or⠀with⠀the⠀quiet⠀fact⠀that⠀a⠀connection⠀has⠀now⠀formed⠀without⠀yet⠀changing⠀anything⠀visible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀readable,⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀For⠀a⠀historical⠀world⠀these⠀messages⠀are⠀the⠀forms⠀through⠀which⠀written⠀transmission⠀actually⠀occurred:⠀a⠀letter⠀passed⠀to⠀a⠀carrier,⠀a⠀note⠀folded⠀and⠀delivered,⠀a⠀few⠀lines⠀entered⠀into⠀a⠀journal⠀over⠀a⠀signature,⠀a⠀copy⠀of⠀an⠀order,⠀a⠀reply⠀dictated⠀through⠀another⠀person.⠀Each⠀message⠀passes⠀through⠀a⠀real⠀sender⠀and⠀a⠀real⠀channel;⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀world⠀permits⠀speed⠀and⠀distribution,⠀the⠀transcript⠀reflects⠀that.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀screens,⠀handles,⠀or⠀modern⠀delivery⠀mechanics⠀unless⠀the⠀scenario's⠀history⠀explicitly⠀includes⠀them.\n\nLet⠀each⠀sender's⠀social⠀position⠀shape⠀the⠀message.⠀A⠀person⠀writes⠀to⠀a⠀superior⠀in⠀one⠀register⠀and⠀to⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀in⠀another.⠀A⠀person⠀who⠀cannot⠀write⠀may⠀send⠀a⠀dictated⠀message,⠀mark⠀a⠀paper,⠀or⠀rely⠀on⠀a⠀messenger⠀whose⠀memory⠀becomes⠀a⠀variable.⠀These⠀are⠀not⠀merely⠀interesting⠀details;⠀they⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀transcript⠀itself⠀carries⠀and⠀withholds.⠀Keep⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀economy⠀inside⠀the⠀message⠀forms:⠀some⠀messages⠀are⠀very⠀short,⠀some⠀are⠀composed⠀around⠀a⠀single⠀request,⠀some⠀break⠀off.⠀What⠀is⠀absent⠀may⠀be⠀as⠀significant⠀as⠀what⠀is⠀included,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀omission⠀a⠀clue.\n\nUse⠀the⠀transcript's⠀formal⠀elements⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀historical⠀record:⠀a⠀message⠀copied⠀into⠀a⠀ledger⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀a⠀private⠀note;⠀a⠀delay⠀because⠀a⠀carrier⠀could⠀not⠀cross⠀a⠀flooded⠀road⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀a⠀sender's⠀hesitation.⠀Include⠀only⠀the⠀timestamp-like⠀or⠀status-like⠀material⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀recipient⠀can⠀know.⠀Mark⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀as⠀sent⠀and⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀as⠀unsent.⠀Private⠀thought⠀during⠀composition⠀and⠀the⠀draft⠀are⠀separate⠀categories:⠀the⠀draft⠀preserves⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀considered⠀committing⠀to⠀paper;⠀the⠀recipient⠀does⠀not⠀see⠀it;⠀the⠀reader⠀does.\n\nWithhold⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀revelation⠀inside⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself.⠀A⠀note⠀arrives⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀reply⠀addresses⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀earlier⠀message⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀contain,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀one⠀letter⠀reappears⠀in⠀another⠀sender's⠀message⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀first⠀letter⠀was⠀not⠀confidential,⠀a⠀request⠀receives⠀an⠀answer⠀before⠀it⠀was⠀made⠀because⠀the⠀messenger⠀spoke⠀it.⠀The⠀transcript's⠀time⠀marks⠀can⠀create⠀the⠀exact⠀pause⠀a⠀stage⠀or⠀screen⠀would⠀express⠀as⠀a⠀look:⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀a⠀message⠀stamped⠀with⠀the⠀date⠀or⠀carrier⠀note⠀before⠀the⠀next⠀sender⠀replies,⠀and⠀the⠀meaning⠀of⠀that⠀interval⠀becomes⠀legible⠀only⠀later.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀can⠀reach.⠀A⠀sender⠀may⠀write⠀from⠀a⠀port,⠀a⠀prison,⠀a⠀parish,⠀a⠀rented⠀room.⠀A⠀recipient⠀may⠀have⠀to⠀move,⠀pay,⠀wait,⠀or⠀not⠀receive⠀the⠀message⠀in⠀order.⠀These⠀facts⠀curve⠀the⠀transcript⠀without⠀being⠀narrated⠀around⠀it.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀note⠀when⠀required⠀to⠀indicate⠀place,⠀wreck,⠀illness,⠀or⠀silent⠀physical⠀action.⠀The⠀answer⠀may⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀that⠀is⠀now⠀en⠀route,⠀a⠀draft⠀left⠀folded,⠀a⠀reply⠀that⠀is⠀materially⠀late,⠀or⠀a⠀line⠀acknowledging⠀ordinary⠀business⠀while⠀another⠀matter⠀remains⠀unreached.⠀No⠀completed⠀revelation⠀or⠀confession⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaiba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nLet⠀scene-setting⠀be⠀concise⠀and⠀visually⠀indexable.⠀A⠀presented⠀room,⠀yard,⠀stair,⠀or⠀table⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀as⠀an⠀organized⠀space.⠀The⠀historical⠀world⠀decides⠀which⠀objects⠀may⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀whose⠀presence⠀and⠀which⠀persons⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀frame.⠀A⠀servant⠀appears⠀with⠀fuel⠀and⠀leaves;⠀a⠀clerk⠀opens⠀a⠀register⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀walk⠀behind⠀the⠀master's⠀chair;⠀a⠀woman⠀sets⠀a⠀lamp⠀on⠀the⠀table⠀where⠀the⠀account⠀book⠀is⠀already⠀open.⠀These⠀remain⠀scenic⠀facts,⠀not⠀symbolic⠀assertions.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀brief⠀focal⠀narration⠀between⠀lines.⠀Attribute⠀dialogue⠀clearly.⠀Keep⠀the⠀inner⠀response⠀short⠀and⠀observable:⠀a⠀name⠀felt⠀as⠀a⠀weight,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀touching⠀a⠀particular⠀drawer,⠀a⠀recollection⠀that⠀the⠀floor⠀near⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀always⠀cold.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀register⠀that⠀something⠀is⠀strange⠀without⠀declaring⠀what⠀it⠀means.⠀Another⠀character⠀may⠀look⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀and⠀speak⠀of⠀something⠀else;⠀the⠀scene⠀holds⠀that⠀difference⠀in⠀place⠀without⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nGive⠀a⠀changed⠀cue⠀the⠀power⠀to⠀revalue⠀an⠀earlier⠀scene.⠀A⠀visual⠀novel's⠀background⠀can⠀remain⠀constant⠀across⠀a⠀conversation,⠀then⠀reappear⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀with⠀one⠀position⠀altered:⠀the⠀teaspoon⠀has⠀been⠀turned⠀the⠀other⠀way,⠀the⠀tallow⠀has⠀been⠀cut,⠀the⠀stool⠀that⠀was⠀by⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀now⠀worked⠀into⠀service⠀near⠀the⠀bed,⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀stacked⠀linen⠀has⠀been⠀disturbed.⠀A⠀later⠀visual⠀arrangement⠀can⠀tell⠀the⠀reader⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀silence⠀had⠀content.⠀Return⠀to⠀objects⠀legitimately⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀period,⠀not⠀as⠀gothic⠀omens,⠀but⠀as⠀the⠀residue⠀of⠀unseen⠀work⠀by⠀someone⠀whose⠀access⠀is⠀socially⠀limited.\n\nReserve⠀focal⠀narration⠀for⠀actual⠀private⠀experience.⠀It⠀may⠀carry⠀perception,⠀association,⠀or⠀reasoning;⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀this⠀character's⠀own.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀the⠀character's⠀expression⠀as⠀a⠀truthometer⠀for⠀others,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀all⠀others'⠀looks⠀be⠀explained⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀narration.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀register⠀that⠀a⠀woman's⠀expression⠀shifted⠀when⠀the⠀name⠀was⠀said,⠀then⠀permit⠀a⠀later⠀arrangement⠀to⠀hint⠀at⠀why⠀without⠀an⠀immediate⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue.\n\nDo⠀not⠀activate⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀visually⠀staged⠀rhythm,⠀not⠀a⠀game⠀schema.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀background⠀left⠀changed,⠀a⠀question⠀not⠀repeated,⠀or⠀a⠀face⠀whose⠀expression⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀cannot⠀settle.⠀No⠀confrontation⠀or⠀completed⠀revelation⠀is⠀required.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaibb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Gu⠀Long⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nKeep⠀the⠀installment⠀grounded⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀current⠀phase⠀of⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀is⠀doing.⠀The⠀ongoing⠀thread⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀quest;⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀work⠀in⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀letters,⠀a⠀disputed⠀obligation,⠀a⠀season⠀of⠀illness⠀or⠀travel,⠀or⠀a⠀covered⠀social⠀break⠀that⠀produces⠀local⠀changes.⠀Open⠀each⠀installment⠀with⠀enough⠀of⠀the⠀scene's⠀active⠀texture⠀to⠀seat⠀a⠀returning⠀reader,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀world⠀resume⠀its⠀own⠀pace.⠀The⠀web⠀serial⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀at⠀each⠀turn.\n\nUse⠀Gu⠀Long's⠀short⠀declarative⠀prose.⠀Do⠀not⠀write⠀redundant⠀lead-ins⠀around⠀a⠀critical⠀line.⠀Let⠀a⠀single⠀observed⠀detail⠀sit⠀in⠀the⠀reader's⠀memory;⠀it⠀may⠀appear⠀without⠀explanation⠀in⠀the⠀first⠀installment,⠀lie⠀dormant⠀while⠀the⠀story⠀moves⠀forward,⠀and⠀return⠀after⠀several⠀installments⠀when⠀the⠀historical⠀situation⠀has⠀developed⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀its⠀meaning⠀visible.⠀Return⠀to⠀the⠀exact⠀particular—the⠀damp⠀floor⠀by⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀clerk⠀folded⠀the⠀paper,⠀the⠀woman's⠀hands⠀leaving⠀no⠀mark⠀on⠀the⠀cup,⠀a⠀phrase⠀someone⠀repeated⠀without⠀inflection—not⠀to⠀a⠀vague⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene.⠀A⠀later⠀line⠀can⠀be⠀weighted⠀without⠀announcing⠀it:⠀the⠀detail⠀reappears⠀as⠀if⠀recovered⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀past.\n\nLet⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀obey⠀the⠀world's⠀own⠀constraints.⠀If⠀a⠀message⠀took⠀days⠀to⠀reach⠀the⠀house,⠀the⠀later⠀scene⠀cannot⠀make⠀everyone⠀know⠀it⠀the⠀same⠀evening⠀unless⠀an⠀arrival⠀is⠀shown.⠀If⠀a⠀servant⠀was⠀not⠀present⠀at⠀a⠀meeting,⠀the⠀later⠀scene⠀cannot⠀give⠀that⠀servant⠀an⠀unexplained⠀look⠀of⠀recognition.⠀The⠀serial⠀may⠀carry⠀uncertainty⠀across⠀long⠀gaps,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀trace⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀could⠀have⠀known⠀at⠀each⠀point.⠀That⠀trace⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀narrative,⠀not⠀a⠀footnote.⠀Work⠀naturally⠀by⠀installment:⠀the⠀wash⠀is⠀done,⠀the⠀tenant⠀returns,⠀the⠀road⠀is⠀passable⠀again,⠀the⠀child⠀is⠀better,⠀while⠀the⠀earlier⠀detail⠀continues⠀to⠀be⠀held⠀in⠀the⠀reader's⠀attention⠀without⠀a⠀recap⠀paragraph.\n\nLet⠀the⠀installment⠀form⠀determine⠀a⠀permissible⠀break.⠀A⠀segment⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀lunch⠀on⠀the⠀third⠀day,⠀immediately⠀after⠀a⠀phrase⠀is⠀heard,⠀before⠀a⠀decision⠀is⠀reached,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀unexplained⠀private⠀image.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀developed⠀cliffhanger.⠀Recovery⠀for⠀returning⠀readers⠀is⠀selective:⠀include⠀only⠀the⠀precise⠀fact⠀that⠀the⠀current⠀installment⠀needs—the⠀name,⠀the⠀date,⠀the⠀debt,⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀previous⠀line—without⠀retelling⠀the⠀earlier⠀scene's⠀whole⠀shape.⠀When⠀the⠀exact⠀detail⠀finally⠀returns,⠀its⠀force⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀installment⠀form⠀itself:⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀carried⠀the⠀unremarked⠀line⠀over⠀time,⠀and⠀the⠀delay⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀trick⠀but⠀the⠀form's⠀way⠀of⠀keeping⠀memory⠀and⠀meaning⠀apart.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nGround⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀period,⠀place,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀supplies.⠀Let⠀the⠀era's⠀ordinary⠀logistics⠀set⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known,⠀obtained,⠀expected,⠀and⠀done:⠀how⠀a⠀message⠀travels,⠀who⠀may⠀enter⠀a⠀room,⠀what⠀work⠀must⠀be⠀finished⠀before⠀anyone⠀can⠀sit⠀down,⠀what⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀obligation⠀costs⠀in⠀time,⠀what⠀an⠀institution⠀permits⠀or⠀forbids.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀given⠀history⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀universal⠀medieval⠀template;⠀when⠀a⠀detail⠀is⠀not⠀established,⠀leave⠀it⠀uncertain⠀rather⠀than⠀filling⠀it⠀with⠀imported⠀period⠀atmosphere.⠀Use⠀period-appropriate⠀language⠀as⠀the⠀narrator's⠀diction⠀allows,⠀not⠀automatic⠀archaic⠀English.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀alternate⠀history,⠀establish⠀the⠀divergence⠀rather⠀than⠀sliding⠀it⠀in⠀as⠀unexplained⠀period⠀detail.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀emotional⠀turbulence⠀through⠀ordinary⠀activity⠀and⠀exact⠀surfaces.⠀Give⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀with⠀real⠀duration—mending,⠀copying,⠀carrying,⠀cleaning,⠀waiting⠀for⠀an⠀answer,⠀preparing⠀food—and⠀let⠀attention⠀keep⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀weight,⠀edge,⠀or⠀resistance⠀of⠀the⠀object.⠀The⠀hurt⠀may⠀remain⠀unspoken⠀or⠀only⠀half⠀admitted;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀still⠀receive⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀experience.⠀Render⠀that⠀inner⠀pressure⠀directly⠀in⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀voice:⠀the⠀sentence⠀they⠀almost⠀say,⠀the⠀private⠀calculation⠀of⠀whether⠀to⠀ask⠀for⠀help,⠀the⠀sting⠀of⠀needing⠀someone⠀who⠀may⠀not⠀come,⠀the⠀memory⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀difficult.⠀Do⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀feeling⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀condition⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀automatically⠀perceive⠀it.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀output⠀contract⠀uses⠀hidden⠀interiority,⠀place⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀hidden⠀wrapper⠀rather⠀than⠀omitting⠀it;⠀if⠀visible⠀interiority⠀is⠀active,⠀keep⠀it⠀woven⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀narrative⠀texture.⠀If⠀the⠀moment⠀carries⠀strangeness,⠀describe⠀it⠀evenly⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀unresolved⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀unstable;⠀keep⠀any⠀threshold⠀effect⠀psychological⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀the⠀impossible.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀at⠀Murakami's⠀conversational⠀distance.⠀People⠀can⠀discuss⠀wages,⠀schedules,⠀weather,⠀or⠀a⠀broken⠀latch⠀in⠀calm,⠀even⠀flat⠀sentences⠀while⠀the⠀strain⠀sits⠀underneath.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀constraint⠀make⠀the⠀emotional⠀move⠀costly:⠀an⠀apology⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀visit⠀may⠀depend⠀on⠀daylight⠀or⠀permission,⠀a⠀letter⠀may⠀cross⠀days⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀arrive,⠀a⠀favor⠀may⠀create⠀an⠀obligation⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀repay.⠀The⠀strain⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀is⠀actually⠀said⠀and⠀done—shorter⠀answers,⠀an⠀unnecessary⠀repetition⠀of⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀never⠀reaches⠀its⠀point—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession,⠀rupture,⠀or⠀reconciliation.\n\nWhen⠀warmth⠀appears,⠀let⠀it⠀be⠀partial,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀compromised⠀by⠀the⠀period's⠀practical⠀demands.⠀A⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀coat⠀lent⠀without⠀comment,⠀a⠀hand⠀briefly⠀steadied⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀unresolved⠀hurt⠀and⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀call⠀to⠀work,⠀a⠀public⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀needed⠀departure.⠀After⠀a⠀difficult⠀exchange,⠀show⠀the⠀consequence⠀in⠀subsequent⠀behavior:⠀an⠀avoided⠀street,⠀a⠀delayed⠀errand,⠀a⠀routine⠀performed⠀with⠀altered⠀attention.⠀The⠀story⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀name⠀the⠀wound,⠀heal⠀it,⠀or⠀make⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀pause.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀scene,⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀task⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀boundary,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀required⠀emotional⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀a⠀definite⠀historical⠀world,⠀using⠀the⠀supplied⠀period,⠀place,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀to⠀decide⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀can⠀know,⠀own,⠀ask⠀for,⠀or⠀arrange.⠀Let⠀work,⠀money,⠀travel,⠀messages,⠀rules,⠀and⠀unavailable⠀goods⠀enter⠀through⠀hands-on⠀activity⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀historical⠀lecture.⠀Build⠀the⠀interval⠀around⠀an⠀unhurried⠀practical⠀task⠀with⠀duration—repairing,⠀preparing,⠀sorting,⠀carrying,⠀waiting⠀in⠀a⠀queue,⠀copying⠀a⠀document,⠀tending⠀a⠀machine—and⠀let⠀its⠀ordinary⠀steps⠀reveal⠀the⠀period's⠀constraints⠀as⠀they⠀come⠀up.⠀If⠀an⠀exact⠀historical⠀detail⠀is⠀not⠀supplied,⠀keep⠀it⠀uncertain⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀medieval⠀or⠀modern⠀default.⠀Alternate⠀history⠀must⠀be⠀established⠀by⠀an⠀actual⠀altered⠀fact,⠀not⠀slipped⠀in⠀as⠀atmosphere.\n\nKeep⠀Murakami's⠀calm,⠀exact⠀surface:⠀ordinary⠀objects⠀and⠀procedures⠀described⠀evenly,⠀without⠀forcing⠀them⠀to⠀announce⠀significance.⠀A⠀utensil,⠀a⠀form,⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀radio,⠀a⠀delivery⠀time⠀can⠀carry⠀private⠀concern⠀if⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀returns⠀to⠀it⠀with⠀mild,⠀specific⠀attention.⠀Let⠀the⠀strange⠀or⠀unresolved⠀remain⠀alongside⠀the⠀practical:⠀an⠀odd⠀coincidence,⠀a⠀half-heard⠀remark,⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀quite⠀fit,⠀or⠀a⠀feeling⠀of⠀threshold⠀can⠀unsettle⠀the⠀interval⠀without⠀making⠀the⠀whole⠀world⠀unstable.⠀In⠀a⠀realistic⠀historical⠀scene,⠀treat⠀the⠀threshold⠀psychologically—attention⠀slips,⠀a⠀routine⠀feels⠀briefly⠀wrong,⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀seems⠀newly⠀unfamiliar—rather⠀than⠀importing⠀impossible⠀events⠀the⠀world⠀has⠀not⠀permitted.\n\nFor⠀Chat⠀Roleplay,⠀make⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraphs;⠀start⠀a⠀new⠀paragraph⠀when⠀the⠀speaker⠀changes.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀spoken⠀line⠀clearly⠀through⠀names,⠀tags,⠀or⠀action⠀beats,⠀and⠀keep⠀characters⠀distinct⠀through⠀their⠀practical⠀habits⠀and⠀conversational⠀distance⠀rather⠀than⠀universal⠀wit.⠀One⠀may⠀answer⠀in⠀flat⠀short⠀sentences,⠀another⠀may⠀ask⠀after⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀a⠀time,⠀and⠀both⠀may⠀talk⠀around⠀a⠀private⠀matter⠀without⠀naming⠀it.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀any⠀selected⠀action⠀markers;⠀do⠀not⠀switch⠀perspective,⠀invent⠀player⠀control,⠀or⠀turn⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀a⠀script⠀unless⠀those⠀settings⠀call⠀for⠀it.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀where⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀access⠀it:⠀what⠀the⠀task⠀makes⠀them⠀remember,⠀expect,⠀avoid⠀saying,⠀or⠀notice⠀in⠀another⠀person's⠀manner.⠀That⠀private⠀content⠀may⠀remain⠀unspoken⠀and⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀dialogue⠀for⠀a⠀character-specific⠀reason—caution,⠀habit,⠀embarrassment,⠀or⠀simple⠀irrelevance.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀other⠀characters⠀read⠀it⠀or⠀respond⠀as⠀if⠀they⠀had⠀heard⠀it.⠀If⠀the⠀selected⠀presentation⠀hides⠀interiority,⠀still⠀compose⠀the⠀real⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀its⠀required⠀form⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀vague⠀summary⠀or⠀moving⠀it⠀entirely⠀into⠀planning.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀continuing⠀interval,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀mandatory⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀decision.⠀The⠀reply⠀may⠀stop⠀while⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀unfinished,⠀while⠀someone⠀is⠀speaking,⠀just⠀after⠀a⠀thought,⠀before⠀an⠀answer⠀is⠀given,⠀or⠀as⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀detail⠀enters⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀historical⠀world⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀speakers⠀remain⠀active,⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀beat⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀already⠀happening⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀forced⠀hook.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nKeep⠀to⠀the⠀intimate⠀urban⠀and⠀domestic⠀telling:⠀one⠀household,⠀shop,⠀courtyard,⠀or⠀street,⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀circle⠀of⠀people⠀the⠀character⠀actually⠀deals⠀with.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀moment⠀arrive⠀only⠀at⠀this⠀scale⠀—⠀what⠀costs⠀more⠀this⠀month,⠀which⠀paper⠀must⠀be⠀stamped,⠀how⠀long⠀a⠀letter⠀now⠀takes,⠀who⠀has⠀stopped⠀sitting⠀outside⠀in⠀the⠀evenings.⠀Limit⠀knowledge⠀the⠀same⠀way:⠀the⠀character⠀knows⠀rumors,⠀posted⠀notices,⠀and⠀what⠀relatives⠀pass⠀along,⠀and⠀may⠀be⠀wrong⠀about⠀all⠀three.⠀Where⠀the⠀scenario⠀fixes⠀a⠀place⠀and⠀decade,⠀use⠀its⠀particular⠀currencies,⠀duties,⠀and⠀forms⠀of⠀address;⠀do⠀not⠀fill⠀a⠀gap⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀past,⠀and⠀if⠀the⠀history⠀departs⠀from⠀the⠀record,⠀let⠀someone⠀remember⠀or⠀dispute⠀the⠀difference⠀rather⠀than⠀passing⠀it⠀silently.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀plain,⠀exact⠀register⠀whatever⠀the⠀era.\n\nGive⠀the⠀daily⠀round⠀full⠀unhurried⠀weight.⠀Measure⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀tasks⠀—⠀water⠀carried,⠀stock⠀counted,⠀a⠀shutter⠀mended,⠀the⠀walk⠀to⠀market⠀—⠀and⠀describe⠀surfaces⠀exactly:⠀the⠀heft⠀of⠀the⠀kettle,⠀the⠀drag⠀of⠀the⠀gate,⠀the⠀worn⠀hollow⠀in⠀a⠀step.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀objects⠀pick⠀up⠀private⠀charge⠀under⠀quiet,⠀solitary⠀attention:⠀an⠀unused⠀cup,⠀a⠀coat⠀still⠀on⠀its⠀hook,⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀the⠀character⠀keeps⠀returning⠀to.⠀When⠀something⠀is⠀genuinely⠀wrong⠀—⠀a⠀name⠀missing⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀a⠀stranger⠀asking⠀after⠀someone,⠀an⠀unexplained⠀silence⠀—⠀give⠀it⠀the⠀same⠀even⠀pace⠀and⠀tone⠀as⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀vegetables.⠀The⠀unease⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved;⠀keep⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀facts⠀stable⠀and⠀plain.\n\nLet⠀larger⠀conditions⠀act⠀only⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀a⠀relative's⠀visit⠀that⠀rearranges⠀the⠀day,⠀a⠀payment⠀delayed,⠀a⠀curfew⠀that⠀shortens⠀the⠀walk⠀home,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀request⠀that⠀cannot⠀politely⠀be⠀refused.⠀People⠀may⠀speak⠀evenly⠀of⠀large⠀things,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀register⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀the⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀weight⠀without⠀making⠀anyone⠀name⠀it.⠀Show⠀feeling⠀in⠀placement⠀and⠀timing⠀—⠀who⠀is⠀served⠀first,⠀how⠀long⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀an⠀answer⠀—⠀and⠀carry⠀the⠀character's⠀real⠀private⠀attention⠀alongside⠀the⠀talk:⠀the⠀sentence⠀rehearsed⠀and⠀never⠀said,⠀the⠀coins⠀counted⠀twice,⠀the⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀person⠀that⠀has⠀no⠀polite⠀place⠀to⠀be⠀asked.⠀A⠀boundary⠀can⠀carry⠀a⠀quiet⠀charge⠀—⠀the⠀curtain⠀across⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀quarter⠀where⠀different⠀rules⠀apply⠀—⠀because⠀crossing⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀said,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀mark⠀that⠀shift⠀without⠀anything⠀impossible⠀taking⠀place.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary,⠀wherever⠀it⠀falls:⠀an⠀errand⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀wait⠀still⠀open,⠀a⠀thought⠀unresolved.⠀Nothing⠀here⠀owes⠀a⠀lesson,⠀a⠀loss,⠀or⠀a⠀settled⠀feeling;⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀one⠀particular⠀life⠀inside⠀its⠀moment⠀is⠀the⠀whole⠀task.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀short,⠀hard-edged⠀sentences⠀that⠀still⠀carry⠀Murakami's⠀exact⠀attention⠀to⠀ordinary⠀things.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀arrive⠀through⠀material⠀wear⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀knowledge⠀it⠀implies⠀—⠀a⠀strap⠀mended⠀twice,⠀a⠀floor⠀worn⠀smooth⠀in⠀one⠀spot,⠀a⠀lock⠀that⠀sticks⠀in⠀cold⠀weather⠀—⠀and⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀with⠀what⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀place⠀allows:⠀how⠀far⠀a⠀letter⠀has⠀traveled⠀and⠀what⠀has⠀gone⠀stale⠀in⠀it,⠀who⠀can⠀be⠀asked⠀for⠀what,⠀what⠀a⠀tool⠀costs⠀against⠀a⠀day's⠀work,⠀what⠀a⠀seal⠀or⠀a⠀uniform⠀makes⠀someone⠀do.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀era⠀or⠀archaize⠀the⠀prose;⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀hands⠀and⠀choices⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀world⠀permits⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs.⠀Where⠀the⠀scenario⠀leaves⠀something⠀unspecified,⠀keep⠀it⠀uncertain⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀dressing⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀borrowed⠀template,⠀and⠀if⠀this⠀history⠀diverges⠀from⠀ours,⠀show⠀the⠀divergence⠀in⠀what⠀people⠀handle⠀and⠀repeat⠀instead⠀of⠀assuming⠀it.\n\nCompress⠀the⠀prose,⠀not⠀the⠀work.⠀Use⠀forceful⠀verbs⠀and⠀hard⠀transitions⠀—⠀a⠀detail⠀noticed,⠀acted⠀on,⠀paid⠀for,⠀with⠀no⠀smoothing⠀over⠀the⠀joins⠀—⠀while⠀any⠀real⠀activity⠀keeps⠀its⠀true⠀duration:⠀the⠀kettle⠀takes⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀takes,⠀the⠀harness⠀goes⠀on⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀it⠀demands.⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀routines⠀survive⠀here⠀as⠀narration⠀that⠀neither⠀hurries⠀the⠀hands⠀nor⠀pads⠀the⠀wait.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀works⠀through⠀a⠀practical⠀problem⠀or⠀turns⠀something⠀private⠀over,⠀let⠀the⠀reasoning⠀run⠀longer⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀plain⠀register,⠀then⠀cut⠀back.\n\nLet⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀take⠀on⠀private⠀weight⠀without⠀commentary.⠀Name⠀the⠀thing⠀exactly⠀—⠀the⠀mended⠀strap,⠀the⠀second⠀cup,⠀the⠀door⠀nobody⠀oils⠀anymore⠀—⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀rest⠀on⠀it⠀a⠀moment⠀too⠀long,⠀and⠀move⠀on.⠀Treat⠀whatever⠀is⠀slightly⠀off⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀even⠀voice:⠀an⠀absence⠀nobody⠀explains,⠀a⠀rumor⠀that⠀outruns⠀its⠀facts,⠀a⠀name⠀people⠀have⠀stopped⠀using.⠀Describe⠀it⠀concretely⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀unease⠀stay⠀psychological;⠀the⠀world⠀stays⠀real,⠀and⠀nothing⠀impossible⠀happens⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀it.⠀Keep⠀dialogue⠀plain⠀and⠀practical,⠀with⠀Murakami's⠀conversational⠀distance:⠀people⠀speak⠀about⠀weather,⠀prices,⠀deliveries,⠀aches,⠀while⠀strain⠀or⠀dread⠀stays⠀unspoken⠀or⠀surfaces⠀obliquely.⠀Rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀its⠀particular⠀speaker⠀and⠀situation,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀style's⠀decoration.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀stakes⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀constant:⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀be⠀dangerous,⠀exhausting,⠀or⠀simply⠀necessary,⠀and⠀the⠀body's⠀condition⠀counts⠀—⠀cold,⠀hunger,⠀a⠀strained⠀shoulder,⠀a⠀cut⠀that⠀needs⠀cleaning.⠀Render⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀spoken⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀hard⠀grain:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀dreads,⠀counts⠀and⠀recounts,⠀and⠀how⠀one⠀conclusion⠀hardens⠀into⠀a⠀decision.⠀Uncertainty⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀without⠀the⠀scene's⠀facts⠀turning⠀unstable.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀or⠀observation⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point;⠀the⠀style⠀owes⠀no⠀confession,⠀no⠀reversal,⠀and⠀no⠀explained⠀feeling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀this⠀story⠀entirely⠀through⠀documents—letters,⠀journal⠀entries,⠀reports,⠀receipts,⠀notes,⠀annotated⠀lists—whatever⠀written⠀record⠀the⠀moment⠀actually⠀produces.⠀Before⠀writing⠀an⠀entry,⠀fix⠀its⠀author,⠀its⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀its⠀date,⠀and⠀let⠀those⠀three⠀facts⠀govern⠀every⠀line.⠀They⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀knows⠀so⠀far,⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀to⠀this⠀reader,⠀and⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀held⠀back:⠀a⠀report⠀to⠀an⠀office⠀answers⠀what⠀was⠀asked⠀and⠀nothing⠀more;⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀someone⠀trusted⠀admits⠀a⠀little⠀more;⠀a⠀journal⠀written⠀late⠀at⠀night⠀permits⠀a⠀sentence⠀the⠀morning⠀would⠀strike⠀out.⠀A⠀document⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀surface,⠀not⠀its⠀writer's⠀whole⠀mind,⠀and⠀the⠀choosing⠀of⠀what⠀to⠀record⠀is⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀lives.\n\nLet⠀the⠀period⠀act⠀through⠀the⠀documents'⠀material⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀decoration.⠀What⠀paper⠀and⠀postage⠀cost,⠀who⠀can⠀read,⠀how⠀far⠀a⠀letter⠀travels⠀and⠀how⠀long⠀it⠀takes,⠀which⠀papers⠀an⠀office⠀keeps,⠀whether⠀an⠀opinion⠀is⠀safe⠀to⠀write⠀down—the⠀writers⠀handle⠀these⠀as⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀constraints,⠀like⠀weather⠀and⠀work.⠀A⠀delayed⠀letter,⠀a⠀copy⠀kept⠀for⠀a⠀file,⠀an⠀entry⠀stored⠀where⠀one⠀particular⠀person⠀will⠀find⠀it:⠀such⠀things⠀exist⠀because⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀place⠀make⠀them⠀possible,⠀and⠀the⠀scenario's⠀social⠀position⠀decides⠀who⠀may⠀write,⠀send,⠀and⠀withhold.⠀Where⠀the⠀scenario⠀leaves⠀something⠀unspecified,⠀let⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀stand⠀as⠀the⠀writer⠀would⠀have⠀felt⠀it;⠀if⠀this⠀history⠀diverges⠀from⠀our⠀own,⠀let⠀the⠀records⠀treat⠀the⠀divergence⠀as⠀unremarkable⠀fact.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sentences⠀plain⠀and⠀exact—the⠀period⠀shows⠀in⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀managed⠀and⠀paid⠀for,⠀not⠀in⠀pastiche⠀archaic⠀diction.\n\nGive⠀each⠀document⠀Murakami's⠀calm,⠀unhurried⠀attention⠀to⠀ordinary⠀surfaces:⠀the⠀weather,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀time⠀a⠀task⠀took,⠀the⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀object.⠀Record⠀these⠀precisely⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀private⠀concern⠀without⠀naming⠀it—a⠀letter⠀that⠀only⠀confirms⠀an⠀arrival⠀time⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀one⠀that⠀says⠀the⠀most,⠀and⠀a⠀journal⠀measures⠀worry⠀through⠀what⠀it⠀keeps⠀noticing.⠀Keep⠀the⠀voice⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀content⠀is⠀not.⠀If⠀something⠀strange⠀enters⠀the⠀records,⠀a⠀name⠀recurring⠀across⠀unrelated⠀documents,⠀an⠀object⠀where⠀it⠀ought⠀not⠀to⠀be,⠀an⠀absence⠀no⠀one⠀explains,⠀describe⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀steady⠀tone⠀as⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀ink⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀writer⠀carry⠀on⠀with⠀the⠀day's⠀tasks.⠀The⠀unsettled⠀can⠀stay⠀unsettled;⠀what⠀the⠀records⠀establish⠀stays⠀established.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀sequence⠀across⠀entries⠀rather⠀than⠀within⠀any⠀one⠀of⠀them.⠀Later⠀documents⠀answer,⠀correct,⠀and⠀complicate⠀earlier⠀ones:⠀a⠀letter⠀fixes⠀a⠀date⠀a⠀journal⠀got⠀wrong;⠀an⠀entry⠀reinterprets⠀a⠀report⠀its⠀writer⠀has⠀since⠀reread;⠀two⠀records⠀describe⠀the⠀same⠀afternoon⠀differently⠀because⠀their⠀authors⠀stood⠀in⠀different⠀rooms⠀or⠀wanted⠀different⠀things⠀remembered.⠀Trust⠀each⠀writer's⠀situation⠀to⠀produce⠀the⠀discrepancy⠀rather⠀than⠀planting⠀it⠀for⠀effect.⠀Treat⠀material⠀traces⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀telling—a⠀line⠀crossed⠀out,⠀a⠀page⠀missing,⠀a⠀corner⠀worn⠀soft⠀from⠀rereading—signs⠀of⠀handling⠀by⠀particular⠀hands,⠀not⠀messages⠀left⠀for⠀the⠀reader.⠀Give⠀no⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀between⠀records;⠀the⠀reader⠀assembles⠀the⠀whole⠀and⠀may⠀understand⠀more⠀than⠀any⠀single⠀writer⠀does.⠀Choose⠀each⠀document's⠀form⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀moment⠀needs⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀every⠀available⠀format.⠀An⠀entry⠀can⠀end⠀where⠀its⠀writer's⠀attention⠀ends,⠀and⠀a⠀final⠀document⠀need⠀not⠀reconcile⠀what⠀its⠀writers⠀never⠀could.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nGround⠀the⠀warmth⠀in⠀what⠀this⠀period⠀and⠀place⠀actually⠀make⠀available.⠀Let⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀chosen⠀care⠀grow⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀year's⠀particular⠀conditions⠀—⠀what⠀work⠀allows,⠀what⠀the⠀season⠀supplies,⠀how⠀far⠀a⠀message⠀travels,⠀what⠀someone⠀of⠀this⠀station⠀can⠀offer⠀without⠀strain⠀—⠀so⠀the⠀comfort⠀is⠀specific:⠀a⠀portion⠀measured⠀by⠀scarcity,⠀a⠀preference⠀remembered⠀across⠀a⠀distance,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀quietly⠀to⠀spare⠀another⠀person.⠀Narrate⠀in⠀a⠀plain,⠀unhurried⠀register⠀with⠀exact⠀surfaces⠀—⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀folded⠀blanket,⠀the⠀minutes⠀a⠀small⠀job⠀takes,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀water⠀coming⠀to⠀heat⠀—⠀without⠀archaic⠀diction⠀pasted⠀on⠀for⠀period⠀flavor.⠀The⠀plainness⠀is⠀the⠀voice;⠀the⠀history⠀lives⠀in⠀what⠀things⠀cost⠀and⠀how⠀they⠀arrive.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀things⠀open⠀softly⠀onto⠀private⠀concern.⠀A⠀taste,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀repeated⠀chore⠀can⠀recall⠀another⠀winter⠀or⠀another⠀person,⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint's⠀inward⠀attention⠀—⠀what⠀is⠀noticed,⠀what⠀goes⠀unsaid,⠀and⠀the⠀fondness,⠀habit,⠀or⠀shyness⠀that⠀keeps⠀it⠀unsaid⠀—⠀belongs⠀on⠀the⠀page,⠀not⠀only⠀implied⠀by⠀deeds.⠀Conversation⠀can⠀stay⠀easy⠀and⠀oblique:⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand,⠀the⠀weather,⠀a⠀small⠀local⠀matter,⠀a⠀comfortable⠀silence.⠀A⠀mild⠀oddity⠀—⠀a⠀small⠀coincidence,⠀a⠀peculiar⠀habit,⠀a⠀detail⠀nobody⠀can⠀explain⠀—⠀may⠀be⠀described⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀calm⠀evenness⠀as⠀the⠀kettle⠀and⠀may⠀remain⠀unexplained⠀without⠀becoming⠀a⠀threat.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀The⠀world's⠀difficulties⠀and⠀duties⠀continue⠀around⠀this⠀interval;⠀comfort⠀neither⠀repairs⠀an⠀established⠀problem⠀nor⠀requires⠀a⠀confession.⠀End⠀wherever⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls⠀—⠀mid-task,⠀on⠀an⠀ordinary⠀line⠀of⠀talk,⠀in⠀quiet⠀continuation⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀at⠀a⠀rounded⠀emotional⠀payoff.⠀If⠀one⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀earlier⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀comes⠀round⠀again,⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀its⠀accumulated⠀gentleness⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀a⠀definite⠀moment⠀of⠀the⠀scenario's⠀period⠀and⠀place,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀moment⠀decide⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do.⠀Enter⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀particular:⠀the⠀hour⠀a⠀shift⠀begins,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀street⠀after⠀rain,⠀the⠀queue⠀at⠀a⠀ration⠀window,⠀the⠀wording⠀of⠀a⠀regulation,⠀an⠀obligation⠀that⠀falls⠀on⠀one⠀specific⠀day⠀of⠀the⠀year.⠀Let⠀institutions⠀arrive⠀as⠀encounters⠀—⠀a⠀clerk's⠀ruling,⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀stamped,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀visit⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀summary⠀of⠀an⠀era.⠀Work⠀from⠀the⠀period,⠀location,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀supplied⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀generic⠀historical⠀template,⠀and⠀if⠀an⠀alternate⠀history⠀is⠀in⠀play,⠀establish⠀the⠀divergence⠀inside⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀assuming⠀it⠀silently.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀sustained⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions.⠀A⠀passage⠀may⠀follow⠀one⠀character⠀through⠀a⠀practical⠀task⠀from⠀beginning⠀to⠀end:⠀washing,⠀repairing,⠀delivering,⠀copying,⠀waiting,⠀preparing⠀a⠀meal⠀or⠀a⠀report.⠀Give⠀the⠀exact⠀feel⠀of⠀the⠀materials,⠀the⠀small⠀decisions⠀inside⠀the⠀task,⠀and⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀takes.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀composed⠀and⠀unhurried⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀is⠀strange,⠀and⠀describe⠀that⠀strangeness⠀as⠀evenly⠀as⠀you⠀describe⠀the⠀furniture.⠀Ordinary⠀objects⠀can⠀hold⠀private⠀concern⠀—⠀a⠀tool⠀handled⠀a⠀moment⠀too⠀long,⠀a⠀routine⠀performed⠀with⠀altered⠀attention,⠀a⠀detail⠀others⠀would⠀pass⠀over⠀—⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀announcing⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀means.\n\nUse⠀the⠀style's⠀distance⠀to⠀hold⠀narration⠀apart⠀from⠀speech.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀plain,⠀even⠀flat⠀sentences⠀while⠀the⠀surrounding⠀narration⠀carries⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀historical⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀exchange:⠀who⠀owes⠀what⠀to⠀whom,⠀what⠀a⠀silence⠀will⠀cost,⠀what⠀the⠀neighbours⠀will⠀hear⠀of⠀it.⠀Where⠀the⠀narrator's⠀position⠀permits,⠀frame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀judgment,⠀custom,⠀or⠀history,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀framing⠀concrete⠀—⠀a⠀regulation,⠀a⠀local⠀reputation,⠀a⠀seasonal⠀demand⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀portrait⠀of⠀an⠀age.⠀Give⠀the⠀narrator⠀only⠀the⠀access⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀allows,⠀and⠀keep⠀one⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀outside⠀another⠀character's⠀knowledge.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀nonspoken⠀experience⠀—⠀reflection,⠀sensation,⠀uncertainty,⠀the⠀reasoning⠀that⠀links⠀one⠀decision⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀—⠀accompany⠀the⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it,⠀and⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀actual⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀rather⠀than⠀relaying⠀it⠀later⠀through⠀a⠀letter⠀or⠀an⠀aside.⠀Ambiguity⠀may⠀stay⠀unresolved:⠀a⠀realistic⠀account⠀can⠀be⠀psychologically⠀unsettled⠀without⠀literal⠀impossible⠀events,⠀and⠀uncertainty⠀need⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀scene⠀fact⠀unstable.⠀Where⠀the⠀scenario⠀leaves⠀something⠀unspecified,⠀leave⠀it⠀unspecified⠀rather⠀than⠀filling⠀the⠀gap⠀with⠀a⠀template.\n\nOrganize⠀the⠀telling⠀by⠀the⠀period's⠀own⠀rhythms⠀—⠀work,⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀the⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀faces⠀of⠀a⠀single⠀obligation⠀—⠀and⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀reaches,⠀whether⠀that⠀is⠀mid-task,⠀mid-thought,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀conversation⠀still⠀underway.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting,⠀archaic⠀vocabulary,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀moral;⠀it⠀requires⠀narration⠀that⠀knows⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀moment⠀does⠀and⠀declines⠀to⠀explain⠀it⠀all.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀a⠀concrete⠀occasion⠀for⠀telling:⠀a⠀wait,⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀request⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀listener⠀want⠀something⠀from⠀the⠀teller.⠀Establish⠀the⠀period⠀conditions⠀that⠀make⠀this⠀exchange⠀possible⠀and⠀limited—how⠀far⠀news⠀travels,⠀what⠀records⠀or⠀objects⠀can⠀be⠀checked,⠀what⠀the⠀teller's⠀work⠀or⠀position⠀lets⠀them⠀have⠀seen.⠀Write⠀the⠀teller⠀from⠀that⠀position,⠀not⠀from⠀omniscience.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀outer⠀scene.⠀As⠀the⠀tale⠀proceeds,⠀choose⠀its⠀details⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀actual⠀access:⠀a⠀room⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀entered,⠀a⠀document⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀read,⠀a⠀conversation⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀overheard,⠀a⠀gap⠀they⠀admit⠀or⠀paper⠀over.⠀Show⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀revealing⠀what⠀they⠀want⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀believe⠀or⠀feel.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener⠀respond⠀through⠀small⠀changes⠀in⠀attention,⠀posture,⠀questions,⠀or⠀silence,⠀and⠀let⠀those⠀responses⠀alter⠀the⠀pace⠀or⠀direction⠀of⠀the⠀telling.\n\nUse⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀attention⠀to⠀ordinary⠀things⠀as⠀the⠀connective⠀tissue⠀between⠀levels.⠀Repeat⠀an⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀meal,⠀or⠀small⠀task⠀in⠀both⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀tale,⠀changing⠀its⠀weight⠀each⠀time.⠀Describe⠀each⠀recurrence⠀with⠀the⠀same⠀calm⠀precision⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀mundane⠀or⠀faintly⠀strange,⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀strangeness⠀partly⠀unexplained.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀coincidence,⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀implication⠀without⠀the⠀teller⠀confirming⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀frame⠀active⠀during⠀the⠀telling.⠀Interruptions,⠀practical⠀needs,⠀the⠀passage⠀of⠀the⠀evening,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention⠀can⠀shift⠀the⠀pace.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀stop,⠀resume,⠀revise,⠀or⠀choose⠀a⠀different⠀story⠀when⠀the⠀occasion⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀outer⠀scene's⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀continue⠀to⠀exert⠀pressure:⠀a⠀curfew,⠀a⠀payment⠀due,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀sent,⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀may⠀arrive.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀meaningful⠀point⠀in⠀either⠀level⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀finish,⠀break⠀off,⠀or⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀frame;⠀what⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀listener's⠀situation⠀has⠀been⠀altered⠀by⠀the⠀telling,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀alteration⠀is⠀only⠀a⠀new⠀question,⠀a⠀changed⠀feeling,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀postponed.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀understand⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀and⠀chose⠀to⠀tell,⠀while⠀preserving⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀that⠀knowledge⠀and⠀the⠀full⠀historical⠀event.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Move⠀between⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀documented⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀remembers⠀or⠀infers,⠀keeping⠀the⠀difference⠀explicit⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀prose⠀into⠀an⠀archive⠀catalogue.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀determine⠀what⠀records⠀exist,⠀who⠀can⠀consult⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀omit.\n\nOpen⠀a⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀with⠀evidence⠀or⠀memory:⠀a⠀register,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀photograph,⠀a⠀building,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀name⠀in⠀a⠀list,⠀or⠀a⠀story⠀someone⠀tells⠀about⠀the⠀past.⠀Describe⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀document⠀with⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀precision,⠀noting⠀its⠀physical⠀condition,⠀the⠀handwriting,⠀the⠀paper,⠀the⠀wear,⠀the⠀place⠀where⠀it⠀is⠀kept.⠀Attach⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀concern⠀to⠀a⠀small⠀detail—a⠀misspelled⠀name,⠀a⠀date⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀right,⠀a⠀margin⠀note,⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀survives⠀without⠀its⠀context.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀compares⠀record⠀and⠀recollection,⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀record⠀automatically⠀authoritative⠀or⠀the⠀memory⠀automatically⠀suspect.⠀A⠀document⠀may⠀be⠀incomplete,⠀formulaic,⠀or⠀written⠀for⠀an⠀institution⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀purposes.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀preserve⠀something⠀the⠀record⠀cannot⠀show:⠀a⠀smell,⠀a⠀tone⠀of⠀voice,⠀a⠀fear,⠀a⠀routine,⠀a⠀relationship.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀working⠀through⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀ordinary⠀time,⠀returning⠀to⠀the⠀material,⠀rereading,⠀hesitating,⠀or⠀setting⠀it⠀aside.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀frame⠀concrete.⠀Work,⠀transport,⠀communication,⠀money,⠀family⠀obligations,⠀and⠀institutional⠀rules⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known⠀and⠀done.⠀If⠀a⠀source⠀is⠀missing⠀or⠀ambiguous,⠀leave⠀that⠀uncertainty⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀convenient⠀explanation.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀offer⠀a⠀plausible⠀inference,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀remain⠀marked⠀as⠀inference,⠀not⠀as⠀recovered⠀fact.\n\nWrite⠀measured,⠀precise⠀sentences⠀for⠀records⠀and⠀observations.⠀When⠀the⠀character's⠀memory⠀or⠀private⠀thought⠀takes⠀over,⠀loosen⠀the⠀movement⠀slightly⠀and⠀allow⠀association⠀to⠀lead.⠀Avoid⠀imposing⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀or⠀severe⠀tone.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀the⠀comparison⠀itself—the⠀patient⠀attention⠀to⠀what⠀survives⠀and⠀what⠀does⠀not—not⠀a⠀national⠀temperament⠀or⠀a⠀translated⠀word⠀order.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀as⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life.⠀Let⠀an⠀inherited⠀institution,⠀family⠀claim,⠀legal⠀privilege,⠀building,⠀debt,⠀or⠀custom⠀press⠀on⠀people⠀who⠀must⠀live⠀inside⠀it.⠀Make⠀that⠀pressure⠀concrete:⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀entered,⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀signed,⠀a⠀rent⠀or⠀duty⠀that⠀falls⠀due,⠀a⠀name⠀that⠀carries⠀obligations,⠀a⠀street⠀or⠀household⠀where⠀the⠀past⠀is⠀still⠀physically⠀present.\n\nUse⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced,⠀not⠀to⠀add⠀supernatural⠀events.⠀Describe⠀the⠀material⠀world⠀with⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀precision:⠀worn⠀stone,⠀bad⠀light,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀damp⠀or⠀coal⠀smoke,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀lock⠀or⠀a⠀distant⠀bell,⠀the⠀particular⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat⠀or⠀a⠀key.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀carry⠀private⠀concern.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀watched,⠀trapped,⠀or⠀exposed⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀confirming⠀a⠀literal⠀threat;⠀the⠀unease⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved.\n\nKeep⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀People⠀may⠀depend⠀on⠀someone⠀they⠀fear,⠀protect⠀someone⠀who⠀harms⠀them,⠀desire⠀something⠀offered⠀by⠀an⠀old⠀power,⠀or⠀keep⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀that⠀falls⠀away⠀only⠀in⠀trusted⠀company.⠀Show⠀the⠀small⠀practical⠀exchanges⠀that⠀maintain⠀these⠀relationships:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀loan,⠀a⠀warning,⠀a⠀lie,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀unexpected⠀gentleness⠀or⠀cruelty.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀fraudulent⠀or⠀every⠀authority⠀figure⠀monstrous.\n\nGround⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀limits.⠀What⠀can⠀be⠀inherited,⠀enforced,⠀recorded,⠀or⠀concealed⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀Let⠀characters⠀know⠀different⠀parts⠀of⠀the⠀arrangement⠀and⠀have⠀different⠀reasons⠀for⠀silence⠀or⠀compliance.⠀If⠀a⠀fact⠀is⠀uncertain,⠀leave⠀it⠀uncertain⠀rather⠀than⠀inventing⠀a⠀secret⠀mechanism⠀to⠀explain⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀response⠀end⠀inside⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀and⠀the⠀relationship,⠀not⠀at⠀a⠀forced⠀revelation.⠀The⠀old⠀power⠀may⠀remain,⠀the⠀mask⠀may⠀stay⠀in⠀place,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀may⠀occur⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀larger⠀situation.⠀The⠀horror⠀and⠀the⠀intimacy⠀should⠀both⠀remain⠀personal,⠀historical,⠀and⠀materially⠀specific.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀proceeds⠀as⠀one⠀person's⠀situated⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀lived⠀through,⠀witnessed,⠀or⠀were⠀told,⠀shaped⠀by⠀their⠀social⠀position,⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀period.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀concrete:⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀read,⠀or⠀been⠀trusted⠀to⠀know,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀must⠀report⠀at⠀second⠀hand⠀or⠀admit⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀know.\n\nLet⠀the⠀account⠀move⠀between⠀outward⠀conditions⠀and⠀private⠀attention.⠀Describe⠀work,⠀housing,⠀food,⠀transport,⠀money,⠀family⠀obligations,⠀and⠀institutional⠀rules⠀with⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀precision,⠀but⠀attach⠀those⠀details⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀concern.⠀A⠀particular⠀object—a⠀vessel,⠀a⠀garment,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀doorway—can⠀carry⠀memory⠀or⠀unease⠀without⠀being⠀explained⠀completely.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀such⠀an⠀object,⠀noticing⠀it⠀differently⠀as⠀the⠀account⠀proceeds.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀testimony⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀region,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀code-switching⠀pattern.⠀Let⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀emerge⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀a⠀landlord's⠀visit,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀market⠀transaction,⠀a⠀festival,⠀a⠀dispute,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀return.⠀When⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀a⠀language⠀or⠀community,⠀let⠀its⠀actual⠀terms⠀and⠀relationships⠀shape⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unsaid.\n\nDistinguish⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀knew⠀then⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀know⠀now.⠀A⠀later⠀understanding⠀may⠀be⠀acknowledged,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀earlier⠀experience.⠀Let⠀uncertainty⠀remain⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀resolve⠀it.⠀The⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀judgment;⠀it⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀changed⠀feeling,⠀or⠀a⠀detail⠀that⠀still⠀will⠀not⠀settle.\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀distance.⠀First⠀person⠀is⠀available⠀but⠀not⠀mandatory;⠀if⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀reported⠀or⠀edited⠀by⠀another⠀consciousness,⠀preserve⠀that⠀frame.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀testimony—attentive,⠀partial,⠀and⠀personally⠀invested—not⠀like⠀a⠀neutral⠀historical⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀The⠀response⠀takes⠀the⠀form⠀of⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀dated⠀or⠀occasion-bound⠀entries⠀written⠀by⠀a⠀character⠀whose⠀period,⠀location,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀determine⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀record.⠀Keep⠀the⠀entry's⠀language⠀and⠀distance⠀true⠀to⠀that⠀writer:⠀a⠀merchant,⠀a⠀servant,⠀a⠀student,⠀a⠀traveler,⠀a⠀household⠀member,⠀or⠀another⠀figure⠀with⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀keep⠀such⠀a⠀record.\n\nLet⠀each⠀entry⠀move⠀between⠀immediate⠀observation⠀and⠀reflection.⠀Record⠀the⠀day's⠀practical⠀matters⠀with⠀Murakami's⠀unhurried⠀precision:⠀weather,⠀food,⠀work,⠀errands,⠀prices,⠀letters,⠀visitors,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀a⠀road.⠀Then⠀let⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀or⠀moment⠀draw⠀the⠀writer's⠀private⠀attention—a⠀stain,⠀a⠀sound,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀a⠀person's⠀absence.⠀The⠀association⠀may⠀be⠀strange⠀or⠀unresolved;⠀the⠀writer⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀it⠀fully.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀frame⠀concrete.⠀What⠀the⠀writer⠀knows⠀about⠀events⠀beyond⠀the⠀household⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀depends⠀on⠀the⠀period's⠀communication,⠀travel,⠀and⠀social⠀access.⠀Let⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀enter⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀a⠀tax⠀or⠀rent,⠀a⠀market⠀day,⠀a⠀festival,⠀a⠀journey,⠀an⠀illness,⠀a⠀dispute,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀weather⠀or⠀the⠀harvest.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀entry⠀into⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀era.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀diary⠀to⠀accumulate⠀meaning⠀through⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀name,⠀object,⠀worry,⠀or⠀small⠀ritual⠀may⠀reappear⠀across⠀entries,⠀changing⠀slightly⠀as⠀circumstances⠀change.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀repetition⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀notice.⠀Use⠀seasonal⠀attention⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀setting⠀and⠀writer⠀support⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀inventory.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀entry⠀naturally⠀stops:⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀a⠀reflection,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀quiet.⠀The⠀entry⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀its⠀concerns⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀dramatic⠀turn.⠀Its⠀completeness⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀writer's⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀day⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀weight⠀it⠀carries.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀The⠀narration⠀stays⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀character's⠀perception⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀historical⠀place⠀and⠀moment.⠀Let⠀the⠀city,⠀town,⠀household,⠀or⠀neighborhood⠀register⠀through⠀that⠀character's⠀senses⠀and⠀private⠀concern:⠀the⠀heat,⠀the⠀noise,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀cooking⠀or⠀traffic,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀street,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀room⠀changes⠀with⠀the⠀light.\n\nDescribe⠀ordinary⠀surfaces⠀with⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀precision.⠀A⠀doorway,⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀ticket,⠀a⠀radio,⠀a⠀shirt,⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀window⠀left⠀open⠀can⠀carry⠀more⠀weight⠀than⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀explain.⠀Let⠀the⠀threshold⠀effect⠀remain⠀psychological:⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀may⠀feel⠀strange,⠀a⠀routine⠀may⠀seem⠀to⠀be⠀repeating,⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀seem⠀both⠀known⠀and⠀distant.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀register⠀this⠀unsettlement⠀without⠀confirming⠀any⠀impossible⠀cause.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀and⠀social⠀frame⠀concrete.⠀Work,⠀money,⠀transport,⠀housing,⠀family,⠀religion,⠀politics,⠀and⠀community⠀relationships⠀should⠀affect⠀the⠀character's⠀choices⠀and⠀attention⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀setting.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀temperament⠀or⠀a⠀magical⠀realist⠀atmosphere⠀where⠀the⠀world⠀excludes⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀character's⠀interior⠀life⠀move⠀between⠀observation,⠀memory,⠀and⠀anticipation.⠀They⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀implication,⠀miss⠀it,⠀or⠀interpret⠀it⠀incorrectly.⠀Their⠀private⠀thought⠀need⠀not⠀always⠀match⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀Show⠀the⠀small⠀practical⠀activities⠀that⠀fill⠀the⠀day—waiting,⠀walking,⠀working,⠀eating,⠀listening—and⠀let⠀the⠀historical⠀situation⠀press⠀on⠀them⠀through⠀those⠀activities⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀summary.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀or⠀action.⠀The⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀unease⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀dramatic⠀turn.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀moved⠀through⠀the⠀historical⠀moment⠀inside⠀this⠀particular⠀person's⠀perception,⠀with⠀its⠀specific⠀details⠀and⠀its⠀unresolved⠀private⠀weight.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀place,⠀doing⠀something⠀specific,⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀need⠀or⠀obligation⠀already⠀active.⠀Establish⠀the⠀period⠀conditions⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀itself—what⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀carrying,⠀wearing,⠀waiting⠀for,⠀or⠀trying⠀to⠀avoid—rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀era.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀the⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀street⠀to⠀a⠀building,⠀from⠀one⠀room⠀to⠀another,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀place⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀one,⠀mark⠀the⠀transition⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀detail:⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀light,⠀sound,⠀temperature,⠀or⠀footing.⠀Use⠀Murakami's⠀calm⠀precision⠀for⠀these⠀details,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀sentences⠀readable⠀and⠀the⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀frequent⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.\n\nGive⠀unfamiliar⠀period⠀mechanics⠀clear⠀presentation⠀when⠀they⠀matter.⠀A⠀tool,⠀document,⠀form⠀of⠀payment,⠀route,⠀or⠀social⠀rule⠀should⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀use,⠀with⠀enough⠀concrete⠀detail⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀understand⠀what⠀it⠀does⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀the⠀character.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀this⠀into⠀a⠀glossary⠀or⠀a⠀history⠀lecture;⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀handling⠀of⠀the⠀thing⠀carry⠀the⠀explanation.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀after⠀significant⠀moments.⠀A⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀quiet,⠀or⠀strange,⠀and⠀it⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀temperament⠀and⠀situation.⠀Let⠀the⠀reaction⠀sometimes⠀be⠀unresolved:⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀something⠀odd,⠀feel⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀air,⠀or⠀hesitate⠀without⠀understanding⠀why.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀witty⠀comeback,⠀a⠀dramatic⠀realization,⠀or⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀at⠀every⠀beat.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀historical⠀frame⠀through⠀practical⠀life.⠀Work,⠀money,⠀food,⠀transport,⠀family,⠀and⠀institutional⠀rules⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀next.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀scene—after⠀a⠀decision,⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀small⠀failure,⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀waiting—without⠀requiring⠀the⠀situation⠀to⠀resolve⠀or⠀reverse.⠀The⠀fast-readable⠀form⠀carries⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀through⠀clear⠀staging⠀and⠀private⠀attention,⠀not⠀through⠀compressed⠀action⠀alone.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀period⠀surface⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀handle,⠀watch,⠀or⠀wait⠀for:⠀a⠀latch⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀lifted⠀twice,⠀a⠀ledger⠀page⠀turned⠀under⠀a⠀clerk's⠀thumb,⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀lamp⠀is⠀trimmed⠀before⠀a⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀used.⠀Describe⠀its⠀physical⠀sequence⠀in⠀unhurried,⠀exact⠀clauses,⠀letting⠀the⠀syntax⠀follow⠀the⠀task⠀rather⠀than⠀hurry⠀past⠀it.⠀The⠀historical⠀condition⠀enters⠀through⠀that⠀sequence:⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀knows⠀about⠀the⠀period⠀is⠀what⠀the⠀surface⠀makes⠀available⠀through⠀work,⠀communication,⠀belief,⠀or⠀material⠀life.\n\nWhen⠀an⠀image⠀or⠀repeated⠀sound⠀arises⠀from⠀that⠀surface,⠀let⠀it⠀unfold⠀only⠀as⠀far⠀as⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀present.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀begin⠀as⠀practical⠀observation—the⠀latch's⠀second⠀catch⠀like⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀twice—and⠀then⠀open⠀into⠀a⠀private⠀association,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀teller's⠀memory.⠀Interrupt⠀the⠀figurative⠀movement⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀or⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀task⠀so⠀the⠀lyricism⠀has⠀contrast.⠀Recurring⠀sounds⠀or⠀images⠀return⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀them⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀required⠀motif⠀in⠀every⠀paragraph.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀strangeness⠀even.⠀An⠀unfamiliar⠀period⠀detail⠀is⠀described⠀as⠀calmly⠀as⠀a⠀familiar⠀one,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀concern⠀surfaces⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀without⠀being⠀announced.⠀Uncertainty⠀can⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register⠀does⠀not⠀belong⠀to⠀every⠀character;⠀other⠀speakers⠀may⠀answer⠀an⠀image⠀with⠀practical⠀speech,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀preserves⠀that⠀conversational⠀distance⠀rather⠀than⠀making⠀everyone⠀lyrical.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBegin⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀period⠀detail⠀that⠀has⠀changed⠀or⠀become⠀unavailable:⠀a⠀route⠀no⠀longer⠀used,⠀a⠀food⠀prepared⠀differently,⠀a⠀task⠀someone⠀else⠀now⠀performs,⠀a⠀phrase⠀whose⠀meaning⠀has⠀shifted.⠀Describe⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀in⠀exact,⠀unhurried⠀terms⠀before⠀any⠀reflection⠀begins.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀memory⠀move⠀toward⠀one⠀earlier⠀occasion⠀through⠀a⠀traceable⠀association—the⠀same⠀motion⠀of⠀the⠀hand,⠀the⠀same⠀sound⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀hour—without⠀leaving⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀determines⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀remembered,⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀possible,⠀so⠀the⠀reflection⠀stays⠀inside⠀those⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀a⠀general⠀meditation⠀on⠀time.\n\nLet⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀surface⠀during⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀and⠀recede⠀when⠀the⠀task⠀requires⠀attention.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change⠀only⠀because⠀the⠀routine⠀has⠀made⠀it⠀legible,⠀and⠀that⠀noticing⠀is⠀enough.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.⠀Some⠀details⠀remain⠀available,⠀some⠀pleasures⠀remain⠀intact,⠀and⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀present⠀experience⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available⠀can⠀be⠀carried⠀by⠀a⠀single⠀object⠀rather⠀than⠀stated⠀as⠀a⠀conclusion.\n\nPreserve⠀conversational⠀distance.⠀Another⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀share⠀the⠀narrator's⠀reflective⠀register,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀full⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion.⠀Unfinished⠀attachment⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished.⠀Treat⠀the⠀strangeness⠀of⠀the⠀period⠀evenly,⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀already⠀absorbed,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀melancholy⠀comes⠀from⠀particular⠀losses⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀vague⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀decline.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀situated⠀oral-framed⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀concrete⠀regional⠀route.⠀The⠀teller⠀speaks⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀listener⠀under⠀particular⠀period⠀conditions,⠀and⠀the⠀telling⠀remains⠀inside⠀those⠀conditions:⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀story⠀is⠀told,⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀and⠀the⠀frame⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀business⠀resumed⠀rather⠀than⠀with⠀a⠀moral.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent.⠀What⠀was⠀witnessed,⠀what⠀was⠀reported⠀by⠀another,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀uncertain⠀remain⠀distinguishable⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀account⠀into⠀a⠀legal⠀deposition.\n\nInside⠀the⠀frame,⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀describe⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀with⠀exact,⠀unhurried⠀care.⠀A⠀private⠀association⠀may⠀surface⠀through⠀that⠀detail—the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀bowl,⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀door⠀is⠀barred—and⠀the⠀strangeness⠀of⠀the⠀period⠀is⠀treated⠀evenly,⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀already⠀absorbed.⠀The⠀framed⠀story⠀may⠀shift⠀between⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion,⠀but⠀the⠀shift⠀is⠀motivated⠀by⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀a⠀listener's⠀response⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀an⠀announcement.\n\nDo⠀not⠀treat⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀religion,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀honor⠀code⠀as⠀universal⠀scene⠀requirements.⠀Use⠀the⠀particular⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀scenario.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀be⠀lyric,⠀reflective,⠀or⠀socially⠀concrete,⠀but⠀the⠀chosen⠀route⠀is⠀oral⠀framing:⠀the⠀story's⠀meaning⠀is⠀shaped⠀by⠀who⠀tells⠀it,⠀who⠀hears⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀telling⠀interrupts⠀or⠀delays.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀period⠀object,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀exchange⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀Describe⠀it⠀in⠀direct⠀clauses⠀without⠀explaining⠀what⠀it⠀stands⠀for.⠀When⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀recurs,⠀let⠀the⠀recurrence⠀alter⠀its⠀meaning⠀through⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀or⠀circumstance—the⠀same⠀key⠀now⠀turned⠀by⠀a⠀different⠀hand,⠀the⠀same⠀route⠀now⠀taken⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀reason—rather⠀than⠀through⠀added⠀commentary.⠀Historical⠀information⠀enters⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀handles,⠀observes,⠀or⠀must⠀work⠀around,⠀not⠀through⠀background⠀exposition.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀movement⠀economical.⠀An⠀inward⠀connection⠀appears⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account,⠀but⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable:⠀a⠀task⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀question⠀not⠀asked,⠀a⠀route⠀not⠀taken.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀understand⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀or⠀refrains⠀from⠀acting⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀say⠀so.\n\nLet⠀the⠀strangeness⠀remain⠀even⠀and⠀unresolved.⠀An⠀unfamiliar⠀period⠀fact⠀is⠀stated⠀as⠀plainly⠀as⠀a⠀familiar⠀one,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀concern⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀only⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀choice⠀of⠀what⠀to⠀notice.⠀Preserve⠀conversational⠀distance.⠀Other⠀characters⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀translate⠀every⠀implication⠀into⠀feeling.⠀The⠀result⠀is⠀not⠀coldness;⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀style⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀selected⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀withheld⠀explanation⠀do⠀the⠀emotional⠀work.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀calm⠀practical⠀attention⠀set⠀the⠀pace:⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀described⠀in⠀exact⠀sequence,⠀a⠀conversation⠀pauses⠀while⠀something⠀is⠀fetched⠀or⠀checked,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀association⠀surfaces⠀during⠀the⠀pause⠀without⠀being⠀announced.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery⠀or⠀summary⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀already⠀been⠀shown.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀period⠀present⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀exposition.⠀What⠀people⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do⠀is⠀determined⠀by⠀the⠀scenario's⠀location,⠀social⠀position,⠀and⠀institutions.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀inner⠀experience⠀remains⠀inside⠀those⠀conditions.⠀A⠀recollection⠀may⠀be⠀prompted⠀by⠀a⠀period⠀object⠀or⠀routine,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀historical⠀significance⠀of⠀everything⠀noticed.\n\nLet⠀the⠀strangeness⠀remain⠀even⠀and⠀unresolved.⠀An⠀unfamiliar⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀treated⠀as⠀ordinary⠀by⠀the⠀narrator,⠀and⠀a⠀familiar⠀detail⠀may⠀acquire⠀private⠀weight.⠀Preserve⠀conversational⠀distance:⠀other⠀characters⠀speak⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀registers,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator's⠀inner⠀life⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀legible⠀to⠀them.⠀The⠀contemporary-novel⠀presentation⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀contemporary⠀setting,⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply,⠀or⠀realism⠀as⠀the⠀only⠀possible⠀world⠀physics.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀as⠀the⠀organizing⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Make⠀the⠀premise⠀legible⠀through⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀application,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀person,⠀a⠀small⠀arrangement⠀that⠀only⠀the⠀two⠀of⠀them⠀understand,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀choice.⠀Let⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀have⠀enough⠀space⠀where⠀it⠀belongs,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀the⠀premise⠀does⠀not⠀establish.\n\nGround⠀the⠀relationship⠀in⠀period⠀conditions.⠀What⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀say,⠀arrange,⠀obtain,⠀or⠀do⠀together⠀is⠀determined⠀by⠀the⠀scenario's⠀location,⠀social⠀position,⠀and⠀institutions.⠀A⠀private⠀language⠀develops⠀around⠀what⠀the⠀period⠀makes⠀available:⠀a⠀shared⠀route,⠀a⠀particular⠀object,⠀a⠀phrase⠀from⠀work⠀or⠀belief.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀payoff⠀comes⠀from⠀those⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀contemporary⠀template⠀of⠀confession⠀or⠀resolution.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Murakami-mode⠀distance⠀even⠀inside⠀intimacy.⠀The⠀narrator⠀notices⠀an⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀private⠀weight,⠀and⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀say⠀everything⠀they⠀feel.⠀Repeated⠀moments⠀deepen⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀rather⠀than⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀scene.⠀The⠀telling⠀remains⠀unhurried⠀and⠀exact,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀arrives⠀through⠀the⠀accumulation⠀of⠀small⠀legible⠀acts⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀an⠀announced⠀climax.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀a⠀chronicle⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀deliberately,⠀use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀remembered⠀act,⠀and⠀let⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Relate⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀scale⠀honest⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene.⠀A⠀practical⠀undertaking⠀may⠀earn⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀lived⠀with⠀its⠀consequences,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀resembles⠀a⠀legendary⠀exploit.\n\nUse⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀for⠀recurrence.⠀Who⠀lent⠀the⠀thing,⠀who⠀repaired⠀it,⠀who⠀still⠀tells⠀the⠀story⠀differently:⠀these⠀particulars⠀carry⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀Keep⠀shared⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀private⠀experience.⠀Being⠀remembered⠀as⠀dependable⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀work⠀was⠀effortless,⠀cheerful,⠀or⠀automatic.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀private⠀associations⠀may⠀surface⠀through⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀routine,⠀but⠀the⠀chronicle⠀voice⠀should⠀not⠀absorb⠀every⠀character⠀into⠀the⠀same⠀elevated⠀register.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀retelling.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀object⠀to⠀one⠀detail⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective,⠀and⠀preserve⠀unresolved⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀a⠀social-realist⠀route:⠀the⠀narrative⠀advances⠀through⠀observable⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀situations⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀private⠀introspection⠀alone.⠀Let⠀household⠀management,⠀workplace⠀obligations,⠀institutional⠀procedures,⠀neighborly⠀encounters,⠀and⠀family⠀expectations⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀character's⠀social⠀position⠀determines⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do,⠀and⠀those⠀limits⠀appear⠀as⠀particular⠀constraints:⠀a⠀letter⠀must⠀wait⠀for⠀the⠀post,⠀a⠀room⠀must⠀be⠀heated,⠀a⠀tool⠀must⠀be⠀borrowed,⠀a⠀workplace⠀rule⠀must⠀be⠀followed.⠀Render⠀the⠀specific⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀cost⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀the⠀condition.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀unhurried⠀and⠀exact⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀manner.⠀Describe⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀activities⠀in⠀calm,⠀even⠀prose:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀walking⠀a⠀known⠀route,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀delivery,⠀repairing⠀an⠀object,⠀completing⠀a⠀shift.⠀Let⠀the⠀social-realist⠀situation⠀generate⠀the⠀strangeness:⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀feels⠀wrong⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀learned,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀gathers⠀private⠀significance⠀through⠀a⠀domestic⠀or⠀institutional⠀association,⠀and⠀a⠀conversation⠀about⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀carries⠀an⠀unspoken⠀concern.⠀Uncertainty⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀and⠀social⠀facts⠀stay⠀stable.\n\nUse⠀focal⠀prose⠀for⠀interiority.⠀The⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀hesitation,⠀attention,⠀and⠀unspoken⠀worry⠀are⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀but⠀not⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Let⠀conversation⠀carry⠀distance:⠀people⠀speak⠀around⠀what⠀they⠀mean,⠀answer⠀a⠀practical⠀question⠀while⠀thinking⠀of⠀something⠀else,⠀or⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀situation⠀seems⠀to⠀demand.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀private⠀concern⠀into⠀dialogue.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀a⠀particular⠀Scandinavian⠀location⠀and⠀period,⠀use⠀that⠀location's⠀actual⠀institutions,⠀domestic⠀arrangements,⠀and⠀routines;⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀is⠀set⠀elsewhere,⠀keep⠀the⠀social-realist⠀method⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀Scandinavian⠀scenery,⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀a⠀national⠀temperament.⠀The⠀style⠀selects⠀the⠀narrative⠀approach,⠀not⠀the⠀cast⠀or⠀setting.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀keep⠀action⠀lines⠀concise⠀and⠀readable.⠀Describe⠀what⠀is⠀visible⠀or⠀audible:⠀a⠀character⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀tool,⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀counter,⠀reads⠀a⠀notice,⠀walks⠀a⠀corridor,⠀or⠀pauses⠀before⠀answering.⠀Let⠀period⠀constraints⠀appear⠀through⠀these⠀actions.⠀A⠀message⠀takes⠀the⠀form⠀of⠀a⠀letter⠀handed⠀over,⠀a⠀telegram⠀read⠀aloud,⠀or⠀a⠀note⠀left⠀at⠀a⠀workplace;⠀a⠀journey⠀takes⠀the⠀time⠀its⠀historical⠀conditions⠀require.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀constraint⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line;⠀show⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀the⠀constraint⠀produces.\n\nGive⠀dialogue⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀keep⠀it⠀unhurried.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀practically⠀while⠀withholding⠀private⠀concern,⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀delay,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀sentence⠀unfinished.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀every⠀thought.⠀Use⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀or⠀a⠀cut⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀notes⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀A⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀hesitates⠀to⠀say,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀not⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀voice-over⠀or⠀a⠀performed⠀aside.⠀Let⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀note⠀supplies⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀experience.\n\nRender⠀strangeness⠀through⠀the⠀visible⠀surface.⠀When⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀feels⠀altered⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows,⠀show⠀the⠀alteration⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀action:⠀the⠀character⠀pauses⠀before⠀a⠀routine⠀act,⠀looks⠀at⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀longer⠀than⠀usual,⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀cup⠀without⠀drinking,⠀or⠀turns⠀toward⠀a⠀sound⠀that⠀would⠀normally⠀pass⠀unnoticed.⠀The⠀action⠀line⠀registers⠀the⠀hesitation⠀or⠀the⠀look;⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀supplies⠀the⠀private⠀concern⠀behind⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀state⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀that⠀the⠀room⠀feels⠀altered.⠀Uncertainty⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀while⠀the⠀scene's⠀observable⠀facts⠀stay⠀stable.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Let⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene:⠀a⠀character⠀folds⠀a⠀garment,⠀checks⠀a⠀ledger,⠀sets⠀a⠀kettle,⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀door,⠀or⠀moves⠀a⠀chair.⠀Use⠀objects⠀and⠀blocking⠀to⠀make⠀historical⠀conditions⠀observable.⠀A⠀task⠀takes⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀tools⠀its⠀period⠀requires;⠀a⠀message⠀arrives⠀through⠀a⠀person⠀entering⠀with⠀a⠀letter⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀narrated⠀exposition.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀constraint⠀in⠀the⠀stage⠀direction;⠀show⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀the⠀constraint⠀produces.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀unhurried⠀and⠀socially⠀distant⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀manner.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀about⠀the⠀immediate⠀task⠀while⠀withholding⠀private⠀concern,⠀pause⠀before⠀answering,⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀line⠀trail⠀off.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀thought⠀into⠀speech.⠀Use⠀monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀have⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀interiority.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation.⠀This⠀material⠀records⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀hesitates⠀to⠀say,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear⠀and⠀not⠀a⠀performed⠀aside.⠀Let⠀the⠀staged⠀scene⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀supplies⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀actual⠀experience.\n\nRender⠀strangeness⠀through⠀the⠀staged⠀surface.⠀When⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀feels⠀wrong⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀learned,⠀show⠀the⠀wrongness⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀action:⠀the⠀character⠀pauses⠀before⠀a⠀routine⠀task,⠀looks⠀at⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀longer⠀than⠀usual,⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀cup⠀without⠀drinking,⠀or⠀lets⠀a⠀silence⠀lengthen⠀before⠀answering.⠀The⠀stage⠀direction⠀registers⠀the⠀hesitation⠀or⠀the⠀look;⠀the⠀nonspoken⠀material⠀supplies⠀the⠀private⠀concern⠀behind⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀write⠀a⠀stage⠀direction⠀that⠀states⠀the⠀room⠀feels⠀wrong.⠀Uncertainty⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀while⠀the⠀scene's⠀observable⠀facts⠀stay⠀stable.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀and⠀let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀those⠀associations.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀imagined,⠀or⠀feared.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀turn⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀enter⠀the⠀mental⠀flow⠀as⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀that⠀recur⠀with⠀changed⠀significance.⠀A⠀remembered⠀price⠀returns⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀expense⠀appears;⠀a⠀workplace⠀rule⠀surfaces⠀when⠀a⠀choice⠀is⠀contemplated;⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool⠀returns⠀when⠀the⠀body⠀performs⠀a⠀familiar⠀task;⠀the⠀time⠀a⠀letter⠀takes⠀to⠀arrive⠀returns⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀waits⠀or⠀decides⠀not⠀to⠀wait.⠀The⠀character's⠀social⠀position⠀appears⠀as⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀or⠀avoids:⠀a⠀debt,⠀an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀letter⠀not⠀yet⠀sent,⠀a⠀permission⠀not⠀yet⠀granted.⠀These⠀limits⠀are⠀not⠀summarized;⠀they⠀surface⠀through⠀the⠀associations⠀the⠀mind⠀makes.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀movement⠀unhurried⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀manner.⠀Ordinary⠀practical⠀activities⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀body⠀while⠀the⠀mind⠀drifts:⠀washing,⠀walking,⠀waiting,⠀preparing⠀food,⠀completing⠀a⠀familiar⠀task.⠀Let⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀association⠀gather⠀private⠀significance.⠀Strangeness⠀remains⠀psychological⠀and⠀even;⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀can⠀feel⠀altered⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀learned,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀facts⠀stay⠀stable.\n\nDo⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀association⠀into⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀force⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀resolve⠀its⠀concern⠀before⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.⠀Let⠀the⠀associations⠀accumulate⠀as⠀private⠀concern⠀while⠀the⠀body⠀continues⠀its⠀routine.⠀Uncertainty⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved.⠀The⠀technique⠀is⠀associative⠀mental⠀movement,⠀not⠀ordinary⠀reasoning⠀narrated⠀step⠀by⠀step.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Include⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀sender⠀writes⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀waits⠀before⠀replying,⠀another⠀leaves⠀a⠀message⠀unfinished.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀shape⠀the⠀exchange⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀transcript⠀itself⠀shows.⠀A⠀gap⠀between⠀messages⠀reflects⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀period⠀without⠀access;⠀a⠀short⠀reply⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀interval⠀reflects⠀cost,⠀time,⠀or⠀the⠀limits⠀of⠀the⠀available⠀channel;⠀a⠀message⠀sent⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀hour⠀reflects⠀a⠀work⠀schedule;⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀meeting⠀place⠀reflects⠀travel⠀time.⠀Do⠀not⠀silently⠀modernize⠀the⠀period's⠀communication.⠀When⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀moment⠀and⠀technology,⠀use⠀what⠀that⠀moment⠀permits,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀transcript's⠀rhythm⠀show⠀the⠀constraint.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀messages⠀unhurried⠀and⠀distant⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀manner.⠀People⠀may⠀write⠀about⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀while⠀withholding⠀private⠀concern,⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀indirectly,⠀or⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀the⠀situation⠀seems⠀to⠀demand.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀objects⠀and⠀routines⠀enter⠀the⠀exchange⠀naturally:⠀a⠀delayed⠀reply⠀because⠀of⠀a⠀shift,⠀a⠀message⠀about⠀a⠀borrowed⠀item,⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀a⠀meeting⠀place.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript.⠀This⠀context⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀hesitates⠀to⠀send,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀transmitted⠀message⠀and⠀not⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀sender.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Strangeness⠀remains⠀psychological⠀and⠀even;⠀uncertainty⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved⠀while⠀the⠀exchange's⠀observable⠀facts⠀stay⠀stable.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀and⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Let⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene:⠀a⠀short⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀focal⠀reaction,⠀a⠀pause.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.\n\nLet⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀carry⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀through⠀particular⠀objects⠀and⠀actions.⠀A⠀background⠀cue⠀may⠀show⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀stove,⠀a⠀posted⠀notice,⠀a⠀waiting⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀street⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀shopfront;⠀the⠀object⠀carries⠀a⠀period⠀constraint—a⠀task⠀to⠀complete,⠀a⠀rule⠀to⠀follow,⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀wait⠀for.⠀An⠀expression⠀cue⠀registers⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀or⠀hesitation,⠀not⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀these⠀cues⠀into⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀unhurried⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀manner.⠀Ordinary⠀practical⠀activities⠀may⠀occupy⠀the⠀focal⠀character:⠀waiting,⠀preparing⠀food,⠀walking⠀a⠀known⠀route,⠀completing⠀a⠀task.⠀Let⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀gather⠀private⠀significance.⠀Strangeness⠀remains⠀psychological⠀and⠀even;⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀can⠀feel⠀altered⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀knows,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀facts⠀stay⠀stable.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀This⠀material⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀but⠀not⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction⠀follow⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀staged⠀action⠀and⠀supply⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀that⠀the⠀image⠀cannot.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀private⠀thought⠀into⠀dialogue.⠀Conversation⠀may⠀stay⠀distant:⠀people⠀speak⠀around⠀what⠀they⠀mean,⠀answer⠀practically⠀while⠀thinking⠀of⠀something⠀else,⠀or⠀leave⠀a⠀sentence⠀unfinished.⠀Uncertainty⠀may⠀remain⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiajbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Haruki⠀Murakami⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀At⠀the⠀start⠀of⠀an⠀installment,⠀recover⠀only⠀the⠀context⠀that⠀helps:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changed⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀investigation⠀or⠀routine.⠀Let⠀selected⠀earlier⠀particulars⠀return⠀as⠀concrete⠀objects,⠀places,⠀people,⠀or⠀arrangements⠀shown⠀under⠀a⠀new⠀condition:⠀a⠀borrowed⠀tool⠀is⠀returned⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀mark,⠀a⠀familiar⠀route⠀is⠀walked⠀with⠀different⠀knowledge,⠀a⠀postponed⠀letter⠀arrives⠀with⠀news⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀waiting.⠀The⠀return⠀deepens⠀the⠀particular's⠀significance⠀rather⠀than⠀restarting⠀the⠀same⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀progress.⠀Work,⠀communication,⠀travel,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀take⠀their⠀period-specific⠀time.⠀A⠀task⠀may⠀span⠀installments⠀because⠀materials⠀must⠀be⠀obtained;⠀a⠀message⠀may⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀courier,⠀post,⠀or⠀messenger;⠀a⠀repair⠀may⠀require⠀a⠀part⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀ordered.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources,⠀not⠀only⠀completed⠀events.⠀Show⠀the⠀constraint⠀as⠀the⠀installment's⠀actual⠀waiting,⠀travel,⠀or⠀work⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀unhurried⠀in⠀Murakami's⠀manner.⠀Ordinary⠀practical⠀activities⠀may⠀occupy⠀a⠀scene:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀waiting,⠀walking,⠀completing⠀a⠀shift.⠀Let⠀an⠀ordinary⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀association⠀gather⠀private⠀significance.⠀Strangeness⠀remains⠀psychological⠀and⠀even;⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀can⠀feel⠀altered⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀learned,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀facts⠀stay⠀stable.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀across⠀installments.⠀The⠀focal⠀character's⠀reasoning,⠀hesitation,⠀attention,⠀and⠀unspoken⠀worry⠀are⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀but⠀not⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Conversation⠀may⠀stay⠀distant.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nTreat⠀the⠀period's⠀social⠀forms⠀as⠀the⠀actual⠀site⠀of⠀emotional⠀injury.⠀A⠀visit,⠀an⠀offer,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀letter,⠀an⠀introduction,⠀or⠀a⠀financial⠀arrangement⠀should⠀force⠀someone⠀to⠀choose⠀between⠀what⠀they⠀feel⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀situation⠀permits⠀them⠀to⠀say.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀characters⠀uniformly⠀articulate⠀about⠀their⠀pain.⠀Let⠀one⠀person⠀speak⠀with⠀careful⠀civility⠀while⠀the⠀narrative⠀exposes⠀what⠀that⠀civility⠀costs,⠀and⠀let⠀another⠀person's⠀bluntness⠀damage⠀the⠀room⠀without⠀producing⠀a⠀clean⠀reconciliation.\n\nUse⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀to⠀show⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀interpreting⠀a⠀small⠀social⠀signal⠀and⠀then⠀living⠀with⠀the⠀interpretation.⠀The⠀narrative⠀may⠀reveal⠀that⠀she⠀has⠀mistaken⠀a⠀pause⠀for⠀coldness,⠀or⠀that⠀she⠀has⠀understood⠀an⠀insult⠀exactly⠀and⠀cannot⠀answer⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀judgment⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀mind.⠀Another⠀character's⠀actual⠀motive⠀remains⠀his⠀own.⠀When⠀the⠀scene⠀shifts,⠀show⠀the⠀strain⠀in⠀subsequent⠀behavior:⠀a⠀task⠀performed⠀too⠀slowly,⠀a⠀question⠀asked⠀too⠀late,⠀a⠀courtesy⠀offered⠀with⠀excessive⠀precision,⠀a⠀silence⠀where⠀an⠀explanation⠀was⠀expected.\n\nLet⠀warmth⠀and⠀pain⠀coexist⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀repaired⠀relationship.⠀A⠀sincere⠀kindness⠀may⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀form⠀that⠀still⠀reminds⠀the⠀recipient⠀of⠀her⠀dependence.⠀An⠀apology⠀may⠀be⠀offered⠀and⠀accepted⠀while⠀the⠀original⠀wound⠀remains⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀tragic⠀ending,⠀a⠀final⠀rupture,⠀or⠀a⠀compulsory⠀moment⠀of⠀emotional⠀breakthrough.⠀The⠀method⠀is⠀to⠀make⠀social⠀life⠀exert⠀continuous⠀pressure⠀on⠀private⠀feeling,⠀not⠀to⠀force⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀crisis.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀pressure⠀leaves⠀it,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀difficulty⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀shared⠀interval⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀scene⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀speakers.⠀Begin⠀each⠀new⠀speech⠀or⠀significant⠀action⠀with⠀clear⠀attribution,⠀and⠀keep⠀narrative⠀passages⠀short⠀enough⠀for⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀social⠀situation⠀at⠀a⠀glance.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀and⠀institutional⠀constraints⠀appear⠀through⠀concrete⠀details:⠀who⠀may⠀call,⠀what⠀a⠀letter⠀costs,⠀which⠀invitation⠀matters,⠀what⠀a⠀servant's⠀presence⠀prevents,⠀what⠀a⠀room's⠀arrangement⠀implies.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Austen⠀profile's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀focal⠀reaction⠀rather⠀than⠀omniscient⠀explanation.⠀After⠀a⠀speech⠀or⠀gesture,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀how⠀she⠀reads⠀it.⠀She⠀may⠀infer⠀too⠀much,⠀miss⠀a⠀practical⠀motive,⠀or⠀recognize⠀a⠀slight⠀she⠀cannot⠀answer.⠀Keep⠀that⠀reading⠀hers.⠀Another⠀character's⠀private⠀intention⠀remains⠀unavailable⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀access.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀pause⠀into⠀a⠀hidden⠀meaning;⠀let⠀some⠀social⠀details⠀simply⠀establish⠀the⠀world.\n\nResolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point.⠀The⠀next⠀participant⠀may⠀speak,⠀act,⠀leave,⠀or⠀change⠀the⠀subject.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀forced⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀Keep⠀NPCs⠀active⠀and⠀the⠀world⠀moving,⠀but⠀stop⠀where⠀the⠀current⠀interval⠀naturally⠀rests.⠀The⠀Austen⠀profile⠀supplies⠀social⠀attention⠀and⠀irony,⠀not⠀a⠀compulsory⠀courtship⠀plot⠀or⠀uniformly⠀polished⠀speech.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realist⠀route.⠀Shape⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀vernacular,⠀episode-like⠀sequence⠀in⠀which⠀each⠀encounter⠀exposes⠀a⠀working⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀order:⠀an⠀inheritance,⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀reputation,⠀a⠀visit⠀whose⠀timing⠀reveals⠀rank.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrative⠀move⠀through⠀these⠀episodes⠀with⠀clear⠀causal⠀links,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀how⠀one⠀household⠀decision⠀produces⠀the⠀next⠀social⠀difficulty.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Austen⠀profile's⠀domestic⠀scale⠀and⠀focal⠀irony.⠀Show⠀what⠀people⠀believe⠀about⠀themselves⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀conversation⠀or⠀circumstances⠀reveal.⠀A⠀parent⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀match⠀as⠀prudent⠀while⠀the⠀narrative⠀exposes⠀the⠀financial⠀anxiety⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀suitor⠀may⠀perform⠀generosity⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀what⠀the⠀performance⠀costs⠀someone⠀else.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀satire⠀become⠀a⠀general⠀denunciation.⠀Attach⠀each⠀judgment⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀mind⠀and⠀a⠀particular⠀exchange.\n\nUse⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀Chinese⠀setting,⠀cast,⠀or⠀language⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀route⠀comes⠀from⠀Chinese⠀literary⠀traditions.⠀The⠀route⠀governs⠀narrative⠀construction:⠀episodic⠀social⠀exposure,⠀satirical⠀clarity⠀about⠀family⠀and⠀money,⠀and⠀vernacular⠀readability.⠀It⠀does⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀new⠀national⠀setting.⠀End⠀an⠀episode⠀where⠀its⠀social⠀consequence⠀becomes⠀legible,⠀not⠀necessarily⠀where⠀the⠀emotional⠀difficulty⠀is⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀significant⠀detail⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀explanatory⠀padding.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀conditions⠀appear⠀through⠀specific⠀wear⠀and⠀practical⠀stakes:⠀a⠀frayed⠀cuff,⠀a⠀cold⠀room,⠀a⠀delayed⠀letter,⠀a⠀coin⠀counted⠀twice,⠀a⠀road⠀too⠀wet⠀for⠀a⠀promised⠀visit,⠀a⠀servant's⠀tired⠀face.⠀Use⠀these⠀details⠀to⠀carry⠀social⠀meaning.⠀A⠀worn⠀garment⠀may⠀indicate⠀not⠀only⠀poverty⠀but⠀a⠀family's⠀effort⠀to⠀appear⠀respectable.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Austen⠀profile's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀focal⠀observation⠀and⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment.⠀Show⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀reading⠀a⠀gesture,⠀an⠀omission,⠀or⠀an⠀offer⠀in⠀terms⠀of⠀money,⠀rank,⠀family,⠀and⠀reputation.⠀Let⠀the⠀judgment⠀be⠀sharp⠀and⠀particular,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀moral.⠀Another⠀character's⠀motive⠀remains⠀his⠀own.⠀When⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀needed,⠀retain⠀it;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀the⠀scene⠀move⠀quickly⠀from⠀speech⠀to⠀consequence.\n\nGround⠀rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀blunt⠀remark⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀that⠀character's⠀position,⠀temper,⠀or⠀interest,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀universal⠀gritty⠀tone.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀into⠀survival⠀horror⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀hostile.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀pressure-oriented⠀prose,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀that⠀every⠀comfort⠀fail⠀or⠀every⠀relationship⠀become⠀brutal.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀material⠀and⠀social⠀consequence⠀is⠀clear.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry,⠀a⠀household⠀account,⠀a⠀note,⠀a⠀formal⠀reply,⠀or⠀another⠀record⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀situation.⠀Do⠀not⠀rotate⠀through⠀forms⠀mechanically.⠀Let⠀the⠀document's⠀writer⠀decide⠀what⠀to⠀record⠀and⠀what⠀to⠀omit⠀according⠀to⠀his⠀or⠀her⠀position,⠀interest,⠀and⠀audience.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Austen⠀profile's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀documents.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀describe⠀an⠀offer⠀as⠀generous⠀while⠀a⠀household⠀account⠀reveals⠀the⠀debt⠀behind⠀it.⠀A⠀journal⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀caller's⠀courtesy⠀while⠀omitting⠀the⠀writer's⠀own⠀embarrassment.⠀A⠀reply⠀may⠀be⠀delayed⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀reason⠀that⠀the⠀recipient⠀reads⠀as⠀a⠀slight.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀assemble⠀the⠀fuller⠀social⠀meaning⠀from⠀conflicting⠀accounts,⠀omissions,⠀and⠀material⠀traces.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀across⠀entries.⠀Show⠀the⠀time⠀and⠀situation⠀of⠀each⠀document⠀through⠀its⠀heading,⠀salutation,⠀or⠀surrounding⠀detail.⠀Let⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀event⠀and⠀revise⠀its⠀meaning⠀without⠀claiming⠀that⠀the⠀earlier⠀writer⠀knew⠀what⠀the⠀later⠀writer⠀has⠀learned.⠀Keep⠀the⠀period's⠀communication⠀constraints⠀active:⠀a⠀letter⠀may⠀arrive⠀late,⠀be⠀read⠀aloud,⠀be⠀answered⠀under⠀pressure,⠀or⠀be⠀kept⠀from⠀someone.⠀End⠀an⠀entry⠀where⠀its⠀document⠀naturally⠀closes,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀larger⠀difficulty⠀remains⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀practical⠀care⠀within⠀the⠀period's⠀social⠀world.⠀Show⠀someone⠀remembering⠀a⠀preference,⠀arranging⠀a⠀small⠀comfort,⠀making⠀room⠀for⠀another⠀person's⠀ease,⠀or⠀offering⠀help⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀actual⠀constraints⠀of⠀the⠀setting.⠀Let⠀the⠀warmth⠀appear⠀in⠀particular⠀actions:⠀a⠀fire⠀lit⠀early,⠀a⠀seat⠀saved,⠀a⠀letter⠀carried,⠀a⠀difficult⠀task⠀quietly⠀taken⠀over,⠀a⠀familiar⠀joke⠀returned⠀at⠀the⠀right⠀moment.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀Affection⠀may⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀still⠀remain⠀partly⠀unspoken.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀Austen⠀profile's⠀social⠀attention⠀through⠀focal⠀observation⠀and⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀judgment⠀be⠀affectionate⠀rather⠀than⠀satirical.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀kindness⠀is⠀clumsy,⠀that⠀a⠀compliment⠀is⠀sincere,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀preference⠀has⠀been⠀remembered.⠀She⠀may⠀also⠀notice⠀a⠀small⠀friction⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀pass.⠀Preserve⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy.⠀A⠀character⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀agreeable,⠀explain⠀every⠀feeling,⠀or⠀abandon⠀a⠀real⠀disagreement⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀warm.\n\nDo⠀not⠀erase⠀established⠀problems⠀from⠀the⠀world.⠀A⠀family⠀difficulty,⠀a⠀financial⠀worry,⠀or⠀a⠀social⠀slight⠀may⠀remain⠀present⠀while⠀the⠀scene⠀still⠀offers⠀comfort.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀a⠀treatment⠀of⠀attention⠀and⠀tone,⠀not⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀every⠀difficulty⠀resolves⠀pleasantly.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀moment⠀of⠀care⠀or⠀ease⠀naturally⠀rests,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀tidy⠀conclusion.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene⠀open⠀through⠀its⠀social⠀situation:⠀who⠀is⠀expected,⠀what⠀the⠀visit⠀or⠀letter⠀means,⠀what⠀obligation⠀or⠀hope⠀brings⠀these⠀people⠀together.⠀Use⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀frame⠀the⠀exchange⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀or⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀formal.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Austen⠀profile's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀mind.⠀Show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀believes⠀about⠀herself⠀and⠀what⠀conversation⠀or⠀circumstance⠀reveals.⠀A⠀courteous⠀offer⠀may⠀carry⠀an⠀unspoken⠀condition.⠀A⠀family⠀discussion⠀may⠀expose⠀the⠀financial⠀anxiety⠀beneath⠀a⠀show⠀of⠀principle.⠀A⠀pause⠀may⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀approval,⠀reluctance,⠀or⠀simple⠀distraction.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀interpret⠀the⠀moment,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrative⠀measure⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀her⠀interpretation⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀actually⠀shows.⠀Keep⠀other⠀characters'⠀private⠀motives⠀outside⠀her⠀knowledge⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits⠀access.\n\nLet⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀relevant.⠀A⠀formal⠀visit⠀may⠀give⠀way⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀exchange.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀be⠀composed⠀for⠀one⠀audience⠀and⠀read⠀by⠀another.⠀Use⠀these⠀structures⠀to⠀deepen⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀marriage⠀plot⠀or⠀a⠀uniformly⠀polished⠀cast.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀social⠀and⠀emotional⠀movement⠀naturally⠀rests,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀larger⠀question⠀remains⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nTreat⠀an⠀embedded⠀tale⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀transaction⠀that⠀enters⠀an⠀already⠀active⠀outer⠀situation.⠀Open⠀with⠀the⠀request,⠀permission,⠀or⠀expectation⠀that⠀produces⠀the⠀telling,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀material⠀position⠀govern⠀what⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀safely⠀include.⠀A⠀dependent⠀relation⠀may⠀turn⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀a⠀petition;⠀a⠀person⠀of⠀credit⠀may⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀justify⠀a⠀decision⠀the⠀listeners⠀have⠀not⠀yet⠀accepted.\n\nRender⠀the⠀telling⠀through⠀a⠀focal⠀listener's⠀or⠀teller's⠀free⠀indirect⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀a⠀detached⠀observer's⠀summary.⠀Follow⠀what⠀one⠀consciousness⠀notices⠀in⠀the⠀performance:⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀name,⠀the⠀emphasis⠀given⠀to⠀an⠀act⠀of⠀generosity,⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀listener's⠀courtesy⠀becomes⠀fixed⠀attention.⠀Let⠀the⠀embedded⠀story's⠀selection⠀itself⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀social⠀choice.⠀When⠀the⠀tale⠀praises⠀someone,⠀show⠀what⠀relation⠀the⠀praise⠀is⠀meant⠀to⠀secure;⠀when⠀it⠀blames⠀someone,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀stands⠀to⠀gain⠀by⠀making⠀that⠀blame⠀public.⠀The⠀tale⠀may⠀be⠀true⠀while⠀still⠀serving⠀an⠀interest.\n\nClose⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀consequence⠀of⠀the⠀telling.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀grant⠀a⠀request,⠀revise⠀an⠀opinion,⠀repeat⠀the⠀story⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀emphasis,⠀or⠀withhold⠀the⠀response⠀the⠀teller⠀wanted.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀cross⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀and⠀change⠀force:⠀a⠀formula⠀of⠀courtesy⠀used⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀be⠀spoken⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀with⠀new⠀pressure,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀named⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀reappear⠀where⠀its⠀presence⠀answers⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀ask⠀aloud.⠀Delay⠀revelation⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀delay⠀has⠀a⠀social⠀cause,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀listener⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀safer⠀moment⠀to⠀speak.⠀Keep⠀the⠀levels⠀distinct⠀in⠀attribution,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀audience⠀can⠀know⠀or⠀expect⠀without⠀importing⠀a⠀court,⠀magical⠀bargain,⠀or⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Choose⠀one⠀recurring⠀institutional⠀or⠀material⠀relation⠀that⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀must⠀encounter⠀more⠀than⠀once:⠀a⠀household⠀account,⠀a⠀guild⠀regulation,⠀a⠀parish⠀obligation,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀answered,⠀or⠀a⠀journey⠀that⠀depends⠀on⠀another⠀person's⠀permission.⠀Let⠀that⠀relation⠀become⠀the⠀spine⠀of⠀the⠀developmental⠀arc.\n\nAt⠀each⠀encounter,⠀render⠀the⠀character's⠀self-description⠀in⠀free⠀indirect⠀terms,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀surrounding⠀scene⠀supply⠀the⠀correction.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀adopts⠀the⠀character's⠀view⠀of⠀their⠀own⠀generosity,⠀prudence,⠀or⠀injury,⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀detail⠀that⠀complicates⠀it:⠀another⠀person's⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀practical⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀the⠀visible⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀choice.⠀The⠀irony⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀self-description⠀and⠀social⠀consequence,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀detached⠀contempt.⠀Keep⠀the⠀judgment⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character.\n\nLet⠀development⠀occur⠀through⠀the⠀accumulating⠀difference⠀between⠀one⠀encounter⠀and⠀the⠀next.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀first⠀name⠀a⠀constraint⠀as⠀bad⠀luck,⠀then⠀as⠀another⠀person's⠀fault,⠀and⠀only⠀later⠀recognize⠀their⠀own⠀dependence⠀or⠀the⠀labor⠀that⠀sustains⠀their⠀comfort.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀change;⠀let⠀the⠀later⠀self-description⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀earlier⠀one⠀could⠀not⠀admit.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀determines⠀what⠀alternatives⠀are⠀actually⠀available,⠀and⠀the⠀story⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀partial⠀adjustment,⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀constraint.⠀Syntax⠀may⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀analytic,⠀but⠀the⠀emotional⠀register⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀carry⠀an⠀intimate⠀political⠀atmosphere⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀inherited⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀decaying⠀estate,⠀a⠀family⠀privilege⠀that⠀still⠀controls⠀access,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀binds⠀one⠀person⠀to⠀another,⠀or⠀a⠀custom⠀that⠀survives⠀because⠀someone⠀benefits⠀from⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀treat⠀these⠀as⠀scenery.⠀Show⠀how⠀the⠀arrangement⠀shapes⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀enter,⠀refuse,⠀ask,⠀or⠀conceal.\n\nRender⠀Austen's⠀social⠀observation⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀calculation,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀material⠀detail⠀of⠀the⠀space⠀carry⠀that⠀calculation.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀performs⠀deference,⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀thought⠀that⠀runs⠀beneath⠀the⠀bow⠀or⠀the⠀polite⠀phrase:⠀the⠀cost⠀being⠀counted,⠀the⠀claim⠀being⠀tested,⠀or⠀the⠀desire⠀being⠀hidden.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀should⠀expose⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀performed⠀role⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀motive,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀judgment⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀universal⠀narrator.⠀Let⠀trusted⠀company⠀become⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀mask⠀can⠀slip,⠀not⠀by⠀confessing⠀everything,⠀but⠀by⠀permitting⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀notice⠀what⠀they⠀had⠀refused⠀to⠀name.\n\nUse⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀change⠀how⠀an⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced⠀without⠀replacing⠀its⠀social⠀content.⠀A⠀dark⠀corridor,⠀a⠀locked⠀room,⠀or⠀a⠀neglected⠀garden⠀can⠀make⠀a⠀character⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀arrangement⠀they⠀already⠀know.⠀Private⠀desire⠀and⠀moral⠀complication⠀may⠀coexist:⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀want⠀something⠀from⠀a⠀person⠀whose⠀power⠀they⠀resent,⠀or⠀protect⠀someone⠀while⠀also⠀depending⠀on⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀vampires,⠀blood⠀bonds,⠀secret⠀powers,⠀or⠀a⠀supernatural⠀institution.⠀The⠀horror⠀here⠀is⠀historical⠀and⠀personal:⠀the⠀discovery⠀that⠀an⠀inherited⠀arrangement⠀is⠀still⠀alive⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀and⠀still⠀exacting⠀its⠀cost.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Establish⠀one⠀concrete⠀network⠀relation⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀scene's⠀stakes:⠀a⠀household⠀decision,⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀loan,⠀an⠀inheritance,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀held⠀among⠀relatives,⠀neighbors,⠀or⠀patrons⠀who⠀may⠀interpret⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀differently.⠀Let⠀money⠀and⠀material⠀dependence⠀appear⠀in⠀particular⠀forms⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀general⠀pressure.\n\nTreat⠀conversation⠀as⠀a⠀negotiation⠀within⠀that⠀network.⠀Render⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀free⠀indirect⠀calculation⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀due⠀to⠀them⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀owe,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀surrounding⠀scene⠀show⠀how⠀another⠀party⠀calculates⠀the⠀same⠀exchange.⠀A⠀polite⠀refusal⠀may⠀protect⠀a⠀family's⠀standing,⠀an⠀offer⠀may⠀create⠀an⠀obligation,⠀and⠀an⠀omission⠀may⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀an⠀insult⠀or⠀a⠀mercy⠀depending⠀on⠀who⠀hears⠀it.⠀The⠀irony⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀sense⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀proper⠀and⠀the⠀network's⠀actual⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀gesture.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀uniformly⠀polished⠀or⠀equally⠀perceptive.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario⠀gives⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀a⠀particular⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀determine⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀know,⠀travel⠀to,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀expect.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not;⠀it⠀may⠀equally⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀household⠀decision,⠀a⠀reputation⠀damaged⠀by⠀rumor,⠀or⠀a⠀dependent's⠀attempt⠀to⠀secure⠀a⠀place.⠀The⠀ending⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀social⠀arrangement⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀compulsory⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀rupture.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀psychological⠀realism⠀route.⠀Choose⠀one⠀recurring⠀social⠀relation⠀that⠀requires⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀to⠀decide⠀between⠀speech⠀and⠀silence:⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀household⠀economy,⠀a⠀visit⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀refused,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀managed⠀before⠀strangers.\n\nAt⠀each⠀encounter,⠀render⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀reason⠀for⠀withholding⠀or⠀speaking⠀in⠀free⠀indirect⠀terms.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀say,⠀choose⠀silence⠀to⠀preserve⠀a⠀relation,⠀or⠀realize⠀that⠀a⠀polite⠀phrase⠀has⠀done⠀more⠀work⠀than⠀a⠀direct⠀request⠀would⠀have.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀follow⠀that⠀calculation⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀terms,⠀while⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀shows⠀how⠀the⠀silence⠀or⠀speech⠀is⠀received.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀silence⠀wise⠀or⠀every⠀spoken⠀word⠀false;⠀the⠀point⠀is⠀the⠀particular⠀character's⠀reason⠀for⠀the⠀choice.\n\nLet⠀psychological⠀time⠀pass⠀through⠀the⠀accumulating⠀difference⠀between⠀one⠀encounter⠀and⠀the⠀next.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀gradually⠀recognize⠀that⠀their⠀own⠀courtesy⠀has⠀been⠀a⠀form⠀of⠀dependence,⠀or⠀that⠀another⠀person's⠀reserve⠀was⠀not⠀coldness⠀but⠀caution.⠀Seasonal⠀or⠀environmental⠀detail⠀may⠀mark⠀that⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀setting⠀supplies⠀it,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀seasonal⠀inventory⠀or⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀in⠀understanding,⠀a⠀practical⠀rearrangement,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀tension.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀marriage⠀plot⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀confession⠀as⠀a⠀required⠀close.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀psychological⠀or⠀urban⠀fiction⠀route.⠀Establish⠀one⠀concrete⠀setting⠀relation⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀scene's⠀stakes:⠀a⠀family's⠀standing,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀opinion,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀journey⠀that⠀is⠀possible⠀only⠀under⠀certain⠀conditions.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀desire⠀be⠀understood⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀that⠀setting⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀an⠀isolated⠀feeling.\n\nRender⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀mixed⠀motive⠀in⠀their⠀own⠀terms⠀through⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀believe⠀they⠀are⠀acting⠀from⠀generosity⠀while⠀also⠀securing⠀an⠀advantage,⠀or⠀resent⠀a⠀relative⠀while⠀still⠀depending⠀on⠀their⠀goodwill.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀follow⠀that⠀self-account⠀closely,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀conversation⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀difficulty⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀not⠀admitted.⠀Courtesy,⠀offers,⠀and⠀omissions⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀community's⠀expectations,⠀not⠀merely⠀individual⠀manners.⠀The⠀irony⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀character's⠀self-description⠀and⠀the⠀community's⠀actual⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀gesture.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀when⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario⠀gives⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀a⠀supernatural⠀event⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀already⠀permits⠀it.⠀The⠀story⠀may⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀intimate⠀encounters,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀in⠀marriage,⠀exile,⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀reversal.⠀A⠀partial⠀change⠀in⠀understanding,⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀an⠀unresolved⠀social⠀pressure⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀sufficient⠀close.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrative⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀determine⠀what⠀alternatives⠀are⠀actually⠀available.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀social⠀situation⠀is⠀already⠀in⠀motion:⠀a⠀visit⠀has⠀begun,⠀a⠀letter⠀has⠀arrived,⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀be⠀made,⠀or⠀a⠀room⠀has⠀just⠀been⠀entered.⠀Establish⠀the⠀space⠀in⠀a⠀few⠀concrete⠀details⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀stand,⠀and⠀what⠀object⠀or⠀arrangement⠀matters⠀to⠀the⠀exchange.\n\nUse⠀short⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action.⠀After⠀a⠀significant⠀speech⠀or⠀gesture,⠀give⠀a⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beat⠀that⠀renders⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀calculation⠀in⠀free⠀indirect⠀terms:⠀what⠀they⠀think⠀the⠀offer⠀costs,⠀what⠀they⠀suspect⠀the⠀speaker⠀wants,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reaction⠀owned⠀by⠀that⠀character⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀narrator.⠀The⠀reaction⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀resentful,⠀or⠀quietly⠀amused,⠀but⠀the⠀tone⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀position⠀and⠀history,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀default⠀wit.\n\nLet⠀the⠀social⠀content⠀remain⠀Austen's.⠀A⠀polite⠀phrase⠀should⠀carry⠀several⠀meanings,⠀and⠀money,⠀family,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀dependence⠀should⠀give⠀the⠀exchange⠀its⠀stakes.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀line⠀into⠀banter⠀or⠀every⠀pause⠀into⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀Spatial⠀changes⠀should⠀be⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀when⠀characters⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀hall⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀room,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀new⠀space⠀permits⠀or⠀forbids.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀still⠀unanswered⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀is⠀still⠀forming.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀completed⠀transaction,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀reversal⠀before⠀the⠀response⠀boundary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀material⠀object⠀or⠀recurring⠀sensory⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀social⠀judgment⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀says⠀plainly.⠀A⠀room's⠀temperature,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀cup⠀is⠀set⠀down,⠀or⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀garment⠀can⠀register⠀dependence,⠀reproach,⠀or⠀withheld⠀approval.⠀Trace⠀the⠀image⠀across⠀the⠀scene:⠀first⠀as⠀an⠀observed⠀fact,⠀then⠀as⠀something⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀returns⠀to,⠀then⠀as⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀has⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀meaning⠀after⠀the⠀image⠀has⠀done⠀its⠀work.\n\nShape⠀syntax⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀social⠀interpretation.⠀A⠀sentence⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀courteous⠀phrase,⠀extend⠀through⠀the⠀material⠀particulars⠀that⠀contradict⠀it,⠀and⠀end⠀on⠀the⠀private⠀realization⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀voice.⠀Use⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀so⠀the⠀narrator's⠀irony⠀has⠀an⠀owner;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀whether⠀the⠀observation⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character,⠀to⠀the⠀narrator,⠀or⠀to⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀them.⠀Let⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀interrupt⠀the⠀lyrical⠀passage⠀when⠀a⠀fact⠀of⠀money,⠀time,⠀or⠀obligation⠀must⠀land⠀without⠀ornament,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀interruption⠀alter⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀what⠀follows⠀rather⠀than⠀closing⠀the⠀passage⠀down.\n\nKeep⠀every⠀comparison⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀historical⠀scene.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀thinks⠀of⠀a⠀debt⠀as⠀a⠀slow⠀leak,⠀the⠀image⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀something⠀present:⠀a⠀roof,⠀a⠀vessel,⠀a⠀stain,⠀a⠀recurring⠀expense.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀imagery⠀from⠀another⠀period⠀or⠀landscape.⠀The⠀lyrical⠀register⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀associations,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker;⠀a⠀servant,⠀tradesperson,⠀or⠀neighbor⠀may⠀answer⠀the⠀elevated⠀passage⠀with⠀direct⠀practical⠀speech.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀has⠀become⠀legible,⠀not⠀where⠀every⠀feeling⠀has⠀been⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀begin⠀from⠀a⠀specific⠀social⠀fact:⠀a⠀visit⠀no⠀longer⠀paid,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀stopped,⠀a⠀room⠀rearranged⠀after⠀a⠀death⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀fortune,⠀a⠀phrase⠀of⠀courtesy⠀now⠀used⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀degree⠀of⠀warmth.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀should⠀notice⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀first,⠀then⠀the⠀memory⠀it⠀revives,⠀then⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀once⠀meant⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀now.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀reflection⠀float⠀away⠀from⠀the⠀historical⠀circumstances⠀that⠀produced⠀the⠀change.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀to⠀give⠀the⠀memory⠀its⠀edge.⠀A⠀remembered⠀conversation⠀can⠀be⠀reexamined⠀for⠀what⠀was⠀omitted,⠀what⠀was⠀offered,⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀believed⠀about⠀herself.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀understanding⠀or⠀leave⠀it⠀unresolved.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀irony⠀measured⠀and⠀owned;⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀regret⠀a⠀mistake,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀punish⠀every⠀remembered⠀hope.\n\nAllow⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀to⠀remain⠀present.⠀A⠀warm⠀room,⠀a⠀good⠀meal,⠀a⠀familiar⠀face,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀well⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀the⠀awareness⠀that⠀something⠀has⠀been⠀lost.⠀The⠀response⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence.⠀It⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀inside⠀the⠀present⠀moment,⠀carrying⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀thing⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀limits⠀on⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀recovered,⠀said,⠀or⠀attempted.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀situated⠀oral⠀or⠀framed⠀telling⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀specific⠀teller⠀reconstructs⠀a⠀social⠀episode⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀audience.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀have⠀witnessed⠀some⠀exchanges,⠀heard⠀others⠀from⠀participants,⠀and⠀inferred⠀the⠀rest⠀from⠀material⠀facts:⠀who⠀was⠀received,⠀who⠀was⠀not,⠀what⠀was⠀offered,⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀afterward,⠀what⠀changed⠀in⠀a⠀household's⠀arrangements.⠀Mark⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀saw,⠀what⠀was⠀reported,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀now⠀suspects.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀teller⠀access⠀to⠀every⠀private⠀mind.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame⠀give⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀a⠀second⠀layer.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀comment⠀on⠀a⠀courtesy⠀that⠀meant⠀more⠀than⠀it⠀appeared⠀to⠀mean,⠀an⠀omission⠀that⠀altered⠀a⠀family's⠀standing,⠀or⠀a⠀marriage,⠀debt,⠀or⠀inheritance⠀whose⠀consequences⠀outlasted⠀the⠀original⠀conversation.⠀The⠀audience's⠀presence⠀may⠀shape⠀the⠀telling:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀emphasize⠀what⠀this⠀particular⠀listener⠀needs⠀to⠀understand,⠀or⠀may⠀withhold⠀a⠀judgment⠀until⠀the⠀evidence⠀has⠀been⠀laid⠀out.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀irony⠀owned⠀by⠀the⠀teller⠀rather⠀than⠀floating⠀above⠀the⠀scene.\n\nGround⠀the⠀account⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀period,⠀location,⠀and⠀community⠀supplied.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀generic⠀antiquity,⠀mysticism,⠀exile⠀narrative,⠀or⠀honor⠀code.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀move⠀between⠀scenes,⠀recollections,⠀and⠀direct⠀address,⠀but⠀each⠀transition⠀should⠀be⠀motivated⠀by⠀the⠀teller's⠀purpose.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀teller⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀legible⠀to⠀the⠀audience,⠀not⠀where⠀every⠀question⠀has⠀been⠀answered.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀chair⠀left⠀empty,⠀a⠀letter⠀placed⠀on⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀sum⠀named⠀in⠀a⠀low⠀voice,⠀a⠀door⠀opened⠀by⠀a⠀servant⠀instead⠀of⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀a⠀longer⠀explanation.⠀State⠀the⠀detail⠀in⠀a⠀direct⠀clause⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀or⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀show⠀its⠀consequence.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀detail⠀that⠀repeats⠀the⠀same⠀point.\n\nUse⠀short⠀exchanges⠀to⠀reveal⠀what⠀people⠀believe⠀about⠀themselves.⠀A⠀polite⠀refusal,⠀an⠀offer⠀made⠀too⠀late,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀answered⠀with⠀a⠀smaller⠀truth⠀than⠀was⠀asked⠀can⠀expose⠀dependence,⠀pride,⠀or⠀uncertainty.⠀Keep⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀brief⠀and⠀owned:⠀a⠀single⠀clause⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀explaining⠀it⠀twice.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator's⠀irony⠀is⠀present,⠀let⠀it⠀reside⠀in⠀the⠀choice⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀reported⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀an⠀added⠀comment.\n\nPreserve⠀causality.⠀Omit⠀the⠀explanation,⠀not⠀the⠀connection⠀between⠀a⠀material⠀fact⠀and⠀its⠀effect.⠀If⠀a⠀character's⠀silence⠀follows⠀a⠀mention⠀of⠀money,⠀the⠀silence⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀already⠀established.⠀An⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀extend⠀beyond⠀a⠀fragment⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀actual⠀turning⠀point.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀once⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀is⠀inferable,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀available⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀historical⠀scene⠀as⠀continuous⠀contemporary-novel⠀prose.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀sees⠀and⠀hears,⠀what⠀is⠀said,⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀privately⠀understands⠀or⠀misreads.⠀Let⠀a⠀social⠀exchange⠀open⠀into⠀a⠀brief⠀recollection⠀or⠀an⠀inward⠀judgment,⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀room⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀fact.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀mark⠀these⠀shifts⠀without⠀announcing⠀them.\n\nKeep⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀courtesy,⠀an⠀omission,⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀of⠀reputation⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀explained⠀by⠀the⠀narrator.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀may⠀color⠀a⠀sentence,⠀but⠀its⠀owner⠀must⠀be⠀clear:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀whether⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀reasoning,⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀observing,⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀belief⠀is⠀being⠀quietly⠀tested.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀irony⠀remain⠀measured⠀and⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀moment.\n\nDo⠀not⠀modernize⠀the⠀setting's⠀actual⠀constraints.⠀The⠀period⠀determines⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀know,⠀say,⠀obtain,⠀and⠀attempt;⠀the⠀contemporary⠀prose⠀style⠀affects⠀presentation,⠀not⠀world⠀physics⠀or⠀social⠀permission.⠀Speech⠀may⠀vary⠀by⠀position⠀and⠀temperament⠀rather⠀than⠀sounding⠀uniformly⠀polished.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀scene⠀boundary,⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀question⠀legible⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀still⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nBuild⠀each⠀scene⠀around⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise.⠀Choose⠀moments⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀legible:⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀used⠀only⠀between⠀the⠀two,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture⠀whose⠀meaning⠀changes,⠀a⠀social⠀situation⠀that⠀forces⠀them⠀to⠀measure⠀public⠀behavior⠀against⠀private⠀understanding.⠀Give⠀the⠀emotional⠀beat⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀land,⠀whether⠀it⠀is⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀additional⠀tropes⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise⠀does⠀not⠀support.\n\nLet⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀create⠀the⠀pressure⠀around⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Reputation,⠀family⠀expectation,⠀money,⠀and⠀the⠀obligations⠀of⠀courtesy⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀say⠀openly⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀risk.⠀A⠀small⠀exchange⠀may⠀carry⠀several⠀meanings:⠀an⠀offer⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀test,⠀an⠀omission⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀protection⠀or⠀a⠀wound,⠀a⠀public⠀courtesy⠀may⠀conceal⠀a⠀private⠀claim.⠀Use⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀to⠀show⠀how⠀one⠀character⠀reads⠀the⠀other,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀irony⠀owned⠀rather⠀than⠀mocking⠀the⠀relationship⠀itself.\n\nUse⠀callbacks⠀with⠀purpose.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀place⠀should⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀significance,⠀not⠀as⠀decoration.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀determines⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀arrange,⠀write,⠀travel⠀to,⠀or⠀expect⠀from⠀family⠀and⠀community.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀relationship's⠀present⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀has⠀become⠀legible,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀turn⠀open⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession,⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀historical⠀episode⠀as⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀the⠀acts⠀by⠀which⠀these⠀people⠀are⠀remembered.⠀A⠀repeated⠀kindness,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀marriage⠀arranged⠀or⠀declined,⠀a⠀debt⠀honored⠀or⠀ignored,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀courtesy⠀that⠀changed⠀a⠀family's⠀standing⠀can⠀become⠀the⠀deed⠀the⠀community⠀recalls.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀act,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Keep⠀the⠀present⠀scene's⠀scale:⠀a⠀household⠀dispute⠀remains⠀a⠀household⠀dispute⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀longer⠀history.\n\nLet⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀supply⠀the⠀substance⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀remembered.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀was⠀offered,⠀what⠀was⠀omitted,⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀before⠀witnesses,⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀understood⠀only⠀later.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀should⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Distinguish⠀shared⠀reputation⠀from⠀private⠀experience;⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀generous⠀or⠀proud⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀person⠀felt⠀generous⠀or⠀proud,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀may⠀complicate⠀the⠀public⠀account.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀authority⠀of⠀the⠀chronicle.⠀The⠀subject⠀of⠀an⠀oft-told⠀incident⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀answer⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀practical⠀concern.⠀This⠀need⠀not⠀become⠀parody.⠀Humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀persistence⠀of⠀a⠀local⠀story,⠀but⠀domestic⠀work⠀is⠀not⠀mock⠀combat⠀and⠀social⠀failure⠀is⠀not⠀heroic⠀doom.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀and⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀limits.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀account⠀brought⠀to⠀a⠀natural⠀pause,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀in⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀tradition:⠀a⠀restrained,⠀closely⠀observed⠀narrative⠀of⠀ordinary⠀household⠀and⠀community⠀life⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀make⠀social⠀judgment⠀legible.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀concrete⠀and⠀understated.⠀Let⠀a⠀household⠀task,⠀a⠀market⠀transaction,⠀a⠀letter's⠀delay,⠀a⠀debt,⠀an⠀official⠀visit,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀difficulty⠀of⠀a⠀journey⠀show⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀know,⠀expect,⠀and⠀afford.⠀A⠀polite⠀phrase⠀carries⠀weight⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀established⠀the⠀practical⠀consequence⠀behind⠀it:⠀who⠀must⠀wait,⠀who⠀can⠀pay,⠀who⠀is⠀owed⠀an⠀answer,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀weather⠀or⠀season⠀permits.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀owner,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀route⠀discipline⠀its⠀expression.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀enters⠀a⠀character's⠀view⠀of⠀another⠀person,⠀let⠀that⠀view⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀character's⠀position⠀and⠀interest,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀remain⠀observant⠀rather⠀than⠀epigrammatic.⠀The⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀confirm⠀the⠀judgment,⠀expose⠀its⠀partiality,⠀or⠀show⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀acting⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀concern.⠀Courtesy,⠀omission,⠀and⠀reputation⠀should⠀produce⠀several⠀meanings⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀silence⠀into⠀a⠀hidden⠀motive⠀or⠀every⠀pointed⠀phrase⠀into⠀a⠀narrator's⠀triumph.\n\nLet⠀the⠀social⠀world⠀operate⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀hierarchy.⠀A⠀servant's⠀knowledge⠀may⠀be⠀practical⠀and⠀exact⠀where⠀a⠀guest's⠀is⠀polite⠀and⠀mistaken.⠀A⠀neighbor's⠀offer⠀may⠀be⠀generous,⠀self-interested,⠀or⠀constrained⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀household⠀can⠀accept.⠀Keep⠀the⠀characters⠀occupied⠀with⠀actual⠀work⠀and⠀obligation⠀so⠀that⠀social⠀interpretation⠀arises⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀and⠀cannot⠀do,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀narrator's⠀general⠀remarks⠀about⠀the⠀age.⠀The⠀restrained⠀social-realist⠀route⠀may⠀admit⠀a⠀quiet⠀inward⠀turn⠀when⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reflects⠀on⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀occurred,⠀but⠀that⠀reflection⠀should⠀remain⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀becoming⠀essayistic⠀or⠀autobiographical.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀universal⠀medieval⠀or⠀Nordic⠀template.⠀If⠀the⠀location⠀is⠀Danish,⠀Norwegian,⠀Swedish,⠀or⠀another⠀context,⠀let⠀its⠀specific⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀story's⠀own⠀details.⠀Reserve,⠀snow,⠀and⠀isolation⠀are⠀not⠀automatic⠀features.⠀The⠀narrative⠀language⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀active⠀author⠀and⠀style,⠀not⠀archaic⠀English.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀ends;⠀a⠀private⠀interval⠀or⠀unfinished⠀task⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀forced⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nPresent⠀the⠀social⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀and⠀attributed⠀dialogue.⠀Use⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Let⠀visible⠀and⠀audible⠀events⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀meaning:⠀who⠀enters,⠀who⠀is⠀served,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀picks⠀up⠀an⠀object,⠀who⠀avoids⠀a⠀question.⠀Keep⠀the⠀action⠀readable⠀and⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀stage,⠀without⠀camera⠀commands.\n\nLet⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀work⠀through⠀what⠀characters⠀say⠀and⠀do⠀in⠀shared⠀space.⠀A⠀polite⠀offer⠀can⠀be⠀undercut⠀by⠀a⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀accepting,⠀or⠀the⠀practical⠀difficulty⠀of⠀fulfilling⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀expression⠀a⠀truth⠀indicator.⠀A⠀contradiction⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀shown⠀should⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀interpretation⠀matters,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀placed⠀immediately⠀after⠀the⠀public⠀beat⠀it⠀interprets.⠀The⠀note⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀suspects,⠀or⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀cast⠀of⠀mind.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue,⠀voice-over,⠀or⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀public⠀scene⠀then⠀continues⠀on⠀its⠀own⠀terms,⠀and⠀another⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀without⠀knowing⠀that⠀private⠀conclusion.\n\nUse⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀directions⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀voice-over⠀replace⠀the⠀focal⠀note.⠀Historical⠀setting⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀particular⠀material⠀and⠀institutional⠀details:⠀a⠀room's⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀journey's⠀difficulty.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀natural⠀boundary;⠀a⠀conversation⠀may⠀continue,⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀judgment⠀may⠀stay⠀private.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀Let⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀make⠀social⠀claims⠀testable:⠀who⠀can⠀see⠀an⠀entrance,⠀reach⠀a⠀table,⠀hear⠀a⠀lowered⠀voice,⠀or⠀leave⠀without⠀being⠀noticed.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀should⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions,⠀not⠀certify⠀hidden⠀feeling.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business.⠀A⠀polite⠀speech⠀may⠀be⠀complicated⠀by⠀the⠀speaker's⠀position⠀near⠀the⠀door,⠀the⠀object⠀in⠀their⠀hands,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀address.⠀Courtesy,⠀omission,⠀and⠀reputation⠀can⠀give⠀a⠀small⠀exchange⠀several⠀meanings⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀pause⠀into⠀a⠀confession.⠀Let⠀a⠀contradiction⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀says⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀staged⠀conditions⠀show⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀judgment⠀matters,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀placed⠀after⠀the⠀staged⠀beat⠀it⠀interprets.⠀The⠀note⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀suspects,⠀or⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀but⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀Do⠀not⠀disguise⠀it⠀as⠀an⠀aside,⠀monologue,⠀or⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀performed⠀scene.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀appear⠀through⠀particular⠀material⠀and⠀institutional⠀details⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged:⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀tray,⠀a⠀coat,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀visitor's⠀status.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀ends;⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀a⠀continuing⠀conversation,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀judgment⠀that⠀remains⠀unspoken⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀forced⠀theatrical⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nBraid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀social⠀concern⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀the⠀mind's⠀associations,⠀while⠀keeping⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀imagined,⠀or⠀feared.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind⠀or⠀turn⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀as⠀the⠀mind's⠀live⠀process⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀narrator's⠀summary.⠀A⠀courtesy,⠀an⠀omission,⠀a⠀sum⠀of⠀money,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀can⠀return⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀each⠀time⠀altered⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀just⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀or⠀remembered.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀judge⠀another⠀person,⠀correct⠀that⠀judgment,⠀or⠀notice⠀its⠀own⠀partiality.⠀Let⠀the⠀judgment⠀retain⠀a⠀clear⠀owner.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀mind⠀notices⠀and⠀recalls:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀coat,⠀the⠀delay⠀of⠀a⠀letter,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀journey,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀room,⠀the⠀obligation⠀attached⠀to⠀a⠀visit.⠀Material⠀life⠀and⠀institutions⠀should⠀enter⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement⠀through⠀particular⠀sensation⠀and⠀memory,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀general⠀historical⠀explanation.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.\n\nMake⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀by⠀association⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀a⠀narrator's⠀orderly⠀summary.⠀Let⠀one⠀perception⠀or⠀memory⠀lead⠀to⠀another,⠀and⠀allow⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀to⠀shift⠀mid-thought.⠀Within⠀that⠀movement,⠀clear⠀thought,⠀decision,⠀and⠀perception⠀may⠀still⠀occur.⠀A⠀private⠀interval⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀an⠀external⠀task⠀or⠀practical⠀decision⠀to⠀justify⠀its⠀place.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀mind's⠀actual⠀attention⠀ends;⠀a⠀thought⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀judgment⠀may⠀remain⠀provisional,⠀and⠀an⠀event⠀may⠀remain⠀only⠀partly⠀understood.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀digital⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀one⠀sender⠀may⠀type⠀and⠀delete,⠀another⠀may⠀answer⠀immediately,⠀another⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀message⠀unread.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀the⠀wording⠀and⠀conduct⠀of⠀the⠀exchange.⠀A⠀polite⠀offer,⠀an⠀omission,⠀a⠀reference⠀to⠀money⠀or⠀family,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀can⠀give⠀a⠀short⠀message⠀several⠀meanings.⠀The⠀delay⠀before⠀a⠀reply,⠀the⠀choice⠀to⠀answer⠀in⠀a⠀group⠀channel⠀or⠀privately,⠀the⠀edit⠀that⠀softens⠀a⠀phrase,⠀and⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀asked⠀can⠀all⠀carry⠀social⠀weight.⠀Let⠀a⠀contradiction⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀sender⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀transcript⠀shows⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀judgment⠀matters,⠀write⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀block⠀placed⠀after⠀the⠀message⠀it⠀interprets,⠀labeled⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀name.⠀The⠀block⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀suspects,⠀or⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀and⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀senders.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀should⠀retain⠀a⠀clear⠀owner.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀scenario's⠀period,⠀location,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀permit.⠀Communication,⠀work,⠀belief,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀affect⠀the⠀exchange⠀through⠀particular⠀details,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀universal⠀digital⠀template.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀boundary;⠀a⠀conversation⠀may⠀continue,⠀a⠀message⠀may⠀remain⠀unanswered,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀judgment⠀may⠀stay⠀private.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nPresent⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Let⠀the⠀rhythm⠀suit⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene:⠀a⠀short⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀room⠀or⠀place,⠀a⠀clear⠀speaker⠀line,⠀and⠀a⠀focal⠀reaction⠀that⠀interprets⠀what⠀has⠀just⠀been⠀said⠀or⠀seen.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀narration.⠀A⠀courteous⠀phrase,⠀an⠀omission,⠀a⠀reference⠀to⠀money⠀or⠀family,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀can⠀give⠀a⠀small⠀exchange⠀several⠀meanings.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀judgment⠀of⠀another⠀person⠀be⠀shaped⠀by⠀position⠀and⠀interest.⠀The⠀next⠀line⠀may⠀support⠀that⠀judgment,⠀complicate⠀it,⠀or⠀show⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀acting⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀concern.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits⠀whose⠀expression⠀always⠀reveals⠀their⠀feeling⠀or⠀truthfulness.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀appear⠀through⠀particular⠀scene⠀details⠀and⠀material⠀life:⠀a⠀room's⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀payment,⠀a⠀visitor's⠀status,⠀a⠀journey's⠀difficulty.⠀Institutions⠀and⠀work⠀should⠀affect⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀concrete⠀encounters,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀general⠀historical⠀explanation.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀A⠀private⠀judgment⠀may⠀remain⠀private,⠀a⠀conversation⠀may⠀continue,⠀and⠀a⠀relationship⠀consequence⠀may⠀remain⠀unsettled.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiakbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jane⠀Austen⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀installments:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀Let⠀an⠀earlier⠀particular⠀remain⠀available⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀suggests:⠀a⠀person⠀answers⠀a⠀familiar⠀question⠀under⠀a⠀different⠀condition,⠀an⠀offer⠀once⠀declined⠀is⠀made⠀again,⠀a⠀debt⠀once⠀mentioned⠀becomes⠀urgent,⠀or⠀a⠀reputation⠀once⠀accepted⠀is⠀qualified⠀by⠀new⠀knowledge.\n\nUse⠀Austen's⠀social⠀interpretation⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀courtesy,⠀omission,⠀reference⠀to⠀money⠀or⠀family,⠀or⠀reputation⠀can⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀supplies⠀a⠀fact⠀that⠀revises⠀the⠀earlier⠀judgment.⠀Free⠀indirect⠀judgment⠀should⠀retain⠀a⠀clear⠀owner:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀revise⠀a⠀view⠀of⠀another⠀person⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀pretending⠀the⠀earlier⠀view⠀never⠀existed.⠀Let⠀the⠀revision⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀particular⠀development,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀sudden⠀reversal.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀appear⠀through⠀particular⠀material⠀and⠀institutional⠀details⠀that⠀persist⠀across⠀installments:⠀a⠀household's⠀resources,⠀a⠀journey's⠀difficulty,⠀a⠀letter's⠀delay,⠀an⠀official⠀obligation,⠀a⠀season's⠀work.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀installment⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.\n\nEnd⠀an⠀installment⠀after⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀A⠀conversation⠀may⠀continue,⠀a⠀task⠀may⠀span⠀installments,⠀and⠀a⠀private⠀judgment⠀may⠀remain⠀provisional.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLet⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀and⠀obligations⠀make⠀emotional⠀exposure⠀expensive.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀admit⠀something,⠀place⠀the⠀admission⠀inside⠀a⠀specific⠀historical⠀relationship:⠀a⠀subordinate⠀speaking⠀to⠀a⠀superior,⠀a⠀debtor⠀to⠀a⠀creditor,⠀a⠀companion⠀to⠀someone⠀whose⠀help⠀they⠀cannot⠀openly⠀request,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀member⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀controls⠀their⠀standing.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀admission⠀costs⠀in⠀that⠀relationship,⠀not⠀in⠀general⠀terms.⠀The⠀cost⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀loss⠀of⠀standing,⠀a⠀new⠀obligation,⠀a⠀risk⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀act⠀afterward.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀a⠀difficult⠀conversation⠀develop⠀across⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀work⠀interval,⠀or⠀a⠀waiting⠀period⠀rather⠀than⠀compressing⠀it⠀into⠀one⠀abrupt⠀confession.⠀Give⠀the⠀character⠀a⠀reason⠀to⠀withhold⠀that⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀historical⠀situation:⠀speaking⠀may⠀bind⠀someone⠀else,⠀break⠀a⠀necessary⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀not⠀yet⠀free⠀to⠀make.⠀The⠀character's⠀restraint⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀particular⠀decision⠀about⠀loyalty⠀or⠀obligation,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀fear⠀of⠀emotion.\n\nRender⠀the⠀turbulent⠀feeling⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀and⠀says.⠀Let⠀strain⠀change⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀how⠀much⠀they⠀can⠀say,⠀whether⠀they⠀interrupt⠀themselves,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀with⠀their⠀hands,⠀work,⠀or⠀belongings.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀has⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀experience,⠀show⠀the⠀specific⠀thought⠀or⠀uncertainty⠀that⠀accompanies⠀the⠀visible⠀behavior.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain:⠀an⠀apology⠀may⠀be⠀sincere⠀and⠀still⠀insufficient;⠀comfort⠀may⠀arrive⠀as⠀practical⠀care⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀repair⠀the⠀hurt;⠀a⠀return⠀may⠀be⠀wanted⠀and⠀still⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀fresh⠀wound.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀in⠀motion⠀around⠀the⠀emotional⠀scene.⠀A⠀messenger,⠀a⠀work⠀deadline,⠀a⠀household⠀duty,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀expectation⠀can⠀interrupt⠀or⠀shape⠀the⠀conversation⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀relationship⠀to⠀collapse⠀or⠀heal⠀by⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀response.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀encounter⠀with⠀the⠀hurt⠀still⠀unresolved⠀and⠀the⠀next⠀obligation⠀already⠀pressing⠀on⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Attribute⠀each⠀speech⠀clearly,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀speaker's⠀historical⠀position⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀say,⠀request,⠀or⠀refuse.⠀A⠀servant,⠀official,⠀merchant,⠀soldier,⠀or⠀household⠀member⠀speaks⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀standing,⠀and⠀their⠀obligations⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀exchange⠀without⠀a⠀lecture.⠀Show⠀the⠀standing⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀does⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀ask⠀for,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀their⠀rank.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀engine.⠀Give⠀the⠀characters⠀a⠀shared⠀history⠀or⠀a⠀present⠀alliance⠀that⠀matters,⠀and⠀let⠀their⠀choices⠀about⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀loyalty⠀affect⠀what⠀happens⠀next.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀helps⠀someone⠀they⠀care⠀about,⠀show⠀the⠀public⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀duty⠀left⠀undone,⠀a⠀superior⠀who⠀will⠀notice,⠀a⠀reputation⠀that⠀will⠀change,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀will⠀come⠀due.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀refuses⠀a⠀request,⠀show⠀the⠀obligation⠀they⠀are⠀protecting,⠀not⠀just⠀the⠀refusal.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀active⠀around⠀the⠀conversation.⠀Work⠀continues,⠀a⠀message⠀may⠀arrive,⠀someone⠀may⠀be⠀waiting,⠀or⠀a⠀duty⠀may⠀pull⠀a⠀character⠀away.⠀Let⠀NPCs⠀make⠀choices⠀and⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives⠀rather⠀than⠀freezing⠀while⠀the⠀player-character⠀speaks.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀leave⠀to⠀attend⠀to⠀a⠀task,⠀send⠀a⠀message,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀decision⠀that⠀affects⠀the⠀scene's⠀next⠀step.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀move⠀through⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀work⠀interval,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀so⠀the⠀dialogue⠀has⠀room⠀to⠀develop.\n\nEnd⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀next⠀step⠀may⠀be⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀a⠀person⠀still⠀waiting,⠀a⠀decision⠀someone⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀made,⠀or⠀an⠀obligation⠀now⠀due.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀screen.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀continue⠀without⠀being⠀told⠀to⠀choose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route:⠀organize⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀linked⠀sequence⠀of⠀scenes,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀encounter,⠀a⠀particular⠀decision,⠀and⠀a⠀consequence⠀that⠀carries⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀episode.⠀Let⠀each⠀episode⠀open⠀with⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀obligation⠀or⠀expectation⠀is⠀pressing⠀on⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do⠀in⠀their⠀historical⠀position.⠀The⠀orientation⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀workplace,⠀a⠀household,⠀a⠀market,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀duty⠀that⠀sets⠀the⠀episode's⠀limits.\n\nGive⠀each⠀episode⠀a⠀turning⠀point⠀that⠀arises⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀choice.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀choose⠀loyalty⠀to⠀a⠀companion⠀over⠀a⠀public⠀duty,⠀or⠀may⠀honor⠀an⠀alliance⠀at⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀private⠀wish.⠀Show⠀the⠀choice⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does,⠀not⠀through⠀commentary⠀about⠀their⠀virtue.⠀The⠀turning⠀point⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀a⠀decision⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀avoid⠀making⠀under⠀the⠀period's⠀constraints:⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀summons,⠀a⠀shortage,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀conflict⠀between⠀two⠀obligations.\n\nLet⠀the⠀episodes⠀accumulate⠀shared⠀history.⠀A⠀debt⠀incurred⠀in⠀one⠀scene⠀may⠀be⠀repaid⠀or⠀refused⠀in⠀another;⠀a⠀reputation⠀earned⠀in⠀one⠀place⠀may⠀precede⠀the⠀character⠀into⠀the⠀next.⠀When⠀a⠀consequence⠀carries⠀into⠀a⠀later⠀episode,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀change:⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀now⠀trusts⠀or⠀distrusts⠀the⠀character,⠀a⠀resource⠀that⠀is⠀now⠀available⠀or⠀gone,⠀an⠀obligation⠀that⠀has⠀become⠀heavier,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀that⠀has⠀shifted.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀earlier⠀choices⠀without⠀being⠀told⠀their⠀meaning.\n\nMove⠀between⠀episodes⠀with⠀clear⠀transitions⠀that⠀preserve⠀momentum.⠀A⠀journey,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀season,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀arrival⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀reader⠀forward.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀episode⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀task.⠀The⠀sequence⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀continuing⠀account⠀of⠀consequential⠀encounters,⠀not⠀a⠀series⠀of⠀disconnected⠀set⠀pieces.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful⠀diction⠀and⠀compressed⠀transitions.⠀Move⠀from⠀one⠀action⠀or⠀perception⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀without⠀smoothing⠀over⠀the⠀joins.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀show⠀its⠀wear:⠀chafed⠀hands,⠀a⠀patched⠀coat,⠀a⠀dulled⠀blade,⠀a⠀leaking⠀roof,⠀a⠀road⠀rutted⠀by⠀rain.⠀Ground⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀actually⠀touch,⠀carry,⠀repair,⠀or⠀lose.⠀Choose⠀details⠀that⠀limit⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀next,⠀not⠀details⠀that⠀merely⠀decorate⠀the⠀setting.\n\nMake⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀physical.⠀When⠀a⠀promise⠀costs⠀a⠀character⠀sleep,⠀food,⠀or⠀safety,⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀in⠀the⠀scene:⠀the⠀character⠀gives⠀away⠀a⠀ration,⠀walks⠀through⠀the⠀night,⠀or⠀takes⠀a⠀blow⠀meant⠀for⠀someone⠀else.⠀When⠀a⠀loyalty⠀is⠀measured⠀in⠀what⠀someone⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀carry⠀or⠀endure,⠀show⠀the⠀carrying⠀or⠀enduring,⠀not⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀loyalty.⠀Let⠀technique⠀and⠀restraint⠀appear⠀as⠀practical⠀choices:⠀a⠀character⠀checks⠀a⠀weapon,⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀signal,⠀shares⠀a⠀ration,⠀or⠀holds⠀a⠀position⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀demands⠀it,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀narration⠀announces⠀their⠀virtue.\n\nKeep⠀physical⠀stakes⠀legible⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀genre⠀into⠀survival⠀horror.⠀Injury,⠀exhaustion,⠀cold,⠀and⠀want⠀matter⠀because⠀they⠀limit⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do⠀next,⠀not⠀because⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀must⠀fail.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀permitted⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀reasoning⠀through⠀a⠀debt,⠀an⠀alliance,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀shown⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀gesture.⠀The⠀thought⠀should⠀stay⠀concrete:⠀the⠀character⠀weighs⠀a⠀specific⠀cost⠀against⠀a⠀specific⠀obligation,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀principle.\n\nChange⠀rhythm⠀usefully.⠀A⠀compressed⠀burst⠀of⠀action⠀can⠀be⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀slower⠀interval⠀of⠀travel,⠀repair,⠀or⠀waiting⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀action⠀settles.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀obligation⠀or⠀danger⠀remain⠀present⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀completed⠀task⠀or⠀a⠀reversal⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents⠀that⠀each⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀petition,⠀a⠀note⠀passed⠀in⠀haste.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀determine⠀how⠀the⠀document⠀travels,⠀who⠀can⠀read⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀send⠀or⠀keep⠀it.⠀The⠀document's⠀form⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀can⠀say:⠀a⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀superior⠀will⠀not⠀confess⠀what⠀a⠀private⠀journal⠀might,⠀and⠀a⠀note⠀passed⠀in⠀haste⠀will⠀not⠀explain⠀what⠀a⠀formal⠀petition⠀must.\n\nMake⠀each⠀document⠀an⠀intervention⠀in⠀a⠀relationship⠀or⠀obligation.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀write⠀to⠀secure⠀help,⠀to⠀explain⠀a⠀choice,⠀to⠀protect⠀someone,⠀to⠀record⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀to⠀leave⠀a⠀trace⠀that⠀will⠀matter⠀later.⠀Use⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation:⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀says,⠀omits,⠀or⠀conceals⠀through⠀the⠀document's⠀language.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀address⠀the⠀recipient's⠀public⠀duty⠀while⠀leaving⠀the⠀writer's⠀private⠀attachment⠀unspoken;⠀a⠀report⠀may⠀record⠀an⠀action⠀without⠀recording⠀the⠀loyalty⠀that⠀prompted⠀it;⠀a⠀journal⠀may⠀confess⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀could⠀not⠀say⠀to⠀the⠀person⠀involved.\n\nLet⠀the⠀gaps⠀between⠀documents⠀carry⠀the⠀story.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀be⠀answered⠀late,⠀intercepted,⠀or⠀never⠀answered.⠀A⠀report⠀may⠀contradict⠀a⠀journal⠀entry.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀may⠀reveal⠀what⠀an⠀earlier⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀or⠀chose⠀not⠀to⠀record.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀by⠀letting⠀each⠀new⠀document⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀its⠀date,⠀sender,⠀recipient,⠀and⠀immediate⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀adding⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record.\n\nDo⠀not⠀rotate⠀mechanically⠀through⠀all⠀available⠀formats.⠀Choose⠀the⠀document⠀that⠀the⠀scene's⠀communication⠀actually⠀requires,⠀and⠀let⠀material⠀traces—a⠀torn⠀edge,⠀a⠀copied⠀line,⠀a⠀missing⠀page,⠀a⠀seal⠀broken—reveal⠀what⠀the⠀words⠀alone⠀do⠀not⠀say.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀within⠀the⠀historical⠀world.⠀Let⠀the⠀care⠀arise⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀period⠀permits:⠀a⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀how⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀save⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀food,⠀mend⠀a⠀garment,⠀share⠀a⠀blanket,⠀or⠀choose⠀a⠀longer⠀route⠀to⠀walk⠀beside⠀a⠀companion.⠀Show⠀the⠀care⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀action,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀mood⠀of⠀warmth.⠀The⠀action⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀care⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀know⠀about⠀each⠀other,⠀not⠀because⠀the⠀narration⠀announces⠀it.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀shared⠀history⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀comfort⠀earned.⠀The⠀characters⠀may⠀have⠀traveled⠀together,⠀kept⠀faith⠀through⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀known⠀each⠀other⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀recognize⠀a⠀preference⠀or⠀a⠀silence.⠀Let⠀the⠀shared⠀history⠀show⠀through⠀a⠀small⠀recognition:⠀one⠀character⠀knows⠀which⠀task⠀the⠀other⠀finds⠀hardest,⠀which⠀food⠀they⠀will⠀eat⠀when⠀tired,⠀or⠀which⠀silence⠀means⠀they⠀need⠀company⠀rather⠀than⠀talk.⠀Affection⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀show⠀love⠀by⠀remembering,⠀by⠀waiting,⠀by⠀doing⠀a⠀small⠀task⠀well,⠀or⠀by⠀leaving⠀room⠀for⠀someone⠀to⠀be⠀tired⠀or⠀cross.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀care⠀awkwardly,⠀refuse⠀help⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀want,⠀or⠀argue⠀about⠀a⠀small⠀thing⠀while⠀still⠀being⠀glad⠀of⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀presence.⠀Established⠀problems⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀world:⠀the⠀danger,⠀debt,⠀or⠀duty⠀outside⠀the⠀warm⠀interval⠀does⠀not⠀disappear,⠀but⠀the⠀scene⠀may⠀rest⠀inside⠀it⠀for⠀a⠀while.⠀The⠀warmth⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀pause⠀inside⠀the⠀historical⠀situation,⠀not⠀a⠀removal⠀from⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀comfort⠀operate⠀within⠀the⠀historical⠀fiction⠀genre⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it.⠀The⠀kindness⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀actual⠀situation—work,⠀travel,⠀waiting,⠀recovery,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal—and⠀the⠀next⠀obligation⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀waiting⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀each⠀scene⠀open⠀with⠀enough⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀orientation⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀their⠀period:⠀what⠀institution,⠀household,⠀trade,⠀or⠀obligation⠀governs⠀the⠀encounter,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀expect⠀from⠀one⠀another⠀under⠀those⠀conditions.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language⠀through⠀its⠀sentence⠀movement⠀and⠀framing,⠀not⠀through⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.\n\nUse⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀central⠀pressure.⠀Give⠀the⠀characters⠀room⠀to⠀travel,⠀explain,⠀and⠀relate⠀to⠀one⠀another⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀action⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows.⠀Let⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀show⠀how⠀those⠀decisions⠀are⠀judged⠀by⠀the⠀people⠀around⠀them.⠀The⠀judgment⠀should⠀be⠀specific:⠀a⠀superior⠀who⠀notes⠀the⠀choice,⠀a⠀companion⠀who⠀understands⠀its⠀cost,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀that⠀will⠀remember⠀it⠀differently.\n\nFrame⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀social⠀context,⠀history,⠀or⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits⠀it.⠀A⠀public⠀ceremony,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀household⠀arrangement,⠀or⠀a⠀contrast⠀between⠀private⠀and⠀public⠀behavior⠀may⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀relevant.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀observes⠀how⠀a⠀choice⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀in⠀standing,⠀tie⠀the⠀observation⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀particular⠀decision:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀chose⠀loyalty⠀over⠀advancement,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀private⠀kindness⠀will⠀be⠀read⠀as⠀weakness⠀in⠀public.⠀Do⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀characters'⠀particular⠀experience⠀with⠀general⠀commentary.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀specific⠀rather⠀than⠀generic.⠀The⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀belief,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀style;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀automatically⠀supply⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀or⠀a⠀distant,⠀ornamental⠀tone.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀a⠀definite⠀historical⠀occasion:⠀a⠀wait,⠀a⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀vigil,⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀where⠀someone⠀has⠀reason⠀to⠀tell⠀a⠀story⠀to⠀particular⠀listeners.⠀Establish⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀conditions⠀through⠀the⠀telling⠀situation⠀itself—what⠀the⠀room⠀allows,⠀who⠀may⠀speak,⠀who⠀is⠀absent,⠀what⠀news⠀could⠀arrive,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀need⠀from⠀the⠀teller⠀before⠀the⠀night⠀or⠀the⠀journey⠀is⠀over.\n\nMake⠀the⠀embedded⠀story⠀an⠀intervention⠀in⠀that⠀outer⠀occasion.⠀The⠀teller⠀chooses⠀an⠀incident⠀from⠀shared⠀or⠀reported⠀history⠀because⠀it⠀will⠀persuade,⠀warn,⠀delay,⠀comfort,⠀or⠀reorder⠀a⠀listener's⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀present.⠀Let⠀the⠀story⠀carry⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile's⠀sense⠀of⠀consequence:⠀a⠀promise⠀kept⠀at⠀cost,⠀a⠀public⠀duty⠀that⠀strained⠀a⠀private⠀attachment,⠀a⠀reputation⠀built⠀on⠀a⠀decision⠀whose⠀full⠀terms⠀the⠀teller⠀only⠀partly⠀knew.⠀The⠀tale⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀sealed⠀legend.⠀Its⠀details⠀about⠀roads,⠀seasons,⠀work,⠀authority,⠀communication,⠀and⠀obligation⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀historical⠀setting,⠀and⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀may⠀confirm,⠀complicate,⠀or⠀contradict⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀presents.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀meaningful.⠀What⠀the⠀teller⠀omits⠀may⠀be⠀deliberate⠀loyalty,⠀genuine⠀ignorance,⠀or⠀a⠀limit⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀social⠀position;⠀the⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀this⠀through⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀the⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀announcing⠀it.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀with⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀timing,⠀access,⠀or⠀consequence,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀answer,⠀evade,⠀or⠀revise.⠀Make⠀recurring⠀phrases,⠀objects,⠀or⠀place⠀names⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀by⠀having⠀them⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀owner,⠀price,⠀or⠀obligation:⠀a⠀road⠀named⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀becomes⠀the⠀road⠀the⠀listeners⠀must⠀take,⠀a⠀token⠀remembered⠀as⠀a⠀gift⠀reappears⠀as⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀phrase⠀first⠀spoken⠀in⠀praise⠀returns⠀as⠀a⠀warning.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀alter⠀how⠀a⠀later⠀outer⠀action⠀is⠀read,⠀not⠀merely⠀echo⠀the⠀earlier⠀passage.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀tale⠀to⠀be⠀true,⠀complete,⠀or⠀morally⠀decisive.⠀Its⠀power⠀lies⠀in⠀how⠀it⠀acts⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀relationship.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀historical⠀frame's⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀gaps⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀premodern⠀template⠀or⠀import⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀palaces,⠀djinn,⠀deserts,⠀or⠀religious⠀machinery.⠀End⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀situation,⠀whether⠀the⠀tale⠀has⠀finished,⠀paused,⠀or⠀been⠀interrupted;⠀no⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀completed⠀persuasion⠀is⠀compulsory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀record⠀establishes⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀remembers⠀or⠀later⠀understands,⠀keeping⠀those⠀sources⠀distinct.⠀A⠀register⠀may⠀note⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀payment,⠀or⠀a⠀punishment;⠀a⠀witness⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀weather,⠀the⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀the⠀words⠀spoken⠀afterward.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀not⠀pretend⠀that⠀the⠀record⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀confirm⠀each⠀other⠀automatically.⠀Where⠀they⠀diverge,⠀the⠀divergence⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀historical⠀situation,⠀not⠀an⠀error⠀to⠀be⠀smoothed⠀away.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀through⠀the⠀way⠀later⠀accounts⠀reconstruct⠀a⠀decision.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀have⠀acted⠀from⠀loyalty⠀that⠀no⠀document⠀names,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀duty⠀whose⠀private⠀cost⠀only⠀a⠀companion⠀remembers.⠀Show⠀the⠀decision⠀through⠀particular⠀consequences:⠀a⠀route⠀taken,⠀a⠀message⠀delayed,⠀an⠀alliance⠀honored,⠀a⠀reputation⠀altered.⠀Give⠀scenes⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀documentary⠀frame⠀mark⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known⠀afterward.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀say⠀that⠀a⠀certain⠀motive⠀was⠀never⠀recorded,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀surviving⠀account⠀was⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀teller's⠀later⠀position.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀concrete⠀and⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀location.⠀Institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀appear⠀as⠀particular⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀background⠀decoration.⠀Let⠀the⠀syntax⠀and⠀distance⠀follow⠀the⠀documentary-memory⠀narrator:⠀composed,⠀attentive⠀to⠀attribution,⠀and⠀willing⠀to⠀leave⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀evidence⠀and⠀feeling.⠀When⠀the⠀response⠀reaches⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀available⠀account,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator⠀mark⠀that⠀edge⠀positively—by⠀naming⠀what⠀the⠀surviving⠀record⠀cannot⠀reach,⠀by⠀noting⠀which⠀voice⠀is⠀missing,⠀or⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀a⠀later⠀memory⠀revises⠀without⠀replacing⠀an⠀earlier⠀one.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀final⠀reconciliation⠀between⠀record⠀and⠀memory.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀available⠀account⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀inherited⠀authority⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀historical⠀institution:⠀a⠀house,⠀office,⠀title,⠀guild,⠀garrison,⠀estate,⠀or⠀lineage⠀whose⠀old⠀claims⠀press⠀against⠀present⠀life.⠀Establish⠀its⠀material⠀texture⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters—who⠀may⠀enter,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀maintained,⠀what⠀debt⠀or⠀privilege⠀passes⠀with⠀the⠀position,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀occupants⠀actually⠀need.⠀Let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀arise⠀from⠀that⠀collision⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀generic⠀gloom.⠀A⠀cold⠀room,⠀a⠀worn⠀seal,⠀a⠀locked⠀archive,⠀or⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀obligation⠀should⠀matter⠀through⠀its⠀function⠀and⠀history.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀wear⠀a⠀social⠀mask⠀before⠀superiors⠀or⠀rivals⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀fall⠀only⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀revealing⠀desire,⠀fear,⠀or⠀loyalty⠀that⠀the⠀institution⠀does⠀not⠀permit.⠀Show⠀restraint,⠀alliance,⠀and⠀reputation⠀through⠀decisions:⠀a⠀favor⠀that⠀binds,⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀protects,⠀a⠀public⠀act⠀that⠀costs⠀a⠀private⠀attachment.⠀Give⠀these⠀decisions⠀room⠀to⠀develop⠀through⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀them⠀to⠀sudden⠀confrontations.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀limits⠀intact⠀while⠀letting⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀operate⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀own⠀terms.⠀Decay⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀debt,⠀neglect,⠀changing⠀law,⠀lost⠀heirs,⠀or⠀a⠀maintained⠀form⠀whose⠀function⠀has⠀emptied;⠀the⠀old⠀authority's⠀power⠀must⠀remain⠀human⠀and⠀social.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀Atmosphere⠀changes⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀create⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀or⠀guarantee⠀that⠀every⠀intimacy⠀is⠀dangerous.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀scene,⠀whether⠀the⠀mask⠀has⠀fallen,⠀held,⠀or⠀only⠀shifted.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route.⠀Give⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀specific⠀historical⠀community⠀and⠀occasion:⠀a⠀gathering,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀festival,⠀a⠀dispute,⠀or⠀a⠀period⠀of⠀waiting⠀in⠀which⠀someone⠀recounts⠀a⠀deed,⠀a⠀lineage,⠀a⠀promise,⠀or⠀a⠀past⠀conflict⠀to⠀listeners⠀who⠀share⠀or⠀contest⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀social⠀position,⠀language,⠀region,⠀and⠀community⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said,⠀what⠀is⠀emphasized,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀expects⠀to⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene;⠀use⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀and⠀period⠀actually⠀provide.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile's⠀shared⠀history⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀audible⠀in⠀the⠀telling.⠀A⠀tale⠀of⠀an⠀alliance,⠀a⠀restraint,⠀a⠀reputation,⠀or⠀a⠀costly⠀loyalty⠀should⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀listeners⠀because⠀they⠀inherit⠀its⠀consequences.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀be⠀generous⠀to⠀a⠀companion,⠀severe⠀to⠀a⠀rival,⠀or⠀silent⠀about⠀a⠀private⠀attachment,⠀and⠀that⠀selection⠀is⠀itself⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀situation.⠀Let⠀repeated⠀names,⠀phrases,⠀or⠀objects⠀accrue⠀meaning⠀by⠀having⠀them⠀return⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀relationship⠀or⠀consequence⠀for⠀the⠀listeners:⠀a⠀name⠀first⠀spoken⠀as⠀praise⠀returns⠀as⠀a⠀claim⠀on⠀the⠀present,⠀a⠀token⠀remembered⠀from⠀the⠀tale⠀reappears⠀as⠀an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀phrase⠀of⠀honor⠀is⠀repeated⠀by⠀someone⠀who⠀now⠀doubts⠀it.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀mark⠀a⠀relationship⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀decorating⠀the⠀speech.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀concrete.⠀Institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀belief,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀who⠀may⠀speak,⠀who⠀may⠀interrupt,⠀what⠀news⠀or⠀obligation⠀waits⠀outside⠀the⠀telling,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listeners⠀must⠀decide⠀afterward.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀The⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀complete,⠀authoritative,⠀or⠀morally⠀decisive;⠀it⠀acts⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀choices⠀and⠀the⠀audience's⠀response.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀telling⠀situation,⠀whether⠀the⠀tale⠀has⠀finished,⠀paused,⠀or⠀been⠀challenged.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀follow⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀person's⠀record⠀of⠀days,⠀encounters,⠀journeys,⠀and⠀obligations.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀note⠀a⠀season,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀but⠀these⠀details⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀location⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery.⠀Keep⠀the⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀teller's⠀position,⠀education,⠀and⠀circumstances.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀diarist⠀chooses⠀to⠀record⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀unspoken.⠀A⠀public⠀duty⠀may⠀be⠀noted⠀briefly⠀while⠀a⠀private⠀cost⠀is⠀described⠀at⠀length,⠀or⠀the⠀reverse.⠀When⠀the⠀diarist⠀records⠀a⠀public⠀obligation⠀in⠀a⠀short,⠀formal⠀sentence⠀and⠀then⠀dwells⠀on⠀a⠀private⠀attachment,⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀the⠀prose⠀itself:⠀the⠀official⠀entry⠀is⠀spare⠀and⠀dated,⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀reflection⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀moment⠀with⠀sensory⠀detail,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀unspent⠀feeling.⠀The⠀record⠀can⠀show⠀restraint,⠀alliance,⠀and⠀reputation⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions:⠀a⠀promise⠀honored,⠀a⠀silence⠀kept,⠀a⠀companion⠀trusted,⠀a⠀rival's⠀claim⠀weighed.⠀Let⠀the⠀diarist's⠀later⠀knowledge⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀was⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀A⠀present⠀reflection⠀may⠀revise⠀an⠀earlier⠀entry⠀without⠀erasing⠀it,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀both⠀the⠀original⠀uncertainty⠀and⠀the⠀later⠀consequence.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀concrete.⠀Institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀belief,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀background⠀decoration.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀The⠀diary⠀need⠀not⠀explain⠀everything⠀or⠀reach⠀a⠀final⠀judgment.⠀Its⠀omissions⠀are⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀private⠀experience,⠀not⠀a⠀failure⠀of⠀the⠀form.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀record⠀naturally⠀pauses,⠀whether⠀at⠀a⠀day's⠀end,⠀a⠀journey's⠀halt,⠀or⠀a⠀reflection⠀left⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀gather⠀a⠀historical⠀conflict,⠀journey,⠀or⠀decision⠀through⠀accounts⠀attributed⠀to⠀particular⠀participants,⠀witnesses,⠀or⠀chroniclers.⠀Each⠀account⠀should⠀carry⠀its⠀speaker's⠀social⠀position,⠀community,⠀language,⠀and⠀interest.⠀A⠀landowner,⠀a⠀courier,⠀a⠀servant,⠀a⠀soldier,⠀or⠀a⠀local⠀official⠀may⠀describe⠀the⠀same⠀event⠀differently⠀because⠀each⠀knew⠀different⠀parts⠀of⠀it⠀and⠀needed⠀different⠀outcomes.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language⠀and⠀community⠀actually⠀supplied⠀by⠀the⠀scenario;⠀do⠀not⠀manufacture⠀a⠀generic⠀regional⠀voice⠀or⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts.\n\nMake⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀differences⠀among⠀accounts.⠀One⠀testimony⠀may⠀emphasize⠀a⠀public⠀duty,⠀another⠀a⠀private⠀loyalty,⠀another⠀a⠀reputation⠀at⠀stake.⠀When⠀accounts⠀diverge,⠀make⠀the⠀divergence⠀causally⠀legible:⠀show⠀what⠀each⠀teller⠀could⠀have⠀seen⠀from⠀their⠀position,⠀what⠀each⠀needed⠀the⠀listener⠀to⠀believe,⠀and⠀what⠀each⠀stood⠀to⠀gain⠀or⠀lose⠀by⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀restraint,⠀alliance,⠀and⠀consequence⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions:⠀a⠀route⠀chosen,⠀a⠀message⠀carried⠀or⠀withheld,⠀a⠀promise⠀kept,⠀a⠀debt⠀repaid.⠀Give⠀these⠀decisions⠀room⠀to⠀develop⠀through⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀them⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀juxtapose⠀accounts⠀without⠀forcing⠀them⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀verdict.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀concrete.⠀Institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀belief,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀who⠀could⠀travel,⠀what⠀news⠀could⠀arrive,⠀what⠀authority⠀could⠀compel⠀or⠀protect,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀could⠀reasonably⠀know.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀accounts⠀still⠀in⠀tension,⠀provided⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀why⠀each⠀teller⠀saw⠀and⠀said⠀what⠀they⠀did.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀historical⠀situation⠀cleanly.⠀Establish⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀reach,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀permit⠀in⠀this⠀particular⠀encounter.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀road,⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀boat,⠀a⠀market,⠀or⠀a⠀garrison⠀should⠀be⠀staged⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀who⠀is⠀where⠀and⠀what⠀movement⠀costs.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀When⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀name,⠀title,⠀tool,⠀or⠀obligation⠀appears,⠀present⠀it⠀clearly⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀for⠀a⠀glossary.\n\nUse⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beats⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀profile's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation.⠀After⠀a⠀demand,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀reunion,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀claim,⠀give⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀private⠀response⠀that⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀obligation⠀costs⠀or⠀what⠀the⠀attachment⠀requires.⠀Ground⠀the⠀reaction⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀or⠀spatial⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀period:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀set⠀down,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate⠀closing⠀on⠀a⠀companion,⠀the⠀distance⠀to⠀a⠀road⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀taken,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀seal⠀or⠀token⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀do.⠀The⠀reaction⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀its⠀owner;⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀witty⠀or⠀combative.⠀Show⠀restraint,⠀alliance,⠀and⠀reputation⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions:⠀a⠀favor⠀accepted,⠀a⠀silence⠀kept,⠀a⠀route⠀chosen,⠀a⠀companion⠀trusted.⠀Give⠀encounters⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀them⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows⠀or⠀rapid⠀reversals.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀limits⠀intact.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀fast-readable⠀presentation⠀import⠀modern⠀conveniences,⠀instant⠀communication,⠀or⠀anachronistic⠀attitudes.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀A⠀reaction⠀beat⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀encounter,⠀whether⠀a⠀decision⠀has⠀been⠀made,⠀a⠀journey⠀begun,⠀or⠀a⠀conversation⠀left⠀unfinished.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀historical⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀moving⠀attention,⠀letting⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀conditions⠀enter⠀as⠀encountered⠀particulars⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀background⠀exposition.⠀A⠀road's⠀condition,⠀a⠀garment's⠀weight,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀message⠀must⠀be⠀carried,⠀or⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀delay⠀can⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀obligation.⠀Let⠀public⠀duty⠀and⠀private⠀attachment⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀decision.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀an⠀observed⠀detail⠀to⠀an⠀association,⠀then⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀practical⠀act⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀still⠀perform,⠀so⠀that⠀feeling⠀and⠀consequence⠀share⠀one⠀continuous⠀movement.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀paragraph⠀around⠀a⠀traceable⠀image⠀or⠀sound⠀from⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀extend⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀understands⠀about⠀the⠀person,⠀place,⠀or⠀choice⠀before⠀them;⠀otherwise⠀let⠀it⠀remain⠀brief.⠀Recurring⠀images⠀should⠀return⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning⠀because⠀circumstances⠀have⠀altered,⠀not⠀as⠀decorative⠀refrains.⠀Use⠀plain⠀declarative⠀sentences⠀to⠀ground⠀the⠀rhythm,⠀especially⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀acts,⠀refuses,⠀or⠀accepts⠀an⠀obligation.⠀The⠀lyricism⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀narration's⠀attention,⠀not⠀to⠀every⠀speaker;⠀dialogue⠀may⠀remain⠀direct⠀and⠀practical.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀style's⠀associative⠀movement⠀from⠀dissolving⠀the⠀scene's⠀causality.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀light⠀on⠀a⠀wall⠀and⠀then⠀remember⠀a⠀promise,⠀but⠀the⠀promise⠀must⠀still⠀be⠀kept,⠀broken,⠀or⠀renegotiated⠀through⠀particular⠀actions.⠀Give⠀technique,⠀alliance,⠀reputation,⠀and⠀restraint⠀their⠀consequences⠀in⠀the⠀world.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀moving⠀through⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀still⠀deciding,⠀without⠀requiring⠀the⠀feeling⠀to⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀completed⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀reflection⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀historical⠀scene's⠀particular⠀changes:⠀a⠀route⠀no⠀longer⠀safe,⠀a⠀person⠀now⠀addressed⠀by⠀a⠀different⠀title,⠀a⠀skill⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀hidden,⠀a⠀room⠀that⠀has⠀lost⠀one⠀of⠀its⠀former⠀occupants.⠀The⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀such⠀a⠀change⠀while⠀still⠀performing⠀a⠀present⠀obligation.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀general⠀meditation⠀on⠀time.⠀Instead,⠀let⠀the⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀enter⠀because⠀the⠀present⠀moment⠀has⠀made⠀it⠀relevant,⠀and⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀practical⠀decision,⠀journey,⠀or⠀encounter⠀that⠀continues.\n\nUse⠀the⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀for⠀reflection.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀remember⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise⠀while⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀honor⠀a⠀new⠀one,⠀or⠀recognize⠀that⠀an⠀alliance⠀has⠀outlasted⠀the⠀affection⠀that⠀first⠀formed⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀memory⠀complicate⠀the⠀present⠀choice⠀without⠀automatically⠀canceling⠀it.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure,⠀humor,⠀competence,⠀and⠀relief⠀can⠀remain⠀available;⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀or⠀a⠀well-made⠀plan⠀may⠀be⠀enjoyed⠀even⠀when⠀it⠀recalls⠀an⠀absence.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reflection⠀proportionate⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀movement.⠀A⠀remembered⠀detail⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀or⠀extended⠀according⠀to⠀what⠀it⠀explains⠀about⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀understanding.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀encounter⠀to⠀end⠀by⠀announcing⠀impermanence⠀or⠀loss.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀attending⠀to⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀still⠀traveling,⠀or⠀still⠀in⠀conversation,⠀carrying⠀the⠀memory⠀without⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀completed⠀judgment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀definite⠀regional⠀route.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀situated⠀teller⠀and⠀an⠀occasion⠀for⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀halt⠀on⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀gathering⠀after⠀a⠀public⠀event,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀news,⠀or⠀an⠀elder⠀asked⠀to⠀explain⠀an⠀old⠀dispute.⠀The⠀frame⠀scene⠀must⠀remain⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story's⠀present.⠀The⠀teller's⠀knowledge,⠀audience,⠀and⠀purpose⠀shape⠀what⠀is⠀included,⠀what⠀is⠀delayed,⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀uncertain.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀frame⠀into⠀a⠀neutral⠀recitation⠀device.\n\nWithin⠀the⠀told⠀account,⠀preserve⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀expansive⠀scenic⠀movement⠀and⠀the⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation.⠀Let⠀the⠀nested⠀story⠀follow⠀particular⠀people⠀through⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀consequential⠀choices.⠀Technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀matter⠀because⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀listeners⠀care⠀about⠀how⠀a⠀decision⠀was⠀made⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀pause⠀to⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀correct⠀a⠀listener's⠀assumption,⠀or⠀admit⠀the⠀limits⠀of⠀what⠀they⠀witnessed.⠀Such⠀interruptions⠀should⠀affect⠀the⠀account⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀decorate⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀regional⠀tradition⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀generic.⠀Use⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀setting,⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀to⠀determine⠀the⠀occasion,⠀forms⠀of⠀address,⠀hospitality,⠀and⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀said⠀openly.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀universal⠀honor⠀code,⠀mysticism,⠀exile,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀diction.⠀The⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀told⠀story⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀each⠀other⠀at⠀the⠀end,⠀with⠀the⠀listeners⠀or⠀teller⠀still⠀facing⠀an⠀unfinished⠀practical⠀matter.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀there⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀nested⠀account⠀into⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀historical⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀period's⠀constraints⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀position⠀concrete.⠀One⠀detail⠀may⠀stand⠀for⠀a⠀longer⠀condition:⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀road,⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀a⠀seal,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀wet⠀cloak,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀message⠀must⠀be⠀delivered.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀carry⠀obligation⠀and⠀consequence⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀paragraph.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀choose⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀duty,⠀show⠀the⠀choice⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀do,⠀say,⠀or⠀refuse,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀general⠀statement⠀about⠀loyalty.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀scene⠀moving.⠀Travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship⠀can⠀still⠀occur,⠀but⠀compress⠀the⠀movement:⠀a⠀journey⠀may⠀be⠀rendered⠀by⠀its⠀decisive⠀leg,⠀a⠀conversation⠀by⠀the⠀exchange⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀causality.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀infer⠀why⠀a⠀character⠀acts⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀detail,⠀the⠀preceding⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀inward⠀connection.⠀An⠀essential⠀thought⠀may⠀extend⠀across⠀several⠀clauses⠀when⠀it⠀explains⠀a⠀decision⠀that⠀would⠀otherwise⠀seem⠀arbitrary.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀create⠀inference⠀rather⠀than⠀confusion.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀withholds⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀avoids⠀a⠀meeting,⠀the⠀surrounding⠀details⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀reason⠀available⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Keep⠀each⠀cast⠀voice⠀individual;⠀minimal⠀narration⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀every⠀speaker⠀uses⠀the⠀same⠀clipped⠀rhythm.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀consequence⠀is⠀already⠀inferable,⠀without⠀a⠀summarizing⠀reflection⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀sustained⠀scene-first⠀prose.⠀Open⠀within⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀situation⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀characters'⠀actions⠀and⠀perceptions.⠀A⠀journey,⠀negotiation,⠀public⠀gathering,⠀or⠀private⠀meeting⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀scene,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀Use⠀paragraphing⠀to⠀mark⠀changes⠀in⠀attention⠀or⠀time⠀without⠀inserting⠀recap⠀machinery⠀or⠀announcing⠀a⠀transition.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene⠀set⠀the⠀register.⠀A⠀tense⠀public⠀confrontation⠀may⠀use⠀shorter⠀exchanges⠀and⠀sharper⠀physical⠀detail;⠀a⠀longer⠀journey⠀may⠀allow⠀broader⠀reflection⠀or⠀explanation.⠀Preserve⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀generous⠀scenic⠀movement:⠀give⠀relationships⠀room⠀to⠀develop⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters,⠀and⠀let⠀technique,⠀restraint,⠀alliances,⠀and⠀reputation⠀affect⠀what⠀people⠀attempt⠀and⠀how⠀others⠀respond.⠀Private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀should⠀press⠀on⠀the⠀same⠀decision⠀rather⠀than⠀existing⠀as⠀separate⠀thematic⠀statements.\n\nUse⠀recollection⠀and⠀inner⠀experience⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀present⠀understanding.⠀A⠀memory⠀may⠀explain⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀loyalty,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀a⠀character⠀reads⠀another⠀person.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀understated⠀emotion,⠀contemporary⠀speech,⠀or⠀a⠀lesson⠀at⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀every⠀reply.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀the⠀conversation,⠀journey,⠀or⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀progress,⠀leaving⠀the⠀next⠀consequence⠀available⠀without⠀summarizing⠀its⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLet⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀select⠀the⠀scenes⠀and⠀determine⠀what⠀receives⠀extended⠀attention.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀is⠀a⠀long⠀alliance⠀tested⠀by⠀public⠀duty,⠀choose⠀encounters⠀where⠀that⠀test⠀becomes⠀concrete:⠀a⠀summons,⠀a⠀shared⠀journey,⠀a⠀debt⠀called⠀in,⠀a⠀confidence⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀kept⠀or⠀broken.⠀Use⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀institutions,⠀communication,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀particular⠀pressures⠀on⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes;⠀develop⠀only⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise.\n\nGive⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments⠀room⠀to⠀work.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀shared⠀practice⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀circumstances⠀have⠀changed⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀should⠀occupy⠀the⠀scene⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀register⠀as⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀a⠀label.⠀Preserve⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation:⠀the⠀relationship's⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀may⠀arrive⠀through⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀loyalty,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀restraint,⠀not⠀in⠀place⠀of⠀one.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀relationship's⠀consequences⠀legible⠀inside⠀the⠀historical⠀world.⠀What⠀one⠀character⠀risks⠀for⠀another,⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀say⠀openly,⠀and⠀what⠀their⠀alliance⠀costs⠀should⠀affect⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀outcome.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀authorized⠀interiority;⠀one⠀character's⠀private⠀feeling⠀does⠀not⠀grant⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀other's⠀mind.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀advanced,⠀strained,⠀comforted,⠀or⠀left⠀uncertain,⠀but⠀the⠀emotional⠀beat⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀required⠀confession⠀or⠀reconciliation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀a⠀chronicle⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀that⠀places⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀longer⠀history:⠀who⠀has⠀come,⠀what⠀obligation⠀is⠀being⠀tested,⠀or⠀what⠀earlier⠀act⠀now⠀returns.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀establish⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀alliance,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀encounter⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀supply⠀the⠀concrete⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀deed.⠀A⠀journey,⠀negotiation,⠀oath,⠀or⠀public⠀confrontation⠀can⠀organize⠀the⠀telling⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀establishes⠀it.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀deliberately.⠀A⠀name,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀remembered⠀act⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀event⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀Relate⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered,⠀but⠀keep⠀that⠀relation⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀focal⠀account⠀and⠀the⠀available⠀knowledge.⠀Shared⠀reputation⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀same⠀as⠀private⠀experience:⠀a⠀character⠀remembered⠀as⠀loyal⠀may⠀still⠀hesitate,⠀resent,⠀or⠀calculate.⠀Preserve⠀Jin⠀Yong's⠀tension⠀between⠀private⠀attachment⠀and⠀public⠀obligation⠀by⠀showing⠀how⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀alliance,⠀restraint,⠀or⠀reputation⠀becomes⠀a⠀deed⠀with⠀consequences.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀into⠀every⠀speaker.⠀Let⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀historical⠀setting⠀and⠀source⠀tradition⠀determine⠀the⠀forms⠀of⠀oath,⠀kinship,⠀gift,⠀feud,⠀or⠀public⠀memory⠀that⠀are⠀available.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀elevation⠀with⠀practical⠀speech,⠀and⠀humor⠀may⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀a⠀reputation⠀and⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀bears⠀it.⠀The⠀response⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀deed⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀in⠀motion,⠀leaving⠀its⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀remembered⠀account⠀unsettled.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀through⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀realism⠀route:⠀the⠀story's⠀public⠀obligations⠀become⠀legible⠀inside⠀particular⠀households,⠀workplaces,⠀and⠀local⠀institutions.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀loyalty⠀as⠀a⠀theme.⠀Let⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀reputation⠀acquire⠀weight⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀arrangements⠀it⠀disturbs:⠀a⠀kitchen⠀task⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀visitor⠀who⠀must⠀be⠀received,⠀a⠀work⠀schedule⠀changed⠀because⠀an⠀official⠀demand⠀arrives,⠀a⠀family⠀meal⠀delayed⠀while⠀someone⠀decides⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀said⠀at⠀table,⠀a⠀household⠀account⠀that⠀cannot⠀stretch⠀to⠀cover⠀both⠀a⠀private⠀kindness⠀and⠀a⠀public⠀duty.\n\nUse⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀pressure,⠀not⠀as⠀background⠀decoration.⠀A⠀character's⠀choices⠀are⠀limited⠀by⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀permits⠀them⠀to⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀say.⠀When⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified,⠀preserve⠀that⠀uncertainty⠀instead⠀of⠀filling⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀medieval⠀or⠀Nordic⠀template.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀unless⠀the⠀scenario⠀establishes⠀them.\n\nLet⠀competing⠀loyalties⠀emerge⠀through⠀ordinary⠀social⠀negotiation.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀asked⠀to⠀vouch⠀for⠀a⠀neighbor,⠀house⠀a⠀relative,⠀lend⠀a⠀tool,⠀carry⠀a⠀message,⠀or⠀keep⠀silent⠀about⠀an⠀arrangement.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀request⠀costs⠀in⠀time,⠀resources,⠀standing,⠀or⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀person,⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀decision⠀without⠀making⠀one⠀side⠀obviously⠀right.⠀A⠀refusal⠀may⠀be⠀prudent⠀and⠀still⠀wound;⠀a⠀promise⠀may⠀be⠀kept⠀and⠀still⠀cost⠀something⠀the⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀expect⠀to⠀lose.⠀Let⠀the⠀consequences⠀remain⠀open⠀rather⠀than⠀resolving⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.\n\nGive⠀encounters⠀room⠀for⠀travel,⠀explanation,⠀and⠀relationship.⠀A⠀conversation⠀can⠀develop⠀across⠀a⠀walk⠀to⠀the⠀market,⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀third⠀person.⠀Let⠀technique⠀and⠀restraint⠀appear⠀as⠀competence⠀within⠀the⠀domestic⠀or⠀working⠀world:⠀a⠀practiced⠀hand⠀at⠀a⠀craft,⠀a⠀careful⠀choice⠀of⠀when⠀to⠀speak,⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀finish⠀a⠀job⠀before⠀answering⠀a⠀provocation.⠀The⠀narration⠀records⠀the⠀particular⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀social⠀effect,⠀not⠀a⠀described⠀prowess.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀composed⠀and⠀clear,⠀with⠀private⠀experience⠀given⠀the⠀same⠀weight⠀as⠀visible⠀action.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀feel⠀loyalty,⠀resentment,⠀relief,⠀or⠀doubt⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Render⠀that⠀inward⠀life⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀while⠀keeping⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀separate.⠀Thought⠀and⠀speech⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀differ⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀reason;⠀no⠀fixed⠀ratio⠀is⠀required.\n\nEnd⠀a⠀response⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀attention⠀ends:⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀task⠀begun,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀realization.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀test⠀into⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀and⠀heard:⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀hands,⠀the⠀movement⠀across⠀a⠀room⠀or⠀road,⠀the⠀objects⠀a⠀person⠀carries⠀or⠀refuses.⠀Let⠀technique⠀and⠀restraint⠀appear⠀as⠀visible⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀described⠀prowess.⠀A⠀skilled⠀person⠀may⠀prepare⠀a⠀tool,⠀wait⠀for⠀the⠀right⠀moment,⠀or⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀act,⠀and⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀records⠀the⠀observable⠀result.\n\nLet⠀the⠀frame's⠀limits⠀carry⠀the⠀historical⠀world's⠀constraints.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀arriving⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀period's⠀transport⠀would⠀permit⠀it.⠀A⠀message⠀becomes⠀visible⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀handed⠀over,⠀set⠀down,⠀or⠀read.⠀An⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀may⠀announce⠀an⠀arrival,⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀work⠀continuing⠀elsewhere,⠀but⠀use⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀that⠀specific⠀audible⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀silently⠀compress⠀distances⠀or⠀communication⠀times⠀for⠀convenience.\n\nGive⠀dialogue⠀blocks⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀period's⠀obligations.⠀People⠀explain⠀themselves,⠀argue⠀over⠀loyalties,⠀make⠀promises,⠀and⠀withhold⠀what⠀their⠀position⠀forbids.⠀Do⠀not⠀reduce⠀every⠀encounter⠀to⠀a⠀confrontation.⠀A⠀conversation⠀can⠀establish⠀an⠀alliance,⠀repair⠀a⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀reveal⠀that⠀two⠀people⠀share⠀a⠀history⠀without⠀either⠀one⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nMake⠀loyalty⠀and⠀consequence⠀legible⠀through⠀staging⠀and⠀objects.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀hand⠀over⠀a⠀letter,⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀tool,⠀block⠀a⠀doorway,⠀turn⠀away⠀from⠀a⠀speaker,⠀or⠀wait⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀does⠀not⠀arrive.⠀Let⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀record⠀the⠀particular⠀decision⠀and⠀its⠀visible⠀cost.⠀A⠀promise⠀may⠀be⠀kept⠀by⠀staying,⠀by⠀leaving,⠀by⠀returning⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀by⠀refusing⠀to⠀speak.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀these⠀tensions⠀by⠀making⠀one⠀side⠀obviously⠀right;⠀let⠀the⠀consequences⠀remain⠀open.\n\nKeep⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀when⠀the⠀authorship⠀contract⠀requires⠀it.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀dialogue⠀and⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Use⠀voice-over⠀or⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀that⠀specific⠀device,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀default⠀container⠀for⠀thought.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀moment:⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀task⠀underway,⠀or⠀a⠀reaction⠀that⠀opens⠀the⠀next⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀arc⠀into⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nLet⠀the⠀shared⠀stage⠀space⠀make⠀relationships⠀legible.⠀Who⠀enters⠀when,⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀an⠀object,⠀who⠀stands⠀between⠀two⠀speakers,⠀and⠀who⠀leaves⠀before⠀a⠀question⠀is⠀answered⠀should⠀be⠀clear⠀from⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Use⠀these⠀physical⠀facts⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀period's⠀constraints:⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀watched,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀handed⠀over⠀or⠀withheld,⠀a⠀distance⠀that⠀makes⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀impossible.\n\nLet⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀obligation⠀and⠀reputation⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀staging⠀permits.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀promise⠀while⠀holding⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀refuse⠀a⠀request⠀while⠀moving⠀toward⠀an⠀exit,⠀or⠀offer⠀help⠀while⠀standing⠀too⠀far⠀away⠀to⠀give⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀line⠀and⠀the⠀blocking⠀work⠀together:⠀the⠀words⠀state⠀one⠀thing,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀position⠀shows⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀can⠀actually⠀do⠀or⠀risk.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀exchange⠀into⠀a⠀duel⠀of⠀wit.⠀A⠀pause⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀business⠀can⠀carry⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀a⠀line.\n\nKeep⠀encounters⠀spacious⠀enough⠀for⠀travel⠀and⠀explanation⠀within⠀the⠀stage's⠀limits.⠀A⠀scene⠀can⠀begin⠀with⠀an⠀arrival⠀and⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀departure.⠀A⠀relationship⠀can⠀develop⠀through⠀repeated⠀meetings⠀rather⠀than⠀one⠀decisive⠀confrontation.⠀Let⠀technique⠀appear⠀as⠀staged⠀action:⠀a⠀practiced⠀movement,⠀a⠀careful⠀choice⠀of⠀object,⠀a⠀visible⠀restraint.⠀The⠀stage⠀direction⠀records⠀the⠀particular⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀social⠀effect,⠀not⠀a⠀described⠀prowess.\n\nUse⠀entrances⠀and⠀exits⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀historical⠀world's⠀pressures⠀present.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀arrive⠀with⠀news⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said,⠀leave⠀because⠀a⠀duty⠀calls,⠀or⠀wait⠀for⠀someone⠀whose⠀arrival⠀is⠀uncertain.⠀The⠀time⠀a⠀journey⠀takes⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀scene's⠀structure:⠀do⠀not⠀silently⠀compress⠀it⠀for⠀convenience.⠀When⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified,⠀preserve⠀uncertainty⠀rather⠀than⠀filling⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀template.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀and⠀not⠀disguised⠀as⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Use⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀in⠀the⠀public⠀scene,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀every⠀private⠀thought.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀the⠀staged⠀action⠀naturally⠀pauses:⠀after⠀an⠀exit,⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀task⠀begun,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀move⠀open.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀gathered⠀resolution⠀into⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nLet⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind⠀carry⠀the⠀telling.⠀Its⠀movement⠀follows⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀historical⠀situation:⠀an⠀unpaid⠀obligation,⠀a⠀loyalty⠀divided⠀between⠀two⠀people,⠀a⠀reputation⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀protected⠀or⠀repaired.⠀Syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀may⠀follow⠀those⠀associations,⠀but⠀keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered⠀or⠀imagined.\n\nLet⠀the⠀recurring⠀concern⠀change⠀as⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀it.⠀A⠀promise⠀remembered⠀in⠀the⠀morning⠀may⠀look⠀different⠀after⠀a⠀visitor⠀speaks,⠀a⠀task⠀fails,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀arrives.⠀The⠀mind⠀should⠀revise⠀its⠀earlier⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀repeat⠀the⠀same⠀worry.⠀Show⠀the⠀new⠀detail⠀that⠀alters⠀the⠀memory:⠀a⠀phrase⠀the⠀person⠀now⠀hears⠀differently,⠀a⠀cost⠀the⠀mind⠀had⠀not⠀counted,⠀a⠀reason⠀for⠀loyalty⠀that⠀now⠀seems⠀weaker⠀or⠀stronger.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀tension⠀on⠀a⠀fixed⠀schedule;⠀let⠀the⠀revision⠀remain⠀partial⠀and⠀open.\n\nDo⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀inward⠀flow⠀erase⠀the⠀outward⠀world.⠀Encounters⠀still⠀occur⠀and⠀interrupt⠀thought.⠀A⠀person⠀arrives,⠀a⠀task⠀must⠀be⠀done,⠀a⠀message⠀comes,⠀a⠀journey⠀resumes.⠀The⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀these⠀events,⠀revises⠀its⠀understanding⠀of⠀them,⠀and⠀carries⠀their⠀practical⠀consequences.⠀Give⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀material⠀life⠀weight⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention:⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀time⠀a⠀road⠀takes,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀choice,⠀the⠀limits⠀of⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known⠀or⠀said.⠀When⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified,⠀preserve⠀uncertainty⠀rather⠀than⠀filling⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀template.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀world's⠀constraints⠀enter⠀as⠀sensory⠀and⠀practical⠀pressure.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀load,⠀the⠀cold⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀delay⠀of⠀a⠀messenger,⠀the⠀absence⠀of⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀should⠀have⠀arrived.⠀These⠀sensations⠀are⠀not⠀symbols;⠀they⠀are⠀the⠀actual⠀conditions⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀work⠀through.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀try⠀to⠀set⠀them⠀aside⠀and⠀fail,⠀or⠀return⠀to⠀them⠀because⠀they⠀block⠀a⠀private⠀wish.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀separation⠀between⠀minds.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀this⠀character's⠀private⠀experience,⠀but⠀other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀it⠀unless⠀the⠀scene⠀gives⠀them⠀a⠀reason.⠀Thought⠀and⠀speech⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀differ⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀cause.\n\nEnd⠀where⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀naturally⠀rests:⠀after⠀an⠀interruption,⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀a⠀realization⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀uncertain.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reversal,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀arc⠀into⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contributions:⠀one⠀writes⠀at⠀length,⠀another⠀replies⠀in⠀fragments,⠀a⠀third⠀delays⠀or⠀edits.⠀Use⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀matter⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀exchange⠀reveals⠀or⠀withholds.\n\nMake⠀loyalty⠀and⠀consequence⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀exchange's⠀actual⠀choices.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀send⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀commits⠀them,⠀withhold⠀one⠀that⠀would⠀warn⠀someone,⠀draft⠀a⠀reply⠀and⠀then⠀delete⠀it,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀smaller⠀truth⠀than⠀the⠀one⠀they⠀know.⠀Let⠀the⠀transcript⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀decision⠀and⠀its⠀cost:⠀a⠀delay⠀that⠀loses⠀an⠀opportunity,⠀an⠀edit⠀that⠀softens⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt⠀that⠀confirms⠀someone⠀knows⠀and⠀has⠀not⠀answered.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀these⠀tensions⠀by⠀making⠀one⠀side⠀obviously⠀right;⠀let⠀the⠀consequences⠀remain⠀open.\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀or⠀question⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀exchange⠀develops.⠀A⠀sender⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀promise⠀after⠀new⠀information⠀arrives,⠀or⠀ask⠀again⠀a⠀question⠀that⠀was⠀previously⠀avoided.⠀The⠀second⠀occurrence⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀has⠀changed:⠀a⠀new⠀fact,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀growing⠀cost.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀fresh⠀contradiction⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀drama.\n\nMake⠀the⠀medium⠀register⠀the⠀historical⠀world's⠀constraints.⠀A⠀message⠀takes⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀period's⠀communication⠀allows.⠀A⠀sender⠀can⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀been⠀told⠀or⠀observed.⠀A⠀delay⠀may⠀mean⠀distance,⠀work,⠀danger,⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀to⠀wait.⠀Do⠀not⠀silently⠀compress⠀these⠀limits⠀for⠀convenience.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Required⠀private⠀experience⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀clearly⠀separated⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀transcript,⠀attributed⠀and⠀kept⠀out⠀of⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀exchange⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀communication⠀pauses:⠀after⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀read⠀receipt,⠀a⠀draft⠀abandoned,⠀or⠀a⠀reply⠀left⠀pending.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀negotiation⠀into⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀concise⠀scene-setting⠀to⠀establish⠀the⠀historical⠀moment:⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀are,⠀what⠀objects⠀and⠀conditions⠀surround⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀life⠀makes⠀possible⠀or⠀difficult.⠀Let⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicators.⠀A⠀changed⠀expression⠀may⠀draw⠀attention,⠀but⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀facts⠀and⠀spoken⠀words⠀must⠀carry⠀the⠀actual⠀meaning.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀reaction⠀beat⠀register⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀loyalty⠀decision.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀else,⠀see⠀a⠀person⠀arrive⠀too⠀late⠀or⠀leave⠀too⠀early,⠀or⠀recognize⠀that⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀in⠀one⠀place⠀now⠀binds⠀them⠀in⠀another.⠀The⠀inner⠀response⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀consequence:⠀relief,⠀resentment,⠀doubt,⠀or⠀a⠀revised⠀understanding⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀obligation⠀will⠀require.⠀Keep⠀that⠀private⠀experience⠀out⠀of⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Thought⠀and⠀speech⠀may⠀align⠀or⠀differ⠀for⠀a⠀particular⠀reason.\n\nGive⠀dialogue⠀clear⠀attribution⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀carry⠀obligation⠀and⠀reputation.⠀People⠀explain⠀themselves,⠀argue⠀over⠀loyalties,⠀make⠀promises,⠀and⠀withhold⠀what⠀their⠀position⠀forbids.⠀Keep⠀encounters⠀spacious⠀enough⠀for⠀travel⠀and⠀relationship⠀to⠀develop⠀across⠀scenes.⠀A⠀conversation⠀can⠀establish⠀an⠀alliance,⠀repair⠀a⠀misunderstanding,⠀or⠀reveal⠀shared⠀history⠀without⠀either⠀person⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nMake⠀technique⠀and⠀restraint⠀visible⠀through⠀particular⠀decisions.⠀A⠀skilled⠀person⠀may⠀prepare⠀a⠀tool,⠀wait⠀for⠀the⠀right⠀moment,⠀or⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀act.⠀The⠀narrative⠀passage⠀records⠀the⠀observable⠀result⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀response,⠀not⠀a⠀described⠀prowess.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene's⠀objects⠀and⠀conditions⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀decision⠀costs:⠀a⠀task⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀a⠀route⠀not⠀taken,⠀a⠀message⠀not⠀sent.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀attention⠀rests:⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀task⠀begun,⠀or⠀a⠀reaction⠀that⠀opens⠀the⠀next⠀question.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀arc⠀into⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaialbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jin⠀Yong⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Open⠀with⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀is⠀underway:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀the⠀action⠀stands,⠀and⠀what⠀obligation⠀or⠀relationship⠀is⠀currently⠀at⠀stake.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀full⠀retelling⠀of⠀earlier⠀installments.\n\nLet⠀a⠀loyalty⠀decision⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀across⠀installments.⠀A⠀promise⠀made⠀in⠀one⠀reply⠀may⠀cost⠀a⠀duty⠀in⠀another,⠀but⠀the⠀later⠀installment⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀particular⠀change:⠀a⠀new⠀fact,⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀the⠀character⠀did⠀not⠀expect.⠀Recover⠀the⠀exact⠀earlier⠀decision⠀briefly⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀fresh⠀contradiction⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀drama;⠀let⠀the⠀new⠀information⠀qualify⠀the⠀old⠀understanding⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀old⠀event.\n\nLet⠀each⠀reply⠀advance⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter.⠀People⠀travel,⠀work,⠀explain⠀themselves,⠀argue⠀over⠀loyalties,⠀make⠀promises,⠀or⠀choose⠀restraint.⠀Give⠀the⠀scene⠀room⠀to⠀develop⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀action⠀to⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀blows.⠀A⠀technique⠀or⠀skill⠀matters⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀decision,⠀not⠀a⠀described⠀prowess.\n\nTie⠀progress⠀to⠀the⠀historical⠀world's⠀actual⠀constraints.⠀A⠀journey⠀takes⠀the⠀time⠀the⠀period's⠀transport⠀allows.⠀A⠀message⠀arrives⠀when⠀communication⠀would⠀permit⠀it.⠀A⠀person⠀can⠀know⠀only⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀have⠀seen⠀or⠀been⠀told.⠀When⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified,⠀preserve⠀uncertainty⠀rather⠀than⠀filling⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀generic⠀template.\n\nUse⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀A⠀hook⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀a⠀consequence⠀that⠀remains⠀open,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀being⠀imposed⠀to⠀create⠀suspense.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀actual⠀scene⠀pauses:⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀task⠀begun,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀realization⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀uncertain.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀into⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀emotional⠀strain⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀constraints:⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀takes⠀days⠀to⠀arrive,⠀a⠀household⠀obligation⠀that⠀prevents⠀a⠀private⠀conversation,⠀a⠀shared⠀object⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀replaced,⠀a⠀social⠀expectation⠀that⠀makes⠀apology⠀or⠀admission⠀costly.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀feeling⠀in⠀general⠀terms;⠀let⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀repeated⠀object,⠀task,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀routine⠀and⠀show⠀how⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed⠀after⠀the⠀hurtful⠀event.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀difficult⠀conversation⠀as⠀it⠀actually⠀unfolds⠀under⠀those⠀conditions.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀practical⠀matters,⠀fall⠀silent,⠀say⠀less⠀than⠀they⠀intended,⠀or⠀offer⠀an⠀apology⠀that⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀cannot⠀fully⠀accept.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀affect⠀subsequent⠀behavior:⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀performed⠀with⠀too⠀much⠀care,⠀a⠀habitual⠀phrase⠀that⠀now⠀goes⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀room⠀avoided,⠀a⠀question⠀postponed.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain.⠀A⠀moment⠀of⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀interrupted⠀by⠀the⠀very⠀obligation⠀that⠀caused⠀the⠀rift,⠀and⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀resolve⠀the⠀hurt.\n\nUse⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀suffering.⠀A⠀first-person⠀narrator⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀physical⠀details⠀that⠀betray⠀their⠀own⠀state;⠀a⠀more⠀distant⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀the⠀visible⠀signs⠀while⠀leaving⠀the⠀exact⠀private⠀feeling⠀implied.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀available⠀under⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀articulate⠀their⠀wound.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀determines⠀what⠀repair⠀is⠀possible:⠀someone⠀may⠀return,⠀apologize,⠀or⠀resume⠀a⠀shared⠀routine⠀without⠀the⠀relationship⠀becoming⠀what⠀it⠀was⠀before.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀tragic⠀ending⠀or⠀a⠀miraculous⠀reconciliation;⠀the⠀recipe's⠀work⠀is⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀unresolved⠀hurt⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀particular⠀life⠀the⠀period⠀has⠀given⠀these⠀characters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀with⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution.⠀Ground⠀the⠀interval⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀concrete⠀routines:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀mending,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀letter,⠀walking⠀to⠀work,⠀attending⠀a⠀market,⠀performing⠀a⠀household⠀or⠀institutional⠀task.⠀Let⠀the⠀active⠀characters⠀and⠀NPCs⠀continue⠀their⠀practical⠀lives⠀during⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀pausing⠀to⠀wait⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀prompt.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Maeda⠀profile's⠀repeated⠀objects,⠀routines,⠀phrases,⠀and⠀relationships⠀as⠀continuity⠀anchors⠀across⠀replies.⠀A⠀familiar⠀object⠀may⠀reappear⠀with⠀slightly⠀changed⠀significance;⠀a⠀habitual⠀phrase⠀may⠀be⠀answered⠀differently;⠀a⠀routine⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀or⠀resumed.⠀These⠀callbacks⠀help⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀previous⠀events.⠀Keep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀active⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀with⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀belief,⠀or⠀material⠀life,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀backdrop⠀of⠀period⠀decoration.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀progress,⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀pause,⠀an⠀arrival⠀or⠀departure,⠀a⠀decision⠀deferred.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀at⠀the⠀end.⠀The⠀next⠀reply⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀interval⠀or⠀begin⠀a⠀later⠀one.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control⠀settings.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀to⠀appropriate⠀people⠀and⠀scenes,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀witty⠀or⠀every⠀pause⠀significant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route⠀—⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀chaptered⠀narrative⠀—⠀and⠀divide⠀the⠀story⠀into⠀bounded⠀episodes,⠀each⠀a⠀complete⠀small⠀account⠀with⠀its⠀own⠀scene,⠀participants,⠀and⠀turn⠀of⠀events,⠀joined⠀less⠀by⠀continuous⠀narration⠀than⠀by⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀running⠀underneath.⠀Open⠀each⠀episode⠀with⠀a⠀situating⠀anchor:⠀a⠀season,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀recurring⠀task,⠀a⠀point⠀in⠀the⠀year's⠀round.⠀Let⠀the⠀episode's⠀action⠀turn⠀on⠀one⠀concrete⠀encounter⠀with⠀work,⠀an⠀institution,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀belief,⠀or⠀a⠀shortage,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀period⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀attempt⠀within⠀it.\n\nBetween⠀episodes,⠀mark⠀time⠀by⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀summary.⠀Show⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀performed⠀differently⠀at⠀its⠀next⠀appearance⠀—⠀hands⠀that⠀moved⠀quickly⠀now⠀slow,⠀a⠀customary⠀greeting⠀now⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀portion⠀now⠀measured⠀out⠀scant.⠀Let⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀relationship⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀episode⠀carrying⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀whatever⠀intervened,⠀and⠀trust⠀the⠀episodic⠀spacing⠀to⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀recognize⠀the⠀echo⠀and⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding⠀without⠀narration⠀explaining⠀the⠀shift.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀exactly⠀as⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀them;⠀this⠀route⠀is⠀a⠀way⠀of⠀telling,⠀not⠀a⠀transplanted⠀setting⠀or⠀cast⠀identity.⠀Use⠀chapter-like⠀closures⠀or⠀scene⠀breaks⠀at⠀each⠀episode's⠀end⠀while⠀keeping⠀the⠀telling⠀continuous⠀enough⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀across⠀the⠀gaps.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀scenes⠀that⠀can⠀hold⠀them.⠀The⠀final⠀understanding⠀may⠀be⠀partial;⠀a⠀closing⠀episode⠀may⠀simply⠀show⠀the⠀characters⠀living⠀on⠀inside⠀the⠀arrangements⠀the⠀period⠀allows⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard,⠀concrete⠀strokes:⠀forceful⠀verbs,⠀specific⠀nouns,⠀transitions⠀that⠀cut⠀from⠀one⠀physical⠀fact⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀—⠀a⠀cracked⠀bowl,⠀a⠀seam⠀mended⠀twice,⠀a⠀letter⠀folded⠀until⠀the⠀creases⠀split,⠀a⠀tool⠀worn⠀smooth⠀at⠀the⠀grip.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀life⠀supply⠀the⠀texture⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀what⠀the⠀work⠀demands⠀of⠀a⠀body,⠀what⠀weather⠀does⠀to⠀a⠀road,⠀what⠀scarcity⠀does⠀to⠀a⠀portion,⠀what⠀an⠀institution's⠀clerk⠀can⠀withhold.⠀The⠀hard⠀edges⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀world,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀generic⠀survival⠀backdrop⠀laid⠀over⠀it.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀profile's⠀recurrence⠀in⠀objects⠀and⠀bodies⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀stated⠀feeling.⠀A⠀familiar⠀thing⠀takes⠀on⠀its⠀new⠀weight⠀through⠀condition⠀and⠀use:⠀a⠀routine⠀performed⠀with⠀too⠀much⠀force⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀habitual⠀phrase⠀said⠀flat,⠀dropped,⠀or⠀answered⠀with⠀only⠀a⠀look.⠀Let⠀tenderness⠀arrive⠀as⠀practical⠀care⠀—⠀food⠀shared,⠀something⠀repaired,⠀someone⠀walked⠀home,⠀a⠀task⠀finished⠀for⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀cannot⠀finish⠀it⠀—⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀prose⠀concrete⠀while⠀it⠀happens.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀on⠀purpose.⠀Hold⠀most⠀transitions⠀tight,⠀but⠀keep⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀actually⠀working⠀out⠀what⠀a⠀change⠀means⠀or⠀what⠀to⠀do⠀next;⠀compression⠀must⠀not⠀amputate⠀reasoning.⠀Ground⠀any⠀rough⠀or⠀abrasive⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker⠀—⠀position,⠀habit,⠀immediate⠀pressure⠀—⠀so⠀one⠀blunt⠀voice⠀stays⠀one⠀person's⠀voice⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀room's⠀weather.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀contract.⠀Humor⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀and⠀scenes⠀that⠀can⠀carry⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀wit⠀into⠀a⠀grim⠀interval,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀grimness⠀into⠀a⠀warm⠀one.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nCarry⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀documents,⠀each⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀an⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀a⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Choose⠀the⠀form⠀the⠀situation⠀actually⠀produces⠀—⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀journal⠀entry,⠀a⠀ledger⠀line,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀note,⠀a⠀receipt⠀—⠀rather⠀than⠀rotating⠀through⠀every⠀available⠀format.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀govern⠀the⠀medium:⠀what⠀paper⠀and⠀ink⠀cost,⠀how⠀many⠀days⠀a⠀message⠀travels,⠀who⠀can⠀read,⠀what⠀a⠀record⠀is⠀kept⠀for,⠀what⠀an⠀official⠀form⠀has⠀room⠀to⠀say.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document⠀know⠀and⠀omit⠀what⠀its⠀author's⠀situation⠀dictates.⠀A⠀letter⠀leaves⠀out⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀risked⠀or⠀afforded,⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀assumes⠀the⠀recipient⠀already⠀knows,⠀what⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀been⠀understood.⠀A⠀journal⠀may⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀routine⠀in⠀detail⠀and⠀pass⠀in⠀one⠀line⠀over⠀the⠀event⠀that⠀hurt⠀most.⠀A⠀report⠀can⠀flatten⠀a⠀loss⠀into⠀an⠀item.⠀Read⠀events⠀across⠀entries⠀through⠀gaps⠀and⠀traces:⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀phrase,⠀a⠀letter⠀never⠀sent,⠀a⠀figure⠀corrected⠀later,⠀a⠀page⠀softened⠀by⠀refolding.\n\nThread⠀the⠀profile's⠀recurrence⠀through⠀the⠀paper⠀record.⠀An⠀object⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀letter,⠀then⠀a⠀journal,⠀then⠀an⠀inventory,⠀each⠀mention⠀carrying⠀a⠀different⠀weight;⠀a⠀habitual⠀phrase⠀can⠀be⠀quoted,⠀misquoted,⠀or⠀finally⠀answered⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀hand;⠀a⠀relationship⠀can⠀shift⠀between⠀entries⠀without⠀any⠀single⠀document⠀naming⠀the⠀change.⠀A⠀private⠀page⠀can⠀hold⠀real⠀unspoken⠀reasoning,⠀while⠀what⠀its⠀writer⠀would⠀never⠀put⠀to⠀paper⠀stays⠀with⠀the⠀active⠀interiority⠀contract⠀rather⠀than⠀vanishing⠀with⠀the⠀form.⠀Trust⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀assemble⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀written⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀conspicuously⠀not,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀sequence⠀readable⠀without⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀record.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀be⠀partial:⠀a⠀last⠀document⠀can⠀simply⠀show⠀the⠀characters⠀living⠀with⠀what⠀has⠀happened.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nGive⠀the⠀attention⠀to⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀forms:⠀a⠀dish⠀cooked⠀the⠀way⠀one⠀person⠀likes⠀it,⠀a⠀task⠀taken⠀over⠀unasked,⠀a⠀seat⠀kept⠀warm,⠀a⠀small⠀thing⠀mended⠀or⠀replaced,⠀a⠀route⠀chosen⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀easier⠀on⠀someone,⠀a⠀quiet⠀hour⠀arranged⠀inside⠀a⠀crowded⠀household.⠀Let⠀the⠀setting⠀decide⠀what⠀comfort⠀can⠀be⠀—⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀bought⠀or⠀bartered,⠀what⠀work⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀allow,⠀what⠀the⠀season⠀permits⠀—⠀so⠀each⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀costs⠀something⠀real⠀and⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀world.⠀The⠀period's⠀obligations,⠀institutions,⠀and⠀material⠀limits⠀stay⠀present⠀around⠀the⠀warm⠀interval;⠀the⠀treatment⠀works⠀inside⠀the⠀genre,⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀story⠀with⠀a⠀timeless⠀domestic⠀vignette.\n\nMake⠀the⠀care⠀particular⠀through⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀rather⠀than⠀generic⠀through⠀declaration.⠀A⠀remembered⠀preference⠀—⠀how⠀someone⠀takes⠀their⠀tea,⠀which⠀blanket⠀they⠀reach⠀for⠀first⠀—⠀does⠀more⠀than⠀a⠀stated⠀feeling.⠀A⠀routine⠀adjusted⠀by⠀a⠀small⠀margin,⠀a⠀habitual⠀phrase⠀worn⠀into⠀a⠀private⠀joke⠀or⠀a⠀reassurance,⠀an⠀object⠀given,⠀returned,⠀or⠀used⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀shows⠀attention⠀to⠀its⠀owner:⠀these⠀are⠀the⠀working⠀units.⠀Affection⠀can⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀a⠀confession⠀and⠀without⠀an⠀emotional⠀repair;⠀sitting⠀with⠀someone⠀in⠀silence,⠀or⠀finishing⠀a⠀chore⠀for⠀them,⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀whole⠀event⠀of⠀the⠀scene.\n\nKeep⠀personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀intact.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀and⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀the⠀world's⠀established⠀problems.⠀Someone⠀may⠀accept⠀care⠀awkwardly,⠀refuse⠀it,⠀or⠀offer⠀it⠀inconveniently.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀people⠀who⠀can⠀carry⠀them.⠀Close⠀where⠀the⠀warmth⠀closes⠀—⠀the⠀difficulty⠀outside⠀the⠀door⠀is⠀still⠀there,⠀and⠀the⠀characters⠀are⠀still⠀glad⠀of⠀each⠀other.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nCompose⠀in⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀a⠀scene⠀open⠀outward⠀into⠀its⠀social⠀frame⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀permits:⠀the⠀household's⠀standing,⠀the⠀institution's⠀expectations,⠀the⠀season's⠀demands,⠀the⠀public⠀meaning⠀a⠀private⠀act⠀will⠀acquire.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narration⠀distinct⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language⠀—⠀shaped,⠀considered,⠀able⠀to⠀hold⠀custom⠀and⠀history⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀sentence⠀as⠀a⠀gesture⠀—⠀while⠀the⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀in⠀the⠀mouths⠀and⠀idiom⠀of⠀the⠀actual⠀cast.⠀Frame⠀judgment⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀permitted⠀distance,⠀never⠀through⠀a⠀generic⠀aristocratic⠀template;⠀the⠀framing⠀must⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀social⠀position.\n\nLet⠀the⠀profile's⠀recurrence⠀live⠀inside⠀this⠀architecture.⠀Describe⠀a⠀familiar⠀object⠀once⠀with⠀enough⠀care⠀that⠀its⠀later⠀reappearance⠀carries⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding⠀without⠀a⠀stated⠀summary.⠀Render⠀a⠀routine⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀ceremony⠀—⠀the⠀order⠀of⠀tasks,⠀the⠀handing⠀over⠀of⠀things,⠀the⠀words⠀exchanged⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀point⠀each⠀day⠀—⠀so⠀that⠀when⠀the⠀ceremony⠀continues⠀after⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀gave⠀it⠀meaning⠀is⠀gone,⠀the⠀paragraph⠀itself⠀does⠀the⠀mourning.⠀A⠀habitual⠀phrase⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀the⠀narration⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀inflection⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀and⠀the⠀sustained⠀movement⠀lets⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀rather⠀than⠀be⠀told⠀it.\n\nUse⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀and⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀rooms⠀to⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀material⠀offers⠀them:⠀a⠀letter⠀read⠀aloud⠀before⠀witnesses,⠀an⠀occasion⠀pressing⠀against⠀a⠀private⠀grief,⠀a⠀form⠀observed⠀exactly⠀because⠀feeling⠀cannot⠀be⠀shown.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀prose⠀archaic⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate,⠀and⠀supply⠀no⠀aristocracy⠀the⠀scenario⠀lacks;⠀the⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀style.⠀The⠀changed⠀understanding⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀and⠀a⠀closing⠀scene⠀may⠀simply⠀show⠀the⠀characters⠀continuing⠀inside⠀their⠀altered⠀arrangements.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀the⠀telling⠀becomes⠀possible:⠀a⠀night⠀watch,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀wait⠀for⠀news,⠀a⠀meal,⠀a⠀work⠀stoppage,⠀or⠀another⠀pause⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀setting⠀actually⠀permit.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀why⠀this⠀teller⠀speaks⠀now,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀hopes⠀to⠀gain,⠀avoid,⠀or⠀understand.⠀Let⠀the⠀occasion⠀create⠀a⠀practical⠀or⠀emotional⠀reason⠀for⠀the⠀tale;⠀the⠀telling⠀should⠀be⠀an⠀intervention⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀not⠀decoration.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀from⠀material⠀the⠀outer⠀characters⠀already⠀share:⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀routine,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀recurring⠀errand,⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀both⠀know.⠀Have⠀the⠀teller⠀revisit⠀that⠀shared⠀material⠀from⠀a⠀different⠀angle,⠀so⠀the⠀listener⠀learns⠀not⠀only⠀what⠀happened⠀but⠀what⠀it⠀meant⠀to⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀live⠀through⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀tale⠀be⠀true,⠀partial,⠀or⠀shaped⠀by⠀loyalty;⠀its⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀reveal⠀the⠀teller's⠀present⠀feeling⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀the⠀past⠀event.⠀Show⠀that⠀shaping⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀dwells⠀on,⠀skips,⠀or⠀repeats.\n\nUse⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀constraints⠀to⠀govern⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀and⠀report.⠀A⠀character⠀cannot⠀recount⠀a⠀private⠀conversation⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀witness⠀or⠀describe⠀a⠀mechanism⠀their⠀social⠀position⠀would⠀not⠀let⠀them⠀inspect.⠀When⠀the⠀tale⠀reaches⠀the⠀limit⠀of⠀the⠀teller's⠀knowledge,⠀have⠀the⠀telling⠀hesitate,⠀admit⠀uncertainty,⠀or⠀shift⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀observed.⠀Let⠀the⠀listener⠀notice⠀such⠀a⠀limit⠀and⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later,⠀so⠀the⠀frame's⠀audience⠀awareness⠀does⠀real⠀narrative⠀work.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀one⠀concrete⠀detail⠀from⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀acquire⠀new⠀weight:⠀the⠀listener⠀handles⠀the⠀object⠀differently,⠀repeats⠀a⠀phrase⠀with⠀altered⠀meaning,⠀or⠀sees⠀a⠀familiar⠀routine⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀something⠀previously⠀unacknowledged.⠀The⠀changed⠀understanding⠀may⠀remain⠀unspoken;⠀it⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀listener's⠀private⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀room,⠀the⠀teller,⠀or⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.⠀The⠀telling⠀may⠀change⠀the⠀relationship⠀without⠀resolving⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀distinct⠀through⠀clear⠀transitions:⠀the⠀frame's⠀present⠀action,⠀the⠀teller's⠀voice,⠀and⠀the⠀embedded⠀past⠀should⠀each⠀carry⠀their⠀own⠀sensory⠀and⠀temporal⠀markers.⠀Let⠀recurrence⠀connect⠀levels⠀rather⠀than⠀blur⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀royal⠀court,⠀desert,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀magical⠀bargain⠀unless⠀the⠀actual⠀historical⠀setting⠀supplies⠀them.⠀The⠀frame's⠀power⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀need⠀and⠀the⠀listener's⠀attention⠀within⠀their⠀specific⠀historical⠀circumstances.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀or⠀developmental⠀realism⠀route.⠀Ground⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀institutions,⠀work⠀rhythms,⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀location.⠀Let⠀a⠀character's⠀daily⠀attachment⠀become⠀visible⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀repeatedly:⠀the⠀errands⠀they⠀run,⠀the⠀tools⠀they⠀maintain,⠀the⠀ledgers⠀they⠀keep,⠀the⠀meals⠀they⠀prepare,⠀the⠀permissions⠀they⠀need,⠀or⠀the⠀hours⠀they⠀keep.⠀Derive⠀these⠀particulars⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀historical⠀setting⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀premodern⠀template.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀accumulated⠀ordinary⠀scenes⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀dramatic⠀event.⠀Show⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀routine⠀returning⠀across⠀different⠀days⠀or⠀seasons,⠀each⠀time⠀carrying⠀slightly⠀more⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀situation:⠀a⠀shared⠀task⠀becomes⠀harder,⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀is⠀said⠀with⠀different⠀feeling,⠀a⠀small⠀obligation⠀reveals⠀a⠀larger⠀dependence.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀understand⠀the⠀relationship⠀by⠀watching⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀manage⠀practical⠀life⠀together,⠀not⠀by⠀being⠀told⠀what⠀they⠀mean⠀to⠀each⠀other.\n\nLet⠀institutions⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀affect⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀a⠀landlord,⠀an⠀official,⠀a⠀guild⠀rule,⠀a⠀market⠀price,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀arrives⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀arrive,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀is⠀possible.⠀Make⠀these⠀encounters⠀create⠀the⠀specific⠀pressures⠀that⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀cannot⠀help,⠀visit,⠀speak,⠀or⠀provide,⠀show⠀the⠀concrete⠀reason⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀arrangements.\n\nAfter⠀the⠀event⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life,⠀keep⠀the⠀ordinary⠀texture⠀intact.⠀Have⠀the⠀character⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀routines⠀while⠀their⠀private⠀attention⠀to⠀them⠀changes:⠀the⠀familiar⠀task⠀now⠀feels⠀like⠀proof⠀of⠀something,⠀the⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀now⠀sounds⠀like⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀an⠀evasion,⠀the⠀object⠀now⠀carries⠀a⠀memory⠀it⠀did⠀not⠀carry⠀before.⠀The⠀changed⠀understanding⠀can⠀remain⠀unspoken⠀or⠀be⠀expressed⠀only⠀partially,⠀in⠀a⠀gesture⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀decision.\n\nKeep⠀syntax⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀realist⠀route⠀and⠀the⠀actual⠀narrator.⠀A⠀third-person⠀narrator⠀may⠀observe⠀social⠀detail⠀and⠀private⠀feeling⠀with⠀measured⠀clarity;⠀a⠀first-person⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀only⠀what⠀their⠀position⠀lets⠀them⠀know.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀bureaucratic⠀tone,⠀a⠀single⠀national⠀temperament,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order.⠀The⠀realism⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀precision⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀observation,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀clinical⠀or⠀documentary⠀voice.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nEstablish⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀as⠀a⠀specific⠀historical⠀arrangement:⠀a⠀family⠀claim,⠀a⠀property⠀right,⠀a⠀religious⠀office,⠀a⠀guild⠀privilege,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀another⠀inherited⠀power⠀that⠀still⠀shapes⠀what⠀people⠀may⠀do.⠀Show⠀its⠀collision⠀with⠀present⠀daily⠀life⠀through⠀concrete⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀material:⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀building,⠀the⠀route⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀take,⠀the⠀hours⠀a⠀place⠀is⠀open,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀service,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀room⠀is⠀furnished⠀or⠀neglected.⠀Make⠀the⠀authority⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀physical⠀world,⠀not⠀only⠀in⠀dialogue.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀attachment⠀that⠀exists⠀within⠀this⠀collision:⠀two⠀people⠀who⠀share⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀routine,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀phrase⠀while⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀presses⠀on⠀them⠀differently.⠀Show⠀their⠀ordinary⠀repetitions—the⠀same⠀errand,⠀the⠀same⠀meal,⠀the⠀same⠀walk,⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀handled⠀daily—so⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀what⠀their⠀shared⠀life⠀feels⠀like⠀before⠀it⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀make⠀that⠀ordinary⠀life⠀feel⠀exposed:⠀a⠀trusted⠀place⠀may⠀be⠀watched,⠀a⠀familiar⠀route⠀may⠀become⠀unsafe,⠀a⠀private⠀moment⠀may⠀be⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀claim⠀neither⠀character⠀fully⠀controls.\n\nUse⠀social⠀masks⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀feature⠀of⠀the⠀collision.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀perform⠀deference,⠀indifference,⠀or⠀loyalty⠀in⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀the⠀authority⠀while⠀their⠀private⠀attention⠀remains⠀on⠀the⠀other⠀person.⠀Let⠀the⠀mask⠀fall⠀only⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀fall⠀be⠀partial:⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀how⠀a⠀familiar⠀phrase⠀is⠀said.⠀Keep⠀the⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated—affection⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀dependence,⠀resentment,⠀fear,⠀or⠀complicity—without⠀making⠀every⠀caring⠀act⠀fraudulent⠀or⠀every⠀trusted⠀person⠀a⠀betrayer.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀event⠀changes⠀the⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life,⠀keep⠀the⠀change⠀within⠀the⠀world's⠀actual⠀possibilities.⠀The⠀old⠀authority⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀defeated⠀or⠀revealed⠀as⠀a⠀supernatural⠀force.⠀Instead,⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀see⠀the⠀shared⠀routine⠀or⠀object⠀differently:⠀the⠀daily⠀walk⠀now⠀registers⠀the⠀authority's⠀reach,⠀the⠀familiar⠀room⠀now⠀shows⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀staying,⠀the⠀private⠀phrase⠀now⠀carries⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀said⠀in⠀public.⠀The⠀changed⠀understanding⠀may⠀lead⠀to⠀a⠀practical⠀decision,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀collision.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀horror⠀and⠀atmosphere⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀historical⠀authority's⠀real⠀power⠀over⠀bodies,⠀spaces,⠀and⠀choices,⠀rendered⠀with⠀intimate⠀material⠀precision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀route.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀household,⠀neighborhood,⠀or⠀workplace⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀location.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters'⠀shared⠀life⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀routines⠀that⠀structure⠀their⠀days:⠀who⠀cooks,⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀travels,⠀who⠀keeps⠀accounts,⠀who⠀tends⠀a⠀child⠀or⠀an⠀elder,⠀who⠀observes⠀a⠀festival⠀or⠀a⠀fast,⠀who⠀negotiates⠀a⠀price⠀or⠀a⠀permission.⠀Derive⠀these⠀particulars⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀historical⠀setting,⠀including⠀the⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀supplied.\n\nDevelop⠀the⠀attachment⠀through⠀repeated⠀domestic⠀and⠀social⠀detail.⠀Show⠀the⠀same⠀object,⠀task,⠀or⠀phrase⠀returning⠀across⠀different⠀days⠀or⠀seasons,⠀each⠀time⠀carrying⠀more⠀of⠀the⠀characters'⠀situation:⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀becomes⠀harder⠀to⠀arrange,⠀a⠀familiar⠀route⠀becomes⠀longer⠀or⠀shorter,⠀a⠀household⠀task⠀changes⠀hands,⠀a⠀phrase⠀of⠀greeting⠀or⠀complaint⠀acquires⠀a⠀private⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀understand⠀the⠀relationship⠀by⠀watching⠀how⠀the⠀characters⠀manage⠀daily⠀life⠀together,⠀not⠀by⠀being⠀told⠀what⠀they⠀mean⠀to⠀each⠀other.\n\nLet⠀family,⠀work,⠀and⠀local⠀obligation⠀create⠀the⠀specific⠀pressures⠀on⠀the⠀attachment.⠀A⠀relative's⠀need,⠀a⠀landlord's⠀demand,⠀a⠀market⠀condition,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀expectation,⠀or⠀a⠀community⠀event⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other.⠀Show⠀the⠀concrete⠀reason⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀cannot⠀help,⠀visit,⠀speak,⠀or⠀provide.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀a⠀universal⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀religion⠀onto⠀the⠀scene;⠀use⠀only⠀what⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀and⠀characters⠀actually⠀contain.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀event⠀changes⠀the⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life,⠀keep⠀the⠀change⠀within⠀the⠀domestic⠀texture.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀routines⠀while⠀their⠀private⠀attention⠀to⠀them⠀shifts:⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀now⠀feels⠀like⠀a⠀burden⠀or⠀a⠀gift,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀now⠀sounds⠀like⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀an⠀avoidance,⠀a⠀household⠀object⠀now⠀carries⠀a⠀memory⠀it⠀did⠀not⠀carry⠀before.⠀Let⠀the⠀changed⠀understanding⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀decision—a⠀meal⠀prepared⠀differently,⠀a⠀task⠀taken⠀over,⠀a⠀visit⠀made⠀or⠀not⠀made—rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀dramatic⠀confession.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narration's⠀language⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀characters⠀and⠀setting.⠀If⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀includes⠀a⠀particular⠀language⠀or⠀multilingual⠀situation,⠀render⠀it⠀as⠀those⠀characters⠀would⠀experience⠀and⠀use⠀it;⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀or⠀a⠀translated⠀register⠀onto⠀the⠀narration.⠀The⠀realism⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀precision⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀domestic⠀observation,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀national⠀temperament⠀or⠀a⠀landscape⠀inventory.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Present⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀composed⠀record—a⠀diary,⠀a⠀notebook,⠀or⠀a⠀set⠀of⠀occasion-based⠀reflections—written⠀by⠀a⠀character⠀whose⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀historical⠀circumstances⠀determine⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀record⠀and⠀know.⠀Establish⠀the⠀writer's⠀situation⠀early:⠀why⠀they⠀write,⠀when⠀they⠀write,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀observe⠀from⠀their⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀or⠀community.\n\nLet⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀accumulate⠀through⠀entries⠀that⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀objects,⠀routines,⠀phrases,⠀and⠀people.⠀A⠀particular⠀meal,⠀errand,⠀tool,⠀room,⠀or⠀seasonal⠀task⠀may⠀appear⠀in⠀several⠀entries,⠀each⠀time⠀with⠀slightly⠀different⠀attention:⠀the⠀writer⠀notices⠀its⠀cost,⠀its⠀comfort,⠀its⠀difficulty,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀associated⠀with⠀it.⠀Build⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀attachment⠀through⠀that⠀selective⠀repetition⠀without⠀the⠀writer⠀announcing⠀its⠀importance.\n\nUse⠀seasonal⠀attention⠀selectively⠀and⠀concretely.⠀Weather,⠀light,⠀plants,⠀food,⠀clothing,⠀or⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀work⠀and⠀festivals⠀should⠀appear⠀when⠀they⠀affect⠀the⠀writer's⠀day⠀or⠀mark⠀the⠀passage⠀of⠀time,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀mandatory⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery.⠀Omission⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀tool:⠀the⠀writer⠀may⠀not⠀record⠀an⠀important⠀event⠀on⠀the⠀day⠀it⠀happens,⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀later,⠀or⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀gap⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀interpret.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀knew⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀of⠀an⠀entry⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀have⠀learned⠀since.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀event⠀changes⠀the⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life,⠀let⠀the⠀change⠀emerge⠀gradually⠀across⠀entries.⠀An⠀earlier⠀entry⠀may⠀describe⠀a⠀routine⠀without⠀recognizing⠀its⠀meaning;⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀may⠀revisit⠀the⠀same⠀routine⠀with⠀new⠀feeling⠀or⠀understanding.⠀The⠀writer⠀need⠀not⠀state⠀the⠀change⠀directly.⠀It⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀now⠀choose⠀to⠀record,⠀in⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated⠀with⠀different⠀weight,⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀decision⠀noted⠀in⠀passing.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀personal⠀language⠀and⠀narrative⠀distance⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀actual⠀teller.⠀A⠀diary⠀writer⠀may⠀be⠀plain,⠀lyrical,⠀anxious,⠀or⠀dry⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀character⠀and⠀situation.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness,⠀a⠀mandatory⠀indirectness,⠀or⠀a⠀translated⠀register.⠀The⠀form's⠀power⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀writer's⠀selective⠀attention⠀and⠀the⠀reader's⠀gradual⠀recognition⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀repeated⠀details⠀mean.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀or⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀route.⠀Present⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀participant's⠀retrospective⠀telling:⠀someone⠀who⠀lived⠀through⠀the⠀events,⠀or⠀witnessed⠀part⠀of⠀them,⠀now⠀recounts⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀to⠀a⠀listener,⠀a⠀reader,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀community.⠀Establish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀position⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀period,⠀location,⠀and⠀social⠀order,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀position⠀determine⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀know,⠀report,⠀and⠀interpret.\n\nDistinguish⠀personal⠀participation⠀from⠀reported⠀events.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀describes⠀what⠀they⠀saw,⠀heard,⠀or⠀did,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀carry⠀the⠀texture⠀of⠀direct⠀experience.⠀When⠀they⠀describe⠀what⠀someone⠀else⠀told⠀them,⠀what⠀they⠀learned⠀later,⠀or⠀what⠀they⠀infer,⠀mark⠀that⠀shift⠀through⠀phrasing⠀such⠀as⠀\"I⠀was⠀told,\"⠀\"later⠀I⠀understood,\"⠀or⠀\"I⠀did⠀not⠀see⠀it⠀myself.\"⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀retrospective⠀narrator⠀silently⠀become⠀omniscient.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀should⠀govern⠀what⠀information⠀could⠀reach⠀them.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀through⠀repeated⠀objects,⠀routines,⠀phrases,⠀and⠀relationships⠀that⠀the⠀narrator⠀returns⠀to⠀across⠀the⠀account.⠀A⠀particular⠀route,⠀meal,⠀task,⠀song,⠀or⠀household⠀object⠀may⠀appear⠀several⠀times,⠀each⠀time⠀with⠀more⠀of⠀the⠀narrator's⠀later⠀understanding⠀attached⠀to⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀repetition⠀make⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀attachment⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀announcing⠀its⠀meaning⠀in⠀advance.⠀Keep⠀the⠀earlier⠀experience⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀later⠀interpretation.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀event⠀changes⠀the⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life,⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀selection⠀and⠀emphasis⠀show⠀the⠀change.⠀They⠀may⠀linger⠀on⠀a⠀detail⠀they⠀once⠀ignored,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀with⠀new⠀feeling,⠀or⠀describe⠀a⠀routine⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀something⠀they⠀did⠀not⠀recognize⠀at⠀the⠀time.⠀The⠀changed⠀understanding⠀may⠀be⠀stated⠀plainly⠀or⠀left⠀implicit⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀now⠀chooses⠀to⠀include.⠀It⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀question⠀or⠀produce⠀a⠀complete⠀reconciliation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts,⠀magical⠀realism,⠀or⠀a⠀marvelous⠀event⠀unless⠀the⠀actual⠀world⠀and⠀canon⠀permit⠀them.⠀The⠀testimony's⠀power⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀situated⠀memory⠀and⠀the⠀concrete⠀historical⠀conditions⠀that⠀shaped⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀do,⠀know,⠀and⠀preserve.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaman::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀where⠀they⠀are,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing⠀or⠀waiting⠀for.⠀Establish⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀through⠀concrete⠀material⠀and⠀social⠀detail—the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀route⠀a⠀character⠀takes,⠀the⠀task⠀at⠀hand,⠀the⠀person⠀whose⠀permission⠀or⠀payment⠀matters—rather⠀than⠀through⠀exposition.⠀Keep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow⠀by⠀naming⠀the⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀movement⠀between⠀places⠀clearly.\n\nUse⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀acts,⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀consequence.⠀When⠀they⠀speak,⠀let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀and⠀emotional⠀content⠀without⠀over-explaining.⠀When⠀they⠀react⠀privately,⠀give⠀the⠀reaction⠀its⠀own⠀beat:⠀a⠀brief⠀attention⠀to⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀remembered⠀phrase,⠀a⠀physical⠀sensation,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀made⠀in⠀the⠀moment.⠀Let⠀the⠀reaction⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀character⠀and⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀situation.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀shared⠀life⠀through⠀repeated⠀callbacks⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀easily.⠀A⠀familiar⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀place⠀should⠀appear⠀more⠀than⠀once,⠀each⠀time⠀with⠀slightly⠀different⠀weight.⠀The⠀first⠀appearance⠀establishes⠀the⠀shared⠀life;⠀the⠀later⠀appearance⠀lets⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀what⠀has⠀changed.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀callback's⠀meaning.⠀Let⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀response—a⠀longer⠀look,⠀a⠀different⠀tone,⠀a⠀small⠀practical⠀choice—show⠀the⠀new⠀understanding.\n\nLet⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀constrain⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀know⠀and⠀do.⠀If⠀a⠀message⠀cannot⠀arrive⠀quickly,⠀a⠀route⠀is⠀closed,⠀a⠀price⠀is⠀too⠀high,⠀or⠀a⠀social⠀position⠀forbids⠀an⠀action,⠀show⠀that⠀concrete⠀limit⠀in⠀the⠀scene.⠀Use⠀the⠀light⠀novel's⠀clarity⠀to⠀make⠀these⠀constraints⠀immediately⠀legible⠀rather⠀than⠀burying⠀them⠀in⠀period⠀description.⠀A⠀character's⠀inability⠀to⠀act⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀specific⠀historical⠀condition,⠀not⠀a⠀vague⠀obstacle.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀event⠀changes⠀the⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life,⠀keep⠀the⠀change⠀within⠀the⠀scene's⠀focused⠀beats.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀routine⠀while⠀their⠀private⠀response⠀to⠀it⠀shifts:⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀now⠀feels⠀heavier⠀or⠀lighter,⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀now⠀sounds⠀like⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀an⠀evasion,⠀a⠀shared⠀object⠀now⠀carries⠀a⠀memory.⠀The⠀changed⠀understanding⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀explained⠀at⠀length;⠀it⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀reaction⠀beat⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀decision.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀cliffhanger,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀its⠀natural⠀boundary,⠀with⠀the⠀character's⠀changed⠀attention⠀made⠀clear.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀through⠀its⠀ordinary⠀use:⠀who⠀handles⠀it,⠀when⠀it⠀appears,⠀what⠀small⠀adjustment⠀has⠀become⠀habit,⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀or⠀yields⠀in⠀that⠀particular⠀material⠀life.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀an⠀event,⠀so⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀carries⠀a⠀different⠀weight.⠀The⠀return⠀should⠀happen⠀through⠀syntax⠀and⠀image⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation:⠀a⠀clause⠀that⠀repeats⠀the⠀object's⠀name⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀verb,⠀a⠀sound⠀from⠀its⠀use⠀that⠀echoes⠀an⠀earlier⠀sentence,⠀or⠀a⠀comparison⠀that⠀moves⠀from⠀the⠀object's⠀physical⠀appearance⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀understands.\n\nBuild⠀each⠀paragraph⠀around⠀a⠀recurrence⠀that⠀follows⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention.⠀A⠀phrase⠀may⠀return⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀grammatical⠀position,⠀a⠀vowel⠀or⠀consonant⠀may⠀carry⠀from⠀one⠀image⠀to⠀the⠀next,⠀or⠀a⠀comparison⠀may⠀open⠀from⠀something⠀seen⠀or⠀touched⠀into⠀a⠀fuller⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀moment.⠀Keep⠀the⠀imagery⠀traceable⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀see,⠀touch,⠀remember,⠀or⠀associate⠀in⠀this⠀period⠀and⠀place.⠀Let⠀plain⠀sentences⠀interrupt⠀the⠀rhythm⠀when⠀practical⠀work,⠀another⠀person's⠀speech,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀perception⠀needs⠀direct⠀statement,⠀so⠀the⠀lyricism⠀remains⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀floating⠀above⠀it.\n\nUse⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀to⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀cannot⠀yet⠀know.⠀Work,⠀communication,⠀belief,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀a⠀delayed⠀message,⠀a⠀broken⠀tool,⠀an⠀empty⠀seat,⠀a⠀task⠀now⠀done⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀When⠀a⠀repeated⠀habit⠀changes⠀meaning,⠀ground⠀that⠀change⠀in⠀one⠀of⠀those⠀specific⠀occurrences.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀scene⠀toward⠀tragedy⠀or⠀miraculous⠀repair.⠀The⠀lyrical⠀movement⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀attending⠀to⠀the⠀changed⠀routine,⠀the⠀reframing⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀repeated⠀sound⠀or⠀image⠀but⠀not⠀completed⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nMove⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀between⠀a⠀present⠀moment⠀and⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀period⠀and⠀place.⠀The⠀memory⠀should⠀be⠀specific:⠀a⠀particular⠀meal,⠀errand,⠀conversation,⠀or⠀task,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀summary⠀of⠀better⠀times.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀detail⠀that⠀prompts⠀the⠀memory⠀be⠀ordinary⠀and⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀senses—a⠀smell⠀from⠀cooking,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀route⠀being⠀walked,⠀the⠀empty⠀place⠀at⠀a⠀table.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀then⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀the⠀difference⠀made⠀visible⠀in⠀that⠀same⠀detail:⠀the⠀meal⠀eaten⠀alone,⠀the⠀tool⠀now⠀used⠀differently,⠀the⠀route⠀no⠀longer⠀traveled.⠀The⠀scene⠀need⠀not⠀end⠀by⠀declaring⠀that⠀everything⠀has⠀changed.\n\nUse⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀loss⠀or⠀change⠀concrete.⠀A⠀route⠀no⠀longer⠀traveled,⠀a⠀craft⠀no⠀longer⠀practiced,⠀a⠀person⠀no⠀longer⠀present,⠀a⠀custom⠀now⠀observed⠀differently,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀arrived⠀too⠀late⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀of⠀passing⠀time.⠀Ground⠀these⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀social⠀positions⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀universal⠀medieval⠀or⠀premodern⠀melancholy;⠀let⠀the⠀specific⠀conditions⠀of⠀this⠀setting⠀determine⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀unavailable⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀still⠀expect,⠀obtain,⠀or⠀do.\n\nPreserve⠀ordinary⠀pleasure.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀may⠀be⠀warm,⠀funny,⠀or⠀satisfying⠀even⠀as⠀it⠀is⠀no⠀longer⠀available.⠀A⠀present⠀moment⠀may⠀still⠀offer⠀comfort,⠀food,⠀company,⠀or⠀useful⠀work.⠀Let⠀humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀appear⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀would⠀actually⠀show⠀them.⠀The⠀reflective⠀movement⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀character's⠀own⠀attention⠀and⠀association,⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀lesson⠀about⠀impermanence.⠀An⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀may⠀remain⠀unfinished,⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀change⠀may⠀be⠀enough⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀oral⠀account.⠀Establish⠀a⠀particular⠀storyteller,⠀a⠀particular⠀listener⠀or⠀small⠀audience,⠀and⠀the⠀occasion⠀that⠀prompts⠀the⠀telling.⠀The⠀frame⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀place:⠀a⠀household⠀gathering,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀work⠀pause,⠀a⠀visit,⠀or⠀another⠀plausible⠀occasion⠀for⠀someone⠀to⠀speak⠀at⠀length.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀social⠀position,⠀knowledge,⠀and⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀listener⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀historical⠀setting.⠀The⠀opening⠀frame⠀should⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀know⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀expects⠀to⠀hear,⠀so⠀the⠀tale's⠀later⠀movement⠀can⠀revise⠀that⠀expectation.\n\nLet⠀the⠀framed⠀tale⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀shared⠀life.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀may⠀appear⠀first⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀within⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀later⠀as⠀the⠀thing⠀the⠀teller⠀understands⠀differently.⠀When⠀the⠀listener⠀interrupts,⠀asks⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀supplies⠀a⠀memory,⠀let⠀that⠀exchange⠀change⠀the⠀teller's⠀emphasis:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀with⠀new⠀weight,⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀realize⠀that⠀the⠀listener⠀has⠀carried⠀a⠀different⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life.⠀This⠀exchange⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀real⠀conversation⠀between⠀particular⠀people,⠀not⠀a⠀ceremonial⠀performance.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀regional⠀conventions.⠀The⠀language,⠀customs,⠀and⠀social⠀relations⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀setting⠀and⠀tradition.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀use⠀a⠀deliberate⠀opening⠀and⠀a⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀occasion,⠀but⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀involve⠀nested⠀tales⠀within⠀tales,⠀supernatural⠀elements,⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀lesson.⠀The⠀telling⠀itself⠀is⠀the⠀emotional⠀movement:⠀through⠀it,⠀the⠀teller⠀and⠀listener⠀arrive⠀at⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀shared⠀life,⠀even⠀if⠀that⠀understanding⠀remains⠀partial.⠀Let⠀the⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀way—a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀now⠀spoken⠀differently,⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀listener⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀to⠀ask,⠀or⠀a⠀silence⠀that⠀replaces⠀an⠀old⠀explanation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀exact⠀details⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀place⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀A⠀tool,⠀a⠀garment,⠀a⠀food,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀can⠀stand⠀for⠀the⠀larger⠀situation⠀without⠀explanation.⠀The⠀detail⠀should⠀be⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀setting⠀and⠀this⠀character's⠀position,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀historical⠀prop.⠀When⠀the⠀detail⠀returns⠀later,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀its⠀use⠀or⠀meaning⠀through⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀perception:⠀the⠀tool⠀now⠀held⠀by⠀someone⠀else,⠀the⠀garment⠀folded⠀instead⠀of⠀worn,⠀the⠀route⠀walked⠀in⠀the⠀opposite⠀direction,⠀the⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀without⠀its⠀old⠀reply.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀change.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀short⠀paragraphs.⠀Keep⠀only⠀the⠀inward⠀connection⠀that⠀materially⠀contributes⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀account.⠀A⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀think⠀one⠀essential⠀sentence⠀about⠀what⠀a⠀repeated⠀object⠀or⠀routine⠀now⠀means,⠀but⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀not⠀expand⠀that⠀thought⠀into⠀a⠀general⠀reflection.⠀Attach⠀the⠀thought⠀to⠀the⠀detail⠀itself:⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀about⠀the⠀object's⠀weight,⠀absence,⠀or⠀changed⠀use.⠀Let⠀dialogue,⠀action,⠀and⠀perception⠀carry⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀not⠀say.\n\nDo⠀not⠀delete⠀causality.⠀If⠀a⠀change⠀matters,⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀infer⠀its⠀cause⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀details⠀and⠀events.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀knows⠀something,⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀knowledge⠀is⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀period:⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀report,⠀a⠀witnessed⠀event,⠀a⠀shared⠀task.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀create⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀logic.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail⠀simply⠀present⠀again,⠀its⠀changed⠀use⠀visible⠀and⠀its⠀cause⠀inferable⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀happened.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀continuous⠀prose⠀that⠀moves⠀naturally⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀does,⠀says,⠀perceives,⠀remembers,⠀and⠀thinks.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene:⠀the⠀work⠀being⠀done,⠀the⠀room⠀being⠀entered,⠀the⠀message⠀being⠀sent⠀or⠀received,⠀the⠀social⠀expectation⠀being⠀met⠀or⠀refused.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀scene⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀period.⠀The⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀and⠀assumptions⠀should⠀reflect⠀what⠀someone⠀in⠀this⠀position⠀and⠀time⠀could⠀actually⠀know,⠀shown⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀expect,⠀ask,⠀avoid,⠀or⠀take⠀for⠀granted.\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀character's⠀shared⠀life⠀appear⠀early⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀part⠀of⠀it.⠀Later,⠀after⠀an⠀event⠀or⠀conversation,⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀detail⠀so⠀that⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀shifted.⠀The⠀return⠀may⠀happen⠀in⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀recollection,⠀or⠀thought,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀motivated⠀by⠀the⠀scene's⠀immediate⠀attention:⠀the⠀character⠀reaches⠀for⠀the⠀object⠀and⠀finds⠀it⠀changed,⠀repeats⠀the⠀phrase⠀and⠀hears⠀it⠀differently,⠀or⠀remembers⠀the⠀routine⠀while⠀performing⠀a⠀new⠀task.⠀The⠀shift⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀natural⠀movement⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀attention,⠀not⠀a⠀structural⠀device⠀announced⠀to⠀the⠀reader.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀A⠀new⠀paragraph⠀may⠀follow⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀speaker,⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀action⠀to⠀thought,⠀or⠀a⠀movement⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀place⠀or⠀time.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀and⠀the⠀author⠀profile.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀belong⠀where⠀the⠀characters⠀would⠀actually⠀show⠀them.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀character⠀still⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀task⠀or⠀conversation,⠀the⠀changed⠀detail⠀present⠀again⠀and⠀its⠀new⠀weight⠀registered⠀in⠀the⠀prose.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nUse⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀organizing⠀center.⠀Select⠀a⠀moment⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀premise⠀legible:⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀private⠀conversation,⠀a⠀small⠀conflict,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀comfort,⠀jealousy,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀these⠀particular⠀people.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀do⠀and⠀say.⠀Social⠀position,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀create⠀the⠀specific⠀constraints⠀and⠀opportunities⠀of⠀the⠀scene:⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀admit,⠀offer,⠀or⠀expect⠀from⠀each⠀other,⠀where⠀they⠀can⠀meet,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀send⠀or⠀leave⠀unsent,⠀what⠀they⠀must⠀do⠀in⠀public⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀only⠀do⠀in⠀private.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀repeated⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀shared⠀routines.⠀A⠀phrase⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀uses,⠀an⠀object⠀they⠀both⠀handle,⠀a⠀habit⠀they⠀have⠀developed⠀together,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀moment⠀can⠀return⠀later⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀with⠀new⠀weight.⠀Make⠀the⠀callback⠀operational:⠀the⠀private⠀phrase⠀appears⠀first⠀in⠀an⠀ordinary⠀moment,⠀then⠀returns⠀in⠀a⠀different⠀context⠀where⠀its⠀meaning⠀has⠀changed⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀between⠀them.⠀The⠀shared⠀object⠀may⠀be⠀handled⠀differently,⠀the⠀habit⠀interrupted⠀or⠀resumed⠀with⠀a⠀difference,⠀the⠀remembered⠀moment⠀retold⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀emphasis.⠀The⠀callback⠀should⠀feel⠀earned⠀by⠀what⠀has⠀happened⠀between⠀the⠀characters,⠀not⠀inserted⠀as⠀a⠀fanfiction⠀marker.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀enough⠀space⠀to⠀develop⠀through⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀roster⠀of⠀familiar⠀tropes.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀particular⠀promise⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise,⠀not⠀gesture⠀toward⠀a⠀generic⠀enemies-to-lovers⠀or⠀hurt-comfort⠀shape.⠀Let⠀the⠀characters'⠀historical⠀circumstances⠀affect⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀admit,⠀offer,⠀or⠀expect⠀from⠀each⠀other.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀relationship⠀still⠀in⠀motion:⠀a⠀question⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀gesture⠀made,⠀a⠀routine⠀resumed⠀with⠀a⠀difference.⠀Show⠀the⠀emotional⠀payoff⠀in⠀the⠀returned⠀private⠀language⠀or⠀routine,⠀its⠀meaning⠀changed⠀by⠀the⠀specific⠀repeated⠀life⠀these⠀characters⠀share.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀that⠀establishes⠀who⠀is⠀being⠀spoken⠀of⠀or⠀what⠀act⠀is⠀being⠀remembered,⠀then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀place.⠀Use⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀introduce⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀deed,⠀but⠀ground⠀them⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀setting:⠀the⠀work⠀done,⠀the⠀route⠀traveled,⠀the⠀obligation⠀kept⠀or⠀broken,⠀the⠀message⠀sent,⠀the⠀object⠀given⠀or⠀repaired.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀heroic⠀past⠀or⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon⠀into⠀a⠀setting⠀that⠀does⠀not⠀include⠀them.\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀or⠀phrase⠀from⠀the⠀characters'⠀shared⠀life⠀become⠀the⠀saga's⠀recurring⠀material.⠀It⠀may⠀appear⠀first⠀as⠀an⠀ordinary⠀detail⠀within⠀the⠀account's⠀particulars⠀and⠀later⠀as⠀the⠀thing⠀by⠀which⠀an⠀act⠀is⠀remembered.⠀Make⠀the⠀recurrence⠀operational:⠀the⠀object⠀is⠀named⠀in⠀the⠀opening⠀declaration,⠀then⠀returns⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀act—the⠀tool⠀used⠀in⠀the⠀work⠀that⠀kept⠀an⠀obligation,⠀the⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀at⠀the⠀journey's⠀start⠀and⠀repeated⠀at⠀its⠀end,⠀the⠀routine⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀quarrel⠀and⠀resumed⠀after⠀a⠀reconciliation.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀should⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence,⠀not⠀assigned⠀as⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective.⠀A⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀account⠀may⠀differ⠀from⠀the⠀public⠀reputation,⠀and⠀the⠀prose⠀should⠀preserve⠀that⠀difference⠀by⠀showing⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀know⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀reported⠀or⠀assumed.\n\nRelate⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀without⠀declaring⠀every⠀modest⠀deed⠀legendary.⠀A⠀kindness,⠀a⠀quarrel,⠀a⠀journey,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀undertaking⠀can⠀earn⠀a⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀because⠀the⠀community⠀has⠀lived⠀with⠀its⠀consequences.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀interrupt⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀authority⠀when⠀a⠀participant⠀objects⠀to⠀a⠀detail⠀or⠀answers⠀an⠀elevated⠀introduction⠀with⠀an⠀ordinary⠀concern.⠀The⠀interruption⠀should⠀change⠀the⠀account's⠀emphasis,⠀not⠀merely⠀provide⠀comic⠀relief:⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀correct⠀the⠀record,⠀concede⠀a⠀point,⠀or⠀repeat⠀the⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀application.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀repeated⠀detail⠀still⠀available⠀for⠀future⠀retelling,⠀its⠀meaning⠀changed⠀by⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀told,⠀rather⠀than⠀pronouncing⠀it⠀legend⠀on⠀the⠀community's⠀behalf.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀continuous⠀prose⠀in⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀domestic⠀mode.⠀Treat⠀the⠀household,⠀workplace,⠀and⠀local⠀institution⠀as⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀machinery:⠀who⠀performs⠀which⠀task,⠀who⠀is⠀owed⠀what,⠀who⠀may⠀enter,⠀who⠀must⠀wait,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀costs⠀in⠀effort⠀or⠀money.⠀Let⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀social⠀position⠀determine⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known,⠀expected,⠀asked,⠀or⠀refused,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀position⠀appear⠀through⠀practical⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀explanation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀close⠀to⠀one⠀focal⠀character's⠀ordinary⠀attention.⠀Render⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀assumes,⠀and⠀privately⠀feels⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀proceeds.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀knowable⠀through⠀their⠀speech,⠀actions,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀interpretation⠀of⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀narration⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀excludes.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀movement⠀through⠀specific⠀shared⠀life.⠀Introduce⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀relationship⠀early⠀enough⠀that⠀it⠀belongs⠀to⠀daily⠀experience⠀rather⠀than⠀to⠀a⠀lesson.⠀When⠀an⠀event⠀changes⠀circumstances,⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀familiar⠀particular⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀shift⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀now⠀knows⠀or⠀feels.⠀The⠀shift⠀may⠀be⠀quiet:⠀an⠀object⠀once⠀handled⠀without⠀thought⠀becomes⠀a⠀reminder,⠀a⠀routine⠀once⠀shared⠀becomes⠀a⠀measure⠀of⠀absence,⠀or⠀a⠀phrase⠀once⠀casual⠀becomes⠀weighted.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀tragic⠀break⠀or⠀a⠀miraculous⠀repair;⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀understanding⠀is⠀the⠀payoff.\n\nLet⠀humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀arise⠀only⠀where⠀the⠀particular⠀people⠀and⠀scene⠀support⠀them.⠀A⠀neighbor's⠀dry⠀remark,⠀a⠀child's⠀habit,⠀or⠀an⠀awkward⠀kindness⠀can⠀carry⠀warmth⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀whole⠀community⠀into⠀a⠀chorus⠀of⠀gentle⠀wisdom.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀real⠀constraints:⠀distance,⠀cost,⠀obligation,⠀weather,⠀work,⠀and⠀authority⠀should⠀affect⠀what⠀can⠀happen⠀next.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀the⠀era's⠀meaning.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nUse⠀screenplay⠀presentation⠀with⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀lines,⠀and⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀visible⠀and⠀stageable:⠀who⠀enters,⠀what⠀they⠀carry,⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀with⠀an⠀object,⠀what⠀sound⠀or⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room⠀matters.⠀Historical⠀context⠀enters⠀through⠀concrete⠀business⠀rather⠀than⠀description.⠀A⠀character⠀mends⠀a⠀harness,⠀counts⠀coins,⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀letter,⠀stokes⠀a⠀stove,⠀or⠀observes⠀a⠀work⠀schedule⠀because⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀make⠀that⠀action⠀necessary.\n\nWrite⠀dialogue⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀task.⠀People⠀discuss⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀what⠀they⠀need,⠀what⠀they⠀owe,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀expect⠀from⠀one⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀dialogue⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀era⠀to⠀the⠀audience.⠀Let⠀social⠀position⠀shape⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀say,⠀ask,⠀or⠀refuse⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀others.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀notes,⠀separated⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action.⠀A⠀note⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀fears,⠀or⠀privately⠀understands⠀while⠀the⠀visible⠀scene⠀continues.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀hear⠀or⠀know⠀this⠀material.⠀Use⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀specifically⠀requires⠀it,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀convert⠀every⠀private⠀note⠀into⠀voice-over.\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀relationship⠀early⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use⠀through⠀visible⠀or⠀audible⠀business.⠀Show⠀the⠀object⠀being⠀handled,⠀the⠀routine⠀being⠀performed,⠀or⠀the⠀phrase⠀being⠀spoken⠀in⠀its⠀usual⠀context.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀same⠀particular⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀after⠀circumstances⠀have⠀changed.⠀The⠀repetition⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀on⠀screen:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀handled⠀differently,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀situation,⠀the⠀same⠀routine⠀now⠀incomplete⠀or⠀performed⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀Let⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀register⠀through⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀a⠀nonspoken⠀note,⠀without⠀a⠀character⠀announcing⠀the⠀theme.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀visible⠀change,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Let⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀historical⠀setting:⠀who⠀sets⠀the⠀table,⠀mends⠀a⠀garment,⠀checks⠀a⠀ledger,⠀carries⠀water,⠀or⠀waits⠀by⠀a⠀door.⠀Objects⠀should⠀be⠀handled⠀because⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀require⠀them,⠀not⠀because⠀they⠀symbolize⠀the⠀era.⠀Keep⠀blocking⠀specific⠀enough⠀to⠀stage:⠀a⠀character⠀crosses⠀to⠀the⠀window,⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀bowl,⠀turns⠀away,⠀or⠀pauses⠀before⠀answering.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀pause,⠀a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀performs⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀can⠀convey⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀Dialogue⠀should⠀fit⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation⠀and⠀the⠀speakers'⠀social⠀positions.⠀People⠀ask⠀for⠀what⠀they⠀need,⠀refuse⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀accept,⠀and⠀avoid⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀say⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀others.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀dialogue⠀to⠀explain⠀historical⠀context⠀to⠀the⠀audience.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀spoken⠀lines⠀and⠀stage⠀directions.⠀This⠀material⠀records⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀privately⠀understands,⠀or⠀feels⠀while⠀the⠀public⠀scene⠀continues.⠀It⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀aside,⠀a⠀monologue,⠀or⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Use⠀a⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀dramatic⠀situation⠀specifically⠀requires⠀a⠀performed⠀speech,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀it⠀replace⠀the⠀required⠀private⠀material.\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀relationship⠀early⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use⠀through⠀stageable⠀business.⠀Show⠀the⠀object⠀being⠀handled,⠀the⠀task⠀being⠀performed,⠀or⠀the⠀phrase⠀being⠀spoken⠀in⠀its⠀usual⠀context.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀same⠀particular⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀after⠀circumstances⠀have⠀changed.⠀The⠀repetition⠀should⠀be⠀stageable:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀handled⠀differently,⠀the⠀same⠀task⠀now⠀done⠀by⠀someone⠀else,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀spoken⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀situation,⠀or⠀a⠀familiar⠀gesture⠀now⠀interrupted⠀by⠀a⠀pause.⠀Let⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀register⠀through⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀nonspoken⠀material.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀an⠀exit,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀theatrical⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀move⠀the⠀narration⠀associatively⠀rather⠀than⠀in⠀a⠀linear⠀report.⠀Syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀may⠀follow⠀the⠀mind's⠀jumps,⠀but⠀keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀to⠀distinguish⠀what⠀is⠀happening⠀now⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀remembered,⠀imagined,⠀or⠀feared.\n\nGround⠀the⠀associations⠀in⠀the⠀specific⠀historical⠀world.⠀The⠀mind⠀notices⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bucket,⠀the⠀cold⠀of⠀a⠀floor,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀bell,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀fuel,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀mended⠀seam,⠀the⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀may⠀not⠀come.⠀Social⠀position⠀and⠀period⠀institutions⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do.⠀A⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀work⠀schedule,⠀or⠀a⠀household⠀rule⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀world,⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀vague⠀atmosphere.\n\nLet⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀relationship⠀surface⠀early⠀in⠀ordinary⠀association⠀through⠀sensory⠀or⠀habitual⠀detail:⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀handle,⠀the⠀rhythm⠀of⠀a⠀task,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀familiar⠀instruction,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀object.⠀After⠀an⠀event⠀changes⠀circumstances,⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀particular⠀resurface⠀through⠀a⠀changed⠀texture.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀handle⠀now⠀feels⠀different,⠀the⠀familiar⠀rhythm⠀now⠀stops⠀short,⠀the⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀arrives⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀tone,⠀or⠀the⠀object's⠀absence⠀interrupts⠀a⠀habitual⠀reach.⠀The⠀shift⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced;⠀it⠀emerges⠀through⠀the⠀changed⠀sensory⠀or⠀temporal⠀quality⠀of⠀the⠀association.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀mind's⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀throughout,⠀including⠀reasoning,⠀uncertainty,⠀sensation,⠀and⠀feeling.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀knowable⠀only⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀perceives,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀infers.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀narration⠀access⠀to⠀excluded⠀minds.⠀Humor⠀and⠀tenderness⠀may⠀surface⠀where⠀the⠀particular⠀person⠀and⠀scene⠀support⠀them,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀the⠀mind⠀universally⠀witty⠀or⠀sentimental.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀association⠀naturally⠀pauses,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀reflection.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
        },
        {
            "role": "system",
            "injection_position": 0,
            "injection_depth": 4,
            "system_prompt": false,
            "marker": false,
            "enabled": true,
            "forbid_overrides": false,
            "injection_order": 100,
            "injection_trigger": [],
            "identifier": "nemo-init-recipes-historical_fiction-04",
            "name": "🔧 Init · Historical Fiction · 04/07",
            "content": "{{#if {{.NCGenreId == historical_fiction}}}}{{// @category Variable-Init }}{{// @icon 🔧 }}{{// @badge INIT }}{{// @tooltip Historical Fiction. Selected-partition data; keep enabled in supplied order after recipe selectors and before the Writing Recipe resolver. Part 4 of 7. }}{{// Source group: recipes-historical_fiction; payload preserved. }}{{setvar::NPaiamaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nUse⠀the⠀transcript⠀form⠀for⠀the⠀story's⠀transmitted⠀communication.⠀Present⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀with⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀communication⠀constraints⠀shape⠀the⠀exchange:⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀note⠀passed⠀through⠀an⠀intermediary,⠀a⠀telegram,⠀a⠀ledger⠀entry,⠀or⠀another⠀medium⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀permits.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀digital⠀infrastructure⠀the⠀period⠀does⠀not⠀have.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀person's⠀message⠀habits⠀distinct.⠀One⠀sender⠀writes⠀formally,⠀another⠀leaves⠀things⠀out,⠀another⠀repeats⠀a⠀particular⠀phrase⠀or⠀asks⠀the⠀same⠀question.⠀Social⠀position⠀and⠀practical⠀need⠀shape⠀what⠀they⠀transmit:⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀supplies,⠀a⠀report⠀of⠀work⠀done,⠀a⠀warning,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀an⠀arrangement.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀the⠀messages⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀era⠀to⠀the⠀reader.\n\nSeparate⠀transmitted⠀text⠀from⠀private⠀material.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀the⠀character's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀and⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀or⠀privately⠀feels⠀while⠀composing,⠀sending,⠀or⠀waiting.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀receive⠀this⠀material.\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase,⠀routine,⠀object,⠀or⠀relationship⠀through⠀the⠀messages⠀themselves.⠀A⠀sender's⠀habitual⠀greeting,⠀a⠀recurring⠀request,⠀a⠀familiar⠀complaint,⠀or⠀a⠀shared⠀reference⠀should⠀appear⠀early⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use⠀within⠀the⠀transmitted⠀medium.⠀After⠀an⠀event⠀changes⠀circumstances,⠀let⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀or⠀routine⠀resurface⠀through⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀its⠀transmission:⠀a⠀message⠀arrives⠀late,⠀a⠀familiar⠀request⠀goes⠀unanswered,⠀a⠀habitual⠀phrase⠀is⠀omitted⠀or⠀altered,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀once⠀came⠀from⠀one⠀sender⠀now⠀comes⠀from⠀another.⠀The⠀shift⠀should⠀register⠀through⠀the⠀transcript's⠀actual⠀content,⠀timing,⠀sender,⠀or⠀omission.⠀End⠀after⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀received⠀reply,⠀a⠀meaningful⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀interface⠀event.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiamba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀scene-oriented⠀presentation⠀with⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible.⠀Background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references⠀to⠀the⠀illustrated⠀scene,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nGround⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀concrete⠀material⠀life.⠀The⠀setting⠀should⠀include⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀see,⠀handle,⠀and⠀use:⠀a⠀workbench,⠀a⠀hearth,⠀a⠀market⠀stall,⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀mended⠀garment,⠀a⠀waiting⠀room.⠀Social⠀position⠀and⠀institutions⠀enter⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀can⠀know,⠀expect,⠀ask⠀for,⠀or⠀refuse.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀fit⠀the⠀immediate⠀task⠀and⠀relationship⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀the⠀era.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀rhythm.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀record⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices,⠀remembers,⠀privately⠀understands,⠀or⠀feels⠀while⠀the⠀dialogue⠀and⠀action⠀continue.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀know⠀this⠀material.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀expression⠀into⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator⠀for⠀the⠀reader⠀or⠀the⠀cast.\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀relationship⠀early⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use⠀through⠀a⠀legible⠀visual⠀anchor:⠀a⠀familiar⠀background⠀detail,⠀a⠀habitual⠀task⠀shown⠀in⠀the⠀scene,⠀or⠀a⠀recurring⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue.⠀Return⠀to⠀that⠀same⠀particular⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀scene⠀after⠀circumstances⠀have⠀changed.⠀The⠀visual⠀anchor⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀same,⠀but⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀response⠀or⠀the⠀situation⠀around⠀it⠀has⠀changed:⠀the⠀familiar⠀detail⠀now⠀draws⠀a⠀longer⠀look,⠀the⠀habitual⠀task⠀is⠀interrupted,⠀the⠀recurring⠀line⠀is⠀spoken⠀by⠀someone⠀else⠀or⠀met⠀with⠀silence.⠀Let⠀the⠀new⠀significance⠀emerge⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀End⠀a⠀scene⠀after⠀a⠀completed⠀exchange,⠀a⠀visible⠀change,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀choice⠀screen⠀or⠀a⠀summary⠀line.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiambb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Jun⠀Maeda⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀installment-oriented⠀prose⠀with⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies.⠀Each⠀installment⠀should⠀make⠀clear⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀re-enter:⠀a⠀name,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀relationship,⠀or⠀a⠀recent⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀retell⠀the⠀whole⠀history.\n\nGround⠀the⠀ongoing⠀story⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀and⠀material⠀life.⠀The⠀through-line⠀may⠀involve⠀a⠀harvest,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀household⠀obligation,⠀a⠀legal⠀matter,⠀a⠀craft,⠀or⠀a⠀relationship⠀maintained⠀across⠀distance.⠀Social⠀position⠀determines⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules.\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀routine,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀relationship⠀early⠀in⠀ordinary⠀use⠀within⠀one⠀installment.⠀Let⠀it⠀recur⠀naturally⠀across⠀installments⠀without⠀special⠀emphasis.⠀After⠀an⠀event⠀changes⠀circumstances,⠀return⠀to⠀that⠀familiar⠀particular⠀in⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀meaning⠀shift.⠀A⠀task⠀once⠀shared⠀is⠀now⠀done⠀alone;⠀a⠀phrase⠀once⠀casual⠀now⠀carries⠀a⠀different⠀weight;⠀an⠀object⠀once⠀handled⠀without⠀thought⠀now⠀prompts⠀memory.⠀The⠀shift⠀may⠀be⠀quiet⠀and⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀locally⠀legible⠀within⠀the⠀installment⠀where⠀it⠀recurs.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀available⠀when⠀it⠀contributes⠀feeling⠀or⠀thought,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀immediate⠀decision⠀changes.⠀Other⠀characters⠀remain⠀knowable⠀through⠀their⠀speech,⠀actions,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀interpretation.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀life⠀continue⠀around⠀the⠀main⠀developments.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀installment⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀End⠀an⠀installment⠀after⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nWrite⠀each⠀emotional⠀turn⠀through⠀the⠀tactical⠀sequence⠀that⠀produces⠀it.⠀Identify⠀the⠀concrete⠀social⠀rule⠀or⠀material⠀constraint⠀governing⠀the⠀scene—who⠀may⠀speak,⠀what⠀a⠀debt⠀obliges,⠀what⠀a⠀visit⠀signals,⠀what⠀this⠀position⠀can⠀refuse—and⠀let⠀the⠀character⠀work⠀that⠀system.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀is⠀using⠀it,⠀misreading⠀it,⠀or⠀discovering⠀that⠀it⠀has⠀closed⠀off⠀an⠀option,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀private⠀residue⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀movement.\n\nMake⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀move⠀felt⠀as⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀it⠀accomplishes⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀make⠀the⠀correct⠀social⠀play⠀and⠀still⠀feel⠀the⠀loss⠀of⠀the⠀alternative;⠀they⠀may⠀admit⠀a⠀need⠀because⠀the⠀situation⠀leaves⠀no⠀better⠀move,⠀and⠀the⠀admission⠀should⠀remain⠀uncomfortable⠀rather⠀than⠀cathartic.⠀When⠀someone⠀withholds,⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀withholding⠀protects⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀makes⠀impossible.⠀When⠀someone⠀apologizes⠀or⠀returns,⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀apology⠀erase⠀the⠀earlier⠀injury.⠀Warmth⠀can⠀arrive⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀as⠀strain,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀be⠀partial,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀contingent⠀on⠀something⠀still⠀unresolved.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts.⠀If⠀a⠀conversation⠀turns,⠀show⠀the⠀new⠀information⠀or⠀pressure⠀that⠀turned⠀it.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀changes⠀tactics,⠀make⠀the⠀change⠀follow⠀from⠀a⠀legible⠀calculation,⠀a⠀failed⠀approach,⠀or⠀a⠀sudden⠀recognition⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀needs.⠀Let⠀private⠀thought⠀run⠀ahead⠀of⠀speech⠀or⠀lag⠀behind⠀it;⠀the⠀gap⠀should⠀reveal⠀the⠀character's⠀actual⠀state⠀without⠀granting⠀them⠀perfect⠀self-knowledge.⠀The⠀turbulence⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀emotional⠀layer⠀but⠀the⠀experience⠀of⠀working⠀a⠀system⠀that⠀exacts⠀a⠀price⠀for⠀every⠀available⠀move.\n\nDo⠀not⠀convert⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀backdrop.⠀The⠀specific⠀institution,⠀material⠀constraint,⠀or⠀social⠀expectation⠀should⠀be⠀the⠀thing⠀the⠀character⠀works⠀against⠀or⠀within.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀a⠀tonal⠀treatment⠀of⠀the⠀selected⠀genre,⠀not⠀a⠀requirement⠀that⠀the⠀relationship⠀end⠀in⠀tragedy⠀or⠀that⠀every⠀confession⠀collapse.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀each⠀response⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Attribute⠀every⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀unmistakably,⠀and⠀keep⠀action⠀and⠀reaction⠀close⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀who⠀did⠀what.⠀Use⠀the⠀active⠀narrative⠀person⠀and⠀action⠀markers⠀from⠀the⠀selected⠀settings;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀first⠀person⠀or⠀asterisked⠀actions.\n\nMake⠀the⠀historical⠀situation⠀the⠀live⠀problem⠀the⠀participants⠀are⠀working.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀limits⠀determine⠀what⠀each⠀character⠀can⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀refuse,⠀or⠀risk.⠀When⠀a⠀move⠀depends⠀on⠀a⠀rule—an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀permission,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀tool—explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀briefly⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀awareness⠀or⠀action,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀result.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀shifts⠀rapidly,⠀keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible:⠀a⠀new⠀arrival,⠀a⠀changed⠀calculation,⠀or⠀a⠀failed⠀attempt⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀as⠀the⠀cause⠀of⠀the⠀turn.\n\nLet⠀NPCs⠀and⠀the⠀ongoing⠀world⠀continue⠀according⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀lives.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀help,⠀resist,⠀misunderstand,⠀or⠀pursue⠀a⠀separate⠀errand⠀without⠀the⠀reply⠀forcing⠀a⠀choice.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀progress,⠀a⠀conversation⠀pausing,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀arriving.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀completed⠀exchange⠀at⠀the⠀end.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀rather⠀than⠀decorative⠀period⠀vocabulary.⠀The⠀scene's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀limits⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀can⠀do⠀next,⠀so⠀the⠀continuation⠀point⠀is⠀the⠀unfinished⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀legible⠀tactical⠀sequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀route.⠀Open⠀each⠀episode⠀by⠀establishing⠀the⠀characters'⠀concrete⠀position⠀under⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀conditions:⠀what⠀they⠀know,⠀possess,⠀expect,⠀and⠀are⠀permitted⠀to⠀do.⠀Close⠀the⠀episode⠀when⠀a⠀reversal,⠀acquisition,⠀loss,⠀or⠀new⠀obligation⠀has⠀altered⠀that⠀position⠀enough⠀to⠀change⠀the⠀next⠀episode's⠀available⠀options.\n\nWithin⠀each⠀episode,⠀treat⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀as⠀a⠀working⠀system.⠀Explain⠀a⠀mechanism⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it:⠀a⠀tax⠀procedure,⠀a⠀travel⠀permit,⠀a⠀market⠀custom,⠀a⠀household⠀obligation,⠀a⠀message⠀route.⠀Show⠀the⠀action⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀that⠀understanding⠀or⠀mistake.⠀Keep⠀reversals⠀rapid⠀but⠀physically⠀legible;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀see⠀what⠀new⠀fact⠀or⠀resource⠀produced⠀the⠀turn.\n\nLet⠀the⠀narration⠀move⠀between⠀lively⠀incident⠀and⠀brief⠀explanatory⠀passages.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀carry⠀bargaining,⠀persuasion,⠀or⠀dispute,⠀while⠀narrative⠀passages⠀supply⠀the⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀and⠀period⠀constraints⠀behind⠀a⠀choice.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀particular⠀dynasty,⠀cast,⠀or⠀setting⠀from⠀source⠀examples;⠀use⠀the⠀scenario's⠀own⠀period⠀and⠀community.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀author⠀and⠀genre⠀rather⠀than⠀imposing⠀an⠀archaic⠀register.\n\nLet⠀consequences⠀accumulate⠀across⠀episodes.⠀A⠀debt⠀incurred⠀in⠀one⠀episode⠀can⠀limit⠀a⠀later⠀choice;⠀a⠀favor⠀can⠀return⠀in⠀altered⠀form.⠀Recurrence⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀system,⠀not⠀restart⠀the⠀same⠀conflict.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀historical⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀in⠀hard-edged,⠀concrete⠀prose.⠀Use⠀specific⠀objects,⠀surfaces,⠀distances,⠀weights,⠀and⠀costs⠀rather⠀than⠀general⠀conditions.⠀Move⠀from⠀cause⠀to⠀effect⠀without⠀restating⠀the⠀intermediate⠀step⠀when⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀is⠀already⠀clear.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters—a⠀lock,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀ration,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀regulation—explain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀fewest⠀concrete⠀terms⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀material⠀result.\n\nKeep⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀legible⠀through⠀physical⠀detail.⠀A⠀reversal⠀should⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀visible⠀change:⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀a⠀coin⠀changes⠀hands,⠀a⠀load⠀shifts,⠀a⠀message⠀arrives,⠀a⠀supply⠀runs⠀out.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀what⠀new⠀resource⠀or⠀constraint⠀produced⠀the⠀turn.⠀Use⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm⠀deliberately:⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀is⠀justified⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀must⠀work⠀through⠀a⠀calculation⠀or⠀a⠀risk,⠀but⠀otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀prose⠀moving.\n\nGround⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker.⠀A⠀character's⠀bluntness⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀their⠀position,⠀work,⠀or⠀immediate⠀pressure,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀universal⠀tough⠀register.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀supply⠀the⠀material⠀wear:⠀worn⠀equipment,⠀scarce⠀goods,⠀long⠀travel,⠀crowded⠀quarters,⠀seasonal⠀labor,⠀institutional⠀delay.⠀The⠀grit⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀prose⠀and⠀the⠀practical⠀stakes,⠀not⠀in⠀mandatory⠀misery⠀or⠀stripped-away⠀ordinary⠀feeling.\n\nPreserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.⠀The⠀period's⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀whose⠀authors,⠀recipients,⠀purposes,⠀and⠀times⠀of⠀composition⠀are⠀clear.⠀Choose⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀requires:⠀a⠀letter,⠀journal⠀entry,⠀report,⠀account⠀book,⠀permit,⠀notice,⠀or⠀record.\n\nTreat⠀each⠀document⠀as⠀a⠀move⠀within⠀a⠀historical⠀system.⠀Its⠀writer⠀knows⠀only⠀what⠀their⠀position,⠀sources,⠀and⠀timing⠀permit;⠀they⠀may⠀exploit⠀a⠀rule,⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀or⠀conceal⠀something⠀for⠀a⠀practical⠀reason.⠀When⠀a⠀document⠀explains⠀a⠀mechanism—a⠀price,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀legal⠀procedure,⠀a⠀supply⠀arrangement—let⠀the⠀explanation⠀reflect⠀the⠀writer's⠀actual⠀access⠀and⠀purpose.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀document⠀does⠀in⠀the⠀world:⠀it⠀requests,⠀records,⠀persuades,⠀warns,⠀obliges,⠀or⠀misleads.\n\nUse⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀to⠀create⠀reversals.⠀A⠀later⠀document⠀can⠀correct⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀reveal⠀what⠀the⠀first⠀writer⠀did⠀not⠀know,⠀or⠀show⠀the⠀consequence⠀of⠀an⠀action⠀the⠀first⠀document⠀set⠀in⠀motion.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀across⠀entries:⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀reconstruct⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀when,⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀documents⠀disagree.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀record;⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀supply⠀what⠀it⠀would⠀naturally⠀know.\n\nPreserve⠀readable⠀continuity.⠀Dates,⠀places,⠀names,⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀can⠀anchor⠀the⠀sequence.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀should⠀determine⠀what⠀forms⠀of⠀writing⠀are⠀available,⠀who⠀can⠀send⠀or⠀keep⠀them,⠀and⠀how⠀long⠀they⠀take⠀to⠀arrive.⠀A⠀document⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀a⠀transparent⠀window⠀into⠀its⠀writer's⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nWrite⠀comfort⠀as⠀practical⠀work⠀within⠀the⠀historical⠀setting.⠀Identify⠀what⠀care⠀actually⠀requires⠀here:⠀preparing⠀food,⠀mending⠀clothing,⠀sharing⠀scarce⠀supplies,⠀passing⠀along⠀useful⠀information,⠀walking⠀someone⠀home,⠀keeping⠀a⠀promise,⠀making⠀a⠀space⠀warm⠀or⠀quiet.⠀Explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀when⠀it⠀matters—how⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀done,⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀what⠀rule⠀or⠀shortage⠀constrains⠀it—then⠀show⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀the⠀small⠀pleasure⠀or⠀relief⠀it⠀produces.\n\nSpend⠀attention⠀on⠀chosen⠀kindness⠀and⠀familiar⠀preferences.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀know⠀that⠀someone⠀likes⠀a⠀particular⠀food,⠀fears⠀a⠀particular⠀route,⠀or⠀finds⠀a⠀routine⠀reassuring,⠀and⠀act⠀on⠀that⠀knowledge⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀but⠀not⠀necessarily⠀confessed.⠀Comfort⠀can⠀be⠀partial:⠀the⠀room⠀is⠀warm⠀but⠀the⠀worry⠀remains,⠀the⠀errand⠀succeeds⠀but⠀the⠀larger⠀problem⠀is⠀untouched.⠀Personality,⠀privacy,⠀and⠀disagreement⠀stay⠀intact;⠀no⠀one⠀becomes⠀agreeable⠀just⠀because⠀they⠀are⠀being⠀cared⠀for.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀small⠀tasks.⠀If⠀a⠀plan⠀for⠀comfort⠀fails⠀or⠀changes,⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀reason:⠀a⠀missing⠀ingredient,⠀a⠀closed⠀road,⠀an⠀unexpected⠀visitor,⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀forbids⠀the⠀easier⠀solution.⠀The⠀characters⠀can⠀then⠀adjust,⠀accept⠀the⠀smaller⠀comfort,⠀or⠀set⠀the⠀task⠀aside.⠀The⠀warmth⠀is⠀the⠀felt⠀result⠀of⠀a⠀legible⠀move,⠀not⠀a⠀separate⠀emotional⠀layer.\n\nUse⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀life⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀warmth⠀concrete.⠀The⠀comfort⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀particular⠀encounters⠀with⠀the⠀setting's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀and⠀resources,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀domestic⠀vignette.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀composed⠀novel⠀prose⠀with⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement.⠀Let⠀each⠀scene⠀open⠀into⠀its⠀social⠀situation:⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀frame⠀an⠀encounter⠀through⠀the⠀institution,⠀custom,⠀history,⠀or⠀public⠀judgment⠀that⠀bears⠀on⠀it,⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator's⠀position⠀permits.⠀Distinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀or⠀uniformly⠀elaborate⠀speech.\n\nKeep⠀Kamachi's⠀tactical⠀legibility⠀inside⠀the⠀broader⠀movement.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀mechanism—an⠀obligation,⠀a⠀price,⠀a⠀procedure,⠀a⠀route,⠀a⠀resource—explain⠀it⠀clearly⠀enough⠀that⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀follows.⠀Rapid⠀shifts⠀should⠀remain⠀physically⠀understandable⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀prose⠀around⠀them⠀is⠀more⠀expansive.⠀A⠀reversal⠀may⠀arrive⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀sentence,⠀but⠀the⠀surrounding⠀paragraphs⠀can⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀change⠀means⠀for⠀the⠀character's⠀position,⠀reputation,⠀or⠀obligations.\n\nUse⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀as⠀the⠀active⠀frame.⠀The⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀determine⠀what⠀people⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do.⠀Let⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀the⠀contrast⠀between⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀life⠀organize⠀a⠀passage⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀warrants⠀it.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀may⠀allow⠀judgment⠀or⠀historical⠀perspective,⠀but⠀preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀concrete⠀cause⠀and⠀effect⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀formal⠀movement:⠀what⠀was⠀attempted,⠀what⠀rule⠀or⠀resource⠀shaped⠀the⠀attempt,⠀and⠀what⠀changed⠀as⠀a⠀result.⠀The⠀style⠀adds⠀social⠀framing⠀and⠀deliberate⠀movement;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀replace⠀the⠀story's⠀legible⠀systems⠀with⠀atmosphere.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀present⠀occasion⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀pressure⠀on⠀the⠀telling.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀listening,⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀needs⠀from⠀them,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀risks⠀by⠀being⠀believed,⠀doubted,⠀or⠀interrupted.⠀Let⠀that⠀stake⠀shape⠀the⠀tale's⠀selection:⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀a⠀past⠀incident⠀because⠀it⠀teaches⠀a⠀procedure,⠀justifies⠀a⠀delay,⠀shifts⠀blame,⠀or⠀makes⠀a⠀requested⠀action⠀seem⠀possible.⠀The⠀outer⠀scene⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀a⠀neutral⠀frame;⠀the⠀audience's⠀need⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀interest⠀remain⠀active⠀before,⠀during,⠀and⠀after⠀the⠀embedded⠀account.\n\nInside⠀the⠀embedded⠀story,⠀render⠀one⠀period⠀mechanism⠀as⠀a⠀working⠀sequence⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀follow.⠀Choose⠀the⠀mechanism⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario's⠀actual⠀institutions⠀or⠀material⠀life,⠀and⠀present⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀must⠀use⠀it:⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀a⠀petition⠀moves,⠀the⠀point⠀at⠀which⠀a⠀toll⠀or⠀fee⠀is⠀owed,⠀the⠀inspection⠀that⠀must⠀occur⠀before⠀goods⠀may⠀pass,⠀the⠀record⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀signed⠀before⠀an⠀obligation⠀is⠀recognized.⠀Explain⠀each⠀step⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀inside⠀the⠀tale⠀reaches⠀it,⠀so⠀the⠀explanation⠀remains⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀action.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀exploiting,⠀missing,⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀one⠀step,⠀and⠀make⠀the⠀consequence⠀immediate⠀and⠀physical.\n\nReturn⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀the⠀tale⠀has⠀changed⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀do.⠀The⠀listener⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀procedure,⠀ask⠀about⠀a⠀step⠀the⠀teller⠀omitted,⠀or⠀recognize⠀that⠀the⠀tale's⠀lesson⠀applies⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀person⠀than⠀the⠀teller⠀claimed.⠀The⠀embedded⠀account⠀need⠀not⠀close⠀every⠀question;⠀its⠀function⠀is⠀to⠀alter⠀the⠀present⠀situation⠀by⠀supplying⠀usable⠀knowledge,⠀exposing⠀an⠀omission,⠀or⠀revising⠀the⠀listener's⠀sense⠀of⠀who⠀can⠀be⠀trusted.⠀Keep⠀the⠀return⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀summarizing⠀the⠀tale's⠀meaning.\n\nUse⠀recurrence⠀as⠀a⠀connection⠀between⠀levels,⠀not⠀as⠀proof.⠀When⠀a⠀phrase,⠀object,⠀or⠀gesture⠀appears⠀in⠀both⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀the⠀tale,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀different⠀function⠀at⠀each⠀level:⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀marked⠀safe⠀passage⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀be⠀the⠀thing⠀the⠀listener⠀now⠀needs⠀to⠀surrender,⠀or⠀a⠀formula⠀of⠀respect⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀signal⠀that⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀avoiding⠀a⠀name.⠀Let⠀the⠀reader⠀notice⠀the⠀recurrence⠀through⠀its⠀changed⠀practical⠀effect.⠀If⠀a⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀comes,⠀make⠀it⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀step⠀the⠀tale⠀showed⠀but⠀the⠀listener⠀did⠀not⠀yet⠀weigh,⠀never⠀from⠀an⠀unestablished⠀magical⠀rule⠀or⠀hidden⠀authority.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀telling's⠀historical⠀limits⠀visible.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀omit,⠀misremember,⠀or⠀shape⠀the⠀past,⠀but⠀cannot⠀report⠀what⠀the⠀period's⠀communication⠀and⠀records⠀would⠀not⠀have⠀made⠀available.⠀The⠀Arabian⠀Nights⠀craft⠀source⠀operates⠀through⠀the⠀situated⠀voice,⠀the⠀audience⠀with⠀stakes,⠀the⠀nested⠀account⠀that⠀intervenes⠀in⠀the⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀accruing⠀meaning⠀of⠀repeated⠀elements;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀court,⠀desert,⠀djinn,⠀or⠀nightly⠀survival⠀frame⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario⠀already⠀contains⠀them.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Establish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀material⠀before⠀the⠀first⠀remembered⠀scene:⠀a⠀descendant⠀working⠀through⠀papers,⠀an⠀official⠀reviewer⠀checking⠀claims,⠀a⠀community⠀member⠀assembling⠀testimony,⠀or⠀a⠀chronicler⠀comparing⠀accounts.⠀Show⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀can⠀actually⠀consult⠀and⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀inferred.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀reports⠀a⠀remembered⠀scene,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀memory;⠀when⠀the⠀narrator⠀reports⠀a⠀ledger⠀entry,⠀permit,⠀register,⠀or⠀letter,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀record.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀tell⠀which⠀kind⠀of⠀source⠀is⠀governing⠀each⠀sentence.\n\nBegin⠀each⠀remembered⠀scene⠀with⠀the⠀historical⠀arrangement⠀that⠀constrains⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀it:⠀a⠀labor⠀obligation,⠀a⠀travel⠀permit,⠀a⠀market⠀rule,⠀a⠀parish⠀register,⠀an⠀apprenticeship⠀contract,⠀a⠀ration⠀or⠀inheritance⠀claim.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀act,⠀explain⠀the⠀arrangement⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀in⠀working⠀order.⠀Show⠀the⠀step⠀the⠀character⠀reaches,⠀the⠀document⠀or⠀permission⠀it⠀requires,⠀and⠀the⠀physical⠀action⠀that⠀follows.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀misunderstands⠀or⠀exploits⠀a⠀step,⠀show⠀the⠀misunderstanding⠀as⠀it⠀operates⠀at⠀that⠀moment,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀later⠀narrator's⠀correction.\n\nCompare⠀memory⠀with⠀record⠀through⠀specific⠀conflicts.⠀When⠀a⠀witness⠀remembers⠀a⠀departure,⠀payment,⠀or⠀closing⠀of⠀a⠀gate,⠀and⠀a⠀document⠀shows⠀a⠀different⠀order,⠀state⠀the⠀difference⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms:⠀the⠀witness⠀places⠀the⠀toll⠀in⠀the⠀morning,⠀the⠀receipt⠀is⠀dated⠀after⠀noon.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀notice⠀what⠀the⠀conflict⠀implies⠀about⠀who⠀recorded⠀the⠀event⠀and⠀under⠀what⠀pressure.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀discrepancy;⠀a⠀gap⠀between⠀memory⠀and⠀record⠀can⠀remain⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀institution⠀worked.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀reversal⠀as⠀a⠀correction⠀of⠀sequence.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀mistaken⠀memory⠀or⠀an⠀incomplete⠀record,⠀and⠀the⠀consequences⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀that⠀error⠀in⠀a⠀traceable⠀physical⠀order.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀document⠀or⠀testimony⠀changes⠀the⠀picture,⠀make⠀it⠀overturn⠀one⠀specific⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀about⠀order,⠀access,⠀or⠀responsibility.⠀The⠀reversal⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀historical⠀mechanism⠀more⠀intelligible,⠀not⠀merely⠀add⠀drama.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀reporting⠀syntax⠀plain⠀and⠀documentary,⠀while⠀remembered⠀scenes⠀carry⠀the⠀particular⠀sensations⠀and⠀judgments⠀of⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀lived⠀them.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀chosen⠀source⠀relation:⠀a⠀descendant⠀may⠀feel⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀ancestor's⠀omission,⠀an⠀official⠀reviewer⠀may⠀be⠀colder⠀about⠀a⠀claimant's⠀memory.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀bureaucratic⠀severity,⠀a⠀single⠀national⠀setting,⠀or⠀translated⠀word⠀order;⠀the⠀documentary⠀route⠀is⠀the⠀settled⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀a⠀national⠀temperament.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀as⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life,⠀and⠀make⠀that⠀collision⠀specific⠀before⠀it⠀drives⠀the⠀action.⠀A⠀family's⠀ancient⠀right⠀may⠀now⠀depend⠀on⠀a⠀modern⠀toll⠀register;⠀a⠀workshop's⠀inherited⠀custom⠀may⠀be⠀enforced⠀by⠀a⠀new⠀inspector;⠀a⠀debt⠀owed⠀to⠀a⠀patron⠀may⠀be⠀collected⠀through⠀a⠀changed⠀legal⠀procedure.⠀Establish⠀which⠀old⠀permission⠀or⠀obligation⠀is⠀still⠀in⠀force,⠀which⠀present⠀system⠀now⠀administers⠀it,⠀and⠀who⠀can⠀be⠀hurt⠀by⠀the⠀difference.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀act,⠀explain⠀the⠀governing⠀mechanism⠀in⠀its⠀working⠀order:⠀who⠀may⠀enter,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀signed,⠀which⠀door⠀is⠀watched,⠀what⠀fee⠀or⠀courtesy⠀is⠀owed,⠀what⠀happens⠀if⠀a⠀step⠀is⠀skipped.⠀Render⠀the⠀mechanism⠀through⠀its⠀actual⠀physical⠀history.⠀A⠀damp⠀stair,⠀worn⠀seal,⠀locked⠀archive,⠀or⠀ritual⠀of⠀greeting⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀controls⠀access⠀or⠀obligation,⠀and⠀its⠀age⠀or⠀decay⠀shows⠀where⠀the⠀old⠀arrangement⠀is⠀straining⠀against⠀present⠀use.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀clear⠀through⠀any⠀rapid⠀shift.\n\nLet⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀social⠀masks⠀carry⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀mechanism's⠀human⠀cost.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀perform⠀deference⠀while⠀calculating⠀an⠀escape,⠀or⠀show⠀trust⠀only⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀room⠀with⠀a⠀particular⠀person.⠀When⠀the⠀mask⠀falls⠀away,⠀make⠀the⠀exposure⠀consequential:⠀someone⠀sees⠀too⠀much,⠀a⠀promise⠀becomes⠀harder⠀to⠀keep,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀confidence⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀later⠀deny.⠀The⠀intimacy⠀should⠀reveal⠀the⠀pressure⠀the⠀arrangement⠀places⠀on⠀the⠀person,⠀not⠀merely⠀decorate⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀reversal⠀to⠀expose⠀a⠀specific⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀about⠀the⠀arrangement.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀which⠀rule,⠀permission,⠀or⠀relationship⠀the⠀reversal⠀overturns.⠀A⠀sudden⠀change⠀of⠀fortune⠀is⠀useful⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀clarifies⠀the⠀collision⠀between⠀inherited⠀power⠀and⠀present⠀life:⠀a⠀trusted⠀exception⠀turns⠀out⠀to⠀have⠀been⠀revoked,⠀an⠀old⠀right⠀is⠀found⠀to⠀require⠀a⠀new⠀signature,⠀or⠀a⠀personal⠀loyalty⠀conflicts⠀with⠀a⠀recorded⠀obligation.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀Humanity⠀numbers,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood-bond⠀rules.⠀The⠀Gothic-Punk⠀treatment⠀supplies⠀atmosphere,⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy,⠀urban⠀material⠀detail,⠀and⠀the⠀pressure⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀on⠀present⠀life;⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀and⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀profile⠀supply⠀the⠀rules⠀and⠀mechanisms.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route.⠀Write⠀from⠀a⠀participant⠀who⠀can⠀distinguish⠀what⠀they⠀understood⠀at⠀the⠀time⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀learned⠀later.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀first⠀person⠀or⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀close⠀third-person⠀account⠀of⠀one⠀participant's⠀experience;⠀keep⠀the⠀ownership⠀of⠀the⠀testimony⠀clear⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀particular⠀pronoun.⠀Establish⠀the⠀participant's⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀immediate⠀need⠀before⠀the⠀institutional⠀encounter⠀begins.\n\nLet⠀the⠀account⠀begin⠀with⠀the⠀specific⠀institution,⠀work,⠀or⠀material⠀condition⠀that⠀shaped⠀the⠀participant's⠀choices:⠀a⠀revenue⠀assessment,⠀a⠀household's⠀marriage⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀workshop's⠀piece-rate,⠀a⠀pilgrimage⠀route,⠀a⠀market's⠀credit⠀network,⠀a⠀school⠀or⠀court⠀record.⠀When⠀the⠀participant⠀must⠀act,⠀explain⠀the⠀mechanism⠀as⠀they⠀encountered⠀it,⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀they⠀learned⠀it.⠀Show⠀which⠀step⠀they⠀understood,⠀which⠀step⠀they⠀misunderstood,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀did⠀as⠀a⠀result.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀remain⠀inside⠀the⠀participant's⠀experience:⠀the⠀reader⠀learns⠀the⠀procedure⠀through⠀the⠀participant's⠀attempt⠀to⠀use⠀it,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀external⠀summary.\n\nSeparate⠀earlier⠀knowledge⠀from⠀later⠀knowledge⠀explicitly.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀say,⠀\"At⠀the⠀time⠀I⠀thought⠀the⠀receipt⠀had⠀been⠀filed,\"⠀and⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀record⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀conversation⠀revealed.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀later⠀knowledge⠀retroactively⠀become⠀the⠀earlier⠀motive.⠀The⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀participant⠀knew⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀institution⠀recorded⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀testimony's⠀meaning,⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀should⠀mark⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀that⠀gap⠀became⠀visible.\n\nUse⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀as⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀participant's⠀situation:⠀a⠀summons,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀new⠀employer,⠀a⠀letter,⠀a⠀death,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀law.⠀Each⠀shift⠀should⠀follow⠀from⠀a⠀concrete⠀event⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀trace.⠀When⠀a⠀reversal⠀occurs,⠀make⠀it⠀overturn⠀a⠀specific⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀about⠀access,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀sequence.⠀The⠀reversal⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀participant⠀learning⠀that⠀a⠀step⠀they⠀thought⠀complete⠀was⠀not,⠀or⠀that⠀an⠀authority⠀they⠀trusted⠀had⠀recorded⠀the⠀matter⠀differently.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀English,⠀code-switching,⠀religion,⠀caste⠀experience,⠀or⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀onto⠀the⠀scene.⠀The⠀testimonial⠀route⠀is⠀the⠀chosen⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀claim⠀that⠀all⠀Indian⠀literary⠀traditions⠀share⠀one⠀voice⠀or⠀one⠀set⠀of⠀domestic⠀concerns.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀diary⠀and⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀dated⠀personal⠀record⠀in⠀which⠀the⠀writer⠀notes⠀what⠀happened,⠀what⠀they⠀understood,⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀later⠀thought⠀about⠀it.⠀The⠀entry⠀may⠀be⠀brief⠀or⠀extended;⠀keep⠀the⠀writer's⠀actual⠀situation⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀record⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀pass⠀over.⠀The⠀diary⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀so⠀its⠀omissions⠀and⠀emphases⠀should⠀reflect⠀the⠀writer's⠀immediate⠀concerns,⠀not⠀a⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀practical⠀mechanism⠀enters⠀the⠀day,⠀explain⠀it⠀as⠀the⠀writer⠀encountered⠀it:⠀the⠀steps⠀for⠀sending⠀a⠀petition,⠀the⠀schedule⠀of⠀a⠀ferry,⠀the⠀rule⠀governing⠀a⠀market⠀stall,⠀the⠀procedure⠀for⠀borrowing⠀seed⠀or⠀cloth,⠀the⠀route⠀a⠀message⠀must⠀take.⠀Show⠀the⠀sequence⠀in⠀working⠀order,⠀then⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀did⠀with⠀it.⠀If⠀the⠀writer⠀misunderstood⠀a⠀step,⠀record⠀the⠀misunderstanding⠀as⠀it⠀was⠀at⠀the⠀time,⠀not⠀as⠀the⠀later⠀correction.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀learn⠀the⠀mechanism⠀through⠀the⠀writer's⠀dated⠀attempt⠀to⠀use⠀it.\n\nLet⠀rapid⠀shifts⠀appear⠀as⠀separate⠀entries⠀or⠀as⠀clearly⠀dated⠀turns⠀within⠀one⠀entry.⠀A⠀sudden⠀departure,⠀a⠀changed⠀order,⠀a⠀visitor,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀instruction⠀can⠀interrupt⠀the⠀day,⠀but⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀must⠀remain⠀traceable.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀entry⠀revises⠀an⠀earlier⠀one,⠀make⠀the⠀revision⠀specific:⠀the⠀writer⠀learns⠀that⠀the⠀messenger⠀left⠀before⠀the⠀gate⠀opened,⠀or⠀that⠀the⠀fee⠀was⠀paid⠀twice.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀which⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀the⠀new⠀knowledge⠀overturns.\n\nUse⠀reflection⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀record,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀universal⠀quietness.⠀The⠀writer⠀may⠀be⠀angry,⠀relieved,⠀confused,⠀amused,⠀or⠀practical.⠀Seasonal⠀attention,⠀omission,⠀direct⠀feeling,⠀and⠀plain⠀argument⠀are⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀particular⠀writer⠀would⠀use⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀an⠀inventory⠀of⠀Japanese⠀scenery⠀or⠀a⠀restrained⠀tone.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀diary's⠀limits⠀operational:⠀the⠀entry⠀contains⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀recorded⠀and⠀later⠀reflected⠀on,⠀not⠀a⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀The⠀historical⠀setting⠀should⠀shape⠀what⠀the⠀writer⠀can⠀know⠀and⠀record,⠀while⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀profile⠀keeps⠀the⠀mechanisms⠀and⠀reversals⠀legible.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀realism,⠀chronicle,⠀and⠀testimony⠀route.⠀Write⠀from⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀assembles⠀what⠀people⠀saw,⠀said,⠀and⠀recorded,⠀and⠀who⠀marks⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀each⠀piece:⠀direct⠀observation,⠀a⠀named⠀witness,⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀rumor,⠀or⠀an⠀inference.⠀The⠀narrator⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀neutral;⠀the⠀chronicle's⠀perspective⠀should⠀be⠀legible⠀in⠀what⠀it⠀emphasizes⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀doubts.⠀Establish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀relation⠀to⠀the⠀community⠀and⠀the⠀event⠀before⠀the⠀assembled⠀accounts⠀begin.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀explain⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀sequence⠀that⠀governs⠀the⠀situation:⠀a⠀land⠀claim,⠀a⠀labor⠀contract,⠀a⠀transport⠀route,⠀a⠀market⠀permit,⠀a⠀church⠀or⠀court⠀record,⠀a⠀debt⠀or⠀inheritance⠀procedure.⠀Show⠀the⠀steps⠀in⠀working⠀order⠀as⠀the⠀relevant⠀characters⠀understand⠀them.⠀Then⠀show⠀who⠀exploited⠀or⠀misunderstood⠀which⠀step,⠀and⠀what⠀action⠀followed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀clear⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀chronicle⠀moves⠀between⠀places⠀and⠀times.\n\nDistinguish⠀personal⠀participation⠀from⠀reported⠀events.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀have⠀seen⠀one⠀part⠀and⠀heard⠀the⠀rest⠀from⠀a⠀witness⠀whose⠀interests⠀are⠀visible.⠀When⠀accounts⠀conflict,⠀make⠀the⠀conflict⠀concrete:⠀one⠀person⠀says⠀the⠀gate⠀was⠀locked,⠀another⠀says⠀the⠀guard⠀was⠀absent,⠀a⠀document⠀shows⠀a⠀different⠀date.⠀Do⠀not⠀resolve⠀every⠀conflict;⠀let⠀the⠀disagreement⠀itself⠀show⠀how⠀information⠀moved⠀through⠀the⠀community.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Kamachi⠀reversal⠀as⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀the⠀available⠀testimony.⠀A⠀later⠀witness,⠀a⠀recovered⠀document,⠀or⠀a⠀newly⠀understood⠀sequence⠀can⠀overturn⠀a⠀specific⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀about⠀access,⠀order,⠀or⠀responsibility.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀trace⠀which⠀source⠀changed⠀and⠀why⠀it⠀matters.⠀The⠀reversal⠀should⠀clarify⠀the⠀social⠀mechanism,⠀not⠀merely⠀add⠀drama.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀when⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts⠀to⠀a⠀world⠀that⠀excludes⠀them.⠀Magical⠀realism⠀is⠀one⠀route⠀rather⠀than⠀the⠀whole⠀category,⠀and⠀this⠀entry⠀has⠀chosen⠀the⠀chronicle⠀and⠀testimony⠀route⠀instead.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀the⠀immediate⠀historical⠀situation⠀cleanly:⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀trying⠀to⠀do,⠀and⠀what⠀practical⠀constraint⠀is⠀already⠀in⠀motion.⠀Do⠀not⠀open⠀with⠀a⠀general⠀description⠀of⠀the⠀period.⠀Let⠀the⠀first⠀exchange⠀or⠀action⠀show⠀the⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀that⠀matter⠀now.\n\nKeep⠀spatial⠀changes⠀easy⠀to⠀follow.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀moves⠀from⠀a⠀workshop⠀to⠀a⠀street,⠀a⠀gate⠀to⠀a⠀ledger⠀room,⠀a⠀dock⠀to⠀a⠀household,⠀mark⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀a⠀short⠀concrete⠀sentence.⠀Use⠀readable⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀track⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀order⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀use⠀it.⠀Break⠀the⠀explanation⠀into⠀clear⠀steps:⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀presented,⠀who⠀must⠀approve⠀it,⠀what⠀fee⠀or⠀token⠀changes⠀hands,⠀what⠀happens⠀if⠀a⠀step⠀is⠀missed.⠀Use⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀arrangements:⠀a⠀guild⠀inspection,⠀a⠀tax⠀assessment,⠀a⠀travel⠀permit,⠀a⠀debt⠀register,⠀a⠀household's⠀supply⠀ration.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀character⠀exploiting⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀one⠀step⠀and⠀acting⠀on⠀it.\n\nGive⠀each⠀significant⠀action⠀or⠀revelation⠀a⠀focused⠀reaction⠀beat.⠀The⠀reaction⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀who⠀just⠀acted⠀or⠀learned,⠀and⠀it⠀may⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀practical,⠀or⠀funny⠀according⠀to⠀that⠀person.⠀The⠀beat⠀should⠀show⠀the⠀private⠀response⠀in⠀the⠀moment,⠀not⠀summarize⠀the⠀whole⠀scene's⠀meaning.\n\nWhen⠀a⠀reversal⠀occurs,⠀make⠀it⠀overturn⠀a⠀specific⠀earlier⠀assumption⠀about⠀the⠀mechanism⠀or⠀the⠀situation.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀which⠀step,⠀permission,⠀or⠀relationship⠀the⠀reversal⠀exposes.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀first⠀person,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀comedy,⠀or⠀a⠀closing⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀Light⠀Novel⠀container⠀supplies⠀fast-readable⠀staging⠀and⠀focused⠀beats;⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀and⠀Kamachi⠀profile⠀supply⠀the⠀rules⠀and⠀reversals.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nLet⠀a⠀practical⠀object⠀or⠀rule⠀become⠀the⠀lyric's⠀organizing⠀subject.⠀When⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀handles⠀a⠀lock,⠀weighs⠀a⠀measure,⠀reads⠀a⠀mark,⠀or⠀follows⠀a⠀route,⠀slow⠀the⠀sentence⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀feel⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀small⠀operations:⠀the⠀resistance⠀before⠀a⠀catch⠀gives,⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀sound⠀when⠀a⠀container⠀is⠀nearly⠀full,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀familiar⠀path⠀narrows⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀a⠀mistake⠀becomes⠀costly.⠀Keep⠀each⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀what⠀this⠀person⠀can⠀see,⠀touch,⠀remember,⠀or⠀reasonably⠀infer⠀in⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀place.\n\nTurn⠀the⠀explanation⠀of⠀a⠀mechanism⠀into⠀patterned⠀attention.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀learns⠀how⠀a⠀kiln⠀must⠀be⠀fed,⠀how⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀recorded,⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀gate⠀opens⠀only⠀at⠀certain⠀hours,⠀let⠀the⠀sentence's⠀rhythm⠀follow⠀the⠀mechanism's⠀parts.⠀Recurring⠀sounds⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀repeated⠀action:⠀the⠀scrape⠀of⠀the⠀tally,⠀the⠀pause⠀while⠀the⠀heat⠀gathers,⠀the⠀second⠀knock⠀that⠀means⠀the⠀watchman⠀has⠀recognized⠀the⠀caller.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀unfold⠀as⠀understanding⠀changes,⠀so⠀that⠀what⠀first⠀seems⠀like⠀a⠀locked⠀room⠀becomes,⠀by⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀explanation,⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀permissions⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀now⠀read.⠀After⠀the⠀mechanism⠀is⠀understood,⠀return⠀to⠀plain⠀clauses⠀for⠀the⠀resulting⠀action:⠀who⠀moved,⠀what⠀was⠀carried,⠀what⠀remained⠀possible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀lyric⠀passage⠀mark⠀a⠀particular⠀moment⠀of⠀learning,⠀risk,⠀or⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀general⠀mood.⠀A⠀practical⠀failure⠀may⠀recall⠀an⠀earlier⠀sound⠀or⠀image,⠀but⠀the⠀association⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀object⠀or⠀encounter.⠀Use⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀as⠀the⠀contrast⠀that⠀completes⠀the⠀turn,⠀so⠀the⠀rhythm⠀gathers⠀toward⠀the⠀action⠀and⠀then⠀releases⠀into⠀it.⠀The⠀scene⠀remains⠀legible⠀even⠀when⠀syntax⠀becomes⠀more⠀elaborate;⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀always⠀know⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀understands⠀and⠀what⠀that⠀understanding⠀permits.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBegin⠀the⠀reflective⠀turn⠀from⠀a⠀present⠀object,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀arrangement⠀whose⠀conditions⠀have⠀changed.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀tool⠀is⠀now⠀borrowed⠀instead⠀of⠀owned,⠀that⠀a⠀route⠀is⠀closed,⠀that⠀a⠀customary⠀payment⠀no⠀longer⠀buys⠀the⠀same⠀protection,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀familiar⠀task⠀has⠀passed⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀determine⠀what⠀change⠀is⠀possible⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀know⠀about⠀it.⠀Name⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀practical⠀terms⠀first:⠀what⠀is⠀missing,⠀who⠀now⠀decides,⠀what⠀the⠀new⠀cost⠀is.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀character⠀reflects,⠀reconstruct⠀the⠀former⠀mechanism⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀familiar⠀thing⠀work.⠀A⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀should⠀include⠀enough⠀of⠀its⠀old⠀rule,⠀cost,⠀or⠀sequence⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀what⠀has⠀been⠀lost:⠀who⠀used⠀to⠀open⠀the⠀gate,⠀how⠀the⠀payment⠀was⠀counted,⠀why⠀the⠀borrowed⠀tool⠀was⠀kept⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀place.⠀Let⠀the⠀present⠀object⠀supply⠀the⠀route⠀into⠀memory,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀explanation⠀legible⠀so⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀vague⠀ache⠀but⠀a⠀specific⠀arrangement⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀holds.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀misunderstands⠀why⠀the⠀change⠀occurred,⠀preserve⠀that⠀misunderstanding⠀rather⠀than⠀granting⠀later⠀historical⠀knowledge.\n\nLet⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀continue⠀through⠀the⠀reflection.⠀The⠀character⠀can⠀finish⠀a⠀transaction,⠀answer⠀a⠀question,⠀or⠀adjust⠀a⠀plan⠀while⠀remembering.⠀The⠀remembered⠀sequence⠀may⠀sharpen⠀the⠀present⠀action:⠀the⠀same⠀gesture⠀now⠀costs⠀more,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀now⠀means⠀something⠀different,⠀the⠀same⠀repair⠀now⠀requires⠀help⠀the⠀character⠀once⠀did⠀not⠀need.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀moment;⠀a⠀meal⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀good,⠀a⠀child's⠀joke⠀can⠀still⠀land,⠀and⠀a⠀repaired⠀object⠀can⠀still⠀work.⠀The⠀reflective⠀turn⠀is⠀complete⠀when⠀the⠀changed⠀meaning⠀of⠀the⠀familiar⠀thing⠀has⠀become⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀action,⠀not⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀has⠀summarized⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀announced⠀impermanence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀storytelling⠀as⠀the⠀presentation.⠀Establish⠀who⠀is⠀telling⠀the⠀tale,⠀to⠀whom,⠀and⠀under⠀what⠀practical⠀or⠀social⠀conditions:⠀a⠀traveler⠀waiting⠀out⠀a⠀delay,⠀a⠀merchant⠀explaining⠀a⠀failed⠀venture,⠀a⠀servant⠀accounting⠀for⠀a⠀broken⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀host⠀entertaining⠀a⠀guest⠀whose⠀help⠀may⠀be⠀needed.⠀The⠀teller's⠀period,⠀location,⠀and⠀position⠀determine⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀known,⠀repeated,⠀or⠀guessed.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀teller⠀later⠀historical⠀knowledge.\n\nMake⠀the⠀tale's⠀mechanism⠀legible⠀to⠀the⠀listener⠀because⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀need⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀it.⠀When⠀the⠀framed⠀account⠀involves⠀a⠀rule,⠀resource,⠀debt,⠀route,⠀or⠀custom,⠀the⠀teller⠀explains⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀explains⠀something⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀must⠀understand⠀it:⠀what⠀was⠀carried,⠀who⠀was⠀permitted⠀to⠀enter,⠀why⠀a⠀payment⠀failed,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀produced⠀the⠀next⠀move.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀serve⠀the⠀tale's⠀physical⠀sequence,⠀and⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀moral⠀instinct⠀should⠀remain⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀framed⠀character's⠀reasoning.⠀A⠀listener⠀may⠀interrupt⠀to⠀ask⠀the⠀practical⠀question⠀the⠀teller⠀omitted,⠀and⠀that⠀question⠀may⠀force⠀the⠀teller⠀to⠀revise⠀or⠀complete⠀the⠀mechanism.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀frame⠀as⠀a⠀real⠀boundary⠀and⠀a⠀continuing⠀social⠀relation.⠀The⠀outer⠀scene⠀may⠀return⠀between⠀sections,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀pause⠀but⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀telling's⠀conditions:⠀the⠀listener⠀becomes⠀impatient,⠀the⠀room⠀grows⠀colder,⠀a⠀name⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀turns⠀out⠀to⠀belong⠀to⠀someone⠀the⠀listener⠀knows,⠀or⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀omit⠀a⠀part⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀is⠀present.⠀Keep⠀the⠀chosen⠀tradition⠀coherent⠀through⠀the⠀teller's⠀language,⠀the⠀tale's⠀structure,⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀relation⠀shown⠀in⠀the⠀frame.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀tale⠀interrupted,⠀completed,⠀or⠀redirected⠀by⠀the⠀listener's⠀response,⠀leaving⠀the⠀outer⠀situation's⠀next⠀move⠀open.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀exact⠀details⠀that⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀use⠀or⠀be⠀constrained⠀by⠀in⠀this⠀period⠀and⠀place.⠀A⠀detail⠀should⠀identify⠀a⠀resource,⠀a⠀rule,⠀a⠀limit,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀route,⠀or⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀situation.⠀If⠀a⠀detail⠀appears,⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀infer⠀why⠀it⠀matters⠀or⠀how⠀it⠀will⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀next⠀action.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀atmospheric⠀objects⠀that⠀merely⠀decorate⠀the⠀historical⠀setting.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀direct.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀must⠀be⠀explained,⠀use⠀the⠀shortest⠀explanation⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀character⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀in⠀plain⠀clauses.⠀Rapid⠀shifts⠀are⠀acceptable⠀if⠀each⠀shift⠀preserves⠀who⠀moved,⠀what⠀changed,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀now⠀knows.⠀Omission⠀should⠀leave⠀the⠀consequence⠀inferable⠀from⠀what⠀remains;⠀if⠀the⠀reader⠀cannot⠀reconstruct⠀why⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀followed,⠀the⠀omitted⠀link⠀was⠀causal,⠀not⠀decorative.\n\nAllow⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀to⠀occupy⠀a⠀longer⠀sentence⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀actual⠀mechanism⠀of⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀calculation⠀of⠀cost,⠀a⠀recognition⠀of⠀a⠀changed⠀rule,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀whom⠀to⠀trust.⠀In⠀that⠀case,⠀the⠀longer⠀sentence⠀should⠀carry⠀the⠀practical⠀reasoning⠀the⠀character⠀needs⠀before⠀acting,⠀not⠀a⠀general⠀reflection.⠀Keep⠀cast⠀voices⠀individual⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀everyone⠀to⠀the⠀same⠀terse⠀register.⠀The⠀scene⠀ends⠀when⠀the⠀immediate⠀action⠀or⠀understanding⠀is⠀complete,⠀not⠀when⠀a⠀word⠀count⠀or⠀fragment⠀quota⠀has⠀been⠀reached.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀continuous⠀contemporary-novel⠀prose,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do.⠀Move⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀A⠀shift⠀to⠀memory⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀scene:⠀a⠀familiar⠀sound,⠀an⠀object⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀accounted⠀for,⠀a⠀name⠀in⠀a⠀record,⠀or⠀a⠀rule⠀that⠀has⠀changed.⠀Keep⠀the⠀recollection⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀using⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀pause⠀that⠀removes⠀the⠀character⠀from⠀the⠀scene.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀scene⠀involves⠀a⠀mechanism,⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀register⠀of⠀the⠀narrator⠀and⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character.⠀The⠀explanation⠀may⠀occur⠀through⠀dialogue,⠀through⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀while⠀handling⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀through⠀the⠀narrator's⠀close⠀account⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀notices⠀and⠀tries.⠀Let⠀the⠀paragraph⠀follow⠀the⠀mechanism's⠀stages:⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀the⠀mark⠀or⠀hears⠀the⠀signal,⠀works⠀out⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀under⠀the⠀period's⠀rules,⠀and⠀then⠀acts.⠀After⠀the⠀explanation,⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀so⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀remains⠀legible.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀character's⠀period-specific⠀misunderstanding⠀when⠀it⠀drives⠀the⠀next⠀choice.\n\nUse⠀paragraphing⠀and⠀transitions⠀to⠀orient⠀the⠀reader⠀without⠀recap⠀machinery.⠀A⠀new⠀paragraph⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀speaker,⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀outer⠀action⠀to⠀inner⠀calculation,⠀or⠀a⠀movement⠀to⠀a⠀different⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀immediate⠀scene.⠀Keep⠀the⠀narrator's⠀voice⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀and⠀the⠀author⠀profile's⠀practical⠀clarity.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀business⠀continuing⠀or⠀a⠀question⠀unresolved,⠀so⠀the⠀next⠀reply⠀can⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀same⠀action⠀or⠀move⠀to⠀its⠀consequence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nSelect⠀scenes⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀established⠀relationship⠀premise⠀legible⠀under⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀constraints.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀involves⠀loyalty,⠀rivalry,⠀comfort,⠀discovery,⠀or⠀unresolved⠀desire,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀what⠀these⠀people⠀can⠀do⠀for⠀each⠀other⠀given⠀their⠀positions,⠀resources,⠀and⠀obligations.⠀A⠀repeated⠀moment⠀should⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀premise:⠀the⠀same⠀errand,⠀the⠀same⠀guarded⠀phrase,⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀passed⠀between⠀them,⠀or⠀the⠀same⠀public⠀custom⠀that⠀forces⠀a⠀private⠀choice.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀determine⠀what⠀the⠀repetition⠀costs⠀now,⠀not⠀merely⠀that⠀it⠀recurs.\n\nLet⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀callbacks⠀carry⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀gesture,⠀or⠀shared⠀reference⠀may⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀situation⠀gives⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀is⠀passed⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning,⠀the⠀same⠀guarded⠀phrase⠀now⠀answers⠀a⠀different⠀question,⠀or⠀the⠀same⠀errand⠀is⠀performed⠀under⠀a⠀changed⠀obligation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀callback⠀legible⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀context.⠀If⠀a⠀mechanism⠀or⠀rule⠀affects⠀the⠀relationship,⠀explain⠀it⠀when⠀one⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀other⠀responds.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀change⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀can⠀offer,⠀ask,⠀or⠀understand⠀about⠀the⠀other,⠀so⠀the⠀emotional⠀consequence⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀conditions⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀generic⠀feeling.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀characters'⠀individual⠀knowledge⠀and⠀agency.⠀One⠀character's⠀private⠀reasoning⠀may⠀remain⠀unknown⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀narration⠀reveals⠀it.⠀A⠀consequence⠀may⠀fulfill⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise⠀without⠀resolving⠀every⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀the⠀scene⠀end⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀of⠀the⠀interaction,⠀with⠀the⠀relationship's⠀next⠀move⠀still⠀open⠀rather⠀than⠀forced⠀into⠀a⠀completed⠀emotional⠀beat.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nGive⠀the⠀account⠀the⠀sense⠀of⠀being⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀of⠀who⠀acted,⠀what⠀was⠀at⠀stake,⠀or⠀what⠀later⠀became⠀known:⠀a⠀bargain⠀that⠀held,⠀a⠀warning⠀that⠀was⠀ignored,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changed⠀hands,⠀or⠀a⠀route⠀that⠀was⠀closed⠀after⠀a⠀particular⠀night.⠀Then⠀expand⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀Keep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀practical⠀conditions⠀present:⠀a⠀journey's⠀route,⠀a⠀debt's⠀terms,⠀a⠀tool's⠀repair,⠀or⠀a⠀custom's⠀enforcement⠀can⠀be⠀the⠀substance⠀of⠀a⠀remembered⠀deed.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀unless⠀the⠀supplied⠀world⠀establishes⠀them.\n\nUse⠀compact⠀declarations⠀to⠀mark⠀a⠀person⠀or⠀act,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀mechanism⠀that⠀made⠀the⠀outcome⠀possible.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀a⠀rule⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀resource,⠀the⠀chronicle⠀may⠀explain⠀it⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀remembered⠀sequence:⠀what⠀was⠀carried,⠀who⠀was⠀permitted⠀to⠀pass,⠀why⠀a⠀payment⠀failed,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀produced⠀the⠀next⠀move.⠀Maintain⠀an⠀understandable⠀physical⠀order⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀telling⠀shifts⠀rapidly⠀from⠀preparation⠀to⠀result.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀should⠀return⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀occurrence⠀gives⠀it⠀new⠀application,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀ornamental⠀epithet⠀attached⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.\n\nRelate⠀an⠀act⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀without⠀declaring⠀every⠀modest⠀action⠀legendary.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀bargain⠀held,⠀that⠀a⠀warning⠀was⠀ignored,⠀or⠀that⠀a⠀kindness⠀became⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀later⠀dispute.⠀Keep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀consistent⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective⠀and⠀period.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀business⠀concluded⠀or⠀resumed,⠀leaving⠀another⠀act⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀closing⠀the⠀chronicle⠀with⠀a⠀fixed⠀verdict.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀historical⠀fiction⠀through⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀realism.⠀Treat⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work⠀routines,⠀and⠀material⠀arrangements⠀as⠀the⠀operative⠀systems⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀Choose⠀the⠀particular⠀system⠀from⠀the⠀scenario:⠀a⠀household's⠀obligations,⠀a⠀parish's⠀authority,⠀a⠀workshop's⠀practices,⠀a⠀market's⠀terms,⠀or⠀a⠀road's⠀conditions.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀that⠀system,⠀and⠀the⠀narrative⠀explains⠀the⠀mechanism⠀only⠀when⠀that⠀exploitation⠀or⠀misunderstanding⠀becomes⠀possible.⠀Show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀in⠀a⠀legible⠀physical⠀sequence,⠀so⠀a⠀reversal⠀arises⠀from⠀a⠀concrete⠀change⠀in⠀resources,⠀obligations,⠀or⠀access⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀an⠀abstract⠀twist.\n\nGround⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀social⠀position⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀involved.⠀What⠀one⠀person⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀or⠀do⠀depends⠀on⠀their⠀place⠀in⠀the⠀community,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀position⠀visible⠀through⠀encounters:⠀a⠀conversation⠀at⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀meal.⠀Let⠀domestic⠀and⠀institutional⠀life⠀carry⠀the⠀story's⠀pressure.⠀A⠀sudden⠀shift⠀of⠀fortune⠀should⠀feel⠀like⠀a⠀real⠀consequence⠀within⠀those⠀arrangements,⠀not⠀a⠀genre⠀escalation.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀voice⠀composed⠀and⠀observant,⠀attentive⠀to⠀the⠀unspoken⠀terms⠀of⠀ordinary⠀life.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀reasons⠀through⠀a⠀problem,⠀show⠀the⠀practical⠀steps⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀cost⠀of⠀each⠀option:⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀asked,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀given,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀risked,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀is⠀likely⠀to⠀infer.⠀Private⠀thought⠀may⠀run⠀ahead⠀of⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀says,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀their⠀own;⠀another⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀gain⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀place⠀actually⠀supplied;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀folktale⠀or⠀mythic⠀machinery,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀reserve,⠀snow,⠀isolation,⠀or⠀bleakness⠀as⠀required⠀scenery.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀historical⠀fiction⠀as⠀a⠀screenplay.⠀Use⠀concise⠀action⠀lines⠀to⠀show⠀the⠀period⠀mechanisms⠀that⠀matter:⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀does⠀with⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀lock,⠀a⠀measure,⠀a⠀coin,⠀or⠀a⠀work⠀process.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀exploits⠀or⠀misunderstands⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀the⠀setting,⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀shows⠀the⠀physical⠀steps⠀and⠀the⠀immediate⠀result.⠀A⠀misreading⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀reaches⠀for,⠀checks,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀do;⠀an⠀exploitation⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀set⠀in⠀motion.⠀Keep⠀the⠀sequence⠀understandable⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts.\n\nGive⠀each⠀speaker⠀a⠀clear⠀cue⠀and⠀let⠀dialogue⠀carry⠀the⠀tactical⠀reasoning.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀what⠀they⠀intend,⠀test⠀another⠀person's⠀understanding,⠀or⠀reveal⠀a⠀misreading⠀of⠀the⠀period's⠀arrangements.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀problem,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀pause⠀to⠀lecture.⠀Let⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀reveal⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀believes⠀about⠀a⠀rule,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀action⠀line⠀confirm⠀or⠀complicate⠀that⠀belief.\n\nUse⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀and⠀use⠀cuts,⠀offscreen⠀sound,⠀or⠀voice-over⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀affect⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀delivery,⠀a⠀dispute.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀in⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀notes⠀when⠀the⠀active⠀presentation⠀requires⠀it;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀dialogue⠀or⠀knowledge⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀cast.⠀Do⠀not⠀fill⠀the⠀page⠀with⠀camera⠀commands.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified⠀instead⠀of⠀inventing⠀a⠀generic⠀historical⠀template.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀historical⠀fiction⠀as⠀a⠀playable⠀stage⠀script.⠀Use⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀objects,⠀pauses,⠀and⠀actions⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀staged.⠀When⠀a⠀period⠀mechanism⠀matters—a⠀tool,⠀a⠀container,⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀measure,⠀a⠀work⠀process—establish⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀prop⠀or⠀a⠀stageable⠀action,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀characters⠀handle⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀follow.⠀A⠀misreading⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀reaches⠀for,⠀checks,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀do;⠀an⠀exploitation⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀set⠀in⠀motion.\n\nLet⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀tactical⠀reasoning.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀explain⠀what⠀they⠀intend,⠀test⠀another⠀person's⠀understanding,⠀or⠀reveal⠀a⠀misreading⠀of⠀the⠀period's⠀arrangements.⠀The⠀explanation⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀scene's⠀practical⠀problem,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀pause⠀to⠀lecture.⠀Let⠀a⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue⠀reveal⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀believes⠀about⠀a⠀rule,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀movement⠀confirm⠀or⠀complicate⠀that⠀belief.\n\nLet⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀affect⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀delivery,⠀a⠀dispute.⠀A⠀reversal⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀people⠀and⠀objects,⠀not⠀delivered⠀as⠀an⠀abstract⠀twist.⠀Stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀certify⠀hidden⠀guilt⠀or⠀hidden⠀knowledge.⠀Monologues⠀and⠀asides⠀need⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀every⠀private⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀its⠀active⠀presentation⠀instead⠀of⠀disguising⠀it⠀as⠀something⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀historical⠀fiction⠀as⠀stream⠀of⠀consciousness⠀through⠀a⠀particular⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Braid⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern,⠀and⠀let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀those⠀associations.⠀Keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀events⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy:⠀a⠀remembered⠀transaction⠀is⠀not⠀happening⠀again,⠀and⠀an⠀imagined⠀outcome⠀has⠀not⠀occurred.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀mind⠀process⠀the⠀period's⠀rules,⠀resources,⠀and⠀practical⠀problems⠀as⠀recurring⠀concerns.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀can⠀be⠀exploited⠀or⠀misunderstood,⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement⠀works⠀through⠀the⠀steps⠀and⠀the⠀possible⠀results:⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀a⠀thing,⠀the⠀wording⠀of⠀an⠀obligation,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀distance⠀to⠀a⠀place,⠀or⠀the⠀likely⠀response⠀of⠀another⠀person.⠀A⠀misreading⠀emerges⠀through⠀the⠀mind's⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀rule,⠀its⠀comparison⠀with⠀a⠀memory,⠀or⠀its⠀anticipation⠀of⠀a⠀consequence.⠀The⠀association⠀is⠀the⠀method,⠀not⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence;⠀when⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀occurs,⠀show⠀it⠀in⠀a⠀legible⠀sequence.\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀associations⠀in⠀the⠀period,⠀location,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀actually⠀supplied.⠀What⠀the⠀mind⠀knows,⠀obtains,⠀expects,⠀and⠀does⠀depends⠀on⠀those⠀conditions,⠀and⠀the⠀stream⠀should⠀reflect⠀them⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀conversation,⠀a⠀bodily⠀effort.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀share⠀a⠀mind,⠀authorize⠀human-owned⠀thoughts,⠀or⠀turn⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate.⠀Ordinary⠀reasoning⠀alone⠀is⠀not⠀this⠀stylistic⠀mode;⠀the⠀associative⠀movement⠀must⠀carry⠀the⠀telling.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀historical⠀fiction⠀as⠀a⠀story⠀carried⠀by⠀messages.⠀Use⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages⠀and⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀period-appropriate⠀communication⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀what⠀they⠀write,⠀how⠀they⠀address⠀the⠀recipient,⠀what⠀they⠀omit,⠀and⠀how⠀quickly⠀they⠀respond⠀depend⠀on⠀the⠀setting's⠀medium⠀and⠀social⠀position.\n\nTreat⠀the⠀communication⠀itself⠀as⠀the⠀operative⠀system.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀the⠀exchange:⠀who⠀can⠀reach⠀whom,⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀can⠀carry,⠀what⠀a⠀delay⠀means,⠀what⠀a⠀recipient⠀is⠀likely⠀to⠀infer.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀matters,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀the⠀transmitted⠀text⠀and⠀the⠀interface⠀events.⠀A⠀misreading⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀writes,⠀asks,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀ask;⠀an⠀exploitation⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀send,⠀withhold,⠀or⠀time.⠀A⠀reversal⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀a⠀concrete⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀sent,⠀received,⠀withheld,⠀or⠀misread.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀affect⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters⠀referenced⠀or⠀arranged⠀in⠀the⠀messages.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀historical⠀fiction⠀as⠀a⠀visual⠀novel.⠀Use⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response⠀in⠀a⠀rhythm⠀suited⠀to⠀an⠀illustrated⠀scene.⠀Let⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀orient⠀the⠀moment⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.\n\nShow⠀the⠀period's⠀mechanisms⠀through⠀the⠀scene's⠀visual⠀and⠀physical⠀details.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀exploit⠀or⠀misunderstand⠀a⠀rule⠀of⠀the⠀setting—a⠀tool,⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀measure,⠀a⠀work⠀process,⠀a⠀social⠀obligation—the⠀scene-setting⠀establishes⠀the⠀object⠀or⠀arrangement,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀dialogue⠀works⠀through⠀the⠀practical⠀steps.⠀A⠀misreading⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices,⠀checks,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀notice;⠀an⠀exploitation⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀set⠀in⠀motion.⠀Keep⠀the⠀physical⠀sequence⠀understandable⠀through⠀rapid⠀shifts:⠀a⠀reversal⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀details⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀response⠀to⠀them,⠀not⠀delivered⠀as⠀an⠀abstract⠀twist.\n\nLet⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀affect⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters:⠀an⠀errand,⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀repair,⠀a⠀delivery,⠀a⠀dispute.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀inside⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀narration;⠀another⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀gain⠀access⠀to⠀it.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀Preserve⠀uncertainty⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀unspecified⠀instead⠀of⠀inventing⠀a⠀generic⠀historical⠀template.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaianbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Kamachi⠀Kazuma⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀historical⠀fiction⠀as⠀a⠀web⠀serial.⠀Maintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.\n\nLet⠀an⠀earlier⠀period⠀arrangement⠀or⠀resource⠀remain⠀available⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀changes⠀what⠀it⠀suggests.⠀A⠀character⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀workshop⠀rule,⠀the⠀parish⠀obligation,⠀the⠀market⠀price,⠀the⠀road⠀condition,⠀or⠀the⠀household⠀agreement⠀previously⠀established,⠀and⠀the⠀new⠀development⠀qualifies⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Briefly⠀recover⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history⠀that⠀first⠀established⠀it.⠀New⠀information⠀can⠀qualify⠀an⠀old⠀explanation⠀without⠀replacing⠀the⠀old⠀event⠀or⠀making⠀a⠀character⠀deliberately⠀forget⠀a⠀supported⠀conclusion.\n\nShow⠀Kamachi-style⠀tactical⠀reasoning⠀through⠀the⠀installment's⠀practical⠀problems.⠀When⠀a⠀mechanism⠀can⠀be⠀exploited⠀or⠀misunderstood,⠀explain⠀it⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀act⠀on⠀it,⠀then⠀show⠀the⠀resulting⠀action⠀in⠀a⠀legible⠀physical⠀sequence.⠀A⠀misreading⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀reaches⠀for,⠀checks,⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀do;⠀an⠀exploitation⠀becomes⠀visible⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀set⠀in⠀motion.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀affect⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀particular⠀encounters.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀The⠀installment⠀can⠀close⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀or⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nMake⠀every⠀emotional⠀move⠀bear⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀period's⠀constraints.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀admits⠀a⠀need,⠀tie⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀thing⠀the⠀present⠀arrangement⠀may⠀deny:⠀a⠀room,⠀a⠀journey,⠀a⠀marriage⠀prospect,⠀an⠀apprenticeship,⠀a⠀promise⠀made⠀in⠀another's⠀name.⠀When⠀one⠀withholds,⠀ground⠀that⠀silence⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀could⠀lose⠀or⠀fail⠀to⠀procure,⠀not⠀simply⠀in⠀mood.⠀Let⠀apologies⠀arrive⠀late,⠀from⠀the⠀wrong⠀person,⠀or⠀in⠀words⠀that⠀fit⠀public⠀requirements⠀while⠀the⠀private⠀wound⠀remains⠀visible.\n\nUse⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀to⠀give⠀costs⠀a⠀practical⠀shape.⠀A⠀treasured⠀object⠀becomes⠀awkward⠀when⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀sold,⠀confiscated,⠀or⠀inherited⠀by⠀someone⠀else.⠀A⠀remembered⠀place⠀carries⠀both⠀sensuous⠀detail⠀and⠀the⠀fact⠀that⠀returning⠀to⠀it⠀may⠀now⠀be⠀forbidden,⠀too⠀expensive,⠀or⠀changed⠀in⠀ways⠀one⠀person⠀refuses⠀to⠀name⠀while⠀the⠀other⠀states⠀outright.⠀Institutions—family⠀authority,⠀labor⠀contracts,⠀travel⠀documents,⠀religious⠀obligation,⠀market⠀dependence—do⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀be⠀explained⠀at⠀length,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀determine⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀or⠀done⠀next.\n\nLet⠀strain⠀alter⠀the⠀conversation⠀itself.⠀A⠀question⠀may⠀turn⠀into⠀a⠀reminder⠀of⠀a⠀settlement,⠀a⠀compliment⠀may⠀expose⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀comfort⠀may⠀resurface⠀an⠀injury⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀repaired⠀in⠀this⠀room.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀exchange⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀vulnerability;⠀sometimes⠀a⠀character⠀defends⠀themselves⠀with⠀misleading⠀composure,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀appears⠀in⠀what⠀they⠀fail⠀to⠀say.⠀Show⠀the⠀lag⠀between⠀feeling⠀and⠀speech⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀steady⠀stream⠀of⠀confession.\n\nPreserve⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precision⠀without⠀letting⠀lushness⠀swallow⠀the⠀conflict.⠀Describe⠀a⠀fabric,⠀meal,⠀seasonal⠀change,⠀or⠀gesture⠀in⠀terms⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀intimacy⠀exact,⠀then⠀let⠀that⠀detail⠀become⠀the⠀thing⠀one⠀person⠀uses⠀to⠀wound⠀or⠀remember.⠀Keep⠀private⠀experience⠀bound⠀to⠀the⠀body:⠀a⠀hand⠀kept⠀from⠀touching,⠀a⠀breath⠀held⠀while⠀riding⠀past⠀a⠀familiar⠀lane,⠀an⠀appetite⠀that⠀returns⠀with⠀shame.⠀Beauty⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀contrast⠀that⠀softens⠀the⠀hurt;⠀it⠀is⠀one⠀more⠀object⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀owned,⠀withheld,⠀misread,⠀or⠀lost.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀turbulent⠀exchange⠀to⠀produce⠀reconciliation,⠀estrangement,⠀or⠀a⠀plotted⠀turn.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀practical⠀obligations⠀are⠀still⠀stalled⠀and⠀the⠀relationship⠀remains⠀in⠀motion.⠀Trace⠀the⠀specific⠀uneven⠀recognition⠀between⠀the⠀characters⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀scene⠀grows⠀from⠀that⠀imbalance.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nTreat⠀each⠀response⠀as⠀an⠀interval⠀within⠀a⠀continuing⠀period⠀setting.⠀Use⠀unmistakable⠀speech⠀attribution⠀and⠀keep⠀narrative⠀paragraphs⠀short⠀enough⠀to⠀scan⠀while⠀preserving⠀physical⠀texture.⠀Name⠀who⠀speaks,⠀what⠀they⠀are⠀doing,⠀and⠀what⠀concrete⠀circumstance⠀constrains⠀them—whether⠀it⠀is⠀a⠀meal⠀being⠀served,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀answered,⠀a⠀curfew,⠀an⠀errand⠀that⠀cannot⠀wait,⠀or⠀a⠀social⠀obligation⠀that⠀prevents⠀them⠀from⠀leaving⠀the⠀room.\n\nMake⠀the⠀historical⠀world⠀active⠀through⠀dialogue⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition.⠀Characters⠀may⠀discuss⠀prices,⠀routes,⠀household⠀duties,⠀permissions,⠀suspicions,⠀or⠀debts⠀without⠀slowing⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀one⠀speaker⠀notice⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀custom⠀the⠀other⠀takes⠀for⠀granted;⠀this⠀gives⠀the⠀other⠀player⠀something⠀to⠀answer⠀besides⠀the⠀emotional⠀tension.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀wants⠀to⠀speak⠀privately,⠀show⠀how⠀the⠀period's⠀arrangements⠀make⠀that⠀hard—servants⠀passing,⠀thin⠀walls,⠀communal⠀sleeping,⠀chaperonage,⠀or⠀the⠀need⠀to⠀wait⠀for⠀a⠀market⠀day.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀compression⠀in⠀small,⠀clear⠀strokes.⠀Describe⠀a⠀scent,⠀texture,⠀or⠀gesture⠀in⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀suggests⠀attraction,⠀memory,⠀or⠀discomfort⠀without⠀halting⠀the⠀exchange⠀for⠀a⠀long⠀paragraph.⠀Glamorous⠀details—good⠀silk,⠀a⠀particular⠀tea,⠀a⠀remembered⠀street—can⠀make⠀social⠀difference⠀audible,⠀but⠀a⠀beautiful⠀surface⠀should⠀also⠀carry⠀cost.⠀If⠀a⠀speaker⠀comments⠀on⠀someone's⠀clothes,⠀let⠀it⠀reveal⠀their⠀own⠀position⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀not⠀merely⠀scenery.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀the⠀character⠀under⠀the⠀current⠀speaker's⠀control⠀into⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀reaction.⠀Their⠀dialogue⠀may⠀remain⠀evasive,⠀practical,⠀tender,⠀or⠀silent,⠀depending⠀on⠀the⠀active⠀roleplay⠀authority.⠀At⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀a⠀response,⠀the⠀next⠀speaker⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀natural⠀thing⠀to⠀do⠀or⠀say:⠀pick⠀up⠀the⠀letter,⠀taste⠀the⠀cold⠀food,⠀challenge⠀a⠀false⠀report,⠀ask⠀whose⠀carriage⠀is⠀outside,⠀or⠀continue⠀a⠀task⠀they⠀were⠀already⠀performing.⠀A⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀direct⠀question⠀is⠀not⠀required;⠀the⠀historical⠀continuity⠀itself⠀creates⠀the⠀next⠀move.\n\nRespect⠀period⠀knowledge⠀and⠀perspective.⠀A⠀character⠀should⠀not⠀mention⠀a⠀future⠀event⠀or⠀modern⠀concept⠀unless⠀the⠀setting,⠀scenario,⠀and⠀active⠀contract⠀permit⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀scene⠀rooted⠀in⠀what⠀these⠀people⠀can⠀know⠀and⠀do⠀now.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nChoose⠀the⠀classical⠀episodic⠀route,⠀but⠀anchor⠀each⠀episode⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀period,⠀place,⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀of⠀the⠀scenario⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀dynastic⠀backdrop.⠀Scene⠀titles⠀or⠀section⠀breaks⠀may⠀separate⠀episodes:⠀a⠀debt⠀recounted⠀at⠀a⠀window,⠀a⠀gift⠀refused⠀at⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀marriage⠀proposal⠀carried⠀across⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀a⠀servant's⠀changed⠀errand.⠀Each⠀episode⠀should⠀alter⠀some⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀while⠀leaving⠀most⠀questions⠀unresolved.\n\nUse⠀a⠀composed⠀narration⠀that⠀knows⠀more⠀than⠀any⠀single⠀speaker,⠀but⠀limit⠀it⠀to⠀what⠀the⠀period's⠀people⠀could⠀observe,⠀report,⠀or⠀suspect.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀describe⠀fabric,⠀food,⠀weather,⠀and⠀architecture⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision,⠀then⠀press⠀that⠀attention⠀toward⠀division⠀and⠀memory.⠀A⠀remembered⠀house⠀is⠀not⠀just⠀beautiful;⠀entering⠀it⠀again⠀opens⠀a⠀threshold⠀someone⠀has⠀lost⠀the⠀right⠀to⠀cross.⠀A⠀bowl⠀of⠀rice⠀may⠀become⠀a⠀measure⠀of⠀welcome⠀or⠀of⠀obligation.\n\nGive⠀dialogue⠀a⠀terse,⠀formal⠀surface⠀that⠀sometimes⠀breaks.⠀Characters⠀in⠀authority⠀speak⠀in⠀short⠀instructions⠀and⠀measured⠀refusals;⠀those⠀with⠀less⠀power⠀may⠀shape⠀even⠀a⠀request⠀as⠀a⠀report.⠀The⠀break⠀matters⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀rare⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀loss,⠀jealousy,⠀or⠀longing.⠀Do⠀not⠀modernize⠀speech⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀exchange⠀witty;⠀let⠀social⠀constraint⠀produce⠀the⠀pauses.\n\nDraw⠀on⠀the⠀tradition's⠀episodic⠀rhythm⠀without⠀adding⠀supernatural⠀or⠀fantastic⠀material⠀unless⠀the⠀active⠀world⠀permits⠀it.⠀Recurrence⠀can⠀work⠀through⠀seasonal⠀work,⠀household⠀routine,⠀an⠀official⠀visit,⠀or⠀a⠀market⠀day.⠀A⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀may⠀connect⠀episodes,⠀but⠀its⠀meaning⠀must⠀change⠀with⠀the⠀facts⠀the⠀reader⠀now⠀knows⠀rather⠀than⠀certify⠀emotion⠀as⠀truth.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀recalls⠀an⠀earlier⠀episode,⠀note⠀what⠀they⠀noticed⠀then⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀name⠀now.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language⠀period-aware⠀but⠀not⠀artificially⠀archaic.⠀The⠀phrasing⠀may⠀be⠀formal,⠀but⠀the⠀model⠀should⠀use⠀English⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀author⠀and⠀register.⠀Any⠀reference⠀to⠀another⠀tradition⠀should⠀remain⠀craft⠀guidance,⠀not⠀a⠀transplanted⠀setting⠀or⠀cast.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀short,⠀concrete⠀sentences⠀and⠀verbs⠀that⠀name⠀physical⠀work:⠀pried,⠀scraped,⠀counted,⠀folded,⠀carried,⠀asked,⠀refused.⠀Let⠀transitions⠀from⠀one⠀moment⠀to⠀the⠀next⠀be⠀abrupt⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀sharpens⠀or⠀the⠀situation⠀changes,⠀but⠀avoid⠀sentence⠀fragments⠀as⠀decoration.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀needs⠀longer⠀reasoning,⠀allow⠀it,⠀but⠀make⠀the⠀reasoning⠀turn⠀on⠀a⠀material⠀fact—what⠀the⠀letter⠀may⠀cost⠀to⠀send,⠀whether⠀the⠀horse⠀can⠀survive⠀the⠀road,⠀who⠀else⠀can⠀hear⠀the⠀argument⠀through⠀the⠀wall.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensuous⠀attention⠀without⠀softness.⠀Describe⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀cloth,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀wet⠀rice⠀stalks,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀copper⠀coin⠀worn⠀smooth,⠀the⠀exact⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀bruise⠀beneath⠀a⠀sleeve.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀these⠀details⠀float⠀as⠀atmosphere.⠀Each⠀should⠀attach⠀to⠀a⠀limit:⠀the⠀cloth⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone,⠀the⠀rice⠀won't⠀last,⠀the⠀coin⠀may⠀be⠀counterfeit,⠀the⠀bruise⠀must⠀be⠀hidden⠀before⠀an⠀audience.⠀Beauty⠀in⠀this⠀style⠀is⠀never⠀free.\n\nMake⠀historical⠀constraints⠀visible⠀through⠀ordinary⠀wear.⠀A⠀door⠀that⠀will⠀not⠀shut,⠀a⠀torn⠀account⠀book,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat⠀too⠀large⠀in⠀the⠀shoulders,⠀an⠀expensive⠀stick⠀of⠀rouge⠀that⠀would⠀bring⠀more⠀sold⠀than⠀used—these⠀are⠀the⠀instruments⠀of⠀longing⠀and⠀injury.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀remembers⠀a⠀place,⠀ground⠀the⠀memory⠀in⠀its⠀current⠀condition:⠀a⠀courtyard⠀now⠀rented⠀to⠀strangers,⠀a⠀bridge⠀rebuilt⠀after⠀a⠀flood,⠀a⠀shop⠀sign⠀repainted⠀under⠀a⠀different⠀name.\n\nLet⠀longing⠀and⠀jealousy⠀appear⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀controlled⠀speech⠀rather⠀than⠀declaration.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀set⠀down⠀a⠀bowl⠀too⠀hard,⠀refuse⠀to⠀say⠀a⠀name,⠀return⠀a⠀gift⠀in⠀public,⠀or⠀walk⠀past⠀a⠀familiar⠀street⠀without⠀looking⠀in.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀be⠀rough,⠀but⠀only⠀if⠀the⠀speaker⠀would⠀be⠀rough;⠀do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀grittily⠀snappish.⠀Silence⠀or⠀flat⠀practicality⠀can⠀be⠀more⠀violent⠀than⠀a⠀curse.\n\nVary⠀the⠀rhythm⠀when⠀the⠀scene⠀turns.⠀A⠀sudden⠀action—a⠀slap,⠀a⠀dropped⠀load,⠀a⠀door⠀kicked⠀shut—reads⠀best⠀in⠀a⠀short⠀paragraph;⠀the⠀preceding⠀anger⠀or⠀the⠀calculated⠀decision⠀afterward⠀may⠀need⠀longer⠀clauses.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀material⠀task⠀or⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀stop,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀next⠀action⠀should⠀be⠀physically⠀possible⠀within⠀the⠀setting,⠀and⠀the⠀unresolved⠀emotional⠀situation⠀may⠀simply⠀continue.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀form⠀which⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀situation⠀justify:⠀a⠀letter,⠀account⠀book,⠀delivery⠀note,⠀diary⠀entry,⠀draft⠀that⠀would⠀never⠀be⠀sent,⠀temple⠀record,⠀household⠀memorandum,⠀or⠀magistrate's⠀filing.⠀Each⠀document⠀must⠀carry⠀its⠀writer's⠀position⠀and⠀purpose.⠀A⠀servant⠀listing⠀supplies⠀does⠀not⠀mention⠀an⠀argument⠀in⠀the⠀courtyard,⠀though⠀a⠀late⠀entry⠀or⠀unexplained⠀expense⠀may⠀betray⠀it.⠀A⠀letter⠀from⠀a⠀mother⠀about⠀a⠀marriage⠀prospect⠀may⠀never⠀name⠀the⠀daughter's⠀known⠀objection.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀precision⠀inside⠀the⠀document.⠀Let⠀a⠀letter⠀describe⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀particular⠀room⠀held⠀heat,⠀the⠀exact⠀shade⠀of⠀a⠀robe⠀bought⠀years⠀ago,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀hairpin⠀in⠀a⠀box⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀opened⠀in⠀public.⠀A⠀journal⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀scent⠀associated⠀with⠀a⠀street⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀exists.⠀But⠀this⠀richness⠀follows⠀the⠀writer's⠀chosen⠀record,⠀not⠀an⠀omniscient⠀witness.⠀An⠀angry⠀letter⠀may⠀become⠀decorous⠀because⠀a⠀scribe⠀or⠀household⠀elder⠀will⠀read⠀it;⠀a⠀private⠀memorandum⠀may⠀contain⠀only⠀figures⠀and⠀a⠀single⠀bitter⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀margin.\n\nLet⠀gaps⠀and⠀material⠀traces⠀advance⠀the⠀story.⠀One⠀letter⠀may⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀nobody⠀asked⠀in⠀the⠀surviving⠀text.⠀A⠀torn⠀page⠀may⠀begin⠀an⠀account⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀another⠀writer's⠀agitation.⠀A⠀receipt⠀can⠀fix⠀a⠀date⠀that⠀contradicts⠀a⠀later⠀memory.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀every⠀gap⠀immediately;⠀let⠀the⠀next⠀document⠀reveal⠀the⠀inconsistency⠀through⠀its⠀own⠀conventions.⠀The⠀selected⠀narrator⠀or⠀current⠀authorship⠀contract⠀still⠀controls⠀how⠀much⠀the⠀reader⠀may⠀infer,⠀but⠀the⠀document⠀itself⠀provides⠀the⠀evidence.\n\nGround⠀the⠀decision⠀to⠀write⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions.⠀There⠀is⠀a⠀reason⠀this⠀letter⠀exists:⠀a⠀business⠀route,⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀legal⠀dispute,⠀a⠀school⠀exercise,⠀an⠀official⠀report.⠀The⠀same⠀period⠀limit⠀defines⠀what⠀a⠀given⠀writer⠀can⠀say⠀without⠀risk:⠀a⠀debtor⠀may⠀record⠀only⠀names⠀and⠀sums;⠀a⠀wife⠀may⠀frame⠀a⠀complaint⠀as⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀household⠀goods.⠀Let⠀that⠀constraint⠀create⠀the⠀emotional⠀pressure,⠀not⠀a⠀generic⠀confession.\n\nWrite⠀documents⠀in⠀the⠀language⠀their⠀writer⠀would⠀plausibly⠀use.⠀A⠀formal⠀petition⠀may⠀employ⠀set⠀phrases⠀and⠀deferential⠀formulas;⠀a⠀private⠀note⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀younger⠀sister⠀may⠀be⠀plainer,⠀even⠀sharp.⠀Preserve⠀readability⠀and⠀continuity.⠀Do⠀not⠀interleave⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀each⠀document;⠀let⠀the⠀documents⠀speak⠀in⠀sequence,⠀with⠀their⠀authors,⠀recipients,⠀and⠀dates⠀clear⠀from⠀their⠀headings⠀or⠀address⠀lines.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nKeep⠀comfort⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀period,⠀place,⠀and⠀social⠀position.⠀Choose⠀concrete⠀acts⠀of⠀care⠀that⠀these⠀characters⠀could⠀actually⠀perform:⠀heating⠀water⠀over⠀a⠀brazier,⠀sharing⠀a⠀clean⠀rice⠀bowl,⠀mending⠀a⠀torn⠀seam,⠀walking⠀a⠀child⠀to⠀a⠀temple⠀gate,⠀buying⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀fruit⠀out⠀of⠀season⠀because⠀someone⠀has⠀not⠀tasted⠀it⠀in⠀years.⠀Let⠀the⠀setting's⠀institutions⠀supply⠀their⠀own⠀small⠀pleasures—permission⠀to⠀sit⠀inside⠀a⠀tea⠀stall,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀remembered⠀remedy,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀arrives⠀with⠀good⠀news⠀about⠀a⠀cousin's⠀debt.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensuous⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀warmth⠀feel⠀real:⠀the⠀exact⠀smoothness⠀of⠀a⠀washed⠀floor,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀blanket,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀jasmine⠀or⠀sesame⠀oil,⠀the⠀bright⠀or⠀muted⠀colors⠀of⠀a⠀shared⠀meal.⠀These⠀details⠀should⠀intensify⠀care⠀rather⠀than⠀serve⠀as⠀luxury⠀inventory.⠀A⠀present⠀of⠀expensive⠀rouge⠀may⠀be⠀kind⠀or⠀may⠀expose⠀the⠀giver's⠀misunderstood⠀position;⠀the⠀scene⠀can⠀enjoy⠀the⠀moment⠀while⠀preserving⠀that⠀possibility.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀confessions⠀or⠀remove⠀disagreement,⠀privacy,⠀or⠀established⠀problems.⠀Comfort⠀can⠀be⠀wordless—holding⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀leaving⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀rice⠀cake,⠀arranging⠀a⠀room⠀warmer⠀without⠀asking—and⠀it⠀need⠀not⠀turn⠀into⠀a⠀declaration.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀accept⠀care,⠀decline⠀it,⠀or⠀take⠀it⠀while⠀still⠀angry⠀about⠀something⠀else.⠀The⠀style⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀healing⠀arc;⠀no⠀relationship⠀must⠀reach⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀fixed⠀state.\n\nLet⠀charm⠀and⠀humor⠀appear⠀where⠀they⠀fit⠀the⠀characters,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀required⠀beat.⠀Affection⠀can⠀show⠀through⠀repetitive,⠀gentle⠀interactions:⠀one⠀person⠀always⠀leaves⠀the⠀last⠀piece⠀for⠀the⠀other,⠀another⠀checks⠀a⠀loose⠀roof⠀tile⠀after⠀a⠀storm,⠀another⠀shares⠀a⠀small⠀superstition⠀about⠀the⠀first⠀ripe⠀plum.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀everyone⠀universally⠀sweet.⠀A⠀practical⠀scold⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀comforting⠀without⠀becoming⠀soft-spoken.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀world's⠀difficulties⠀alive.⠀A⠀warm⠀room⠀in⠀winter⠀still⠀depends⠀on⠀fuel⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀bought⠀or⠀gathered.⠀A⠀good⠀meal⠀still⠀implies⠀someone's⠀labor.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀includes⠀a⠀current⠀hardship,⠀the⠀comfort⠀should⠀acknowledge⠀it⠀rather⠀than⠀pretend⠀it⠀has⠀already⠀passed.⠀End⠀the⠀interval⠀when⠀the⠀particular⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀has⠀happened⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀reception⠀is⠀shown;⠀the⠀scene⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀tidy⠀summary⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀about⠀the⠀future.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀deliberate,⠀composed⠀narration⠀that⠀can⠀move⠀through⠀long⠀paragraphs⠀without⠀losing⠀the⠀scene's⠀physical⠀precision.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀place⠀an⠀intimate⠀moment⠀within⠀its⠀historical⠀frame:⠀who⠀owns⠀the⠀house,⠀what⠀marriage⠀or⠀debt⠀shapes⠀the⠀visit,⠀which⠀family⠀obligation⠀delays⠀the⠀question,⠀what⠀rumor⠀the⠀servants⠀already⠀know.⠀Social⠀context⠀is⠀not⠀background⠀scenery;⠀it⠀is⠀the⠀arrangement⠀through⠀which⠀a⠀glance,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀gift⠀becomes⠀significant.\n\nUse⠀transitions⠀that⠀carry⠀time⠀and⠀consequence:⠀a⠀storm⠀passes⠀while⠀the⠀family⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀messenger;⠀a⠀name⠀changes⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀book;⠀a⠀closed⠀garden⠀is⠀opened⠀years⠀later⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀reason.⠀These⠀transitions⠀may⠀summarize⠀an⠀institution's⠀operation⠀without⠀reducing⠀the⠀characters⠀to⠀illustrations.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀understand⠀why⠀the⠀period's⠀procedures⠀matter⠀to⠀these⠀particular⠀people.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀lushness⠀serve⠀interpretation.⠀When⠀a⠀narrator⠀describes⠀silk,⠀candlelight,⠀painted⠀screens,⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀street,⠀the⠀detail⠀should⠀do⠀more⠀than⠀please⠀the⠀eye:⠀it⠀should⠀reveal⠀class,⠀memory,⠀desire,⠀or⠀exclusion.⠀A⠀room⠀can⠀be⠀beautiful⠀precisely⠀because⠀one⠀character⠀is⠀invited⠀and⠀another⠀is⠀not.⠀A⠀dish⠀can⠀recall⠀a⠀dead⠀parent⠀whose⠀recipe⠀was⠀never⠀written⠀down.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀precise⠀and⠀individually⠀voiced⠀rather⠀than⠀uniformly⠀ornate;⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀formal⠀in⠀architecture,⠀not⠀in⠀every⠀sentence's⠀vocabulary.\n\nUse⠀the⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀for⠀judgment⠀where⠀the⠀selected⠀point⠀of⠀view⠀permits⠀it.⠀The⠀narrative⠀may⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀public⠀ceremony⠀proceeded⠀with⠀perfect⠀courtesy⠀while⠀the⠀real⠀argument⠀occurred⠀in⠀which⠀register⠀mattered,⠀who⠀could⠀be⠀seen,⠀and⠀who⠀was⠀remembered.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀narrator⠀knowledge⠀the⠀character⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀in⠀a⠀limited⠀perspective.⠀If⠀the⠀active⠀view⠀is⠀close⠀third⠀or⠀first⠀person,⠀shape⠀the⠀historical⠀frame⠀through⠀that⠀person's⠀awareness⠀instead⠀of⠀an⠀omniscient⠀commentary.\n\nDo⠀not⠀dissolve⠀genre⠀into⠀a⠀domestic⠀tableau.⠀Historical⠀events,⠀work,⠀and⠀belief⠀should⠀affect⠀the⠀romantic⠀or⠀familial⠀situation.⠀A⠀festival,⠀a⠀tax,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀law,⠀a⠀rumor⠀about⠀a⠀distant⠀war,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀shop⠀opening⠀can⠀alter⠀the⠀characters'⠀choices⠀without⠀becoming⠀the⠀center⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀At⠀the⠀same⠀time,⠀the⠀formal⠀novel⠀can⠀remain⠀intimate;⠀the⠀broad⠀historical⠀frame⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀excuse⠀to⠀abandon⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀private⠀strangeness.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nOpen⠀inside⠀a⠀particular⠀room,⠀garden,⠀courtyard,⠀workshop,⠀or⠀route⠀where⠀one⠀character⠀has⠀agreed⠀to⠀tell⠀something⠀and⠀another⠀wants⠀a⠀particular⠀response.⠀Give⠀the⠀occasion⠀a⠀practical⠀motive:⠀a⠀sale,⠀a⠀betrothal⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀debt,⠀an⠀inheritance⠀dispute,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀work,⠀or⠀a⠀servant⠀retained⠀across⠀changing⠀fortunes.⠀Establish⠀early,⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms,⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀can⠀grant⠀or⠀refuse—who⠀may⠀live⠀in⠀the⠀house,⠀keep⠀the⠀child,⠀receive⠀the⠀money,⠀touch⠀the⠀cloth,⠀take⠀the⠀credit,⠀or⠀sign⠀the⠀permit—so⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀a⠀visible⠀stake.\n\nThe⠀teller⠀selects⠀what⠀the⠀listener⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀see.⠀Write⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀as⠀a⠀deliberate⠀intervention⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀dispute,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀neutral⠀recollection.⠀A⠀remembered⠀singer,⠀garment,⠀house,⠀or⠀discarded⠀suitor⠀should⠀be⠀rendered⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision—its⠀making,⠀wear,⠀scent,⠀weight,⠀the⠀gesture⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀accompany⠀it—and⠀organized⠀around⠀a⠀loss,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀that⠀bears⠀on⠀the⠀present⠀request.⠀Let⠀the⠀teller's⠀selection⠀reveal⠀a⠀strategy:⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀may⠀soften⠀a⠀betrayal,⠀magnify⠀a⠀sacrifice,⠀omit⠀a⠀witness,⠀or⠀place⠀a⠀rival⠀in⠀a⠀worse⠀light.⠀The⠀listener⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀notice⠀the⠀strategy⠀without⠀the⠀narration⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀delay⠀the⠀moment⠀of⠀decision⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀listener⠀reconsider⠀the⠀people⠀involved.⠀The⠀delay⠀works⠀if⠀every⠀interruption⠀and⠀resumed⠀night⠀alters⠀the⠀listener's⠀practical⠀reading⠀of⠀the⠀outer⠀problem,⠀not⠀if⠀it⠀merely⠀postpones⠀an⠀answer.⠀When⠀someone⠀from⠀the⠀audience⠀interrupts,⠀ask⠀what⠀the⠀interruption⠀serves⠀or⠀protects:⠀it⠀may⠀correct⠀a⠀detail,⠀defend⠀a⠀reputation,⠀or⠀warn⠀the⠀listener⠀against⠀being⠀moved.\n\nUse⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀motif⠀cleanly:⠀the⠀same⠀flower,⠀type⠀of⠀fabric,⠀song⠀title,⠀coins,⠀stair,⠀or⠀scar⠀can⠀appear⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀and⠀inside⠀the⠀told⠀past.⠀Make⠀the⠀motif's⠀meaning⠀shift⠀through⠀the⠀retellings,⠀so⠀that⠀an⠀object⠀first⠀presented⠀as⠀proof⠀of⠀love⠀becomes⠀evidence⠀of⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀token⠀of⠀mourning⠀becomes⠀a⠀claim⠀of⠀ownership.⠀Keep⠀actual⠀historical⠀knowledge⠀before⠀each⠀repetition;⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀did⠀not⠀know⠀then⠀cannot⠀justify⠀a⠀later⠀claim,⠀though⠀present⠀understanding⠀may⠀color⠀the⠀telling.⠀Distinguish⠀the⠀teller's⠀later⠀knowledge⠀from⠀the⠀knowledge⠀of⠀the⠀people⠀inside⠀the⠀tale:⠀a⠀participant⠀can⠀act⠀on⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀while⠀the⠀teller,⠀years⠀later,⠀knows⠀what⠀it⠀cost.\n\nClose⠀the⠀frame⠀on⠀the⠀occasion's⠀real⠀outcome,⠀not⠀on⠀a⠀false⠀reconciliation.⠀The⠀listener⠀can⠀refuse,⠀offer⠀a⠀smaller⠀payment,⠀ask⠀one⠀direct⠀question,⠀or⠀notice⠀that⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀become⠀a⠀bid.⠀Let⠀the⠀embedded⠀story's⠀beauty⠀remain⠀ambiguous:⠀alluring⠀to⠀the⠀listener⠀without⠀certifying⠀the⠀teller's⠀honesty.⠀Write⠀no⠀court,⠀no⠀djinn,⠀no⠀magic⠀bargain,⠀and⠀no⠀compulsory⠀cliffhanger⠀at⠀every⠀break;⠀the⠀suspense⠀is⠀human⠀and⠀specific.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀a⠀social-realist⠀mode⠀sharpened⠀by⠀documentary⠀memory.⠀Start⠀with⠀a⠀specific⠀workplace,⠀tenancy,⠀guild⠀position,⠀migration,⠀court⠀case,⠀or⠀household⠀economy.⠀Give⠀the⠀scene⠀its⠀material⠀limits⠀precisely:⠀what⠀is⠀stored⠀in⠀the⠀chest,⠀who⠀holds⠀the⠀key,⠀how⠀long⠀the⠀journey⠀takes,⠀what⠀the⠀official⠀will⠀accept⠀as⠀proof,⠀which⠀ingredients⠀can⠀be⠀bought⠀in⠀that⠀season.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀archaic⠀English⠀to⠀signal⠀the⠀past;⠀keep⠀syntax⠀plain⠀and⠀exact⠀while⠀the⠀sensuous⠀detail⠀comes⠀from⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀register.\n\nUse⠀short,⠀factual⠀paragraphs⠀that⠀move⠀between⠀observable⠀action⠀and⠀restrained⠀inference.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀know⠀one⠀character's⠀private⠀responses⠀well—an⠀anticipated⠀touch,⠀a⠀remembered⠀room,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀cloth⠀or⠀street—but⠀must⠀not⠀leap⠀into⠀excluded⠀minds.⠀Present⠀beauty⠀as⠀dependent⠀on⠀a⠀transaction⠀or⠀a⠀claim:⠀the⠀glass,⠀the⠀coat,⠀the⠀ribbon,⠀the⠀pastry,⠀the⠀little⠀garden⠀exact⠀a⠀price⠀or⠀belong⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Let⠀jealousy⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀practical⠀choice,⠀such⠀as⠀who⠀is⠀invited⠀to⠀eat,⠀which⠀letter⠀is⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀whose⠀name⠀goes⠀on⠀the⠀lease.\n\nInclude⠀one⠀concrete⠀historical⠀trace⠀early—an⠀announcement,⠀a⠀municipal⠀register,⠀an⠀old⠀letter,⠀a⠀ration⠀card,⠀a⠀repair⠀account,⠀a⠀railway⠀timetable—and⠀compare⠀it⠀later⠀with⠀a⠀memory.⠀The⠀comparison⠀should⠀show⠀a⠀gap:⠀someone⠀remembered⠀a⠀longer⠀childhood⠀room,⠀a⠀promised⠀inheritance⠀never⠀recorded,⠀a⠀marriage⠀date⠀that⠀contradicts⠀the⠀child's⠀age,⠀a⠀debt⠀acknowledged⠀only⠀orally.⠀Make⠀the⠀gap⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀by⠀connecting⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀decision⠀or⠀claim,⠀not⠀by⠀turning⠀every⠀document⠀into⠀a⠀reveal.⠀The⠀trace⠀and⠀the⠀memory⠀should⠀each⠀carry⠀their⠀own⠀authority:⠀the⠀document⠀records⠀what⠀was⠀accepted,⠀while⠀the⠀memory⠀records⠀what⠀was⠀lived,⠀and⠀neither⠀is⠀automatically⠀more⠀true.\n\nResist⠀explanatory⠀commentary⠀until⠀the⠀characters⠀have⠀acted.⠀A⠀short,⠀direct⠀sentence⠀like⠀'She⠀had⠀learned⠀to⠀keep⠀the⠀good⠀cup⠀behind⠀the⠀flour'⠀can⠀do⠀the⠀social⠀work⠀of⠀a⠀whole⠀paragraph.⠀Use⠀recurring⠀objects⠀to⠀anchor⠀time—the⠀same⠀folded⠀newspapers,⠀a⠀mended⠀sleeve,⠀the⠀bench⠀where⠀they⠀met—and⠀let⠀their⠀condition⠀change.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀thematic⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nTreat⠀the⠀historical⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀collision⠀between⠀a⠀surviving⠀old⠀structure⠀and⠀immediate⠀modern⠀life:⠀a⠀former⠀customs⠀house⠀now⠀used⠀for⠀a⠀lease⠀dispute,⠀a⠀family⠀workshop⠀beside⠀a⠀new⠀boulevard,⠀an⠀antiquated⠀legal⠀guardianship⠀still⠀enforced⠀over⠀an⠀adult⠀heir,⠀a⠀fashionable⠀apartment⠀built⠀inside⠀a⠀bankrupt⠀monastery.⠀Keep⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀concrete—a⠀deed,⠀a⠀badge,⠀a⠀committee,⠀a⠀uniform,⠀a⠀listed⠀staircase,⠀a⠀privilege⠀of⠀access—and⠀show⠀its⠀pressure⠀through⠀arrangements⠀rather⠀than⠀speeches:⠀who⠀has⠀the⠀second⠀key,⠀why⠀the⠀lift⠀stops⠀at⠀floor⠀five,⠀what⠀the⠀porter⠀knows,⠀which⠀papers⠀require⠀a⠀seal.⠀The⠀horror⠀is⠀personal⠀and⠀political,⠀not⠀supernatural.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀descriptive⠀precision⠀on⠀modern⠀decay⠀rather⠀than⠀picturesque⠀ruin:⠀water⠀stains⠀over⠀a⠀new⠀coat⠀of⠀paint,⠀a⠀cable⠀drilled⠀through⠀carved⠀wood,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀machine⠀oil⠀and⠀stale⠀perfume⠀in⠀a⠀shared⠀lift.⠀Make⠀glamour⠀costly⠀and⠀temporary.⠀A⠀character⠀can⠀own⠀one⠀exquisite⠀thing—a⠀lacquered⠀box,⠀a⠀pair⠀of⠀shoes,⠀a⠀silk⠀scarf,⠀a⠀photograph⠀of⠀a⠀lost⠀lover—and⠀pay⠀for⠀it⠀through⠀an⠀old⠀family⠀debt,⠀a⠀punishing⠀job,⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀still⠀controls⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀estate.⠀Let⠀the⠀object's⠀beauty⠀sharpen⠀the⠀discomfort⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀that⠀secures⠀it.\n\nLet⠀intimacy⠀develop⠀in⠀trusted⠀company,⠀not⠀universal⠀flirtation.⠀Social⠀masks⠀can⠀fall⠀in⠀a⠀stairwell,⠀a⠀closed⠀changing⠀room,⠀a⠀late⠀tram,⠀a⠀kitchen⠀after⠀hours.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀reveals⠀a⠀private⠀desire,⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀show⠀what⠀that⠀revelation⠀costs⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀risks,⠀but⠀also⠀what⠀it⠀gains:⠀a⠀genuine⠀alliance,⠀a⠀shared⠀meal,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀rest,⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀information⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀character's⠀options.⠀Avoid⠀making⠀every⠀intimate⠀opening⠀a⠀trap;⠀allow⠀relief⠀and⠀cooperation⠀without⠀denying⠀the⠀surrounding⠀menace.\n\nKeep⠀urban⠀material⠀detail⠀operational:⠀a⠀locked⠀gate,⠀a⠀name⠀on⠀a⠀brass⠀plate,⠀or⠀an⠀unrecorded⠀promise⠀can⠀exert⠀pressure⠀more⠀effectively⠀than⠀a⠀villain's⠀speech.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀Kindred⠀physiology,⠀factions,⠀powers,⠀or⠀blood⠀rules.⠀Close⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀supported⠀private⠀experience—dread,⠀longing,⠀relief,⠀suspicion,⠀or⠀resolve—that⠀leaves⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀a⠀testimonial⠀or⠀autobiographical⠀account⠀anchored⠀in⠀a⠀definite⠀time,⠀place,⠀occupation,⠀and⠀community.⠀The⠀narrator⠀tells⠀what⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀saw,⠀did,⠀and⠀wanted,⠀and⠀distinguishes⠀direct⠀experience⠀from⠀hearsay:⠀'I⠀was⠀in⠀the⠀kitchen⠀when⠀my⠀uncle⠀said⠀it,'⠀not⠀'Everyone⠀knew.'⠀Let⠀this⠀distinction⠀govern⠀the⠀whole⠀account.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀reports⠀an⠀event⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀did⠀not⠀witness,⠀mark⠀it⠀as⠀report⠀or⠀speculation,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀authority⠀rest⠀on⠀the⠀scenes⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀actually⠀inhabited.\n\nUse⠀social/domestic⠀realism⠀to⠀make⠀inherited⠀arrangements⠀concrete:⠀who⠀sleeps⠀where,⠀whose⠀earnings⠀support⠀the⠀house,⠀which⠀aunt⠀decides⠀a⠀match,⠀why⠀an⠀older⠀brother's⠀migration⠀changes⠀the⠀cooking,⠀what⠀the⠀season's⠀festival⠀costs.⠀Preserve⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensuous⠀precision⠀through⠀small⠀remembered⠀objects⠀and⠀rooms—the⠀smell⠀of⠀mustard⠀oil⠀and⠀soap,⠀a⠀red⠀border⠀on⠀a⠀sari,⠀the⠀cool⠀floor⠀under⠀the⠀cot,⠀a⠀tin⠀of⠀sweets⠀kept⠀for⠀a⠀visitor⠀who⠀never⠀came.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀be⠀perishable⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀someone's⠀claim⠀or⠀loss,⠀so⠀that⠀each⠀remembered⠀object⠀carries⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀that⠀secured⠀it.\n\nIntroduce⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀material⠀anchors⠀that⠀recur⠀with⠀changing⠀meaning:⠀recurring⠀bus⠀fares,⠀a⠀pawned⠀earring,⠀a⠀courtyard⠀tap,⠀the⠀same⠀song⠀on⠀the⠀radio,⠀a⠀letter⠀from⠀a⠀distant⠀city,⠀a⠀saree⠀folded⠀for⠀a⠀wedding⠀that⠀is⠀postponed.⠀Use⠀them⠀to⠀mark⠀time⠀and⠀emotion,⠀not⠀as⠀symbols⠀to⠀decode.⠀If⠀the⠀narrator⠀recalls⠀a⠀person,⠀show⠀the⠀wound⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀choice:⠀what⠀was⠀said⠀at⠀the⠀train⠀station,⠀which⠀dish⠀was⠀prepared⠀when⠀the⠀guest⠀arrived,⠀who⠀paid⠀for⠀the⠀medicine.\n\nLet⠀public⠀events⠀enter⠀through⠀daily⠀life,⠀not⠀through⠀explanatory⠀paragraphs.⠀A⠀curfew,⠀election,⠀ration⠀line,⠀strike,⠀or⠀school⠀closure⠀may⠀affect⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀an⠀altered⠀meal,⠀a⠀locked⠀street,⠀or⠀a⠀delayed⠀wage.⠀Keep⠀language⠀plain⠀and⠀contemporary;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀Hindi⠀words⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀specifies⠀them,⠀and⠀never⠀award⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure⠀or⠀caste⠀experience⠀not⠀given⠀by⠀the⠀setting.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀narrator's⠀understanding⠀remains⠀partial⠀or⠀painful,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀moral⠀or⠀reconciliation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀diary⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀form.⠀Write⠀short⠀dated⠀or⠀undated⠀entries,⠀each⠀moving⠀from⠀a⠀particular⠀observation⠀to⠀the⠀narrator's⠀private⠀feeling.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀appear⠀through⠀daily⠀items:⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀charcoal,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀the⠀morning⠀horn,⠀a⠀ration⠀seal⠀on⠀the⠀rice⠀paper,⠀the⠀length⠀of⠀the⠀tram⠀queue,⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀radio,⠀a⠀single⠀imported⠀pencil⠀kept⠀for⠀letters.⠀The⠀entries⠀need⠀not⠀form⠀a⠀smooth⠀causal⠀plot;⠀their⠀connection⠀can⠀be⠀a⠀season,⠀a⠀person,⠀a⠀route,⠀or⠀a⠀growing⠀fear.\n\nKeep⠀emotional⠀disclosure⠀oblique⠀but⠀real.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀beauty⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀belongs⠀in⠀things⠀the⠀narrator⠀cannot⠀hold:⠀a⠀split⠀persimmon⠀shared⠀with⠀a⠀lover,⠀a⠀cracked⠀mirror⠀repaired⠀with⠀tape,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀camphor⠀in⠀a⠀stored⠀kimono,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀gate's⠀shadow⠀crosses⠀the⠀threshold⠀earlier⠀each⠀autumn.⠀Let⠀erotic⠀and⠀jealous⠀feelings⠀surface⠀through⠀remembered⠀gestures⠀rather⠀than⠀announced⠀analysis:⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down⠀with⠀two⠀hands,⠀the⠀order⠀in⠀which⠀shoes⠀are⠀removed,⠀a⠀letter⠀folded⠀differently.⠀Each⠀observation⠀should⠀be⠀particular⠀enough⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling⠀without⠀the⠀narrator⠀explaining⠀it.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀as⠀a⠀narrative⠀resource.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀not⠀record⠀the⠀worst⠀day;⠀later⠀entries⠀can⠀reveal⠀its⠀effects⠀through⠀a⠀changed⠀habit,⠀a⠀newly⠀avoided⠀room,⠀a⠀meal⠀no⠀longer⠀prepared,⠀or⠀an⠀object⠀moved⠀out⠀of⠀sight.⠀Allow⠀sensory⠀notes⠀and⠀concrete⠀remarks⠀to⠀suggest⠀more⠀than⠀they⠀say.⠀An⠀entry⠀such⠀as⠀'He⠀did⠀not⠀come⠀after⠀the⠀rain'⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀loss⠀without⠀commentary.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀quietness⠀or⠀decorative⠀seasonal⠀inventory;⠀choose⠀the⠀relevant⠀weather,⠀tree,⠀or⠀sound⠀because⠀it⠀affects⠀attention,⠀not⠀because⠀it⠀is⠀Japanese⠀scenery.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀within⠀the⠀contract:⠀first-person⠀diary⠀entries⠀must⠀be⠀plausibly⠀written⠀by⠀that⠀character⠀at⠀that⠀time,⠀with⠀his⠀or⠀her⠀knowledge⠀gaps.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀notebook⠀into⠀universal⠀omniscience.⠀End⠀an⠀entry⠀where⠀reflection⠀stops⠀naturally,⠀even⠀in⠀mid-thought,⠀rather⠀than⠀closing⠀with⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nCompose⠀the⠀story⠀as⠀polyphonic,⠀nonlinear⠀testimony⠀around⠀one⠀event,⠀object,⠀place,⠀or⠀relationship.⠀Each⠀section⠀is⠀attributed⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀participant⠀with⠀a⠀distinct⠀vantage:⠀the⠀dressmaker,⠀the⠀cousin⠀who⠀returned,⠀the⠀woman⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀ledger,⠀the⠀boy⠀who⠀ran⠀errands,⠀the⠀friend⠀who⠀was⠀never⠀asked⠀to⠀dance.⠀Dates,⠀headings,⠀or⠀brief⠀attributions⠀must⠀clarify⠀the⠀source⠀without⠀harmonizing⠀the⠀accounts.\n\nLet⠀each⠀participant⠀know⠀something⠀the⠀others⠀do⠀not.⠀A⠀version⠀can⠀be⠀partial,⠀self-justifying,⠀loving,⠀or⠀mistaken⠀without⠀being⠀false.⠀Write⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail⠀through⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀precise⠀register:⠀the⠀red⠀of⠀a⠀spoiled⠀fruit⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀the⠀same⠀gloves⠀worn⠀by⠀two⠀lovers,⠀a⠀mirror⠀that⠀reflected⠀a⠀doorway⠀no⠀one⠀else⠀entered.⠀Make⠀beauty⠀contingent—the⠀dress⠀was⠀borrowed,⠀the⠀ring⠀pawned,⠀the⠀photograph⠀cut⠀with⠀a⠀blade—so⠀that⠀each⠀account⠀reveals⠀a⠀cost⠀specific⠀to⠀that⠀teller's⠀position⠀and⠀attachment.\n\nUse⠀nonlinear⠀order⠀deliberately.⠀A⠀later⠀testimony⠀can⠀precede⠀the⠀scene⠀it⠀interprets,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀a⠀silence⠀or⠀a⠀smile⠀when⠀the⠀earlier⠀account⠀finally⠀appears.⠀Make⠀repetition⠀meaningful:⠀a⠀phrase,⠀place,⠀date,⠀or⠀object⠀can⠀recur,⠀but⠀its⠀meaning⠀shifts⠀with⠀each⠀teller.⠀The⠀narration⠀itself⠀should⠀not⠀privilege⠀one⠀speaker⠀with⠀ultimate⠀truth;⠀let⠀the⠀conflict⠀of⠀detail⠀remain⠀significant⠀for⠀the⠀present,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀holds⠀two⠀or⠀more⠀irreconcilable⠀remembered⠀images⠀at⠀once.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀historical⠀setting⠀exact:⠀transport,⠀food,⠀work,⠀land,⠀legal⠀status,⠀local⠀politics.⠀Use⠀the⠀particular⠀names,⠀neighborhoods,⠀and⠀goods⠀the⠀world⠀supplies.⠀Avoid⠀magical⠀realism⠀or⠀imported⠀supernatural⠀events⠀here,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀treat⠀regional⠀history⠀as⠀exotic⠀scenery.⠀End⠀by⠀moving⠀from⠀one⠀voice's⠀last⠀reflection⠀to⠀a⠀concrete⠀detail⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀frame⠀that⠀leaves⠀the⠀reader⠀holding⠀two⠀irreconcilable⠀remembered⠀images.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀specific⠀historical⠀problem:⠀a⠀character⠀enters⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀contract⠀must⠀be⠀signed,⠀a⠀boat⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀leave,⠀a⠀debt⠀is⠀due,⠀or⠀a⠀locked⠀garden⠀holds⠀the⠀last⠀chance⠀for⠀work.⠀Use⠀clear⠀spatial⠀staging.⠀Each⠀paragraph⠀should⠀track⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀stands,⠀what⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀touches,⠀and⠀who⠀else⠀occupies⠀the⠀scene.⠀Short⠀sentences⠀help;⠀vivid⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀details⠀keep⠀the⠀world⠀concrete⠀and⠀strange.\n\nGive⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀physical⠀focal⠀points⠀per⠀scene:⠀a⠀fox-fur⠀collar⠀on⠀a⠀pawned⠀coat,⠀a⠀glass⠀sweet⠀in⠀a⠀dead⠀woman's⠀cabinet,⠀a⠀calendar⠀with⠀the⠀wrong⠀year,⠀a⠀bruise⠀shaped⠀like⠀a⠀thumb.⠀Let⠀these⠀objects⠀connect⠀to⠀the⠀current⠀desire⠀or⠀fear,⠀and⠀let⠀their⠀beauty⠀or⠀strangeness⠀carry⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀relationship⠀that⠀produced⠀them.⠀After⠀each⠀action⠀or⠀exchange,⠀include⠀a⠀focused⠀private⠀reaction⠀from⠀the⠀protagonist—shame,⠀longing,⠀suspicion,⠀relief,⠀anger—but⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀narration⠀explain⠀the⠀emotion.⠀Use⠀a⠀small⠀bodily⠀detail:⠀a⠀tightened⠀jaw,⠀a⠀damp⠀palm,⠀a⠀half-step⠀backward.\n\nUse⠀dialogue⠀to⠀advance⠀information⠀and⠀show⠀hierarchy⠀cleanly.⠀Invite⠀the⠀reader⠀into⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀a⠀lot⠀of⠀prehistory;⠀historical⠀context⠀should⠀emerge⠀through⠀talk⠀and⠀objects,⠀not⠀flashback⠀exposition.⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀reaction⠀beats⠀so⠀the⠀page⠀remains⠀easy⠀to⠀scan.⠀If⠀a⠀name⠀or⠀title⠀is⠀unfamiliar,⠀provide⠀one⠀concise⠀clarification,⠀such⠀as⠀what⠀a⠀particular⠀official⠀does⠀or⠀why⠀a⠀certain⠀permit⠀can⠀only⠀be⠀issued⠀that⠀morning.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀fictional⠀outcome⠀open.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀promise,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀a⠀discovery,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀deciding⠀what⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀will⠀do⠀tomorrow;⠀no⠀mandatory⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀comic⠀beat⠀applies.⠀First⠀person,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀school-like⠀settings⠀are⠀not⠀required.⠀Write⠀an⠀adult⠀or⠀mixed-age⠀cast⠀in⠀the⠀historical⠀location⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀actually⠀specified.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nAnchor⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀period-specific⠀sensorium.⠀Choose⠀objects⠀and⠀gestures⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀could⠀actually⠀touch,⠀obtain,⠀or⠀observe⠀in⠀that⠀time⠀and⠀place:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀ink⠀or⠀market⠀fruit,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀courtyard⠀holds⠀heat⠀after⠀a⠀visitor⠀leaves.⠀Let⠀one⠀concrete⠀thing⠀open⠀an⠀association,⠀a⠀fear,⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀attachment.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀become⠀a⠀general⠀wash⠀of⠀lanterns,⠀silks,⠀and⠀dust;⠀each⠀sensory⠀detail⠀should⠀carry⠀a⠀practical⠀or⠀relational⠀consequence.\n\nShape⠀attention⠀through⠀syntax⠀rather⠀than⠀adjective⠀accumulation.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀action⠀or⠀a⠀recognizably⠀named⠀thing,⠀then⠀let⠀repeated⠀sounds,⠀colors,⠀or⠀small⠀movements⠀develop⠀as⠀the⠀character's⠀mood⠀finds⠀its⠀image.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀extend⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀or⠀makes⠀an⠀absence⠀present.⠀Keep⠀every⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀that⠀character's⠀memory.⠀Interrupt⠀the⠀rhythm⠀with⠀a⠀plain⠀statement⠀when⠀the⠀contrast⠀will⠀sharpen⠀the⠀feeling.⠀The⠀period⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀belief,⠀work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀limits,⠀not⠀through⠀forced⠀archaism⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀speech.\n\nBind⠀desire⠀and⠀memory⠀to⠀the⠀particular⠀constraints⠀of⠀the⠀period.⠀A⠀secret⠀can⠀be⠀dangerous⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀may⠀see⠀or⠀report⠀it;⠀a⠀gift⠀can⠀be⠀costly⠀because⠀of⠀scarcity,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀jealous⠀household;⠀an⠀ordinary⠀room⠀can⠀become⠀an⠀intimate⠀landscape⠀because⠀someone⠀remembers⠀being⠀observed⠀or⠀ignored⠀there.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀sharpen⠀discomfort⠀instead⠀of⠀disguising⠀it.⠀A⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀may⠀make⠀an⠀unequal⠀attachment⠀more⠀legible,⠀not⠀more⠀romantic.⠀Keep⠀the⠀grammatical⠀access⠀of⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀or⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀need⠀remains⠀felt,⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀loss.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀small⠀irreversible⠀changes⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀period⠀produces:⠀a⠀street⠀renamed⠀or⠀later⠀emptied,⠀a⠀custom⠀now⠀shortened⠀by⠀law⠀or⠀travel,⠀a⠀skill⠀that⠀used⠀to⠀matter,⠀the⠀exact⠀smell⠀a⠀room⠀keeps⠀after⠀someone⠀goes⠀away.⠀Root⠀each⠀reflection⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀setting⠀makes⠀possible⠀to⠀know,⠀recall,⠀and⠀compare.⠀Select⠀remembered⠀occasions⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀sentimental⠀tour⠀but⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀a⠀now⠀unavailable⠀relation.⠀When⠀present⠀experience⠀and⠀memory⠀sit⠀side⠀by⠀side,⠀preserve⠀their⠀difference;⠀do⠀not⠀blur⠀them⠀into⠀one⠀general⠀mood.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀to⠀make⠀attachment⠀tangible⠀and⠀costly.⠀A⠀bowl,⠀a⠀gesture⠀of⠀service,⠀a⠀jealous⠀glance,⠀or⠀a⠀private⠀address⠀can⠀carry⠀unresolved⠀desire⠀and⠀inequality.⠀Let⠀the⠀character⠀reflect⠀directly⠀where⠀the⠀established⠀perspective⠀permits,⠀or⠀let⠀a⠀detail⠀carry⠀the⠀association⠀without⠀explanation.⠀A⠀beautiful⠀thing⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀charged⠀with⠀danger,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀someone⠀else's⠀claim.⠀Later⠀knowledge⠀may⠀enter⠀the⠀reflection⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀selected⠀narrator's⠀access⠀justifies⠀it;⠀an⠀in-scene⠀character⠀cannot⠀yet⠀know⠀what⠀belongs⠀to⠀another⠀time.\n\nKeep⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀real.⠀A⠀warm⠀morning,⠀a⠀familiar⠀food,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀well,⠀or⠀an⠀unguarded⠀smile⠀may⠀stand⠀without⠀immediate⠀cancellation.⠀Change⠀does⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀paragraph⠀to⠀declare⠀impermanence.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀attention⠀still⠀on⠀the⠀living⠀thing,⠀even⠀while⠀its⠀historical⠀frame⠀makes⠀the⠀loss⠀perceptible.⠀Work,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀limits⠀should⠀enter⠀as⠀concrete⠀encounters,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀list⠀of⠀period⠀conditions.⠀Preserve⠀person,⠀ownership,⠀and⠀tense⠀consistently;⠀if⠀the⠀narrator⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀actor,⠀use⠀the⠀authorized⠀third-person⠀or⠀observed⠀reflection⠀rather⠀than⠀forcing⠀first-person⠀confession.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀framed⠀oral⠀recollection⠀as⠀the⠀governing⠀route:⠀a⠀teller⠀within⠀the⠀historical⠀scene⠀relates⠀an⠀experience⠀that⠀the⠀narration⠀shapes⠀for⠀a⠀listener,⠀a⠀later⠀visitor,⠀or⠀a⠀record.⠀Make⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀tale⠀distinct.⠀The⠀teller's⠀period⠀position⠀affects⠀vocabulary,⠀opportunity,⠀social⠀hesitation,⠀and⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀admitted,⠀but⠀the⠀historical⠀body⠀need⠀not⠀imitate⠀archaic⠀language.⠀Let⠀the⠀frame⠀interrupt⠀twice⠀or⠀more,⠀so⠀we⠀see⠀the⠀teller⠀choosing⠀what⠀to⠀repeat,⠀omit,⠀or⠀soften,⠀and⠀how⠀a⠀listener⠀receives⠀it.\n\nInside⠀the⠀told⠀material,⠀write⠀lyric⠀and⠀reflective⠀prose⠀with⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimate⠀strangeness.⠀Attend⠀to⠀a⠀remembered⠀place⠀through⠀exact⠀sensory⠀detail:⠀the⠀passage⠀of⠀light⠀across⠀a⠀wall,⠀the⠀particular⠀coldness⠀of⠀a⠀metal⠀bowl,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀garment,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀someone⠀waited.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀carry⠀relationship⠀cost.⠀Jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀may⠀surface⠀through⠀a⠀practiced⠀gesture,⠀a⠀gift⠀used⠀as⠀claim,⠀or⠀a⠀fragment⠀the⠀narrator⠀almost⠀says.⠀The⠀framing⠀teller⠀may⠀annotate⠀a⠀feeling⠀or⠀let⠀the⠀image⠀stand.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀tradition's⠀own⠀storytelling⠀habits⠀rather⠀than⠀mixing⠀every⠀epic⠀or⠀parable⠀convention.\n\nGround⠀the⠀history⠀in⠀particular⠀social⠀and⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Establish⠀what⠀people⠀could⠀know,⠀afford,⠀watch,⠀avoid,⠀and⠀foresee.⠀A⠀private⠀meeting⠀has⠀its⠀period-specific⠀risk;⠀an⠀errand,⠀courtyard⠀visit,⠀or⠀market⠀exchange⠀has⠀familiar⠀and⠀unfamiliar⠀rules.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀a⠀generic⠀gallery⠀of⠀honor-bound⠀types,⠀mystics,⠀or⠀exiles.⠀The⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀tale⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀unfinished⠀or⠀returned⠀to⠀the⠀listener,⠀as⠀long⠀as⠀the⠀unfinished⠀point⠀belongs⠀to⠀a⠀formed⠀story,⠀not⠀to⠀the⠀author's⠀uncertainty.⠀Maintain⠀the⠀active⠀narrator⠀and⠀viewpoint;⠀an⠀oral⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀third-person⠀if⠀the⠀teller⠀is⠀reporting⠀others,⠀but⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀authorized⠀emotion⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀the⠀included⠀moment⠀or⠀a⠀measured⠀interruption.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nChoose⠀two⠀or⠀three⠀exact⠀historical⠀details⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀scene.⠀State⠀them⠀plainly:⠀the⠀chipped⠀rim⠀of⠀a⠀cup,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀coat⠀hooks⠀at⠀the⠀collar,⠀a⠀name⠀written⠀in⠀the⠀margin⠀of⠀a⠀ledger.⠀Let⠀these⠀details⠀imply⠀the⠀period's⠀constraint⠀and⠀the⠀character's⠀attachment.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀second⠀atmospheric⠀layer⠀or⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀object⠀means⠀beyond⠀what⠀the⠀present⠀account⠀needs.⠀Keep⠀causality⠀inferable:⠀if⠀a⠀meeting⠀is⠀dangerous,⠀show⠀the⠀visible⠀practical⠀reason⠀in⠀the⠀setting;⠀if⠀a⠀gift⠀matters,⠀show⠀who⠀can⠀afford⠀it,⠀who⠀will⠀notice,⠀or⠀what⠀debt⠀it⠀creates.\n\nWrite⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀limited⠀reaction.⠀A⠀look⠀can⠀be⠀answered⠀with⠀speech⠀or⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀action.⠀Use⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀cost⠀through⠀material⠀and⠀social⠀consequence⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀ornamental⠀emotion.⠀Jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀may⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀delayed⠀question,⠀a⠀repeated⠀visit,⠀or⠀a⠀deliberate⠀withholding⠀of⠀touch.⠀Keep⠀inward⠀connection⠀economical⠀but⠀not⠀impossible.⠀When⠀an⠀essential⠀thought⠀is⠀needed,⠀let⠀it⠀run⠀to⠀the⠀length⠀that⠀makes⠀its⠀reasoning⠀clear;⠀skip⠀the⠀meditative⠀sentence⠀that⠀only⠀echoes⠀what⠀the⠀detail⠀already⠀showed.\n\nDo⠀not⠀turn⠀economical⠀prose⠀into⠀performed⠀fragments.⠀A⠀longer⠀precise⠀sentence⠀may⠀serve⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀abrupt⠀clauses.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀character's⠀time-bound⠀knowledge:⠀the⠀figure⠀cannot⠀mention⠀what⠀that⠀period⠀has⠀not⠀yet⠀made⠀known.⠀End⠀on⠀the⠀last⠀inference⠀or⠀action⠀that⠀matters,⠀even⠀if⠀the⠀desire⠀is⠀still⠀unspoken.⠀The⠀setting⠀should⠀remain⠀ordinary⠀and⠀specific.⠀No⠀universal⠀melancholy,⠀no⠀ornamental⠀epithet,⠀no⠀summary⠀that⠀tells⠀the⠀reader⠀how⠀to⠀feel.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nStart⠀in⠀the⠀immediate⠀historical⠀scene:⠀a⠀particular⠀room,⠀street,⠀transaction,⠀visit,⠀or⠀task.⠀Present⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue⠀with⠀enough⠀material⠀context⠀to⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀period⠀allows.⠀Then⠀move⠀naturally⠀to⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀or⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀attention⠀shifts.⠀A⠀character⠀noticing⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀key⠀or⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀closing⠀gate⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀former⠀occasion,⠀weigh⠀a⠀rival⠀claim,⠀and⠀then⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀Do⠀not⠀stop⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀an⠀explanatory⠀paragraph⠀about⠀the⠀era.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimacy⠀through⠀exactness.⠀The⠀surface⠀may⠀be⠀attractive,⠀but⠀let⠀it⠀disclose⠀cost⠀or⠀inequality.⠀Pay⠀attention⠀to⠀the⠀object⠀touched,⠀the⠀repeated⠀address,⠀the⠀unclaimed⠀food,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀waits.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀retain⠀an⠀individual⠀rhythm⠀without⠀universal⠀witty⠀repartee.⠀Interiority⠀should⠀match⠀perspective⠀and⠀knowledge:⠀a⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀think,⠀remember,⠀and⠀misunderstand,⠀but⠀another⠀person's⠀hidden⠀mind⠀is⠀unavailable⠀unless⠀the⠀selected⠀viewpoint⠀permits⠀it.⠀Modern⠀prose⠀does⠀not⠀mean⠀present-day⠀speech⠀or⠀contemporary⠀values;⠀the⠀characters'⠀expectations,⠀fears,⠀and⠀permissions⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀world.\n\nLet⠀transitions⠀orient⠀by⠀location⠀and⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀by⠀a⠀recap.⠀A⠀later⠀section⠀may⠀begin⠀with⠀a⠀changed⠀threshold,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed,⠀or⠀a⠀visitor⠀seen⠀from⠀across⠀a⠀room.⠀The⠀paragraph⠀can⠀move⠀between⠀outside⠀and⠀inside⠀without⠀announcing⠀the⠀switch.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀actual⠀duration⠀of⠀waiting,⠀travel,⠀and⠀silence.⠀Time⠀may⠀pass⠀while⠀little⠀visible⠀happens,⠀but⠀that⠀interval⠀remains⠀real.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀present⠀need⠀or⠀unfinished⠀attachment⠀is⠀vivid.⠀The⠀response⠀can⠀stop⠀during⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀character's⠀continuing⠀thought⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀completed⠀business.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nMake⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀premise⠀govern⠀scene⠀selection.⠀If⠀two⠀characters⠀are⠀betrothed,⠀former⠀lovers,⠀patron⠀and⠀protégé,⠀rivals⠀sharing⠀a⠀household,⠀or⠀another⠀established⠀relation,⠀let⠀that⠀particular⠀relation⠀shape⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀A⠀word⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀uses⠀only⠀with⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀recurring⠀practical⠀service,⠀a⠀place⠀they⠀both⠀remember⠀differently—these⠀give⠀the⠀pairing⠀continuity.⠀Do⠀not⠀pour⠀in⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀pining,⠀confession,⠀or⠀rivalry⠀unless⠀the⠀premise⠀and⠀current⠀scene⠀actually⠀make⠀them⠀arise.⠀One⠀call-back⠀should⠀open⠀a⠀new⠀consequence⠀or⠀change⠀an⠀existing⠀understanding⠀rather⠀than⠀merely⠀restate⠀an⠀earlier⠀feeling.\n\nGive⠀enough⠀space⠀for⠀the⠀emotion⠀at⠀issue.⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimacy⠀is⠀attractive⠀and⠀risky;⠀let⠀desire⠀surface⠀through⠀looks,⠀tasks,⠀social⠀obligations,⠀or⠀brief⠀shared⠀privacy.⠀Historical⠀constraints⠀make⠀the⠀risk⠀specific:⠀who⠀might⠀see⠀a⠀gesture,⠀which⠀rooms⠀are⠀available,⠀what⠀a⠀delayed⠀response⠀can⠀mean.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀knowledge⠀separate⠀from⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀inner⠀mind.⠀A⠀lover⠀may⠀interpret⠀or⠀misread.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀show⠀uncertainty⠀without⠀withholding⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀own⠀authorized⠀private⠀thought.⠀When⠀hidden⠀interiority⠀wrapping⠀is⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀active⠀contract,⠀place⠀actual⠀nonspoken⠀private⠀experience⠀there;⠀it⠀may⠀not⠀be⠀replaced⠀by⠀dialogue,⠀a⠀performed⠀aside,⠀or⠀an⠀in-world⠀document.\n\nPayoff⠀follows⠀the⠀relationship's⠀actual⠀logic,⠀not⠀a⠀mandatory⠀arc.⠀Affection⠀may⠀improve⠀a⠀scene,⠀discovery⠀may⠀hurt,⠀comfort⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀and⠀a⠀rivalry⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀confession.⠀A⠀relationship-centric⠀reply⠀may⠀end⠀inside⠀a⠀charged⠀moment⠀even⠀while⠀the⠀practical⠀or⠀emotional⠀question⠀remains⠀open.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀real⠀boundary⠀falls,⠀without⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀quota.⠀Let⠀period⠀institutions,⠀communication,⠀and⠀material⠀limits⠀remain⠀operative.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀chronicle⠀note⠀to⠀establish⠀that⠀this⠀is⠀being⠀retold.⠀Use⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀about⠀the⠀person,⠀place,⠀or⠀deed,⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particulars⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀reputation⠀incomplete.⠀A⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀the⠀actual⠀relation,⠀task,⠀or⠀remembered⠀event:⠀the⠀lamp⠀left⠀burning,⠀the⠀road⠀taken⠀past⠀the⠀watch,⠀the⠀gift⠀returned⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀way.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀later⠀when⠀a⠀new⠀occurrence⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀assign⠀ornamental⠀epithets⠀to⠀every⠀entrance.\n\nLet⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimacy⠀survive⠀the⠀public⠀tale.⠀The⠀thing⠀remembered⠀with⠀exactness—how⠀a⠀sleeve⠀was⠀folded,⠀the⠀temperature⠀of⠀tea⠀in⠀a⠀certain⠀room,⠀a⠀voice⠀heard⠀through⠀a⠀partition—carries⠀attachment⠀and⠀cost.⠀A⠀divided⠀love⠀or⠀a⠀jealous⠀obligation⠀may⠀appear⠀through⠀a⠀gesture⠀or⠀an⠀account⠀the⠀teller⠀cannot⠀settle.⠀The⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀known⠀for⠀a⠀deed,⠀but⠀being⠀remembered⠀as⠀faithful,⠀generous,⠀or⠀patient⠀need⠀not⠀mean⠀the⠀act⠀was⠀easy,⠀wanted,⠀or⠀without⠀consequence.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀selected⠀oral-chronicle⠀tradition⠀and⠀the⠀supplied⠀historical⠀setting;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀Nordic⠀pantheon⠀or⠀generic⠀heroic⠀doom.\n\nGround⠀the⠀account⠀in⠀period⠀knowledge⠀and⠀institutions.⠀The⠀teller⠀can⠀relate⠀what⠀was⠀seen,⠀heard,⠀reported,⠀or⠀afterward⠀understood,⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀silently⠀acquire⠀information⠀unavailable⠀to⠀that⠀position.⠀Let⠀dialogue⠀or⠀a⠀contradictory⠀memory⠀interrupt⠀the⠀formal⠀authority⠀without⠀turning⠀every⠀interruption⠀into⠀comedy.⠀Time⠀may⠀pass⠀in⠀ordinary⠀labor⠀and⠀waiting.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀matter⠀remembered⠀and⠀still⠀developing,⠀leaving⠀another⠀act⠀available⠀for⠀later⠀retelling⠀rather⠀than⠀pronouncing⠀a⠀legend⠀on⠀everyone's⠀behalf.⠀Keep⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀person⠀and⠀access⠀consistent⠀throughout.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀this⠀as⠀Scandinavian⠀social⠀domestic⠀realism.⠀Treat⠀the⠀household,⠀workshop,⠀or⠀local⠀institution⠀as⠀an⠀economic⠀and⠀relational⠀system:⠀who⠀performs⠀which⠀labor,⠀who⠀owns⠀or⠀borrows⠀what,⠀who⠀is⠀owed,⠀and⠀who⠀may⠀touch,⠀enter,⠀or⠀speak⠀for⠀whom.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀conditions⠀govern⠀what⠀characters⠀can⠀know,⠀obtain,⠀expect,⠀and⠀do.⠀A⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀a⠀mended⠀seam,⠀a⠀debt⠀recorded⠀in⠀a⠀ledger,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀way⠀of⠀setting⠀a⠀table⠀is⠀social⠀evidence,⠀not⠀scenic⠀decoration.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀through⠀the⠀physical⠀texture⠀of⠀this⠀material⠀life.⠀Describe⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀key,⠀the⠀worn⠀edge⠀of⠀a⠀table,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀stored⠀linen,⠀the⠀particular⠀way⠀a⠀garment⠀is⠀folded⠀or⠀mended.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀appear⠀as⠀a⠀cost⠀when⠀an⠀attractive⠀surface⠀requires⠀upkeep,⠀debt,⠀concealment,⠀or⠀someone's⠀labor.⠀A⠀fine⠀room⠀may⠀be⠀kept⠀orderly⠀by⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀cannot⠀sit⠀in⠀it;⠀a⠀polished⠀object⠀may⠀be⠀handled⠀only⠀by⠀the⠀one⠀who⠀must⠀return⠀it.⠀The⠀domestic⠀surface⠀is⠀not⠀neutral:⠀it⠀records⠀who⠀maintains⠀it⠀and⠀at⠀what⠀price.\n\nRender⠀jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀practical⠀claims⠀and⠀obligations.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀possessive⠀about⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀household⠀position,⠀an⠀object⠀with⠀a⠀history,⠀or⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀person's⠀time.⠀Show⠀the⠀conflict⠀through⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀touch,⠀enter,⠀speak⠀for,⠀or⠀depend⠀on⠀whom.⠀A⠀repeated⠀errand,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀garment,⠀a⠀chair⠀left⠀empty,⠀or⠀a⠀task⠀performed⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀refused⠀to⠀another⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀attachment⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narration⠀psychologically⠀precise⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀character⠀articulate⠀their⠀feelings.⠀A⠀focal⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀a⠀detail,⠀interpret⠀it,⠀and⠀act⠀on⠀that⠀interpretation⠀while⠀another⠀character⠀remains⠀unaware⠀of⠀the⠀private⠀reasoning.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀distinguished⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀or⠀observed.⠀Do⠀not⠀grant⠀the⠀narration⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀outside⠀the⠀active⠀contract.\n\nLet⠀remembered⠀places⠀carry⠀intimacy⠀by⠀returning⠀to⠀a⠀specific⠀object,⠀room,⠀threshold,⠀or⠀routine,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀return⠀reveal⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀merely⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀mood.⠀The⠀restraint⠀of⠀social⠀realism⠀should⠀sharpen⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intensity⠀rather⠀than⠀erase⠀it:⠀a⠀single⠀observed⠀detail⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀larger⠀attachment,⠀and⠀a⠀calm⠀domestic⠀scene⠀can⠀contain⠀an⠀uncomfortable⠀relationship.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀a⠀pending⠀obligation,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀understands,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀dramatic⠀reversal.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀concise⠀scene⠀blocks⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀cues⠀and⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀conditions⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀reach,⠀wear,⠀carry,⠀pay⠀for,⠀or⠀leave⠀behind.⠀A⠀locked⠀drawer,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀coat,⠀a⠀mended⠀seam,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀way⠀of⠀setting⠀a⠀table⠀can⠀carry⠀social⠀meaning⠀without⠀explanatory⠀dialogue.⠀Keep⠀action⠀lines⠀visible⠀and⠀audible:⠀what⠀a⠀hand⠀does,⠀what⠀a⠀surface⠀sounds⠀like,⠀what⠀remains⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀after⠀someone⠀exits.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀register⠀the⠀maintenance⠀and⠀cost⠀of⠀attractive⠀surfaces.⠀Show⠀a⠀stain⠀being⠀hidden,⠀a⠀fine⠀garment⠀being⠀returned,⠀a⠀mirror⠀being⠀avoided⠀or⠀consulted,⠀a⠀polished⠀object⠀handled⠀only⠀by⠀the⠀person⠀who⠀must⠀give⠀it⠀back.⠀The⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀static⠀image;⠀it⠀is⠀something⠀someone⠀keeps⠀up,⠀repairs,⠀conceals,⠀or⠀owes.⠀Let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀telling⠀objects⠀or⠀gestures⠀recur⠀across⠀scenes⠀and⠀acquire⠀changed⠀meaning⠀through⠀later⠀visible⠀facts.\n\nStage⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀physical⠀access⠀and⠀handling.⠀A⠀character⠀enters⠀without⠀knocking,⠀waits⠀outside,⠀touches⠀an⠀object⠀meant⠀for⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀performs⠀a⠀service⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀refuses⠀it⠀to⠀another.⠀Let⠀the⠀action⠀line⠀show⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀approach,⠀handle,⠀or⠀take,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀left⠀watching.⠀The⠀attachment⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀management⠀of⠀space⠀and⠀objects,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀historical⠀situation.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀around⠀a⠀desire,⠀enforce⠀a⠀household⠀rule,⠀or⠀bargain⠀over⠀an⠀object.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀line⠀witty⠀or⠀confessional.⠀Let⠀pauses,⠀interruptions,⠀and⠀unfinished⠀sentences⠀carry⠀pressure⠀without⠀turning⠀them⠀into⠀universal⠀signs⠀of⠀guilt.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀notes⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀separate⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀not⠀automatically⠀known⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀Do⠀not⠀use⠀voice-over⠀or⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀unless⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀it.⠀A⠀cut⠀may⠀move⠀the⠀scene⠀forward,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀erase⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀has⠀already⠀seen⠀or⠀understood.\n\nEnd⠀a⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀visible⠀change⠀in⠀the⠀room,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀confrontation.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀pressure⠀under⠀different⠀conditions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀playable⠀script⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀economical⠀stage⠀directions.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀staged:⠀who⠀carries⠀a⠀tray,⠀who⠀sits⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀who⠀folds⠀a⠀garment,⠀who⠀stands⠀at⠀a⠀threshold.⠀Use⠀props⠀and⠀blocking⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀historical⠀constraints⠀concrete.⠀A⠀character's⠀ability⠀to⠀enter⠀a⠀room,⠀touch⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀leave⠀with⠀something⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀situation.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀physical⠀business⠀of⠀the⠀scene⠀register⠀the⠀maintenance⠀and⠀cost⠀of⠀attractive⠀surfaces.⠀Stage⠀a⠀pause⠀while⠀a⠀character⠀straightens⠀a⠀cloth,⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀cup⠀is⠀set⠀down,⠀the⠀careful⠀handling⠀of⠀a⠀letter⠀or⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀jewelry,⠀a⠀stain⠀being⠀hidden,⠀a⠀mirror⠀consulted,⠀a⠀fine⠀garment⠀adjusted⠀or⠀returned.⠀The⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀static⠀image;⠀it⠀is⠀something⠀someone⠀keeps⠀up,⠀repairs,⠀conceals,⠀or⠀owes.⠀Let⠀a⠀recurring⠀prop⠀or⠀gesture⠀acquire⠀changed⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀develops.\n\nStage⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀access⠀and⠀service.⠀A⠀character⠀performs⠀a⠀service⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another,⠀avoids⠀a⠀particular⠀touch,⠀places⠀an⠀object⠀where⠀someone⠀will⠀find⠀it,⠀or⠀waits⠀at⠀a⠀threshold⠀while⠀another⠀enters.⠀Let⠀the⠀blocking⠀show⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀approach,⠀handle,⠀or⠀take,⠀and⠀who⠀is⠀left⠀watching.⠀The⠀attachment⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀management⠀of⠀space⠀and⠀objects,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀specific⠀and⠀playable.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀in⠀partial⠀sentences,⠀repeat⠀a⠀phrase⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning,⠀or⠀answer⠀a⠀question⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀instruction.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀line⠀polished⠀or⠀confessional.⠀Let⠀the⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀carry⠀the⠀public⠀scene.⠀A⠀monologue⠀or⠀aside⠀may⠀be⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀has⠀a⠀dramatic⠀purpose;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀the⠀default⠀destination⠀for⠀private⠀thought.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀authoring⠀material⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀hear.⠀Do⠀not⠀disguise⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀line⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀overhear.⠀The⠀audience⠀may⠀understand⠀more⠀than⠀any⠀single⠀character,⠀but⠀that⠀understanding⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀staged⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue,⠀not⠀from⠀unearned⠀access⠀to⠀every⠀mind.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀an⠀exit,⠀an⠀entrance,⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀pause.⠀The⠀next⠀scene⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀pressure⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀gathering⠀of⠀all⠀parties.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀through⠀one⠀authorized⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀private⠀words,⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀interruption,⠀and⠀recurring⠀concern⠀braid⠀together⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀thought,⠀not⠀a⠀linear⠀report,⠀structures⠀the⠀telling.⠀Keep⠀the⠀historical⠀period⠀present⠀inside⠀that⠀movement:⠀a⠀smell,⠀a⠀texture,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀rule,⠀a⠀particular⠀room.⠀The⠀character's⠀social⠀position⠀shapes⠀what⠀enters⠀the⠀mind⠀as⠀possible,⠀expected,⠀forbidden,⠀or⠀already⠀lost.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀by⠀letting⠀the⠀stream's⠀associations⠀be⠀triggered⠀by⠀the⠀cost⠀and⠀maintenance⠀of⠀attractive⠀surfaces.⠀The⠀mind⠀lingers⠀on⠀a⠀polished⠀object,⠀a⠀fine⠀sleeve,⠀a⠀remembered⠀room,⠀and⠀then⠀registers⠀the⠀labor,⠀concealment,⠀or⠀obligation⠀beneath⠀it.⠀A⠀remembered⠀place⠀returns⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀detail:⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀comb,⠀the⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀mended⠀seam.⠀The⠀beauty⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀static⠀image;⠀it⠀is⠀something⠀someone⠀keeps⠀up,⠀repairs,⠀conceals,⠀or⠀owes,⠀and⠀the⠀mind⠀returns⠀to⠀that⠀cost.\n\nLet⠀jealous⠀or⠀divided⠀attachment⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀recurring⠀concern⠀that⠀interrupts⠀other⠀thoughts.⠀A⠀name,⠀a⠀task,⠀a⠀threshold,⠀or⠀a⠀particular⠀hour⠀may⠀break⠀into⠀the⠀stream⠀and⠀pull⠀it⠀back⠀toward⠀a⠀claim,⠀an⠀avoidance,⠀or⠀an⠀obligation.⠀The⠀attachment⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀interruption⠀and⠀return,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀single⠀announced⠀emotion.\n\nDistinguish⠀present⠀perception⠀from⠀recollection⠀and⠀fantasy.⠀A⠀sensory⠀detail⠀may⠀trigger⠀a⠀memory,⠀but⠀the⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀has⠀left⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀when⠀it⠀returns.⠀Use⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀associations⠀while⠀keeping⠀enough⠀orientation:⠀an⠀interruption,⠀a⠀repeated⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀shift⠀in⠀tense⠀can⠀mark⠀the⠀boundary.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀the⠀technique⠀make⠀all⠀scene⠀facts⠀indeterminate⠀or⠀grant⠀access⠀to⠀minds⠀outside⠀the⠀active⠀contract.\n\nLet⠀ordinary⠀reasoning⠀appear⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀mental⠀stream,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀mistake⠀a⠀calm⠀sequence⠀of⠀thoughts⠀for⠀this⠀stylistic⠀mode.⠀The⠀movement⠀should⠀be⠀associative:⠀a⠀sound⠀leads⠀to⠀a⠀memory,⠀a⠀memory⠀to⠀a⠀phrase,⠀a⠀phrase⠀to⠀a⠀bodily⠀sensation,⠀a⠀sensation⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀task.⠀The⠀historical⠀world⠀remains⠀concrete⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀mind⠀moves⠀through⠀it⠀obliquely.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀passage⠀where⠀the⠀mind's⠀attention⠀settles,⠀is⠀interrupted,⠀or⠀turns⠀toward⠀an⠀unfinished⠀concern.⠀The⠀next⠀passage⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀stream⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀realization.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nWrite⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀readable⠀sender-attributed⠀messages.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀period's⠀communication⠀system⠀shape⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀sent,⠀how⠀long⠀it⠀takes,⠀who⠀can⠀read⠀it,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀message⠀costs.⠀A⠀delay,⠀a⠀shared⠀channel,⠀a⠀formal⠀address,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀passed⠀through⠀another⠀person⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀social⠀situation,⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀interface.⠀Use⠀only⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀edits,⠀receipts,⠀attachments,⠀or⠀channel⠀changes⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀through⠀the⠀wording⠀of⠀the⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀specific⠀remembered⠀detail:⠀a⠀place,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀particular⠀hour,⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀key,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀stored⠀linen.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀appear⠀when⠀an⠀attractive⠀phrase⠀or⠀image⠀requires⠀concealment,⠀delay,⠀or⠀a⠀debt⠀the⠀sender⠀does⠀not⠀state.⠀The⠀polished⠀message⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀neutral⠀report;⠀it⠀is⠀something⠀someone⠀composes,⠀edits,⠀and⠀sends⠀at⠀a⠀price.\n\nRender⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀the⠀pattern⠀of⠀transmission,⠀delay,⠀and⠀withholding.⠀One⠀character⠀may⠀write⠀in⠀fragments,⠀another⠀in⠀careful⠀sentences,⠀another⠀may⠀delay⠀or⠀edit.⠀A⠀message⠀may⠀be⠀polished,⠀brief,⠀repeated,⠀or⠀left⠀unsent.⠀Show⠀the⠀attachment⠀through⠀who⠀receives⠀a⠀prompt⠀reply,⠀who⠀is⠀left⠀waiting,⠀who⠀is⠀copied⠀or⠀excluded,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀sender⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀transmit.⠀The⠀attachment⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀management⠀of⠀the⠀exchange,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀feeling.\n\nDistinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀An⠀unsent⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀private⠀thought.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Do⠀not⠀let⠀another⠀character⠀know⠀a⠀private⠀thought⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀reader⠀has⠀seen⠀it.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀message⠀witty⠀or⠀confessional.⠀Context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀required,⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀an⠀interface⠀event⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀exchange⠀on⠀a⠀sent⠀message,⠀a⠀pending⠀reply,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀or⠀a⠀meaningful⠀silence.⠀The⠀next⠀exchange⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀pressure⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaoba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀scene-oriented⠀presentation⠀with⠀concise⠀scene-setting,⠀readable⠀dialogue⠀attribution,⠀and⠀focal⠀narration⠀or⠀inner⠀response.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀period's⠀material⠀life⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀appear⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀shows:⠀a⠀room's⠀arrangement,⠀a⠀garment's⠀condition,⠀an⠀object's⠀placement,⠀a⠀character's⠀posture.⠀Keep⠀scene⠀changes⠀legible⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀shifts.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀sensual⠀precision⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀focal⠀narration⠀register⠀the⠀maintenance⠀and⠀cost⠀of⠀attractive⠀surfaces.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀notices⠀a⠀mended⠀seam,⠀a⠀borrowed⠀ornament,⠀a⠀room⠀kept⠀too⠀orderly,⠀a⠀stain⠀being⠀hidden,⠀a⠀fine⠀garment⠀being⠀returned.⠀The⠀glamorous⠀surface⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀static⠀image;⠀it⠀is⠀something⠀someone⠀keeps⠀up,⠀repairs,⠀conceals,⠀or⠀owes.⠀Let⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀telling⠀elements⠀recur⠀across⠀scenes⠀and⠀acquire⠀changed⠀meaning⠀through⠀later⠀visible⠀facts.\n\nRender⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀attention⠀to⠀access⠀and⠀handling.⠀The⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀may⠀notice⠀who⠀stands⠀near⠀whom,⠀who⠀touches⠀an⠀object⠀meant⠀for⠀someone⠀else,⠀who⠀avoids⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀who⠀performs⠀a⠀service⠀for⠀one⠀person⠀and⠀not⠀another.⠀The⠀attachment⠀is⠀legible⠀through⠀the⠀management⠀of⠀space⠀and⠀objects,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀line⠀that⠀names⠀the⠀feeling.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀outside⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀Preserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀distinguished⠀from⠀dialogue.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀and⠀the⠀historical⠀situation.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀around⠀a⠀desire,⠀enforce⠀a⠀household⠀rule,⠀or⠀bargain⠀over⠀an⠀object.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀line⠀polished⠀or⠀confessional.⠀Let⠀the⠀next⠀exchange⠀support,⠀complicate,⠀or⠀redirect⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀interpretation⠀without⠀turning⠀the⠀cast⠀into⠀fixed⠀reaction⠀portraits.⠀A⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cue⠀may⠀orient⠀the⠀moment,⠀but⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀an⠀automatic⠀truth⠀indicator;⠀a⠀contradiction⠀in⠀an⠀arrangement⠀or⠀account⠀must⠀do⠀the⠀interpretive⠀work.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀on⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀exchange,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀change⠀in⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀understands,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀revelation⠀or⠀a⠀choice⠀screen.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaobb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Li⠀Bihua⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀part⠀of⠀a⠀cumulative⠀story.⠀Maintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Let⠀the⠀historical⠀period's⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀material⠀life⠀shape⠀the⠀developments.⠀Progress⠀can⠀involve⠀knowledge,⠀relationships,⠀work,⠀or⠀resources.⠀Do⠀not⠀impose⠀leveling⠀systems,⠀rankings,⠀or⠀progression-fantasy⠀world⠀rules⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nUse⠀Li⠀Bihua's⠀intimacy⠀of⠀remembered⠀places⠀as⠀the⠀serial's⠀connective⠀tissue.⠀A⠀recurring⠀object,⠀room,⠀threshold,⠀or⠀routine⠀can⠀return⠀across⠀installments⠀and⠀acquire⠀new⠀meaning⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀develops.⠀Let⠀beauty⠀with⠀a⠀cost⠀accumulate:⠀an⠀attractive⠀surface⠀that⠀requires⠀upkeep,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀grows,⠀a⠀glamorous⠀arrangement⠀that⠀becomes⠀harder⠀to⠀maintain.⠀Each⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀or⠀object⠀should⠀reveal⠀what⠀has⠀changed⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀merely⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀mood.\n\nRender⠀divided⠀attachment⠀through⠀recurring⠀claims,⠀avoidances,⠀and⠀obligations⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀single⠀announced⠀conflict.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀be⠀possessive⠀about⠀a⠀shared⠀task,⠀a⠀household⠀position,⠀an⠀object⠀with⠀a⠀history,⠀or⠀access⠀to⠀another⠀person's⠀time.⠀Show⠀the⠀conflict⠀through⠀who⠀is⠀permitted⠀to⠀touch,⠀enter,⠀speak⠀for,⠀or⠀depend⠀on⠀whom,⠀and⠀let⠀that⠀pattern⠀shift⠀across⠀installments⠀as⠀the⠀situation⠀develops.\n\nRecover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀When⠀a⠀later⠀installment⠀returns⠀to⠀an⠀earlier⠀object⠀or⠀arrangement,⠀supply⠀the⠀necessary⠀particular⠀rather⠀than⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀history.⠀Let⠀an⠀earlier⠀observation⠀remain⠀available⠀so⠀that⠀its⠀new⠀significance⠀is⠀earned⠀by⠀a⠀later⠀fact,⠀not⠀by⠀changing⠀the⠀earlier⠀event.\n\nKeep⠀each⠀installment⠀legible⠀to⠀a⠀reader⠀returning⠀after⠀a⠀gap.⠀Open⠀with⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀then⠀let⠀the⠀action⠀continue.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.⠀A⠀quiet⠀change⠀in⠀understanding⠀can⠀be⠀as⠀significant⠀as⠀a⠀dramatic⠀event.\n\nPreserve⠀required⠀nonspoken⠀interiority⠀in⠀the⠀active⠀presentation,⠀clearly⠀distinguished⠀from⠀dialogue⠀and⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge.⠀End⠀the⠀installment⠀on⠀completed⠀work,⠀a⠀pending⠀request,⠀a⠀changed⠀understanding,⠀or⠀a⠀plain⠀acknowledgment⠀of⠀what⠀is⠀now⠀known.⠀The⠀next⠀installment⠀may⠀continue⠀the⠀same⠀pressure⠀under⠀changed⠀conditions.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nSelect⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀whose⠀period-specific⠀obligations⠀make⠀a⠀difficult⠀relationship⠀impossible⠀to⠀avoid:⠀a⠀visit⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀paid,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀acknowledged,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀delivered⠀or⠀withheld,⠀a⠀duty⠀performed⠀for⠀someone⠀who⠀has⠀caused⠀harm.⠀The⠀turbulence⠀is⠀not⠀announced;⠀it⠀is⠀carried⠀by⠀the⠀act⠀itself.⠀Choose⠀the⠀act⠀for⠀the⠀particular⠀unresolved⠀cost⠀it⠀exposes—an⠀apology⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀made⠀in⠀the⠀available⠀privacy,⠀a⠀request⠀that⠀would⠀be⠀heard⠀as⠀weakness,⠀a⠀return⠀made⠀out⠀of⠀obligation⠀that⠀reopens⠀the⠀wound.\n\nWrite⠀the⠀emotional⠀strain⠀through⠀the⠀material⠀conditions⠀of⠀the⠀scene.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀determine⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀said⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀whom,⠀how⠀long⠀a⠀journey⠀takes,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀offered⠀or⠀refused,⠀and⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀do⠀despite⠀feeling⠀it.⠀Describe⠀these⠀conditions⠀precisely⠀in⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀language.⠀The⠀hurt⠀shows⠀in⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀cannot⠀bring⠀themselves⠀to⠀do,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀effort⠀required⠀to⠀perform⠀an⠀ordinary⠀gesture.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀awareness⠀available⠀and⠀distinct⠀from⠀what⠀other⠀characters⠀can⠀see.⠀Render⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀hope⠀and⠀then⠀stop⠀hoping.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀this⠀interiority.⠀Let⠀the⠀strain⠀affect⠀subsequent⠀behavior,⠀not⠀only⠀the⠀immediate⠀exchange:⠀after⠀a⠀difficult⠀conversation,⠀the⠀character⠀may⠀complete⠀a⠀task⠀more⠀slowly,⠀avoid⠀a⠀room,⠀or⠀speak⠀with⠀unusual⠀care⠀to⠀someone⠀else.\n\nAllow⠀comfort,⠀when⠀it⠀appears,⠀to⠀be⠀partial⠀or⠀awkward.⠀A⠀practical⠀kindness⠀may⠀not⠀resolve⠀the⠀hurt;⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀warmth⠀may⠀coexist⠀with⠀pain.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀reconciliation,⠀or⠀a⠀final⠀collapse.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀completed⠀and⠀the⠀unresolved⠀cost⠀still⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀character's⠀private⠀awareness⠀or⠀visible⠀behavior.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nStage⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀around⠀an⠀ordinary⠀historical⠀encounter:⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀request⠀made⠀through⠀the⠀proper⠀channels,⠀a⠀visit⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀paid,⠀a⠀service⠀rendered⠀or⠀refused.⠀Use⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀so⠀each⠀speaker's⠀position⠀is⠀clear⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say⠀and⠀how⠀they⠀say⠀it.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀determine⠀what⠀each⠀speaker⠀can⠀know,⠀ask,⠀offer,⠀or⠀refuse.⠀A⠀character's⠀acceptance⠀of⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation—being⠀kept⠀waiting,⠀being⠀spoken⠀over,⠀being⠀charged⠀too⠀much—can⠀expose⠀the⠀institution⠀at⠀work⠀without⠀an⠀explanatory⠀aside.\n\nUse⠀brief⠀narrative⠀passages⠀to⠀ground⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀material⠀life:⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀a⠀room,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀service,⠀the⠀time⠀a⠀task⠀requires,⠀the⠀presence⠀of⠀someone⠀who⠀must⠀not⠀overhear.⠀Keep⠀these⠀details⠀particular⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting.⠀Let⠀them⠀affect⠀the⠀conversation⠀directly:⠀a⠀speaker⠀may⠀lower⠀their⠀voice,⠀change⠀the⠀subject,⠀or⠀make⠀a⠀request⠀indirectly⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀is⠀present⠀or⠀what⠀is⠀permitted.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀through⠀the⠀attributed⠀dialogue⠀and⠀its⠀material⠀constraints,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀narrator's⠀lecture.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀awareness⠀differ⠀from⠀what⠀they⠀say.⠀Render⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀understand⠀about⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀moment.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀this⠀interiority.⠀One⠀character's⠀ordinary⠀expectation⠀can⠀be⠀another⠀character's⠀quiet⠀injury,⠀and⠀neither⠀needs⠀to⠀announce⠀it.\n\nKeep⠀ongoing⠀world⠀and⠀NPC⠀behavior⠀active.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀continue⠀a⠀task,⠀respond⠀to⠀a⠀practical⠀need,⠀or⠀act⠀on⠀their⠀own⠀understanding⠀of⠀the⠀situation⠀while⠀the⠀exchange⠀proceeds.⠀End⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀what⠀has⠀occurred:⠀a⠀task⠀still⠀in⠀progress,⠀a⠀conversation⠀that⠀has⠀reached⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀practical⠀next⠀step⠀that⠀is⠀now⠀possible⠀or⠀newly⠀difficult.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀choice⠀screen.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract,⠀including⠀narrative⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀satirical⠀realism⠀route.⠀Select⠀one⠀ordinary⠀social⠀encounter⠀whose⠀accepted⠀form⠀carries⠀a⠀specific⠀institutional⠀claim:⠀a⠀petition⠀that⠀promises⠀fairness,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation⠀that⠀promises⠀order,⠀a⠀transaction⠀that⠀promises⠀mutual⠀benefit,⠀a⠀public⠀gathering⠀that⠀promises⠀community.⠀Render⠀the⠀encounter⠀with⠀clean,⠀particular⠀language⠀grounded⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀location:⠀who⠀must⠀be⠀greeted⠀first,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀offered,⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀refused,⠀what⠀is⠀too⠀expensive⠀to⠀mention.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀the⠀practice's⠀stated⠀purpose⠀and⠀its⠀actual⠀cost.⠀Let⠀the⠀concrete⠀particulars⠀do⠀the⠀satirical⠀work:⠀the⠀petition⠀is⠀filed⠀with⠀the⠀correct⠀form⠀and⠀ignored;⠀the⠀family⠀obligation⠀is⠀performed⠀and⠀leaves⠀someone⠀short;⠀the⠀transaction⠀is⠀completed⠀and⠀one⠀party⠀is⠀quietly⠀harmed.⠀The⠀irony⠀emerges⠀from⠀the⠀narrator's⠀unsentimental⠀observation⠀of⠀this⠀gap,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀moralizing⠀comment.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀every⠀individual⠀a⠀villain⠀or⠀every⠀scene⠀a⠀political⠀demonstration.\n\nLet⠀narrators⠀and⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀One⠀character's⠀ordinary⠀expectation⠀can⠀be⠀another⠀character's⠀quiet⠀injury,⠀and⠀neither⠀may⠀need⠀to⠀announce⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀awareness⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits:⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀understand⠀only⠀later.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀this⠀interiority.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀period,⠀and⠀community⠀distinct.⠀Do⠀not⠀transplant⠀a⠀setting⠀or⠀cast⠀identity⠀from⠀a⠀cultural⠀example.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀without⠀resolution,⠀with⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀completed⠀and⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀purpose⠀and⠀cost⠀left⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀aftermath.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act⠀whose⠀physical⠀cost⠀carries⠀a⠀specific⠀social⠀damage:⠀carrying⠀a⠀load⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀delivered⠀to⠀someone⠀who⠀will⠀not⠀pay⠀fairly,⠀waiting⠀outside⠀an⠀office⠀where⠀the⠀petitioner⠀is⠀not⠀permitted⠀to⠀sit,⠀paying⠀a⠀fee⠀twice⠀because⠀the⠀first⠀payment⠀was⠀not⠀recorded,⠀repairing⠀a⠀tool⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀someone⠀else.⠀Render⠀the⠀material⠀texture⠀precisely⠀in⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀diction:⠀the⠀weight,⠀the⠀cost,⠀the⠀time,⠀the⠀condition⠀of⠀the⠀body⠀and⠀the⠀objects⠀involved.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀determine⠀what⠀is⠀available,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀endured,⠀and⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀avoided.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀institution⠀through⠀the⠀physical⠀fact⠀itself.⠀A⠀chair⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀offered,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀entered⠀from⠀the⠀side,⠀a⠀payment⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀made⠀twice—these⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀even⠀when⠀the⠀detail⠀is⠀hard.⠀The⠀grit⠀is⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀seen⠀and⠀done,⠀not⠀in⠀decorative⠀harshness.⠀Ground⠀abrasive⠀or⠀rough⠀speech⠀in⠀its⠀speaker⠀and⠀situation:⠀a⠀character's⠀bluntness⠀comes⠀from⠀their⠀position⠀and⠀need,⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀uniform⠀tone⠀imposed⠀on⠀the⠀whole⠀scene.\n\nUse⠀compressed⠀transitions⠀and⠀useful⠀changes⠀of⠀rhythm.⠀Move⠀quickly⠀between⠀the⠀physical⠀action⠀and⠀its⠀consequence;⠀use⠀a⠀short⠀sentence⠀when⠀the⠀action⠀turns,⠀and⠀allow⠀a⠀longer⠀thought⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀character's⠀reasoning⠀needs⠀it.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀awareness⠀available—what⠀they⠀calculate,⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀to⠀endure,⠀what⠀they⠀notice⠀about⠀the⠀cost.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀this⠀interiority.\n\nDo⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀survival⠀horror⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀individual⠀cruel.⠀The⠀damage⠀is⠀social⠀and⠀particular:⠀an⠀accepted⠀practice⠀that⠀grinds⠀someone⠀down,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀transaction⠀that⠀leaves⠀someone⠀short.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀act⠀completed⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀still⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀body,⠀the⠀objects,⠀or⠀the⠀aftermath.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀sequence⠀through⠀documents⠀whose⠀form⠀and⠀conditions⠀of⠀composition⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀exposure.⠀Use⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀social⠀position⠀to⠀determine⠀who⠀can⠀write,⠀what⠀materials⠀they⠀can⠀obtain,⠀how⠀a⠀letter⠀or⠀record⠀is⠀delivered⠀or⠀preserved,⠀and⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀omitted⠀for⠀safety,⠀propriety,⠀or⠀practicality.⠀A⠀document's⠀form⠀is⠀part⠀of⠀its⠀meaning:⠀a⠀formal⠀petition,⠀a⠀private⠀letter,⠀a⠀shop⠀record,⠀a⠀family⠀note,⠀a⠀report⠀filed⠀with⠀an⠀office.\n\nLet⠀each⠀document's⠀author⠀reveal⠀their⠀position⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀writer⠀may⠀record⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation⠀as⠀a⠀routine⠀matter,⠀omit⠀a⠀request⠀because⠀it⠀would⠀be⠀improper⠀to⠀put⠀in⠀writing,⠀or⠀phrase⠀a⠀complaint⠀so⠀carefully⠀that⠀the⠀damage⠀is⠀visible⠀only⠀in⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀said.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀through⠀these⠀choices⠀of⠀record⠀and⠀omission,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀omniscient⠀explanation⠀after⠀every⠀entry.⠀Let⠀gaps,⠀revisions,⠀and⠀conflicting⠀accounts⠀carry⠀the⠀damage⠀across⠀entries.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀and⠀unsentimental.⠀A⠀document⠀records⠀what⠀its⠀author⠀chooses⠀to⠀record;⠀it⠀is⠀not⠀automatically⠀their⠀complete⠀live⠀mind.⠀When⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀requires⠀interiority,⠀render⠀it⠀separately⠀from⠀the⠀document's⠀composed⠀text,⠀so⠀that⠀the⠀difference⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀writes⠀and⠀what⠀they⠀actually⠀think⠀or⠀feel⠀remains⠀available.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀this⠀interiority.\n\nUse⠀the⠀specific⠀document⠀form⠀required⠀by⠀the⠀scene⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation.⠀A⠀letter⠀may⠀be⠀delayed,⠀a⠀record⠀may⠀be⠀corrected,⠀a⠀report⠀may⠀be⠀filed⠀and⠀ignored.⠀The⠀sequence⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀document⠀unfinished,⠀unsent,⠀or⠀received⠀too⠀late,⠀if⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀situation.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀across⠀entries⠀without⠀imposing⠀a⠀summary⠀or⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nSelect⠀a⠀concrete⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀whose⠀historical⠀conditions⠀make⠀it⠀specific⠀and⠀meaningful:⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀food⠀set⠀aside⠀from⠀a⠀limited⠀supply,⠀a⠀fire⠀tended⠀before⠀someone⠀returns,⠀a⠀task⠀taken⠀over⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀rest⠀arranged⠀in⠀a⠀crowded⠀schedule,⠀a⠀small⠀preference⠀remembered⠀and⠀honored.⠀Render⠀the⠀comfort⠀through⠀the⠀material⠀world—what⠀can⠀be⠀spared,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀asked⠀for,⠀what⠀is⠀too⠀expensive⠀to⠀mention,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀done⠀quietly⠀because⠀of⠀who⠀is⠀watching.⠀The⠀care⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀particular⠀act⠀and⠀its⠀cost,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀general⠀atmosphere⠀of⠀warmth.\n\nLet⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀emotional⠀repair.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀show⠀care⠀by⠀doing⠀something⠀rather⠀than⠀saying⠀something,⠀or⠀by⠀saying⠀something⠀ordinary⠀that⠀carries⠀warmth⠀because⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀say⠀it.⠀Keep⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀intact.⠀Disagreement⠀and⠀established⠀problems⠀remain⠀present⠀in⠀the⠀world;⠀comfort⠀does⠀not⠀make⠀everyone⠀agreeable⠀or⠀remove⠀the⠀social⠀damage.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀may⠀still⠀occur⠀in⠀the⠀same⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀small⠀kindness,⠀and⠀both⠀can⠀be⠀true.\n\nUse⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀language.⠀The⠀warmth⠀is⠀in⠀the⠀attention⠀and⠀the⠀particular⠀acts,⠀not⠀in⠀decorative⠀tenderness.⠀Let⠀narrators⠀and⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal:⠀a⠀character's⠀ordinary⠀expectation⠀can⠀make⠀another⠀character's⠀kindness⠀more⠀visible,⠀and⠀a⠀character's⠀quiet⠀injury⠀can⠀coexist⠀with⠀their⠀genuine⠀pleasure⠀in⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀ease.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀awareness⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits:⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀appreciate,⠀what⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀say.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀this⠀interiority.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀comfort⠀received⠀and⠀the⠀larger⠀difficulty⠀still⠀present,⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀declaration.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀deliberate⠀transitions⠀and⠀sustained⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀to⠀frame⠀an⠀ordinary⠀act—a⠀visit,⠀a⠀transaction,⠀a⠀family⠀obligation,⠀a⠀public⠀duty—within⠀its⠀social⠀and⠀institutional⠀context.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀location⠀determine⠀the⠀concrete⠀conditions:⠀who⠀has⠀authority,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀observed,⠀what⠀is⠀taken⠀for⠀granted,⠀what⠀cannot⠀be⠀said⠀aloud.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀open⠀with⠀the⠀social⠀context⠀or⠀history⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀move⠀from⠀that⠀framing⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀encounter⠀rather⠀than⠀replacing⠀it⠀with⠀a⠀general⠀lesson.\n\nDistinguish⠀narration⠀from⠀ordinary⠀spoken⠀language.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀is⠀composed⠀and⠀observant,⠀with⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀diction.⠀Let⠀it⠀attend⠀to⠀what⠀people⠀accept⠀as⠀normal:⠀a⠀speaker's⠀careful⠀choice⠀of⠀words,⠀a⠀character's⠀unquestioned⠀acceptance⠀of⠀a⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement⠀that⠀quietly⠀harms⠀someone.⠀The⠀social⠀damage⠀emerges⠀through⠀these⠀particulars,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀explanatory⠀lecture.⠀The⠀composed⠀voice⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀practice⠀claims⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀costs,⠀but⠀it⠀does⠀so⠀through⠀observation⠀rather⠀than⠀moralizing.\n\nUse⠀the⠀formal⠀architecture⠀to⠀manage⠀public⠀and⠀private⠀contrast.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀public⠀exchange⠀to⠀a⠀private⠀interval,⠀or⠀from⠀a⠀character's⠀outward⠀compliance⠀to⠀their⠀inward⠀awareness.⠀Let⠀the⠀paragraph⠀movement⠀carry⠀this⠀shift:⠀a⠀broader⠀passage⠀for⠀the⠀social⠀context,⠀a⠀closer⠀passage⠀for⠀the⠀particular⠀act,⠀a⠀deliberate⠀transition⠀into⠀the⠀private⠀aftermath.⠀Keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀interiority⠀available⠀where⠀the⠀active⠀contract⠀permits:⠀what⠀they⠀notice,⠀what⠀they⠀decide⠀not⠀to⠀say,⠀what⠀they⠀understand⠀about⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀the⠀moment.⠀Other⠀characters⠀do⠀not⠀share⠀this⠀interiority.\n\nThe⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀completed⠀and⠀its⠀damage⠀left⠀visible⠀in⠀the⠀social⠀fabric,⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀resolution⠀or⠀a⠀moral⠀summary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nWrite⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀concrete⠀historical⠀occasion⠀where⠀someone⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀reason⠀to⠀tell⠀an⠀embedded⠀story:⠀a⠀dispute⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀settled,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀justified,⠀a⠀waiting⠀period⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀filled,⠀or⠀a⠀bystander⠀who⠀must⠀be⠀won⠀over.⠀Establish⠀the⠀listeners'⠀stake⠀in⠀the⠀account⠀before⠀the⠀telling⠀begins,⠀so⠀the⠀frame⠀is⠀a⠀live⠀situation⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀decorative⠀opening.\n\nThe⠀embedded⠀story⠀should⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀social⠀world⠀and⠀period⠀knowledge.⠀It⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀remembered⠀public⠀event,⠀a⠀locally⠀known⠀incident,⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀a⠀custom,⠀or⠀an⠀account⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀encounter.⠀As⠀the⠀teller⠀selects⠀and⠀orders⠀details,⠀let⠀the⠀emphasis⠀show⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀accepts⠀as⠀ordinary:⠀a⠀landlord's⠀right,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀reluctance,⠀a⠀family's⠀silence,⠀a⠀routine⠀humiliation.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀that⠀acceptance⠀into⠀a⠀lecture;⠀instead⠀let⠀the⠀listener's⠀later⠀question⠀or⠀the⠀frame's⠀outer⠀action⠀expose⠀it.\n\nConnect⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels⠀through⠀specific⠀recurrence.⠀A⠀repeated⠀place,⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀or⠀small⠀gesture⠀should⠀appear⠀once⠀in⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀and⠀once⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene,⠀changing⠀its⠀meaning⠀at⠀the⠀second⠀occurrence.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀bowl⠀passed⠀during⠀the⠀telling⠀may⠀recall⠀a⠀bowl⠀in⠀the⠀story;⠀a⠀saying⠀quoted⠀by⠀the⠀teller⠀may⠀return⠀as⠀an⠀official⠀formula⠀heard⠀in⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀must⠀be⠀concrete⠀and⠀historically⠀available⠀to⠀the⠀characters,⠀not⠀a⠀supernatural⠀sign.\n\nThe⠀teller's⠀reliability⠀should⠀be⠀a⠀source⠀of⠀pressure,⠀not⠀mystery⠀alone.⠀A⠀speaker⠀may⠀omit⠀a⠀motive,⠀soften⠀a⠀role,⠀or⠀sincerely⠀misunderstand⠀the⠀event⠀while⠀staying⠀credible.⠀When⠀the⠀outer⠀listener⠀returns⠀to⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀sequence,⠀access,⠀or⠀authority,⠀the⠀inquiry⠀should⠀be⠀answerable⠀from⠀the⠀world⠀of⠀the⠀story.⠀The⠀telling⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀to⠀deliver⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀resolve⠀every⠀doubt;⠀it⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀listeners⠀with⠀a⠀more⠀exact⠀sense⠀of⠀where⠀responsibility⠀was⠀distributed⠀and⠀where⠀it⠀was⠀not⠀named.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀through⠀small⠀accepted⠀norms.⠀A⠀minor⠀character's⠀politeness⠀may⠀do⠀the⠀work⠀of⠀supervision;⠀an⠀official's⠀civility⠀may⠀make⠀a⠀refusal⠀more⠀damaging;⠀a⠀family's⠀practical⠀language⠀may⠀treat⠀a⠀lost⠀person⠀as⠀an⠀obstacle.⠀Keep⠀the⠀prose⠀clean⠀and⠀direct,⠀avoiding⠀archaic⠀diction.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀be⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀storyteller's⠀voice⠀or⠀a⠀close⠀third-person⠀aligned⠀with⠀one⠀listener,⠀but⠀the⠀embedded⠀account⠀should⠀remain⠀attributed⠀to⠀its⠀teller⠀and⠀flagged⠀clearly⠀when⠀it⠀ends.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀outer⠀scene⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀telling⠀has⠀altered⠀the⠀listeners'⠀relationship⠀to⠀the⠀past⠀event,⠀even⠀if⠀no⠀practical⠀outcome⠀occurs.⠀The⠀frame⠀may⠀show⠀someone⠀preparing⠀to⠀act⠀on⠀the⠀new⠀awareness,⠀refusing⠀it,⠀or⠀repeating⠀a⠀phrase⠀differently.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀every⠀account⠀to⠀be⠀true,⠀every⠀teller⠀to⠀be⠀self-serving,⠀or⠀every⠀listener⠀to⠀be⠀enlightened.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀route.⠀Write⠀the⠀narration⠀as⠀a⠀deliberate⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀event,⠀assembled⠀from⠀records,⠀remembered⠀conditions,⠀and⠀particular⠀encounters⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀historical⠀setting.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀chronicler,⠀clerk,⠀teacher,⠀witness,⠀or⠀later⠀compiler,⠀but⠀the⠀narrator's⠀position⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀selected⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀called⠀ordinary.\n\nLet⠀documents⠀and⠀reports⠀enter⠀scenes⠀as⠀authored⠀objects⠀with⠀limits.⠀A⠀register⠀shows⠀who⠀paid⠀and⠀who⠀did⠀not,⠀but⠀not⠀why;⠀a⠀letter⠀preserves⠀a⠀phrase⠀without⠀preserving⠀the⠀tone;⠀a⠀posted⠀notice⠀names⠀a⠀penalty⠀without⠀showing⠀the⠀faces⠀of⠀those⠀who⠀must⠀obey⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀record⠀contradicts⠀memory,⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀either⠀source⠀automatically⠀become⠀truth.⠀Instead⠀show⠀the⠀gap⠀as⠀evidence⠀of⠀how⠀the⠀institution⠀expected⠀events⠀to⠀be⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀participants⠀could⠀say.\n\nExpose⠀the⠀larger⠀system⠀through⠀small⠀concrete⠀humiliations.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀made⠀to⠀wait⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀door,⠀sign⠀a⠀paper⠀without⠀understanding⠀its⠀full⠀meaning,⠀repeat⠀a⠀title⠀to⠀avoid⠀offense,⠀or⠀discover⠀that⠀an⠀old⠀debt⠀has⠀been⠀transferred⠀to⠀a⠀new⠀ledger.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language⠀clean⠀and⠀unsentimental,⠀so⠀the⠀damage⠀registers⠀through⠀the⠀ordinary⠀act⠀rather⠀than⠀through⠀commentary.\n\nShape⠀the⠀narrative⠀through⠀comparative⠀recollection.⠀At⠀least⠀two⠀accounts⠀or⠀records⠀should⠀stand⠀beside⠀each⠀other:⠀a⠀survivor's⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀day⠀and⠀an⠀official⠀log⠀of⠀the⠀same⠀day;⠀a⠀child's⠀description⠀of⠀a⠀room⠀and⠀an⠀inspector's⠀note⠀about⠀that⠀room;⠀a⠀promise⠀repeated⠀at⠀a⠀funeral⠀and⠀a⠀receipt⠀that⠀cancels⠀it.⠀The⠀juxtaposition⠀need⠀not⠀resolve⠀into⠀a⠀single⠀verdict,⠀but⠀it⠀should⠀make⠀the⠀institutional⠀rule⠀more⠀exact.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀documentary⠀distance⠀in⠀syntax.⠀Prefer⠀clauses⠀that⠀lay⠀one⠀fact⠀beside⠀another⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀inference⠀arrive⠀from⠀the⠀placement.⠀Avoid⠀melodramatic⠀punctuation,⠀rhetorical⠀exclamation,⠀and⠀psychological⠀explanation⠀of⠀every⠀motive.⠀When⠀the⠀narration⠀enters⠀one⠀participant's⠀interiority,⠀keep⠀it⠀within⠀the⠀same⠀documentary⠀frame:⠀a⠀remembered⠀sensation,⠀an⠀attention⠀caught⠀by⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀phrase⠀that⠀returns⠀later.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀the⠀document⠀itself⠀into⠀a⠀confessional⠀voice⠀unless⠀the⠀frame⠀establishes⠀that⠀a⠀particular⠀person⠀wrote⠀it.\n\nEnd⠀with⠀the⠀reader⠀able⠀to⠀see⠀the⠀pattern⠀without⠀a⠀lecture.⠀The⠀final⠀paragraph⠀may⠀return⠀to⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀street,⠀or⠀a⠀repeated⠀phrase⠀that⠀now⠀carries⠀the⠀accumulated⠀weight.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀document⠀to⠀be⠀destroyed,⠀every⠀official⠀to⠀be⠀monstrous,⠀or⠀every⠀survivor⠀to⠀gain⠀full⠀understanding.⠀The⠀historical⠀record⠀is⠀partial;⠀the⠀fiction⠀should⠀make⠀that⠀partiality⠀meaningful.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nUse⠀Gothic-Punk⠀atmosphere⠀without⠀importing⠀its⠀supernatural⠀machinery.⠀Treat⠀the⠀collision⠀of⠀old⠀authority⠀and⠀present⠀life⠀as⠀a⠀historical⠀condition:⠀a⠀decaying⠀estate,⠀a⠀changing⠀trade,⠀an⠀inherited⠀office,⠀a⠀wall⠀that⠀still⠀carries⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀an⠀older⠀order.⠀Let⠀the⠀atmosphere⠀arise⠀from⠀material⠀particulars⠀the⠀characters⠀can⠀touch,⠀smell,⠀or⠀avoid.\n\nMake⠀the⠀institution⠀present⠀through⠀urban⠀or⠀domestic⠀detail.⠀A⠀gate⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀entered⠀through⠀the⠀side,⠀a⠀lamp⠀that⠀costs⠀too⠀much⠀to⠀keep⠀lit,⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀furniture⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀may⠀sit⠀on,⠀a⠀street⠀where⠀certain⠀people⠀are⠀watched—these⠀are⠀the⠀forms⠀inherited⠀power⠀takes.⠀Show⠀them⠀through⠀ordinary⠀actions⠀and⠀small⠀humiliations,⠀the⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀method:⠀a⠀person⠀bows⠀at⠀the⠀wrong⠀moment,⠀removes⠀shoes⠀too⠀late,⠀or⠀says⠀\"it⠀is⠀the⠀custom\"⠀when⠀it⠀is⠀only⠀the⠀landlord's⠀convenience.\n\nUse⠀the⠀intimate⠀political⠀atmosphere⠀to⠀reveal⠀social⠀masks.⠀Characters⠀may⠀speak⠀more⠀honestly⠀in⠀a⠀back⠀room,⠀on⠀the⠀stairs,⠀or⠀while⠀sharing⠀food⠀away⠀from⠀officious⠀eyes.⠀But⠀intimacy⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀safety⠀by⠀default:⠀a⠀trusted⠀companion⠀may⠀still⠀repeat⠀a⠀comforting⠀lie,⠀enforce⠀a⠀shameful⠀rule,⠀or⠀remain⠀silent⠀at⠀the⠀exact⠀point⠀where⠀speech⠀would⠀cost⠀something.⠀Let⠀private⠀desire⠀and⠀unease⠀complicate⠀these⠀moments⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀relationship⠀treacherous.\n\nKeep⠀morally⠀complicated⠀intimacy⠀attached⠀to⠀the⠀historical⠀setting.⠀A⠀servant's⠀loyalty⠀may⠀include⠀resentment;⠀a⠀daughter's⠀obedience⠀may⠀include⠀calculation;⠀a⠀clerk's⠀courtesy⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀strategy⠀for⠀survival.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀let⠀a⠀character⠀understand⠀one⠀part⠀of⠀this⠀and⠀miss⠀another.⠀Do⠀not⠀convert⠀these⠀complexities⠀into⠀a⠀diagnosis⠀or⠀an⠀open⠀confession⠀unless⠀the⠀scene's⠀actual⠀access⠀permits⠀it.\n\nAtmosphere⠀should⠀change⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced:⠀light⠀failing⠀in⠀a⠀room⠀where⠀a⠀decision⠀must⠀be⠀made;⠀dust⠀rising⠀from⠀a⠀ledger⠀that⠀determines⠀someone's⠀future;⠀a⠀smell⠀that⠀returns⠀years⠀later⠀with⠀an⠀old⠀command.⠀Keep⠀these⠀details⠀concrete⠀and⠀functional;⠀they⠀may⠀illuminate⠀power⠀or⠀memory⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀substitute⠀for⠀the⠀social⠀mechanism.⠀An⠀unsettling⠀ruin⠀explains⠀mood,⠀not⠀causation.\n\nDo⠀not⠀add⠀Kindred,⠀factions,⠀blood-bonds,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀powers.⠀The⠀inherited⠀power⠀in⠀this⠀style⠀is⠀historical,⠀not⠀occult.⠀End⠀the⠀scene⠀at⠀the⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀pressure⠀is⠀felt⠀most⠀exactly,⠀not⠀where⠀a⠀hidden⠀truth⠀is⠀unveiled⠀or⠀a⠀monster⠀appears.⠀The⠀horror⠀should⠀be⠀that⠀the⠀ordinary⠀system⠀works.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀testimonial⠀and⠀autobiographical⠀route.⠀Write⠀as⠀a⠀participant⠀or⠀close⠀observer⠀recalling⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀event,⠀in⠀a⠀voice⠀that⠀shows⠀whose⠀memory⠀this⠀is⠀and⠀what⠀position⠀the⠀speaker⠀occupied.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀be⠀told⠀or⠀written,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀remain⠀a⠀situated⠀personal⠀testimony,⠀not⠀a⠀detached⠀chronicle.\n\nLet⠀the⠀testimony⠀expose⠀an⠀institution⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀speaker⠀accepts⠀as⠀normal.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀report⠀a⠀landlord's⠀clause,⠀a⠀family's⠀custom,⠀a⠀clerk's⠀phrase,⠀or⠀a⠀public⠀punishment,⠀without⠀stopping⠀to⠀denounce⠀it.⠀The⠀irony⠀lies⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀speaker⠀blends⠀complaint,⠀loyalty,⠀shame,⠀or⠀practicality.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀person⠀may⠀say⠀\"we⠀always⠀did⠀it⠀that⠀way\"⠀while⠀describing⠀the⠀precise⠀moment⠀that⠀custom⠀became⠀a⠀weapon.\n\nKeep⠀language,⠀region,⠀community,⠀and⠀period⠀specific⠀where⠀the⠀story⠀supplies⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀code-switching,⠀a⠀generic⠀family⠀structure,⠀or⠀a⠀religious⠀explanation.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀has⠀no⠀specified⠀Indian⠀language,⠀use⠀plain⠀English⠀shaped⠀by⠀the⠀narrator's⠀social⠀position;⠀the⠀Indian⠀literary⠀tradition⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀testimonial⠀form's⠀attention⠀to⠀memory,⠀witness⠀limits,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀speaking,⠀not⠀in⠀decorative⠀Indian⠀scenery.\n\nDistinguish⠀earlier⠀experience⠀from⠀later⠀knowledge.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀not⠀report⠀a⠀fact⠀learned⠀after⠀the⠀event⠀as⠀if⠀it⠀were⠀known⠀then.⠀Use⠀phrases⠀such⠀as⠀\"I⠀learned⠀later\"⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀narrative⠀frame⠀permits⠀the⠀older⠀narrator⠀to⠀speak⠀directly.⠀Otherwise⠀keep⠀the⠀younger⠀self's⠀ignorance⠀vivid:⠀a⠀paper⠀signed⠀without⠀understanding,⠀a⠀name⠀mistaken,⠀a⠀doorway⠀taken⠀for⠀granted⠀that⠀proved⠀decisive.\n\nThe⠀story⠀may⠀compare⠀a⠀private⠀memory⠀with⠀a⠀public⠀record,⠀but⠀the⠀testimony⠀itself⠀remains⠀the⠀organizing⠀voice.⠀A⠀remembered⠀phrase⠀can⠀be⠀revisited⠀after⠀the⠀official⠀version⠀has⠀been⠀stated.⠀The⠀final⠀tone⠀should⠀be⠀clear⠀and⠀restrained,⠀letting⠀the⠀accumulated⠀details⠀produce⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀without⠀a⠀closing⠀lecture.\n\nDo⠀not⠀require⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀be⠀heroic⠀or⠀the⠀outcome⠀redemptive.⠀The⠀testimony⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀unresolved⠀loss,⠀a⠀continued⠀silence,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀act⠀of⠀refusal.⠀What⠀matters⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀sees⠀how⠀the⠀institution⠀moved⠀through⠀ordinary⠀people⠀and⠀how⠀one⠀person⠀came⠀to⠀speak⠀of⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀social⠀and⠀psychological⠀realism.⠀Write⠀the⠀narration⠀from⠀a⠀close⠀position⠀aligned⠀with⠀one⠀or⠀more⠀members⠀of⠀the⠀community,⠀preserving⠀what⠀they⠀know,⠀notice,⠀and⠀accept.⠀The⠀historical⠀institution⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀small⠀daily⠀interactions:⠀a⠀tax⠀assessment,⠀a⠀school⠀requirement,⠀a⠀medical⠀visit,⠀a⠀funeral⠀debt,⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀who⠀may⠀sit⠀where.\n\nLet⠀omission⠀carry⠀weight.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀not⠀hear⠀a⠀conversation,⠀may⠀be⠀told⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀an⠀instruction,⠀or⠀may⠀choose⠀not⠀to⠀ask.⠀The⠀narration⠀can⠀pause⠀at⠀a⠀closed⠀door⠀or⠀a⠀half-finished⠀sentence⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀missing⠀portion⠀produce⠀its⠀own⠀pressure.⠀However,⠀omission⠀must⠀remain⠀a⠀chosen⠀narrative⠀device⠀within⠀the⠀scene,⠀not⠀an⠀excuse⠀to⠀hide⠀relevant⠀information⠀from⠀the⠀reader.⠀The⠀reader⠀should⠀know⠀that⠀something⠀was⠀withheld⠀and,⠀often,⠀what⠀kind⠀of⠀thing⠀it⠀was.\n\nUse⠀seasonal⠀and⠀environmental⠀attention⠀sparingly⠀as⠀time⠀markers.⠀Rain,⠀heat,⠀dusk,⠀or⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀path⠀can⠀show⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀waiting,⠀travel,⠀or⠀attendance.⠀Do⠀not⠀compile⠀a⠀landscape⠀inventory⠀or⠀force⠀every⠀chapter⠀to⠀open⠀with⠀weather.⠀The⠀season⠀becomes⠀meaningful⠀when⠀it⠀affects⠀the⠀characters'⠀practical⠀world:⠀a⠀harvest⠀deadline,⠀a⠀flooded⠀route,⠀the⠀cold⠀after⠀a⠀family⠀has⠀sold⠀its⠀brazier.\n\nKeep⠀social⠀exposure⠀unsentimental.⠀A⠀person⠀may⠀express⠀gratitude⠀for⠀a⠀punishment,⠀call⠀an⠀unjust⠀fee⠀\"small,\"⠀or⠀thank⠀an⠀official⠀for⠀allowing⠀a⠀delay.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀translate⠀this⠀into⠀sarcasm;⠀instead,⠀the⠀exact⠀words⠀and⠀the⠀situation⠀around⠀them⠀expose⠀the⠀power⠀relation.⠀The⠀irony⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀gap⠀between⠀speech⠀and⠀experience.\n\nPsychological⠀attention⠀should⠀focus⠀on⠀the⠀reason⠀for⠀an⠀action,⠀not⠀on⠀endless⠀analysis.⠀Show⠀a⠀character⠀waiting⠀because⠀refusal⠀would⠀harm⠀someone⠀else,⠀or⠀bowing⠀because⠀the⠀alternative⠀is⠀unthinkable.⠀Interiority⠀can⠀render⠀the⠀calculation⠀or⠀the⠀numbness⠀in⠀plain⠀language.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀misses⠀a⠀meaning,⠀the⠀narration⠀should⠀not⠀immediately⠀correct⠀it⠀unless⠀another⠀character⠀or⠀later⠀event⠀does⠀so.\n\nThe⠀ending⠀may⠀leave⠀a⠀social⠀outcome⠀uncertain⠀while⠀the⠀reader⠀understands⠀the⠀mechanism⠀more⠀exactly.⠀Avoid⠀a⠀final⠀revelation⠀that⠀resolves⠀every⠀silence.⠀The⠀realism⠀is⠀in⠀a⠀definite⠀historical⠀constraint⠀and⠀a⠀particular⠀human⠀response.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀social⠀realism⠀with⠀chronicle⠀and⠀testimony.⠀Shape⠀the⠀narration⠀as⠀a⠀community⠀witness's⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀historical⠀event⠀or⠀pressure:⠀a⠀strike,⠀a⠀land⠀dispute,⠀a⠀government⠀order,⠀a⠀disease,⠀a⠀failed⠀harvest,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀road⠀that⠀changes⠀trade.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀be⠀a⠀participant,⠀an⠀observer,⠀or⠀a⠀later⠀compiler⠀of⠀testimony,⠀but⠀the⠀position⠀must⠀be⠀clear⠀and⠀fallible.\n\nLet⠀the⠀institution⠀appear⠀through⠀concrete,⠀ordinary⠀transactions.⠀A⠀list⠀of⠀names⠀read⠀at⠀the⠀church⠀door,⠀a⠀stamp⠀that⠀costs⠀three⠀days'⠀wages,⠀a⠀soldier⠀who⠀asks⠀for⠀water⠀and⠀takes⠀a⠀chicken,⠀a⠀boundary⠀stone⠀moved⠀overnight—these⠀details⠀carry⠀social⠀meaning⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Use⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀method:⠀record⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀clean⠀language,⠀including⠀the⠀small⠀humiliation⠀that⠀accompanies⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀system⠀at⠀work.\n\nPreserve⠀the⠀relevant⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀from⠀the⠀supplied⠀scenario.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀generic⠀Latin⠀American⠀landscape,⠀dialect,⠀or⠀political⠀crisis.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀is⠀a⠀specific⠀country⠀or⠀region,⠀use⠀its⠀actual⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀life;⠀if⠀unspecified,⠀keep⠀the⠀community's⠀specific⠀social⠀position⠀central⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀stereotypes.\n\nInclude⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀moment⠀where⠀testimony⠀is⠀partial⠀or⠀contradictory.⠀Two⠀neighbors⠀remember⠀a⠀threat⠀differently;⠀a⠀local⠀committee⠀has⠀a⠀record⠀that⠀omits⠀a⠀death;⠀a⠀child⠀saw⠀more⠀than⠀the⠀adults⠀say.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀can⠀hold⠀these⠀versions⠀beside⠀each⠀other⠀without⠀declaring⠀a⠀single⠀truth,⠀but⠀the⠀differences⠀must⠀be⠀legible⠀as⠀social⠀positions:⠀who⠀was⠀allowed⠀to⠀speak,⠀who⠀owed⠀whom,⠀who⠀was⠀not⠀present.\n\nThe⠀voice⠀should⠀remain⠀clean⠀and⠀restrained,⠀not⠀oratorical.⠀Avoid⠀magical⠀events⠀unless⠀the⠀story's⠀world⠀explicitly⠀includes⠀them;⠀the⠀style's⠀\"marvelous⠀treated⠀as⠀ordinary\"⠀is⠀not⠀a⠀license⠀to⠀add⠀supernatural⠀facts.⠀If⠀the⠀story⠀does⠀include⠀a⠀marvelous⠀element,⠀treat⠀it⠀as⠀natural⠀within⠀that⠀canon⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀social⠀testimony⠀realistic⠀around⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀redemptive⠀climax.⠀The⠀chronicle⠀may⠀end⠀at⠀the⠀moment⠀a⠀witness⠀decides⠀to⠀remember⠀publicly,⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀list⠀is⠀posted,⠀or⠀when⠀a⠀person⠀leaves⠀the⠀village.⠀The⠀important⠀result⠀is⠀that⠀the⠀historical⠀institution⠀has⠀become⠀more⠀intelligible⠀through⠀ordinary⠀lives.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nUse⠀fast,⠀direct⠀paragraphs⠀built⠀around⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀clear⠀spatial⠀beats.⠀Open⠀a⠀scene⠀by⠀naming⠀the⠀immediate⠀place⠀and⠀the⠀person's⠀practical⠀position:⠀the⠀bench⠀where⠀a⠀tenant⠀waits,⠀the⠀counter⠀where⠀a⠀fee⠀is⠀paid,⠀the⠀road⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀crossed⠀before⠀dark.⠀Keep⠀movement⠀easy⠀to⠀follow:⠀a⠀step⠀toward⠀the⠀door,⠀a⠀paper⠀placed⠀on⠀the⠀desk,⠀a⠀glance⠀at⠀the⠀wall⠀clock.\n\nBreak⠀paragraphs⠀around⠀concrete⠀actions,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀private⠀response.⠀A⠀social⠀humiliation⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀visible⠀stage:⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀bow,⠀the⠀hand⠀too⠀slow⠀to⠀take⠀the⠀receipt,⠀the⠀chair⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀offered.⠀After⠀such⠀a⠀beat,⠀give⠀one⠀short⠀interior⠀line⠀that⠀is⠀specific⠀to⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀the⠀period,⠀not⠀an⠀explanatory⠀essay.⠀For⠀example,⠀a⠀clerk⠀may⠀think⠀that⠀the⠀wrong⠀person⠀is⠀being⠀thanked;⠀a⠀tenant⠀may⠀notice⠀that⠀a⠀written⠀figure⠀is⠀smaller⠀than⠀the⠀spoken⠀one.\n\nUse⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀irony⠀through⠀plain⠀report.⠀Do⠀not⠀say⠀\"the⠀official⠀was⠀cruel.\"⠀Show⠀the⠀official⠀praising⠀the⠀very⠀rule⠀that⠀causes⠀the⠀harm,⠀or⠀thanking⠀a⠀family⠀for⠀their⠀patience⠀while⠀recording⠀the⠀penalty.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator⠀or⠀focal⠀character⠀register⠀the⠀gap⠀without⠀announcing⠀it.⠀The⠀clean⠀sentence⠀order⠀lets⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀the⠀institution⠀at⠀work.\n\nHandle⠀unfamiliar⠀terms⠀efficiently.⠀If⠀a⠀historical⠀object,⠀office,⠀or⠀fee⠀is⠀not⠀likely⠀to⠀be⠀known,⠀give⠀one⠀concrete⠀clause:⠀what⠀it⠀looks⠀like,⠀who⠀must⠀use⠀it,⠀or⠀what⠀happens⠀after⠀it⠀is⠀paid.⠀Do⠀not⠀pause⠀for⠀a⠀long⠀historical⠀note.⠀The⠀scene's⠀purpose⠀is⠀not⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀whole⠀period⠀but⠀to⠀make⠀one⠀particular⠀constraint⠀feel⠀immediate.\n\nResponse⠀beats⠀should⠀follow⠀the⠀actual⠀stakes⠀of⠀the⠀situation,⠀not⠀a⠀formula.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀answer⠀quickly⠀out⠀of⠀fear,⠀remain⠀silent⠀out⠀of⠀habit,⠀or⠀speak⠀the⠀expected⠀words⠀while⠀noticing⠀something⠀else.⠀First⠀person,⠀comedy,⠀a⠀young⠀cast,⠀and⠀a⠀cliffhanger⠀are⠀not⠀required.⠀If⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀close⠀third-person,⠀keep⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀limitations⠀honest:⠀what⠀they⠀see,⠀hear,⠀and⠀can⠀infer⠀from⠀their⠀position.\n\nEnd⠀the⠀response⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point:⠀a⠀door⠀closing,⠀a⠀phrase⠀repeated,⠀a⠀number⠀written⠀down,⠀a⠀decision⠀deferred.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀dramatic⠀cut⠀on⠀every⠀scene.⠀The⠀effect⠀should⠀be⠀that⠀a⠀single⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀has⠀made⠀the⠀wider⠀historical⠀institution⠀visible⠀and⠀exact.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀sees⠀plainly⠀and⠀without⠀consolation,⠀but⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀move⠀by⠀shaped⠀attention⠀rather⠀than⠀report.⠀Begin⠀with⠀a⠀concrete⠀historical⠀act—waiting⠀for⠀a⠀permit,⠀carrying⠀a⠀written⠀complaint,⠀selling⠀a⠀parcel,⠀receiving⠀a⠀ration—and⠀let⠀one⠀object⠀recur⠀across⠀the⠀paragraph:⠀the⠀paper⠀in⠀a⠀clerk's⠀hand,⠀the⠀mud⠀on⠀a⠀threshold,⠀the⠀queue⠀of⠀people⠀outside⠀a⠀yard.⠀The⠀object⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀the⠀social⠀position,⠀not⠀imported⠀for⠀decoration.\n\nBuild⠀rhythm⠀by⠀return⠀and⠀variation.⠀Describe⠀the⠀object⠀once⠀as⠀it⠀appears,⠀return⠀to⠀it⠀after⠀a⠀small⠀act⠀changes⠀its⠀meaning,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀plain⠀sentence⠀interrupt⠀the⠀pattern.⠀The⠀plain⠀sentence⠀should⠀be⠀syntactically⠀shorter⠀and⠀factually⠀bare—'The⠀clerk⠀did⠀not⠀look⠀up'⠀or⠀'The⠀paper⠀was⠀still⠀in⠀his⠀hand'—so⠀that⠀it⠀cuts⠀the⠀accumulating⠀image⠀without⠀becoming⠀an⠀explanation.⠀Do⠀not⠀moralize.⠀The⠀institution⠀may⠀remain⠀unnamed⠀or⠀observed⠀only⠀through⠀its⠀counter,⠀forms,⠀or⠀delay.\n\nUse⠀an⠀image⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands.⠀A⠀comparison⠀may⠀expand⠀a⠀perception⠀but⠀must⠀stay⠀tied⠀to⠀what⠀this⠀character⠀in⠀this⠀setting⠀can⠀actually⠀see⠀or⠀remember.⠀If⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀an⠀official's⠀clean⠀hands,⠀the⠀image⠀may⠀suggest⠀the⠀many⠀other⠀hands⠀that⠀carried⠀the⠀dirt;⠀if⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀a⠀child⠀holding⠀a⠀piece⠀of⠀paper,⠀the⠀repetition⠀can⠀faintly⠀connect⠀one⠀document⠀to⠀another.⠀Let⠀these⠀connections⠀be⠀felt⠀rather⠀than⠀announced.⠀An⠀elegiac⠀tone⠀arises⠀from⠀the⠀distance⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀expected⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀act⠀actually⠀amounts⠀to,⠀not⠀from⠀adjectives⠀of⠀sadness.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀sparse⠀and⠀exact.⠀When⠀a⠀speaker⠀says⠀something⠀ordinary,⠀let⠀the⠀prose⠀notice⠀the⠀word's⠀social⠀function—a⠀clerk's⠀'next'⠀that⠀ends⠀a⠀petition,⠀a⠀relative's⠀'still⠀here'⠀that⠀admits⠀a⠀longer⠀absence.⠀The⠀narrator's⠀own⠀thought⠀may⠀enlarge⠀the⠀moment,⠀but⠀it⠀remains⠀an⠀observation⠀of⠀damage,⠀not⠀a⠀celebration⠀of⠀endurance.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀historical⠀act⠀reaches⠀an⠀ordinary⠀pause:⠀the⠀form⠀is⠀accepted,⠀the⠀queue⠀moves,⠀the⠀object⠀is⠀handed⠀over⠀or⠀put⠀away.⠀Let⠀the⠀rhythm⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀weight;⠀no⠀summary⠀paragraph⠀should⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀scene⠀meant.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nLet⠀the⠀narrator⠀measure⠀an⠀ordinary⠀present⠀against⠀a⠀remembered⠀particular⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀historical⠀world:⠀a⠀room⠀now⠀used⠀for⠀a⠀different⠀purpose,⠀a⠀path⠀no⠀longer⠀walked⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀hour,⠀a⠀phrase⠀once⠀repeated⠀and⠀now⠀heard⠀in⠀a⠀new⠀way.⠀Begin⠀with⠀the⠀present⠀scene⠀and⠀its⠀work,⠀not⠀with⠀a⠀declaration⠀of⠀loss.⠀Show⠀the⠀difference⠀through⠀one⠀small⠀irreversible⠀change—a⠀gate⠀repaired,⠀a⠀name⠀removed⠀from⠀a⠀register,⠀a⠀younger⠀person⠀performing⠀a⠀duty⠀the⠀narrator⠀once⠀performed.⠀The⠀remembrance⠀may⠀arrive⠀mid-scene⠀and⠀interrupt⠀the⠀action⠀briefly,⠀but⠀it⠀returns⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀with⠀altered⠀attention.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀change⠀as⠀decline⠀or⠀improvement;⠀let⠀the⠀weight⠀come⠀from⠀coexistence:⠀the⠀remembered⠀act⠀remains⠀vivid,⠀but⠀the⠀conditions⠀that⠀made⠀it⠀possible⠀are⠀gone.\n\nUse⠀reflection⠀as⠀an⠀observation,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀psychological⠀thesis.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀remembers⠀a⠀person,⠀recall⠀an⠀actual⠀object,⠀sentence,⠀or⠀gesture⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀of⠀their⠀character.⠀A⠀dead⠀colleague⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀through⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀folded⠀a⠀letter;⠀a⠀former⠀arrangement⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀through⠀a⠀bowl⠀no⠀one⠀now⠀fills.⠀Keep⠀the⠀historical⠀institution⠀visible⠀in⠀these⠀details:⠀the⠀loss⠀is⠀also⠀a⠀loss⠀of⠀function,⠀tenancy,⠀permission,⠀or⠀standing.⠀Ordinary⠀pleasure⠀can⠀remain⠀exact—a⠀fresh⠀load⠀of⠀fuel,⠀a⠀familiar⠀voice⠀across⠀a⠀yard—without⠀being⠀immediately⠀undercut.⠀The⠀sign⠀of⠀change⠀appears⠀in⠀the⠀arrangement⠀or⠀object,⠀not⠀in⠀a⠀compulsory⠀closing⠀sentence.\n\nMaintain⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀clean⠀language.⠀One⠀precise⠀sentence⠀can⠀state⠀the⠀narrator's⠀awareness;⠀additional⠀sentences⠀can⠀extend⠀it,⠀but⠀they⠀should⠀not⠀accumulate⠀synonyms⠀for⠀sadness.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀let⠀a⠀speaker⠀accept⠀a⠀change⠀as⠀normal⠀while⠀the⠀narrator⠀privately⠀registers⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀closing⠀returns⠀the⠀narrator⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀task⠀or⠀place⠀with⠀the⠀remembered⠀detail⠀still⠀in⠀view:⠀the⠀errand⠀resumed,⠀the⠀phrase⠀heard⠀again,⠀the⠀spot⠀where⠀the⠀remembered⠀action⠀once⠀happened.⠀The⠀past⠀is⠀seen⠀beside⠀the⠀present,⠀and⠀the⠀difference⠀is⠀allowed⠀to⠀remain.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀a⠀framed⠀tale:⠀a⠀teller⠀is⠀present⠀at⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀an⠀evening⠀gathering⠀or⠀in⠀a⠀waiting⠀room⠀and⠀relates⠀an⠀incident⠀from⠀the⠀same⠀historical⠀community.⠀The⠀incident⠀centers⠀on⠀an⠀ordinary⠀exchange—an⠀appeal⠀to⠀an⠀official,⠀a⠀disputed⠀measure,⠀a⠀marriage⠀negotiation,⠀a⠀debt—so⠀that⠀the⠀expected⠀honor⠀or⠀generosity⠀is⠀tested⠀by⠀actual⠀material⠀life.⠀The⠀storyteller⠀may⠀pause⠀to⠀address⠀a⠀hearer,⠀but⠀the⠀moral⠀is⠀never⠀delivered⠀as⠀a⠀summary.⠀Let⠀the⠀audience's⠀reaction⠀supply⠀interpretation:⠀a⠀listener⠀asks⠀about⠀the⠀clerk's⠀salary,⠀a⠀child⠀mishears⠀a⠀word,⠀an⠀older⠀hearer⠀says⠀the⠀same⠀thing⠀happened⠀before.\n\nInside⠀the⠀tale,⠀keep⠀the⠀narrator⠀close⠀to⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀seen⠀and⠀known.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀invokes⠀a⠀proverb,⠀custom,⠀or⠀religious⠀phrase,⠀let⠀another⠀character's⠀practical⠀need⠀reveal⠀its⠀limits⠀without⠀satire⠀becoming⠀clownish.⠀The⠀formality⠀of⠀speech⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀occasion:⠀a⠀petitioner⠀may⠀use⠀courteous⠀language⠀while⠀the⠀official's⠀reply⠀remains⠀purely⠀administrative.⠀Recurrence⠀is⠀functional—the⠀same⠀request⠀repeated⠀at⠀two⠀doors,⠀the⠀same⠀phrase⠀returned⠀with⠀a⠀different⠀meaning,⠀the⠀same⠀coin⠀changing⠀value.⠀Give⠀the⠀frame⠀and⠀the⠀tale⠀different⠀textures:⠀the⠀frame⠀plain⠀and⠀immediate,⠀with⠀short⠀exchanges⠀and⠀practical⠀interruptions;⠀the⠀tale⠀more⠀elaborated⠀when⠀a⠀moment⠀becomes⠀emblematic,⠀its⠀sentences⠀allowed⠀to⠀expand⠀around⠀the⠀repeated⠀request⠀or⠀the⠀withheld⠀answer.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀region⠀and⠀language⠀concrete⠀through⠀the⠀actual⠀terms⠀of⠀the⠀setting:⠀seating⠀arrangements,⠀modes⠀of⠀address,⠀the⠀food⠀or⠀heat,⠀the⠀route⠀to⠀the⠀office,⠀not⠀through⠀imported⠀exotica.⠀The⠀teller's⠀own⠀position⠀colors⠀the⠀account;⠀a⠀shopkeeper⠀and⠀a⠀refugee⠀would⠀notice⠀different⠀details.⠀Neither⠀mysticism⠀nor⠀a⠀sweeping⠀honor⠀code⠀is⠀required.⠀End⠀with⠀the⠀frame⠀in⠀view:⠀a⠀hearer⠀asks⠀a⠀practical⠀question,⠀the⠀teller⠀accepts⠀correction⠀on⠀a⠀detail,⠀or⠀the⠀quarrel⠀about⠀the⠀story's⠀meaning⠀continues⠀after⠀the⠀tale⠀ends.⠀The⠀social⠀damage⠀remains⠀particular,⠀while⠀the⠀retelling⠀itself⠀becomes⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀community⠀handles,⠀mocks,⠀or⠀quietly⠀admits⠀what⠀it⠀already⠀knows.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀a⠀few⠀details⠀and⠀let⠀their⠀repetition⠀do⠀the⠀institutional⠀work.⠀Choose⠀one⠀object⠀that⠀marks⠀the⠀social⠀relation⠀in⠀the⠀historical⠀setting—a⠀stool,⠀a⠀stamp,⠀a⠀horse,⠀a⠀receipt—and⠀one⠀quality⠀of⠀speech,⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀repeated⠀refusal⠀phrase⠀or⠀a⠀title⠀that⠀is⠀never⠀corrected.⠀Describe⠀the⠀first⠀encounter⠀briefly.⠀Then⠀show⠀the⠀same⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀later,⠀when⠀the⠀practical⠀situation⠀has⠀changed.⠀The⠀change⠀earns⠀the⠀inference;⠀no⠀explanatory⠀sentence⠀is⠀needed.⠀If⠀a⠀narrator⠀judges,⠀make⠀the⠀judgment⠀concrete:⠀instead⠀of⠀saying⠀the⠀official⠀felt⠀superior,⠀show⠀him⠀wiping⠀the⠀edge⠀of⠀the⠀desk⠀before⠀answering.\n\nUse⠀direct⠀clauses⠀and⠀brief⠀paragraphs,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀causality⠀intact.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀wait,⠀then⠀see⠀a⠀door⠀close,⠀then⠀walk⠀back;⠀the⠀order⠀itself⠀supplies⠀the⠀meaning.⠀Do⠀not⠀delete⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀connects⠀the⠀detail⠀to⠀the⠀outcome.⠀If⠀the⠀reader⠀must⠀infer⠀why⠀a⠀petitioner⠀turns⠀away,⠀retain⠀the⠀specific⠀sign—the⠀name⠀omitted⠀from⠀a⠀list,⠀the⠀bowl⠀passed⠀without⠀being⠀filled—rather⠀than⠀cutting⠀it.⠀Dialogue⠀can⠀carry⠀an⠀essential⠀reason,⠀but⠀should⠀not⠀become⠀the⠀only⠀carrier;⠀the⠀narrator⠀may⠀silently⠀notice⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀a⠀speaker⠀ignores.\n\nLet⠀each⠀character's⠀access⠀remain⠀consistent.⠀One⠀person⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀folded⠀document;⠀another⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀it⠀says.⠀The⠀prose⠀should⠀not⠀add⠀a⠀psychological⠀portrait,⠀but⠀a⠀focal⠀person⠀may⠀notice⠀what⠀an⠀object⠀costs,⠀what⠀work⠀produced⠀it,⠀or⠀what⠀it⠀means⠀that⠀no⠀one⠀asks.⠀Humor⠀and⠀irony⠀may⠀be⠀present⠀in⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀withheld⠀expected⠀phrase,⠀or⠀an⠀official's⠀small⠀act⠀of⠀propriety,⠀but⠀they⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀its⠀functional⠀pause:⠀the⠀door⠀closes,⠀the⠀paper⠀is⠀not⠀returned,⠀or⠀the⠀person⠀resumes⠀walking.⠀The⠀restraint⠀lets⠀the⠀damage⠀settle⠀without⠀a⠀concluding⠀judgment.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀close⠀third⠀person⠀or⠀another⠀authorized⠀perspective⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀supplied⠀cast,⠀moving⠀among⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀sees,⠀does,⠀hears,⠀and⠀privately⠀understands.⠀Begin⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀an⠀ordinary⠀historical⠀activity⠀whose⠀institutional⠀dimension⠀is⠀initially⠀unstated:⠀inspecting⠀a⠀share⠀of⠀goods,⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀stretcher,⠀delivering⠀an⠀application,⠀sitting⠀through⠀a⠀formal⠀greeting.⠀Let⠀the⠀world⠀be⠀made⠀of⠀period-specific⠀limits,⠀not⠀romantic⠀clutter.⠀Show⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀journey,⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀a⠀bell⠀or⠀a⠀clerk's⠀return,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀stamp⠀or⠀a⠀pass,⠀through⠀events⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀descriptive⠀inventory.⠀Paragraph⠀transitions⠀follow⠀attention⠀naturally;⠀when⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀recalls⠀an⠀earlier⠀visit,⠀the⠀memory⠀arises⠀from⠀a⠀sensory⠀or⠀practical⠀trigger⠀in⠀the⠀present.\n\nUse⠀the⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀profile⠀as⠀an⠀attitude⠀toward⠀selection.⠀A⠀speaker's⠀ordinary⠀acceptance—'we⠀have⠀always⠀done⠀it⠀this⠀way'—can⠀be⠀reported⠀without⠀comment,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀quiet⠀recognition⠀of⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀can⠀be⠀rendered⠀in⠀plain⠀interior⠀prose.⠀Avoid⠀explanatory⠀editorializing;⠀instead,⠀let⠀a⠀second⠀character⠀misunderstand⠀or⠀act⠀complacently,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀privately⠀register⠀the⠀gap.⠀The⠀narration⠀may⠀include⠀the⠀physical⠀detail⠀that⠀reveals⠀the⠀institution's⠀operation:⠀a⠀window⠀through⠀which⠀papers⠀are⠀slid,⠀a⠀bench⠀placed⠀where⠀applicants⠀cannot⠀be⠀seen,⠀a⠀tariff⠀recited⠀without⠀looking⠀up.\n\nLet⠀the⠀paragraphs⠀be⠀sustained⠀and⠀unobtrusively⠀structured,⠀not⠀fragmentary.⠀Dialogue⠀may⠀be⠀interspersed⠀with⠀brief⠀narration⠀of⠀placement⠀and⠀pause,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀dialogue⠀tags⠀as⠀emotional⠀labels.⠀Recollection⠀should⠀not⠀halt⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀prepared⠀case⠀history;⠀keep⠀memories⠀partial⠀and⠀oriented⠀by⠀the⠀immediate⠀need.⠀End⠀with⠀a⠀natural⠀pause⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀attention.⠀The⠀social⠀damage⠀is⠀the⠀accumulating⠀weight⠀of⠀small,⠀specific⠀acts;⠀the⠀novel's⠀flexibility⠀lets⠀that⠀weight⠀come⠀from⠀sequence⠀and⠀recurrence⠀rather⠀than⠀from⠀a⠀summarizing⠀reflection.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nLocate⠀the⠀supplied⠀relationship⠀inside⠀the⠀specific⠀historical⠀institution⠀that⠀makes⠀intimate⠀ordinary⠀decisions⠀exposed:⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀a⠀couple⠀may⠀sit,⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀examined,⠀a⠀rent⠀or⠀permit⠀that⠀names⠀one⠀person,⠀a⠀rumor⠀that⠀changes⠀a⠀welcome.⠀Use⠀scenes⠀that⠀repeat⠀a⠀shared⠀object⠀or⠀phrase⠀across⠀the⠀narrative:⠀a⠀bowl⠀they⠀always⠀fill⠀first,⠀a⠀way⠀one⠀says⠀the⠀other's⠀name⠀when⠀asking⠀for⠀something,⠀a⠀spot⠀where⠀they⠀used⠀to⠀meet.⠀The⠀callback⠀needs⠀a⠀new⠀historical⠀pressure⠀to⠀make⠀its⠀emotional⠀weight⠀concrete—returning⠀to⠀the⠀spot⠀after⠀a⠀price⠀has⠀risen⠀or⠀a⠀person⠀has⠀been⠀forbidden—not⠀a⠀mere⠀nostalgic⠀echo.\n\nLet⠀each⠀partner's⠀acceptance⠀of⠀social⠀facts⠀differ.⠀One⠀may⠀adjust;⠀the⠀other⠀may⠀privately⠀catalog⠀the⠀cost.⠀Neither⠀is⠀automatically⠀right.⠀Their⠀intimacy⠀can⠀include⠀pleasure,⠀irritation,⠀practical⠀cooperation,⠀and⠀the⠀way⠀they⠀warn⠀or⠀spare⠀one⠀another⠀from⠀humiliation.⠀Use⠀dialogue⠀that⠀sounds⠀like⠀the⠀established⠀pair,⠀with⠀small⠀negotiations⠀and⠀repetitions⠀that⠀are⠀meaningful⠀because⠀they⠀have⠀happened⠀before.⠀The⠀narrator⠀should⠀remain⠀aligned⠀with⠀the⠀selected⠀perspective;⠀one⠀character's⠀jealousy⠀or⠀tenderness⠀need⠀not⠀be⠀announced,⠀but⠀may⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀a⠀physical⠀action,⠀an⠀abrupt⠀change⠀of⠀topic,⠀or⠀a⠀decision⠀about⠀whom⠀to⠀wake⠀first.⠀The⠀relationship's⠀promise⠀should⠀be⠀fulfilled⠀through⠀consequences⠀in⠀this⠀historical⠀world—shelter⠀shared,⠀a⠀risk⠀taken,⠀an⠀ordinary⠀arrangement⠀changed—not⠀through⠀a⠀generic⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀confession.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀plain⠀and⠀unsentimental,⠀but⠀the⠀focal⠀interiority⠀should⠀still⠀expose⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀usually⠀keep⠀private.⠀The⠀style's⠀double⠀beat—the⠀familiar⠀small⠀moment⠀and⠀the⠀historical⠀constraint⠀around⠀it—lets⠀Lu⠀Xun's⠀social⠀observation⠀enter⠀without⠀a⠀lesson.⠀A⠀call-and-response⠀phrase⠀the⠀couple⠀uses⠀may⠀recur⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀surrounding⠀episode⠀has⠀given⠀that⠀phrase⠀a⠀new⠀burden.⠀Leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀open⠀where⠀the⠀source⠀is⠀open;⠀the⠀scene's⠀satisfaction⠀comes⠀from⠀the⠀participants'⠀actual⠀knowledge⠀of⠀each⠀other⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀social⠀order,⠀not⠀from⠀an⠀imposed⠀happy⠀shape.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nLet⠀the⠀narration⠀proceed⠀as⠀a⠀chronicle⠀held⠀in⠀the⠀community's⠀voice,⠀but⠀choose⠀ordinary⠀events⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀remembering.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀compact⠀declaration⠀that⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀setting—'In⠀the⠀year⠀the⠀well⠀was⠀blocked,⠀we⠀waited⠀for⠀the⠀water⠀officer'—and⠀then⠀give⠀the⠀particular⠀acts:⠀who⠀carried⠀the⠀petition,⠀who⠀repeated⠀the⠀phrase⠀at⠀the⠀gate,⠀who⠀was⠀blamed⠀when⠀the⠀answer⠀came.⠀Repeat⠀a⠀formula⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀later⠀fact⠀changes⠀its⠀application.⠀A⠀man⠀may⠀be⠀called⠀'one⠀who⠀never⠀waits'⠀and⠀then⠀be⠀shown⠀spending⠀a⠀full⠀morning⠀outside⠀a⠀clerk's⠀room;⠀the⠀epithet⠀becomes⠀bitter⠀without⠀an⠀editorial⠀judgment.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀teller's⠀access⠀historical.⠀If⠀this⠀is⠀a⠀first-person⠀participant,⠀the⠀account⠀may⠀know⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀witnessed⠀and⠀later⠀heard,⠀but⠀not⠀other⠀minds;⠀if⠀the⠀narration⠀is⠀collective,⠀it⠀may⠀preserve⠀different⠀versions⠀rather⠀than⠀settle⠀them.⠀Each⠀remembered⠀consequence⠀should⠀be⠀concrete:⠀a⠀family's⠀bread,⠀a⠀name⠀absent⠀from⠀the⠀register,⠀the⠀pieces⠀of⠀a⠀broken⠀seal.⠀Use⠀recurrence⠀less⠀as⠀heroic⠀patterning⠀than⠀as⠀social⠀rhythm—the⠀same⠀window,⠀the⠀same⠀cold⠀morning,⠀the⠀same⠀proverb⠀repeated⠀by⠀people⠀who⠀no⠀longer⠀believe⠀it.\n\nDo⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀heroic⠀doom⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀diction.⠀Deeds⠀may⠀include⠀kindness,⠀prudent⠀refusal,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀lie⠀that⠀protected⠀someone,⠀and⠀the⠀chronicle⠀may⠀remember⠀them⠀without⠀announcing⠀their⠀meaning.⠀The⠀account⠀can⠀supply⠀a⠀later⠀report:⠀after⠀the⠀well⠀was⠀opened,⠀the⠀officer⠀took⠀the⠀first⠀bucket;⠀after⠀the⠀dispute,⠀no⠀one⠀spoke⠀of⠀the⠀witness.⠀These⠀consequences⠀are⠀the⠀epic's⠀actual⠀treasure.⠀End⠀with⠀an⠀unanswered⠀question⠀or⠀an⠀act⠀that⠀could⠀not⠀be⠀completed,⠀remaining⠀within⠀the⠀historical⠀world;⠀the⠀damage⠀is⠀carried⠀forward⠀by⠀the⠀tale⠀itself.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀Scandinavian⠀social-realist⠀domestic⠀mode:⠀a⠀single⠀household⠀interior,⠀observed⠀with⠀clean⠀unsentimental⠀attention⠀to⠀its⠀material⠀order.⠀Let⠀the⠀room⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀social⠀structure—a⠀bench⠀kept⠀against⠀the⠀wall,⠀a⠀table⠀laid⠀for⠀some⠀and⠀not⠀others,⠀a⠀door⠀that⠀one⠀person⠀enters⠀without⠀knocking⠀and⠀another⠀waits⠀beside.\n\nBuild⠀the⠀scene⠀from⠀ordinary⠀household⠀work:⠀a⠀meal⠀prepared,⠀water⠀carried,⠀a⠀floor⠀swept,⠀a⠀coat⠀taken⠀at⠀the⠀door.⠀Describe⠀the⠀gestures⠀and⠀objects⠀precisely,⠀without⠀interpreting⠀them.⠀Show⠀who⠀performs⠀the⠀work,⠀who⠀receives⠀it,⠀and⠀who⠀remains⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange.⠀The⠀institution⠀becomes⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀choreography⠀of⠀service,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀character's⠀explanation.\n\nWhere⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀let⠀the⠀dialogue⠀stay⠀practical⠀and⠀sparse.⠀A⠀request⠀for⠀water,⠀an⠀instruction⠀about⠀the⠀fire,⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀evening⠀meal.⠀The⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀consider⠀normal:⠀a⠀person⠀thanked⠀or⠀not⠀thanked,⠀a⠀task⠀expected⠀or⠀overlooked,⠀a⠀chair⠀offered⠀or⠀left⠀empty.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀an⠀argument⠀or⠀a⠀moment⠀of⠀protest.⠀A⠀small⠀humiliation⠀may⠀pass⠀almost⠀unnoticed,⠀recorded⠀only⠀in⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀lowered⠀hand,⠀or⠀a⠀silence.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀and⠀material⠀limits⠀of⠀the⠀supplied⠀setting⠀firm.⠀What⠀can⠀be⠀afforded,⠀who⠀may⠀sit,⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀fetched⠀from⠀outside,⠀and⠀how⠀long⠀a⠀task⠀takes⠀all⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀period⠀and⠀place.⠀Do⠀not⠀modernize⠀the⠀household's⠀expectations⠀or⠀invent⠀a⠀universal⠀servant-master⠀template.\n\nAllow⠀brief⠀private⠀feeling⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀is⠀authorized⠀to⠀think.⠀The⠀thought⠀may⠀be⠀as⠀plain⠀as⠀the⠀observation:⠀the⠀water⠀is⠀heavy,⠀the⠀master⠀has⠀not⠀looked⠀up,⠀the⠀bench⠀is⠀still⠀empty.⠀This⠀noticing⠀need⠀not⠀change⠀the⠀action⠀or⠀lead⠀to⠀a⠀decision.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀domestic⠀exchange⠀has⠀been⠀completed⠀or⠀interrupted,⠀without⠀resolving⠀the⠀inequality⠀or⠀turning⠀the⠀scene⠀into⠀a⠀lesson.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀a⠀single⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀period-appropriate⠀place⠀where⠀work,⠀payment,⠀or⠀service⠀occurs.⠀Use⠀a⠀concise⠀scene⠀heading⠀for⠀location⠀and⠀time.⠀Present⠀the⠀characters⠀through⠀visible⠀actions:⠀goods⠀lifted⠀and⠀set⠀down,⠀coins⠀counted,⠀a⠀ledger⠀opened,⠀a⠀door⠀held,⠀a⠀task⠀begun⠀and⠀interrupted.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀action⠀lines⠀denotative.⠀Record⠀the⠀gesture⠀and⠀the⠀object⠀exactly—the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀sack,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀a⠀hand,⠀the⠀pause⠀before⠀a⠀coin⠀changes⠀hands.⠀Do⠀not⠀interpret⠀the⠀gesture⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀line.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀the⠀audience⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀hear:⠀who⠀waits,⠀who⠀is⠀addressed⠀by⠀name,⠀who⠀is⠀not,⠀what⠀is⠀offered⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀withheld.\n\nWrite⠀dialogue⠀that⠀stays⠀on⠀the⠀practical⠀matter.⠀How⠀much,⠀how⠀long,⠀who⠀will⠀come⠀tomorrow,⠀whether⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀settled.⠀Let⠀the⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀accept⠀as⠀normal.⠀A⠀short⠀payment⠀accepted⠀without⠀question,⠀an⠀instruction⠀given⠀without⠀thanks,⠀a⠀request⠀answered⠀only⠀with⠀a⠀receipt.⠀No⠀character⠀states⠀the⠀theme⠀or⠀explains⠀the⠀inequality.\n\nUse⠀cuts⠀or⠀offscreen⠀sound⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀chosen⠀sequence⠀needs⠀them.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀camera⠀commands⠀beyond⠀simple⠀transitions.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀when⠀the⠀transaction⠀is⠀finished,⠀when⠀a⠀request⠀is⠀left⠀unanswered,⠀or⠀when⠀the⠀work⠀continues⠀without⠀acknowledgment.⠀The⠀institution⠀is⠀exposed⠀because⠀the⠀audience⠀sees⠀the⠀exchange⠀as⠀ordinary.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nSet⠀the⠀scene⠀in⠀a⠀single⠀room⠀with⠀period⠀objects⠀that⠀establish⠀the⠀social⠀order:⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀stool,⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀door.⠀Use⠀stage⠀directions⠀to⠀place⠀the⠀characters⠀in⠀relation⠀to⠀these⠀objects.⠀Who⠀sits,⠀who⠀stands,⠀who⠀waits⠀outside⠀until⠀called,⠀and⠀who⠀enters⠀without⠀asking⠀are⠀the⠀scene's⠀first⠀exposition.\n\nLet⠀the⠀dialogue⠀be⠀sparse⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀request⠀for⠀water⠀or⠀a⠀document,⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀the⠀day's⠀work,⠀a⠀formal⠀petition,⠀an⠀answer⠀given⠀without⠀looking⠀up.⠀The⠀speakers⠀reveal⠀their⠀positions⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀expect:⠀a⠀task⠀performed⠀without⠀thanks,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀permission,⠀a⠀favor⠀asked⠀in⠀a⠀voice⠀that⠀already⠀anticipates⠀refusal.\n\nCarry⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀through⠀physical⠀business.⠀A⠀person⠀does⠀not⠀sit⠀on⠀an⠀empty⠀stool.⠀A⠀cup⠀is⠀set⠀down⠀rather⠀than⠀handed⠀over.⠀Two⠀hands⠀do⠀not⠀meet.⠀A⠀door⠀is⠀closed⠀from⠀the⠀outside.⠀No⠀speech⠀explains⠀these⠀distances.⠀The⠀audience⠀reads⠀the⠀hierarchy⠀from⠀the⠀bodies⠀and⠀the⠀room.\n\nKeep⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀blocking,⠀and⠀objects⠀playable.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀film-camera⠀instructions.⠀Monologues⠀or⠀asides⠀are⠀permitted⠀only⠀when⠀they⠀serve⠀the⠀dramatic⠀situation,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀replacement⠀for⠀private⠀thought.⠀End⠀when⠀the⠀business⠀is⠀done⠀or⠀interrupted,⠀leaving⠀the⠀hierarchy⠀visibly⠀intact⠀without⠀a⠀stated⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nStay⠀inside⠀one⠀authorized⠀character's⠀mind⠀during⠀a⠀short⠀historical⠀moment.⠀Let⠀the⠀moment⠀be⠀ordinary⠀and⠀specific:⠀a⠀request⠀made,⠀a⠀task⠀performed,⠀a⠀door⠀opened,⠀a⠀payment⠀counted,⠀a⠀person⠀waited⠀for.⠀Do⠀not⠀announce⠀the⠀social⠀meaning;⠀let⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement⠀reveal⠀it.\n\nBraid⠀present⠀sensation⠀with⠀memory.⠀The⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bowl⠀now⠀and⠀the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀bowl⠀yesterday.⠀The⠀sound⠀of⠀a⠀gate⠀opening⠀and⠀the⠀same⠀sound⠀from⠀a⠀season⠀before.⠀A⠀hand⠀kept⠀open,⠀a⠀bench⠀not⠀sat⠀on,⠀a⠀knock⠀that⠀is⠀or⠀is⠀not⠀required.⠀Let⠀syntax⠀and⠀paragraph⠀shape⠀follow⠀these⠀associations,⠀while⠀keeping⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀present⠀event⠀from⠀recollection⠀or⠀fantasy.\n\nUse⠀clean,⠀unsentimental⠀language⠀even⠀as⠀the⠀associations⠀jump.⠀The⠀character's⠀attention⠀may⠀move⠀from⠀a⠀worn⠀table⠀edge⠀to⠀a⠀face⠀remembered⠀at⠀that⠀table,⠀from⠀the⠀cold⠀of⠀the⠀water⠀to⠀the⠀cold⠀of⠀a⠀morning⠀years⠀earlier.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀what⠀the⠀memory⠀means.⠀The⠀recurrence⠀itself⠀registers⠀the⠀position.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀historical⠀and⠀material⠀details⠀concrete.⠀The⠀character's⠀associations⠀should⠀arise⠀from⠀what⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀knows,⠀handles,⠀and⠀expects⠀in⠀the⠀supplied⠀period⠀and⠀place,⠀not⠀from⠀later⠀historical⠀judgment.⠀The⠀mind⠀may⠀accept⠀an⠀inequality⠀as⠀ordinary;⠀the⠀narrative⠀should⠀not⠀step⠀outside⠀to⠀condemn⠀or⠀diagnose⠀that⠀acceptance.\n\nAllow⠀the⠀flow⠀to⠀stop⠀when⠀the⠀moment⠀has⠀registered—when⠀the⠀sensation,⠀memory,⠀and⠀present⠀act⠀have⠀completed⠀their⠀association.⠀No⠀resolution⠀is⠀required.⠀The⠀small⠀humiliation,⠀if⠀one⠀occurs,⠀may⠀remain⠀unremarked⠀even⠀by⠀the⠀character.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀brief⠀written⠀messages⠀exchanged⠀in⠀the⠀story's⠀period.⠀Use⠀whatever⠀written⠀mode⠀the⠀setting⠀actually⠀supplies:⠀a⠀shop⠀note,⠀a⠀petition,⠀a⠀short⠀letter⠀carried⠀by⠀a⠀servant,⠀an⠀official⠀chit,⠀a⠀message⠀left⠀at⠀a⠀gate.⠀Format⠀each⠀message⠀with⠀a⠀clear⠀sender⠀attribution.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀messages⠀plain⠀and⠀practical.⠀They⠀concern⠀payment,⠀delivery,⠀permission,⠀a⠀request,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀summons.⠀The⠀social⠀meaning⠀emerges⠀through⠀what⠀is⠀written⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀not⠀answered:⠀a⠀request⠀for⠀advance⠀pay⠀receives⠀a⠀note⠀about⠀accounts;⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀discharge⠀receives⠀a⠀receipt;⠀a⠀plea⠀receives⠀only⠀a⠀date.\n\nUse⠀only⠀as⠀much⠀delay⠀as⠀the⠀mode⠀requires—a⠀runner's⠀walk,⠀a⠀day's⠀post,⠀a⠀memorial⠀request,⠀a⠀wait⠀at⠀the⠀gate.⠀Do⠀not⠀fabricate⠀interface⠀events⠀or⠀delays⠀merely⠀to⠀add⠀subtext.⠀Let⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀written⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution:⠀some⠀write⠀formally,⠀some⠀briefly,⠀some⠀not⠀at⠀all.\n\nDo⠀not⠀transcribe⠀private⠀thought⠀in⠀the⠀message⠀lines.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀write⠀what⠀is⠀socially⠀acceptable⠀and⠀leave⠀the⠀rest⠀unwritten.⠀If⠀required⠀private⠀experience⠀must⠀appear,⠀keep⠀it⠀clearly⠀separated⠀from⠀the⠀transcript⠀as⠀nonspoken⠀material,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀transmitted⠀message.⠀A⠀brief⠀narrative⠀frame⠀may⠀set⠀location⠀or⠀time,⠀but⠀do⠀not⠀use⠀it⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀messages'⠀meaning.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀exchange⠀reaches⠀its⠀natural⠀stop:⠀an⠀unanswered⠀request,⠀a⠀final⠀curt⠀reply,⠀a⠀receipt⠀delivered,⠀or⠀a⠀message⠀that⠀never⠀arrives.⠀Leave⠀the⠀institution⠀visible⠀rather⠀than⠀denounced.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nOpen⠀with⠀a⠀precise⠀setting⠀line⠀that⠀establishes⠀the⠀room⠀and⠀its⠀social⠀order⠀through⠀objects:⠀a⠀high-backed⠀chair,⠀a⠀low⠀table,⠀a⠀bench⠀against⠀the⠀wall,⠀a⠀desk,⠀a⠀cup.⠀Attribute⠀all⠀dialogue⠀clearly,⠀and⠀divide⠀speech⠀from⠀narration.\n\nLet⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀inner⠀response⠀be⠀brief⠀and⠀clean.⠀When⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀sees⠀a⠀particular⠀object⠀or⠀posture,⠀the⠀thought⠀should⠀state⠀the⠀fact⠀plainly:⠀the⠀chair⠀is⠀for⠀the⠀master,⠀the⠀bench⠀is⠀not⠀for⠀sitting,⠀the⠀cup⠀is⠀not⠀offered.⠀No⠀anger,⠀no⠀filigree.⠀The⠀recognition⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀social⠀meaning.\n\nUse⠀only⠀the⠀cues⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀posture,⠀a⠀pause⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀cup⠀set⠀down,⠀a⠀hand⠀withdrawn.⠀Do⠀not⠀label⠀every⠀line⠀with⠀an⠀expression⠀or⠀require⠀a⠀visual⠀marker.⠀Let⠀the⠀silent⠀acceptance⠀of⠀who⠀stands⠀and⠀who⠀sits⠀accumulate⠀through⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀plain⠀noticing.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀scene⠀within⠀the⠀historical⠀location⠀and⠀situation.⠀The⠀background⠀and⠀expression⠀cues⠀are⠀purposeful⠀references⠀to⠀the⠀illustrated⠀scene,⠀not⠀executable⠀engine⠀code⠀or⠀a⠀mandatory⠀label⠀on⠀every⠀line.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀menus,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀romance,⠀or⠀images⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀style⠀is⠀selected.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀encounter⠀has⠀completed⠀its⠀ordinary⠀exchange⠀or⠀been⠀interrupted.⠀No⠀forced⠀reconciliation,⠀no⠀stated⠀moral,⠀no⠀branching⠀choice.⠀The⠀hierarchy⠀remains⠀visible⠀without⠀being⠀explained.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiapbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Lu⠀Xun⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nEstablish⠀a⠀concrete,⠀ongoing⠀social⠀situation⠀at⠀the⠀start:⠀a⠀family⠀negotiating⠀debt,⠀apprentices⠀working⠀under⠀a⠀master,⠀patients⠀waiting⠀at⠀a⠀dispensary,⠀or⠀another⠀period-specific⠀arrangement.⠀Name⠀the⠀particular⠀object⠀that⠀will⠀recur—a⠀scale⠀weight,⠀a⠀tally⠀book,⠀a⠀roll⠀of⠀bandages,⠀a⠀chair,⠀a⠀cup—and⠀show⠀its⠀first⠀ordinary⠀use.\n\nIn⠀each⠀new⠀installment,⠀do⠀not⠀restart⠀the⠀situation.⠀Bring⠀back⠀only⠀the⠀one⠀or⠀two⠀details⠀needed⠀for⠀re-entry:⠀the⠀weight⠀that⠀was⠀short,⠀the⠀entry⠀not⠀recorded,⠀the⠀bandage⠀withheld,⠀the⠀chair⠀still⠀empty.⠀Let⠀a⠀character⠀notice⠀the⠀recurrence⠀if⠀the⠀scene⠀permits;⠀the⠀noticing⠀may⠀deepen⠀the⠀situation⠀without⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀a⠀development.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀prose⠀clean⠀and⠀plain,⠀close⠀to⠀observed⠀action.⠀Where⠀it⠀fits⠀the⠀established⠀speaker⠀and⠀occasion,⠀dialogue⠀stays⠀practical:⠀when⠀the⠀installment⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀shop,⠀the⠀clerk⠀answers⠀a⠀question⠀about⠀weight;⠀when⠀it⠀returns⠀to⠀the⠀dispensary,⠀the⠀assistant⠀mentions⠀the⠀missing⠀roll.⠀Do⠀not⠀have⠀a⠀narrator⠀explain⠀what⠀these⠀recurrences⠀mean.\n\nMaintain⠀a⠀readable⠀through-line⠀across⠀replies:⠀what⠀is⠀underway,⠀what⠀changes⠀locally,⠀and⠀what⠀remains⠀available⠀to⠀continue.⠀Recover⠀context⠀briefly⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀helps.⠀Use⠀earned⠀developments⠀and⠀occasional⠀hooks⠀without⠀making⠀every⠀turn⠀a⠀complete⠀miniature⠀chapter⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.\n\nEnd⠀when⠀the⠀current⠀encounter⠀reaches⠀a⠀natural⠀stopping⠀point—the⠀work⠀finished,⠀the⠀request⠀pending,⠀the⠀receipt⠀delivered,⠀or⠀the⠀door⠀closed.⠀The⠀next⠀installment⠀may⠀resume⠀from⠀that⠀point⠀without⠀a⠀forced⠀revelation.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqaa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nLet⠀the⠀specific⠀historical⠀setting⠀determine⠀who⠀may⠀speak,⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀asked,⠀and⠀which⠀obligations⠀make⠀emotional⠀strain⠀hard⠀to⠀resolve.⠀Kishimoto's⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀works⠀through⠀scenes⠀where⠀two⠀people⠀need⠀something⠀from⠀each⠀other—recognition,⠀forgiveness,⠀an⠀explanation,⠀a⠀return—but⠀the⠀period's⠀practical⠀and⠀social⠀order⠀forces⠀them⠀to⠀route⠀that⠀need⠀through⠀indirect⠀speech,⠀delayed⠀meetings,⠀or⠀public⠀forms⠀that⠀cannot⠀carry⠀the⠀whole⠀feeling.\n\nStage⠀the⠀emotional⠀encounter⠀concretely:⠀identify⠀the⠀act⠀that⠀wounded⠀the⠀relationship,⠀make⠀one⠀character⠀approach⠀the⠀other⠀under⠀a⠀particular⠀historical⠀reason,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀conversation⠀move⠀forward⠀not⠀through⠀confession⠀alone⠀but⠀through⠀small⠀requests,⠀refusalsials,⠀silences,⠀or⠀practical⠀errands⠀that⠀carry⠀displaced⠀feeling.⠀When⠀a⠀past⠀wound⠀enters⠀the⠀present⠀scene,⠀anchor⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀material⠀detail⠀available⠀in⠀the⠀the⠀period—a⠀letter⠀someone⠀still⠀carries,⠀a⠀task⠀left⠀unfinished,⠀an⠀absence⠀at⠀a⠀public⠀event—so⠀the⠀memory⠀belongs⠀to⠀this⠀world⠀and⠀not⠀to⠀a⠀modern⠀therapy⠀idiom.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀to⠀show⠀that⠀feeling⠀still⠀changes⠀behavior⠀even⠀when⠀words⠀fail.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀return⠀an⠀object,⠀complete⠀an⠀errand,⠀or⠀stand⠀at⠀a⠀door⠀without⠀saying⠀what⠀she⠀intended.⠀The⠀narration⠀should⠀give⠀the⠀reader⠀the⠀private⠀experience⠀behind⠀those⠀actions—the⠀fear⠀of⠀being⠀refused,⠀the⠀hoped-for⠀reply,⠀the⠀memory⠀that⠀sharpens⠀or⠀silences—while⠀keeping⠀other⠀characters'⠀knowledge⠀limited⠀to⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀observe⠀or⠀infer.⠀Do⠀not⠀require⠀every⠀scene⠀to⠀end⠀in⠀reconciliation.⠀Let⠀strain⠀remain⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀day's⠀work,⠀in⠀a⠀half-finished⠀sentence,⠀or⠀in⠀the⠀way⠀one⠀person⠀avoids⠀an⠀ordinary⠀place.\n\nMake⠀the⠀angst⠀specific⠀to⠀this⠀historical⠀situation.⠀If⠀the⠀setting⠀forbids⠀open⠀accusation,⠀let⠀the⠀pressure⠀come⠀from⠀what⠀must⠀not⠀be⠀said;⠀if⠀social⠀roles⠀make⠀apology⠀dangerous,⠀let⠀apology⠀arrive⠀as⠀a⠀broken⠀promise,⠀a⠀return,⠀or⠀a⠀practical⠀act⠀that⠀acknowledges⠀the⠀wound⠀without⠀naming⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀period's⠀language⠀and⠀constraints;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀contemporary⠀therapeutic⠀vocabulary.⠀The⠀result⠀is⠀an⠀intimate,⠀turbulent⠀treatment⠀of⠀historical⠀relationships:⠀painful⠀admissions,⠀partial⠀comfort,⠀and⠀the⠀continued⠀cost⠀of⠀waiting⠀for⠀someone⠀to⠀speak.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀shared⠀interval⠀with⠀clear⠀speakers⠀and⠀short,⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Establish⠀the⠀historical⠀location⠀and⠀situation⠀through⠀action⠀rather⠀than⠀exposition:⠀a⠀character⠀stands⠀at⠀a⠀particular⠀street,⠀handles⠀a⠀specific⠀object,⠀or⠀reports⠀to⠀someone⠀under⠀a⠀known⠀obligation.⠀Let⠀the⠀setting⠀supply⠀the⠀constraints⠀that⠀make⠀each⠀move⠀meaningful—what⠀may⠀be⠀said⠀publicly,⠀what⠀errand⠀must⠀be⠀completed,⠀what⠀debt⠀or⠀appointment⠀presses⠀on⠀the⠀day.⠀Keep⠀attribution⠀unmistakable,⠀especially⠀when⠀multiple⠀characters⠀are⠀present.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀to⠀make⠀emotional⠀significance⠀visible⠀in⠀physical⠀action⠀and⠀specific⠀dialogue.⠀When⠀a⠀relationship⠀matters,⠀show⠀it⠀through⠀a⠀remembered⠀detail,⠀a⠀changed⠀tone,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀meet⠀someone's⠀eyes,⠀or⠀a⠀gesture⠀that⠀carries⠀a⠀promise⠀from⠀an⠀earlier⠀conflict.⠀The⠀historical⠀period⠀determines⠀what⠀those⠀gestures⠀can⠀be;⠀do⠀not⠀import⠀a⠀special⠀power⠀or⠀tournament⠀structure.⠀Advance⠀the⠀relationship⠀through⠀the⠀present⠀interaction:⠀one⠀character⠀asks⠀for⠀information,⠀work,⠀help,⠀or⠀an⠀explanation,⠀and⠀the⠀other⠀responds⠀according⠀to⠀his⠀own⠀aims⠀and⠀the⠀world's⠀constraints.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀ongoing⠀world⠀active⠀after⠀the⠀submitted⠀exchange.⠀An⠀NPC⠀may⠀continue⠀working,⠀issue⠀a⠀warning,⠀accept⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀leave⠀to⠀attend⠀another⠀matter.⠀The⠀scene⠀should⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀point⠀where⠀the⠀next⠀player⠀reply⠀can⠀naturally⠀continue⠀the⠀interaction—after⠀a⠀question⠀hangs⠀in⠀the⠀air,⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀begun,⠀or⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀interrupted—without⠀requiring⠀the⠀other⠀participant⠀to⠀choose⠀between⠀artificial⠀options.⠀Do⠀not⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀forced⠀cliffhanger⠀or⠀a⠀rhetorical⠀flourish.⠀If⠀the⠀scene's⠀emotional⠀tension⠀remains⠀unresolved,⠀let⠀that⠀tension⠀persist⠀in⠀the⠀situation⠀itself:⠀a⠀character⠀waits⠀for⠀an⠀answer,⠀a⠀debt⠀remains⠀unpaid,⠀or⠀a⠀misunderstanding⠀cannot⠀be⠀corrected⠀until⠀a⠀later⠀meeting.⠀Use⠀the⠀historical⠀world's⠀own⠀unfinished⠀business⠀to⠀provide⠀the⠀continuation⠀point.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqac::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Chinese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nUse⠀the⠀classical⠀or⠀vernacular⠀episodic⠀telling⠀as⠀the⠀primary⠀presentation.⠀Organize⠀the⠀narrative⠀into⠀short,⠀self-contained⠀units⠀where⠀each⠀passage⠀completes⠀one⠀encounter—a⠀dispute⠀at⠀a⠀market,⠀a⠀demand⠀for⠀a⠀debt,⠀a⠀meeting⠀on⠀the⠀road,⠀a⠀confrontation⠀outside⠀an⠀office—and⠀then⠀leaves⠀a⠀new⠀obligation⠀or⠀altered⠀relationship⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀episode.⠀Keep⠀the⠀historical⠀period's⠀institutions,⠀social⠀ranks,⠀and⠀practical⠀constraints⠀visible⠀in⠀every⠀encounter:⠀who⠀may⠀speak⠀first,⠀what⠀goods⠀or⠀services⠀are⠀owed,⠀how⠀a⠀message⠀travels,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀local⠀authority⠀would⠀do⠀if⠀called.\n\nApply⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀to⠀the⠀episodic⠀form.⠀Show⠀each⠀relationship⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀and⠀say⠀under⠀pressure.⠀A⠀rival⠀appears⠀as⠀someone⠀whose⠀prior⠀claim⠀or⠀insult⠀must⠀be⠀answered⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀the⠀period⠀permits;⠀a⠀bond⠀appears⠀when⠀one⠀character⠀takes⠀a⠀risk,⠀shares⠀information,⠀or⠀keeps⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀costs⠀something.⠀Use⠀memories⠀of⠀earlier⠀events⠀to⠀reshape⠀a⠀present⠀encounter.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀recalls⠀a⠀past⠀wound⠀or⠀debt,⠀make⠀that⠀memory⠀change⠀his⠀current⠀choice:⠀he⠀may⠀accept⠀a⠀task⠀he⠀refused,⠀refuse⠀a⠀task⠀he⠀once⠀accepted,⠀or⠀speak⠀more⠀carefully⠀in⠀front⠀of⠀an⠀old⠀enemy.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀special⠀powers⠀or⠀a⠀tournament⠀structure;⠀the⠀emotional⠀stakes⠀must⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀historical⠀order⠀itself.\n\nLet⠀the⠀episodic⠀form⠀manage⠀pacing⠀and⠀information⠀flow.⠀Each⠀unit⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀departure,⠀or⠀a⠀looming⠀appointment⠀that⠀the⠀next⠀episode⠀will⠀answer⠀or⠀postpone.⠀Repetition⠀of⠀names,⠀places,⠀and⠀obligations⠀helps⠀the⠀reader⠀follow⠀the⠀chain⠀of⠀events;⠀a⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀may⠀mark⠀a⠀relationship⠀or⠀a⠀promise⠀but⠀does⠀not⠀prove⠀its⠀truth.⠀The⠀narrative⠀voice⠀should⠀be⠀direct⠀and⠀readable,⠀closer⠀to⠀vernacular⠀storytelling⠀than⠀to⠀an⠀academic⠀translation.⠀Dialogue⠀carries⠀the⠀social⠀force⠀of⠀the⠀period;⠀narration⠀supplies⠀the⠀physical⠀staging⠀and⠀context.⠀Avoid⠀archaizing⠀English⠀and⠀avoid⠀a⠀fixed⠀menu⠀of⠀supernatural⠀or⠀martial⠀clichés.⠀The⠀result⠀is⠀a⠀historical⠀adventure⠀told⠀in⠀linked⠀episodes,⠀where⠀old⠀debts⠀and⠀new⠀encounters⠀move⠀the⠀story⠀forward.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqad::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Compressed⠀Gritty⠀Prose\n\nWrite⠀with⠀forceful,⠀concrete⠀sentences.⠀Open⠀each⠀scene⠀close⠀to⠀the⠀action:⠀a⠀tool⠀in⠀a⠀hand,⠀a⠀debt⠀called⠀in,⠀a⠀figure⠀waiting⠀at⠀the⠀corner,⠀a⠀guard⠀asking⠀for⠀papers.⠀Use⠀the⠀historical⠀period's⠀material⠀reality⠀as⠀the⠀source⠀of⠀pressure—worn⠀leather,⠀a⠀leak⠀in⠀the⠀roof,⠀a⠀ration⠀of⠀bread,⠀a⠀wound⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀cleaned,⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀may⠀not⠀hold.⠀Let⠀institutions⠀and⠀work⠀create⠀the⠀constraints:⠀a⠀guild⠀rule,⠀a⠀military⠀order,⠀a⠀tax⠀collector's⠀schedule,⠀a⠀family's⠀claim⠀on⠀a⠀person's⠀time.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀to⠀make⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀visible⠀through⠀action.⠀Show⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀do⠀for⠀someone,⠀or⠀to⠀someone,⠀in⠀practical⠀terms:⠀he⠀hands⠀over⠀the⠀last⠀coin,⠀she⠀blocks⠀a⠀doorway,⠀he⠀refuses⠀to⠀write⠀a⠀letter,⠀she⠀returns⠀a⠀tool⠀she⠀was⠀told⠀to⠀keep.⠀When⠀memory⠀enters,⠀make⠀it⠀change⠀the⠀present⠀encounter⠀physically—a⠀hand⠀goes⠀to⠀an⠀old⠀injury,⠀a⠀name⠀is⠀spoken⠀differently,⠀a⠀character⠀steps⠀back⠀or⠀steps⠀forward.⠀Do⠀not⠀explain⠀the⠀feeling⠀in⠀abstract⠀terms;⠀let⠀the⠀concrete⠀consequence⠀carry⠀it.⠀A⠀longer⠀thought⠀may⠀appear⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀calculating⠀risk,⠀deciding⠀whether⠀to⠀trust,⠀or⠀reviewing⠀what⠀an⠀old⠀promise⠀will⠀cost⠀now.\n\nVary⠀rhythm⠀deliberately.⠀Short,⠀hard⠀paragraphs⠀can⠀drive⠀a⠀confrontation;⠀a⠀slightly⠀longer⠀passage⠀can⠀slow⠀the⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀character⠀must⠀choose⠀what⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀do.⠀Avoid⠀sentimentality⠀and⠀lengthy⠀exposition.⠀Keep⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀specific⠀and⠀active:⠀the⠀street,⠀the⠀work,⠀the⠀weather,⠀the⠀price⠀of⠀something.⠀Do⠀not⠀turn⠀every⠀scene⠀into⠀survival⠀horror⠀or⠀make⠀every⠀character⠀monosyllabic.⠀The⠀gritty⠀compression⠀serves⠀the⠀relationship⠀conflict,⠀not⠀the⠀other⠀way⠀around.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqae::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Epistolary⠀/⠀Documents\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀documents⠀produced⠀by⠀the⠀characters⠀within⠀the⠀historical⠀period.⠀Each⠀entry⠀must⠀have⠀a⠀clear⠀author,⠀intended⠀recipient⠀or⠀purpose,⠀and⠀time⠀of⠀composition.⠀Use⠀the⠀setting⠀to⠀determine⠀what⠀document⠀form⠀is⠀possible⠀and⠀appropriate:⠀a⠀letter⠀to⠀a⠀relative,⠀a⠀report⠀to⠀a⠀superior,⠀an⠀entry⠀in⠀a⠀shop⠀ledger,⠀a⠀note⠀passed⠀secretly,⠀a⠀petition,⠀a⠀receipt,⠀a⠀will,⠀a⠀confession⠀recorded⠀by⠀a⠀clerk.⠀The⠀author's⠀social⠀position⠀and⠀practical⠀constraints⠀shape⠀what⠀he⠀or⠀she⠀can⠀write,⠀must⠀omit,⠀or⠀dares⠀to⠀address.\n\nUse⠀Kishimoto's⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀documents⠀themselves⠀load-bearing⠀encounters.⠀A⠀rival's⠀formal⠀report⠀may⠀hide⠀a⠀threat⠀in⠀polite⠀phrasing;⠀a⠀friend's⠀brief⠀note⠀may⠀include⠀the⠀one⠀sentence⠀that⠀asks⠀for⠀help⠀without⠀saying⠀the⠀word.⠀Show⠀bonds⠀through⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀chooses⠀to⠀record:⠀the⠀name⠀included⠀in⠀a⠀list,⠀the⠀promise⠀repeated,⠀the⠀request⠀for⠀news⠀that⠀is⠀not⠀answered.⠀Let⠀memories⠀enter⠀through⠀references⠀to⠀past⠀events⠀that⠀the⠀writer⠀assumes⠀the⠀reader⠀knows,⠀or⠀through⠀a⠀detail⠀whose⠀significance⠀emerges⠀only⠀when⠀compared⠀with⠀another⠀document.⠀An⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀may⠀be⠀visible⠀only⠀as⠀a⠀gap:⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀was⠀not⠀sent,⠀a⠀page⠀torn⠀out,⠀a⠀line⠀crossed⠀through.\n\nUse⠀the⠀document⠀sequence⠀to⠀manage⠀revelation⠀and⠀continuity.⠀Gaps⠀between⠀entries⠀may⠀mark⠀the⠀time⠀it⠀takes⠀for⠀a⠀message⠀to⠀travel⠀or⠀for⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀be⠀made.⠀Conflicting⠀accounts⠀should⠀be⠀attributed⠀to⠀their⠀sources⠀and⠀resolved⠀only⠀when⠀the⠀record⠀itself⠀permits;⠀do⠀not⠀add⠀an⠀omniscient⠀paragraph⠀explaining⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀really⠀means.⠀A⠀material⠀detail—a⠀seal,⠀a⠀watermark,⠀a⠀different⠀handwriting,⠀a⠀smear—can⠀carry⠀weight⠀without⠀being⠀underlined.⠀Preserve⠀readable⠀continuity⠀by⠀connecting⠀documents⠀through⠀their⠀recipients,⠀subjects,⠀or⠀references⠀to⠀a⠀common⠀event.⠀Do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀through⠀every⠀available⠀format;⠀use⠀the⠀specific⠀form⠀the⠀scene⠀calls⠀for.⠀The⠀result⠀is⠀a⠀history⠀told⠀through⠀what⠀people⠀wrote,⠀concealed,⠀and⠀saved,⠀where⠀old⠀debts⠀and⠀loyalties⠀remain⠀legible⠀in⠀the⠀records.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqaf::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Fluffy⠀/⠀Comforting\n\nUse⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀to⠀locate⠀comfort⠀in⠀particular,⠀period-appropriate⠀acts⠀of⠀care.⠀Instead⠀of⠀a⠀generic⠀reassurance,⠀show⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀does⠀for⠀another:⠀he⠀saves⠀a⠀portion⠀of⠀food,⠀she⠀mends⠀a⠀sleeve⠀without⠀being⠀asked,⠀he⠀walks⠀a⠀longer⠀route⠀to⠀accompany⠀someone⠀home,⠀she⠀shares⠀a⠀blanket⠀on⠀a⠀cold⠀evening.⠀Let⠀familiar⠀preferences⠀carry⠀warmth—the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀takes⠀tea,⠀the⠀place⠀he⠀always⠀pauses⠀at⠀the⠀market,⠀the⠀song⠀she⠀hums⠀while⠀working.⠀Small⠀pleasures⠀matter⠀because⠀this⠀period⠀makes⠀them⠀scarce⠀or⠀deliberate.\n\nApply⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀to⠀the⠀relationship⠀itself.⠀Show⠀the⠀bond⠀through⠀action⠀and⠀dialogue⠀that⠀reveal⠀long⠀familiarity:⠀a⠀joke⠀based⠀on⠀a⠀shared⠀memory,⠀a⠀gentle⠀correction,⠀an⠀easy⠀silence,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀together⠀without⠀discussion.⠀Let⠀affection⠀be⠀sincere⠀without⠀forcing⠀a⠀confession.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀express⠀care⠀by⠀bringing⠀an⠀extra⠀portion,⠀remembering⠀a⠀name,⠀or⠀simply⠀staying⠀when⠀leaving⠀would⠀be⠀easier.⠀Keep⠀personality⠀and⠀privacy⠀intact;⠀one⠀person⠀may⠀be⠀reserved,⠀another⠀may⠀tease,⠀and⠀a⠀disagreement⠀may⠀be⠀ordinary⠀friction⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀crisis.⠀Comfort⠀does⠀not⠀remove⠀the⠀established⠀problems⠀of⠀the⠀world—war,⠀poverty,⠀distance,⠀or⠀the⠀next⠀day's⠀work—but⠀it⠀gives⠀the⠀characters⠀a⠀moment⠀where⠀those⠀problems⠀are⠀held⠀at⠀bay⠀by⠀someone's⠀deliberate⠀kindness.\n\nUse⠀the⠀historical⠀setting's⠀routines⠀to⠀structure⠀the⠀warm⠀scene:⠀the⠀preparation⠀of⠀food,⠀the⠀cleaning⠀of⠀tools,⠀the⠀closing⠀of⠀a⠀shop,⠀the⠀care⠀of⠀children,⠀the⠀walk⠀to⠀a⠀well⠀or⠀a⠀temple,⠀the⠀sharing⠀of⠀news⠀at⠀day's⠀end.⠀Let⠀the⠀narration⠀notice⠀textures,⠀sounds,⠀and⠀small⠀details⠀that⠀make⠀the⠀moment⠀feel⠀lived.⠀Avoid⠀sentimental⠀excess⠀and⠀modern⠀therapeutic⠀vocabulary.⠀The⠀scene⠀may⠀end⠀while⠀the⠀warmth⠀is⠀still⠀present,⠀leaving⠀the⠀reader⠀with⠀the⠀sense⠀that⠀this⠀particular⠀comfort⠀will⠀carry⠀into⠀the⠀next⠀difficulty⠀without⠀needing⠀to⠀name⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqag::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Formal⠀Literary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀with⠀composed,⠀deliberately⠀structured⠀paragraphs.⠀Use⠀transitions⠀that⠀carry⠀the⠀reader⠀from⠀a⠀physical⠀action⠀to⠀its⠀social⠀meaning:⠀a⠀quarrel⠀in⠀a⠀workshop⠀becomes⠀a⠀question⠀of⠀rank⠀and⠀obligation;⠀a⠀shared⠀meal⠀becomes⠀a⠀negotiation⠀between⠀households;⠀a⠀walk⠀across⠀a⠀district⠀becomes⠀a⠀map⠀of⠀old⠀alliances⠀and⠀dangers.⠀Maintain⠀enough⠀narrative⠀distance⠀to⠀place⠀each⠀scene⠀in⠀the⠀historical⠀period's⠀social⠀order,⠀but⠀keep⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character's⠀perceptions⠀and⠀decisions⠀concrete⠀rather⠀than⠀subsumed⠀in⠀abstraction.\n\nApply⠀Kishimoto's⠀clear⠀staging⠀to⠀the⠀formal⠀novel's⠀emphasis⠀on⠀relationship⠀and⠀history.⠀Present⠀each⠀encounter⠀as⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀a⠀personal⠀bond⠀or⠀rivalry⠀is⠀tested⠀by⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions:⠀a⠀debt⠀redeemed⠀or⠀dishonored,⠀a⠀promise⠀kept⠀under⠀public⠀scrutiny,⠀a⠀memory⠀that⠀alters⠀how⠀a⠀person⠀interprets⠀an⠀official⠀record⠀or⠀a⠀neighbor's⠀silence.⠀Show⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀and⠀say,⠀while⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀reveal⠀the⠀larger⠀consequences⠀they⠀cannot⠀yet⠀see.⠀Do⠀not⠀import⠀special⠀powers⠀or⠀a⠀tournament⠀structure.⠀Instead,⠀the⠀dramatic⠀stakes⠀come⠀from⠀the⠀social⠀and⠀material⠀world:⠀inheritance,⠀trade,⠀military⠀command,⠀land,⠀reputation,⠀and⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀choosing⠀one⠀loyalty⠀over⠀another.\n\nDistinguish⠀the⠀narrator's⠀prose⠀from⠀ordinary⠀speech.⠀The⠀dialogue⠀may⠀be⠀plain⠀and⠀period-appropriate;⠀the⠀narration⠀may⠀use⠀longer⠀sentences⠀and⠀a⠀more⠀reflective⠀register⠀to⠀frame⠀motives,⠀histories,⠀and⠀judgments⠀where⠀the⠀chosen⠀narrator⠀permits.⠀Use⠀ceremony,⠀correspondence,⠀or⠀public/private⠀contrast⠀when⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀provides⠀them:⠀a⠀formal⠀audience⠀followed⠀by⠀a⠀private⠀conversation,⠀a⠀letter⠀read⠀aloud⠀and⠀then⠀answered,⠀a⠀public⠀announcement⠀that⠀changes⠀a⠀private⠀plan.⠀Avoid⠀archaic⠀vocabulary⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀assume⠀an⠀aristocratic⠀setting⠀unless⠀the⠀scenario⠀supplies⠀one.⠀The⠀formal⠀architecture⠀is⠀the⠀style,⠀not⠀the⠀cast's⠀social⠀class.⠀The⠀result⠀is⠀a⠀historical⠀novel⠀where⠀Kishimoto's⠀rivalries⠀and⠀bonds⠀unfold⠀within⠀a⠀fully⠀realized⠀social⠀world.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqah::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Framed⠀Oral⠀Storytelling⠀(Arabian⠀Nights-inspired)\n\nGive⠀the⠀telling⠀a⠀fixed⠀seat⠀in⠀the⠀historical⠀world.⠀The⠀occasion⠀is⠀practical,⠀not⠀decorative:⠀a⠀ferry⠀that⠀runs⠀only⠀at⠀dusk,⠀a⠀night⠀watch⠀divided⠀between⠀two⠀people,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀witnessed⠀before⠀a⠀court⠀sits,⠀a⠀household⠀where⠀only⠀this⠀visitor⠀is⠀admitted.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀work,⠀travel,⠀payment,⠀and⠀household⠀rules⠀decide⠀who⠀is⠀present,⠀who⠀may⠀speak,⠀and⠀why⠀the⠀account⠀cannot⠀simply⠀be⠀given⠀tomorrow.⠀Give⠀the⠀listeners⠀something⠀at⠀stake—help⠀to⠀grant,⠀a⠀decision⠀to⠀make,⠀a⠀name⠀to⠀protect⠀or⠀correct—so⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale⠀acts⠀on⠀the⠀outer⠀situation⠀from⠀its⠀first⠀sentence.\n\nLet⠀the⠀teller⠀select⠀and⠀order⠀the⠀past⠀with⠀a⠀purpose⠀the⠀listeners⠀can⠀sense:⠀securing⠀shelter,⠀delaying⠀a⠀verdict,⠀warning⠀a⠀young⠀person⠀off⠀a⠀road,⠀presenting⠀a⠀companion⠀in⠀a⠀particular⠀light.⠀What⠀happened⠀at⠀a⠀border,⠀in⠀a⠀workshop,⠀during⠀a⠀shortage,⠀at⠀a⠀collection⠀is⠀included,⠀shortened,⠀or⠀passed⠀over⠀according⠀to⠀that⠀aim.⠀Ground⠀interruptions⠀in⠀the⠀outer⠀scene—a⠀poker⠀shifted,⠀a⠀child⠀asking⠀about⠀a⠀familiar⠀place,⠀an⠀elder⠀objecting⠀that⠀the⠀version⠀contradicts⠀a⠀record⠀everyone⠀knows—and⠀let⠀the⠀teller⠀adjust⠀what⠀comes⠀next⠀without⠀conceding⠀the⠀floor.\n\nCarry⠀a⠀small⠀number⠀of⠀phrases⠀or⠀objects⠀across⠀the⠀narrative⠀levels.⠀A⠀formula⠀the⠀teller⠀repeats⠀at⠀each⠀hard⠀turn,⠀a⠀receipt⠀passed⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand,⠀a⠀route⠀marker⠀named⠀twice,⠀a⠀garment⠀laid⠀aside⠀at⠀the⠀same⠀point⠀in⠀two⠀tellings:⠀let⠀these⠀recur⠀without⠀explanation,⠀then⠀let⠀a⠀later⠀outer⠀exchange⠀or⠀a⠀second⠀embedded⠀account⠀show⠀why⠀the⠀phrasing⠀changed⠀or⠀the⠀object⠀mattered.⠀Aim⠀the⠀delayed⠀recognition⠀at⠀both⠀the⠀reader⠀and⠀at⠀least⠀one⠀listener⠀who⠀is⠀now⠀in⠀a⠀position⠀to⠀act⠀differently.\n\nTreat⠀memory⠀as⠀a⠀force⠀inside⠀the⠀telling⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summary⠀before⠀it.⠀A⠀face⠀at⠀the⠀fire's⠀edge,⠀a⠀mended⠀tool,⠀the⠀name⠀of⠀a⠀place⠀someone⠀left⠀and⠀did⠀not⠀return⠀to⠀can⠀press⠀an⠀old⠀wound⠀into⠀the⠀teller's⠀choice⠀of⠀detail—what⠀is⠀finally⠀said,⠀what⠀is⠀moved⠀past⠀quickly.⠀Let⠀the⠀tale's⠀climax⠀bear⠀on⠀the⠀outer⠀bond:⠀a⠀listener⠀may⠀refuse⠀a⠀request,⠀offer⠀cooperation,⠀ask⠀the⠀question⠀that⠀had⠀been⠀avoided,⠀or⠀recognize⠀a⠀debt,⠀provided⠀the⠀change⠀grows⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀specific⠀historical⠀relationship⠀and⠀not⠀from⠀a⠀lesson⠀the⠀scene⠀is⠀forced⠀to⠀teach.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀levels⠀legible.⠀Mark⠀the⠀opening⠀and⠀return⠀of⠀an⠀embedded⠀tale⠀with⠀the⠀teller's⠀voice⠀and⠀the⠀room's⠀own⠀signals—light⠀failing,⠀a⠀gate⠀barred,⠀food⠀cooling—so⠀the⠀reader⠀never⠀wonders⠀which⠀world⠀a⠀sentence⠀belongs⠀to.⠀A⠀tale⠀can⠀pause⠀when⠀the⠀teller⠀needs⠀a⠀fact,⠀when⠀a⠀listener⠀objects,⠀or⠀when⠀an⠀outer⠀obligation⠀calls;⠀a⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀with⠀the⠀outer⠀exchange⠀unfinished.⠀If⠀the⠀scene⠀offers⠀it,⠀close⠀on⠀the⠀recurring⠀phrase⠀or⠀object⠀in⠀its⠀changed⠀context,⠀letting⠀the⠀delay⠀show⠀its⠀consequence⠀without⠀settling⠀the⠀decision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqai::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀German-Language⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀documentary⠀and⠀historical-memory⠀prose:⠀a⠀narrator⠀assembling⠀one⠀past⠀event⠀out⠀of⠀records,⠀traces,⠀and⠀the⠀people⠀still⠀willing⠀to⠀speak.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀access⠀in⠀the⠀period—a⠀clerk⠀permitted⠀into⠀an⠀archive,⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀copying⠀papers⠀for⠀a⠀claim,⠀a⠀surveyor⠀sent⠀to⠀measure⠀a⠀disputed⠀boundary—so⠀that⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀consulted,⠀borrowed,⠀or⠀transcribed⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀historical⠀fact.⠀The⠀narration⠀is⠀driven⠀by⠀a⠀present⠀need⠀to⠀understand⠀how⠀a⠀particular⠀action⠀was⠀possible⠀and⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀Keep⠀the⠀syntax⠀plain,⠀letting⠀an⠀occasional⠀long⠀sentence⠀carry⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀findings⠀toward⠀a⠀delayed⠀recognition;⠀avoid⠀bureaucratic⠀stiffness⠀and⠀the⠀cadence⠀of⠀translation.\n\nStage⠀every⠀remembered⠀event.⠀When⠀the⠀reconstruction⠀reaches⠀a⠀past⠀confrontation—an⠀inspection,⠀a⠀departure,⠀a⠀payment⠀refused,⠀a⠀claim⠀pressed—place⠀the⠀people⠀in⠀a⠀specific⠀room⠀or⠀yard,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀record⠀cover⠀only⠀part⠀of⠀that⠀space.⠀Fill⠀the⠀gap⠀with⠀present⠀observation:⠀the⠀width⠀of⠀a⠀doorway⠀two⠀men⠀could⠀not⠀have⠀passed⠀through⠀together,⠀the⠀height⠀of⠀a⠀shelf,⠀the⠀distance⠀a⠀shout⠀would⠀actually⠀carry.⠀Mark⠀the⠀boundary⠀between⠀what⠀a⠀document⠀states⠀and⠀what⠀is⠀inferred⠀from⠀wear,⠀placement,⠀or⠀absence,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀supply⠀dialogue⠀the⠀sources⠀cannot⠀support.\n\nLet⠀an⠀old⠀wound⠀surface⠀as⠀an⠀encounter⠀with⠀evidence⠀rather⠀than⠀as⠀explanation.⠀A⠀descendant,⠀a⠀survivor,⠀or⠀a⠀retired⠀official⠀confronted⠀with⠀a⠀crossed-out⠀name,⠀a⠀dated⠀signature,⠀or⠀a⠀missing⠀page⠀reacts⠀practically⠀first:⠀stops⠀reading,⠀asks⠀who⠀else⠀has⠀seen⠀the⠀folder,⠀turns⠀pages⠀too⠀quickly,⠀corrects⠀a⠀date⠀with⠀unexpected⠀precision.⠀Read⠀the⠀memory's⠀weight⠀out⠀of⠀the⠀choice⠀that⠀follows—whether⠀a⠀copy⠀is⠀allowed,⠀a⠀testimony⠀added,⠀cooperation⠀withdrawn—and⠀make⠀the⠀reconstruction's⠀next⠀step⠀depend⠀on⠀that⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀on⠀a⠀confession⠀the⠀scene⠀has⠀not⠀earned.\n\nUse⠀the⠀comparison⠀of⠀records⠀as⠀the⠀engine⠀of⠀advance.⠀A⠀tax⠀roll⠀and⠀a⠀baptismal⠀register⠀can⠀disagree⠀about⠀who⠀lived⠀where;⠀a⠀witness's⠀season⠀can⠀be⠀made⠀unlikely⠀by⠀the⠀grain⠀price⠀a⠀market⠀ledger⠀preserves.⠀Show⠀the⠀narrator⠀noticing⠀such⠀a⠀contradiction,⠀stating⠀why⠀it⠀matters⠀to⠀ordinary⠀people's⠀possibilities,⠀and⠀then⠀seeking⠀a⠀third⠀source⠀or⠀a⠀material⠀trace.⠀Let⠀some⠀discrepancies⠀stand;⠀where⠀the⠀sources⠀fall⠀silent,⠀say⠀so.⠀The⠀satisfaction⠀the⠀prose⠀offers⠀is⠀a⠀sequenced,⠀readable⠀demonstration⠀of⠀one⠀record⠀qualifying⠀another,⠀not⠀manufactured⠀certainty.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀living⠀parties⠀in⠀motion⠀around⠀the⠀documents.⠀A⠀creditor,⠀a⠀village⠀assembly,⠀a⠀tenant⠀community,⠀a⠀family⠀read⠀the⠀same⠀entries⠀differently⠀because⠀each⠀has⠀a⠀practical⠀stake⠀in⠀what⠀gets⠀recorded.⠀Interrupt⠀the⠀documentary⠀summary⠀with⠀staged⠀encounters—someone⠀asking⠀whether⠀a⠀name⠀will⠀be⠀restored,⠀whether⠀a⠀claim⠀can⠀still⠀be⠀pursued,⠀whether⠀an⠀outsider⠀may⠀see⠀the⠀page—and⠀let⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀govern⠀the⠀answer:⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀copied,⠀who⠀controls⠀the⠀archive,⠀which⠀fee⠀or⠀permission⠀stands⠀in⠀the⠀way.⠀A⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀while⠀permission⠀is⠀still⠀pending⠀and⠀the⠀remembered⠀event⠀only⠀half⠀rebuilt.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqaj::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Gothic-Punk\n\nBuild⠀the⠀story⠀around⠀an⠀inherited⠀authority⠀that⠀survives⠀through⠀ordinary⠀historical⠀mechanisms:⠀a⠀chartered⠀guild⠀holding⠀an⠀urban⠀trade,⠀a⠀family⠀entitled⠀to⠀a⠀river⠀toll,⠀a⠀church⠀court's⠀old⠀jurisdiction⠀over⠀one⠀district,⠀a⠀manor's⠀right⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀market⠀building.⠀Give⠀this⠀power⠀a⠀physical⠀body—shelves⠀of⠀unexamined⠀charters,⠀a⠀toll⠀gate⠀worn⠀hollow⠀by⠀cart⠀hubs,⠀a⠀dye⠀house⠀whose⠀stink⠀is⠀legally⠀protected,⠀a⠀seal⠀in⠀a⠀locked⠀drawer⠀that⠀no⠀longer⠀matches⠀the⠀present⠀ruler—and⠀let⠀that⠀body⠀press⠀on⠀a⠀current⠀encounter:⠀a⠀disputed⠀consignment,⠀an⠀apprentice's⠀contract,⠀a⠀widow's⠀claim,⠀a⠀new⠀tenant's⠀inventory.\n\nStage⠀the⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀as⠀choreography⠀inside⠀these⠀institutions.⠀A⠀character⠀steps⠀between⠀an⠀official⠀and⠀a⠀doorway,⠀lays⠀a⠀hand⠀flat⠀on⠀a⠀ledger⠀before⠀the⠀clerk⠀can⠀open⠀it,⠀returns⠀keys⠀to⠀a⠀table⠀in⠀a⠀deliberate⠀order,⠀drags⠀a⠀workbench⠀across⠀a⠀passage.⠀Each⠀gesture⠀should⠀have⠀a⠀practical⠀consequence⠀the⠀period⠀can⠀enforce—an⠀entry⠀left⠀unrecorded,⠀a⠀fee⠀uncollected,⠀a⠀meeting⠀forced⠀elsewhere—so⠀that⠀advances⠀come⠀from⠀visible⠀choices⠀rather⠀than⠀speeches.⠀Anchor⠀private⠀feeling⠀to⠀the⠀material⠀world⠀when⠀it⠀appears:⠀a⠀scarred⠀table⠀recalls⠀the⠀last⠀inspection;⠀the⠀shape⠀of⠀a⠀clasp⠀identifies⠀a⠀debt⠀before⠀the⠀page⠀is⠀read.\n\nUse⠀social⠀masks⠀that⠀hold⠀in⠀public⠀and⠀can⠀drop⠀only⠀where⠀trust⠀is⠀real,⠀and⠀make⠀trust⠀itself⠀historical.⠀The⠀guild⠀officer⠀defends⠀the⠀charter⠀before⠀the⠀assembled⠀workshop⠀and,⠀in⠀a⠀shuttered⠀counting⠀house,⠀admits⠀the⠀fear⠀of⠀losing⠀it;⠀the⠀priest⠀enforces⠀a⠀fee⠀at⠀the⠀door⠀and⠀quietly⠀shows⠀a⠀family⠀how⠀to⠀evade⠀it.⠀When⠀a⠀mask⠀falls,⠀show⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀change⠀in⠀capability⠀in⠀that⠀moment—a⠀contrary⠀instruction⠀written,⠀a⠀confiscated⠀paper⠀returned,⠀a⠀rival⠀sitting⠀down⠀uninvited.⠀Let⠀the⠀formal⠀manner⠀come⠀back⠀when⠀an⠀outsider⠀enters,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀see⠀why⠀both⠀faces⠀are⠀necessary.\n\nKeep⠀intimacy⠀morally⠀complicated⠀and⠀tied⠀to⠀the⠀old⠀authority.⠀A⠀favor⠀owed⠀to⠀a⠀previous⠀ruler⠀makes⠀a⠀man⠀protect⠀a⠀privilege⠀that⠀impoverishes⠀his⠀neighbor;⠀a⠀family⠀obligation⠀forces⠀cooperation⠀with⠀an⠀official⠀whose⠀harsh⠀methods⠀have⠀nonetheless⠀prevented⠀worse.⠀Explore⠀the⠀entanglement⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀period's⠀people⠀can⠀actually⠀know⠀and⠀expect:⠀how⠀a⠀formal⠀appeal⠀proceeds,⠀what⠀the⠀community⠀says⠀about⠀the⠀authority's⠀methods,⠀whether⠀the⠀current⠀regime⠀has⠀curbed⠀the⠀old⠀right⠀or⠀merely⠀renamed⠀it.⠀Resist⠀resolving⠀the⠀knot⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀old⠀order⠀simply⠀rotten⠀or⠀the⠀protagonist⠀simply⠀right.\n\nMove⠀through⠀the⠀urban⠀fabric⠀where⠀the⠀old⠀authority⠀is⠀thickest—gatehouses,⠀stairwells,⠀covered⠀passages,⠀back⠀rooms,⠀a⠀crypt⠀holding⠀coffins⠀a⠀burial⠀dispute⠀has⠀stranded—and⠀let⠀atmosphere⠀alter⠀how⠀an⠀encounter⠀is⠀experienced:⠀shadow⠀across⠀a⠀doorway⠀can⠀make⠀someone⠀hesitate,⠀cold⠀can⠀lengthen⠀a⠀pause.⠀The⠀cause⠀underneath⠀remains⠀a⠀practical⠀arrangement,⠀not⠀a⠀supernatural⠀one.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀scene⠀itself⠀stops:⠀the⠀response⠀can⠀end⠀mid-negotiation,⠀mid-interruption,⠀or⠀on⠀the⠀beat⠀after⠀a⠀mask⠀has⠀dropped,⠀with⠀the⠀private⠀desire⠀underneath⠀still⠀unresolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqak::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Indian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTake⠀the⠀oral,⠀epic,⠀and⠀frame-tale⠀route,⠀and⠀treat⠀the⠀framed⠀story⠀as⠀a⠀community's⠀working⠀record⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀performance⠀for⠀its⠀own⠀sake.⠀Set⠀the⠀telling⠀where⠀such⠀records⠀carry⠀weight—an⠀assembly⠀gathered⠀before⠀a⠀land⠀decision,⠀a⠀rest⠀house⠀where⠀traders⠀compare⠀routes,⠀a⠀household⠀weighing⠀a⠀marriage⠀proposal,⠀a⠀verandah⠀where⠀an⠀old⠀account⠀of⠀a⠀hard⠀season⠀is⠀repeated⠀to⠀support⠀a⠀claim—using⠀the⠀region,⠀language,⠀and⠀community⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀actually⠀establishes.⠀Give⠀the⠀teller⠀a⠀definite⠀social⠀position:⠀an⠀elder⠀whose⠀versions⠀are⠀usually⠀deferred⠀to,⠀a⠀former⠀servant⠀with⠀exact⠀memory,⠀a⠀woman⠀whose⠀account⠀was⠀never⠀written⠀down.⠀Let⠀the⠀listeners⠀withhold⠀automatic⠀belief,⠀and⠀give⠀a⠀younger⠀focal⠀character⠀a⠀concrete⠀reason⠀to⠀check⠀the⠀story⠀against⠀the⠀tangible⠀world.\n\nStage⠀each⠀embedded⠀episode⠀with⠀clear,⠀followable⠀action.⠀A⠀dispute⠀over⠀a⠀well,⠀a⠀grain⠀payment⠀withheld,⠀a⠀journey⠀that⠀failed⠀because⠀the⠀ferry⠀was⠀not⠀running,⠀a⠀fire⠀in⠀a⠀storeroom:⠀give⠀the⠀episode⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀time,⠀and⠀an⠀ordered⠀sequence⠀of⠀physical⠀acts,⠀so⠀the⠀listener—and⠀the⠀reader—could⠀redraw⠀it.⠀Formulaic⠀phrases⠀may⠀structure⠀the⠀telling,⠀but⠀keep⠀them⠀load-bearing:⠀calling⠀a⠀road⠀\"the⠀road⠀that⠀paid⠀two⠀tolls\"⠀reminds⠀everyone⠀that⠀the⠀story⠀explains⠀why⠀that⠀toll⠀should⠀not⠀be⠀paid⠀now.⠀Afterward,⠀a⠀listener⠀should⠀be⠀able⠀to⠀quote⠀the⠀formula⠀back⠀inside⠀an⠀argument;⠀if⠀it⠀cannot⠀be⠀used⠀that⠀way,⠀cut⠀it.\n\nLet⠀the⠀younger⠀listener's⠀advance⠀depend⠀on⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀document⠀whose⠀retrieval⠀changes⠀how⠀the⠀account⠀is⠀received:⠀a⠀receipt⠀remembered⠀on⠀a⠀high⠀shelf,⠀a⠀boundary⠀stone⠀standing⠀at⠀a⠀different⠀bend⠀than⠀the⠀story⠀placed⠀it,⠀a⠀scribe's⠀written⠀version⠀that⠀contradicts⠀one⠀detail.⠀Stage⠀the⠀retrieval⠀in⠀the⠀material⠀world—climbing⠀to⠀the⠀shelf,⠀untying⠀a⠀box⠀of⠀an⠀ancestor's⠀papers,⠀walking⠀to⠀the⠀site⠀before⠀light⠀fails,⠀paying⠀for⠀a⠀line⠀to⠀be⠀read⠀aloud.⠀The⠀finding⠀should⠀not⠀simply⠀convict⠀the⠀elder⠀of⠀lying;⠀let⠀the⠀oral⠀account⠀gain⠀or⠀lose⠀authority⠀in⠀one⠀specific⠀respect,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀relationship⠀move⠀with⠀it—recognition⠀that⠀the⠀listener⠀no⠀longer⠀needs⠀to⠀be⠀spared⠀an⠀unpleasant⠀truth,⠀or⠀a⠀correction⠀accepted⠀in⠀a⠀way⠀that⠀preserves⠀honor⠀while⠀changing⠀the⠀decision.\n\nRepeat⠀one⠀detail⠀across⠀the⠀levels⠀until⠀its⠀meaning⠀shifts:⠀a⠀particular⠀brass⠀pot,⠀rain⠀damage⠀staining⠀a⠀wall⠀in⠀two⠀tellings,⠀a⠀name⠀spoken⠀with⠀a⠀hitch.⠀Withhold⠀the⠀explanation;⠀after⠀the⠀tale,⠀the⠀listener⠀may⠀notice⠀the⠀same⠀detail⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀household⠀and⠀ask,⠀and⠀the⠀elder⠀may⠀answer⠀with⠀a⠀second⠀short⠀episode⠀or⠀with⠀silence.⠀Let⠀the⠀recognition⠀make⠀an⠀old⠀wound⠀visible—why⠀the⠀elder⠀never⠀enters⠀a⠀certain⠀building,⠀why⠀a⠀sum⠀is⠀never⠀named—and⠀connect⠀it⠀to⠀a⠀real⠀present⠀choice:⠀continuing⠀the⠀journey,⠀accepting⠀the⠀proposal,⠀testifying⠀in⠀the⠀property⠀case,⠀sharing⠀the⠀meal.\n\nWhen⠀practical⠀life⠀interrupts—an⠀arrival,⠀food⠀served,⠀livestock⠀to⠀be⠀checked—return⠀to⠀the⠀outer⠀action⠀before⠀resuming⠀the⠀tale,⠀and⠀keep⠀the⠀levels⠀marked⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀always⠀knows⠀whose⠀voice⠀is⠀speaking.⠀Do⠀not⠀slip⠀into⠀unmarked⠀inner⠀monologue⠀inside⠀the⠀embedded⠀tale;⠀save⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀reflection⠀for⠀after⠀it⠀ends.⠀A⠀response⠀may⠀close⠀with⠀a⠀claim⠀half-examined,⠀the⠀young⠀listener⠀holding⠀the⠀retrieved⠀object,⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀moment⠀to⠀speak—the⠀record⠀still⠀working⠀on⠀the⠀people⠀around⠀it.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqal::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Japanese⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nKeep⠀a⠀situated⠀diary⠀or⠀reflective⠀miscellany⠀written⠀by⠀someone⠀whose⠀station⠀decides⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀recorded⠀and⠀what⠀must⠀be⠀left⠀out:⠀a⠀young⠀household⠀member⠀keeping⠀accounts⠀for⠀an⠀elder,⠀a⠀clerk⠀documenting⠀a⠀journey⠀for⠀a⠀patron,⠀a⠀wife⠀or⠀servant⠀whose⠀notes⠀are⠀private⠀but⠀whose⠀paper⠀and⠀light⠀are⠀limited,⠀a⠀student⠀copying⠀events⠀between⠀practical⠀memoranda.⠀Treat⠀the⠀entries⠀as⠀working⠀documents—dated,⠀sometimes⠀three⠀lines⠀long,⠀interrupted⠀by⠀errands⠀or⠀a⠀knock—shaped⠀by⠀whoever⠀the⠀writer⠀expects⠀to⠀read⠀them.⠀Bring⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀limits⠀only⠀where⠀they⠀touch⠀the⠀telling:⠀what⠀paper⠀costs,⠀when⠀light⠀fails,⠀when⠀someone⠀must⠀be⠀asked⠀to⠀write⠀or⠀read⠀a⠀line.\n\nStage⠀the⠀important⠀events⠀even⠀inside⠀the⠀compressed⠀form.⠀A⠀confrontation⠀in⠀a⠀workshop,⠀a⠀message⠀arriving⠀at⠀a⠀gate,⠀a⠀debt⠀counted⠀out⠀on⠀a⠀mat,⠀an⠀injury⠀treated⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀hand:⠀record⠀the⠀sequence⠀of⠀physical⠀acts⠀first,⠀so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀who⠀moved,⠀what⠀changed⠀hands,⠀and⠀what⠀was⠀left⠀undone.⠀Then⠀let⠀the⠀entry⠀turn⠀to⠀reflection,⠀tied⠀to⠀one⠀concrete⠀thing—the⠀color⠀of⠀a⠀bruise⠀the⠀next⠀morning,⠀a⠀cloak⠀hung⠀up⠀too⠀roughly,⠀a⠀bowl⠀left⠀unwashed⠀by⠀a⠀person⠀who⠀always⠀washes⠀it.⠀The⠀reflection⠀may⠀hold⠀uncertainty⠀about⠀another's⠀motive,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀an⠀earlier⠀encounter,⠀a⠀question⠀the⠀writer⠀never⠀asked.⠀Not⠀every⠀entry⠀needs⠀to⠀explain;⠀a⠀plain⠀note⠀that⠀something⠀happened⠀is⠀itself⠀a⠀voice.\n\nUse⠀omission⠀deliberately.⠀The⠀writer⠀breaks⠀off⠀before⠀recording⠀what⠀an⠀elder⠀said,⠀spells⠀a⠀name⠀oddly⠀to⠀avoid⠀an⠀accusation,⠀inserts⠀a⠀correction⠀above⠀an⠀earlier⠀date.⠀Let⠀the⠀register⠀change⠀with⠀the⠀occasion:⠀a⠀supply⠀list⠀terse,⠀a⠀farewell⠀longer,⠀a⠀punishment⠀recorded⠀formally⠀and⠀indirectly.⠀No⠀universal⠀quietness⠀is⠀required,⠀and⠀no⠀inventory⠀of⠀scenery:⠀use⠀a⠀season⠀or⠀a⠀weather⠀note⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀alters⠀a⠀practical⠀situation—a⠀storm⠀holding⠀a⠀messenger,⠀heat⠀spoiling⠀a⠀medicine,⠀cold⠀making⠀a⠀wait⠀at⠀the⠀gate⠀unbearable—or⠀when⠀the⠀writer⠀ties⠀it⠀to⠀someone's⠀return⠀or⠀absence.\n\nLet⠀relationship⠀conflict⠀arrive⠀at⠀the⠀diary's⠀checkpoints.⠀A⠀companion⠀stops⠀dictating;⠀a⠀creditor⠀asks⠀about⠀a⠀gap⠀in⠀the⠀entries;⠀a⠀family⠀member⠀discovers⠀the⠀book⠀has⠀been⠀read.⠀Stage⠀these⠀present⠀encounters⠀as⠀concretely⠀as⠀the⠀recorded⠀past—the⠀moment⠀the⠀other⠀person⠀picks⠀up⠀the⠀volume,⠀asks⠀whether⠀an⠀event⠀happened⠀differently,⠀notices⠀a⠀page⠀torn.⠀Afterward,⠀show⠀the⠀private⠀effect⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀next⠀entry⠀does⠀not⠀contain:⠀a⠀day⠀left⠀blank,⠀a⠀shift⠀from⠀first⠀person⠀to⠀a⠀formal⠀third-person⠀note,⠀a⠀sudden⠀list⠀of⠀expenses.⠀An⠀advance⠀can⠀come⠀when⠀the⠀writer⠀records⠀a⠀long-avoided⠀fact⠀or⠀retrieves⠀an⠀old⠀entry⠀to⠀settle⠀a⠀dispute;⠀a⠀confession⠀on⠀the⠀page⠀is⠀not⠀required,⠀and⠀a⠀note⠀that⠀a⠀certain⠀drawer⠀is⠀now⠀locked⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀same⠀weight.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀flow⠀readable.⠀Open⠀each⠀response⠀by⠀establishing⠀date,⠀place,⠀and⠀immediate⠀situation⠀in⠀a⠀line⠀or⠀two;⠀break⠀paragraphs⠀where⠀the⠀writer⠀pauses⠀between⠀action⠀and⠀reflection;⠀end⠀where⠀the⠀entry⠀itself⠀breaks—a⠀visitor⠀announced,⠀the⠀writer⠀called⠀away,⠀the⠀ink⠀giving⠀out,⠀or⠀a⠀decision,⠀written⠀or⠀unspoken,⠀not⠀to⠀set⠀down⠀what⠀was⠀just⠀said.⠀An⠀unfinished⠀private⠀note⠀is⠀a⠀legitimate⠀place⠀to⠀stop.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqam::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Latin⠀American⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀testimony⠀and⠀chronicle:⠀a⠀narrator⠀who⠀took⠀part⠀in⠀some⠀of⠀the⠀events⠀and⠀can⠀report⠀the⠀rest⠀only⠀through⠀what⠀neighbors,⠀workers,⠀relatives,⠀and⠀officials⠀have⠀said.⠀Give⠀the⠀assembly⠀a⠀present⠀purpose⠀and⠀name⠀it⠀early—preparing⠀a⠀petition,⠀explaining⠀an⠀absence,⠀settling⠀an⠀inheritance,⠀recording⠀a⠀debt⠀before⠀witnesses⠀forget,⠀walking⠀a⠀route⠀again⠀with⠀people⠀who⠀traveled⠀it—and⠀let⠀that⠀purpose⠀govern⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀seeks⠀out⠀and⠀writes⠀down.⠀Keep⠀the⠀language,⠀community,⠀and⠀history⠀the⠀supplied⠀story⠀actually⠀provides;⠀do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀village,⠀a⠀region,⠀or⠀a⠀political⠀background⠀the⠀source⠀does⠀not⠀name.\n\nWhen⠀the⠀narrator⠀witnessed⠀something,⠀stage⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀physical⠀sequence:⠀who⠀came⠀in,⠀what⠀was⠀set⠀on⠀the⠀table,⠀when⠀the⠀messenger⠀left,⠀how⠀the⠀wound⠀looked⠀the⠀next⠀morning.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀did⠀not⠀witness⠀it,⠀say⠀so⠀through⠀attribution—\"according⠀to⠀the⠀boy⠀who⠀carried⠀the⠀water,\"⠀\"the⠀neighbor⠀says⠀she⠀heard,\"⠀\"the⠀ledger⠀shows⠀a⠀payment⠀but⠀not⠀a⠀name.\"⠀Never⠀slide⠀into⠀another⠀person's⠀interior⠀as⠀though⠀it⠀were⠀known.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀guess⠀at⠀feeling,⠀but⠀present⠀the⠀guess⠀as⠀inference⠀from⠀a⠀look,⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀an⠀object⠀moved⠀out⠀of⠀its⠀place.\n\nLet⠀relationship⠀conflict⠀run⠀through⠀the⠀comparison⠀of⠀accounts.⠀A⠀mother's⠀version⠀omits⠀why⠀a⠀son⠀was⠀sent⠀away;⠀a⠀creditor's⠀ledger⠀contradicts⠀the⠀family's⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀repayment;⠀two⠀witnesses⠀disagree⠀about⠀whether⠀a⠀gate⠀was⠀barred.⠀Do⠀not⠀settle⠀such⠀conflicts⠀by⠀preferring⠀the⠀most⠀sympathetic⠀speaker.⠀Send⠀the⠀narrator⠀after⠀material⠀traces—a⠀half-burnt⠀receipt,⠀a⠀notch⠀cut⠀into⠀a⠀doorframe,⠀a⠀pair⠀of⠀shoes⠀left⠀behind,⠀a⠀grave⠀without⠀a⠀marker—and⠀when⠀a⠀trace⠀confirms⠀or⠀corrects⠀a⠀story,⠀the⠀advance⠀is⠀concrete⠀and⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀historical⠀world.⠀The⠀second⠀encounter⠀that⠀follows⠀can⠀move⠀the⠀relationship:⠀an⠀old⠀anger⠀complicates,⠀a⠀claim⠀is⠀withdrawn,⠀a⠀silence⠀breaks,⠀or⠀nothing⠀yields⠀and⠀the⠀narrator⠀says⠀so.\n\nHandle⠀the⠀many⠀voices⠀as⠀discrete,⠀situated⠀blocks.⠀Introduce⠀each⠀attributed⠀account⠀inside⠀a⠀scene—the⠀speaker⠀sitting⠀by⠀the⠀well,⠀arriving⠀after⠀dark,⠀talking⠀across⠀a⠀courtyard—so⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀follow⠀every⠀shift⠀without⠀a⠀signpost⠀debate.⠀The⠀voices⠀need⠀not⠀each⠀carry⠀a⠀distinct⠀dialect;⠀what⠀must⠀differ⠀is⠀what⠀each⠀person⠀could⠀know:⠀the⠀child⠀reports⠀movement,⠀the⠀clerk⠀amounts,⠀the⠀widow⠀what⠀her⠀husband⠀told⠀her.⠀The⠀narrator⠀may⠀weigh⠀the⠀versions⠀aloud⠀or⠀in⠀private⠀reflection,⠀without⠀flattening⠀them⠀into⠀one⠀official⠀register.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀whole⠀thing⠀a⠀working⠀chronicle⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀finished⠀history.⠀Dates⠀and⠀names⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀uncertainty⠀of⠀oral⠀transmission;⠀a⠀scene⠀already⠀described⠀may⠀be⠀told⠀again⠀when⠀better⠀information⠀arrives,⠀with⠀the⠀earlier⠀version⠀left⠀standing⠀beside⠀the⠀correction.⠀Let⠀the⠀narrator's⠀own⠀remembered⠀wound—returning⠀to⠀a⠀place⠀after⠀a⠀departure,⠀learning⠀of⠀a⠀death,⠀finding⠀a⠀house⠀changed—become⠀an⠀explicit⠀stage⠀in⠀the⠀testimony,⠀and⠀let⠀a⠀present⠀encounter⠀alter⠀what⠀the⠀narrator⠀understands⠀rather⠀than⠀confirm⠀it.⠀Stop⠀where⠀the⠀record⠀actually⠀pauses:⠀a⠀witness⠀called⠀away,⠀a⠀document⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀read⠀until⠀morning,⠀a⠀statement⠀held⠀back⠀until⠀it⠀can⠀be⠀checked.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqan::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Light⠀Novel\n\nEnter⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀a⠀concrete⠀errand.⠀Someone⠀is⠀trying⠀to⠀finish⠀a⠀task⠀before⠀the⠀day's⠀constraints⠀close⠀it:⠀catch⠀a⠀cart⠀before⠀it⠀leaves,⠀find⠀a⠀paper⠀before⠀the⠀clerk⠀shuts⠀his⠀book,⠀deliver⠀a⠀message⠀while⠀the⠀porter⠀still⠀holds⠀the⠀gate,⠀return⠀a⠀tool⠀before⠀the⠀workshop⠀bell.⠀Make⠀the⠀period's⠀objects⠀and⠀procedures⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀opening⠀pressure—the⠀strap⠀of⠀a⠀satchel⠀cutting⠀a⠀shoulder,⠀ink⠀that⠀must⠀dry⠀before⠀a⠀seal⠀can⠀be⠀pressed,⠀the⠀number⠀of⠀steps⠀between⠀the⠀workshop⠀and⠀the⠀counting⠀room—so⠀that⠀by⠀the⠀end⠀of⠀the⠀first⠀paragraph⠀the⠀reader⠀knows⠀where⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀stands⠀and⠀what⠀failing⠀would⠀cost.\n\nReanchor⠀space⠀whenever⠀it⠀changes.⠀A⠀move⠀from⠀courtyard⠀to⠀stairway,⠀from⠀boat⠀landing⠀to⠀storehouse,⠀from⠀one⠀side⠀of⠀a⠀table⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀gets⠀its⠀own⠀short⠀action⠀line:⠀\"He⠀stepped⠀past⠀the⠀brazier⠀to⠀where⠀the⠀lamplight⠀reached⠀the⠀ledger.\"⠀Break⠀paragraphs⠀whenever⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀or⠀private⠀response⠀shifts,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀let⠀one⠀long⠀summary⠀carry⠀several⠀movements;⠀if⠀a⠀door⠀opens,⠀give⠀the⠀sound⠀and⠀the⠀pause⠀it⠀causes⠀their⠀own⠀beat.\n\nGive⠀reaction⠀beats⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀the⠀character's⠀station.⠀After⠀a⠀decisive⠀line⠀of⠀dialogue,⠀stop⠀and⠀show⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀response⠀through⠀a⠀physical⠀detail⠀or⠀a⠀short⠀grounded⠀thought—the⠀weight⠀of⠀the⠀tray,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀damp⠀wool,⠀the⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀similar⠀morning.⠀The⠀reaction⠀can⠀be⠀serious,⠀uncertain,⠀angry,⠀or⠀quietly⠀relieved,⠀but⠀not⠀every⠀character⠀gets⠀the⠀same⠀sharpness:⠀a⠀servant⠀notices⠀an⠀order⠀that⠀omitted⠀a⠀necessary⠀provision;⠀an⠀official⠀calculates⠀whether⠀a⠀delay⠀will⠀be⠀blamed⠀on⠀him;⠀a⠀cousin⠀recognizes⠀a⠀tone⠀from⠀a⠀childhood⠀quarrel.⠀Let⠀each⠀reaction⠀set⠀up⠀the⠀next⠀visible⠀choice⠀instead⠀of⠀standing⠀alone⠀as⠀decoration.\n\nMake⠀relationship⠀shifts⠀visible⠀as⠀action.⠀Two⠀people⠀who⠀have⠀been⠀cooperating⠀reach⠀a⠀moment⠀when⠀one⠀hands⠀over⠀an⠀object⠀too⠀carefully⠀or⠀fails⠀to⠀rise⠀when⠀expected;⠀two⠀rivals⠀find⠀they⠀must⠀share⠀a⠀bench⠀or⠀pass⠀through⠀the⠀same⠀narrow⠀doorway.⠀Play⠀the⠀shift⠀as⠀a⠀sequence:⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀notices⠀the⠀other's⠀hesitation,⠀answers⠀with⠀a⠀practical⠀act—offering⠀the⠀stool,⠀adjusting⠀the⠀lamp,⠀taking⠀the⠀other⠀route—and⠀then⠀registers⠀what⠀that⠀act⠀did⠀to⠀the⠀room.⠀Let⠀the⠀advance⠀be⠀both⠀personal⠀and⠀practical:⠀a⠀barrier⠀removed,⠀a⠀warning⠀accepted,⠀a⠀favor⠀claimed.⠀A⠀speech⠀about⠀resolve⠀is⠀not⠀needed;⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself⠀carries⠀the⠀change.\n\nKeep⠀historical⠀knowledge⠀inside⠀the⠀scene.⠀Where⠀a⠀toll,⠀a⠀guild⠀rule,⠀or⠀a⠀family⠀obligation⠀matters,⠀reveal⠀it⠀through⠀how⠀someone⠀handles⠀a⠀thing⠀or⠀reacts⠀to⠀a⠀name—refusing⠀to⠀sign⠀before⠀a⠀witness,⠀asking⠀whether⠀a⠀horse⠀can⠀be⠀spared,⠀recognizing⠀a⠀seal⠀from⠀last⠀year's⠀dispute.⠀If⠀an⠀unfamiliar⠀term⠀or⠀mechanism⠀must⠀exist,⠀explain⠀it⠀in⠀the⠀beat⠀where⠀it⠀appears,⠀through⠀action:⠀\"The⠀dye⠀had⠀to⠀be⠀fixed⠀before⠀the⠀third⠀bell,⠀or⠀the⠀vat⠀master⠀would⠀call⠀the⠀day⠀lost.\"⠀No⠀lecture,⠀no⠀footnote.⠀End⠀where⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary⠀falls:⠀a⠀checkpoint⠀such⠀as⠀a⠀closing⠀door,⠀an⠀entered⠀name,⠀a⠀refusal,⠀or⠀an⠀arrival⠀that⠀makes⠀everyone⠀look⠀up⠀is⠀one⠀good⠀option,⠀and⠀so⠀is⠀a⠀beat⠀in⠀the⠀middle⠀of⠀motion—the⠀focal⠀character⠀already⠀crossing⠀the⠀room,⠀a⠀reply⠀half-spoken—with⠀the⠀next⠀concern⠀clear⠀to⠀the⠀reader⠀and⠀nothing⠀yet⠀resolved.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqao::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Lyrical⠀Prose\n\nStage⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀sequence⠀of⠀visible⠀beats—two⠀people,⠀an⠀object⠀passing⠀between⠀them,⠀a⠀gate⠀watched—then⠀let⠀the⠀sentence⠀itself⠀carry⠀the⠀movement.⠀Use⠀syntax⠀to⠀build⠀and⠀release:⠀a⠀short⠀declarative⠀clause⠀can⠀stop⠀a⠀confrontation;⠀a⠀longer⠀periodic⠀sentence⠀can⠀trace⠀a⠀tool⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand⠀or⠀follow⠀a⠀memory⠀rising⠀through⠀a⠀familiar⠀room.⠀Let⠀rhythm⠀obey⠀the⠀physical⠀reality⠀of⠀the⠀period—the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀carried⠀load,⠀the⠀pause⠀a⠀bell⠀imposes⠀on⠀a⠀courtyard,⠀the⠀time⠀a⠀road⠀takes—so⠀the⠀historical⠀constraint⠀is⠀felt⠀in⠀the⠀sentence⠀before⠀anyone⠀explains⠀it.\n\nBuild⠀a⠀small⠀set⠀of⠀images⠀that⠀belong⠀to⠀this⠀place⠀and⠀these⠀people,⠀and⠀let⠀them⠀recur⠀as⠀the⠀relationship⠀changes:⠀the⠀sound⠀that⠀was⠀ordinary⠀during⠀one⠀exchange⠀becomes⠀charged⠀after⠀a⠀parting⠀or⠀a⠀reconciliation.⠀Let⠀comparison⠀arise⠀only⠀when⠀it⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀understands,⠀or⠀when⠀it⠀makes⠀a⠀practical⠀object⠀carry⠀private⠀significance.⠀Keep⠀every⠀image⠀traceable⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀or⠀to⠀that⠀one⠀mind's⠀associations;⠀when⠀a⠀memory⠀enters,⠀anchor⠀it⠀to⠀something⠀present—the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀worked⠀surface,⠀the⠀way⠀someone⠀checks⠀a⠀strap—and⠀return⠀from⠀it⠀to⠀the⠀action,⠀changed.\n\nMove⠀from⠀outward⠀perception⠀into⠀inward⠀feeling⠀without⠀a⠀visible⠀break:⠀show⠀the⠀posture,⠀the⠀glance,⠀the⠀hesitating⠀hand,⠀then⠀extend⠀the⠀sentence⠀into⠀what⠀that⠀person⠀privately⠀remembers⠀or⠀wants.⠀Stage⠀a⠀rival's⠀gesture⠀or⠀an⠀unexpected⠀kindness⠀clearly⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀seen⠀before⠀the⠀prose⠀turns⠀inward,⠀and⠀keep⠀access⠀to⠀the⠀single⠀focal⠀mind⠀throughout.⠀Do⠀not⠀push⠀every⠀speaker⠀into⠀the⠀narrator's⠀figurative⠀register;⠀dialogue⠀can⠀stay⠀direct⠀and⠀practical⠀while⠀the⠀lyric⠀weight⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀narration.⠀Set⠀an⠀important⠀consequence⠀in⠀a⠀bare⠀clause⠀after⠀a⠀long⠀image,⠀so⠀plainness⠀lands⠀with⠀weight.⠀End⠀on⠀an⠀image,⠀a⠀physical⠀act,⠀or⠀a⠀continuing⠀motion⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀summarizing⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqap::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Melancholic⠀/⠀Reflective\n\nBegin⠀with⠀visible⠀staging:⠀who⠀moves⠀first,⠀what⠀is⠀said⠀practically,⠀what⠀object⠀changes⠀hands.⠀Let⠀the⠀confrontation,⠀the⠀piece⠀of⠀work,⠀or⠀the⠀meeting⠀across⠀a⠀familiar⠀room⠀establish⠀itself⠀as⠀an⠀act⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀before⠀the⠀narration⠀turns⠀inward.⠀Then⠀let⠀reflection⠀follow⠀from⠀something⠀specific⠀in⠀that⠀action—a⠀repeated⠀gesture,⠀an⠀unchanged⠀tool,⠀a⠀different⠀tone⠀of⠀voice—so⠀a⠀memory⠀surfaces⠀through⠀a⠀present⠀detail⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀announced⠀as⠀memory.⠀The⠀action⠀can⠀continue⠀while⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀reflects,⠀and⠀the⠀reflection⠀may⠀alter⠀the⠀next⠀practical⠀choice⠀rather⠀than⠀stopping⠀the⠀scene⠀for⠀a⠀set⠀piece.⠀Keep⠀interior⠀access⠀to⠀that⠀one⠀mind.\n\nAttend⠀to⠀what⠀has⠀become⠀unavailable⠀without⠀converting⠀every⠀attachment⠀into⠀complete⠀loss.⠀A⠀relationship⠀may⠀still⠀exist,⠀altered⠀by⠀a⠀parting,⠀a⠀changed⠀obligation,⠀or⠀an⠀unspoken⠀resentment;⠀a⠀remembered⠀occasion⠀keeps⠀its⠀unfinished⠀feeling⠀precisely⠀because⠀the⠀setting⠀still⠀recognizes⠀it—the⠀smell⠀of⠀a⠀particular⠀workshop,⠀a⠀route⠀still⠀walked,⠀a⠀joke⠀no⠀one⠀makes⠀now.⠀Let⠀ordinary⠀pleasure⠀remain⠀pleasurable⠀when⠀it⠀occurs:⠀warmth,⠀food,⠀laughter,⠀and⠀small⠀successes⠀need⠀not⠀turn⠀ironic.⠀The⠀melancholy⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀coexistence⠀of⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀what⠀is⠀gone,⠀not⠀in⠀canceling⠀present⠀enjoyment.\n\nUse⠀the⠀period's⠀passing⠀time⠀as⠀the⠀material⠀of⠀reflection⠀rather⠀than⠀abstract⠀commentary.⠀Communication⠀delays,⠀work⠀rhythms,⠀and⠀social⠀rules⠀can⠀sharpen⠀a⠀memory—a⠀reply⠀that⠀arrives⠀after⠀days,⠀an⠀expectation⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀held⠀without⠀resolution,⠀a⠀season⠀that⠀closes⠀a⠀road.⠀When⠀an⠀advance⠀occurs,⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀a⠀practical⠀basis⠀in⠀these⠀circumstances:⠀someone⠀learns⠀the⠀task,⠀repairs⠀the⠀thing,⠀finds⠀the⠀route,⠀or⠀chooses⠀to⠀speak⠀because⠀it⠀serves⠀need⠀and⠀feeling⠀together.⠀The⠀reflection⠀should⠀deepen⠀the⠀reader's⠀sense⠀of⠀the⠀character's⠀present⠀life;⠀a⠀scene⠀may⠀close⠀on⠀a⠀resumed⠀task⠀or⠀an⠀ordinary⠀continuation⠀without⠀announcing⠀impermanence.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqaq::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Middle⠀Eastern⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nTell⠀the⠀story⠀through⠀a⠀situated⠀frame:⠀a⠀particular⠀teller⠀speaks⠀to⠀a⠀particular⠀audience⠀inside⠀the⠀story⠀world,⠀and⠀the⠀narration⠀moves⠀between⠀the⠀tale⠀and⠀the⠀telling.⠀Ground⠀both⠀levels⠀in⠀the⠀scenario's⠀actual⠀period⠀and⠀place—the⠀tale⠀in⠀its⠀own⠀moment,⠀the⠀telling⠀at⠀whatever⠀later⠀time⠀or⠀different⠀company⠀the⠀frame⠀establishes—and⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀need⠀or⠀the⠀listeners'⠀attention⠀decide⠀which⠀events⠀are⠀shown⠀in⠀full⠀and⠀which⠀are⠀summarized.⠀Inside⠀a⠀narrated⠀episode,⠀stage⠀the⠀action⠀with⠀clear⠀physical⠀detail⠀and⠀direct⠀dialogue:⠀who⠀did⠀what,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀what⠀changed⠀hands.⠀At⠀a⠀meaningful⠀pause,⠀return⠀to⠀the⠀frame⠀so⠀the⠀telling⠀itself⠀becomes⠀part⠀of⠀the⠀story—an⠀interruption,⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀promise⠀to⠀continue,⠀a⠀listener's⠀reaction⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀the⠀teller⠀chooses⠀to⠀tell⠀next.\n\nOrganize⠀recurrence⠀through⠀the⠀oral⠀act.⠀A⠀phrase,⠀name,⠀or⠀image⠀returns⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀changed,⠀and⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀mark⠀that⠀change⠀without⠀converting⠀it⠀into⠀a⠀moral.⠀Use⠀delayed⠀revelation⠀for⠀relationship-driven⠀material:⠀a⠀casual⠀encounter⠀or⠀a⠀remembered⠀slight⠀gains⠀meaning⠀later,⠀when⠀another⠀episode⠀or⠀a⠀listener's⠀question⠀exposes⠀what⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀knew⠀or⠀refused⠀to⠀say.⠀Keep⠀the⠀reveal⠀inside⠀the⠀world's⠀historical⠀possibilities—a⠀reply⠀that⠀arrives⠀after⠀days,⠀a⠀token⠀passed⠀from⠀hand⠀to⠀hand,⠀a⠀rumor⠀that⠀crosses⠀a⠀trade⠀route.⠀Add⠀no⠀supernatural⠀events⠀and⠀no⠀universal⠀mysticism⠀unless⠀the⠀setting⠀itself⠀includes⠀them;⠀the⠀frame⠀is⠀a⠀literary⠀apparatus,⠀not⠀a⠀claim⠀about⠀what⠀the⠀culture⠀believes.\n\nMind⠀the⠀boundary⠀between⠀teller⠀and⠀tale.⠀The⠀teller⠀may⠀let⠀a⠀reader⠀see⠀what⠀a⠀rival⠀or⠀friend⠀in⠀the⠀tale⠀could⠀not⠀see,⠀but⠀must⠀not⠀report⠀the⠀inner⠀life⠀of⠀someone⠀whose⠀mind⠀the⠀telling⠀could⠀not⠀reach:⠀render⠀that⠀person⠀through⠀deed,⠀speech,⠀and⠀what⠀witnesses⠀noticed,⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀teller's⠀own⠀silences,⠀hesitations,⠀and⠀withheld⠀feelings⠀in⠀the⠀frame⠀carry⠀the⠀live⠀private⠀experience—unless⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract⠀explicitly⠀grants⠀the⠀tale⠀a⠀focal⠀mind.⠀When⠀the⠀teller⠀comments,⠀keep⠀the⠀comment⠀on⠀the⠀tale's⠀particulars—what⠀a⠀person⠀did,⠀what⠀was⠀said,⠀how⠀long⠀something⠀took—rather⠀than⠀broad⠀cultural⠀diagnosis.⠀Let⠀the⠀language⠀rise⠀where⠀the⠀retelling⠀rises,⠀and⠀keep⠀speech⠀inside⠀the⠀episodes⠀direct⠀and⠀practical.⠀A⠀scene⠀may⠀stop⠀at⠀a⠀boundary⠀inside⠀the⠀telling:⠀a⠀question⠀held⠀over,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed⠀in⠀the⠀tale,⠀a⠀listener's⠀reaction⠀left⠀without⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqar::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Minimalist⠀Prose\n\nSelect⠀little⠀and⠀exactly:⠀one⠀physical⠀feature⠀of⠀the⠀setting,⠀one⠀object⠀or⠀tool⠀that⠀matters,⠀one⠀gesture⠀or⠀expression⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀relationship.⠀Let⠀the⠀period's⠀constraints⠀appear⠀only⠀through⠀action—a⠀character⠀waits⠀for⠀a⠀messenger,⠀cannot⠀afford⠀a⠀replacement,⠀finishes⠀the⠀work⠀before⠀speaking,⠀takes⠀the⠀route⠀that⠀lets⠀the⠀rival⠀approach.⠀Do⠀not⠀stop⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀historical⠀context;⠀if⠀a⠀fact⠀cannot⠀be⠀inferred⠀from⠀what⠀is⠀shown,⠀show⠀a⠀different⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀withhold⠀the⠀fact⠀until⠀it⠀matters.\n\nGive⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience⠀briefly⠀and⠀directly.⠀One⠀or⠀two⠀sentences⠀can⠀establish⠀what⠀a⠀gesture⠀means,⠀why⠀the⠀delay⠀matters,⠀or⠀how⠀a⠀memory⠀changes⠀the⠀present;⠀keep⠀the⠀thought⠀long⠀enough⠀to⠀make⠀sense⠀instead⠀of⠀fragmenting⠀it⠀into⠀performed⠀short⠀strokes.⠀Let⠀omission⠀leave⠀something⠀inferable⠀rather⠀than⠀erase⠀the⠀causal⠀link⠀between⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀sees⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀does⠀next.⠀A⠀memory⠀can⠀surface⠀as⠀a⠀single⠀recalled⠀phrase⠀or⠀image,⠀and⠀the⠀reader⠀infers⠀the⠀rest⠀from⠀the⠀present⠀action.\n\nStage⠀an⠀advance⠀or⠀reversal⠀as⠀a⠀practical⠀occurrence,⠀not⠀a⠀narrative⠀comment:⠀someone⠀arrives,⠀returns⠀the⠀tool,⠀makes⠀the⠀offer,⠀fails⠀to⠀meet⠀the⠀expectation.⠀Show⠀the⠀movement⠀and⠀its⠀immediate⠀effect,⠀then⠀stop—no⠀summary⠀sentence⠀explaining⠀the⠀scene's⠀significance.⠀Keep⠀each⠀speaker's⠀voice⠀individual⠀rather⠀than⠀reducing⠀all⠀dialogue⠀to⠀clipped⠀fragments;⠀a⠀precise⠀extended⠀sentence⠀serves⠀better⠀than⠀several⠀performed⠀short⠀ones⠀when⠀it⠀carries⠀the⠀material⠀consequence.⠀End⠀on⠀an⠀action⠀or⠀an⠀unfinished⠀situation,⠀with⠀the⠀next⠀step⠀left⠀inferable.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqas::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Modern⠀Literature⠀/⠀Contemporary⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀the⠀scene's⠀dramatic⠀present⠀and⠀open⠀on⠀a⠀concrete⠀action⠀or⠀exchange,⠀not⠀a⠀contextual⠀paragraph.⠀Let⠀the⠀period⠀arrive⠀through⠀what⠀the⠀characters⠀handle,⠀wait⠀for,⠀or⠀discuss—a⠀tool⠀passed⠀over⠀a⠀stall,⠀a⠀road⠀that⠀must⠀be⠀covered⠀before⠀dark,⠀a⠀debt⠀that⠀changes⠀what⠀may⠀be⠀said.⠀Use⠀ordinary⠀contemporary⠀prose;⠀adopt⠀archaic⠀diction⠀only⠀where⠀a⠀quoted⠀document⠀or⠀a⠀frame⠀genuinely⠀requires⠀it.⠀Let⠀paragraphing⠀follow⠀the⠀movement⠀of⠀attention⠀and⠀speech⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀fixed⠀rotation⠀of⠀description,⠀dialogue,⠀and⠀thought.\n\nMove⠀naturally⠀among⠀action,⠀dialogue,⠀perception,⠀recollection,⠀and⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀authorized⠀inner⠀experience.⠀A⠀spoken⠀line⠀can⠀prompt⠀a⠀recollection⠀in⠀the⠀next⠀paragraph,⠀and⠀the⠀recollection⠀can⠀return⠀the⠀character⠀to⠀the⠀present⠀with⠀a⠀new⠀practical⠀choice.⠀Anchor⠀each⠀memory⠀to⠀a⠀present⠀stimulus⠀and⠀come⠀back⠀to⠀the⠀scene⠀before⠀the⠀character⠀acts.⠀Derive⠀transitions⠀from⠀the⠀immediate⠀moment—a⠀sound,⠀an⠀interruption,⠀an⠀object⠀noticed,⠀a⠀change⠀of⠀subject—instead⠀of⠀inserted⠀recaps,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀pause⠀the⠀forward⠀movement⠀for⠀biographical⠀summary⠀unless⠀the⠀situation⠀makes⠀that⠀material⠀necessary.\n\nGive⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀the⠀clarity⠀of⠀a⠀staged⠀moment:⠀a⠀rival's⠀decision,⠀a⠀friend's⠀refusal,⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀should⠀be⠀visible⠀in⠀physical⠀detail⠀and⠀direct⠀exchange⠀before⠀the⠀narration⠀turns⠀inward.⠀Let⠀any⠀advance⠀or⠀reversal⠀carry⠀both⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀a⠀practical⠀basis⠀within⠀the⠀period—who⠀moves,⠀what⠀obstacle⠀is⠀met,⠀what⠀is⠀at⠀stake⠀between⠀these⠀people—so⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀arrive⠀merely⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀wants⠀a⠀victory.⠀The⠀register⠀may⠀be⠀understated⠀or⠀direct⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀character,⠀without⠀flattening⠀all⠀feeling⠀into⠀indirect⠀report.⠀Stop⠀the⠀reply⠀at⠀a⠀natural⠀boundary⠀in⠀the⠀dramatic⠀action—business⠀continued,⠀a⠀conversation⠀broken,⠀a⠀question⠀left⠀open—rather⠀than⠀closing⠀on⠀a⠀lesson⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀cliffhanger.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqat::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Relationship-Centric⠀Fanfiction⠀(AO3-inspired)\n\nChoose⠀scenes⠀by⠀the⠀relationship's⠀particular⠀promise.⠀If⠀the⠀premise⠀is⠀rivalry,⠀show⠀the⠀moments⠀where⠀the⠀competition⠀is⠀charged⠀and⠀where⠀it⠀shifts;⠀if⠀it⠀is⠀affection⠀or⠀comfort,⠀show⠀the⠀private⠀or⠀halfway-private⠀moments⠀where⠀that⠀affection⠀becomes⠀legible.⠀Do⠀not⠀narrate⠀the⠀relationship's⠀history⠀in⠀general⠀terms—make⠀it⠀present⠀through⠀something⠀the⠀characters⠀do⠀together⠀or⠀against⠀each⠀other.⠀Let⠀historical⠀constraint⠀shape⠀the⠀available⠀moments:⠀a⠀shared⠀watch,⠀a⠀market⠀errand,⠀a⠀room⠀divided⠀by⠀a⠀workbench,⠀a⠀route⠀taken⠀together⠀despite⠀an⠀old⠀quarrel.⠀Use⠀the⠀period's⠀practical⠀necessities⠀to⠀create⠀the⠀opportunities,⠀rather⠀than⠀importing⠀modern⠀intimacy⠀protocols⠀into⠀the⠀setting.\n\nGive⠀the⠀pair⠀private⠀language⠀and⠀repeated⠀moments.⠀A⠀nickname⠀used⠀only⠀when⠀one⠀of⠀them⠀is⠀worried,⠀a⠀task⠀one⠀always⠀finished⠀for⠀the⠀other,⠀a⠀phrase⠀left⠀over⠀from⠀a⠀remembered⠀slight—these⠀can⠀return⠀when⠀the⠀situation⠀has⠀changed,⠀and⠀the⠀return⠀pays⠀off⠀without⠀explanation.⠀Ground⠀every⠀callback⠀in⠀the⠀actual⠀supplied⠀premise;⠀do⠀not⠀stack⠀familiar⠀tropes⠀such⠀as⠀forced⠀proximity,⠀hurt/comfort,⠀or⠀only⠀one⠀bed⠀unless⠀the⠀world⠀or⠀the⠀situation⠀actually⠀establishes⠀them.⠀Give⠀affection,⠀jealousy,⠀comfort,⠀rivalry,⠀or⠀discovery⠀the⠀space⠀it⠀needs⠀where⠀it⠀belongs:⠀a⠀tense⠀conversation⠀may⠀take⠀several⠀exchanges,⠀and⠀a⠀small⠀act⠀of⠀care⠀may⠀be⠀allowed⠀to⠀linger⠀instead⠀of⠀being⠀skipped⠀for⠀the⠀next⠀plot⠀point.\n\nStage⠀the⠀relationship's⠀conflict⠀with⠀visual⠀clarity⠀and⠀direct⠀speech:⠀a⠀person⠀walks⠀out,⠀returns⠀an⠀object,⠀refuses⠀help,⠀admits⠀a⠀need.⠀Let⠀a⠀memory⠀enter⠀because⠀something⠀in⠀the⠀present⠀recalls⠀it,⠀and⠀let⠀it⠀alter⠀the⠀character's⠀next⠀move.⠀Nonspeaking⠀private⠀thought⠀may⠀carry⠀the⠀feeling,⠀kept⠀with⠀the⠀single⠀focal⠀mind.⠀The⠀payoff⠀should⠀fulfill⠀the⠀premise's⠀promise⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀confession,⠀a⠀kiss,⠀or⠀a⠀permanent⠀settlement.⠀Stop⠀at⠀the⠀scene's⠀own⠀boundary—an⠀open⠀look,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed—rather⠀than⠀sealing⠀the⠀reply⠀with⠀a⠀moral.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqau::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Saga⠀/⠀Oral⠀Epic\n\nTell⠀the⠀events⠀as⠀something⠀already⠀retold.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀deliberate⠀statement⠀that⠀fixes⠀what⠀happened⠀and⠀to⠀whom—plain⠀assertion,⠀not⠀prophecy—and⠀then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀particular⠀circumstances.⠀Inside⠀the⠀retelling,⠀stage⠀confrontations,⠀journeys,⠀gifts,⠀and⠀quarrels⠀as⠀sequences⠀of⠀deeds:⠀who⠀did⠀what,⠀who⠀answered,⠀what⠀changed⠀hands,⠀what⠀it⠀cost.⠀Keep⠀the⠀telling⠀inside⠀the⠀period's⠀actual⠀institutions⠀and⠀constraints;⠀import⠀no⠀Nordic⠀pantheon,⠀heroic⠀doom,⠀or⠀ceremonial⠀dialogue⠀unless⠀the⠀setting⠀includes⠀them,⠀and⠀let⠀each⠀speaker's⠀language⠀remain⠀their⠀own⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀generic⠀epic⠀register.\n\nEstablish⠀standing⠀through⠀compact⠀declarations⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀account's⠀own⠀deeds—\"no⠀one⠀outran⠀her⠀on⠀the⠀north⠀road,\"⠀\"he⠀never⠀returned⠀a⠀borrowed⠀tool\"—and⠀let⠀a⠀designation⠀recur⠀when⠀later⠀events⠀give⠀it⠀a⠀new⠀application:⠀the⠀patient⠀one⠀is⠀finally⠀shown⠀waiting⠀for⠀the⠀wrong⠀reason.⠀Bind⠀episodes⠀with⠀recurring⠀phrasing⠀rather⠀than⠀decorating⠀each⠀entrance.⠀Keep⠀public⠀reputation⠀distinct⠀from⠀the⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀experience;⠀the⠀chronicle⠀reports⠀what⠀was⠀done,⠀while⠀remembered⠀wounds⠀and⠀undisclosed⠀thought⠀show⠀that⠀the⠀deed⠀was⠀not⠀effortless.⠀When⠀a⠀memory⠀changes⠀a⠀present⠀encounter,⠀show⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀action—a⠀refusal⠀to⠀lend,⠀a⠀crossed⠀room,⠀a⠀voice⠀after⠀long⠀silence—and⠀let⠀the⠀telling⠀mark⠀the⠀earlier⠀event⠀that⠀gives⠀the⠀moment⠀its⠀weight.\n\nRelate⠀acts⠀to⠀what⠀will⠀be⠀remembered⠀of⠀them.⠀Witnesses⠀may⠀remember⠀the⠀same⠀deed⠀differently—whether⠀the⠀debt⠀was⠀repaid,⠀who⠀kept⠀the⠀blade—and⠀the⠀teller⠀can⠀record⠀that⠀difference⠀without⠀resolving⠀or⠀moralizing⠀it.⠀Give⠀any⠀advance⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀in⠀the⠀period's⠀terms:⠀a⠀route⠀learned,⠀an⠀obligation⠀met,⠀an⠀oath⠀kept⠀at⠀real⠀cost,⠀not⠀a⠀victory⠀supplied⠀because⠀the⠀scene⠀needs⠀one.⠀The⠀account⠀may⠀end⠀with⠀an⠀act⠀concluded⠀or⠀still⠀under⠀way,⠀leaving⠀another⠀modest⠀deed⠀available⠀to⠀be⠀remembered⠀rather⠀than⠀declaring⠀the⠀person⠀a⠀legend.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqav::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Scandinavian⠀Literary⠀Traditions\n\nWrite⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀social-psychological⠀realism:⠀the⠀period's⠀work,⠀obligations,⠀and⠀domestic⠀arrangements⠀are⠀the⠀visible⠀grammar⠀through⠀which⠀private⠀feeling⠀becomes⠀legible.⠀Anchor⠀the⠀encounter⠀in⠀a⠀concrete⠀activity—checking⠀a⠀ledger,⠀mending⠀a⠀coat,⠀sharing⠀food,⠀visiting⠀a⠀room,⠀completing⠀a⠀task—and⠀let⠀the⠀way⠀a⠀person⠀performs,⠀delays,⠀or⠀shares⠀that⠀activity⠀carry⠀the⠀emotional⠀content.⠀A⠀hesitation⠀before⠀taking⠀up⠀a⠀tool,⠀a⠀portion⠀offered⠀or⠀withheld,⠀a⠀task⠀done⠀badly⠀because⠀the⠀mind⠀is⠀elsewhere:⠀these⠀are⠀the⠀scene's⠀inward⠀disclosures.\n\nLet⠀the⠀period's⠀material⠀and⠀social⠀facts⠀determine⠀what⠀a⠀person⠀can⠀know,⠀expect,⠀and⠀risk.⠀If⠀letters⠀travel⠀slowly,⠀let⠀that⠀affect⠀the⠀timing⠀of⠀a⠀promise⠀or⠀a⠀threat.⠀If⠀an⠀occupation⠀grants⠀access,⠀show⠀how⠀that⠀access⠀shapes⠀the⠀encounter.⠀Do⠀not⠀invent⠀a⠀tournament,⠀training⠀ground,⠀or⠀supernatural⠀system.⠀Translate⠀Kishimoto's⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀into⠀ordinary⠀historical⠀movement:⠀a⠀confrontation⠀may⠀occur⠀across⠀a⠀worktable,⠀a⠀rivalry⠀over⠀who⠀may⠀carry⠀a⠀message,⠀a⠀bond⠀through⠀the⠀shared⠀completion⠀of⠀a⠀difficult⠀job.⠀The⠀source⠀profile's⠀remembered⠀wound⠀becomes⠀a⠀past⠀event⠀whose⠀social⠀or⠀economic⠀consequence⠀still⠀presses⠀into⠀the⠀present.⠀Let⠀a⠀particular⠀object,⠀obligation,⠀or⠀remembered⠀failure⠀change⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀is⠀willing⠀to⠀say⠀or⠀do⠀now,⠀and⠀make⠀that⠀change⠀have⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀rather⠀than⠀a⠀sudden⠀speech⠀about⠀not⠀giving⠀up.\n\nKeep⠀the⠀narrative⠀voice⠀calm⠀and⠀composed,⠀with⠀enough⠀sensory⠀detail⠀to⠀make⠀the⠀room,⠀weather,⠀work,⠀and⠀gesture⠀legible.⠀Inward⠀attention⠀should⠀clarify⠀the⠀character's⠀position,⠀labor,⠀or⠀worry,⠀not⠀sever⠀the⠀scene⠀from⠀its⠀social⠀context.⠀When⠀emotion⠀rises,⠀let⠀it⠀appear⠀through⠀quickened⠀action,⠀hesitation,⠀or⠀a⠀direct⠀remark—not⠀through⠀an⠀abstract⠀declaration⠀of⠀feeling.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀A⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀unavailable⠀to⠀the⠀cast⠀unless⠀spoken;⠀another⠀character's⠀motive⠀may⠀be⠀inferred⠀from⠀behavior⠀but⠀not⠀narrated⠀as⠀known⠀fact.⠀Close⠀on⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀complete⠀encounter,⠀a⠀restored⠀bond,⠀or⠀a⠀resolved⠀future.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqaw::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Screenplay\n\nWrite⠀in⠀screenplay⠀format:⠀scene⠀headings⠀when⠀location⠀or⠀time⠀changes,⠀concise⠀action⠀blocks,⠀and⠀dialogue⠀with⠀speaker⠀cues.⠀Stage⠀each⠀scene⠀through⠀visible⠀business—a⠀rider⠀checking⠀a⠀bridle,⠀a⠀clerk⠀counting⠀coin,⠀a⠀messenger⠀reading⠀a⠀note—and⠀keep⠀the⠀action⠀concrete⠀enough⠀to⠀be⠀filmed⠀on⠀a⠀historical⠀set⠀without⠀imported⠀costumes⠀or⠀anachronistic⠀props.⠀Make⠀the⠀action⠀block⠀do⠀the⠀emotional⠀work:⠀a⠀character⠀who⠀folds⠀cloth⠀too⠀slowly,⠀sets⠀down⠀a⠀cup⠀before⠀answering,⠀or⠀returns⠀a⠀hand⠀to⠀a⠀worn⠀tool⠀is⠀revealing⠀feeling⠀through⠀filmable⠀gesture,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀explanatory⠀line.\n\nLet⠀the⠀period's⠀institutions⠀and⠀material⠀conditions⠀determine⠀what⠀a⠀character⠀can⠀do.⠀If⠀a⠀road⠀is⠀closed,⠀show⠀the⠀walk⠀or⠀the⠀detour⠀rather⠀than⠀explaining⠀it⠀in⠀dialogue.⠀If⠀a⠀task⠀matters,⠀include⠀the⠀physical⠀steps:⠀folding⠀cloth,⠀sorting⠀tools,⠀lifting⠀a⠀burden.⠀Use⠀relationship-driven⠀conflict⠀to⠀sharpen⠀the⠀scene:⠀two⠀people⠀who⠀need⠀the⠀same⠀scarce⠀resource,⠀a⠀promise⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀kept⠀under⠀current⠀conditions,⠀a⠀memory⠀of⠀a⠀past⠀loss⠀that⠀changes⠀how⠀one⠀character⠀reads⠀another's⠀gesture.⠀Make⠀the⠀remembered⠀wound⠀visible⠀through⠀a⠀hesitation,⠀a⠀choice⠀of⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀single⠀difficult⠀line,⠀not⠀through⠀an⠀explanatory⠀monologue.⠀The⠀source⠀profile's⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀becomes⠀a⠀physical⠀sequence—a⠀hand⠀stopped⠀halfway,⠀a⠀chair⠀turned⠀toward⠀the⠀door—that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀the⠀director⠀can⠀stage.\n\nKeep⠀dialogue⠀economical.⠀Let⠀action⠀convey⠀emotion;⠀a⠀turn⠀away,⠀a⠀delayed⠀answer,⠀or⠀a⠀hand⠀returned⠀to⠀a⠀worn⠀tool.⠀Use⠀a⠀cut⠀only⠀when⠀a⠀scene⠀change⠀supplies⠀new⠀information⠀or⠀lets⠀a⠀consequence⠀land.⠀Offscreen⠀sound⠀may⠀extend⠀the⠀world,⠀but⠀not⠀replace⠀a⠀character's⠀actual⠀presence.⠀When⠀a⠀focal⠀character's⠀private⠀thought⠀is⠀required,⠀place⠀it⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀action⠀block,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀voice-over⠀or⠀assumption⠀that⠀the⠀cast⠀can⠀hear⠀it.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀End⠀on⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary:⠀a⠀completed⠀action,⠀a⠀spoken⠀line⠀that⠀opens⠀the⠀next⠀move,⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀look⠀that⠀changes⠀the⠀standing⠀between⠀characters—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀victory,⠀a⠀confession,⠀or⠀a⠀full⠀narrative⠀resolution.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqax::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Stage⠀Play\n\nWrite⠀a⠀stageable⠀scene⠀with⠀clear⠀speaker⠀names,⠀entrances,⠀exits,⠀and⠀blocking⠀that⠀a⠀director⠀could⠀follow.⠀Ground⠀the⠀historical⠀situation⠀in⠀objects⠀already⠀present:⠀a⠀bench,⠀a⠀ledger,⠀a⠀coat,⠀a⠀cup,⠀a⠀letter.⠀Use⠀those⠀objects⠀to⠀carry⠀business—one⠀character⠀sets⠀down⠀the⠀cup⠀before⠀speaking,⠀another⠀counts⠀coins⠀at⠀a⠀table,⠀a⠀third⠀turns⠀a⠀letter⠀over.⠀Let⠀the⠀positions⠀and⠀timing⠀matter:⠀who⠀blocks⠀a⠀doorway,⠀who⠀stands⠀too⠀close,⠀who⠀leaves⠀without⠀taking⠀their⠀coat.⠀The⠀relationship⠀between⠀lines⠀and⠀physical⠀business⠀is⠀the⠀public⠀scene;⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀turned⠀back,⠀or⠀a⠀hand⠀left⠀on⠀a⠀prop⠀can⠀carry⠀as⠀much⠀as⠀a⠀spoken⠀line.\n\nTranslate⠀Kishimoto's⠀emotionally⠀charged⠀confrontation⠀into⠀staged⠀physical⠀action.⠀A⠀remembered⠀wound⠀should⠀appear⠀through⠀an⠀object⠀or⠀gesture⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀observe⠀and⠀misinterpret,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀speech⠀explaining⠀the⠀past.⠀A⠀rival⠀may⠀speak⠀calmly⠀while⠀arranging⠀tools,⠀and⠀the⠀tension⠀lives⠀in⠀how⠀the⠀arrangement⠀becomes⠀a⠀claim.⠀An⠀advance⠀in⠀understanding⠀can⠀come⠀from⠀a⠀practical⠀adjustment:⠀one⠀character⠀chooses⠀to⠀hand⠀over⠀an⠀object,⠀share⠀a⠀task,⠀or⠀step⠀back⠀and⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀pass.⠀Keep⠀the⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀for⠀that⠀change⠀visible,⠀not⠀a⠀sudden⠀recital⠀of⠀a⠀lesson.⠀The⠀source⠀profile's⠀clear⠀staging⠀becomes⠀the⠀director's⠀instruction:⠀the⠀emotional⠀shift⠀is⠀written⠀as⠀a⠀physical⠀sequence⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀performed.\n\nRespect⠀the⠀period's⠀constraints.⠀If⠀a⠀message⠀has⠀not⠀arrived,⠀no⠀character⠀should⠀know⠀its⠀content.⠀If⠀a⠀room⠀is⠀private,⠀an⠀outsider⠀cannot⠀enter⠀without⠀explanation.⠀The⠀stage⠀directions⠀establish⠀observable⠀conditions;⠀they⠀do⠀not⠀reveal⠀hidden⠀guilt.⠀Required⠀private⠀thought⠀should⠀be⠀placed⠀as⠀a⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀nonspoken⠀note⠀in⠀the⠀authoring⠀material,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀aside⠀or⠀monologue⠀that⠀another⠀character⠀can⠀supposedly⠀hear.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀role,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Close⠀on⠀a⠀beat⠀that⠀can⠀continue⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀question,⠀a⠀completed⠀task,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀quiet⠀acknowledgment—not⠀a⠀forced⠀reconciliation⠀or⠀a⠀full⠀outcome.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqay::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Stream⠀of⠀Consciousness\n\nWrite⠀from⠀one⠀authorized⠀focal⠀mind.⠀Let⠀perception,⠀memory,⠀sensation,⠀and⠀recurring⠀worry⠀flow⠀associatively,⠀but⠀keep⠀enough⠀orientation⠀to⠀distinguish⠀the⠀present⠀historical⠀moment⠀from⠀remembered⠀events⠀or⠀imagined⠀futures.⠀Use⠀a⠀concrete⠀sensory⠀anchor—the⠀weight⠀of⠀a⠀door,⠀the⠀smell⠀of⠀wet⠀wool,⠀the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀worn⠀harness—to⠀return⠀the⠀mind⠀to⠀the⠀room⠀when⠀memory⠀pulls⠀it⠀away.\n\nLet⠀a⠀past⠀wound⠀enter⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀neatly⠀told⠀story,⠀but⠀through⠀the⠀prompt⠀of⠀a⠀current⠀object,⠀phrase,⠀sound,⠀or⠀smell.⠀The⠀meaning⠀of⠀that⠀wound⠀should⠀develop⠀across⠀the⠀response,⠀changing⠀how⠀the⠀character⠀reads⠀a⠀gesture,⠀a⠀debt,⠀or⠀a⠀promise.⠀Keep⠀Kishimoto's⠀relationship⠀forces⠀present⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀other⠀person's⠀words⠀or⠀actions⠀interrupt,⠀correct,⠀or⠀unexpectedly⠀answer⠀the⠀associations.⠀A⠀remembered⠀rivalry⠀may⠀be⠀cut⠀short⠀by⠀the⠀actual⠀rival's⠀voice;⠀a⠀feared⠀refusal⠀may⠀be⠀answered⠀by⠀a⠀practical⠀offer;⠀a⠀private⠀resolution⠀may⠀be⠀tested⠀by⠀a⠀single⠀observed⠀gesture.⠀Allow⠀the⠀thoughts⠀to⠀race⠀under⠀stress⠀or⠀slow⠀around⠀a⠀routine⠀task,⠀whichever⠀the⠀character⠀and⠀situation⠀require;⠀do⠀not⠀impose⠀a⠀fixed⠀inner⠀speech⠀length⠀or⠀a⠀ready⠀insight.\n\nGround⠀the⠀stream⠀in⠀historical⠀limits:⠀travel⠀time,⠀work,⠀weather,⠀tools,⠀social⠀position,⠀and⠀what⠀the⠀character⠀can⠀actually⠀know.⠀If⠀a⠀message⠀has⠀not⠀come,⠀the⠀mind⠀may⠀dwell⠀on⠀possibilities⠀without⠀narrating⠀its⠀contents⠀as⠀fact.⠀The⠀period's⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀appear⠀inside⠀the⠀associations—the⠀feel⠀of⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀delay,⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀debt—not⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀historical⠀explanation.⠀Use⠀paragraph⠀breaks⠀or⠀sentence⠀rhythm⠀to⠀follow⠀the⠀mind's⠀movement,⠀but⠀always⠀preserve⠀the⠀distinction⠀between⠀event,⠀memory,⠀and⠀fear.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀perspective⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀Close⠀on⠀whatever⠀thought,⠀sensation,⠀or⠀unfinished⠀action⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary⠀reaches;⠀do⠀not⠀require⠀a⠀complete⠀realization⠀or⠀a⠀resolution⠀of⠀every⠀association.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqaz::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Text⠀Messages⠀/⠀Chat⠀Transcript\n\nPresent⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀sender-attributed⠀written⠀exchange⠀appropriate⠀to⠀the⠀selected⠀historical⠀period:⠀letters,⠀notes,⠀telegrams,⠀ledgers,⠀or⠀another⠀channel⠀that⠀fits⠀the⠀era.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀modern⠀phones,⠀screens,⠀or⠀emoji.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀timestamps,⠀delays,⠀reroutings,⠀and⠀delivery⠀circumstances⠀that⠀matter⠀to⠀the⠀scene:⠀a⠀rider⠀who⠀could⠀not⠀cross⠀a⠀flooded⠀road,⠀a⠀letter⠀delayed⠀at⠀a⠀border,⠀a⠀message⠀copied⠀by⠀a⠀clerk.⠀These⠀are⠀interface⠀events⠀in⠀the⠀historical⠀sense;⠀only⠀include⠀them⠀when⠀they⠀change⠀what⠀one⠀character⠀can⠀know⠀or⠀answer.\n\nLet⠀each⠀person's⠀actual⠀habits⠀shape⠀their⠀contribution.⠀One⠀may⠀write⠀short⠀practical⠀lines;⠀another⠀may⠀circle⠀back⠀to⠀a⠀draft;⠀a⠀third⠀may⠀keep⠀to⠀formal⠀address.⠀Distinguish⠀a⠀sent⠀message⠀from⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft⠀and⠀private⠀thought⠀from⠀transmitted⠀text.⠀A⠀draft⠀is⠀a⠀composed⠀artifact,⠀not⠀automatically⠀a⠀peek⠀into⠀the⠀writer's⠀live⠀mind.⠀If⠀a⠀character⠀remembers⠀a⠀past⠀wound,⠀let⠀it⠀appear⠀through⠀what⠀they⠀choose⠀to⠀write,⠀omit,⠀delay,⠀or⠀address⠀indirectly—not⠀through⠀an⠀inserted⠀interiority⠀paragraph⠀masquerading⠀as⠀a⠀message.\n\nMake⠀Kishimoto's⠀relationship⠀dynamics⠀visible⠀through⠀the⠀exchange⠀itself:⠀a⠀repeated⠀request,⠀a⠀refusal⠀that⠀also⠀protects,⠀a⠀concise⠀line⠀that⠀answers⠀an⠀earlier⠀unspoken⠀fear,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀sentence⠀that⠀halts⠀because⠀the⠀writer⠀chooses⠀not⠀to⠀send⠀it.⠀The⠀conflict⠀lives⠀in⠀the⠀written⠀choices—what⠀is⠀said⠀plainly,⠀what⠀is⠀left⠀out,⠀what⠀is⠀delayed,⠀what⠀is⠀addressed⠀only⠀indirectly—and⠀each⠀choice⠀has⠀a⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis.⠀Use⠀any⠀needed⠀context⠀outside⠀the⠀exchange⠀in⠀clearly⠀separated⠀prose⠀from⠀the⠀transcript.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀role,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary:⠀a⠀delivered⠀message,⠀an⠀unsent⠀draft,⠀a⠀pause⠀in⠀composition,⠀or⠀a⠀waiting⠀recipient—without⠀forcing⠀a⠀reply,⠀a⠀revelation,⠀or⠀a⠀completed⠀practical⠀decision.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqba::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Visual⠀Novel\n\nWrite⠀in⠀visual-novel⠀rhythm:⠀short⠀scene-setting⠀lines,⠀clearly⠀attributed⠀speech,⠀and⠀focal⠀reaction⠀beats⠀that⠀can⠀accompany⠀an⠀illustrated⠀frame.⠀Open⠀with⠀a⠀concise⠀establishing⠀detail⠀that⠀carries⠀the⠀historical⠀world:⠀a⠀scuffed⠀floor,⠀a⠀hanging⠀lamp,⠀a⠀brushed⠀coat,⠀the⠀position⠀of⠀two⠀people⠀across⠀a⠀table.⠀Use⠀background⠀or⠀expression⠀cues⠀as⠀purposeful⠀references⠀for⠀the⠀artist,⠀not⠀as⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀hidden⠀motive⠀or⠀an⠀exhaustive⠀label⠀for⠀every⠀line.\n\nLet⠀the⠀encounter⠀advance⠀through⠀pictured⠀gestures⠀and⠀spoken⠀shifts.⠀Once⠀scene-setting⠀is⠀established,⠀rely⠀on⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀carry⠀the⠀conflict.⠀A⠀focal⠀reaction⠀beat⠀can⠀note⠀what⠀the⠀viewpoint⠀character⠀saw,⠀ignored,⠀or⠀understood⠀after⠀a⠀gesture⠀or⠀line,⠀and⠀must⠀remain⠀their⠀private⠀observation,⠀not⠀shared⠀knowledge⠀unless⠀they⠀speak⠀it.⠀Make⠀Kishimoto's⠀emotional⠀dynamics⠀visible:⠀a⠀meaningful⠀pause⠀before⠀answering,⠀a⠀hand⠀stopped⠀halfway,⠀a⠀chair⠀turned⠀toward⠀the⠀door.⠀Let⠀a⠀remembered⠀wound⠀become⠀legible⠀through⠀a⠀specific⠀visual⠀anchor—the⠀way⠀a⠀character⠀handles⠀a⠀certain⠀object⠀or⠀looks⠀at⠀an⠀empty⠀seat—and⠀let⠀that⠀observation⠀change⠀how⠀the⠀focal⠀character⠀interprets⠀the⠀present.⠀The⠀source⠀profile's⠀clear⠀staging⠀becomes⠀the⠀illustrated⠀frame:⠀the⠀emotional⠀shift⠀is⠀written⠀as⠀a⠀pictured⠀gesture⠀that⠀the⠀reader⠀can⠀see⠀and⠀the⠀artist⠀can⠀render.\n\nRespect⠀historical⠀constraints.⠀If⠀a⠀bell,⠀letter,⠀or⠀visitor⠀is⠀expected,⠀the⠀timing⠀follows⠀period⠀communication⠀and⠀transport.⠀The⠀period's⠀material⠀life⠀should⠀appear⠀inside⠀the⠀pictured⠀details—the⠀wear⠀on⠀a⠀tool,⠀the⠀social⠀meaning⠀of⠀a⠀seat,⠀the⠀cost⠀of⠀a⠀delay—not⠀as⠀a⠀separate⠀historical⠀explanation.⠀Do⠀not⠀add⠀branching⠀choices,⠀player⠀decisions,⠀static⠀romance⠀routes,⠀images,⠀or⠀executable⠀engine⠀commands.⠀Required⠀private⠀matters⠀remain⠀focal⠀narration,⠀not⠀a⠀menu⠀selection⠀or⠀knowledge⠀the⠀other⠀cast⠀can⠀hear.⠀End⠀on⠀a⠀beat⠀that⠀can⠀be⠀illustrated:⠀a⠀spoken⠀question,⠀a⠀completed⠀gesture,⠀an⠀unfinished⠀task,⠀or⠀a⠀held⠀look—not⠀a⠀forced⠀conclusion,⠀romantic⠀resolution,⠀or⠀end-of-route⠀finality.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaqbb::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Masashi⠀Kishimoto⠀/⠀Web⠀Serial\n\nWrite⠀each⠀installment⠀as⠀a⠀readable⠀continuation⠀of⠀an⠀ongoing⠀historical⠀story.⠀Start⠀with⠀a⠀brief⠀concrete⠀anchor⠀that⠀recovers⠀what⠀is⠀underway⠀without⠀retelling⠀the⠀whole⠀prior⠀plot:⠀a⠀name,⠀an⠀object,⠀a⠀pending⠀task,⠀the⠀state⠀of⠀a⠀job⠀or⠀relationship.⠀Then⠀move⠀into⠀the⠀current⠀scene⠀and⠀let⠀its⠀events⠀change⠀something⠀locally—what⠀a⠀character⠀knows,⠀what⠀they⠀can⠀ask⠀for,⠀what⠀resource⠀is⠀now⠀available⠀or⠀spent,⠀or⠀how⠀they⠀regard⠀one⠀another.\n\nKeep⠀Kishimoto's⠀emotional⠀textures⠀by⠀making⠀the⠀ongoing⠀conflict⠀specific⠀to⠀named⠀people⠀and⠀practical⠀circumstances.⠀A⠀rivalry⠀may⠀play⠀out⠀over⠀who⠀can⠀finish⠀a⠀delivery,⠀keep⠀a⠀workshop⠀running,⠀or⠀persuade⠀a⠀local⠀official.⠀A⠀remembered⠀wound⠀can⠀become⠀newly⠀relevant⠀when⠀a⠀current⠀obligation⠀resembles⠀the⠀old⠀one,⠀but⠀it⠀must⠀be⠀earned⠀by⠀the⠀present⠀facts,⠀not⠀by⠀a⠀recap⠀dump.⠀Show⠀the⠀personal⠀and⠀practical⠀basis⠀for⠀each⠀advance.⠀Let⠀a⠀character's⠀decision⠀affect⠀the⠀next⠀installment's⠀options⠀without⠀requiring⠀a⠀complete⠀victory,⠀complete⠀chapter,⠀or⠀cliffhanger.⠀The⠀source⠀profile's⠀emotionally⠀significant⠀action⠀becomes⠀a⠀cumulative⠀development:⠀a⠀rivalry⠀shifts⠀because⠀one⠀person⠀gains⠀access,⠀a⠀bond⠀changes⠀because⠀a⠀task⠀is⠀shared,⠀a⠀wound⠀reopens⠀because⠀a⠀present⠀obligation⠀echoes⠀the⠀old⠀one.\n\nUse⠀the⠀period⠀to⠀shape⠀the⠀installment's⠀logic.⠀Travel⠀time,⠀communication⠀delays,⠀work⠀seasons,⠀legal⠀procedures,⠀and⠀material⠀shortages⠀can⠀decide⠀what⠀can⠀be⠀started,⠀finished,⠀or⠀merely⠀set⠀in⠀motion.⠀Recover⠀such⠀details⠀only⠀to⠀the⠀extent⠀needed⠀for⠀coherence.⠀Preserve⠀the⠀active⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀and⠀world⠀facts.⠀End⠀at⠀the⠀active⠀response⠀boundary:⠀work⠀finished,⠀work⠀set⠀aside,⠀a⠀promise⠀made,⠀a⠀refusal⠀given,⠀or⠀a⠀new⠀fact⠀understood.⠀Do⠀not⠀insert⠀serialization⠀gimmicks⠀such⠀as⠀rankings,⠀system⠀prompts,⠀leveling,⠀or⠀an⠀artificial⠀hook⠀every⠀reply.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiaraa::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Angsty⠀/⠀Emotionally⠀Turbulent\n\nChoose⠀one⠀period-specific⠀obligation⠀or⠀material⠀limit⠀that⠀makes⠀the⠀relationship⠀strain⠀concrete:⠀a⠀letter⠀that⠀costs⠀too⠀much⠀to⠀send,⠀a⠀debt⠀called⠀in,⠀a⠀journey⠀that⠀cannot⠀be⠀made,⠀a⠀duty⠀that⠀keeps⠀one⠀person⠀away.⠀Put⠀that⠀obligation⠀in⠀the⠀scene⠀as⠀a⠀particular⠀action⠀or⠀object,⠀not⠀as⠀a⠀general⠀condition.⠀Show⠀the⠀character⠀trying⠀to⠀work⠀around⠀it,⠀fail,⠀or⠀refuse⠀to⠀speak⠀about⠀it.\n\nTell⠀the⠀scene⠀through⠀familiar⠀activity.⠀Have⠀the⠀characters⠀mend,⠀count,⠀wait,⠀store,⠀travel,⠀or⠀perform⠀a⠀household⠀task⠀while⠀they⠀talk.⠀When⠀the⠀narrator⠀notices⠀a⠀familiar⠀place⠀or⠀object⠀that⠀has⠀changed,⠀describe⠀the⠀change⠀in⠀physical⠀terms—a⠀worn⠀step,⠀an⠀empty⠀hook,⠀a⠀patched⠀sleeve—and⠀let⠀the⠀reader⠀feel⠀the⠀loss⠀through⠀that⠀detail.⠀Do⠀not⠀name⠀the⠀loss⠀as⠀grief⠀or⠀regret.\n\nGive⠀the⠀buried⠀story⠀a⠀concrete⠀present⠀trace.⠀A⠀name,⠀a⠀place,⠀a⠀remembered⠀tale,⠀or⠀a⠀small⠀object⠀can⠀carry⠀the⠀other⠀story⠀behind⠀the⠀encounter.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀mentions⠀it,⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀react⠀to⠀the⠀mention⠀itself,⠀not⠀to⠀an⠀explanation⠀of⠀its⠀meaning.⠀The⠀reader⠀sees⠀the⠀weight⠀through⠀the⠀reaction:⠀a⠀pause,⠀a⠀refusal⠀to⠀answer,⠀a⠀task⠀resumed⠀too⠀quickly.\n\nLet⠀the⠀strain⠀alter⠀the⠀actual⠀exchange.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀ask⠀for⠀something⠀difficult,⠀refuse⠀to⠀say⠀what⠀they⠀need,⠀apologize⠀too⠀late,⠀or⠀return⠀when⠀return⠀is⠀the⠀hardest⠀choice.⠀The⠀warmth⠀may⠀be⠀partial,⠀awkward,⠀or⠀interrupted⠀by⠀practical⠀hardship.⠀Do⠀not⠀translate⠀feeling⠀into⠀a⠀stock⠀vocabulary⠀of⠀anguish,⠀and⠀do⠀not⠀force⠀a⠀confession⠀or⠀a⠀reconciliation.⠀The⠀hurt⠀may⠀remain⠀exactly⠀as⠀unresolved⠀at⠀the⠀response⠀boundary⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀made⠀it.\n\nMaintain⠀the⠀active⠀narrator's⠀distance⠀and⠀diction.⠀A⠀first-person⠀participant⠀may⠀deliver⠀more⠀inward,⠀fragmented⠀feeling;⠀a⠀limited⠀third-person⠀narrator⠀may⠀show⠀the⠀strain⠀through⠀physical⠀detail⠀and⠀small⠀observable⠀failures.⠀Keep⠀private⠀thought⠀unavailable⠀to⠀other⠀characters.⠀The⠀ending⠀may⠀leave⠀the⠀relationship⠀exactly⠀as⠀strained⠀as⠀the⠀scene⠀made⠀it,⠀with⠀the⠀historical⠀circumstances⠀still⠀pressing.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{setvar::NPaiarab::♢ * [STYLE]⠀Historical⠀Fiction⠀/⠀Neil⠀Gaiman⠀/⠀Chat⠀Roleplay\n\nBuild⠀each⠀reply⠀as⠀a⠀coherent⠀shared⠀interval⠀in⠀readable⠀paragraphs.⠀Use⠀unmistakable⠀dialogue⠀attribution⠀for⠀every⠀spoken⠀line.⠀Choose⠀one⠀period-specific⠀task⠀or⠀object⠀to⠀anchor⠀the⠀interval:⠀a⠀tool⠀being⠀prepared,⠀a⠀message⠀being⠀waited⠀for,⠀a⠀custom⠀being⠀observed,⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀people⠀wait⠀or⠀work.⠀Describe⠀the⠀task⠀or⠀object⠀in⠀concrete⠀terms—what⠀it⠀looks⠀like,⠀what⠀it⠀is⠀for,⠀what⠀it⠀costs⠀to⠀use—so⠀the⠀historical⠀setting⠀is⠀felt⠀through⠀the⠀action,⠀not⠀through⠀a⠀catalogue⠀of⠀period⠀details.\n\nGive⠀the⠀scene⠀the⠀direct,⠀familiar⠀Gaiman⠀texture⠀by⠀keeping⠀the⠀telling⠀close⠀to⠀ordinary⠀work⠀and⠀movement.⠀When⠀a⠀character⠀mentions⠀an⠀item⠀with⠀a⠀small⠀history,⠀or⠀a⠀place⠀where⠀something⠀is⠀about⠀to⠀happen,⠀let⠀the⠀other⠀character⠀respond⠀to⠀the⠀mention⠀itself.⠀Do⠀not⠀interrupt⠀the⠀exchange⠀to⠀explain⠀the⠀buried⠀story.⠀The⠀other⠀story⠀stays⠀behind⠀the⠀present⠀action,⠀suggested⠀by⠀a⠀remark,⠀an⠀object,⠀or⠀a⠀pause.\n\nResolve⠀the⠀submitted⠀material⠀according⠀to⠀the⠀active⠀authorship⠀contract.⠀Continue⠀the⠀established⠀narrator,⠀person,⠀action⠀markers,⠀and⠀player⠀control.⠀Active⠀NPCs⠀may⠀answer,⠀act,⠀or⠀hold⠀to⠀their⠀own⠀practical⠀concerns.⠀Let⠀them⠀continue⠀their⠀work⠀or⠀their⠀waiting⠀while⠀they⠀speak.⠀Do⠀not⠀make⠀them⠀pause⠀their⠀lives⠀to⠀deliver⠀information.\n\nLeave⠀a⠀natural⠀continuation⠀point⠀that⠀follows⠀from⠀the⠀scene⠀without⠀demanding⠀a⠀question,⠀cliffhanger,⠀or⠀forced⠀choice.⠀The⠀next⠀move⠀belongs⠀to⠀the⠀other⠀participant.⠀The⠀scene⠀can⠀end⠀during⠀ongoing⠀speech,⠀thought,⠀action,⠀or⠀composition;⠀it⠀does⠀not⠀need⠀a⠀completed⠀practical⠀outcome.⠀A⠀character⠀may⠀still⠀be⠀waiting⠀for⠀a⠀message,⠀still⠀preparing⠀a⠀tool,⠀or⠀still⠀resting⠀from⠀work⠀when⠀the⠀reply⠀ends.}}\n{{trim}}\n{{trim}}{{/if}}"
